T["\nCreatures in this area drop bonus shared materials lootable by your entire party! \n\n|cff71D5FFBonus shared materials, Marks of War, Scroll of Fortune and Skill Cards do not drop on death!|cff22FF22|r\n\n|cffFF2222Event items will not drop for players in a raid group!|r"]="\n此区域的生物会掉落额外共享材料战利品，你的整个小队均可拾取！ \n\n|cff71D5FF额外的共享材料、战争印记、幸运卷轴与技能卡不会在死亡时掉落！|cff22FF22|r\n\n|cffFF2222团队副本队伍中的玩家不会掉落活动物品！|r"
T["\nor (Alternative)\n\n"]="\n或（替代方案）\n\n"
T["\n|cff00d1ffOnly in High-Risk Open World:"]="\n|cff00d1ff仅限高风险开放世界："
T["\n|cff22FF22This event is active!"]="\n|cff22FF22此活动已激活！"
T["\n|cffFFFFFFUse a |cffE6CC80[Keeper's Scroll: High Risk Events]|cffFFFFFF while in this area to activate Bonus Loot drops for the entire server! This bonus loot is shared for the entire party, meaning everyone can loot it! |cff00d1ffThis Bonus Loot does not drop on death!\n\n|cffE6CC80[Keeper's Scroll: High Risk Events]|r can be obtained from Alliance and Horde War Heralds for |cff0070dd[Lesser Profane Nether]|r, the Auction House, or the store at |cffE6CC80Ascension.gg|r"]="\n|cffFFFFFF在此区域使用 |cffE6CC80[守护者卷轴：高风险活动]|cffFFFFFF 即可为整个服务器激活额外掉落！此额外掉落由整个小队共享，意味着所有人都可以拾取！ |cff00d1ff此额外掉落不会在死亡时掉落！\n\n|cffE6CC80[守护者卷轴：高风险活动]|r 可从联盟与部落的战争使者处以 |cff0070dd[次级亵渎虚空]|r 换取，也可从拍卖行或 |cffE6CC80Ascension.gg|r 商店获得"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\129_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Challenge Molten Core on Heroic Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Molten Core offers greater challenges and rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Ragnaros to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\129_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以英雄难度挑战熔火之心！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄熔火之心提供更艰巨的挑战与更丰厚的奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败拉格纳罗斯，即可获得此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\131_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Conquer Blackwing Lair on Heroic!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Blackwing Lair increases difficulty and rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Nefarian to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\131_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以英雄难度征服黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄黑翼之巢会提高难度与奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败奈法利安，即可获得此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\132_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Ossirian the Unscarred on Heroic!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj presents tougher enemies and better loot.<br/><br/>\r\nOvercome challenges to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\132_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以英雄难度击败无疤者奥斯里安！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄安其拉废墟拥有更强的敌人与更好的战利品。<br/><br/>\r\n克服挑战，赢取此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\133_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Face C'Thun in Heroic Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic difficulty offers a more demanding |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r and greater rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat C'Thun to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\133_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在英雄安其拉神殿中迎战克苏恩！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄难度提供更严苛的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r 与更丰厚的奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败克苏恩，即可获得此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\134_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Challenge Naxxramas on Heroic Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Naxxramas intensifies battles and loot quality.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Kel'Thuzad to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\134_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以英雄难度挑战纳克萨玛斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄纳克萨玛斯会加剧战斗并提升战利品品质。<br/><br/>\r\n征服克尔苏加德，即可获得此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\136_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Master Molten Core on Mythic Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Molten Core offers the ultimate challenge with top-tier rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Ragnaros to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\136_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以史诗难度精通熔火之心！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗熔火之心提供终极挑战与顶级奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败拉格纳罗斯，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\137_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Confront Onyxia in Mythic Mode!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Onyxia's Lair provides the most challenging version of the encounter.<br/><br/>\r\nOvercome Onyxia to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\137_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在史诗模式中迎战奥妮克希亚！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗奥妮克希亚的巢穴提供该战斗最具挑战性的版本。<br/><br/>\r\n战胜奥妮克希亚，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\138_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Overcome Blackwing Lair on Mythic!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Blackwing Lair pushes your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r to the limit with increased difficulty.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Nefarian to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\138_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以史诗难度攻克黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗黑翼之巢以更高的难度将你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 推向极限。<br/><br/>\r\n击败奈法利安，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\139_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Ossirian the Unscarred on Mythic!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj offers the toughest challenges and best rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Ossirian the Unscarred to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\139_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以史诗难度击败无疤者奥斯里安！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗安其拉废墟提供最艰巨的挑战与最好的奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败无疤者奥斯里安，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\140_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Confront C'Thun in Mythic Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic difficulty presents the ultimate test with superior loot.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat C'Thun to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\140_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在史诗安其拉神殿中迎战克苏恩！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗难度带来终极考验与更卓越的战利品。<br/><br/>\r\n击败克苏恩，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\141_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Challenge Naxxramas on Mythic Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Naxxramas offers grueling encounters and top rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Kel'Thuzad to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\141_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以史诗难度挑战纳克萨玛斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗纳克萨玛斯带来艰苦的战斗与顶级奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n征服克尔苏加德，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\143_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Molten Core Awaits!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Molten Core is the pinnacle of difficulty, requiring |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r quest by speaking with Lothos Riftwaker at Blackrock Mountain.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Ragnaros to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\143_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升熔火之心在等待！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升熔火之心是难度的巅峰，需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n与黑石山的洛索斯·裂隙行者交谈，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r 任务。<br/><br/>\r\n击败拉格纳罗斯，赢取专属飞升战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\145_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Face Ascended Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Blackwing Lair requires |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r and offers the greatest challenges.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r by obtaining the quest \"Blackhand's Command\" from Drakkisath.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Nefarian to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\145_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">迎战飞升黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升黑翼之巢需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r，并提供最艰巨的挑战。<br/><br/>\r\n从达基萨斯处获得任务 \"黑手的命令\"，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n击败奈法利安，赢取专属飞升战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\146_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj Beckons!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended difficulty requires |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r and provides the toughest battles.<br/><br/>\r\nStart your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r by speaking with Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.<br/><br/>\r\nEarn prestigious to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\146_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升安其拉废墟在召唤！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升难度需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r，并提供最艰苦的战斗。<br/><br/>\r\n与时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯交谈，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n赢取荣耀，获得专属飞升战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\147_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Conquer Ascended Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Temple of Ahn'Qiraj is the ultimate test, requiring |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r by completing the \"Scepter of the Shifting Sands\" questline.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat C'Thun to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\147_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">征服飞升安其拉神殿！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升安其拉神殿是终极考验，需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n完成 \"流沙节杖\" 任务线，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n击败克苏恩，赢取专属飞升战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\148_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Naxxramas Challenges You!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Naxxramas requires |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r to enter its formidable halls.<br/><br/>\r\nStart your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r by speaking with Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Kel'Thuzad to obtain exclusive <strong>Ascended Loot</strong>!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\148_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升纳克萨玛斯向你发起挑战！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进入飞升纳克萨玛斯令人生畏的大厅需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n与圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯交谈，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n征服克尔苏加德，获得专属<strong>飞升战利品</strong>！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\MythicPlus_Dungeon:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Challenge |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons are timed versions of your favorite dungeons with added twists.<br/><br/>\r\nEnemies are augmented with Affixes that increase difficulty and challenge you in new ways.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Group_Finder:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Form a Group for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You cannot queue for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nGather a group of 1 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r, 1 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r, and 3 Damage Dealers by inviting players from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r Chat or Global Chat.<br/><br/>\r\nTravel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r entrance together.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Keystone_Start:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Begin Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Once inside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r, the group leader can use a Mythic Keystone to start the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r run.<br/><br/>\r\nUse a Stone of Retreat or the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to reach the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r quickly.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\MythicPlus_Dungeon:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城是你喜爱的地下城的限时版本，并加入了额外的变化。<br/><br/>\r\n敌人会被词缀强化，从而提升难度并以全新方式挑战你。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Group_Finder:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">为 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城组建队伍</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你无法使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 排队进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城。<br/><br/>\r\n通过从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r 频道或综合频道邀请玩家，组建一支由 1 名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r、1 名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r 和 3 名伤害输出者组成的队伍。<br/><br/>\r\n一起前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 入口。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Keystone_Start:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 后，队伍领袖可以使用史诗钥石开始 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 挑战。<br/><br/>\r\n使用撤退之石或头等实验传送器快速抵达 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r。</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Onyxia's Lair Calls You!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Onyxia's Lair demands the highest level of skill and preparation.<br/><br/>\r\nStart your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r by talking to Drakefire Amulet quest giver in Dustwallow Marsh.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Onyxia to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升奥妮克希亚的巢穴在召唤你！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升奥妮克希亚的巢穴要求最高水平的技巧与准备。<br/><br/>\r\n与尘泥沼泽的龙火护符任务发布者交谈，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n征服奥妮克希亚，赢取专属飞升战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Face Onyxia Again in Heroic Mode!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Onyxia's Lair provides a tougher battle and better rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Onyxia to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在英雄模式中再次迎战奥妮克希亚！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄奥妮克希亚的巢穴提供更艰苦的战斗与更好的奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n征服奥妮克希亚，即可获得此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Zul'Gurub Awaits!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Zul'Gurub is the pinnacle of difficulty, requiring |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r quest by speaking with the appropriate NPC.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Hakkar to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升祖尔格拉布在等待！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升祖尔格拉布是难度的巅峰，需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n与相应的 NPC 交谈，开始你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调谐|h|r 任务。<br/><br/>\r\n击败哈卡，赢取专属飞升战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Conquer Zul'Gurub on Heroic Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Zul'Gurub offers greater challenges and rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Hakkar to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以英雄难度征服祖尔格拉布！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄祖尔格拉布提供更艰巨的挑战与更丰厚的奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败哈卡，即可获得此难度专属的强力英雄战利品！</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Master Zul'Gurub on Mythic Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Zul'Gurub offers the ultimate challenge with top-tier rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Hakkar to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以史诗难度精通祖尔格拉布！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗祖尔格拉布提供终极挑战与顶级奖励。<br/><br/>\r\n击败哈卡，即可获得此难度专属的荣耀史诗战利品！</p>"
