T["4.25% chance to dodge"]="4.25% 躲闪几率"
T["40 Player Group"]="40 人队伍"
T["5 Player (Mythic)"]="5 人（史诗）"
T["5 Player Group"]="5 人队伍"
T["5.00% chance to block"]="5.00% 格挡几率"
T["5.91% chance to crit"]="5.91% 爆击几率"
T["50% chance to increase your attack power by 140 for 30 sec when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This effect cannot occur more than once every 10 seconds."]="击杀可获得经验值或荣誉的目标时，有 50% 几率使你的攻击强度提高 140，持续 30 秒。此效果每 10 秒只能触发一次。"
T["50% chance to increase your spell power by 80 for 30 sec when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This effect cannot occur more than once every 10 seconds."]="击杀可获得经验值或荣誉的目标时，有 50% 几率使你的法术强度提高 80，持续 30 秒。此效果每 10 秒只能触发一次。"
T["5x |cffFFFFFFCommon|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Card|r\n5x |cff1eff00Uncommon|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Card|r\n|cff0070ddRare|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Card|r\n|cffa335eeEpic|r = |cffFFFFFF5 Cards|r\n|cffff8000Legendary|r = |cffFFFFFF25 Cards|r"]="5x |cffFFFFFF普通|r = |cffFFFFFF1 张卡|r\n5x |cff1eff00优秀|r = |cffFFFFFF1 张卡|r\n|cff0070dd精良|r = |cffFFFFFF1 张卡|r\n|cffa335ee史诗|r = |cffFFFFFF5 张卡|r\n|cffff8000传说|r = |cffFFFFFF25 张卡|r"
T["700 to 900 shadow damage inflicted every 2 sec to all targets in the affected area."]="每 2 秒对受影响区域内的所有目标造成 700 到 900 点暗影伤害。"
T["750 Shadow damage inflicted every 3 sec for 24 sec."]="每 3 秒造成 750 点暗影伤害，持续 24 秒。"
T["<Click for more Details>"]="<点击查看更多详情>"
T["<Click to filter by this quality>"]="<Haz clic para filtrar por esta calidad>（点击按此品质筛选）"
T["<For a brief moment, you can see a flash of recognition in the beast's eyes.>\r\n\r\nJulie...run...\r\n\r\n<The recognition fades, and the worgen growls at you again.>"]="<有那么短暂的一瞬，你能在这头野兽的眼中看到一丝认出的神色。>\r\n\r\n朱莉……快跑……\r\n\r\n<那丝神色消退了，狼人再次朝你低吼。>"
T["<Jasper slouches in the chair, his eyes wide and unblinking as he stares vacantly at the wall. His mouth hangs slightly open, the silence broken only by the sudden eruption of a deafening snore that shakes his body.>\n\nIt might be best to leave him undisturbed."]="<贾斯珀瘫在椅子里，双眼圆睁、一眨不眨地盯着墙壁，目光呆滞。他的嘴微微张着，只有突然爆发的一阵震耳鼾声撼动着他的身体，打破这片寂静。>\n\n最好还是别打扰他。"
T["<Right Click to go to Recipe>"]="<Click derecho para ir a la receta>（右键点击前往配方）"
T["<Shift-Click to Teleport>"]="<Shift+点击传送>"
T["<Shift-Click to auto reveal multiple items if no cards to reveal>"]="<Shift+点击可在没有卡牌可揭示时自动揭示多件物品>"
T["<The orb hums with arcane energy.>"]="<法球随着奥术能量嗡鸣。>"
T["<The orb turns its gaze, and for a moment you see fragments of leylines across all of Azeroth. The spell finally settles back in Redridge, a quiet grave under a tree near Lakeshire. The outline of an elderly woman stands beside it.>"]="<法球转过目光，有那么一刻，你看见了遍布整个艾泽拉斯的魔网碎片。法术最终定格回赤脊山，湖畔镇附近一棵树下一座安静的坟墓。一位老妇人的轮廓立在墓旁。>"
T["<The worgen growls at you through the cage>"]="<狼人隔着笼子朝你低吼>"
T["<Though your voice grows louder, more insistent, there is still nothing. Jasper's chest rises and falls in a slow, rhythmic motion, his mouth slightly ajar.>\r\n\r\n<A single, rumbling snore breaks the silence, as if to answer the call with nothing but pure disregard.>\r\n\r\nIt's clear: waking him will take more than just a few shouts."]="<尽管你的声音越来越响、越来越急切，却依然没有任何回应。贾斯珀的胸膛缓慢而有节奏地起伏着，嘴微微张着。>\r\n\r\n<一声低沉的鼾声打破寂静，仿佛在用纯粹的不屑回应你的呼唤。>\r\n\r\n显而易见：想叫醒他，光靠喊几声是不够的。"
T["<You see a quiet tower surrounded by foliage. Gnomes scurry about inside, engrossed in research and arcane experiments. You get the feeling it is this tower's sister, in some sense.>"]="<你看见一座安静的高塔，四周环绕着枝叶。侏儒们在里面忙碌穿梭，专注于研究与奥术实验。你隐约觉得，从某种意义来说，它是这座塔的姊妹塔。>"
T["<p>Max level builds are significantly more powerful than leveling builds. It's vital that you upgrade your build at max level to succeed in end-game content.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• You can find many end-game ready builds in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r. Hit N, then click the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r Tab, then select either Level 60 or 70 Builds depending on your current level.</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\endgamebuilds1:2:1}\r\n<p>You can scroll through high-rated end game builds to find one that matches your playstyle!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>End-game builds rely on Mystic Enchants. Each build will show the required Mystic Enchants at the bottom of the build page.</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\endgamebuilds2:2:1}\r\n<p>You should acquire the Legendary and Epic enchants suggested immediately to unlock the full power of the build, then seek out the Blue and Green enchants as soon as possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• It is highly recommended you try out featured builds before trying to create your own end-game build. You can also reference high-rated builds when creating your own to start with a strong foundation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once you choose a build and begin to grow comfortable with it, don't be afraid to experiment and adjust the build to your specific style of play.</p>"]="<p>满级构筑比升级途中的构筑强大得多。想在满级内容中取得成功，在满级时升级你的构筑至关重要。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• 你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 中找到许多可直接用于满级内容的构筑。按 N 键，点击 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 标签页，然后根据你的当前等级选择 60 级或 70 级构筑。</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\endgamebuilds1:2:1}\r\n<p>你可以浏览评分较高的满级构筑，找到符合你玩法风格的那一个！</p>\r\n\r\n<p>满级构筑依赖神秘附魔。每个构筑都会在构筑页面底部显示所需的神秘附魔。</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\endgamebuilds2:2:1}\r\n<p>你应该立即获取所推荐的传说和史诗附魔，以解锁构筑的全部威力，然后尽快去寻找蓝色和绿色附魔。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• 强烈建议你在尝试自创满级构筑之前，先试用一下精选构筑。你在创建自己的构筑时也可以参考高评分构筑，以便从一个坚实的基础起步。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>一旦你选定了某个构筑并逐渐熟悉它，就不要害怕尝试并按照你自己的具体玩法风格调整它。</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r and defeat level 100!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 100.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中不断推进，击败 100 级！</p><br/><p>你将在 100 级遭遇……</p><br/><p>此战斗需要……</p><br/><p>一旦击败，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r and defeat level 1000!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 1000.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中不断推进，击败 1000 级！</p><br/><p>你将在 1000 级遭遇……</p><br/><p>此战斗需要……</p><br/><p>一旦击败，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r and defeat level 50!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 50.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中不断推进，击败 50 级！</p><br/><p>你将在 50 级遭遇……</p><br/><p>此战斗需要……</p><br/><p>一旦击败，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r and defeat level 500!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 500.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中不断推进，击败 500 级！</p><br/><p>你将在 500 级遭遇……</p><br/><p>此战斗需要……</p><br/><p>一旦击败，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["A Challenge you have active is mutually exclusive with this one."]="你已激活的某个挑战与这个挑战互斥。"
T["A Craftsman’s Codex is a consumable item that unlocks an additional |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r slot for the character it is used on. This allows you to learn and level a third |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r, expanding your crafting and gathering capabilities beyond the usual two-slot limit.\r\n\r\nYou can use multiple codexes on a single character (one for each additional |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r slot) until you have unlocked every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r. This gives you the freedom to master every crafting and gathering trade if you wish.\r\n\r\nYou can purchase a codex off of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r or from Nozdormu for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="工匠的典籍是一种消耗品，可为其使用的角色解锁一个额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r 栏位。这使你能学习和提升第三项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，让你的制造与采集能力突破通常的两栏位限制。\r\n\r\n你可以对同一个角色使用多本典籍（每解锁一个额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 栏位就需要一本），直到你解锁全部 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r。如果你愿意，这让你可以自由精通所有制造与采集技艺。\r\n\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r 或诺兹多姆处以游戏内 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 购买典籍，也可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["A Dangerous World"]="危险的世界"
T["A Feather of the Ancients is a convenience item that instantly unlocks every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h|r for your character within a specific expansion. It’s an invaluable tool for players who want to skip the slow process of manually discovering each |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r, especially on alts or during seasonal leveling.\r\n\r\nThere are different versions of the feather for each expansion:\r\n\r\nKalimdor and Eastern Kingdoms – Unlocks all Vanilla (Classic) flightpaths.\r\nOutland – Unlocks all The Burning Crusade flightpaths.\r\nNorthrend – Unlocks all Wrath of the Lich King flightpaths.\r\n\r\nOnce obtained, feathers are stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r and can be used account-wide on any character.\r\n\r\nYou can acquire Feathers of the Ancients from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, as well as the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="先祖之羽是一件便利物品，可立即为你的角色解锁某个特定资料片内的所有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r。对于想跳过手动发现每个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 这一漫长过程的玩家来说，它是无价之宝，尤其是在小号或赛季升级过程中。\r\n\r\n每个资料片都有不同版本的羽毛：\r\n\r\n卡利姆多与东部王国 —— 解锁所有经典旧世（Vanilla）飞行路线。\r\n外域 —— 解锁所有燃烧的远征飞行路线。\r\n诺森德 —— 解锁所有巫妖王之怒飞行路线。\r\n\r\n获得后，羽毛会保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h藏品|h|r 中，并可在账号内的任意角色上使用。\r\n\r\n你可以用游戏内 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r 获得先祖之羽，也可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["A Group member has recently entered The Manastorm and must wait before doing so again."]="一名小队成员最近进入过法力风暴，必须等待一段时间才能再次进入。"
T["A Healer is a player who specializes in restoring health and keeping their group alive during combat.\r\n\r\nHealers use a variety of healing spells, buffs, and protective abilities to mend damage taken by teammates and prevent deaths. They must carefully manage their resources and prioritize targets to ensure the group stays alive through challenging encounters. \r\n\r\nIn addition to direct healing, Healers often provide utility through removing harmful effects, dispelling debuffs, and offering supportive buffs that enhance the group’s survivability."]="治疗者是一名专精于恢复生命值、在战斗中维持队伍生存的玩家。\r\n\r\n治疗者会使用各种治疗法术、增益和保护技能，修复队友所受的伤害并防止死亡。他们必须谨慎管理资源并优先选择目标，以确保队伍能在充满挑战的战斗中存活下来。\r\n\r\n除了直接治疗外，治疗者还常常通过移除有害效果、驱散减益以及提供增强队伍生存能力的增益来发挥作用。"
T["A Hearthstone is an item that allows your character to instantly teleport back to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r you've set as your current home location. Every player starts with a Hearthstone automatically, bound to their starter zone, and it can be used to quickly return to town for safety, repairs, or quest turn-ins. You can change your home location by speaking with any Innkeeper and selecting the 'Make this |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r your home.' option.\r\n\r\nIf your Hearthstone is ever lost or deleted, it can be easily replaced by talking to any innkeeper, who will provide a new one at no cost. Hearthstones have a 30 minute cooldown, so they’re best used strategically when fast travel is needed.\r\n\r\nIn addition to travel, Hearthstones also have a unique purpose as they serve as an all-in-one totem reagent. Totem-based abilities depend on having a hearthstone in your inventory, so it’s important to keep one with you at all times, even if you use alternate travel methods like teleport scrolls or portals."]="炉石是一件能让你的角色立即传送回你设为当前家的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 的物品。每位玩家一开始都会自动获得一块炉石，并绑定在其起始区域，可用于快速返回城镇以保证安全、修理装备或交付任务。你可以与任意旅店老板交谈并选择「将这家 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 设为你的家」来更改你的家。\r\n\r\n如果你的炉石丢失或被删除，只需与任意旅店老板交谈即可轻松补领一块新的，不收取任何费用。炉石有 30 分钟冷却时间，因此最好在需要快速旅行时策略性地使用。\r\n\r\n除了用于旅行，炉石还有一个独特的用途：它可以作为万能图腾材料。基于图腾的技能需要你的背包中有一块炉石，所以即使你使用传送卷轴或传送门等替代旅行方式，也务必随身携带一块。"
T["A Hotspot is a temporary, rotating area in the open world that offers a bonus to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r gained from defeating enemies and completing quests within its boundaries.\r\n\r\nWhen a hotspot becomes active, it’s announced in the chat for players currently in that zone, making it easy to know when and where one has appeared. You can also identify a Hotspot by looking at your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r (if you’re in the affected zone).\r\n\r\nHotspots rotate periodically and can appear in different zones, encouraging players to move around the world and take advantage of shifting leveling opportunities."]="热点是开放世界中一个临时、轮换的区域，在区域内击败敌人和完成任务所获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 会获得加成。\r\n\r\n当某个热点激活时，会向身处该区域的玩家发送聊天公告，让你轻松得知热点出现的时间和地点。你还可以查看你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 来识别热点（前提是你身处受影响的区域）。\r\n\r\n热点会定期轮换，并可能出现在不同区域，鼓励玩家在世界中四处移动，利用不断变化的升级机会。"
T["A MEGA curse hangs upon you! Every 3 seconds, one of your skills will be Marked for Death. Using it will instantly kill you. Good thing you have friends. \n\nOf course every gambler knows: MEGA Roulette players don't need pets to win, so no pets either!"]="一道 MEGA 诅咒笼罩着你！每 3 秒，你的某个技能会被标记死亡。使用它就会立刻杀死你。还好你有朋友。 \n\n当然，每个赌徒都知道：MEGA 轮盘的玩家不需要宠物也能赢，所以也不会有宠物！"
T["A PvP Quartermaster is a vendor who sells rare and epic Quality PvP gear, available in exchange for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r. These |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r are your main source of PvP equipment outside of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h|r gear.\r\n\r\nPvP Quartermasters are typically found in Capital Cities and PvP-focused hubs throughout the world. To locate them easily, look for the PvP icon on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r or ask a guard.\r\n\r\nThe gear sold by these quartermasters is seasonal, meaning it changes with each competitive PvP season to reflect updated balance and rewards."]="PvP 军需官是一名出售稀有和史诗品质 PvP 装备的商人，可用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r 兑换。这些 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 是你在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r 装备之外获取 PvP 装备的主要来源。\r\n\r\nPvP 军需官通常出现在主城和世界各地以 PvP 为中心的区域。要轻松找到他们，请在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上寻找 PvP 图标，或向卫兵询问。\r\n\r\n这些军需官出售的装备是赛季性的，意味着它会随每个竞技 PvP 赛季变化，以反映更新后的平衡与奖励。"
T["A Scroll of Retreat is a special teleportation item stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r (Hotkey N -> Vanity Tab) that instantly transports your character back to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. \r\n\r\nEvery character gets a scroll upon reaching level 20. To use it, open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r, select the scroll, and click 'Deliver Item' to add it to your inventory to use like any other item.\r\n\r\nYou can use a Scroll of Retreat at any level, but unlike a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h|r, it has a long cooldown, so it's best to save your scroll for when you want to avoid a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h|r or really need to fast travel."]="撤退卷轴是一种特殊的传送物品，保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h藏品|h|r 中（快捷键 N -> 藏品标签页），可将你的角色立即传送回你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。 \r\n\r\n每个角色达到 20 级时都会获得一张卷轴。要使用它，请打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h藏品|h|r，选择该卷轴，然后点击 \"交付物品\" 将其加入背包，之后便可像其他物品一样使用。\r\n\r\n你可以在任意等级使用撤退卷轴，但与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h撤退之石|h|r 不同，它的冷却时间很长，因此最好在你想避开一段 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r 或确实需要快速旅行时留着使用。"
T["A Tank is a player who specializes in absorbing damage and serving as the primary protector of their group by maintaining enemy focus on themselves. \r\n\r\nTanks utilize a combination of defensive abilities, threat management, and crowd control to mitigate incoming damage and control the flow of combat. By drawing enemy aggression (aggro) away from more vulnerable teammates, tanks create safe opportunities for damage dealers and healers to perform their roles effectively."]="坦克是一名专精于承受伤害、通过让敌人持续关注自己来充当队伍主要保护者的玩家。 \r\n\r\n坦克会综合运用防御技能、威胁值管理和群体控制来减免所受伤害并掌控战斗节奏。通过把敌人的攻击（仇恨）从更脆弱的队友身上引开，坦克为伤害输出者和治疗者创造了安全发挥其职责的机会。"
T["A Tome of Specialization allows you to unlock additional Specialization slots on your character, giving you the flexibility to create and save multiple unique builds.\r\n\r\nEach tome unlocks a specific Specialization slot, and slots must be unlocked in order starting with your second Specialization. Your second slot's tome can be purchased directly from Nozdormu using in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r. Additional slots, up to the seventh, can be unlocked using these numbered tomes, which are available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r, or the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nTo unlock your eighth slot and beyond, you’ll need a Master’s Tome of Specialization.\r\n\r\nOnce unlocked, each Specialization slot lets you swap between character loadouts without having to manually reset or rebuild your character. This makes it easy to switch between PvE and PvP builds, Tanking and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r, all on the same character."]="专精之书可以解锁你角色上额外的专精栏位，让你能够灵活地创建并保存多个独特的构筑。\r\n\r\n每本书解锁一个特定的专精栏位，栏位必须从你的第二个专精开始按顺序解锁。你的第二个栏位的书可以直接向诺兹多姆用游戏内 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 购买。更多栏位（最多到第七个）可以用这些编号的书籍解锁，它们可从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 以 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n要解锁第八个及之后的栏位，你需要一本大师专精之书。\r\n\r\n解锁后，每个专精栏位都能让你在角色配装之间切换，而无需手动重置或重建角色。这让在同一角色上切换 PvE 与 PvP 构筑、坦克与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r 都变得轻而易举。"
T["A Vision of the Forgotten"]="被遗忘者的幻象"
T["A [NPC:Book of Ascension]\nis a portable trainer that can be purchased for\n[KEYWORD:Donation Points (DP)]\nor off the\n[KEYWORD:Auction House] for gold!\n\nThe [NPC:Book of Ascension]\ncan train your spell ranks anywhere in the world.\n\nYou can also ask another player to share theirs with you.\n\n[KEYWORD:Class Trainers] can also be found in some towns and all [KEYWORD:Capital Cities]\nAsk a [NPC:Guard] in a [KEYWORD:Capital City] for directions to the nearest [KEYWORD:Class Trainer]!"]="一本 [NPC:飞升之书]\n是一种便携式训练师，可以用\n[KEYWORD:捐赠点数（DP）]\n购买，\n也可以用金币从\n[KEYWORD:拍卖行]\n购买！\n\n[NPC:飞升之书] 可以在世界任何地方训练你的法术等级。\n你也可以请其他玩家与你共享他的书。\n\n[KEYWORD:职业训练师] 也可以在一些城镇和所有 [KEYWORD:主城] 中找到\n在 [KEYWORD:主城] 中向 [NPC:卫兵] 询问前往最近的 [KEYWORD:职业训练师] 的路线！"
T["A crafter's nightmare! Take increased damage, group only with other Nightmare Heroes, and gain experience only through crafting and gathering."]="工匠的噩梦！受到更多伤害，只能与其他梦魇英雄组队，并且只能通过制造和采集获得经验值。"
T["A curse hangs upon you! Every 30 seconds one of your skills will be Marked for Death. Using it will instantly kill you, and as an Ironman, you are completely alone!"]="一道诅咒笼罩着你！每 30 秒，你的某个技能会被标记死亡。使用它就会立刻杀死你，而作为铁人，你完全孤立无援！"
T["A curse hangs upon you! Every 30 seconds, one of your skills will be Marked for Death. Using it will instantly kill you. Good thing you have friends."]="一道诅咒笼罩着你！每 30 秒，你的某个技能会被标记死亡。使用它就会立刻杀死你。还好你有朋友。"
T["A demonic gaze stuns the target."]="一道恶魔般的凝视使目标昏迷。"
T["A flightmaster is an NPC that provides fast travel between different zones and towns across the world using a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h|r. Speaking to a flightmaster for the first time unlocks their location, allowing you to travel back there later from other connected flightmasters.\r\n\r\nUndiscovered flightmasters are marked with a green (!) above their heads, making them easy to spot as you explore new areas. Once unlocked, they will appear as wing icons on your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r, showing all the places your character can fly to from any given location.\r\n\r\nYou can also use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r to highlight nearby flightmasters, helping you quickly locate the nearest point of fast travel."]="飞行管理员是一名 NPC，可通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r 在世界各地的不同区域和城镇之间提供快速旅行。首次与某位飞行管理员交谈会解锁其位置，让你之后可以从其他相连的飞行管理员处飞回那里。\r\n\r\n尚未发现的飞行管理员头顶会标有绿色 (!)，让你在探索新区域时容易发现他们。解锁后，他们会以翅膀图标出现在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上，显示你的角色可从任意给定位置飞往的所有地点。\r\n\r\n你还可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 来高亮附近的飞行管理员，帮助你快速找到最近的快速旅行点。"
T["A gamebreaking issue is one that severely disrupts gameplay, such as crashes, loss of items, or inability to complete essential tasks."]="破坏游戏的问题是严重干扰游戏体验的问题，例如崩溃、物品丢失或无法完成重要任务。"
T["A group member's current challenge does not allow entering The Manastorm!"]="一名小队成员当前的挑战不允许进入法力风暴！"
T["A lingering virus infects you, causing damage every time an enemy hits you. This damage can stack."]="一种挥之不去的病毒感染了你，每当敌人击中你时都会造成伤害。此伤害可以叠加。"
T["A literal test of survival! You'll gain a hunger and thirst bar, and if either 100 stacks, you'll die. Overcome exhaustion, dehydration, and starvation to reach level cap and overcome this trial."]="名副其实的生存考验！你将获得饥饿和口渴条，任意一条达到 100 层你都会死亡。克服疲惫、脱水和饥饿，达到等级上限并通过此试炼。"
T["A literal test of survival! You'll gain a hunger and thirst bar, and if either drop to zero, you'll die. Overcome exhaustion, dehydration, and starvation to reach level cap and overcome this trial. Better get good at cooking and fishing, Hero: you'll need to craft your own food if you hope to survive."]="名副其实的生存考验！你将获得饥饿和口渴条，任意一条降到零你都会死亡。克服疲惫、脱水和饥饿，达到等级上限并通过此试炼。最好把烹饪和钓鱼练好，英雄：如果你想活下去，就得自己制作食物。"
T["A literal test of survival! You'll gain a hunger and thirst bar, and if either reach 100 stacks, you'll die. Overcome exhaustion, dehydration, and starvation to reach level cap and overcome this trial."]="名副其实的生存考验！你将获得饥饿和口渴条，任意一条达到 100 层你都会死亡。克服疲惫、脱水和饥饿，达到等级上限并通过此试炼。"
T["A l’aide de ce menu vous \npourrez réinitialiser vos sorts et talents, \nacquérir de nouvelles techniques et allouer les points de \nstatistique de votre personnage"]="借助此菜单，你可以\n重置你的法术和天赋，\n学习新的技能，并分配你角色的\n属性点"
T["A mount is a player-controlled creature that boosts movement speed for faster travel. Found in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h|r (Hotkey Shift + P), mounts are vital for leveling, exploration, and convenience, and come in various cosmetic styles and types. The various mount types provide unique advantages based on the terrain.\r\n\r\nGround Mounts:\r\nUnlocked first, these mounts increase movement speed by 40%, with higher speeds available from Riding Trainers. Usable only outdoors, they dismount you in buildings, or when using certain abilities. All mounts can function as ground mounts, regardless of type.\r\n\r\nFlying Mounts:\r\nThese mounts enable aerial travel in zones that support it (Outland and Northrend). Flying mounts require flight training and the proper zone; otherwise, they act as ground mounts.\r\n\r\nAquatic Mounts:\r\nDesigned for swimming, these mounts boost swim speed but offer little to no speed on land. Ideal for underwater activities, these rare mounts offer unique utility.\r\n\r\nMounts can be obtained through quests, achievements, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, seasonal events, or purchased from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r."]="坐骑是一种由玩家控制的生物，可提高移动速度以便更快旅行。坐骑位于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r（快捷键 Shift + P），对升级、探索和便利性至关重要，并有各种外观风格和类型。不同坐骑类型根据地形提供独特的优势。\r\n\r\n地面坐骑：\r\n最先解锁，这些坐骑使移动速度提高 40%，向骑术训练师学习还可获得更高速度。只能在户外使用，进入建筑或使用某些技能时会将你卸下。所有坐骑无论类型如何都能作为地面坐骑使用。\r\n\r\n飞行坐骑：\r\n这些坐骑可在支持飞行的区域（外域和诺森德）进行空中旅行。飞行坐骑需要飞行训练和合适的区域；否则它们会作为地面坐骑使用。\r\n\r\n水下坐骑：\r\n专为游泳设计，这些坐骑提高游泳速度，但在陆地上几乎没有速度加成。这些稀有坐骑非常适合水下活动，提供独特的实用性。\r\n\r\n坐骑可以通过任务、成就、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r、赛季活动获得，也可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 购买。"
T["A new update is available and will be applied next time you login or reload your UI"]="有新的更新可用，将在你下次登录或重载界面时应用"
T["A party is a small group of 2 to 5 players who team up to complete content together. Parties are used for a wide range of cooperative activities, including questing, dungeons, elite mobs, and PvP battlegrounds. Playing in a party allows you to share |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, complete group objectives more easily, and support one another with different roles and abilities.\r\n\r\nTo form a party, right-click on another player’s portrait and select 'Invite', or type '/invite PlayerName' in the chat box. Once invited, the other player can accept to join your group. To leave a party, you can either type '/leave' or right-click your own portrait and select 'Leave Party.'\r\n\r\nThe player who forms a party becomes the Party Leader, marked by a crown icon. The leader can set instance difficulty, queue the group for dungeons or battlegrounds, manage loot rules, and place visible-only-to-party markers on players or enemies. Leadership can be transferred by right-clicking a member’s portrait and selecting \"\"Promote to Leader.\"\"\r\n\r\nA standard party for group content (especially for dungeons) typically includes 1 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r, 1 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r, and 3 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r. This balanced setup ensures your team can handle incoming damage, stay healed, and deal enough damage to defeat enemies efficiently."]="小队是由 2 到 5 名玩家组成的小型团体，他们组队一起完成内容。小队用于各种合作活动，包括任务、地下城、精英怪和 PvP 战场。在小队中游戏可以让你共享 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r、更轻松地完成团队目标，并通过不同的职责和技能互相支持。\r\n\r\n要组建小队，请右键点击另一名玩家的头像并选择「邀请」，或在聊天框中输入「/invite 玩家名」。被邀请后，另一名玩家可以接受以加入你的队伍。要离开小队，你可以输入「/leave」，或右键点击自己的头像并选择「离开小队」。\r\n\r\n组建小队的玩家会成为小队领袖，并标有王冠图标。领袖可以设置副本难度、为地下城或战场排队、管理拾取规则，以及在玩家或敌人身上放置仅小队可见的标记。可以通过右键点击成员头像并选择\"\"晋升为领袖\"\"来移交队长。\r\n\r\n用于团队内容（尤其是地下城）的标准小队通常包括 1 名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r、1 名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r 和 3 名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r。这种均衡配置可确保你的队伍能够承受来袭伤害、保持治疗，并造成足够的伤害来高效击败敌人。"
T["A sample of Barleybrew Clear."]="一份大麦酒清酿样品。"
T["A sample of Gordok Grog."]="一份戈多克格罗格酒样品。"
T["A sample of Jungle River Water."]="一份丛林河水样品。"
T["A sample of Small Step Brew."]="一份小步酿样品。"
T["A sample of Thunder 45."]="一份雷霆 45 样品。"
T["A small encampment built around the portal to the Glorious Azzar Faire"]="围绕通往荣耀的阿扎尔集市传送门搭建的小型营地"
T["A strike that deals 125% weapon damage (180% if a dagger is equipped, 100% if a Two-Handed weapon is equipped). \r\n\r\nIncreases your chance to dodge (or parry if a single Two-Handed weapon is equipped) by 10% for 8 sec. Awards 1 combo point."]="一次造成 125% 武器伤害的打击（装备匕首时为 180%，装备双手武器时为 100%）。 \r\n\r\n使你的躲闪几率提高 10%（若装备单把双手武器则为招架），持续 8 秒。获得 1 个连击点。"
T["A strong attack that increases melee damage by 18 and causes a high amount of threat. Effects which increase Bleed damage also increase Maul damage."]="一次强力攻击，使近战伤害提高 18 并造成大量威胁值。提高流血伤害的效果也会提高重殴的伤害。"
T["A temporary fee you pay to create your auction, based on the price, duration, and type of item. If the item sells the deposit is returned with the money from your sold auction."]="你为创建拍卖而支付的一笔临时费用，取决于价格、时长和物品类型。如果物品售出，押金会连同拍卖所得一起返还。"
T["A witch turned you into a frog once. You got better, but now magic damage you take is increased."]="曾经有个女巫把你变成了青蛙。你恢复了，但现在你受到的法术伤害提高了。"
T["A |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Trainer is an NPCs who teach your character the skills needed to learn, level, and specialize in professions. Unlike the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r, which serves as an all-in-one training interface, traditional trainers specialize in a single |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r at a time. \r\n\r\nWhether you’re picking up a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r, trainers are essential for unlocking new |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, higher ranks, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:193|hProfession Specializations|h|r.\r\n\r\nTrainers are commonly found in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, but can also be seen in major towns, and themed areas such as a forge or potion shop. Higher level trainers can be found in more remote or faction-specific zones, and may only become accessible at certain levels or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h|r thresholds.\r\n\r\nTo make locating trainers easier, you can use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r to highlight nearby |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r trainers on your mini-map, helping you quickly find the one you need while exploring the world."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 训练师是向你的角色传授学习、提升和专精专业技能所需知识的 NPC。与作为一站式训练界面的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 不同，传统训练师一次只专精一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r。 \r\n\r\n无论你是要学习 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r 还是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次级技能|h|r，训练师对于解锁新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r、更高等级和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:193|h专业专精|h|r 都是必不可少的。\r\n\r\n训练师通常出现在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中，但也可能出现在主要城镇和主题区域，例如铁匠铺或药水店。更高等级的训练师可以在更偏远或阵营专属的区域找到，并且可能只在特定等级或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r 门槛时才可接触。\r\n\r\n为了更容易找到训练师，你可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 在小地图上高亮附近的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 训练师，帮助你在探索世界时快速找到你需要的那一位。"
