T["Adds a chill effect to your Blizzard.  This effect lowers the target's movement speed by 20%. Lasts 1.50 sec. \r\n\r\nReduces the mana cost of Blizzard by 10% and its periodic interval by 12%."]="为你的暴风雪添加冰冻效果。此效果使目标的移动速度降低 20%。持续 1.50 秒。 \r\n\r\n使暴风雪的法力消耗降低 10%，其周期性间隔缩短 12%。"
T["Adds a chill effect to your Blizzard.  This effect lowers the target's movement speed by 30%. Lasts 1.50 sec. \r\n\r\nReduces the mana cost of Blizzard by 20% and its periodic interval by 20%."]="为你的暴风雪添加冰冻效果。此效果使目标的移动速度降低 30%。持续 1.50 秒。 \r\n\r\n使暴风雪的法力消耗降低 20%，其周期性间隔缩短 20%。"
T["Adds a chill effect to your Blizzard.  This effect lowers the target's movement speed by 40%. Lasts 1.50 sec. \r\n\r\nReduces the mana cost of Blizzard by 30% and its periodic interval by 28%."]="为你的暴风雪添加冰冻效果。此效果使目标的移动速度降低 40%。持续 1.50 秒。 \r\n\r\n使暴风雪的法力消耗降低 30%，其周期性间隔缩短 28%。"
T["Adds a small highlight effect under NPCs related to your quest(s)."]="在你的任务相关 NPC 下方添加一个小型高亮效果。"
T["Adds to your Attack Power, Damage-Per-Second. Strength\ndoes not affect Critical Hit chances at all. Strength does\nnot improve your chance to block, but rather the amount\nblocked when you succeed. This amount is determined in\npart by Strength (and the other part by your shield)."]="提高你的攻击强度和每秒伤害。力量\n完全不影响爆击几率。力量并不\n提高你的格挡几率，而是提高你格挡\n成功时格挡掉的伤害量。该数值部分\n由力量决定（另一部分由你的盾牌决定）。"
T["Adjusts the Field of View of the Camera"]="调整镜头视野"
T["Advanced"]="高级"
T["Adventure Mode"]="冒险模式"
T["Adventure is better together! Complete the challenge in a party of two. But be warned: if one of you fails, the other shares the same fate."]="结伴冒险更精彩！以两人小队完成此挑战。但请注意：如果你们中有一人失败，另一人也将面临同样的命运。"
T["Adventure mode is a special trial that significantly increases the difficulty of open-world gameplay by turning all monsters into elite enemies. These enemies hit harder, have more health, and require more tactical strategy to overcome.\r\n\r\nWhile defeating monsters in adventure mode grants less |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, completing a quest rewards significantly more, encouraging players to focus on exploration, objectives, and progression rather than relying on enemy kills to level.\r\n\r\nThis mode is ideal for those who enjoy a more immersive and rewarding leveling journey, where every encounter is meaningful and every quest completed brings you closer to greatness. \r\n\r\nYou can activate this trial by speaking to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h|r in your starting zone or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r."]="冒险模式是一种特殊试炼，它把所有怪物变成精英敌人，从而大幅提高开放世界玩法的难度。这些敌人打得更痛、生命值更高，需要更多战术策略才能击败。\r\n\r\n虽然在冒险模式中击败怪物获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 较少，但完成任务给予的奖励要多得多，这鼓励玩家专注于探索、目标和成长，而不是依赖击杀敌人来升级。\r\n\r\n此模式非常适合喜欢更有沉浸感、更有回报的升级旅程的玩家，其中每场遭遇都意义非凡，每完成一个任务都让你离伟大更近一步。 \r\n\r\n你可以在起始区域或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|h石皮塔克|h|r 交谈来激活此试炼。"
T["Affixes your one-handed rune weapon with a rune that deflects 2% of all spell damage and reduces the duration of Silence effects by 50% (not cumulative with additional Silence duration reduction).\n\nRequiere a Rune Forge."]="为你的单手符文武器附上一枚符文，可偏转 2% 的所有法术伤害，并使沉默效果的持续时间缩短 50%（不与其他沉默持续时间缩短效果叠加）。\n\n需要符文熔炉。"
T["Affixes your two-handed rune weapon with a rune that deflects 4% of all spell damage and reduces the duration of Silence effects by 50%. \n\nRequiere a Rune Forge."]="为你的双手符文武器附上一枚符文，可偏转 4% 的所有法术伤害，并使沉默效果的持续时间缩短 50%。 \n\n需要符文熔炉。"
T["Affliction"]="痛苦"
T["Affliction Warlock"]="痛苦术士"
T["After landing a critical strike with a Fire, Frost, or Nature damage spell or ability, you have a 100% chance to enter a Clearcasting state. \r\n\r\nThe Clearcasting state reduces the resource cost of your next 2 Magic spells or abilities by 40%."]="使用火焰、冰霜或自然伤害法术或技能造成爆击后，你有 100% 几率进入节能施法状态。 \r\n\r\n节能施法状态使你接下来 2 个魔法法术或技能的资源消耗降低 40%。"
T["Agility by 40 for 15 sec."]="敏捷提高 40，持续 15 秒。"
T["Agosta al enemigo infligiéndole 53 to 65 p. de daño de Fuego."]="使敌人枯萎，对其造成 53 到 65 点火焰伤害。"
T["Ah, good.  Another volunteer.  We're getting a lot of you these days.\n\nI hope it's enough.\n\nThe human lands are threatened from without, and so many of our forces have been marshaled abroad.  This, in turn, leaves room for corrupt and lawless groups to thrive within our borders.\n\nIt is a many-fronted battle we wage, Hidexs.  Gird yourself for a long campaign."]="啊，很好。又一位志愿者。这些天你们这样的人可真不少。\n\n希望这已经足够了。\n\n人类的土地正受到外来的威胁，我们的许多兵力都被调往了海外。这反过来又给腐败和不法之徒在我们境内滋生的空间。\n\n我们打的是一场多线作战，Hidexs。为一场漫长的战役做好准备吧。"
T["Ah, it is rare to see new faces in Dunshire these days.\n\nI suppose you are something of a... mercenary?\n\nGood, good. I have money to spare, and work that needs doing.\n\nWith trade disrupted, the kingdom has neglected the roads, and the wolves have grown bold. It is only a matter of time before they reach Dunshire.\n\nKill a few south of here. Remind them to fear steel and flame."]="啊，这些天在邓希尔很少见到新面孔。\n\n我猜你算是某种……雇佣兵？\n\n很好，很好。我有的是闲钱，也有活要干。\n\n贸易中断之后，王国疏于管理道路，狼群也变得越来越大胆。它们到达邓希尔只是时间问题。\n\n去南边杀几头。让它们记住要畏惧钢铁与火焰。"
T["Aim Decrement"]="瞄准递减"
T["Aim Increment"]="瞄准递增"
