T["Alchemy"]="炼金术"
T["Alchemy is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r for players who want to create powerful consumables that enhance combat performance, provide utility, and support group content. Alchemists craft potions, elixirs, and flasks that can restore health or mana, boost stats, grant |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:209|hResistances|h|r, and more.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn alchemy. Once you've trained the skill, you can start collecting the materials needed to craft your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r. Alchemy relies primarily on herbs gathered through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h|r, though some potions may also require items purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r or obtained in the world.\r\n\r\nUsing crafted potions is as simple as clicking on them in your inventory, but creating them can require access to an alchemy lab. While lower-level potions can be crafted anywhere, some advanced |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r may require special crafting areas, depending on the level of difficulty.\r\n\r\nAlchemy does not require a tool for most crafts, but a philosopher’s stone can be needed for some transmutations. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="炼金术是一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，适合想要制作增强战斗表现、提供实用功能并支撑团队内容的强力消耗品的玩家。炼金师会制作药水、药剂和合剂，用于恢复生命值或法力、提升属性、提供 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:209|h抗性|h|r 等等。\r\n\r\n开始时，你需要拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r 或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习炼金术。学会该技能后，你就可以开始收集制作 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 所需的材料。炼金术主要依赖通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r 采集的草药，不过有些药水可能还需要从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买或在世界中获得的物品。\r\n\r\n使用制作好的药水只需在背包中点击它们，但制作药水可能需要使用炼金实验室。低等级药水可以在任何地方制作，而某些高级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 可能需要特殊的制作区域，具体取决于难度等级。\r\n\r\n炼金术的大多数制作都不需要工具，但某些转化可能需要点金石。对于管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品能把所有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 工具整合到单个背包栏位中，可从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 用游戏内金币购买。"
