T["All melee attacks deal 2 to 3 additional Holy damage.  When used with attacks or abilities that strike a single target, this additional Holy damage will strike up to 2 additional targets.  Lasts until cancelled.\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing 2 to 3 Holy damage."]="所有近战攻击造成 2 到 3 点额外神圣伤害。与只命中单一目标的攻击或技能一起使用时，此额外神圣伤害将命中最多 2 个额外目标。持续直到取消。\r\n\r\n释放此圣印的能量将审判一个敌人，立即造成 2 到 3 点神圣伤害。"
