T["Ameer Greatluck is a helpful NPC located in all Capital Cities who provides access to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h|r menu which can restore accidentally lost items. You can reach this service by clicking the (?) icon in your Micro Menu or by speaking directly to Ameer.\r\n\r\nThrough |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h|r, you can reclaim items that were sold to a Vendor, deleted, or even disenchanted. Whether it’s a rare drop or a piece of important gear, Ameer Greatluck gives you a second chance to recover your lost valuables."]="阿米尔·大运是一位有用的 NPC，出现在所有主城中，可提供 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r 菜单，用于找回意外丢失的物品。你可以点击微型菜单中的 (?) 图标，或直接与阿米尔交谈来使用此服务。\r\n\r\n通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r，你可以找回卖给商人、删除甚至分解掉的物品。无论是稀有掉落还是重要装备，阿米尔·大运都给你第二次机会找回丢失的贵重物品。"
