T["An arena is a fast-paced, instanced PvP battle to the death where players compete in small team-based matches. Designed to test skill, coordination, and build power, Arenas come in three formats: 1v1 duels, 2v2, and 3v3 team fights. Whether you're looking for casual combat or competitive glory, Arena offers something for every PvPer.\r\n\r\nYou can queue for Arenas through the PvP menu (Hotkey H) by selecting Skirmish for a casual match or heading to the Rated tab to enter ranked competitive play. Rated Arenas award |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r, used to purchase powerful PvP gear from a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP Quartermaster|h|r, and affect your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|hArena Rating|h|r, which determines your standing on the leaderboard."]="竞技场是一种快节奏的副本内 PvP 生死战，玩家在其中进行小型团队对抗。竞技场旨在考验技巧、配合与构筑强度，共有三种模式：1v1 决斗、2v2 和 3v3 团队战。无论你想寻求休闲对抗还是竞技荣耀，竞技场都能满足每一位 PvP 玩家。\r\n\r\n你可以通过 PvP 菜单（快捷键 H）排队进入竞技场，选择练习赛进行休闲对战，或前往评级标签页参与排名竞技。评级竞技场会奖励 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r，可用于向 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP 军需官|h|r 购买强力 PvP 装备，并影响你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|h竞技场等级|h|r，后者决定你在排行榜上的名次。"
T["An epic adventure for everyone, especially members of the Horde: can you navigate the deadly road to Elwynn Forest and slay Hogger before level 10 and then endure the adversities of Azeroth until you reach max level? Only those truly adept at facing danger alone will complete this trial.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:448|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Hogger] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 10|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="一场适合所有人的史诗冒险，尤其是部落成员：你能在 10 级前穿越通往艾尔文森林的致命道路并杀死霍格，然后忍受艾泽拉斯的种种逆境直至达到满级吗？只有真正擅长独自面对危险的人才能完成此试炼。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:448|h你必须在达到 10 级前杀死 |cffffff00[霍格]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
