T["Another face in Darkshire… that makes three today.\n\nEither you’re brave, lost, or both. If you plan to head into the woods, you’ll want proper steel and dry rations.\n\nThe Night Watch doesn’t always get the chance to bring people back."]="又一个来到夜色镇的生面孔……今天已经是第三个了。\n\n你要么是勇敢，要么是迷路了，或者两者兼有。如果你打算进入森林，你会需要好钢和干粮。\n\n守夜人并不总是有机会把人带回来。"
