T["Are you sure you wish to end this Hand of Fate?\nThe Hand of Fate will be |cffFF0000removed|r and you will |cffFF0000not|r gain or lose any spells."]="你确定要结束这次命运之手吗？\n命运之手将被 |cffFF0000移除|r，你将 |cffFF0000不会|r 获得或失去任何法术。"
T["Are you sure you're ready for your level 10 Wildcard roll?\n\n|cffFF0000You will not be able to reroll your first 4 starters with the Dice of Destiny after this.|r\n\n|cffFF0000You will not be able to edit your Skill Cards after this.|r\n\nYou have your last chance to change starting Abilities."]="你确定已准备好进行 10 级万能牌抽取了吗？\n\n|cffFF0000此后你将无法用命运骰子重抽你的前 4 个初始技能。|r\n\n|cffFF0000此后你将无法编辑你的技能卡。|r\n\n你还有最后一次机会更改初始技能。"
T["Are you sure you're ready for your level 10 Wildcard roll?\nYou have your last chance to change starting Abilities."]="你确定已准备好进行 10 级万能牌抽取了吗？\n你还有最后一次机会更改初始技能。"
T["Are you sure you're ready to start rolling?|n|n|cffffd100Spells rolled cannot be restored! Ensure you have not selected anything you do not wish to unlearn!|r"]="你确定已准备好开始抽取了吗？|n|n|cffffd100已抽取的法术无法恢复！请确保你没有选中任何不想遗忘的内容！|r"
T["Area Name"]="区域名称"
T["Area of Effect Indicators"]="范围效果指示器"
T["Area: 52"]="区域：52"
T["Area: 52 is Ascension’s main Classless Realm, where players build their heroes by choosing spells and Talents from any of the original vanilla classes. This system offers deep customization and endless build variety, allowing you to craft truly unique playstyles.\r\n\r\nUnlike the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|hSeasonal Realm|h|r, progress on Area: 52 is permanent. When the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|hSeasonal Realm|h|r ends, your characters transfer here along with their gear, enchants, and vanity items, so you can continue your journey without losing your accomplishments.\r\n\r\nArea: 52 is home to a massive, active community, making it an ideal place for long-term progression, PvE, PvP, and creative build crafting.\r\n"]="区域：52 是飞升的主要无职业服务器，玩家可以从任意原版经典职业中挑选法术和天赋来打造自己的英雄。此系统提供深度自定义和无穷的构筑变化，让你打造真正独特的玩法。\r\n\r\n与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|h赛季服务器|h|r 不同，区域：52 的进度是永久的。当 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|h赛季服务器|h|r 结束时，你的角色会连同装备、附魔和藏品一起转移到这里，让你在继续旅程的同时不失去已有成就。\r\n\r\n区域：52 拥有庞大而活跃的社区，是进行长期成长、PvE、PvP 和创意构筑的理想之地。\r\n"
T["Arena (Group Queue)"]="竞技场（团队排队）"
T["Arena (Solo Queue)"]="竞技场（单人排队）"
T["Arena Completed!"]="竞技场已完成！"
T["Arena Frenzy is active! Participating in 2v2 arenas will earn you additional rewards!"]="竞技场狂热已激活！参与 2v2 竞技场将为你带来额外奖励！"
T["Arena Points are a form of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r earned by participating in rated arenas. They’re primarily used to purchase powerful PvP gear from PvP Quartermasters located in Capital Cities and PvP hubs.\r\n\r\nWith the start of every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|hArena Season|h|r, a new tier of PvP equipment becomes available for purchase from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP Quartermaster|h|r using |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Points. While some of this gear is accessible to all players, the most powerful equipment requires you to achieve a specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|hArena Rating|h|r before they can be unlocked for purchase.\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Points are stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r panel (Hotkey C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r Tab)."]="竞技场点数是一种 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，通过参与评级竞技场获得。它们主要用于向位于主城和 PvP 枢纽的 PvP 军需官购买强力 PvP 装备。\r\n\r\n随着每个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|h竞技场赛季|h|r 的开始，会有新一档 PvP 装备可用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 点数从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP 军需官|h|r 处购买。虽然其中部分装备对所有玩家开放，但最强大的装备需要你达到特定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|h竞技场等级|h|r 才能解锁购买。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 点数保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 面板中（快捷键 C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 标签页）。"
T["Arena Rating"]="竞技场等级"
T["Arena Rating is a score that reflects your performance and skill level in rated |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r matches. \r\n\r\nEvery player begins at a base rating of 0, and your score will increase or decrease depending on the outcome of your matches. Winning a match raises your rating, while losing one reduces it. This system ensures you're paired against opponents of similar skill, making for more balanced and competitive fights.\r\n\r\nEach |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r bracket (1v1, 2v2, and 3v3) has its own separate scoring, meaning your performance in one bracket won’t affect your rating in the others. This allows players to specialize in their favorite formats without penalty.\r\n\r\nYou can view your current |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Rating by opening the PvP Menu (Hotkey H -> Rated)."]="竞技场等级是一个反映你在评级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 对战中表现与技巧水平的分数。 \r\n\r\n每位玩家都从 0 基础等级开始，你的分数会根据对战结果上升或下降。赢得一场对战会提高你的等级，输掉一场则会降低。此系统确保你会与技巧水平相近的对手匹配，从而带来更平衡、更有竞争性的战斗。\r\n\r\n每个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 分组（1v1、2v2 和 3v3）都有各自独立的计分，意味着你在一个分组中的表现不会影响你在其他分组中的等级。这让玩家可以专注于自己喜爱的模式而不受惩罚。\r\n\r\n你可以打开 PvP 菜单（快捷键 H -> 评级）查看你当前的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 等级。"
T["Arena Reset"]="竞技场重置"
T["Arena Season"]="竞技场赛季"
T["Arena Skirmish"]="竞技场练习赛"
T["Arena Solo Queue"]="竞技场单人排队"
T["Arena rating reset times indicate when arena ratings will be reset, allowing for strategic planning of competitive battles."]="竞技场等级重置时间会标明竞技场等级何时重置，便于你为竞技对战做策略规划。"
T["Armed with an axe, Woodcutters embark on a tree-mendous adventure, chopping down mighty oaks, towering pines, and gnarled elders. Harness the power of nature's bountiful resource and convert it into precious lumber, which heroes can often find in demand at a callboard in exchange for some currency.\n\n|cff00ccffWoodcutting is an experimental profession only found on Ascension. There is currently no major function for woodcutting aside from callboard quests.|r"]="伐木工手持斧头，踏上了一场高大的冒险，砍倒强壮的橡树、高耸的松树和虬结的古树。驾驭大自然丰厚资源的力量，将其转化为珍贵的木材，英雄们常常可以在告示板上以换取一些货币。\n\n|cff00ccff伐木是飞升独有的实验性专业。目前除了告示板任务外，伐木还没有主要功能。|r"
T["Armor Class"]="护甲类型"
T["Armor Enchantment"]="护甲附魔"
T["Armor Penetration (or ARP) is a secondary stat that allows your attacks to bypass a portion of your enemy’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, increasing the damage of your physical abilities. Since ARP is percentage-based, it is especially effective against heavily armored foes, though it offers less benefit when facing lightly armored targets.\r\n\r\nYou can view your current penetration rating by mousing over |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r in the Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="护甲穿透（或 ARP）是一项次级属性，可让你的攻击无视敌人一部分的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r，从而提高你物理技能的伤害。由于护甲穿透按百分比计算，它对重甲敌人尤其有效，不过面对轻甲目标时收益较低。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中将鼠标悬停在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r 上查看你当前的穿透等级。"
T["Armor Slot"]="护甲栏位"
T["Armor is a defensive stat that reduces the physical damage your character receives. It is found on most pieces of gear, and its value is heavily influenced by the item’s Armor Type (such as cloth, leather, mail, or plate).\r\n\r\nThe higher your armor rating, the less damage you take from physical attacks, making it a key stat for survivability in both PvE and PvP.\r\n\r\nYou can view your current Armor value in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="护甲是一项防御属性，可减少你的角色受到的物理伤害。它出现在大多数装备上，其数值在很大程度上受该物品护甲类型（如布甲、皮甲、锁甲或板甲）的影响。\r\n\r\n你的护甲值越高，受到的物理攻击伤害就越少，因此它是 PvE 和 PvP 中生存能力的关键属性。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看你当前的护甲值。"
