T["Ascension Survival Guide"]="飞升生存指南"
T["Ascension features a unique hybrid-risk PvP system that gives players full control over how they engage with enemy players in combat. Instead of locking everyone into a single PvP ruleset, you can choose from three distinct modes (|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE Mode|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|hNo-Risk PvP Mode|h|r, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|hHigh-Risk PvP Mode|h|r) each offering a different level of intensity, danger, and reward. \r\n\r\nThis system ensures that players with different goals and playstyles can coexist in the same world while enjoying the game on their own terms.\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE Mode|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|hNo-Risk PvP Mode|h|r players share the same game world, meaning both PvE and PvP players can interact with the environment and each other (within their ruleset boundaries) without being forced into unwanted combat.\r\n\r\nTo select your PvP ruleset, visit your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and open the hybrid risk menu (Hotkey H -> PvP Ruleset Tab), then choose the mode that best fits your current gameplay goals. Keep in mind that switching between PvP modes has a 15 minute cooldown, so plan your activities accordingly."]="飞升拥有独特的混合风险 PvP 系统，让玩家完全掌控自己如何在战斗中与敌对玩家交手。该系统不会把所有玩家锁进单一的 PvP 规则集，而是让你从三种不同的模式中选择（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE 模式|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|h无风险 PvP 模式|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|h高风险 PvP 模式|h|r），每种模式提供不同强度的紧张感、危险与奖励。 \r\n\r\n此系统确保目标与玩法风格各异的玩家可以在同一个世界中并存，同时按自己的方式享受游戏。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE 模式|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|h无风险 PvP 模式|h|r 的玩家共享同一个游戏世界，意味着 PvE 和 PvP 玩家都能与环境互动，也能在各自规则集的界限内彼此互动，而不会被强行卷入不想要的战斗。\r\n\r\n要选择你的 PvP 规则集，请前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 并打开混合风险菜单（快捷键 H -> PvP 规则集标签页），然后选择最符合你当前游戏目标的模式。请记住，在 PvP 模式之间切换有 15 分钟冷却时间，因此请相应安排你的活动。"
T["Ascension has a dedicated team of full-time Game Masters that are available to assist 24 hours a day. The next available Game Master will be able to assist you with any issues you might have."]="飞升拥有一支专职的全职游戏管理员团队，每天 24 小时提供协助。下一位可用的游戏管理员将能帮你处理你可能遇到的任何问题。"
T["Ascension has a dedicated team of full-time Game Masters that are available to assist 24 hours a day. The next available Game Master will be able to assist you with any issues you might have.\n\n|cffffd100For non-urgent or general game related questions|r, please try the following steps before contacting a Game Master."]="飞升拥有一支专职的全职游戏管理员团队，每天 24 小时提供协助。下一位可用的游戏管理员将能帮你处理你可能遇到的任何问题。\n\n|cffffd100对于非紧急或一般性的游戏问题|r，请联系游戏管理员之前先尝试以下步骤。"
T["Ascension’s seasonal realms are time-limited servers designed to offer a fresh start, unique challenges, and a competitive environment for players looking to play the game in new and exciting ways. Each season typically introduces a special game mode, such as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:85|hDraft Mode|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:253|hWildcard Mode|h|r, or Felforged, encouraging players to experiment with different builds and strategies.\r\n\r\nProgression on seasonal servers usually begins in Vanilla WoW content and gradually unlocks expansions and new systems, eventually culminating in the current patch found on |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:14|hArea: 52|h|r, Ascension’s permanent progression realm. This seasonal structure creates a focused, level playing field where players race for Server Firsts, dominate leaderboards, and chase exclusive cosmetic and vanity rewards.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the season, the realm is closed and characters are transferred to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:14|hArea: 52|h|r, bringing their gear, titles, and seasonal rewards with them. This ensures your progress is preserved, while keeping the core seasonal journey competitive and time-bound."]="飞升的赛季服务器是限时服务器，旨在为想要以全新而刺激的方式游玩的玩家提供全新的开始、独特的挑战和竞争环境。每个赛季通常会引入一种特殊的游戏模式，例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:85|h抽取模式|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:253|h万能牌模式|h|r 或邪能铸造，鼓励玩家尝试不同的构筑与策略。\r\n\r\n赛季服务器的进度通常从经典旧世内容开始，逐步解锁资料片和新系统，最终汇聚到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:14|h区域：52|h|r 上的当前补丁，那是飞升的永久成长服务器。这种赛季结构创造了一个专注、公平的竞技场，玩家在此竞逐服务器第一、制霸排行榜，并追逐专属的外观与藏品奖励。\r\n\r\n赛季结束时，服务器会关闭，角色会被转移到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:14|h区域：52|h|r，并携带他们的装备、头衔和赛季奖励。这确保你的进度得到保留，同时让核心的赛季旅程保持竞争性与时限性。"
