T["Assume a Shadowform, increasing your Shadow damage by 15%.\r\n\r\nYou may not cast Healing or Priest Holy spells while in this form except for Cure Disease and Abolish Disease.\r\n\r\nGrants the periodic damage from your Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague, and Vampiric Touch spells the ability to critically hit and benefit from haste."]="进入暗影形态，使你的暗影伤害提高 15%。\r\n\r\n在此形态下，你不能施放治疗或牧师神圣系法术，但驱除疾病和驱散疾病除外。\r\n\r\n使你暗言术：痛、噬灵疫病和吸血鬼之触法术的周期性伤害能够造成爆击并受益于急速。"
T["Astral Recall\n|cffffffffLevel|r |cffff1a1a30|r"]="星界传送\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a30|r"
T["At ease, Ranger. If you are just passing through I suggest you stick to the roads and only travel by day. If your business is here in Darkshire, consider lending your abilities to The Night Watch. Our skill is unquestionable but our numbers are small. "]="放轻松，游侠。如果你只是路过，我建议你沿着大路走，并且只在白天赶路。如果你在夜色镇有事要办，不妨把你的能力借给守夜人。我们的技艺毋庸置疑，但人手太少。 "
T["At max level, the [KEYWORD:Call Board] is the place to find [KEYWORD:Daily Quests] and [KEYWORD:Weekly Quests]\n\n[KEYWORD:Daily Quests] are marked with a blue |cff267bfc!|r icon. Daily Quests refresh every day, giving you new tasks to complete every day!\n\n[KEYWORD:Weekly Quests] look like regular quests, but are only available once per week. Weekly Quests typically have far greater rewards."]="满级时，[KEYWORD:告示板] 是寻找 [KEYWORD:日常任务] 和 [KEYWORD:周常任务] 的地方\n\n[KEYWORD:日常任务] 标有蓝色的 |cff267bfc!|r 图标。日常任务每天刷新，每天都会给你新的任务去完成！\n\n[KEYWORD:周常任务] 看起来和普通任务一样，但每周只能完成一次。周常任务通常有丰厚得多的奖励。"
T["Ataca instantáneamente con ambas armas por 100% de daño de arma.  In addition, the next 4 sources of Nature damage dealt to the target from the Shaman are increased by 20%. Lasts 12 sec."]="立即用两把武器攻击，造成 100% 武器伤害。此外，萨满对目标造成的接下来 4 次自然伤害提高 20%。持续 12 秒。"
T["Attach the pieces into a whole."]="把碎片拼合为一个整体。"
T["Attach to the Gni'kiv Medallion."]="连接到格尼基夫徽章。"
T["Attack Power (also known as AP) is a secondary stat that directly increases the damage of your physical attacks and abilities.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current Attack Power in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="攻击强度（又称 AP）是一项次级属性，可直接提高你物理攻击和技能的伤害。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看你当前的攻击强度。"
T["Attack Target"]="攻击目标"
T["Attack with an equipped wand."]="用装备的魔杖攻击。"
T["Attempt to contact Archmage Vargoth."]="尝试联系大法师瓦格斯。"
T["Attempt to disguise yourself as an arakkoa."]="尝试把自己伪装成一个鸦人。"
T["Attempts to step through the shadows and reappear behind your enemy and increases movement speed by 70% for 3 sec.\r\n\r\nUsing it while not in combat reduces its cooldown by 5 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="试图穿行于阴影之中，在你的敌人背后重新出现，并使移动速度提高 70%，持续 3 秒。\r\n\r\n在非战斗状态下使用会使其冷却时间缩短 5 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Attunement refers to the process of meeting specific requirements such as completing quests, reaching certain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h|r levels, or progressing through key storylines, in order to gain access to certain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r instances.\r\n\r\nIn Ascension, attunement is only required for the current tier of Ascended Raids, ensuring that players are properly prepared for the challenge ahead. Older content and lower difficulty Raids do not require attunement, making it easier to explore past content at your own pace. \r\n\r\nYou can check your attunement progress through quest logs, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h|r panel, or by speaking with related NPCs near |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r entrances in the open world."]="调谐是指满足特定要求的过程，例如完成任务、达到特定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r 等级，或推进关键故事情节，从而获得进入某些 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 的资格。\r\n\r\n在飞升中，只有当前档次的飞升团队副本才需要调谐，确保玩家为前方的挑战做好充分准备。较旧的内容和较低难度的团队副本不需要调谐，让你更容易按自己的节奏探索过往内容。 \r\n\r\n你可以通过任务日志、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r 面板，或与开放世界中 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口附近的相关 NPC 交谈来查看你的调谐进度。"
T["Aturde a los enemigos cercanos causando 15 daño y aumenta el tiempo entre sus ataques en 10% durante 10 sec. This ability causes additional threat."]="使附近敌人昏迷，造成 15 点伤害，并使其攻击间隔延长 10%，持续 10 秒。此技能会产生额外威胁值。"
T["Aturde al objetivo durante 4 s. Debe estar en sigilo. Otorga 2 combos puntos."]="使目标昏迷 4 秒。必须处于潜行状态。获得 2 个连击点。"
T["August"]="八月"
T["Aumenta el aguante y el intelecto de tu Imp, Caminante del vacío, Súcubo, Cazador de sucias y Guardia de la Legión en un 10%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your maximum health and mana by 1%."]="使你的小鬼、虚空行者、魅魔、地狱猎犬和恶魔卫士的耐力和智力提高 10%。\r\n\r\n使你的最大生命值和法力值提高 1%。"
T["Aumenta el alcance de tus hechizos dañinos con canalización o tiempo de lanzamiento en 2 yardas. \n\nIncreases the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine Hymn, and Circle of Healing spells by 7%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Directly healing or directly damaging a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 20% chance to restore 2% of your missing mana over 4 sec. This effect can only occur once every 15 seconds.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的引导或施法时间型伤害法术的射程延长 2 码。 \n\n使你的治疗祷言、神圣新星、神圣赞美诗和治疗之环法术的半径扩大 7%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对距离你 20 码以外的目标直接治疗或直接造成伤害时，有 20% 几率在 4 秒内恢复你 2% 的已失去法力。此效果每 15 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta el alcance de tus hechizos dañinos con canalización o tiempo de lanzamiento en 2 yardas. \n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing direct magic damage to a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 33% chance to corrupt their soul, dealing Shadow damage over 3 seconds. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的引导或施法时间型伤害法术的射程延长 2 码。 \n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对距离你 20 码以外的目标造成直接魔法伤害时，有 33% 几率腐蚀其灵魂，在 3 秒内造成暗影伤害。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta el alcance de tus hechizos dañinos con canalización o tiempo de lanzamiento en 2 yardas. \n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing periodic Shadow damage to an enemy within melee range has a 33% chance to trigger a Grim Strike, dealing Shadow damage and reducing the target's melee attack power by 15 for 30 sec. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的引导或施法时间型伤害法术的射程延长 2 码。 \n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对近战范围内的敌人造成周期性暗影伤害时，有 33% 几率触发一次冷酷打击，造成暗影伤害并使目标的近战攻击强度降低 15，持续 30 秒。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta el alcance de tus hechizos dañinos con canalización o tiempo de lanzamiento en 2 yardas. \n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Nature non-periodic spells have a 100% chance to spread your Insect Swarm to all enemies within 5 yards, if hitting a target affected by Insect Swarm. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的引导或施法时间型伤害法术的射程延长 2 码。 \n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：如果你的自然系非周期性法术命中受你虫群影响的目标，则有 100% 几率将你的虫群传播到 5 码范围内的所有敌人。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta el alcance de tus hechizos dañinos con canalización o tiempo de lanzamiento en 2 yardas. \n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your spell critical strike chance is increased against enemies further than 20 yards from you by 4%.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的引导或施法时间型伤害法术的射程延长 2 码。 \n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对距离你 20 码以外的敌人，你的法术爆击几率提高 4%。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta el bono de armadura de tu Aura de devoción un 17%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the amount healed on any target affected by your any of your Auras by 2%."]="使你的虔诚光环的护甲加成提高 17%。\r\n\r\n使你任何一个光环影响的任何目标所受到的治疗量提高 2%。"
T["Aumenta el daño infligido all frost spells and abilities by 6% to targets under 35% health p."]="使你的所有冰霜法术和技能对生命值低于 35% 的目标造成的伤害提高 6%。"
T["Aumenta el daño infligido o la vida drenada por tus hechizos de Sombras un 2% and your Felhunter's Shadow Bite ability by 3%."]="使你的暗影法术造成的伤害或吸取的生命值提高 2%，并使你地狱猎犬的暗影撕咬技能提高 3%。"
T["Aumenta el daño infligido un your Maul and Shred attacks on bleeding targets by 7%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the critical strike chance of your Ferocious Bite ability on bleeding targets by 8%."]="使你的重殴和撕碎攻击对流血目标造成的伤害提高 7%。\r\n\r\n使你的凶猛撕咬技能对流血目标的爆击几率提高 8%。"
T["Aumenta el daño periódico causado por tu Peste Devoradora en 5%.\n\nDevouring Plague now instantly deals 10% of its total periodic effect when cast.\n\nYou deal 1% increased damage against targets afflicted by your Devouring Plague."]="使你的噬灵疫病造成的周期性伤害提高 5%。\n\n噬灵疫病现在施放时立即造成其周期性效果总量的 10%。\n\n你对受你噬灵疫病影响的目标造成的伤害提高 1%。"
T["Aumenta la ira generada por tu Ira sangrienta un 25%.\r\n\r\nWhile in Defensive Stance your Bloodrage reduces your damage taken by 2%."]="使你的血性狂暴产生的怒气提高 25%。\r\n\r\n在防御姿态下，你的血性狂暴使你受到的伤害降低 2%。"
T["Aumenta la probabilidad de conseguir un golpe crítico con todos los hechizos y ataques un 1%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your non-periodic damaging spell casts have a chance to increase your Strength by 2 (based on your level) for 12 seconds. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的所有法术和攻击的爆击几率提高 1%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的非周期性伤害法术施放有几率使你的力量提高 2（基于你的等级），持续 12 秒。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta todas las resistencias en 0.25 per level.\r\n \r\nAll spells that damage you have a 10% chance to restore 1% of your total mana. 6 second cooldown."]="使你的所有抗性每级提高 0.25。\r\n \r\n所有对你造成伤害的法术有 10% 几率恢复你总法力的 1%。6 秒冷却时间。"
T["Aumenta todo el daño infligido un 1%\n\nIncreases Frost damage done by 1%.\n\nIncreases the duration of Deep Freeze by 0.33 sec.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Deep Freeze casts apply up to 5 frozen enemies within 8 yards of your target. If used with Fingers of Frost, it will consume only one charge.|r"]="使你造成的所有伤害提高 1%\n\n使你的冰霜伤害提高 1%。\n\n使你的深度冻结持续时间延长 0.33 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的深度冻结施放会影响目标 8 码范围内最多 5 个被冻结的敌人。若与寒冰指一同使用，它将只消耗一层充能。|r"
T["Aumenta todo el daño infligido un 1%.\n\nReduces the movement speed of targets affected by Frostbolt, Cone of Cold and Frozen Orb by an additional 4%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Frostbolt and Ice Lance casts versus monsters reduce the cooldown of your Deep Freeze by 2 sec and Frozen Orb by 1 sec.|r"]="使你造成的所有伤害提高 1%。\n\n使受寒冰箭、冰锥术和寒冰宝珠影响的目标移动速度额外降低 4%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你对怪物施放寒冰箭和冰枪术会使命中深度冻结的冷却时间缩短 2 秒，寒冰宝珠缩短 1 秒。|r"
T["Aumenta todo el daño infligido un 1%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your Fire damage done by 2%."]="使你造成的所有伤害提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你的火焰伤害提高 2%。"
T["Aumenta tu agilidad total en un 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your melee and ranged critical strike chance by 2%."]="使你的总敏捷提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的近战和远程爆击几率提高 2%。"
T["Aumenta tu aguante en 1%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the healing you take from healthstones by 10%."]="使你的耐力提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你能从治疗石获得的治疗量提高 10%。"
T["Aumenta tu aguante en 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your critical strike chance by 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your Expertise by 2."]="使你的耐力提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的爆击几率提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的精准提高 2。"
T["Aumenta tu celeridad de hechizos en un 4%.\r\n\r\nReduces the global cooldown of your Lifebloom spell by 3%."]="使你的法术急速提高 4%。\r\n\r\n使你的生命绽放法术的公共冷却时间缩短 3%。"
T["Aumenta tu celeridad un 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks by 35%."]="使你的急速提高 1%。\r\n\n使你在受到伤害性攻击时承受的施法延迟降低 35%。"
T["Aumenta tu celeridad un 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting any spells by 35%."]="使你的急速提高 1%。\r\n\n使你在施放任何法术时因受到伤害性攻击而承受的延迟降低 35%。"
T["Aumenta tu celeridad un 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 35%."]="使你的急速提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你在施法时因受到伤害性攻击而承受的延迟降低 35%。"
T["Aumenta tu daño con hechizos en 2%. \n\nWrath, Starfire and Starsurge apply the Earth and Moon effect, which increases magic damage taken by 4% for 12 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使你的法术伤害提高 2%。 \n\n愤怒、星火术和星辰坠落会施加日月之蚀效果，使受到的魔法伤害提高 4%，持续 12 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta tu daño de Escarcha en un 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your Shadow damage by 1%."]="使你的冰霜伤害提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的暗影伤害提高 1%。"
T["Aumenta tu espíritu total un 3%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your spell damage is increased by 10% of your Spirit.|r"]="使你的总精神提高 3%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的法术伤害提高，数值相当于你精神的 10%。|r"
T["Aumenta tu penetración de hechizos en 1, escalando con tu nivel.\n\nReduces the mana cost of your Arcane spells and abilities by 1%."]="使你的法术穿透提高 1，并随你的等级成长。\n\n使你的奥术法术和技能的法力消耗降低 1%。"
T["Aumenta tu poder con hechizos en 7% of your total Spirit.\r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by your Mind Flay and Mind Blast is increased by 4% if your target is afflicted by your Shadow Word: Pain."]="使你的法术强度提高，数值相当于你总精神的 7%。\r\n\r\n如果目标受到你的暗言术：痛影响，你的精神鞭笞和精神震爆造成的伤害提高 4%。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe con hechizos y habilidades en un 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance that your damage over time diseases can be cured by 10%."]="使你的法术和技能命中几率提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你的持续性伤害疾病被治愈的几率降低 10%。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe con hechizos y habilidades en un 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the mana cost of spells by 1%."]="使你的法术和技能命中几率提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使法术的法力消耗降低 1%。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe crítico con todos los hechizos y ataques en un 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 35%."]="使你的所有法术和攻击的爆击几率提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你在施法时因受到伤害性攻击而承受的延迟降低 35%。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe crítico cuerpo a cuerpo y a distancia en un 1%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your total Strength by 1%."]="使你的近战和远程爆击几率提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你的总力量提高 1%。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe crítico en un 1%.\n\nAllows 8% of your mana regeneration to continue while casting.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: All threat generated is reduced by 20%. This capstone effect does not stack with similar capstone effects.|r"]="使你的爆击几率提高 1%。\n\n使你的法力回复在施法时仍可保留 8%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：产生的所有威胁值降低 20%。此巅峰效果不与同类巅峰效果叠加。|r"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe crítico en un 1%.  \n\nThere is a 33% chance that your Obliterate will do its damage without consuming diseases."]="使你的爆击几率提高 1%。  \n\n你的湮没有 33% 几率在不消耗疾病的情况下造成伤害。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe crítico en un 2% when your health is below 75%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Killing an enemy that grants experience or honor or using Siegebreaker will heal you for 208, increased by attack power and reset your Intercept cooldown.\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="当你的生命值低于 75% 时，使你的爆击几率提高 2%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：击杀可获得经验值或荣誉的敌人，或使用破城者，将为你恢复 208 点生命值（受攻击强度加成），并重置你的拦截冷却时间。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe crítico en un 2%.\r\n \r\nReduces the mana cost of your Steady Shot, Aimed Shot, Chimera Shot and Kill Shot by 9%."]="使你的爆击几率提高 2%。\r\n \r\n使你的稳固射击、瞄准射击、奇美拉射击和击杀射击的法力消耗降低 9%。"
T["Aumenta tu probabilidad de parar un 1% and Stamina by 1%."]="使你的招架几率提高 1%，耐力提高 1%。"
T["Aumenta tu valor de armadura de objetos un 2%.\r\n\r\nReduces the duration of all movement slowing effects by 6%."]="使你的物品护甲值提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使所有移动减速效果的持续时间缩短 6%。"
T["Aumenta tu velocidad de movimiento en 10% in Cat Form.\r\n\r\nIncreases your chance to dodge while in Cat Form, Bear Form and Dire Bear Form by 2%."]="使你在猎豹形态下的移动速度提高 10%。\r\n\r\n使你在猎豹形态、熊形态和巨熊形态下的躲闪几率提高 2%。"
