T["Bags expand your inventory space by increasing the number of item slots your character can carry. Every character begins with a permanent 16-slot backpack and has four additional bag slots where larger or specialized bags can be equipped to hold even more items.\r\n\r\nBags come in a variety of sizes and types, and can be purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, found on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, looted from enemies, or bought from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r. Some bags function as containers for specific items only, like gathering or crafting materials, and cannot hold other objects.\r\n\r\nTo manage your inventory, press (Hotkey B) to open your main backpack. Pressing (Hotkey Shift + B) will open all of your equipped bags at once, making it easier to organize and access your items."]="背包通过增加你角色可携带的物品栏位数量来扩展你的背包空间。每个角色一开始都有一个永久的 16 格背包，另有四个额外的背包栏位，可装备更大或专用的背包来携带更多物品。\r\n\r\n背包有多种尺寸和类型，可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买、在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 上找到、从敌人身上拾取，或从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 购买。有些背包只能作为特定物品的容器，例如采集或制造材料，无法存放其他物品。\r\n\r\n要管理你的背包，请按（快捷键 B）打开你的主背包。按（快捷键 Shift + B）会一次打开你装备的所有背包，让你更轻松地整理和取用物品。"
T["Balance"]="平衡"
T["Balance Druid"]="平衡德鲁伊"
T["Band together and delve into the wilds of Azeroth! This single-life adventure calls you to team up with other crafters and gatherers, forage for materials, and level up entirely through professions.You'll gain EXP for crafting or gathering, and gain more experience by crafting rarer items. But be warned: if your hunger or thirst stacks reach 100, you're dead forever! Will you and your fellow artisans survive?\n\nRecommended Group Size: 5"]="团结起来，深入艾泽拉斯的荒野！这场单命冒险召唤你与其他工匠和采集者组队，搜寻材料，并完全通过专业来升级。制作或采集都会获得经验值，制作更稀有的物品还能获得更多经验。但请注意：如果你的饥饿或口渴层数达到 100，你就会永久死亡！你和你的工匠同伴们能活下来吗？\n\n推荐队伍人数：5"
T["Band together with two other allies in the Hardcore Trio challenge! Grab your closest friends and set off on a single-life adventure where you'll need to tackle all vanilla dungeons in order and complete them all before level 60. Delve into the deepest reaches of Azeroth and confront the creatures within, proving your mettle as true Heroes of Azeroth!\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Edwin VanCleef] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 21|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mutanus the Devourer] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 22|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Archmage Arugal] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 26|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Aku'mai] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 28|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Charlga Razorflank] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 33|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mekgineer Thermaplugg] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 34|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Bloodmage Thalnos] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 34|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Arcanist Doan] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 37|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Herod] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 40|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Amnennar]|cffffffffbefore reaching level 41|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Archaedas] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 47|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill |cff