T["Base Health"]="基础生命值"
T["Base Health is the foundational amount of health points (HP) your character has before any modifiers from equipment, Talents, buffs, or enchants are applied. It represents your character’s unmodified |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|hDurability|h|r, determined by your class and level.\r\n\r\nThis value is important because many abilities, scaling effects, and mechanics (especially those related to healing, tanking, or health-based damage) calculate their effects as a percentage of base health, not your total HP after bonuses.\r\n\r\nFor example, if a talent or spell states that it heals for “5% of Base Health,” it will always refer to that unmodified amount, ensuring consistent scaling regardless of your gear or buffs."]="基础生命值是你的角色在应用装备、天赋、增益或附魔的任何修正之前所拥有的生命值（HP）基础数值。它代表你角色未经修正的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|h耐久度|h|r，由你的职业和等级决定。\r\n\r\n此数值很重要，因为许多技能、成长效果和机制（尤其是与治疗、坦克或基于生命值的伤害相关的那些）都是以基础生命值的百分比来计算效果的，而不是你加成后的总生命值。\r\n\r\n例如，如果某个天赋或法术说明它治疗 \"5% 的基础生命值\"，它始终指那个未经修正的数值，从而确保无论你的装备或增益如何，成长都保持一致。"
T["Base Mana"]="基础法力"
T["Base Mana is the default amount of mana a character has before any bonuses from gear, Talents, buffs, or enchantments are applied. It represents your character’s unmodified mana pool, which many abilities and mechanics use as a reference for mana costs or scaling.\r\n\r\nThis value is important because many abilities, scaling effects, and mechanics (especially those related to spellcasting) calculate their effects as a percentage of base mana, not your total mana pool after bonuses.\r\n\r\nFor example, if a Talent or spell states that it costs “5% of Base Mana,” it will always refer to that unmodified amount, ensuring consistent scaling regardless of your gear or buffs."]="基础法力是角色在应用装备、天赋、增益或附魔的任何加成之前所拥有的默认法力数值。它代表你角色未经修正的法力池，许多技能和机制都以它为参照来计算法力消耗或成长。\r\n\r\n此数值很重要，因为许多技能、成长效果和机制（尤其是与施法相关的那些）都是以基础法力的百分比来计算效果的，而不是你加成后的总法力池。\r\n\r\n例如，如果某个天赋或法术说明它消耗 \"5% 的基础法力\"，它始终指那个未经修正的数值，从而确保无论你的装备或增益如何，成长都保持一致。"
