T["Battlegrounds\n\n|cffFFD100This search is taking a while.\n\nExpand your search to include Random Battlegrounds?|r\n\n|cffFF0000You are currently queued for the maximum number of battlegrounds.|r"]="战场\n\n|cffFFD100这次搜索花了点时间。\n\n扩大搜索范围以包含随机战场？|r\n\n|cffFF0000你当前排队的战场数量已达上限。|r"
T["Battlegrounds!"]="战场！"
T["Bazaar Token"]="集市代币"
T["Bazaar Token Lottery"]="集市代币抽奖"
T["Bazaar Tokens"]="集市代币"
T["Bazaar Tokens are a premium |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r used to purchase a wide range of items from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r, a Vendor located in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r of every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. These tokens can be purchased from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or bought from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nOnce obtained, you can exchange them for:\r\n\r\n- Cosmetic Equipment, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, spell effects, and wings\r\n- Convenient |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h|r such as the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r or a Craftsman’s Codex\r\n- |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r that increase levelling speed\r\n- |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h|r for quick travel around the world\r\n\r\nIn addition to shopping at |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r, Bazaar Tokens can be used to auto-complete the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quest, making them a valuable catch-up tool for players with limited time or those aiming to progress quickly through end-game content."]="集市代币是一种高级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，用于向 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r 购买各种各样的物品，后者是位于每个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 中的一名商人。这些代币可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买，或从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n获得后，你可以用它们兑换：\r\n\r\n- 外观装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h小伙伴|h|r、法术效果和翅膀\r\n- 便利的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r，例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r 或工匠的典籍\r\n- 提高升级速度的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r\r\n- 用于在世界各地快速旅行的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h撤退之石|h|r\r\n\r\n除了在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r 处购物外，集市代币还可用于自动完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务，这使它们成为时间有限的玩家或希望快速推进满级内容的玩家的宝贵追赶工具。"
T["Be specific!"]="说具体点！"
T["Beast Mastery"]="兽王"
T["Beast Mastery Hunter"]="兽王猎人"
T["Beastmaster's Whistles"]="兽王的口哨"
T["Because someone said, 'Let's take the scenic route!'"]="因为有人说：\"我们走风景优美的那条路吧！\""
T["Become Cursed! Random afflictions now shadow every step of your journey, twisting fate with disastrous events and mischievous tricks all the way to max level. Can you navigate the fates, or will you be overwhelmed by misfortune?"]="被诅咒吧！随机的苦难如今笼罩着你旅程的每一步，用灾难性事件和恶作剧一路扭曲命运，直到满级。你能驾驭命运，还是会被厄运吞没？"
T["Become a member of a fabled Artisan's Guild! This single-life challenges the more mercantile side of Azeroth, where your gathering and crafting experience is shared with your entire party. As the only way to gain experience, you'll need to scour the world for resources and transform them into equipment, potions, and more, leveling up entirely through crafting. Who knows? You might become the foremost Artisan's Guild in all of Azeroth!"]="成为传说中工匠公会的一员！这场单命挑战考验艾泽拉斯更具商业气息的一面，你的采集和制造经验会与整个小队共享。由于这是获得经验的唯一途径，你需要踏遍世界搜寻资源，并把它们转化为装备、药水等等，完全通过制造来升级。谁知道呢？你或许会成为全艾泽拉斯最杰出的工匠公会！"
T["Become the ultimate champion of the people! Quest through Azeroth and aid citizens in need, gaining experience only through completed quests. With no experience points from slaying monsters, your focus is on solving the troubles of Azeroth's denizens, restoring peace to a world through your good deeds. Join together with fellow adventurers to rise to the challenge and prove your worth as a true Hero of Azeroth! "]="成为人民的终极冠军！在艾泽拉斯各地执行任务，帮助有需要的市民，仅通过完成任务获得经验值。由于击杀怪物不会获得经验值，你的重点将是解决艾泽拉斯居民们的烦恼，用善行让世界重归和平。与其他冒险者携手迎接挑战，证明你是真正的艾泽拉斯英雄！ "
T["Bedlam Bullions"]="混乱铸锭"
T["Bedlam bullions are a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r earned by completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r levels for the first time. Each new level cleared rewards you with a set amount of bullions, and higher levels grant more, encouraging steady progression through the endless |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r. However, re-clearing previously completed levels does not award additional bullions, only your first clear of each floor counts.\r\n\r\nYou can view your current amount of bedlam bullions in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r panel (Hotkey C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r Tab). Because they’re |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r, bullions can’t be traded or sold to other players, but they’re shared across all of your characters on the same realm.\r\n\r\nYou can spend your bedlam bullions at |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h|r for cosmetic equipment, convenience items, novelty toys, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h|r appearances, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r."]="混乱铸锭是一种 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，通过首次完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 层级获得。每通关一个新层级都会奖励你固定数量的铸锭，层级越高给予越多，鼓励你在无尽 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 中稳步推进。不过，重复通关已完成的层级不会额外给予铸锭，只有每层首次通关才算数。\r\n\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 面板（快捷键 C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 标签页）中查看你当前的混乱铸锭数量。由于它们是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r 的，铸锭无法交易或出售给其他玩家，但会在同一服务器的所有角色之间共享。\r\n\r\n你可以向 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|h米尔豪斯·法力风暴|h|r 花费混乱铸锭，换取外观装备、便利物品、新奇玩具、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服宠物|h|r 外观和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h小伙伴|h|r。"
T["Before contacting a Game Master, try these options below. Items that have gone missing usually can be found in one of the following ways:"]="在联系游戏管理员之前，请先试试下面的选项。丢失的物品通常可以通过以下方式之一找回："
