T["Begins a ritual that creates a Soulwell. Raid members can click the Soulwell to acquire a Major Healthstone. The Soulwell lasts for 3 min or 25 charges. \r\n\r\nRequires the caster and 2 additional party members to complete the ritual. In order to participate, all players must right-click the soul portal and not move until the ritual is complete."]="开始一个创造灵魂之井的仪式。团队成员可以点击灵魂之井来获得一块强效治疗石。灵魂之井持续 3 分钟或 25 次使用。 \r\n\r\n完成仪式需要施法者以及 2 名额外的小队成员。要参与其中，所有玩家都必须右键点击灵魂传送门，并在仪式完成前保持不动。"
T["Begins a ritual that creates a summoning portal. The summoning portal can be used by 2 party or raid members to summon a targeted party or raid member.  \r\n\r\nThe ritual portal requires the caster and 2 additional party or raid members to complete. \r\n\r\nIn order to participate, all players must be out of combat and right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="开始一个创造召唤传送门的仪式。召唤传送门可供 2 名小队或团队成员使用，以召唤一名指定的小队或团队成员。  \r\n\r\n完成仪式传送门需要施法者以及 2 名额外的小队或团队成员。 \r\n\r\n要参与其中，所有玩家都必须脱离战斗，右键点击传送门，并在仪式完成前保持不动。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Begins dominating an undead to be your companion. \r\n\r\nYour armor is reduced by 100% while you focus on dominating the undead for 20 sec. \r\n\r\nIf you lose the undead's attention for any reason, the domination process will fail. Each type of undead has unique abilities that you will be able to make use of."]="开始支配一个亡灵，使其成为你的同伴。 \r\n\r\n当你专注于支配该亡灵时，你的护甲降低 100%，持续 20 秒。 \r\n\r\n如果你因任何原因失去了该亡灵的注意，支配过程将会失败。每种亡灵都有你可以利用的独特技能。"
T["Begins enslaving a demon to be your companion. \r\n\r\nYour armor is reduced by 100% while you focus on taming the demon for 20 sec. \r\n\r\nIf you lose the demon's attention for any reason, the enslaving process will fail. Each type of demon has unique abilities that you will be able to make use of."]="开始奴役一个恶魔，使其成为你的同伴。 \r\n\r\n当你专注于驯服该恶魔时，你的护甲降低 100%，持续 20 秒。 \r\n\r\n如果你因任何原因失去了该恶魔的注意，奴役过程将会失败。每种恶魔都有你可以利用的独特技能。"
