T["Blacksmith Hammer"]="铁匠锤"
T["Blacksmithing"]="锻造"
T["Blacksmithing is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r for players who want to forge powerful weapons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, and tools using metal and other materials. Blacksmiths create a wide range of equipment used mostly by melee-focused builds, as well as components essential for other Professions like Enchanting and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h|r. \r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn Blacksmithing. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the required materials, primarily ores and bars gathered and smelted by |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|hMining|h|r.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you'll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r called Plans that teach you how to forge specific weapons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r pieces, enhancements, and tools.\r\n\r\nBlacksmithing requires access to an anvil and a blacksmith hammer. Anvils are found in most towns and cities near forge areas, while the blacksmith hammer can be purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r and must be in your inventory to craft. \r\n\r\nFor those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold.\r\n"]="锻造是一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，适合想要用金属和其他材料打造强力武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r 和工具的玩家。铁匠会制作各种各样的装备，主要供近战向的构筑使用，同时也会制作附魔和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r 等其他专业所需的关键组件。 \r\n\r\n开始时，你需要拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r 或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习锻造。学会之后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需材料，主要是通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r 采集和熔炼的矿石与锭。\r\n\r\n随着你等级提升，你将解锁称为图纸的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，它们会教你锻造特定的武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r 部件、强化和工具。\r\n\r\n锻造需要使用铁砧和铁匠锤。铁砧可以在大多数城镇和城市靠近锻造区的地方找到，而铁匠锤可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买，并且必须放在你的背包中才能制作。 \r\n\r\n对于管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品能把所有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 工具整合到单个背包栏位中，可从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 用游戏内金币购买。\r\n"
