T["Blasts the target with energy, dealing 155 to 179 Arcane damage.  \r\n\r\nCasting this increases all Arcane damage by 15% and its mana cost by 150%. Stacks up to 4 and lasts 6 sec, removed if you cast another Arcane ability that deals damage."]="用能量冲击目标，造成 155 到 179 点奥术伤害。  \r\n\r\n施放此技能会使你造成的所有奥术伤害提高 15%，其法力消耗提高 150%。最多叠加 4 层，持续 6 秒；如果你施放另一个造成伤害的奥术技能则会被移除。"
T["Blasts the target with energy, dealing 250 to 290 Arcane damage.  \r\n\r\nCasting this increases all Arcane damage by 15% and its mana cost by 150%. Stacks up to 4 and lasts 6 sec, removed if you cast another Arcane ability that deals damage."]="用能量冲击目标，造成 250 到 290 点奥术伤害。  \r\n\r\n施放此技能会使你造成的所有奥术伤害提高 15%，其法力消耗提高 150%。最多叠加 4 层，持续 6 秒；如果你施放另一个造成伤害的奥术技能则会被移除。"
T["Blasts the target with energy, dealing 390 to 450 Arcane damage.  \r\n\r\nCasting this increases all Arcane damage by 15% and its mana cost by 150%. Stacks up to 4 and lasts 6 sec, removed if you cast another Arcane ability that deals damage."]="用能量冲击目标，造成 390 到 450 点奥术伤害。  \r\n\r\n施放此技能会使你造成的所有奥术伤害提高 15%，其法力消耗提高 150%。最多叠加 4 层，持续 6 秒；如果你施放另一个造成伤害的奥术技能则会被移除。"
T["Blasts the target with energy, dealing 517 to 601 Arcane damage.  \r\n\r\nCasting this increases all Arcane damage by 15% and its mana cost by 150%. Stacks up to 4 and lasts 6 sec, removed if you cast another Arcane ability that deals damage."]="用能量冲击目标，造成 517 到 601 点奥术伤害。  \r\n\r\n施放此技能会使你造成的所有奥术伤害提高 15%，其法力消耗提高 150%。最多叠加 4 层，持续 6 秒；如果你施放另一个造成伤害的奥术技能则会被移除。"
T["Blasts the target with energy, dealing 688 to 800 Arcane damage.  \r\n\r\nCasting this increases all Arcane damage by 15% and its mana cost by 150%. Stacks up to 4 and lasts 6 sec, removed if you cast another Arcane ability that deals damage."]="用能量冲击目标，造成 688 到 800 点奥术伤害。  \r\n\r\n施放此技能会使你造成的所有奥术伤害提高 15%，其法力消耗提高 150%。最多叠加 4 层，持续 6 秒；如果你施放另一个造成伤害的奥术技能则会被移除。"
