T["Block is a secondary stat that requires an equipped shield. It allows you to absorb a portion of incoming damage when you block an attack from an enemy in front of you or to your sides.\r\n\r\nA higher block rating increases both your chance to block attacks and the amount of damage reduced when you do block, helping improve your survivability in combat.\r\n\r\nYou can view your block rating in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="格挡是一项需要装备盾牌的次级属性。当你格挡来自正面或侧面的敌人攻击时，它能让你吸收一部分来袭伤害。\r\n\r\n更高的格挡值会同时提高你格挡攻击的几率以及格挡时减免的伤害量，有助于提升你在战斗中的生存能力。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看你的格挡值。"
