T["Bloodforged equipment is |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r PvE gear that has been transformed into Bind-on-Equip PvP gear. This process allows previously |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r items to become tradable.\r\n\r\nTo Bloodforge an item, it must first be bound to you. Then, you can combine it with a Bloody Jar, which can be purchased from Nozdormu.\r\n\r\nBloodforged gear can also drop from enemies (at maximum level) or be looted from defeated players slain in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|hHigh-Risk PvP Mode|h|r."]="血铸装备是已被转化为装备绑定 PvP 装备的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r PvE 装备。此过程使原本 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的物品变得可以交易。\r\n\r\n要使一件物品血铸，它必须首先绑定到你身上。然后，你可以将其与一个血腥之罐结合，后者可以向诺兹多姆购买。\r\n\r\n血铸装备也可以从敌人身上掉落（在满级时），或从在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|h高风险 PvP 模式|h|r 中被击杀的玩家身上拾取。"
