T["Bonzo Bolts"]="邦佐螺栓"
T["Bonzo bolts are a unique |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r earned by progressing through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r. Each time you complete a level, you receive bonzo bolts, with higher levels awarding more bolts. Re-clearing previously completed levels will always grant a small amount of bolts making them worth repeating.\r\n\r\nBonzo bolts are stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r panel (Hotkey C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r Tab) and are |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r, meaning they can be used by any character on your server.\r\n\r\nThese bolts are primarily used to interact with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r, a vendor located next to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h|r near the entrance of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:177|hOrgrimmar|h|r. With bonzo bolts, you can purchase new |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r or upgrade existing ones to more powerful versions."]="邦佐螺栓是一种独特的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，通过在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中推进获得。每次你完成一个层级，都会获得邦佐螺栓，层级越高给予的螺栓越多。重复通关已完成的层级也总会给予少量螺栓，因此值得反复挑战。\r\n\r\n邦佐螺栓存放在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 面板中（快捷键 C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 标签页），并且是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r 的，意味着你服务器上的任何角色都可以使用。\r\n\r\n这些螺栓主要用于与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h科格斯沃斯|h|r 互动，后者是一名位于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|h米尔豪斯·法力风暴|h|r 旁边、靠近 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:177|h奥格瑞玛|h|r 入口的商人。使用邦佐螺栓，你可以购买新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r，或将已有的法术升级为更强大的版本。"
