T["Capital cities are the main social and logistical hubs for players of each faction. These cities serve as vital gathering points where players can access essential services such as the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r for storing and retrieving items, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r to buy and sell goods with other players, and the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r for picking up quests and coordinating group activities.\r\n\r\nFor the Alliance, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r stands as the grand capital city, an enormous medieval-style kingdom filled with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, trainers, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r halls, and iconic landmarks. Meanwhile, the Horde’s capital is |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:177|hOrgrimmar|h|r, a fortified city built into the harsh landscapes of Durotar, reflecting the faction’s rugged and tribal culture.\r\n\r\nOnce players reach level 20, they receive a valuable convenience item called the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r. This item is automatically added to their |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r and allows them to instantly teleport back to their faction’s capital city, making travel and access to services much easier, especially after completing quests or dungeons far from home.\r\n\r\nCapital cities also act as social hubs where players can meet, trade, form groups, and participate in various in-game events.\r\n"]="主城是各阵营玩家的主要社交与后勤中心。这些城市是重要的聚集地，玩家可以在此使用各项基本服务，例如用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r 存放和取回物品，用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 与其他玩家买卖货物，以及用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 接取任务和协调团队活动。\r\n\r\n对联盟来说，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 是宏伟的主城，一座巨大的中世纪风格王国，遍布 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、训练师、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r 大厅和标志性地标。而部落的主城是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:177|h奥格瑞玛|h|r，一座建在杜隆塔尔严酷地貌中的要塞城市，体现了该阵营粗犷而部落化的文化。\r\n\r\n当玩家达到 20 级时，他们会获得一件名为 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 的宝贵便利物品。此物品会自动加入他们的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h藏品|h|r，让他们能够立即传送回本阵营的主城，使出行和使用服务变得容易得多，尤其是在远离家乡完成任务或地下城之后。\r\n\r\n主城也是社交中心，玩家可以在此见面、交易、组队，并参与各种游戏内活动。\r\n"
T["Capital of the Alliance!"]="联盟的首都！"
