T["Careful there, friend - food’s still hot. It took me three hours to get it just right.\n\nIf good meals and large muscles don’t win her heart, I’m not sure what will."]="小心点，朋友——饭菜还烫着呢。我花了三个小时才把它做到恰到好处。\n\n如果好饭菜和大块肌肉都赢不了她的心，我不知道还有什么能行。"
