T["Casting Arcane direct damage spells have a 14% chance, and Fire and Frost direct damage spells have a 7% chance to empower your next Arcane Missiles, reducing its channel and fire time by 50%, and removing its mana cost.\r\n\r\nArcane Missiles cannot trigger this effect."]="施放奥术直接伤害法术有 14% 几率，火焰和冰霜直接伤害法术有 7% 几率，使你下一个奥术飞弹得到强化，其引导和发射时间缩短 50%，并移除其法力消耗。\r\n\r\n奥术飞弹无法触发此效果。"
T["Casting Damage Dealer"]="施法伤害输出"
T["Catch the bounty of Azeroth's lakes and seas. Careful bait selection and patience can result in some truly rewarding hauls, from seafaring delicacies a skilled cook can use, to waterlogged flotsam like chests and reagents."]="捕捞艾泽拉斯湖泊与海洋的馈赠。精心挑选鱼饵并保持耐心，可以带来真正丰厚的收获，从熟练厨师能用的海味珍馐，到浸水的漂浮杂物如箱子和材料。"
