T["Cogsworth is an NPC vendor located near |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h|r at the entrance of your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. He plays an important role in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r system, offering a variety of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r and upgrade items in exchange for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h|r which is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r earned by progressing through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.\r\n\r\nThe items Cogsworth sells are designed to enhance your effectiveness in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r, from powerful spells that help in tougher encounters to useful upgrades that provide more control, survivability, or utility as you climb."]="齿轮匠是一名 NPC 商人，位于你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 入口处 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|h米尔豪斯·法力风暴|h|r 附近。他在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 系统中扮演着重要角色，出售各种 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 和升级物品，以换取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|h邦佐螺栓|h|r——一种通过推进 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r。\r\n\r\n齿轮匠出售的物品旨在提升你在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中的效率，既有能在更艰难的战斗中助你一臂之力的强大法术，也有随着你不断攀登而提供更强控制、生存或实用性的有用升级。"
