T["Combine herbs found by Herbalism into brews that produce a variety of - mostly - positive effects, or Transmute rare materials. With their power to create valuable consumables, Alchemists are highly useful to guilds. Alchemists can also make a great deal of money via the Auction House.\n\nAdvanced Alchemists may also specialize further into Elixirs, Potions, or Transmutation."]="将草药学采集到的草药调配成药剂，产生各种——大多是——有益的效果，或者转化稀有材料。凭借制造珍贵消耗品的能力，炼金师对公会来说极为有用。炼金师还能通过拍卖行赚取大量金钱。\n\n高级炼金师还可以进一步专精于药剂、药水或转化。"
T["Combines with Pages 1, 2 & 3."]="可与第 1、2、3 页组合。"
T["Combines with Pages 1, 2 & 4."]="与第 1、2 和 4 页组合。"
T["Combines with Pages 1, 3 & 4."]="可与第 1、3、4 页组合。"
T["Combines with Pages 2, 3 & 4."]="可与第 2、3 和 4 页组合。"
