T["Companions"]="同伴"
T["Companions are small, non-combat pets that accompany your character alongside your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h|r. While they don’t participate in battles, many companions provide useful services that enhance your gameplay |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r.\r\n\r\nTreasure Keeper - Serves as a portable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r - Serves as a portable Class Trainer.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r - Serves as a portable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r.\r\nLootbot 3000 - Automatically loots all the defeated enemies around you so you don’t have to. (You can combine this with the Loot-Transfigurator 5000 for your lootbot to take the appearance of any of your other learned companions.)\r\n\r\nYou can view and summon your companions through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h|r (Hotkey Shift + P -> Companion Tab)."]="伙伴是小型非战斗宠物，它们会与你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服宠物|h|r 一同陪伴你的角色。虽然它们不参与战斗，但许多伙伴能提供有用的服务，提升你的游戏 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r。\r\n\r\n宝物看守者 —— 相当于一个便携式 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r —— 相当于一个便携式职业训练师。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r —— 相当于一个便携式 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r。\r\n拾取机器人 3000 —— 自动拾取你周围所有被击败的敌人，让你无需亲自动手。（你可以将其与拾取变形器 5000 结合使用，让你的拾取机器人变成你已学会的其他任意伙伴的外观。）\r\n\r\n你可以通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r 查看并召唤你的伙伴（快捷键 Shift + P → 伙伴标签页）。"
