T["Conquest Points"]="征服点数"
T["Conquest Points are gained by being victorious in arena combat. You can trade in these arena points for fabulous prizes!"]="在竞技场战斗中获胜即可获得征服点数。你可以用这些竞技场点数换取丰厚的奖励！"
T["Conquest Points are gained by being victorious in arena combat. You can trade in these arena points for fabulous prizes!\n\n-The Conquest Point cap increases every week\n\n-The amount shown is how many Conquest Points you have earned this season"]="在竞技场战斗中获胜即可获得征服点数。你可以用这些竞技场点数兑换丰厚的奖励！\n\n-征服点数上限每周提升\n\n-显示的数量是你本赛季已获得的征服点数"
T["Conquest of Azeroth"]="征服艾泽拉斯"
T["Conquest of Azeroth (CoA) is a specialized Ascension realm designed to deliver a fresh and exciting Vanilla+ |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r. It features 21 unique classes, each offering at least three distinct Specializations, for a total of 69 innovative ways to play.\r\n\r\nOn Conquest of Azeroth, players enjoy brand-new spells, unique visuals, custom content, and specialized game systems crafted to deepen gameplay variety and encourage experimentation. This realm is perfect for those seeking to journey through Azeroth with a twist, combining nostalgia with creative new options that expand how you build and customize your character.\r\n\r\nTo join the current CoA playtesting server, you must purchase a Conquest of Azeroth Travel Guide. This item can be obtained through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or directly from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r. Using the guide unlocks access to this unique realm, allowing you to explore its many custom features."]="征服艾泽拉斯（CoA）是一个专门的 Ascension 服务器，旨在带来全新而激动人心的 Vanilla+ |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r。它包含 21 个独特的职业，每个职业至少提供三种不同的专精，总计有 69 种创新玩法。\r\n\r\n在征服艾泽拉斯中，玩家可以享受全新的法术、独特的视觉效果、自定义内容以及专门的游戏系统，这些内容旨在加深玩法的多样性并鼓励尝试。该服务器非常适合那些希望在艾泽拉斯展开一段别样旅程的玩家，它将怀旧情怀与富有创意的新选项结合在一起，扩展了你构筑和自定义角色的方式。\r\n\r\n要加入当前的 CoA 测试服务器，你必须购买一份征服艾泽拉斯旅行指南。该物品可以通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r获得，或直接从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension 商城|h|r以|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r购买。使用旅行指南即可解锁这个独特的服务器，让你能够探索其中的众多自定义内容。"
T["Conquest of Azeroth - Character Advancement"]="征服艾泽拉斯 - 角色成长"
T["Consider equipping a |cff71d5ffStaff|r when using spells with a cast time! Staves reduce the casting time of your spells!"]="使用有施法时间的法术时，请考虑装备|cff71d5ff法杖|r！法杖会缩短你的法术施法时间！"
