T["Cook strange and wondrous ingredients into beneficial meals for you or your guildmates. Skilled chefs can create meals and feasts which provide powerful temporary stat increases to them and their group members. They may also sell their creations via the Auction House."]="将奇特而美妙的食材烹饪成有益的美食，供你或你的公会成员享用。技艺精湛的厨师可以制作餐点和盛宴，为自己和队伍成员提供强大的临时属性提升。他们还可以通过拍卖行出售自己的作品。"
T["Cooking"]="烹饪"
T["Cooking is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r, focused on preparing food that grants temporary buffs, restores health, and improves combat effectiveness. Cooks create a wide variety of consumables that can boost Primary Attributes and secondary stats.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn cooking. Once trained, you can start collecting the ingredients required for your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r. Cooking materials are primarily gathered from beasts in the open world, caught through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:107|hFishing|h|r, or purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you’ll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r that teach you how to prepare specific meals and feasts to share with your friends. Higher-level meals often grant stronger and more specialized buffs, making them highly sought after for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r preparation or competitive gameplay.\r\n\r\nCooking does not require any special tool to craft, however, players often pair cooking with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:107|hFishing|h|r to maintain a steady supply of materials."]="烹饪是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h专业技能|h|r，也是一种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于制作能提供临时增益、恢复生命值并提升战斗效力的食物。厨师可以制作种类繁多的消耗品，用于提升主属性和次要属性。\r\n\r\n要入门，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习烹饪。学成之后，你就可以开始收集|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r所需的材料了。烹饪材料主要来自在开放世界中猎杀野兽、通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:107|h钓鱼|h|r获得，或从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r处购买。\r\n\r\n随着等级提升，你会解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，学会制作特定的餐点和盛宴与朋友分享。更高等级的餐食往往能提供更强、更专精的增益，因此在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r准备或竞技玩法中备受追捧。\r\n\r\n烹饪不需要任何特殊工具即可制作，不过玩家常常将烹饪与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:107|h钓鱼|h|r搭配，以维持稳定的材料供应。"
