T["Courier Malik is an NPC located inside the Auction Houses of your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. He facilitates the transfer of unbound vanity items (such as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, pets, toys, and other cosmetics) between the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|hSeasonal Realm|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:14|hArea: 52|h|r servers.\r\n\r\nOnly non-consumable vanity items that can be saved in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r are eligible for transfer through Courier Malik. Consumable items cannot be sent this way. When items are transferred, they become instantly bound to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r on the receiving server and cannot be traded, mailed, or sold, ensuring your cosmetic collection remains personal and secure.\r\n\r\nThe transfer process is simple and free, making it an essential tool for maintaining and unifying your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r across different realms."]="信使马利克是一名 NPC，位于你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的拍卖行内。他负责在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|h赛季服务器|h|r 与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:14|h52 区|h|r 服务器之间转移未绑定的外观物品（例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、宠物、玩具以及其他装饰品）。\r\n\r\n只有可存入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 的非消耗品外观物品才可通过信使马利克转移。消耗品无法以此方式发送。物品转移后将立即绑定至接收服务器上的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r，无法交易、邮寄或出售，确保你的外观收藏始终属于你个人且安全无虞。\r\n\r\n转移过程简单且免费，是维护和统一你在不同服务器间 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 的必备工具。"
T["Court of the Highborne"]="上层精灵庭院"
