T["Crafting Queue"]="制造队列"
T["Crafting professions are a category of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r that allow players to use materials gathered from the world or looted from enemies to create equipment, enhancements, and consumables.\r\n\r\nThe available crafting professions are:\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r - Brew potions, elixirs, and flasks that provide powerful temporary buffs.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|hBlacksmithing|h|r - Forge weapons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, and useful metal items.\r\nEnchanting - Enchance your gear with magic, improving stats and adding unique effects.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h|r - Create gadgets, explosives, and special items often useful in utility situations.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|hLeatherworking|h|r - Craft leather and mail |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, as well as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r kits and other useful items.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:233|hTailoring|h|r - Sew cloth |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, powerful spellthreads, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:140|hJewelcrafting|h|r - Cut gems used to socket gear and craft jewelry. (Available in Burning Crusade.)\r\n\r\nCrafting Professions are a great way to earn gold, supply yourself or your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r with amazing enhancements and equipment, and can give you an edge in challenging content."]="制造类专业是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业|h|r 的一类，可让玩家利用从世界中采集或从敌人身上拾取的材料来制作装备、强化物品和消耗品。\r\n\r\n可用的制造类专业有：\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r - 调制提供强大限时增益的药水、药剂和合剂。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|h锻造|h|r - 锻造武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r 以及实用的金属物品。\r\n附魔 - 用魔法强化你的装备，提升属性并附加独特效果。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r - 制作在实用场合中常有奇效的小装置、炸药和特殊物品。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|h制皮|h|r - 制作皮甲和锁甲 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r，以及 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r 片和其他实用物品。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:233|h裁缝|h|r - 缝制布甲 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r、强大的法术线程和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:140|h珠宝加工|h|r - 切割用于镶嵌装备的宝石并制作珠宝。（燃烧的远征中可用。）\r\n\r\n制造类专业是赚取金币、为自己或你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r 提供出色强化与装备的绝佳途径，还能让你在充满挑战的内容中占据优势。"
T["Craftsman's Codex"]="工匠法典"
T["Crea una nube espesa de humo en un radio de 8 yds alrededor tuyo durante 5 s. Los enemigos no pueden seleccionarte ni salir del área de humo.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted."]="在你周围 8 码范围内制造一团浓密的烟雾，持续 5 秒。敌人无法选中你，也无法离开烟雾区域。\n\n该技能可在变形状态下使用。"
