T["Creates a Holy Lightwell.\r\n\r\nLightwell will attempt to heal a nearby party or raid member within 20 yards every second if they have less than 50% health for 55.\r\n\r\nLightwell lasts for 30 seconds or until it heals 10 times."]="创造一个神圣光明之泉。\r\n\r\n光明之泉每秒会尝试治疗 20 码内生命值低于 50% 的小队或团队成员，治疗量为 55。\r\n\r\n光明之泉持续 30 秒，或直到它治疗 10 次为止。"
T["Creates a Minor Soulstone. The Soulstone can be used to store one target's soul.  If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 400 health and 700 mana.\n\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes."]="制造一颗次级灵魂石。灵魂石可用于储存一个目标的灵魂。如果目标在灵魂被储存期间死亡，他将能以 400 点生命值和 700 点法力值复活。\n\n制造出的物品若在离线超过 15 分钟后消失。"
T["Creates a Potion of Fervor."]="制造一瓶狂热药水。"
T["Creates a Totem of Cleansing"]="创造一个净化图腾"
T["Creates a bowl of scrying."]="制造一碗占卜用水。"
T["Creates a violent storm in the target area causing 112 Nature damage to enemies every 1 sec, and increasing the time between attacks of enemies by 20%.\r\n\r\nLasts 10 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="在目标区域制造一场猛烈的风暴，每 1 秒对敌人造成 112 点自然伤害，并使敌人的攻击间隔延长 20%。\r\n\r\n持续 10 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Creates a violent storm in the target area causing 160 Nature damage to enemies every 1 sec, and increasing the time between attacks of enemies by 20%.  Lasts 10 sec.  Druid must channel to maintain the spell.\r\nDoes not stack with other similar effects."]="在目标区域制造一场猛烈风暴，每 1 秒对敌人造成 160 点自然伤害，并使敌人的攻击间隔延长 20%。持续 10 秒。德鲁伊必须持续引导以维持该法术。\r\n无法与其他类似效果叠加。"
T["Creates a violent storm in the target area causing 213 Nature damage to enemies every 1 sec, and increasing the time between attacks of enemies by 20%.  Lasts 10 sec.  Druid must channel to maintain the spell.\r\nDoes not stack with other similar effects."]="在目标区域制造一场猛烈的风暴，每 1 秒对敌人造成 213 点自然伤害，并使敌人的攻击间隔延长 20%。持续 10 秒。德鲁伊必须引导以维持该法术。\r\n不与其他类似效果叠加。"
T["Creates a violent storm in the target area causing 341 Nature damage to enemies every 1 sec, and increasing the time between attacks of enemies by 20%.  Lasts 10 sec.  Druid must channel to maintain the spell.\r\nDoes not stack with other similar effects."]="在目标区域制造一场剧烈的风暴，每 1 秒对敌人造成 341 点自然伤害，并使敌人的攻击间隔延长 20%。  持续 10 秒。  德鲁伊必须持续引导以维持该法术。\r\n无法与其他类似效果叠加。"
T["Creating Group Listing"]="正在创建队伍招募"
T["Creations"]="造物"
T["Creatures in this area can drop Heroic Bloodforged Gear, Marks of Ascension, Skill Cards and Scrolls of Fortune.\n|cff1AFF1AScroll of Fortune are much more likely to drop from this area. Gear from the current raid tier can Only drop while event is active.|r"]="该区域的生物可以掉落英雄血铸装备、飞升印记、技能卡和幸运卷轴。\n|cff1AFF1A此区域掉落幸运卷轴的概率要高得多。当前团队副本等级的装备仅在活动进行期间掉落。|r"
