T["Crit Chance scales Primarily from |cffFFFFFFCrit Rating|r, |cffFFFFFFIntellect|r, and slightly from |cffFFFFFFAgility|r"]="爆击几率主要取决于 |cffFFFFFF爆击等级|r、|cffFFFFFF智力|r，并少量取决于 |cffFFFFFF敏捷|r"
