T["Critical Strike"]="爆击"
T["Critical Strike is a secondary stat that increases your chance for attacks and healing spells to be extra effective. Critical hits deal significantly more damage or healing, making them a powerful way to boost your overall power in combat.\r\n\r\nBy default, physical critical strikes deal 200% damage, while spell criticals heal or deal 175% of their normal value. These numbers can be further improved by increasing your Critical Strike Damage Bonus.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current critical strike rating in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="爆击是一项次要属性，可提高你的攻击与治疗法术产生额外效果的概率。爆击会造成显著更高的伤害或治疗量，是提升整体战斗实力的强力途径。\r\n\r\n默认情况下，物理爆击造成 200% 的伤害，而法术爆击的治疗或伤害为正常值的 175%。提高你的爆击伤害加成可进一步提升这些数值。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看当前的爆击等级。"
T["Critical heals from your Druid direct Nature spells or Lesser Healing Wave have a 33% chance to plant a Living Seed on the target, storing 30% of the healing done.\r\n\r\nLiving Seed will bloom when the target is next hit by a direct spell or attack. Lasts 15 sec."]="你的德鲁伊直接自然法术或次级治疗波造成的爆击治疗有 33% 的几率在目标身上种下一颗生命之种，储存治疗量的 30%。\r\n\r\n当目标下一次受到直接法术或攻击命中时，生命之种将会绽放。持续 15 秒。"
