T["Currency refers to various special tokens and points used to purchase items, services, and unique rewards. These points are not stored in your inventory and cannot be traded or bought on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r. \r\n\r\nYou can view all your currencies in the currency panel (Hotkey C -> Currency Tab).\r\n\r\nExamples of currency are:\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r\r\nMarks of Ascension\r\nSeasonal Points\r\nTokens of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r"]="货币指的是用于购买物品、服务和独特奖励的各种特殊代币和点数。这些点数不存储在你的背包中，也无法交易或在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 上购买。\r\n\r\n你可以在货币面板中查看所有货币（快捷键 C -> 货币标签页）。\r\n\r\n货币的示例包括：\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r\r\n飞升印记\r\n赛季点数\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 代币"
