T["DPS (Damage Per Second) functions both as a player’s role, and as a unit of measurement reported by addons to determine the damage output of a player or group.\r\n\r\nA DPS player specializes in dealing damage to enemies, aiming to reduce their health as quickly and efficiently as possible.\r\n\r\nDPS players focus on using a variety of offensive abilities, spells, and weapon attacks to maximize their damage output while managing resources like mana, energy, or rage. They often rely on positioning, timing, and crowd control to enhance their effectiveness."]="DPS（每秒伤害）既是玩家的一种角色定位，也是插件用于衡量玩家或团队伤害输出的计量单位。\r\n\r\nDPS 玩家专精于对敌人造成伤害，力求尽可能快速高效地削减其生命值。\r\n\r\nDPS 玩家专注于使用各种攻击技能、法术和武器攻击来最大化伤害输出，同时管理法力、能量或怒气等资源。他们通常依靠走位、时机把握和群体控制来提升自身效率。"
T["Da 12 p. de salud a la mascota del taumaturgo cada segundo durante 10 s mientras el taumaturgo canalice."]="每 1 秒为巫医的宠物恢复 10 点生命值，持续 10 秒，需要巫医持续引导。"
