T["Damage Done"]="造成的伤害"
T["Damage from your Thorns increased by 25% and damage done by your Treants increased by 5%. \r\n\r\nMelee attacks done to you while you have Barkskin active have a 5% chance to daze the target for 3 sec."]="你的荆棘术造成的伤害提高 25%，你的树人造成的伤害提高 5%。\r\n\r\n当你拥有树皮术效果时，对你进行的近战攻击有 5% 的几率使目标眩晕 3 秒。"
T["Damage from your Thorns increased by 50% and damage done by your Treants increased by 10%. \r\n\r\nMelee attacks done to you while you have Barkskin active have a 10% chance to daze the target for 3 sec."]="你的荆棘术造成的伤害提高 50%，你的树人造成的伤害提高 10%。\r\n\r\n当你激活树皮术时，对你进行的近战攻击有 10% 的几率使目标眩晕 3 秒。"
T["Damage from your Thorns increased by 75% and damage done by your Treants increased by 15%. \r\n\r\nMelee attacks done to you while you have Barkskin active have a 15% chance to daze the target for 3 sec."]="你的荆棘术造成的伤害提高 75%，你的树人造成的伤害提高 15%。 \r\n\r\n在你保持树皮术效果期间，对你进行的近战攻击有 15% 的几率使目标迷惑 3 秒。"
T["Damage you take sticks harder. You cannot passively or with health-replenishing food regenerate health unless you are in a rested area."]="你受到的伤害更难消退。除非身处休息区域，否则你无法通过自然恢复或食用恢复生命的食物来恢复生命值。"
T["Damage you take sticks. You cannot recieve healing in any form."]="你受到的伤害会持续存在。你无法以任何形式受到治疗。"
T["Damage, healing and auto attacks have a 6% chance of causing you to enter a Clearcasting state.\r\n \r\nThe Clearcasting state reduces the Mana, Rage or Energy cost of your next damage, healing spell or offensive ability by 100%.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="伤害、治疗和自动攻击有 6% 的几率使你进入节能施法状态。\r\n \r\n节能施法状态使你下一次伤害或治疗法术、或攻击技能的法力、怒气或能量消耗降低 100%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
