T["Dealing direct damage with Fire or Shadow spells to targets below 35% health reduces the cast time of Soul Fire by 20% and increases the number of Wild Imps spawned by your Hand of Gul'dan by 1 for 10 sec.\r\n\r\nSoul Fires cast under the effect of Decimation cost no shard."]="以火焰或暗影法术对生命值低于 35% 的目标造成直接伤害时，使灵魂之火的施法时间缩短 20%，并使你的古尔丹之手召唤的野生小鬼数量增加 1 只，持续 10 秒。\r\n\r\n在灭杀效果影响下施放的灵魂之火不消耗灵魂碎片。"
T["Dealing direct frost damage has a 5% chance to cause your next Fireball or Frostfire Bolt spell to be instant cast, cost no mana.\r\n\r\nDamage dealt by your Arcane Missiles and Frostbolt is increased by 2% on targets affected by your Fireball effect."]="造成直接冰霜伤害时有 5% 的几率使你的下一个火球术或霜火之箭变为瞬发，且不消耗法力值。\r\n\r\n你的奥术飞弹和寒冰箭对受你火球术效果影响的目标造成的伤害提高 2%。"
T["Deals 1 Fire damage to your target."]="对你的目标造成 1 点火焰伤害。"
T["Deals 1 Frost damage to the target and any nearby enemies, knocking them back."]="对目标及附近的所有敌人造成 1 点冰霜伤害，并将其击退。"
T["Deals 1 Nature damage every 5 sec to up to 3 enemies within 8 yards of the caster for 15 sec."]="每 5 秒对施法者周围 8 码内最多 3 名敌人造成 1 点自然伤害，持续 15 秒。"
T["Deals 1 Shadow damage to all enemies in front of the caster."]="对施法者前方的所有敌人造成 1 点暗影伤害。"
T["Deals 1 damage to all enemies within 30 yards."]="对 30 码范围内的所有敌人造成 1 点伤害。"
T["Deals 1 shadow damage to nearby enemies and interrupts spellcasting for 4 sec."]="对附近的敌人造成 1 点暗影伤害，并打断施法 4 秒。"
T["Deals 1 to 0 Nature damage."]="造成 1 到 0 点自然伤害。"
T["Deals 1 to 0 Nature to the target and all nearby enemies."]="对目标及所有附近的敌人造成 1 到 0 点自然伤害。"
T["Deals 1 to 0 damage to the target with the second highest threat within melee range."]="对近战范围内威胁值第二高的目标造成 1 至 0 点伤害。"
T["Deals 1 to 0 physical damage to the target and additional fire damage over time."]="对目标造成 1 到 0 点物理伤害，并附加持续性的火焰伤害。"
T["Deals 1% weapon damage, and increases damage dealt by 5%."]="造成 1% 的武器伤害，并使造成的伤害提高 5%。"
T["Deals 10% maximum health damage as Shadow damage to the caster."]="对施法者造成相当于其最大生命值 10% 的暗影伤害。"
T["Deals 100 Frost damage to enemies in front of the caster, destroying 875 to 1125 mana and increases the time between attacks by 100%."]="对施法者前方的敌人造成 100 点冰霜伤害，摧毁 875 到 1125 点法力值，并使攻击间隔延长 100%。"
T["Deals 100 to 118 Fire damage to your target and an additional 25 to 30 Fire damage if the target is affected by an Immolate spell."]="对你的目标造成 100 到 118 点火焰伤害；如果目标受到献祭法术影响，则额外造成 25 到 30 点火焰伤害。"
T["Deals 100% weapon damage to a threatening target with the highest health within melee range."]="对近战范围内生命值最高且具有威胁的目标造成 100% 武器伤害。"
T["Deals 100% weapon damage to all enemies in a cone infront of the caster and reduces their healing received by 5% lasts 1 min. Stacks up to 20 times. Pierces all invulnerabilities."]="对施法者前方锥形范围内的所有敌人造成 100% 武器伤害，并使其受到的治疗效果降低 5%，持续 1 分钟。最多可叠加 20 次。穿透一切无敌效果。"
