T["Direct damage Hunter Shots have a 33% chance to refund 40% of their mana cost when they critically hit.\r\n\r\nArcane Shot and Explosive Shot criticals have a 33% chance to refund 1 sec of their cooldown, and 2 sec of your Chimera Shot, Multi-Shot, and Aimed Shot.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="直接造成伤害的猎人射击技能爆击时，有 33% 的几率返还其 40% 的法力消耗。\r\n\r\n奥术射击与爆炸射击的爆击有 33% 的几率使其冷却时间缩短 1 秒，并使你的奇美拉射击、多重射击和瞄准射击的冷却时间缩短 2 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Direct damage Hunter Shots have a 66% chance to refund 40% of their mana cost when they critically hit.\r\n\r\nArcane Shot and Explosive Shot criticals have a 66% chance to refund 1 sec of their cooldown, and 2 sec of your Chimera Shot, Multi-Shot, and Aimed Shot.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="直接造成伤害的猎人射击技能爆击时，有 66% 的几率返还其 40% 的法力消耗。\r\n\r\n奥术射击与爆炸射击的爆击有 66% 的几率使其冷却时间缩短 1 秒，并使你的奇美拉射击、多重射击和瞄准射击的冷却时间缩短 2 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Direct damage Hunter Shots refund 40% of their mana cost when they critically hit.\r\n\r\nArcane Shot and Explosive Shot criticals refund 1 sec of their cooldown, and 2 sec of your Chimera Shot, Multi-Shot, and Aimed Shot.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="直接造成伤害的猎人射击技能爆击时返还其 40% 的法力消耗。\r\n\r\n冰霜射击与爆炸射击的爆击返还 1 秒冷却时间，并使你的奇美拉射击、多重射击和瞄准射击返还 2 秒冷却时间。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Direct damaging Shadow spells and abilities, Drain Life and Drain Soul apply Shadow Embrace. \r\n\r\nIncreasing all periodic Shadow damage you deal to the target by 2%, and reduces all periodic healing and absorbs on the target by 2%. Lasts for 15 sec. Stacks up to 3 times."]="直接伤害的暗影法术和技能、吸取生命和吸取灵魂会施加暗影之拥。\r\n\r\n使你对该目标造成的所有周期性暗影伤害提高 2%，并使该目标身上的所有周期性治疗和吸收效果降低 2%。"
T["Direct damaging Shadow spells and abilities, Drain Life and Drain Soul apply Shadow Embrace. \r\n\r\nIncreasing all periodic Shadow damage you deal to the target by 3%, and reduces all periodic healing and absorbs on the target by 3%. Lasts for 15 sec. Stacks up to 3 times."]="直接伤害的暗影法术和技能、吸取生命和吸取灵魂会施加暗影之拥。\r\n\r\n使你对该目标造成的所有周期性暗影伤害提高 3%，并使该目标身上的所有周期性治疗和吸收效果降低 3%。"
T["Direct damaging Shadow spells and abilities, Drain Life and Drain Soul apply Shadow Embrace. \r\n\r\nIncreasing all periodic Shadow damage you deal to the target by 4%, and reduces all periodic healing and absorbs on the target by 4%. Lasts for 15 sec. Stacks up to 3 times."]="直接伤害的暗影法术和技能、吸取生命和吸取灵魂会施加暗影之拥。\r\n\r\n使你对该目标造成的所有周期性暗影伤害提高 4%，并使该目标身上的所有周期性治疗和吸收效果降低 4%。"
T["Direct damaging Shadow spells and abilities, Drain Life and Drain Soul apply Shadow Embrace. \r\n\r\nIncreasing all periodic Shadow damage you deal to the target by 5%, and reduces all periodic healing and absorbs on the target by 5%. Lasts for 15 sec. Stacks up to 3 times."]="直接伤害的暗影法术和技能、吸取生命和吸取灵魂会施加暗影之拥。\r\n\r\n使你对该目标造成的所有周期性暗影伤害提高 5%，并使该目标身上的所有周期性治疗和吸收效果降低 5%。"
T["Direct heals on allies below 50% health have a 40% chance to heal for an additional 250 but consuming 250 mana in the process.\r\n\r\nThis can only trigger while your mana is above 50%."]="对生命值低于 50% 的盟友进行的直接治疗有 40% 的几率额外治疗 250 点，但在此过程中会消耗 250 点法力值。\r\n\r\n仅当你的法力值高于 50% 时才能触发。"
