T["Dive into the adrenaline-fueled thrill of Survivalist Mode, where danger lurks at every corner and every step might be your last. This mode is a unique blend of solo and group gameplay, pushing you to the brink with a single life and a world teeming with peril. \n\nSurvivalists can choose to brave the High-Risk or No-Risk paths, but remember, even non-survivalists can be your downfall. Band together with fellow survivalists, for in this perilous journey, unity is your only shield against the relentless onslaught of this challenge. Conquer dungeons and group content, and relish the shared victory that only comes from a survivalist's unity.\n\nStep into Survivalist Mode and prove your mettle in the heart-pounding, unrelenting world of Ascension. Are you strong enough to survive?"]="投身于生存模式那肾上腺素飙升的刺激之中，危险潜伏在每个角落，每一步都可能是你的最后一步。此模式将单人玩法与团队玩法独特地融合在一起，以仅有一次的生命和充满危险的世界将你逼至极限。\n\n生存模式玩家可以选择走高风险或无风险路线，但请记住，即使是非生存模式玩家也可能成为你的败因。与其他生存模式玩家结伴同行吧，因为在这段险恶的旅程中，团结是你抵御这场挑战无情猛攻的唯一护盾。征服地下城与团队内容，品味唯有生存模式玩家团结一心才能带来的共享胜利。\n\n踏入生存模式，在飞升那令人心跳加速、毫不留情的世界中证明你的勇气。你足够强大，能够生存下来吗？"
T["Dive into the heart of terror with Nightmare Mode! In this merciless mode, you'll face the sting of 500% increased spell damage and 300% increased physical damage, testing your skill and strategy to the extreme\n\nRelying on assistance from outsiders? Forget it. Here, it's Nightmare players only, fostering a fellowship of the fearless who dare to navigate this harrowing journey together. Defy the odds and conquer dungeons with your fellow Nightmare comrades, unlocking special achievements and bragging rights along the way​.Nightmare Mode is not for the faint-hearted; it's a battlefield where only the brave thrive. So steel yourself, embrace the fear, and step into the nightmare. Are you ready to face the darkness?"]="与噩梦模式一同潜入恐惧的核心！在这个无情的模式中，你将面对法术伤害提高 500% 和物理伤害提高 300% 的剧痛，将你的技巧与策略考验到极致\n\n指望外人的援助？想都别想。在这里，只有噩梦模式玩家，从而培养出一群敢于共同踏上这段惊险旅程的无畏者。与你的噩梦模式同胞一起逆天改命、征服地下城，一路解锁特殊的成就和炫耀的资本。噩梦模式不适合胆小之人；它是一个只有勇者才能茁壮成长的战场。所以，振作起来，拥抱恐惧，踏入噩梦吧。你准备好面对黑暗了吗？"
