T["Do you really want to reset all of your raids?\nThis will respawn all slain monsters. This does not reset your eligibility for loot."]="你确实要重置所有团队副本吗？\n这将使所有被击杀的怪物重生。这不会重置你的拾取资格。"
T["Do you see it? That’s the famous Archmage Minervia, the one who defended Lakeshire from a dragon attack when I was just a child! \r\n\r\nI’ve read so many scrolls and tomes about her achievements, but standing before her likeness… it’s like I can feel the echoes of her power still lingering in the air. \r\n\r\nImagine being able to weave magic with such precision, to command arcane energies as if they were mere tools! Her feats are the stuff of legends, and yet—here, in this quiet moment—I can’t help but wonder if I will ever reach such heights."]="你看到了吗？那就是著名的大法师米奈尔维亚，在我还是个孩子的时候，就是她抵御了巨龙对湖畔镇的袭击！\r\n\r\n我读过那么多关于她功绩的卷轴和典籍，但站在她的画像前……感觉就像我仍能感受到她力量的余韵在空气中飘荡。\r\n\r\n想象一下，能够以如此精准的手法编织魔法，像驱使普通工具一样号令奥术能量！她的事迹已成为传说，然而——就在此刻这份平静之中——我忍不住问自己，我是否终有一天也能达到那样的高度。"
T["Do you want to reset all keybindings to their defaults?"]="你希望将所有按键绑定重置为默认值吗？"
T["Do you wish to create your own\nbuild or to choose a premade one?"]="你想创建自己的\n构筑，还是选择一个预设构筑？"
T["Do you wish to reset all Ascension feature tutorials?"]="你希望重置所有飞升功能教程吗？"
T["Do you wish to reset all tip popups?"]="你希望重置所有提示弹窗吗？"
T["Does 150 nature damage to the target over 1 min."]="在 1 分钟内对目标造成 150 点自然伤害。"
T["Does 2 additional Fire damage to the target."]="对目标造成 2 点额外的火焰伤害。"
T["Does 375 fire damage to all enemies in the area of effect over 10 sec."]="在 10 秒内对效果范围内的所有敌人造成 375 点火焰伤害。"
T["Does 4 additional Fire damage to the target."]="对目标造成 4 点额外的火焰伤害。"
T["Does 50 fire damage to any enemies within a 5 yard radius around the caster every 3 seconds for 15 sec."]="每 3 秒对施法者周围 5 码半径内的所有敌人造成 50 点火焰伤害，持续 15 秒。"
T["Does 60 damage to the target over 8 sec while reducing their movement speed by 33%."]="在 8 秒内对目标造成 60 点伤害，同时使其移动速度降低 33%。"
T["Does 8 additional Fire damage to the target."]="对目标造成 8 点额外的火焰伤害。"
