T["Don't hesitate, these dummies won't fight back, but the Blackrock sure will."]="别犹豫，这些假人不会还手，但黑石兽人肯定会。"
T["Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."]="别让集市里那些人类骗了你，小伙子；有了那些侏儒修建的地铁，从铁炉堡运送货物比你想象的容易多了。如果他们想加收进口费，就告诉他们你要到我这儿来买装备。"
T["Don't listen to my idiot brother - he simply has a crush on the Lorekeeper upstairs and is too young to remember the chaos of the elder days.\n\nI don't care how many years it's been, I will forever be wary of those arcane witches, no matter how much they claim to reform."]="别听我那个蠢弟弟的——他不过是暗恋楼上那位博学者，而且太年轻，不记得上古时代的混乱罢了。\n\n我才不管过了多少年，我会永远提防那些奥术女巫，无论她们如何声称自己已经改过自新。"
T["Don't. Stop. Jumping."]="别。停。跳。"
T["Donation Items"]="捐赠物品"
T["Donation Points"]="捐赠点数"
T["Donation Points (DP) are a premium |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r used in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r to purchase cosmetics, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, and a wide range of convenience items. DP allows players to support the development of the server while unlocking useful features and stylish gear.\r\n\r\nWhen you purchase Donation Points, you receive equal amounts of both DP and RDP (Realm Donation Points). While your DP balance is shared across your entire account, different realms may use different currencies. Live realms use DP, while PTR or testing realms (such as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:71|hConquest of Azeroth|h|r during its testing phase) use RDP.\r\n\r\nRDP functions like DP but is exclusive to PTR realms. When a PTR realm graduates to a live realm, it resets its economy, and all future purchases must be made with standard DP.\r\n\r\nMost items purchased with these points are tradable and can be found on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or exchanged with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, giving even non-donating players a way to access premium content.\r\n\r\nYou can access the store through the Ascension launcher or at ascension.gg/store.\r\n"]="捐赠点数（DP）是一种高级|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r中用于购买外观、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h同伴|h|r以及各种便利物品。DP 让玩家在支持服务器开发的同时，解锁实用的功能和时尚的装备。\r\n\r\n购买捐赠点数时，你会获得等量的 DP 和 RDP（服务器捐赠点数）。你的 DP 余额在整个账号内共享，但不同服务器可能使用不同的货币。正式服务器使用 DP，而 PTR 或测试服务器（例如测试阶段的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:71|h征服艾泽拉斯|h|r）使用 RDP。\r\n\r\nRDP 的功能与 DP 相同，但仅限 PTR 服务器使用。当 PTR 服务器转为正式服务器时，其经济系统会重置，之后的所有购买都必须使用标准 DP。\r\n\r\n用这些点数购买的大多数物品都可以交易，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r上找到，或与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r兑换为游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，让即使不捐赠的玩家也有途径获取高级内容。\r\n\r\n你可以通过飞升启动器或访问 ascension.gg/store 进入商店。\r\n"
T["Donation Points can be used to purchase vanity items from Ascension.\n\nYou can purchase more at:\n|cffFFFFFFhttps://ascension.gg/|r\nClick to open browser."]="捐赠点数可用于从飞升购买外观物品。\n\n你可以在此购买更多：\n|cffFFFFFFhttps://ascension.gg/|r\n点击打开浏览器。"
T["Donation items are special items obtained through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r, typically purchased using |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP). These items are designed to provide convenience, cosmetic customization, and utility, without offering unfair power advantages in competitive content.\r\n\r\nWhile most donation items are acquired through the online store, many can also be found on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, allowing players to purchase them with in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r instead of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r. This makes them accessible to all players, whether or not they spend real money.\r\n\r\nMost donation items fall into one of two categories:\r\n\r\nConsumables – Useful tools like a Craftsman’s Codex, an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r booster, or Tomes of Specialization.\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r Items – |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, toys, cosmetic equipment, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, and other |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r unlocks are stored safely in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r, where they can be accessed by any character on the same server."]="捐赠物品是通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r获得的特殊物品，通常使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。这些物品旨在提供便利、外观自定义和实用性，而不会在竞技内容中带来不公平的强度优势。\r\n\r\n虽然大多数捐赠物品通过在线商店获得，但许多也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r上找到，让玩家可以用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r而非|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r购买。这使得无论玩家是否花费真钱，都能获得这些物品。\r\n\r\n大多数捐赠物品属于以下两类之一：\r\n\r\n消耗品——实用的工具，例如工匠法典、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r提升道具，或专精宝典。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r物品——|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、玩具、外观装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h同伴|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r以及其他|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r解锁内容都会安全地存放于你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中，同一服务器上的任何角色都可以访问。"
T["Double click on |cff00FF00Healing Ability|r or any other Ability to |cffFFFF00learn|r it"]="双击|cff00FF00治疗技能|r或任意其他技能以|cffFFFF00学习|r"
T["Double click on |cffFF0000Damage Ability|r or any other Ability to |cffFFFF00learn|r it"]="双击|cffFF0000伤害技能|r或任意其他技能以|cffFFFF00学习|r"
