T["Draft"]="抽取"
T["Draft Mode"]="抽取模式"
T["Draft Mode adds a unique twist to character progression by letting you choose one ability from three random, classless options every other level. This system introduces an element of luck and creativity, encouraging you to experiment with different playstyles and combinations.\r\n\r\nWhile your abilities are chosen through Draft Mode, your Talents remain fully customizable, allowing you to personalize your character’s power and strategy.\r\n\r\nOnce you reach max level, you can refine your chosen abilities using Hands of Fate, a special item purchased with Marks of Ascension. Hands of Fate let you redraw your abilities, giving you the freedom to fine-tune your build and craft the perfect setup for your playstyle."]="抽取模式为角色成长增添了独特的变数，让你每隔一级从三个随机的无职业限定选项中挑选一项技能。该系统引入了运气和创造力的元素，鼓励你尝试不同的玩法风格和组合。\r\n\r\n虽然你的技能通过抽取模式选定，但你的天赋仍可完全自定义，让你能够个性化角色的实力与策略。\r\n\r\n达到满级后，你可以使用命运之手来调整所选技能，这是一种用飞升印记购买的的特殊物品。命运之手让你可以重抽技能，自由地微调你的构筑，为你的玩法风格打造完美的配置。"
T["Draft a Featured Build"]="抽取一个精选构筑"
T["Draft is already active!"]="抽取已经激活！"
T["Draft is already inactive!"]="抽取已经停用！"
T["Draft is not available at this time."]="抽取目前不可用。"
T["Draft three complete builds from the featured tab of the Hero Architect. Become epic archetypes with full, complete builds that you can jump into and play immediately.  When you choose a build draft, you'll automatically learn abilities, talents, and Mystic Enchantments while you level, allowing you to focus on the adventure. Once you reach max level, all the enchants the build uses are unlocked in your collection, and you can either deactivate build draft or swap between end-game PVE and PVP variations of the build.\n\nIf you don't like any of your choices, you can leave build draft and go to the Hero Architect (N) to load up a Featured Build. Featured Builds still automatically learn abilities, talents, and mystic enchants, but you will not earn the rewards listed here by directly loading a Featured Build."]="从英雄建筑师精选标签页中抽取三套完整构筑。成为拥有完整构筑的史诗原型，可以立即上手游玩。当你选择构筑抽取时，你会在升级过程中自动学习技能、天赋和神秘附魔，让你能够专注于冒险。达到满级后，该构筑使用的所有附魔都会在你的收藏中解锁，你可以停用构筑抽取，或在构筑的终局 PvE 与 PvP 变体之间切换。\n\n如果你对自己的任何选择都不满意，可以离开构筑抽取并前往英雄建筑师（N）加载一个精选构筑。精选构筑仍会自动学习技能、天赋和神秘附魔，但直接加载精选构筑不会获得此处列出的奖励。"
