T["Drains the soul of the target dealing 155 Shadow damage over 15 sec. Deals Four times damage to targets at or below 25% health.\r\n\r\nIf the target dies while being drained, and yields experience or honor, the caster gains a Soul Shard.  Each time the Drain Soul damages the target, it also has a chance to generate a Soul Shard.  Soul Shards are required for other spells.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="吸取目标的灵魂，在 15 秒内造成 155 点暗影伤害。对生命值处于或低于 25% 的目标造成四倍伤害。\r\n\r\n如果目标在被吸取期间死亡并提供经验值或荣誉，施法者将获得一块灵魂碎片。每当吸取灵魂对目标造成伤害时，也有几率产生一块灵魂碎片。灵魂碎片是其他法术所必需的。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 可查看更多信息|r"
T["Drains the soul of the target dealing 295 Shadow damage over 15 sec. Deals Four times damage to targets at or below 25% health.\r\n\r\nIf the target dies while being drained, and yields experience or honor, the caster gains a Soul Shard.  Each time the Drain Soul damages the target, it also has a chance to generate a Soul Shard.  Soul Shards are required for other spells.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="吸取目标的灵魂，在 15 秒内造成 295 点暗影伤害。对生命值处于或低于 25% 的目标造成四倍伤害。\r\n\r\n如果目标在被吸取期间死亡并提供经验值或荣誉，施法者将获得一块灵魂碎片。每当吸取灵魂对目标造成伤害时，也有几率产生一块灵魂碎片。灵魂碎片是其他法术所必需的。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 可查看更多信息|r"
T["Drains the soul of the target dealing 455 Shadow damage over 15 sec. Deals Four times damage to targets at or below 25% health.\r\n\r\nIf the target dies while being drained, and yields experience or honor, the caster gains a Soul Shard.  Each time the Drain Soul damages the target, it also has a chance to generate a Soul Shard.  Soul Shards are required for other spells.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="吸取目标的灵魂，在 15 秒内造成 455 点暗影伤害。对生命值处于或低于 25% 的目标造成四倍伤害。\r\n\r\n如果目标在被吸取期间死亡并提供经验值或荣誉，施法者将获得一块灵魂碎片。每当吸取灵魂对目标造成伤害时，也有几率产生一块灵魂碎片。灵魂碎片是其他法术所必需的。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Drains the soul of the target dealing 55 Shadow damage over 15 sec. Deals Four times damage to targets at or below 25% health.\r\n\r\nIf the target dies while being drained, and yields experience or honor, the caster gains a Soul Shard.  Each time the Drain Soul damages the target, it also has a chance to generate a Soul Shard.  Soul Shards are required for other spells.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="吸取目标的灵魂，在 15 秒内造成 55 点暗影伤害。对生命值处于或低于 25% 的目标造成四倍伤害。\r\n\r\n如果目标在被吸取期间死亡并提供经验值或荣誉，施法者将获得一块灵魂碎片。每当吸取灵魂对目标造成伤害时，也有几率产生一块灵魂碎片。灵魂碎片是其他法术所必需的。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Drains the soul of the target dealing 620 Shadow damage over 15 sec. Deals Four times damage to targets at or below 25% health.\r\n\r\nIf the target dies while being drained, and yields experience or honor, the caster gains a Soul Shard.  Each time the Drain Soul damages the target, it also has a chance to generate a Soul Shard.  Soul Shards are required for other spells.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="吸取目标的灵魂，在 15 秒内造成 620 点暗影伤害。对生命值处于或低于 25% 的目标造成四倍伤害。\r\n\r\n如果目标在被吸取期间死亡并提供经验值或荣誉，施法者将获得一块灵魂碎片。每当吸取灵魂对目标造成伤害时，也有几率产生一块灵魂碎片。灵魂碎片是其他法术所必需的。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
