T["Dungeons are five-player instanced challenges with elite enemies, tough bosses, and valuable loot, essential for leveling and endgame progression as they scale with your strength. \r\n\r\nYou can access them through entrances across the open world or with the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r (RDF), which matches you with a group and teleports you inside. More difficult dungeons aren’t available through RDF due to difficulty, requiring you to manually form a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r (often via World Chat) and travel to the entrance. There are four types of dungeons:\r\n\r\nNormal Dungeon – Available while leveling or shortly after reaching max level. A good place to learn boss mechanics and earn baseline gear.\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|hHeroic Dungeon|h|r – Tougher versions designed for max-level characters. Enemies hit harder, and bosses drop better loot, including Marks of Triumph or Badges of Justice.\r\n\r\nMythic Dungeon – Even more challenging, with stronger mobs and enhanced mechanics. Mythic dungeons are typically run with organized groups aiming for high performance and better loot.\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r – A competitive, timed version of Mythic dungeons that scales in difficulty with each level. Completing these challenges rewards powerful gear and seasonal rewards."]="地下城是五人副本挑战，拥有精英敌人、强悍的首领和珍贵的战利品，随着你的实力提升而成长，是升级和终局成长的核心内容。\r\n\r\n你可以通过遍布开放世界的入口进入，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r（RDF），它会为你匹配队伍并传送你进入。更困难的地下城因难度原因无法通过 RDF 进入，需要你手动组建|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r（通常通过世界频道）并前往入口。地下城共有四种类型：\r\n\r\n普通地下城——可在升级途中或刚达到满级时进入。是学习首领机制和获取基础装备的好去处。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|h英雄地下城|h|r——为满级角色设计的更困难版本。敌人攻击更狠，首领掉落更好的战利品，包括凯旋徽章或正义徽章。\r\n\r\n史诗地下城——更具挑战性，怪物更强，机制更丰富。史诗地下城通常由追求高表现和更好战利品的固定队伍进行。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r——史诗地下城的竞技限时版本，难度随层数提升。完成这些挑战可获得强力装备和赛季奖励。"
T["Duo"]="双人"
T["Duo End-game"]="双人终局"
T["Duplicate Cards Revealed:"]="已揭示的重复卡牌："
T["Durability is a system that tracks how much wear and tear your equipment takes during gameplay.  Weapons and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r have a durability value that gradually decreases as you engage in combat. Taking damage, using abilities, and especially dying all contribute to durability loss.\r\n\r\nWhen a piece of gear reaches zero durability, it breaks. Broken items lose all of their stat bonuses, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r value, and effects, making them completely unusable until repaired.\r\n\r\nTo restore durability, visit any repair Vendor, typically found in towns, quest hubs, and capital cities. These NPCs can be quickly located using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r by searching for 'Repair.' Repairing gear costs gold, with more powerful items generally requiring more to fix.\r\n\r\nKeeping your gear in good condition is vital, especially before entering dungeons, battlegrounds, or high-risk zones. Don’t wait until something breaks mid-fight, repair early and often."]="耐久度是一个记录你的装备在游戏过程中损耗程度的系统。武器和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r具有耐久度数值，会随着你参与战斗而逐渐降低。受到伤害、使用技能，尤其是死亡，都会导致耐久度损耗。\r\n\r\n当一件装备的耐久度降至零时，它就会损坏。损坏的物品会失去所有属性加成、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r值和效果，在修理之前完全无法使用。\r\n\r\n要恢复耐久度，请访问任何修理商人，他们通常出现在城镇、任务枢纽和主城中。使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r搜索「修理」即可快速找到这些 NPC。修理装备需要花费金币，越强力的物品通常修复费用越高。\r\n\r\n保持装备状态良好至关重要，尤其是在进入地下城、战场或高风险区域之前。不要等到战斗中装备损坏，尽早且经常修理。"
T["Durante los próximos 5 s, causa que tus habilidades físicas de cuerpo a cuerpo produzcan 50 daño de hemorragia durante 5 s y reduce la velocidad de movimiento del objetivo en 30% durante 3 sec. \r\n\nThis ability can be used while shapeshifted."]="在接下来的 5 秒内，使你的近战物理技能在 5 秒内造成 50 点流血伤害，并使目标的移动速度降低 30%，持续 3 秒。\r\n\n此技能可在变形状态下使用。"
