T["Embark on a quest with two allies at a shrunken stature, where each of you will shrink not only in size but in strength. Your health, healing done, and damage done are all reduced by 66 percent, leaving you weakened. Yet while each of you may be frail alone, together your party can stand strong against any challenge. Can you stick together and reach max level as a team, or will your teamwork falter along the way?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1210|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Chok'sul] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 22|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2257|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mug'thol] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 43|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:818|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mai'Zoth] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 45|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7665|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Grol the Destroyer] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 58|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="与两位身材矮小的盟友一同踏上任务，你们不仅体型会缩小，力量也会削弱。你们的生命值、造成的治疗量和造成的伤害都会降低 66%，使你变得虚弱。然而，尽管你们各自都很脆弱，但团结起来，你们的队伍就能坚强地面对任何挑战。你们能齐心协力、以团队之姿达到满级，还是会在途中团队协作崩溃？\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1210|h你必须在达到 22 级前杀死 |cffffff00[乔克苏尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2257|h你必须在达到 43 级前杀死 |cffffff00[穆戈索尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:818|h你必须在达到 45 级前杀死 |cffffff00[麦佐斯] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7665|h你必须在达到 58 级前杀死 |cffffff00[毁灭者格罗尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
T["Embark on a unique and whimsical movement challenge known as Moonwalk Mayhem. In this extraordinary endeavor, your primary mode of locomotion is confined to the art of backpedaling. Embrace the retro dance-like motion as you navigate through captivating landscapes, unveiling secrets and facing unexpected encounters along the way. Traverse the world in reverse, defying convention and adding a touch of flair to your exploration. Moonwalk Mayhem encourages you to master the art of graceful retreat, unleashing your creativity and adaptability in the face of adversity. Get ready to groove your way through this enchanting journey of whimsy and wonder.\n\nYou have to walk backwards. The challenge is that you can only walk backwards."]="踏上一场独特而奇妙的移动挑战——太空步大乱斗。在这场非凡的考验中，你的主要行进方式被限定为倒退行走。在这片迷人的风景中穿行时，拥抱这种复古的舞步般动作，揭开秘密，并在途中遭遇意想不到的事件。反向穿越世界，打破常规，为你的探索增添几分风采。太空步大乱斗鼓励你掌握优雅后退的艺术，在逆境中释放你的创造力与适应力。准备好在这段充满奇思妙想的迷人旅程中尽情摇摆吧。\n\n你必须倒退行走。挑战在于你只能倒退行走。"
T["Embark on an epic journey with a deadly twist: every hit you take is permanent until you recover at an inn. With no natural regen or healing spells to aid you, your only way to restore health and mana is eating and drinking while inside a rest zone. Plan your escapades out into the open world, and reach level cap with a single life. Will you and your allies survive, or suffer death by a thousand cuts?"]="踏上一场史诗般的旅程，却带着致命的转折：你受到的每一次伤害都是永久的，直到你在旅店中恢复。没有自然恢复，也没有治疗法术相助，你恢复生命值和法力的唯一方式就是在休息区域内进食和饮水。规划好你闯荡开放世界的每一次出行，仅凭一条命达到满级。你和你的盟友能活下来，还是会死于千刀万剐？"
T["Embark on an extraordinary quest that challenges your resourcefulness and cunning as you navigate a world where purchasing is strictly prohibited. In this unique challenge, a trade deficit has thrown the economy into disarray, leaving vendors unable to sell their goods. Your task is to explore this unforgiving landscape, relying solely on your wit and creativity to obtain the items you need. Uncover hidden treasures, forge alliances with crafters and traders, and uncover alternative methods of acquisition in your quest to overcome the trade deficit. Are you ready to embark on the Trade Deficit Delve, where resourcefulness reigns supreme and ingenuity is your greatest asset?"]="踏上一项非凡的任务，在严禁购买的世界中穿行，考验你的机智与狡黠。在这场独特的挑战中，贸易逆差使经济陷入混乱，商人们无法出售自己的货物。你的任务是探索这片无情的土地，仅凭自己的智慧和创造力获取所需的物品。发掘隐藏的宝藏，与工匠和商人结成同盟，在克服贸易逆差的征程中寻找替代的获取途径。你准备好踏入「贸易逆差探秘」了吗？这里适应力至上，机智是你最大的资本。"
T["Emboss"]="压印"
T["Embrace the earth's raw power. Rub dirt into your wounds to hasten their mending, because sometimes nature's touch is the best cure.\r\n\r\nHeal yourself 60 damage over 10 sec."]="拥抱大地的原始力量。把泥土揉进伤口以加速愈合，因为有时自然的触碰才是最好的良药。\r\n\r\n在 10 秒内治疗自己 60 点伤害。"
T["Embrace the lonely mantle of the Ironman, a symbol of self-reliance and determination. Set forth into the unforgiving wilds of Azeroth and overcome. With only one life,  no allies to aid you, and no respite from the grueling demands of Azeroth, will you rise above the trial and emerge victorious, or fall like so many before you? "]="披上钢铁侠孤独的斗篷——自立与决心的象征。踏入艾泽拉斯无情的荒野并征服它。只有一条命，没有盟友相助，也无从喘息于艾泽拉斯严酷的考验，你会超越试炼、凯旋而归，还是像你之前的许多人一样倒下？"
T["Embroider"]="刺绣"
T["Embárcate en una misión con dos aliados de estatura reducida, donde cada uno de vosotros no solo encogerá en tamaño, sino también en fuerza. Vuestra salud, la sanación realizada y el daño infligido se reducirán en un 66 por ciento, dejándoos debilitados. Sin embargo, aunque cada uno de vosotros pueda ser frágil por separado, juntos vuestro grupo puede resistir con fuerza cualquier desafío. ¿Podréis manteneros unidos y alcanzar el nivel máximo como equipo, o vuestro trabajo en equipo flaqueará por el camino?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1210|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Chok'sul] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 22|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2257|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Mug'thol] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 43|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:818|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Mai'Zoth] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 45|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7665|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Grol the Destroyer] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 58|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="与两位身材矮小的盟友一同踏上任务，你们不仅体型会缩小，力量也会削弱。你们的生命值、造成的治疗量和造成的伤害都会降低 66%，使你变得虚弱。然而，尽管你们各自都很脆弱，但团结起来，你们的队伍就能坚强地面对任何挑战。你们能齐心协力、以团队之姿达到满级，还是会在途中团队协作崩溃？\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1210|h你必须在达到 22 级前杀死 |cffffff00[乔克苏尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2257|h你必须在达到 43 级前杀死 |cffffff00[穆戈索尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:818|h你必须在达到 45 级前杀死 |cffffff00[麦佐斯] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7665|h你必须在达到 58 级前杀死 |cffffff00[毁灭者格罗尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
