T["Enables High-Risk World PvP and grants +15% experience in the open world.|n|nDeath results in dropping equipped gear, or gold if Felcom is active, and non-soulbound items from your bags. Dropping equipped Soulbound gear Bloodforges it permanently."]="启用高风险世界 PvP，并在开放世界中提供 +15% 经验值。|n|n死亡会导致掉落已装备的装备（若「邪能共济」已激活则改为掉落金币），以及背包中未灵魂绑定的物品。掉落的已灵魂绑定装备将永久变为邪铸。"
T["Enables High-Risk World PvP.|n|n Death results in dropping equipped gear or Felcom gold, and non-soulbound items from your bags. Dropping equipped Soulbound gear becomes permanently Bloodforged."]="启用高风险世界 PvP。|n|n 死亡会导致掉落已装备的装备或「邪能共济」金币，以及背包中未灵魂绑定的物品。掉落的已灵魂绑定装备将永久变为邪铸。"
T["Enables Modern Interface Textures when available."]="在可用时启用现代界面材质。"
