T["Enables World PvP and grants +10% experience in the open world.|n|nAttack other War Mode and High-Risk players. Incur no losses on death.|n|nActivate Mercenary Mode to enable optional FFA-PvP."]="启用世界 PvP，并在开放世界中提供 +10% 经验值。|n|n攻击其他战争模式和高效风险玩家。死亡时不会遭受损失。|n|n激活佣兵模式以启用可选的自由混战 PvP。"
T["Enables World PvP. Attack other War Mode and High-Risk players.|n|nOptionally enable Mercenary Mode to enable FFA-PvP.|n|nNo losses on death."]="启用世界 PvP。攻击其他战争模式和高风险玩家。|n|n可选择启用佣兵模式以启用自由混战 PvP。|n|n死亡时不会遭受损失。"
T["Enables automatic learning of spells and talents when activating this build.\n\nThis will overwrite any modifications you have made or will make to this build. "]="在激活此构筑时自动学习法术和天赋。\n\n这会覆盖你对此构筑已做或将要做的任何修改。 "
