T["Enables improved process priority and timing accuracy.\n\nEnabling this can greatly increase performance, but may also cause a significant increase in CPU usage."]="启用改进的进程优先级和计时精度。\n\n启用此项可大幅提升性能，但也可能导致 CPU 占用显著增加。"
