T["Enables triple buffering of frames when vertical sync is enabled. Selecting triple buffering may improve your framerate."]="在启用垂直同步时启用帧三重缓冲。选择三重缓冲可能提升你的帧率。"
T["Enabling this option causes your Current Target Highlight to be the size of your target's attack range. "]="启用此选项后，你的当前目标高亮将显示为目标攻击范围的大小。 "
T["Enabling this option shows IDs for various tooltips. This includes spell IDs, NPC IDs, item IDs, and more."]="启用此选项会显示各种提示信息中的 ID。这包括法术 ID、NPC ID、物品 ID 等。"
T["Enabling this setting causes NamePlates to remain the same distance above a Unit, regardless of their distance from the camera."]="启用此设置后，姓名板将保持在单位上方相同距离处，无论其与镜头的距离如何。"
T["Enabling this will prevent spell ground targeting from exceeding the range of the spell. Moving your cursor beyond the range of the spell will move the targeting to the maximum range."]="启用此项将防止法术地面目标选择超出法术射程。将光标移到法术射程之外会把目标选择移到最大射程处。"
