T["Engineering"]="工程学"
T["Engineering Bag"]="工程学袋"
T["Engineering is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r for players who want to invent powerful gadgets, explosives, and utility items that can enhance the way you play. Engineers craft unique tools, devices, and trinkets that offer both combat advantages and quirky mechanical effects.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn engineering. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the materials needed. Engineering relies heavily on metal bars and stone gathered and smelted through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|hMining|h|r, though many |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r also require components sourced by |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, enemy loot, or parts crafted through another |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you'll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, known as schematics, that teach you how to craft many items that can’t be found through other professions, like teleporters, parachutes, and combat-enhancing bombs.\r\n\r\nCrafting engineering items requires an rclight spanner, a tool that must remain in your inventory to make most schematics. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="工程学是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，适合想要发明强力装置、炸药和实用物品来改善游戏方式的玩家。工程师会制作独特的工具、装置和饰品，既能提供战斗优势，也有奇特的机械效果。\r\n\r\n首先，你需要拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习工程学。训练完成后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需的材料。工程学非常依赖通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r 采集和熔炼的金属锭与石头，不过许多 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 还需要来自 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、敌人掉落的部件，或通过另一门 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 制作的零件。\r\n\r\n随着等级提升，你将解锁 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r（称为图纸），它们会教你制作许多其他专业无法获得的物品，例如传送器、降落伞和强化战斗的炸弹。\r\n\r\n制作工程学物品需要一把扳手，大多数图纸都要求这件工具留在你的背包中。对于需要兼顾多个专业的玩家，购买一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品能将所有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 工具整合到一个背包格中，可在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商城|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 用游戏内金币购买。"
