T["Epic Riding"]="史诗骑术"
T["Epic Spells give you opportunities to turn the tide of battle, massively increasing your damage output, helping your escape from certain death scenarios, preventing a deadly enemy cast or stunning your opponent.\n\nEpics are primarily made up of Crowd Control, Crowd Control Removal, Stuns, Mobility, Pets, Interrupts, Active Offensive and Defensive Cooldowns."]="史诗法术为你提供扭转战局的机会，大幅提高你的伤害输出，帮助你脱离必死之境，阻止敌人的致命施法或击晕对手。\n\n史诗法术主要由群体控制、解除群体控制、击晕、机动性、宠物、打断、主动进攻与防御冷却技能组成。"
T["Equip Slot"]="装备栏位"
T["Equip a |cffCC6600Legendary Mystic Enchant|r\nto include in suggestions"]="装备一个 |cffCC6600传说神秘附魔|r\n以纳入推荐"
T["Equipment"]="装备"
T["Equipment Set"]="装备套装"
T["Equipment Sets"]="装备套装"
T["Equipment Sets let you quickly swap between different gear loadouts using the equipment manager (Hotkey C -> Equipment Manager Tab) a built-in tool designed to make changing builds fast and efficient. \r\n\r\nThe equipment manager allows you to save your current gear as a named set, making it easy to switch between setups. When you activate a saved set, the system will automatically equip the correct items whether they’re in your inventory or stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r.\r\n\r\nYou can also assign specific equipment sets to your Specialization, so your gear automatically swaps to match the build you're using."]="装备套装让你可以使用装备管理器（快捷键 C -> 装备管理器标签页）在不同的装备配装之间快速切换，这是一个旨在让更换构筑变得快速高效的内置工具。 \r\n\r\n装备管理器允许你将当前装备保存为具名套装，从而轻松地在不同配置之间切换。当你激活一个已保存的套装时，系统会自动装备正确的物品，无论它们是在你的背包中还是存放在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r 中。\r\n\r\n你还可以将特定的装备套装分配给你的专精，这样你的装备就会自动切换以匹配你正在使用的构筑。"
T["Equipped"]="已装备"
