T["Experience (also known as XP or EXP) is the core system that tracks your character’s progress toward the next level until the maximum level is achieved. The maximum level is 60 for Vanilla, 70 for the Burning Crusade Expansion, and 80 for Wrath of the Lich King.\r\n\r\nYou gain experience by doing a wide variety of activities in the world, including:\r\n\r\nCompleting Quests\r\nDefeating Enemies\r\nExploring a New |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|hSub-Zone|h|r\r\nGathering or Crafting using a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r\r\nParticipating in Battlegrounds or World Events\r\n\r\nYour experience bar is located along the bottom of the screen, showing your progress toward the next level. Once the bar is filled, your character levels up and grants new stat points, spell options, Talents and more.\r\n\r\nYour experience gain can be boosted by items like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|hRested Experience|h|r from an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:133|hHotspots|h|r, which offer bonus experience in specific zones."]="经验值（又称 XP 或 EXP）是追踪你的角色向下一级推进直至达到满级的核心系统。最高等级为经典旧世的 60 级、燃烧的远征资料片的 70 级和巫妖王之怒的 80 级。\r\n\r\n你可以通过在世界中参与各种各样的活动来获得经验值，包括：\r\n\r\n完成任务\r\n击败敌人\r\n探索新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|h子区域|h|r\r\n使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 采集或制作\r\n参加战场或世界事件\r\n\r\n你的经验条位于屏幕底部，显示你向下一级推进的进度。经验条填满后，你的角色就会升级，并获得新的属性点、法术选项、天赋等。\r\n\r\n你的经验值获取可以借助 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、来自 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|h充分休息经验|h|r，以及 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:133|h热点|h|r 等物品来提升，后者会在特定区域提供额外经验值。"
T["Experience Items"]="经验值物品"
T["Experimental Process Timing"]="实验性进程计时"
T["Expert"]="专家"
T["Expertise is a secondary stat that reduces the chance your attacks will be dodged or parried by enemies. This means your attacks are more likely to land successfully, improving your overall damage and combat effectiveness.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current expertise in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="精准是一项次要属性，可降低你的攻击被敌人躲闪或招架的几率。这意味着你的攻击更有可能成功命中，从而提升你的总体伤害和战斗效率。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息中查看当前的精准（快捷键 C）。"
