T["Featured Builds automatically apply Abilities, Talents, and Mystic Enchants while you level up.\n\nAll Featured builds are capable of performing in the top 1% of builds, which is a criteria for builds to be featured.\n\nFeatured Builds can only be activated before reaching level 10."]="精选构筑会在你升级时自动应用技能、天赋和神秘附魔。\n\n所有精选构筑都能跻身前 1% 的构筑之列，这是构筑入选精选的标准。\n\n精选构筑只能在达到 10 级之前激活。"
