T["Fel Commutation"]="邪能共济"
T["Fel Commutation Activated. Your equipped items are now insured!"]="邪能共济已激活。你已装备的物品现在有保险了！"
T["Fel Commutation Disabled. Your equipped items are no longer insured!"]="邪能共济已禁用。你已装备的物品不再有保险了！"
T["Fel Commutation is a special gear protection system used in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|hHigh-Risk PvP Mode|h|r, allowing players to safeguard up to three specific pieces of equipment from being dropped when they die. It acts like a form of insurance, helping reduce the sting of PvP losses without fully removing the risk.\r\n\r\nWhen you commutate, you select which three gear pieces (such as weapons, trinkets, or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r) you want to protect. If you die while flagged for high-risk, these protected items will be immune to loot drops, ensuring you keep your most valuable gear. However, a small gold fee will be automatically deducted each time fel commutation activates upon death.\r\n\r\nYou can access the Fel Commutation Portal in any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r by looking for its icon on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r or asking a guard. It’s a vital system for players diving into dangerous PvP zones, especially those carrying valuable equipment or farming high-stakes objectives."]="邪能共济是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|h高风险 PvP 模式|h|r 中使用的一种特殊装备保护系统，允许玩家保护最多三件特定装备，使其在死亡时不会掉落。它就像一种保险，有助于减轻 PvP 损失的痛楚，同时又不完全消除风险。\r\n\r\n当你进行共济时，你可以选择要保护的三件装备（例如武器、饰品或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r）。如果你在标记为高风险的状态下死亡，这些受保护的物品将免疫掉落，确保你保住最宝贵的装备。不过，每次死亡时邪能共济激活都会自动扣除少量金币费用。\r\n\r\n你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 找到邪能共济传送门，在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上寻找其图标，或询问卫兵。对于深入危险 PvP 区域的玩家来说，这是一个至关重要的系统，尤其是那些携带贵重装备或追求高风险目标的玩家。"
T["Fel Commutation is already active."]="邪能共济已处于激活状态。"
T["Fel Commutation is not active!|nYou could potentially lose equipment if you die!"]="邪能共济未激活！若你死亡，可能会损失装备！"
