T["Fills the Paladin with divine light for until cancelled, giving each melee attack a chance to heal the Paladin for 2.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy for 20 sec, granting attacks made against the judged enemy a chance of healing the attacker for 2% of their base health.  Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time."]="用神圣之光充满圣骑士，持续至取消，使每次近战攻击都有几率治疗圣骑士 2 点。同一时间圣骑士身上只能激活一种圣印。\r\n\r\n释放此圣印的能量将审判一个敌人，持续 20 秒，使针对被审判敌人的攻击有几率治疗攻击者，为其恢复其基础生命值的 2%。同一时间每个圣骑士只能激活一个审判效果。"
T["Fills the Paladin with divine wisdom for until cancelled, giving each melee auto attack a chance to restore 4% of the caster's basemana.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will deal 5 Holy damage to an enemy."]="用神圣智慧充满圣骑士，持续至取消，使每次近战自动攻击都有几率恢复施法者 4% 的基础法力值。同一时间圣骑士身上只能激活一种圣印。\r\n\r\n释放此圣印的能量将对一个敌人造成 5 点神圣伤害。"
T["Fills you with divine wisdom for until cancelled, giving each melee auto attack a chance to restore 4% of your total mana. Only one Seal can be active at any one time.\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will deal 4 Holy damage to an enemy."]="用神圣智慧充满你，持续至取消，使每次近战自动攻击都有几率恢复你 4% 的总法力值。同一时间只能激活一种圣印。\r\n\r\n释放此圣印的能量将对一个敌人造成 4 点神圣伤害。"
