T["Finishing move that consumes your Deadly Poison doses on the target and deals instant poison damage. \r\n\r\nAfter the Envenom attack you have an additional 15% chance to apply Deadly Poison and a 75% increased frequency of applying Instant Poison for 1 sec plus an additional 1 sec per combo point.  One dose is consumed for each combo point:\r\n  1 dose:  38 damage\r\n  2 doses: 78 damage\r\n  3 doses: 117 damage\r\n  4 doses: 158 damage\r\n  5 doses: 200 damage"]="终结技，消耗目标身上的致命毒药层数并造成瞬发毒药伤害。 \r\n\r\n在毒伤攻击之后，你额外获得 15% 的几率施加致命毒药，并且施加速效毒药的频率提高 75%，持续 1 秒，每个连击点数额外延长 1 秒。 每个连击点数消耗一层：\r\n  1 层：  38 点伤害\r\n  2 层： 78 点伤害\r\n  3 层： 117 点伤害\r\n  4 层： 158 点伤害\r\n  5 层： 200 点伤害"
T["Finishing move that consumes your Deadly Poison doses on the target and deals instant poison damage.  Following the Envenom attack you have an additional 15% chance to apply Deadly Poison and a 75% increased frequency of applying Instant Poison for 1 sec plus an additional 1 sec per combo point.  One dose is consumed for each combo point:\r\n  1 dose:  106 damage\r\n  2 doses: 214 damage\r\n  3 doses: 321 damage\r\n  4 doses: 430 damage\r\n  5 doses: 540 damage"]="终结技，消耗目标身上的致命毒药层数并造成瞬发毒药伤害。 在毒伤攻击之后，你额外获得 15% 的几率施加致命毒药，并且施加速效毒药的频率提高 75%，持续 1 秒，每个连击点数额外延长 1 秒。 每个连击点数消耗一层：\r\n  1 层：  106 点伤害\r\n  2 层： 214 点伤害\r\n  3 层： 321 点伤害\r\n  4 层： 430 点伤害\r\n  5 层： 540 点伤害"
T["Finishing move that consumes your Deadly Poison doses on the target and deals instant poison damage.  Following the Envenom attack you have an additional 15% chance to apply Deadly Poison and a 75% increased frequency of applying Instant Poison for 1 sec plus an additional 1 sec per combo point.  One dose is consumed for each combo point:\r\n  1 dose:  147 damage\r\n  2 doses: 296 damage\r\n  3 doses: 444 damage\r\n  4 doses: 594 damage\r\n  5 doses: 745 damage"]="终结技，消耗目标身上的致命毒药层数并造成瞬发毒药伤害。 在毒伤攻击之后，你额外获得 15% 的几率施加致命毒药，并且施加速效毒药的频率提高 75%，持续 1 秒，每个连击点数额外延长 1 秒。 每个连击点数消耗一层：\r\n  1 层：  147 点伤害\r\n  2 层： 296 点伤害\r\n  3 层： 444 点伤害\r\n  4 层： 594 点伤害\r\n  5 层： 745 点伤害"
