T["Fire a freezing arrow that places a Freezing Trap at the target location, freezing the first enemy that approaches, preventing all action for up to 20 sec.  Any damage caused will break the ice.  Trap will exist for 30 sec. Only one trap can be active at a time."]="射出一支冰冻箭，在目标位置放置一个冰冻陷阱，冻结第一个靠近的敌人，使其最多 20 秒内无法进行任何行动。 任何造成的伤害都会打破冰冻。 陷阱将持续 30 秒。同一时间只能有一个陷阱处于激活状态。"
T["First Aid"]="急救"
T["First Aid is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r, focused on creating bandages and other medical supplies that restore health quickly in and out of combat.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn first aid. Once trained, you can start collecting the necessary materials, which primarily consists of cloth dropped by humanoid enemies in the open world. These materials are then processed into bandages of increasing potency as you level up this skill.\r\n\r\nAs you progress, you’ll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, known as manuals, that teach you how to craft stronger bandages and other healing items.\r\n\r\nFirst aid does not require any tools or special crafting locations, making it one of the most accessible and low-maintenance skills to use."]="急救是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r，也是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于制作绷带和其他医疗用品，以便在战斗内外快速恢复生命值。\r\n\r\n首先，你需要拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习急救。训练完成后，你就可以开始收集必要的材料，它们主要由开放世界中类人敌人掉落的布料构成。随着你提升此技能，这些材料会被加工成效力不断增强的绷带。\r\n\r\n随着你的进步，你将解锁 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r（称为手册），它们会教你制作更强的绷带和其他治疗物品。\r\n\r\n急救不需要任何工具或特殊的制作地点，这使它成为最容易上手、最省心的技能之一。"
T["First Class Experimental Teleporter"]="头等实验性传送器"
T["First Profession"]="第一专业"
T["Fishing"]="钓鱼"
T["Fishing is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Fish gathered through this skill are used in a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn fishing. Once trained, you can begin gathering fish, or even buried treasure, by locating the nearest body of water. Once leveling to fishing skill 100, you can use a Weather-Beaten Journal that will teach you the skill to 'Find Fish' using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r. This highlights nearby pools with schools of fish where you have a much higher chance to get specific items.\r\n\r\nEach time you collect an item from the water, you have a chance to contribute to your Fishing skill and provide fish-based materials used directly in crafting. Different zones contain different types of fish, typically tied to level ranges and progression, so exploring new areas becomes a rewarding part of leveling the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo catch fish, you’ll need a Fishing Rod, which must be equipped and can be purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r. You can also enhance your fishing ability by attaching lures to your rod. These can also be bought from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, and will temporarily boost your fishing skill allowing you to fish in higher-level waters."]="钓鱼是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r，也是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在开放世界中探索并收集自然资源的玩家。通过此技能钓到的鱼可用于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习钓鱼。训练完成后，你就可以通过找到最近的水域来开始钓鱼，甚至打捞埋藏的宝藏。当钓鱼技能达到 100 后，你可以使用一本饱经风霜的日志，它会教你使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 来「寻找鱼群」的技能。这会在附近有鱼群的水池上做标记，在那里你获得特定物品的几率要高得多。\r\n\r\n每次从水中收集物品时，你都有机会提升你的钓鱼技能，并获得直接用于制作的鱼类材料。不同区域有不同种类的鱼，通常与等级区间和成长进度相关，因此探索新区域就成为提升该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 的回报丰厚的一环。\r\n\r\n要钓鱼，你需要一根钓鱼竿，它必须装备在身上，可从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买。你还可以通过在鱼竿上安装鱼饵来增强钓鱼能力。鱼饵同样可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买，它们会暂时提高你的钓鱼技能，让你能在更高级别的水域钓鱼。"
