T["Flight Master"]="飞行管理员"
T["Flight Masters"]="飞行管理员"
T["Flightpaths (FP) are a fast-travel system, allowing players to quickly fly between specific, connected locations across the open world. They’re essential for cutting down travel time, especially when questing or moving between distant zones.\r\n\r\nTo use a flightpath, you must first unlock its node by speaking to the local |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r. You can also instantly unlock certain nodes by using special items like the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:106|hFeather of the Ancients|h|r, which reveals multiple locations at once.\r\n\r\nHowever, you can only fly between nodes that are directly connected and already discovered. If you're trying to travel across multiple zones, you’ll need to have unlocked all the Flightmasters along the route, otherwise, the system won’t allow you to fly to your intended destination.\r\n\r\nOnce enough nodes are unlocked, you can chain multiple points together to create efficient travel routes, making it much easier to return to old quest hubs, dungeons, or cities.\r\n\r\nFlightpaths are accessed through any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r, typically marked with a wing icon on your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r and mini-map. When planning your journey, be sure to use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r to find nearby Flightmasters and keep your travel network growing."]="飞行路线（FP）是一种快速旅行系统，允许玩家在开放世界中相互连接的具体地点之间快速飞行。它们对于缩短旅行时间至关重要，尤其是在做任务或在相距遥远的区域之间移动时。\r\n\r\n要使用飞行路线，你必须先通过与当地的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 对话来解锁其节点。你也可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:106|h先祖之羽|h|r 等特殊物品来立即解锁某些节点，它会一次性揭示多个地点。\r\n\r\n不过，你只能在直接相连且已发现的节点之间飞行。如果你想跨多个区域旅行，你需要解锁沿途所有的飞行管理员，否则系统不会允许你飞往预定的目的地。\r\n\r\n一旦解锁了足够多的节点，你就可以将多个地点串联起来，规划高效的旅行路线，从而更容易返回旧的任务枢纽、地下城或城市。\r\n\r\n飞行路线可通过任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 使用，它们通常在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 和小地图上以翅膀图标标记。规划旅程时，务必使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 来寻找附近的飞行管理员，让你的旅行网络不断扩展。"
T["Flip Camera"]="翻转镜头"
