T["Forge metals and ore found by Mining into an immense variety of helpful items. By tinkering ceaselessly, and tolerating malfunctions, an engineer can make utterly unique objects: sight-enhancing goggles, potent guns, robot pets, bombs, and many other unique gadgets.\n\nAdvanced Engineers may also specialize into Goblin or Gnomish engineering."]="将采矿获得的金属与矿石锻造成种类繁多的实用物品。通过不断摆弄并忍受故障，工程师可以制造出独一无二的物件：增强视力的护目镜、强力的枪械、机器人宠物、炸弹，以及许多其他独特的装置。\n\n高级工程师还可以专精于地精工程学或侏儒工程学。"
T["Forge metals and ore found by Mining into deadly weapons, mail armor, plate armor, and other similar items. Blacksmiths (particularly those that equip heavy armor) are able to outfit themselves, guildmates, or sell their creations via the Auction House.\n\nAdvanced Blacksmiths may also specialize further into Armorsmithing or Weaponsmithing."]="将采矿获得的金属与矿石锻造成致命的武器、锁甲、板甲和其他类似物品。铁匠（尤其是那些身穿重甲的铁匠）能够为自己、公会成员打造装备，或通过拍卖行出售自己的作品。\n\n高级铁匠还可以进一步专精于护甲锻造或武器锻造。"
