T["Gain the ability to craft |cffffffffCrude Leather|r from the Leather obtained from Skinning, gives you a chance to find it when Skinning beasts, and increases your Skinning speed.\n\nAllows you to craft items that require |cffffffffCrude Leather|r.\n\nYou can learn |cffffffffBushcraft|r crafts from a Ranger Trainer, which can be found by speaking to a Guard in most capital cities."]="获得用剥皮所得的皮革制作 |cffffffff粗制皮革|r 的能力，使你在剥皮野兽时有几率找到它，并提高你的剥皮速度。\n\n允许你制作需要 |cffffffff粗制皮革|r 的物品。\n\n你可以从游侠训练师处学习 |cffffffff丛林工艺|r 制作，在大多数主城中与卫兵交谈即可找到他们。"
