T["Gathering professions are a category of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r that allows players to gather raw materials from the world to supply various a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r.\r\n\r\nThe available gathering professions are:\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h|r - Gather herbs used in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r and other crafting |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|hMining|h|r - Extract ore and stone from mineral nodes, used in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|hBlacksmithing|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h|r.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h|r - Collect leather, hides, and scales from slain beasts, used in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|hLeatherworking|h|r.\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:254|hWoodcutting|h|r - Chop down trees to turn into lumber and turn in for quests.\r\n\r\nGathering professions are a great way to earn gold, supply yourself or your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r with necessary crafting materials, and engage more deeply with the world’s diverse zones."]="采集专业是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r 的一个类别，允许玩家从世界中采集原材料，供给各种 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r。\r\n\r\n可用的采集专业有：\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r - 采集用于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r 和其他制作 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 的草药。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r - 从矿脉中提取矿石和石头，用于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|h锻造|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r - 从被杀死的野兽身上收集皮革、毛皮和鳞片，用于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|h制皮|h|r。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:254|h伐木|h|r - 砍伐树木制成木材，并可上交完成任务。\r\n\r\n采集专业是赚取金币、为自己或你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r 提供必要制作材料，并更深入体验世界多样区域的好方法。"
