T["Gives a 100% chance to remove all Movement Impairing effects when you activate your Sprint ability."]="当你激活疾跑技能时，有 100% 的几率移除所有降低移动速度的效果。"
T["Gives a 50% chance to remove all Movement Impairing effects when you activate your Sprint ability."]="当你激活疾跑技能时，有 50% 的几率移除所有降低移动速度的效果。"
T["Gives all members of the raid or group a Greater Blessing of Sanctuary, reducing damage taken by 3% and increasing strength and stamina by 10% for 1 hour.\r\n\r\nIn addition, when the target blocks, parries, or dodges a melee attack the target will gain 6% of base mana."]="为团队或小队的所有成员施加强效庇护祝福，使其受到的伤害降低 3%，力量和耐力提高 10%，持续 1 小时。\r\n\r\n此外，当目标格挡、招架或躲闪一次近战攻击时，目标将获得其基础法力值的 6%。"
T["Gives the Paladin a chance to deal additional Holy damage equal to 35% of normal weapon damage.  Only one Seal can be active on the Paladin at any one time.  Lasts 30 sec.\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing $s1 Holy damage, $s1 if the target is stunned or incapacitated."]="使圣骑士有几率造成相当于普通武器伤害 35% 的额外神圣伤害。 同一时间圣骑士身上只能激活一种圣印。 持续 30 秒。\r\n\r\n释放此圣印的能量将审判一个敌人，立即造成 $s1 点神圣伤害，如果目标被击晕或失去行动能力则造成 $s1 点伤害。"
T["Gives you a 1% bonus to Physical and Holy damage you deal after dealing a direct critical strike. \r\n\r\nStacks up to 3 times. Lasts 30 seconds."]="在造成一次直接爆击后，你造成的物理和神圣伤害提高 1%。\r\n\r\n最多叠加 3 次。持续 30 秒。"
T["Gives you a 10% chance of entering a Clearcasting state after using a magic damaging spell or ability.\r\n\r\nThe Clearcasting state reduces the mana, energy or rage cost of your next spell by 100%."]="在使用造成伤害的魔法法术或技能后，你有 10% 的几率进入节能施法状态。\r\n\r\n节能施法状态会使你下一个法术的法力、能量或怒气消耗降低 100%。"
T["Gives you a 100% chance to add a combo point to your target after dodging or parrying their attack.\r\n \r\nIncreases the duration of your Ghostly Strike effect by 6 seconds.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="在躲闪或招架敌人的攻击后，你有 100% 的几率给你的目标增加一个连击点数。\r\n \r\n使你的幽魂击效果持续时间延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Gives you a 15% chance of entering a Clearcasting state after using a magic damaging spell or ability.\r\n\r\nThe Clearcasting state reduces the mana, energy or rage cost of your next spell by 100%."]="在使用造成伤害的魔法法术或技能后，你有 15% 的几率进入节能施法状态。\r\n\r\n节能施法状态会使你下一个法术的法力、能量或怒气消耗降低 100%。"
T["Gives you a 33% chance to add a combo point to your target after dodging or parrying their attack.\r\n \r\nIncreases the duration of your Ghostly Strike effect by 2 seconds.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="在躲闪或招架敌人的攻击后，你有 33% 的几率给你的目标增加一个连击点数。\r\n \r\n使你的幽魂击效果持续时间延长 2 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Gives you a 33% chance to gain a 10% bonus to your Spirit after killing a target that yields experience or honor. Lasts 15 sec.\r\n\r\nFor the duration, your mana will regenerate at 25% rate while casting.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="在杀死一个可获得经验值或荣誉的目标后，你有 33% 的几率获得 10% 的精神加成。持续 15 秒。\r\n\r\n在此期间，你的法力将在施法时以 25% 的速度恢复。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Gives you a 5% chance of entering a Clearcasting state after using a magic damaging spell or ability.\r\n\r\nThe Clearcasting state reduces the mana, energy or rage cost of your next spell by 100%."]="在使用造成伤害的魔法法术或技能后，你有 5% 的几率进入节能施法状态。\r\n\r\n节能施法状态会使你下一个法术的法力、能量或怒气消耗降低 100%。"
T["Gives you a 50% chance to gain Focused Casting after being hit by a melee or ranged critical strike. \r\n\r\nFocused Casting reduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting Priest spells by 100% and decreases the duration of Interrupt effects by 10%. Lasts 6 sec."]="在受到近战或远程爆击后，你有 50% 的几率获得专注施法。 \r\n\r\n专注施法使你在施放牧师法术时因受到伤害攻击而遭受的延迟降低 100%，并使打断效果的持续时间缩短 10%。持续 6 秒。"
T["Gives your Shield Bash and Heroic Throw a 100% chance to silence the target for 3 sec. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage of your Shield Slam ability by 10%."]="使你的盾牌猛击和英勇投掷有 100% 的几率沉默目标，持续 3 秒。 \r\n\r\n使你的盾牌猛击技能伤害提高 10%。"
T["Gives your Shield Bash and Heroic Throw a 50% chance to silence the target for 3 sec. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage of your Shield Slam ability by 5%."]="使你的盾牌猛击和英勇投掷有 50% 的几率沉默目标，持续 3 秒。 \r\n\r\n使你的盾牌猛击技能伤害提高 5%。"
