T["Grants 70 haste rating and reduces the mana cost of your healing spells by 5% for 15 sec."]="使你的急速等级提高 70 点，并使你的治疗法术的法力消耗降低 5%，持续 15 秒。"
T["Grants 70 haste rating, and reduces the mana cost of Rejuvenation, Healing Touch, Regrowth, and Tranquility by 5% for 15 sec."]="使你的急速等级提高 70 点，并使回春术、治疗之触、愈合和宁静的法力消耗降低 5%，持续 15 秒。"
T["Grants 80% additional armor contribution from cloth and leather items while in Travel Form or while not shapeshifted.\r\n\r\nIncreases the damage reduction granted by your Barkskin spell by 5%.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance your Barkskin is dispelled by 35%."]="在旅行形态下或未变形时，使布甲和皮甲物品提供的护甲加成提高 80%。\r\n\r\n使你树皮术提供的伤害减免提高 5%。\r\n\r\n使你树皮术被驱散的几率降低 35%。"
T["Grants immunity to Arcane damage."]="使目标免疫奥术伤害。"
T["Grants immunity to Fire damage."]="使目标免疫火焰伤害。"
T["Grants immunity to Frost damage."]="使目标免疫冰霜伤害。"
T["Grants immunity to Shadow damage."]="使目标免疫暗影伤害。"
T["Grants the Beast Within Ability."]="授予野兽之心技能。"
T["Grants the Spitfire Totem Ability."]="授予喷火图腾技能。"
T["Grants the Tidal Surge Ability."]="授予潮汐涌流技能。"
T["Grants the target of your Lay on Hands spell 10% reduced Physical damage taken for 15 sec. \r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of Lay on Hands by 2 min."]="使你圣疗术的目标受到的物理伤害降低 10%，持续 15 秒。 \r\n\r\n使圣疗术的冷却时间缩短 2 分钟。"
T["Grants the target of your Lay on Hands spell 20% reduced Physical damage taken for 15 sec. \r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of Lay on Hands by 4 min."]="使你圣疗术的目标受到的物理伤害降低 20%，持续 15 秒。 \r\n\r\n使圣疗术的冷却时间缩短 4 分钟。"
