T["Great choice!\n\nYou can view your current profession level by opening your [KEYWORD:Spellbook] by pressing [ACTION:P] and finding the spell related to the profession you just learned\n\nClicking the spell will open the [KEYWORD:Crafting Window] for that profession\n\nYou can gain skill in the profession by [ACTION:Gathering] or [ACTION:Crafting] depending on your choice\n\n[ACTION:Turn In]\n[QUEST:1903542]\nat the\n[NPC:Beginner's Book of Ascension]."]="好选择！\n\n按下 [ACTION:P] 打开你的 [KEYWORD:法术书]，找到与你刚学会的专业相关的法术，即可查看你当前的专业等级\n\n点击该法术将打开该专业的 [KEYWORD:制作窗口]\n\n你可以根据选择通过 [ACTION:采集] 或 [ACTION:制作] 来提升该专业的技能\n\n[ACTION:上交]\n[QUEST:1903542]\n于\n[NPC:飞升初级之书]。"
T["Great job!\n\nYou have just allocated your primary stat!\n\nWhen you level up, you will gain points in that stat!\n\nYou can change your stat at anytime.\n\nTo continue, complete the quest at [NPC:Beginner's Book of Ascension]"]="干得好！\n\n你刚刚分配了你的主属性！\n\n当你升级时，你将获得该属性的点数！\n\n你可以随时更改你的属性。\n\n要继续，请在 [NPC:飞升初级之书] 处完成任务"
T["Great! Cast Ability once again!"]="很好！再次施放技能！"
T["Greaves of Shackled Souls"]="束缚之魂护胫"
T["Greed is good! As a solo Resolute Ironman, make a specific number of gold every 10 levels or die from poverty. Reach level cap with at least 1000g.\n\n10: 10g\n20: 50g\n30: 100g\n40: 200g\n50: 500g\n60: 1000g"]="贪婪是好事！作为一名单人坚毅钢铁侠，每 10 级必须赚取指定数量的金币，否则就会死于贫穷。以至少 1000 金币达到满级。\n\n10 级： 10 金币\n20 级： 50 金币\n30 级： 100 金币\n40 级： 200 金币\n50 级： 500 金币\n60 级： 1000 金币"
T["Green Gem"]="绿色宝石"
T["Green Isn't my Color"]="绿色不是我的风格"
T["Greetings friend, glad to see you still in one piece. I suppose you do not happen to have any of those Marks of Ascension, do you? First, a preface: Tired of leaving destiny up to your fate? \n\n ...I suppose you're trying to understand what that means. I'll put it into layman terms, I can offer you the chance to change your destiny Hidexs. \n\n Hand of Fates are one of the most sought after commodities in Azeroth!"]="你好，朋友，很高兴看到你还完好无损。我想你身上应该没有那些飞升印记吧？首先，说句开场白：厌倦了把命运交给运气吗？ \n\n ...我想你正在琢磨那是什么意思。说得通俗点，我可以给你一个改变命运的机会，Hidexs。 \n\n 命运之手是艾泽拉斯最抢手的商品之一！"
T["Greetings friend, want to share my fire?\n\nIt's quite dark out here, and there are some strange noises that give me goosebumps and send shivers down my spine.\n\n…Isn't it great?!"]="你好，朋友，想分享我的火堆吗？\n\n外面相当黑，还有些奇怪的声音让我起鸡皮疙瘩、脊背发凉。\n\n…很棒，对吧？！"
T["Greetings, Hero.\r\n\r\nI offer two services to customize your adventure:\r\n\r\n**Experience Bonus Control**: I can disable all bonus experience sources - Potions of Experience, Auras of Experience, and Refer a Friend bonuses - allowing you to progress at the base rate.\r\n\r\n**Open World Scaling**: I can enable creatures in the open world to automatically match your level for consistent challenge."]="你好，英雄。\r\n\r\n我提供两项服务来定制你的冒险：\r\n\r\n**经验加成控制**：我可以禁用所有经验加成来源——经验药水、经验光环和招募好友加成——让你按基础速率成长。\r\n\r\n**开放世界缩放**：我可以让开放世界中的生物自动匹配你的等级，以保持一致的挑战性。"
T["Grimclaw? Easy there, my friend... where is your master Volcor?"]="恐爪？别急，我的朋友...你的主人沃科尔在哪？"
