T["Guilds are player-created communities that bring adventurers together under a shared banner. Whether you’re looking for friends to chat with, teammates for Dungeons and Raids, or just a sense of belonging in the world, joining a guild opens the door to more social and rewarding gameplay.\r\n\r\nBeing part of a guild gives you access to several valuable features, including a guild chat channel as well as a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:34|hGuild Bank|h|r to collect and share items with your guildmates.\r\n\r\nTo find a guild, keep an eye on the global chat for recruitment messages or check your realm’s Discord server, where many guilds advertise their goals and playstyles.\r\n\r\nIf you’d rather lead than join, you can start your own guild by visiting your faction’s Guild Master NPC, found in major cities. For a small fee, you can purchase a Guild Charter, gather a few signatures from fellow players, and form your own community from scratch."]="公会是玩家创建的社群，将冒险者们聚集在同一面旗帜之下。无论你是在寻找可以聊天的朋友、一起打地下城和团队副本的队友，还是只想在这个世界中找到归属感，加入公会都能为你开启更具社交性和回报的游戏体验。\r\n\r\n成为公会的一员可以让你使用多项宝贵功能，包括公会聊天频道以及用于与公会成员收集和分享物品的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:34|h公会银行|h|r。\r\n\r\n要寻找公会，请留意世界聊天中的招募信息，或查看你所在服务器的 Discord，许多公会都会在那里宣传自己的目标和玩法风格。\r\n\r\n如果你更想领导而非加入，你可以拜访主城中本阵营的公会大师 NPC，创建自己的公会。只需支付一小笔费用，你就能购买公会章程，收集几位玩家的签名，从零开始组建自己的社群。"
