T["Hardcore |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h|r are special challenge modes that reward players for reaching the maximum level without dying. Designed to test your skill, focus, and knowledge of the game, these |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h|r offer unique rewards and bragging rights to those who survive the journey from level 1 to maximum without falling in battle.\r\n\r\nTo begin a hardcore trial, your character must be level 1. Visit |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h|r, found in your starting zone or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, to activate the trial. It's important to note that you must start the trial before gaining any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r. Additionally, you won’t be able to trade, use the mailbox, or access the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r until after you’ve started the challenge.\r\n\r\nDuring the trial, if your character dies even once, the challenge is failed. However, unlike perma-death modes, your character will revive normally and can continue to play the game as usual, they simply won’t receive the tardcore trial rewards.\r\n\r\nSuccessfully completing a hardcore trial often grants you cosmetics, titles, vanity items, or other exclusive rewards, making it a popular option for players seeking thrilling and rewarding gameplay."]="硬核 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r 是一种特殊的挑战模式，奖励那些在不死亡的情况下达到满级的玩家。这些 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r 旨在考验你的技巧、专注力和对游戏的了解，为那些从 1 级到满级全程未在战斗中倒下的幸存者提供独特的奖励和炫耀的资本。\r\n\r\n要开始硬核试炼，你的角色必须是 1 级。前往你出生地或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|h石皮塔克|h|r 来激活试炼。需要注意的是，你必须在获得任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 之前开始试炼。此外，在开始挑战之前，你无法交易、使用邮箱或访问 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r。\r\n\r\n在试炼期间，如果你的角色哪怕死亡一次，挑战即告失败。不过，与永久死亡模式不同，你的角色会正常复活，可以照常继续游戏，只是不会获得硬核试炼的奖励。\r\n\r\n成功完成硬核试炼通常会奖励你外观、头衔、装饰品或其他专属奖励，这使它成为追求刺激与回报的玩家们的热门选择。"
T["Harvest potent herbs found throughout the world, which can be transformed by other professions' - mostly Alchemy or Inscription - recipes. Materials gathered by Herbalist can provide reagents to guildmates, or they may sell their gatherings via the Auction House."]="采集遍布世界的强效草药，它们可以被其他专业——主要是炼金术或铭文——的配方转化。草药师采集的材料可以为公会成员提供材料，也可以通过拍卖行出售他们的采集品。"
