T["Have you ever thought to yourself \"Gosh, I sure wish I didn't have any bag space ever\" then this the trial for YOU! \n\nEnter a terrible nightmare where you have only 16 bag slots to work with, and no additional space of any kind! You'll have to reach max level with just a single life, and backpack of space! "]="你是否曾想过 \"天哪，我真希望自己永远没有背包空间\"？那么这项试炼就是为你准备的！ \n\n进入一场可怕的噩梦，你只有 16 个背包格可用，没有任何其他类型的额外空间！你必须仅凭一条命和区区一个背包的空间达到满级！ "
T["Head to the East Corner of the Trade District, then follow the ramp up, speak to Dungar Longdrink."]="前往贸易区的东角，然后沿斜坡而上，与杜加尔·朗德瑞克交谈。"
