T["Healing power is a secondary stat that increases the effectiveness of your healing spells and abilities. The higher your Healing Power, the more health your abilities restore, making it essential for all healing-focused builds.\r\n\r\nYou can view your healing power in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="治疗强度是一项次要属性，可提高你治疗法术和技能的效果。你的治疗强度越高，你的技能恢复的生命值就越多，这对所有以治疗为核心的构筑都至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息中查看你的治疗强度（快捷键 C）。"
