T["Heirlooms are special pieces of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r gear designed to scale with your character as they level, making them ideal for leveling alternative characters or speeding up the journey to maximum level. These items not only increase in power as your character gains levels, but many also provide bonus |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, helping you level faster through quests, kills, and battlegrounds.\r\n\r\nHeirlooms are stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r and are accessible to all characters on the same realm. Once unlocked, you can equip heirlooms on any eligible character, giving you a powerful head start with solid stats and consistent performance across all level ranges.\r\n\r\nMost heirlooms come in the form of weapons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, and trinkets, and some are themed to match specific class roles, such as Strength-based melee, Intellect-based casters, or Agility-based archers.\r\n\r\nHeirlooms can be obtained through various means, including purchasing them from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r for PvP Points, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r Points, Marks of Ascension, and from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n"]="传家宝是一种特殊的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r 装备，设计为随角色升级而成长，因此非常适合用来练小号或加快冲击满级的速度。这些物品不仅会随角色等级提升而变强，其中许多还提供额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r，帮助你在任务、击杀和战场中更快升级。\r\n\r\n传家宝存放在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h装饰收藏|h|r 中，同一服务器的所有角色都可以使用。一旦解锁，你便可以在任何符合条件的角色上装备传家宝，凭借扎实的属性和在各等级区间稳定一致的表现，获得强大的起步优势。\r\n\r\n大多数传家宝以武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r 和饰品的形式出现，其中一些还针对特定的职业定位设计，例如以力量为主的近战、以智力为主的施法者或以敏捷为主的弓箭手。\r\n\r\n传家宝可以通过多种途径获得，包括用 PvP 点数、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 点数、飞升印记从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买，以及在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商城|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n"
