T["Herb"]="草药"
T["Herb Bag"]="草药袋"
T["Herbalism"]="草药学"
T["Herbalism is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Herbs gathered by herbalists are used in Crafting Professions like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn herbalism. Once trained, you can begin gathering herbs by locating plant nodes found throughout the open world. After learning the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r, you'll also unlock the 'Find Herbs' function in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r, which highlights nearby herb nodes, making it much easier to spot gathering opportunities as you explore.\r\n\r\nEach herb node you gather has a chance to contribute to your herbalism skill and provides plant-based materials used directly in crafting. Different zones contain different types of herbs, typically tied to level ranges and progression, so exploring new areas becomes a rewarding part of leveling the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r.\r\n\r\nWhile herbalism does not require a special tool to gather herbs, many players combine it with Crafting Professions like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r to streamline their material supply. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="草药学是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在开放世界中探索并收集自然资源的玩家。草药师采集的草药可用于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r 等制造专业。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习草药学。训练完成后，你就可以通过寻找遍布开放世界的植物节点来开始采集草药。学会该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 后，你还将在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 中解锁「寻找草药」功能，它会高亮附近的草药节点，让你在探索时更容易发现采集机会。\r\n\r\n你采集的每个草药节点都有机会提升你的草药学技能，并提供直接用于制作的植物材料。不同区域有不同种类的草药，通常与等级区间和成长进度相关，因此探索新区域就成为提升该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 的回报丰厚的一环。\r\n\r\n虽然草药学采集草药不需要特殊工具，但许多玩家会将其与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r 结合，以简化材料供应。对于需要兼顾多个专业的玩家，购买一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品能将所有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 工具整合到一个背包格中，可在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商城|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 用游戏内金币购买。"
T["Here you can configure your LFG or LFM listing. You must have a title, and at least 1 role selected."]="在这里你可以配置你的寻求组队（LFG）或寻求更多（LFM）招募信息。你必须填写标题，并至少选择 1 个角色定位。"
T["Here you can select which activities you are interested in doing."]="在这里你可以选择你有兴趣参与的活动。"
T["Here you will be able to see other players LFG and groups LFM. You can right click on listed groups to whisper the player, request an invite, or invite them to your group!"]="在这里你可以看到其他玩家的寻求组队（LFG）和队伍的寻求更多（LFM）信息。你可以右键点击列出的队伍来密语该玩家、请求邀请，或邀请他们加入你的队伍！"
T["Hero Architect"]="英雄建筑师"
T["Hero Architect Builds you have recently viewed will appear here, allowing you to align your desired and undesired spells with the Architect Build."]="你最近查看过的英雄建筑师构筑将显示在这里，让你可以将想要和不想要的技能与建筑师构筑对齐。"
