T["Heroic Dungeons"]="英雄地下城"
T["Heroic Leap\n|cffffffffLevel|r |cffff1a1a30|r"]="英勇飞跃\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a30|r"
T["Heroic Raiding"]="英雄团队副本"
T["Heroic Throw\n|cffffffffLevel|r |cffff1a1a50|r"]="英勇投掷\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a50|r"
T["Heroic dungeons are tougher, maximum level versions of regular dungeons, designed to offer greater challenges and significantly improved rewards. These dungeons feature enhanced enemies, harder-hitting bosses, and more complex mechanics, making them a key part of any player’s endgame progression.\r\n\r\nTo enter a heroic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r from the open world, right-click your character portrait, select '|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r Difficulty', and switch to 'Heroic' before entering the instance. Otherwise simply select the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r you desire from the specific list, or use the 'Random Heroic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r' option from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r.\r\n\r\nHeroic dungeons offer access to endgame PvE currencies. Bosses in these dungeons drop either Marks of Triumph (in Vanilla content) or Badges of Justice (in Burning Crusade content).\r\n\r\nThese currencies can be exchanged at special |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r or PvE hub for specific pieces of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r-quality gear, giving players a guaranteed path to upgrades even if the boss doesn’t drop what they need directly. This system helps ensure that everyone in the group can make progress.\r\n\r\nHeroic dungeons are a core stepping stone into the next |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, mythic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r, and high-end character builds, offering a reliable way to gear up and master your role."]="英雄地下城是普通地下城的更难、满级版本，旨在提供更大的挑战和显著提升的奖励。这些地下城拥有强化的敌人、伤害更高的首领和更复杂的机制，是任何玩家终局成长的关键一环。\r\n\r\n要从开放世界进入英雄 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，请右键点击你的角色头像，选择\"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 难度\"，并在进入副本前切换到\"英雄\"。否则，只需从特定列表中选取你想要的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 中的\"随机英雄 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r\"选项。\r\n\r\n英雄地下城提供获取终局 PvE 货币的途径。这些地下城中的首领要么掉落凯旋徽记（经典旧世内容），要么掉落正义徽章（燃烧的远征内容）。\r\n\r\n这些货币可以在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 或 PvE 枢纽的特定 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处兑换特定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 品质装备，即使首领没有直接掉落你需要的物品，也能为玩家提供一条有保障的升级途径。这套系统有助于确保队伍中的每个人都能取得进展。\r\n\r\n英雄地下城是迈向下一阶段 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r、史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 和高端角色构筑的核心垫脚石，提供了一条可靠的方式来提升装备并精通你的角色定位。"
