T["High-Risk PvP Mode"]="高风险 PvP 模式"
T["High-Risk PvP Mode is a ruleset designed for players seeking a high-stakes, full-loot PvP extravaganza. \r\n\r\nIn this mode, defeating other players allows you to loot their gear and inventory, creating intense and rewarding encounters. However, the danger goes both ways, if you die, you risk dropping a piece of your equipped gear, along with items from your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo help manage the risk, players can use |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:104|hFel Commutation|h|r, a system that allows you to protect specific gear pieces from being dropped on death. \r\n\r\nItems that are not protected by |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:104|hFel Commutation|h|r and are looted in High-Risk PvP Mode immediately become |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h|r with powerful PvP stats.\r\n\r\nTo enable High-Risk mode, head to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|hHybrid Risk|h|r menu (Hotkey H -> PvP Ruleset Tab), then select 'High-Risk PvP Mode' as your active ruleset. Keep in mind that switching between PvP modes has a 15 minute cooldown, so plan your activities accordingly."]="高风险 PvP 模式是一套为追求高风险、全掉落 PvP 盛宴的玩家设计的规则集。 \r\n\r\n在此模式下，击败其他玩家可以让你拾取他们的装备和背包物品，营造出紧张刺激且回报丰厚的遭遇。然而，危险是双向的，如果你死亡，就有可能掉落一件已装备的装备，以及你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 中的物品。\r\n\r\n为帮助管理风险，玩家可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:104|h邪能共济|h|r，这套系统允许你保护特定的装备部件在死亡时不会掉落。 \r\n\r\n未受 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:104|h邪能共济|h|r 保护、且在高风险 PvP 模式中被拾取的物品会立即变为 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h邪铸|h|r，并带有强大的 PvP 属性。\r\n\r\n要启用高风险模式，请前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 并打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|h混合风险|h|r 菜单（快捷键 H -> PvP 规则集标签页），然后选择「高风险 PvP 模式」作为你的激活规则集。请记住，切换 PvP 模式有 15 分钟的冷却时间，因此请相应地安排你的活动。"
T["High-Risk Recipe"]="高风险配方"
T["High-Risk Tier 1"]="高风险第 1 阶"
T["High-Risk Tier 2"]="高风险第 2 阶"
