T["Hit Cap"]="命中上限"
T["Hit rating is a secondary stat that increases your chance to successfully land spells and abilities on your target. It helps prevent your attacks from missing, which is vital for maintaining a consistent damage output.\r\n\r\nMelee, ranged, and spell attacks each have their own |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:131|hHit Cap|h|r. Reaching the appropriate |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:131|hHit Cap|h|r for your build and content type (PvE or PvP) is a key part of optimizing performance.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current hit rating in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="命中等级是一项次要属性，可提高你的法术和技能成功命中目标的几率。它有助于防止你的攻击未命中，这对保持稳定的伤害输出至关重要。\r\n\r\n近战、远程和法术攻击各有自己的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:131|h命中上限|h|r。达到适合你的构筑和内容类型（PvE 或 PvP）的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:131|h命中上限|h|r 是优化表现的关键一环。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息中查看你当前的命中等级（快捷键 C）。"
T["Hold CTRL + ALT and Click to collect this appearance, binding the item to you."]="按住 CTRL + ALT 并点击以收集此外观，并将该物品绑定到你身上。"
