T["Honor Points are the main PvP |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r earned by participating in Player vs. Player activities. You can gain Honor by fighting in battlegrounds, engaging in open world PvP, completing PvP daily quests, and participating in PvP events. The more you contribute to defeating enemy players and completing objectives, the more Honor you’ll earn.\r\n\r\nYour current total is stored in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r panel (Hotkey C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r Tab).\r\n\r\nHonor Points can be spent at PvP Quartermasters, who offer a wide variety of PvP-focused rewards, including seasonal gear, weapons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, cosmetic items, and other useful tools for both combat and style."]="荣誉点数是参与玩家对玩家活动所获得的主要 PvP |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r。你可以通过参加战场、参与开放世界 PvP、完成 PvP 日常任务和参与 PvP 事件来获得荣誉。你为击败敌方玩家和完成目标做出的贡献越多，获得的荣誉就越多。\r\n\r\n你当前的总量存储于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 面板中（快捷键 C -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 标签页）。\r\n\r\n荣誉点数可以在 PvP 军需官处花费，他们提供各种各样的 PvP 奖励，包括赛季装备、武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、装饰物品，以及其他对战斗和造型都有用的工具。"
