T["I am still having issues"]="我仍然遇到问题"
T["I am the Beginner's Book of Ascension, and I can help you rank up your spells and abilities until you reach level 20. I'm also your guide to the Beginner's Questline, Path to Ascension!\n\nAt level 20, I will be unable to rank up your abilities, but you can ask to use a Book of Ascension owned by other players, or obtain one for yourself!"]="我是飞升初级之书，我可以帮你把法术和技能提升到最高 20 级。我也是你新手指引任务线——飞升之路——的向导！\n\n到了 20 级，我就无法再提升你的技能等级了，但你可以请求使用其他玩家拥有的飞升之书，或者自己弄一本！"
T["I am unable to complete content."]="我无法完成内容。"
T["I can help with..."]="我可以帮忙处理..."
T["I can play around it."]="我可以应对它。"
T["I can't take this anymore..."]="我再也受不了了..."
T["I don't know what Renolea is talking about, I could make the trees grow in my sleep.\n\n<Yawns.>"]="我不知道雷诺莉亚在说什么，我睡着都能让树长起来。\n\n<打了个哈欠。>"
T["I don't understand how Rylor dismisses her so.\n\nThe way her long, autumn hair sways at her hips…\n\nHer beautiful golden eyes - ahh, such a rarity!\n\nNot to mention of course, her beautiful porcelain skin…\n\nShe's perfect, she is gorgeous, and her heart is as golden as her eyes - I shall hear nothing else of the sort! Let the past be damned!"]="我不明白莱勒为何如此轻视她。\n\n她那秋色的长发在腰际摇曳的样子...\n\n她那双美丽的金色眼眸——啊，多么罕见！\n\n更不用说她那美丽的瓷器般肌肤...\n\n她完美，她美丽动人，她的心就像她的眼睛一样金光闪闪——我不想再听别的了！让过去见鬼去吧！"
T["I have a Conscience"]="我有良知"
T["I have sensed your coming for quite some time, Hidexs. It was written in the pattern of the stars. "]="我已感知到你的到来很久了，Hidexs。这一切都写在星辰的图案之中。 "
T["I know many things these days. I am the one you seek, the woman once called Archmage Minervia.\r\n\r\nBut let us not waste time on pleasantries, the time that I can appear even in this place is brief. If you wish for my tale, then will you let me tell it?"]="这些日子我知道许多事。我就是你要找的人，曾经被称为大法师米内维亚的女人。\r\n\r\n但我们就别在客套上浪费时间了，即便在这个地方，我能现身的时间也很短暂。如果你想知道我的故事，那你愿意让我讲述吗？"
T["I never said I did not save her, only that I watched her die that day.\r\n\r\nThe leylines spread across all time and space of Azeroth. I had studied them first under Ilgalar's teachings, and later on my own terms. If my will was infused into the leylines, I could reach across time and pull my granddaughter from the moment of her death.\r\n\r\nIt would only be an instant before they correct themselves and I lose that control, but a mere instant was all I needed. Of course, I can never return to Azeroth, not truly. To appear for a time in a place where the leylines converge is the best I can achieve.\r\n\r\nStill, while this chance persists, I would make one last request.\r\n\r\nMy staff that I used in the spell has also fallen into the leylines, but it remains intact in some form even so, and I believe I can give it to you. Please take it to Alex, besides her life, this is the final gift I can give her."]="我从没说过我没有救她，我只说过我眼睁睁看着她在那天死去。\r\n\r\n魔网线遍布艾泽拉斯的全部时间与空间。我先是师从伊尔加勒研习它们，后来则靠自己摸索。如果我的意志注入魔网线，我就能跨越时间，把我孙女从她死亡的那一刻拉回来。\r\n\r\n它们自行修正、而我失去那份控制之前，只会有一瞬间，但仅仅一瞬间对我来说就够了。当然，我再也回不到艾泽拉斯了，并非真正意义上的回去。在魔网线汇聚之处短暂现身，已是我所能做到的极限。\r\n\r\n不过，趁着这次机会尚在，我想提出最后一个请求。\r\n\r\n我在那个法术中使用的法杖也落入了魔网线，但即便如此它仍以某种形态保持完好，我相信我能把它交给你。请把它带给亚历克斯，除了她的生命，这是我能给她的最后一份礼物。"
T["I shall hurl your corpse into the pit with the others!"]="我要把你的尸体和其他人一起扔进坑里！"
T["I spent far too little time with my son, Daniels, and later with my granddaughter, Alexandria. In that time, I believed it safer to keep them away from me, that my past mistakes could not reach them as well. I will not ask for forgiveness, but please believe me that my reasons for leaving was out of love for Daniels, and later Alex, not for lack of it.\r\n\r\nWhen I caught news of the attack, I thought I might finally take a step towards making amends for my past. I was powerful, but even so, Alex was just a fragile child then, and so she burned to ash before I could finish my spell to save her."]="我与我的儿子丹尼尔斯，以及后来与我的孙女亚历山德里亚相处的时间实在太少。那时我以为，让他们远离我更为安全，以为我过去的错误不会也波及他们。我不会请求原谅，但请相信我，我离开的原因是出于对丹尼尔斯、以及后来对亚历克斯的爱，而不是缺乏爱。\r\n\r\n当我得知袭击的消息时，我以为我终于可以迈出弥补过去的一步。我那时很强大，但即便如此，亚历克斯当时只是个脆弱的孩子，所以在我完成救她的法术之前，她就化为了灰烬。"
T["I will follow the code of conduct"]="我会遵守行为准则"
T["I will have you flayed. The witch shall sew me a loincloth from your skin!"]="我要让人剥了你的皮。那女巫会用你的皮给我缝一条遮羞布！"
