T["If enabled, allows the player to press and hold a keyboard hotkey to continually cast a spell on an ActionBar without having to repeatedly press the button. Items and non-spell macros will still only cast once."]="如果启用，允许玩家按住键盘快捷键，在动作条上连续施放某个法术，而无需反复按键。物品和非法术宏仍然只会施放一次。"
T["If enabled, draft cards will automatically popup after leveling and not in combat. If disabled, drafts will no longer popup below max level. You can open your draft through Character Advancement."]="如果启用，抽取卡牌将在升级后且不在战斗中时自动弹出。如果禁用，达到满级前将不再弹出抽取。你可以通过角色成长打开抽取。"
