T["If enabled, your offensive spell casts will automatically assist friendly targets, casting the spell on their target instead."]="如果启用，你的进攻性法术施放将自动协助友方目标，改为对其目标施放该法术。"
T["If she needs time, I can give it. I’ve waited longer for worse reasons."]="如果她需要时间，我可以给。我曾为更糟的理由等得更久。"
T["If the sole purpose or intent of any action is to continually upset, aggravate, or otherwise annoy another player, that action may be considered physical harassment or �grief play�.  Before reporting physical harassment, make sure that the situation that is being petitioned falls outside the realm of the PvP policy (www.worldofwarcraft.com/policy/pvp.shtml)."]="如果任何行动的唯一目的或意图是持续扰乱、激怒或以其他方式烦扰另一名玩家，该行动可能被视为人身骚扰或 \"恶意捣乱\"。 在举报人身骚扰之前，请确认所申诉的情况不属于 PvP 政策的范畴（www.worldofwarcraft.com/policy/pvp.shtml）。"
T["If there is another player you have enjoyed playing with, add them to your friends list! Click on the |cffffd200Social Button|r (Hotkey O) and add them to your list of friends.|n|nYou can only add friends from your own realm."]="如果有其他你乐于一起游戏的玩家，就把他们加到你的好友列表里！点击 |cffffd200社交按钮|r（快捷键 O）并将他们添加到你的好友列表中。|n你只能添加同一服务器的好友。"
T["If you continue to have issues please feel free to open a ticket in game using the red ? button, or through the |cff00CCFFAscension Discord|r"]="如果你仍然遇到问题，请随意使用游戏中红色的 ? 按钮提交工单，或通过 |cff00CCFF飞升 Discord|r 联系我们"
T["If you currently have a LFG or LFM group listed, you can delist it with this button."]="如果你当前挂有寻求组队（LFG）或寻求更多（LFM）信息，可以用此按钮将其撤下。"
T["If you perform this role, you will receive bonus rewards!"]="如果你担任此角色定位，你将获得额外奖励！"
T["If your character is stuck, you may use one of the options below to free your character."]="如果你的角色卡住了，你可以使用以下选项之一来解救你的角色。"
T["If your hearthstone is not on cooldown, you can use it to teleport your character to your home location. Click the hearthstone button below (or in your backpack) to teleport."]="如果你的炉石不在冷却中，你可以用它把你的角色传送回你的家乡位置。点击下方的炉石按钮（或背包中的炉石）即可传送。"
T["If your hearthstone is on cooldown, and you don't want to wait for it, you have the option to use the Auto-Unstuck tool. This will attempt to free your character."]="如果你的炉石正在冷却中，而你不想等它，你可以选择使用自动脱困工具。它会尝试解救你的角色。"
T["If you’re interested in sharing your own unique build, feel free to check out Hero Architect!"]="如果你有兴趣分享自己独特的构筑，欢迎查看英雄建筑师！"
T["If |cffFF8800Extensions.dll|r is not found, please start by adding an exception in your anti-virus to allow the game folder / extension file."]="如果找不到 |cffFF8800Extensions.dll|r，请先在杀毒软件中添加例外，允许游戏文件夹 / 扩展文件。"
