T["Immerse yourself in the relentless journey of Resolute Mode. A steadfast adventure that holds you to a 1x experience rate for the entirety of your journey. There are no shortcuts here; all experience bonuses, modifiers, and special events that increase experience gain are off the table. Your path is one of resilience, an unwavering odyssey where you'll have to rely solely on your skill and strategy to progress."]="沉浸在坚毅模式无情的旅程中。这段坚定的冒险将让你在整段旅程中保持 1 倍经验获取速率。这里没有捷径；所有提升经验获取的经验加成、修正和特殊事件都被禁用。你的道路是一条坚韧之路，一段坚定的远征，你必须仅凭自己的技巧与策略来取得进展。"
