T["In the upper left corner of your screen is your health bar in green. When your health bar reaches zero, you will die, so be careful.|n|nBelow your health bar is a second bar representing the resources your hero uses to power your special abilities, red is rage, yellow is energy, blue is mana."]="屏幕左上角绿色的条就是你的生命值条。当生命值条归零时，你就会死亡，所以要小心。|n|n生命值条下方是第二条，代表你的英雄用来驱动特殊技能的资源：红色是怒气，黄色是能量，蓝色是法力。"
T["In this challenge, you and two other chosen companion will be bound together, navigating the vast realms of Azeroth as an inseparable Trio. From the moment you join forces, you'll be bonded by death, meaning if one of you dies, you all shall perish. Furthermore, you cannot leave the group, or you'll also instantly fail this challenge."]="在这场挑战中，你和其他两位选定的同伴将被绑定在一起，作为一个不可分割的三人组穿行于艾泽拉斯的广袤国度。从你们结伴的那一刻起，你们就被死亡联结，这意味着如果你们中有一人死亡，你们全都会灭亡。此外，你不能离开队伍，否则也会立即令此挑战失败。"
T["In this challenge, you and your chosen companion will be bound together, navigating the vast realms of Azeroth as an inseparable duo. From the moment you join forces, you'll be bonded by death, meaning if one of you dies, you both shall perish. Furthermore, you cannot leave the group, or you'll also instantly fail this challenge."]="在这场挑战中，你和你选定的同伴将被绑定在一起，作为一个不可分割的双人组穿行于艾泽拉斯的广袤国度。从你们结伴的那一刻起，你们就被死亡联结，这意味着如果你们中有一人死亡，你们两人都会灭亡。此外，你不能离开队伍，否则也会立即令此挑战失败。"
