T["Increases Swipe and Ravage damage by 10%.\n\nIncreases all damage dealt by 1% while Tiger's Fury is active.\n\r\nReduces the chance enemies have to detect you while Prowling.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing damage with Swipe and Ravage reduce the cooldown of Tiger's Fury and Enrage by 1 second.|r"]="使横扫和毁灭的伤害提高 10%。\n\n在猛虎之怒激活期间，使造成的所有伤害提高 1%。\n\r\n降低敌人在你潜行时发现你的几率。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：用横扫和毁灭造成伤害会使猛虎之怒和激怒的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。|r"
T["Increases Swipe and Ravage damage by 20%.\n\nIncreases all damage dealt by 2% while Tiger's Fury is active.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance enemies have to detect you while Prowling.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing damage with Swipe and Ravage reduce the cooldown of Tiger's Fury and Enrage by 1 second.|r"]="使横扫和毁灭的伤害提高 20%。\n\n在猛虎之怒激活期间，使造成的所有伤害提高 2%。\r\n\r\n降低敌人在你潜行时发现你的几率。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：用横扫和毁灭造成伤害会使猛虎之怒和激怒的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。|r"
T["Increases Swipe and Ravage damage by 30%.\n\nIncreases all damage dealt by 3% while Tiger's Fury is active.\n\r\nReduces the chance enemies have to detect you while Prowling.\r\n\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing damage with Swipe and Ravage reduce the cooldown of Tiger's Fury and Enrage by 1 second."]="使横扫和毁灭的伤害提高 30%。\n\n在猛虎之怒激活期间，使造成的所有伤害提高 3%。\n\r\n降低敌人在你潜行时发现你的几率。\r\n\n终极天赋加成：用横扫和毁灭造成伤害会使猛虎之怒和激怒的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。"
T["Increases all damage and healing caused by 20% for 20 sec.\n\r\nCannot be used within 30 sec of being the target of Divine Shield, Divine Protection, or Hand of Protection, or of using Lay on Hands on oneself.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使造成的所有伤害和治疗效果提高 20%，持续 20 秒。\n\r\n在成为神圣护盾、神圣保护或保护之手的目标后 30 秒内，或对自己使用圣疗术后 30 秒内无法使用。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
