T["Increases all damage done by 1%\r\n\r\nIncreases Frost damage done by 1%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the duration of Deep Freeze by 0.33 sec.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Deep Freeze casts apply up to 5 frozen enemies within 8 yards of your target. If used with Fingers of Frost, it will consume only one charge.|r"]="使造成的所有伤害提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使造成的冰霜伤害提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使深度冻结的持续时间延长 0.33 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：你的深度冻结会作用于目标 8 码内最多 5 名被冻结的敌人。如果与寒冰指配合使用，只会消耗一层。|r"
