T["Increases all damage done by 3%\r\n\r\nIncreases Frost damage done by 3%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the duration of Deep Freeze by 1 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Deep Freeze casts apply up to 5 frozen enemies within 8 yards of your target. If used with Fingers of Frost, it will consume only one charge."]="使造成的所有伤害提高 3%。\r\n\r\n使造成的冰霜伤害提高 3%。\r\n\r\n使深度冻结的持续时间延长 1 秒。\n\n终极天赋加成：你的深度冻结会作用于目标 8 码内最多 5 名被冻结的敌人。如果与寒冰指配合使用，只会消耗一层。"
