T["Increases all of total attributes by 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the effects of your Mark of the Wild and Gift of the Wild spells by 40%."]="使所有总属性提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的野性印记和野性赐福法术的效果提高 40%。"
T["Increases armor from cloth and leather by 370%, damage taken while stunned is reduced by 15%. Your direct damaging spells have a 33% chance to regenerate 2% of your total mana.\r\n\nAll party and raid members gain 5% increased spell critical effect chance.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使布甲和皮甲提供的护甲提高 370%，被击晕时受到的伤害降低 15%。你的直接伤害法术有 33% 的几率恢复你总法力值的 2%。\r\n\n所有小队和团队成员获得的法术爆击效果几率提高 5%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases damage of your Revenge ability by 15% and causes Revenge to strike an additional 2 target. \r\n\r\nAfter using Revenge your next Devastate within 8 sec will strike an additional target."]="使你的复仇技能伤害提高 15%，并使复仇额外击中 2 个目标。 \r\n\r\n使用复仇后，你 8 秒内的下一次毁灭打击会额外击中一个目标。"
T["Increases damage of your Revenge ability by 30% and causes Revenge to strike an additional 2 target. \r\n\r\nAfter using Revenge your next Devastate within 8 sec will strike an additional target."]="使你的复仇技能伤害提高 30%，并使复仇额外击中 2 个目标。 \r\n\r\n使用复仇后，你 8 秒内的下一次毁灭打击会额外击中一个目标。"
T["Increases haste by 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 35%\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your periodic magic damage heals you for 20% of the damage done while casting any damaging spell. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使急速提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使施法时因受到伤害攻击而遭受的延迟降低 35%。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：在施放任何伤害性法术时，你的周期性魔法伤害会为你恢复所造成伤害 20% 的生命值。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases haste by 2%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 70%\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your periodic magic damage heals you for 20% of the damage done while casting any damaging spell.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使急速提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使施法时因受到伤害攻击而遭受的延迟降低 70%。\r\n\r\n终极天赋加成：在施放任何伤害性法术时，你的周期性魔法伤害会为你恢复所造成伤害 20% 的生命值。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases haste by 3%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 100%\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your periodic magic damage heals you for 20% of the damage done while casting any damaging spell.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使急速提高 3%。\r\n\r\n使施法时因受到伤害攻击而遭受的延迟降低 100%。\r\n\r\n终极天赋加成：在施放任何伤害性法术时，你的周期性魔法伤害会为你恢复所造成伤害 20% 的生命值。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases healing done to you by 10%. \r\n \r\nYour Rogue finishing moves refund 40% of their Energy cost when they fail to hit.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使你受到的治疗效果提高 10%。 \r\n \r\n你的潜行者终结技未命中时会返还其能量消耗的 40%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases healing done to you by 20%. \r\n \r\nYour Rogue finishing moves refund 80% of their Energy cost when they fail to hit.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使你受到的治疗效果提高 20%。 \r\n \r\n你的潜行者终结技未命中时会返还其能量消耗的 80%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases movement speed and reduces damage taken in Ghost Wolf by 10%.\r\n\nCapstone Bonus: Using Ghost Wolf removes all movement impairing effects and increases your speed by 60% for 2 sec. This can only occur once every 20 seconds."]="使幽魂之狼形态下的移动速度提高，受到的伤害降低 10%。\r\n\n终极天赋加成：使用幽魂之狼会移除所有降低移动速度的效果，并使你的速度提高 60%，持续 2 秒。此效果每 20 秒只能触发一次。"
T["Increases the amount drained by your Drain Life by 10% while your health is at or below 20% health.\r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by your spells and abilities by 4% when your target is at or below 35% health."]="当你的生命值等于或低于 20% 时，使你的生命吸取的吸取量提高 10%。\r\n\r\n当你的目标生命值等于或低于 35% 时，使你的法术和技能造成的伤害提高 4%。"
T["Increases the amount healed by Holy spells by 3%. \r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of your Halo and Prayer of Mending by 10%."]="使神圣法术的治疗量提高 3%。 \r\n\r\n使你的圣光晕环和愈合祷言的冷却时间缩短 10%。"
T["Increases the amount healed by your Chain Heal spell by 20%.\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: After consuming 2 charges of Tidal Waves your next Chain Heal will not consume Riptide."]="使你的治疗链法术的治疗量提高 20%。\r\n\r\n终极天赋加成：在消耗 2 层潮汐波浪后，你的下一个治疗链将不会消耗激流。"
T["Increases the amount of armor increased by your Stoneskin Totem by 10%.\r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of your Grounding Totem by 2 sec."]="使你的石肤图腾提高的护甲量提高 10%。\r\n\r\n使你的根基图腾冷却时间缩短 2 秒。"
T["Increases the amount of armor increased by your Stoneskin Totem by 20%.\r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of your Grounding Totem by 4 sec."]="使你的石肤图腾提高的护甲量提高 20%。\r\n\r\n使你的根基图腾冷却时间缩短 4 秒。"
T["Increases the amount of health transferred by your Health Funnel spell by 10% and reduces the health cost by 10%. \r\n\r\nYour summoned Demon takes 15% less damage while under the effect of your Health Funnel."]="使你的生命通道法术转移的生命值提高 10%，并使其生命值消耗降低 10%。 \r\n\r\n你召唤的恶魔在受你生命通道效果影响时受到的伤害降低 15%。"
T["Increases the amount of health transferred by your Health Funnel spell by 20%. and reduces the health cost by 20%. \r\n\r\nYour summoned Demon takes 30% less damage while under the effect of your Health Funnel."]="使你的生命通道法术转移的生命值提高 20%，并使其生命值消耗降低 20%。 \r\n\r\n你召唤的恶魔在受你生命通道效果影响时受到的伤害降低 30%。"
T["Increases the armor and resistances given by your Frost Armor and Ice Armor spells by 25%. \r\n\r\nFrost Ward, Fire Ward, Shadow Ward and Arcane Ward have a 15% chance to negate the damage taken from the spell and restore mana equal to the damage reduced."]="使你的霜甲术和冰甲术法术提供的护甲和抗性提高 25%。 \r\n\r\n防护冰霜结界、防护火焰结界、防护暗影结界和防护奥术结界有 15% 的几率抵消法术造成的伤害，并恢复等同于减免伤害的法力值。"
T["Increases the armor and resistances given by your Frost Armor and Ice Armor spells by 50%. \r\n\r\nFrost Ward, Fire Ward, Shadow Ward and Arcane Ward have a 30% chance to negate the damage taken from the spell and restore mana equal to the damage reduced."]="使你的霜甲术和冰甲术法术提供的护甲和抗性提高 50%。 \r\n\r\n防护冰霜结界、防护火焰结界、防护暗影结界和防护奥术结界有 30% 的几率抵消法术造成的伤害，并恢复等同于减免伤害的法力值。"
T["Increases the attack power by 5% of party and raid members within 100 yards.  \r\n\r\nIncreases your Strength by 1%."]="使 100 码内的小队和团队成员的攻击强度提高 5%。  \r\n\r\n使你的力量提高 1%。"
