T["Increases the cast speed of your Searing Totem by 15% and the critical strike damage bonus of your Searing and Magma totems by 50%. \r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of Fire Nova by 2 sec. and increases its damage by 10%."]="使你的灼热图腾的施放速度提高 15%，并使你的灼热图腾和熔岩图腾的爆击伤害加成提高 50%。 \r\n\r\n使火焰新星的冷却时间缩短 2 秒，并使其伤害提高 10%。"
