T["Increases the critical effect chance of your Holy Light, Flash of Light, Holy Shock, and Light of Dawn spells by 6%. \r\n\r\nIncreases the amount healed by your Holy critical heals by 15%.\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: After using Blinding Light your next Holy Light, Flash of Light, Holy Shock or Light of Dawn has a 100% increased critical effect chance."]="使你的圣光术、圣光闪现、神圣震击和黎明之光的爆击效果几率提高 6%。 \r\n\r\n使你的神圣爆击治疗的治疗量提高 15%。\r\n\r\n终极天赋加成：使用致盲之光后，你的下一个圣光术、圣光闪现、神圣震击或黎明之光的爆击效果几率提高 100%。"
