T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\nIncreases the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine Hymn, and Circle of Healing spells by 7%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Directly healing or directly damaging a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 20% chance to restore 2% of your missing mana over 4 sec. This effect can only occur once every 15 seconds.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使你的具有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的范围扩大 2 码。 \r\n\r\n使你的治疗祷言、神圣新星、神圣赞美诗和治疗之环法术的半径扩大 7%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：直接治疗或直接伤害距离你 20 码以外的目标时，有 20% 的几率在 4 秒内恢复你已损失法力值的 2%。此效果每 15 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing direct magic damage to a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 33% chance to corrupt their soul, dealing Shadow damage over 3 seconds. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使你的具有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的范围扩大 2 码。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：对距离你 20 码以外的目标造成直接魔法伤害时，有 33% 的几率腐蚀其灵魂，在 3 秒内造成暗影伤害。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing periodic Shadow damage to an enemy within melee range has a 33% chance to trigger a Grim Strike, dealing Shadow damage and reducing the target's melee attack power by 15 for 30 sec. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使你的具有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的范围扩大 2 码。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA终极天赋加成：对近战范围内的敌人造成周期性暗影伤害时，有 33% 的几率触发一次冷酷打击，造成暗影伤害并使目标的近战攻击强度降低 15 点，持续 30 秒。 |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
