T["Inns are important locations found in most quest hubs, towns, and cities throughout the world. Each inn is managed by an innkeeper, who can function as a vendor and bind your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h|r to their location.\r\n\r\nTo bind your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h|r, speak to the Innkeeper and select the option to 'Make this Inn your home.' Upon its next use, your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h|r will teleport you back to that location.\r\n\r\nInns also serve as rest areas, meaning if you log out inside an inn, you’ll gradually accumulate |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|hRested Experience|h|r. Spending even a few hours offline in an inn can provide a significant |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r boost, making them valuable for both active and casual players.\r\n\r\nTo quickly find an inn or innkeeper in any area, use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r and select 'Innkeeper' to highlight any nearby Inns."]="旅店是世界各地大多数任务枢纽、城镇和城市中的重要地点。每家旅店都由一名旅店老板管理，他可以作为商人，并将你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r绑定到他的位置。\r\n\r\n要绑定你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r，请与旅店老板交谈并选择 \"把这家旅店设为你的家\" 选项。下次使用时，你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r会将你传送回该地点。\r\n\r\n旅店同时也是休息区域，这意味着如果你在旅店内下线，你会逐渐积累|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|h休息经验|h|r。在旅店中离线哪怕几个小时，也能提供可观的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r加成，这使得旅店对活跃玩家和休闲玩家都很有价值。\r\n\r\n要在任何区域快速找到旅店或旅店老板，请使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r并选择 \"旅店老板\"，即可高亮显示附近的所有旅店。"
