T["Ironman Mode is the ultimate test of your individual gaming prowess. It's a solo challenge where you've got only one chance to prove yourself. You're entirely on your own – no grouping, trading, or mail – and all familiar amenities are stripped away. High-Risk Ironmen can engage in 1v1 combat with other Ironmen, while Low-Risk Ironmen are safe from all PvP. But remember, if you die, your character becomes a standard one, and you'll have to start all over again. Are you brave enough to take the Ironman challenge?"]="钢铁侠模式是对你个人游戏技艺的终极考验。这是一场单人挑战，你只有一次机会证明自己。你完全只能依靠自己——不能组队、交易或收发邮件——所有熟悉的便利设施都被剥夺。高风险钢铁侠可以与其他钢铁侠进行 1v1 战斗，而低风险钢铁侠则不受任何 PvP 影响。但请记住，如果你死了，你的角色会变成一个普通角色，你必须从头再来。你有勇气接受钢铁侠挑战吗？"
