T["January"]="一月"
T["Jasper, would you mind helping me with- Oh. You're asleep....again. *Sighs* Sometimes I'm not sure why I even bother..."]="贾斯珀，你介意帮我一下——哦。你又睡着了……*叹气* 有时候我都不确定自己为什么要费这个心……"
T["Jewelcrafting"]="珠宝加工"
T["Jewelcrafting is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r that is only available in Burning Crusade content and beyond.\r\n\r\nJewelcrafting focuses on cutting gems and crafting jewelry to enhance gear with powerful stat bonuses. Jewelcrafters can create rings, necklaces, trinkets, and cut gems used in sockets.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn jewelcrafting. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the necessary materials, primarily being raw gems and ores gathered through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|hMining|h|r.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you’ll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, known as designs, that teach you how to cut specific gems and craft a variety of jewelry.\r\n\r\nCreating most jewelcrafting items requires a jeweler’s kit, which must be in your inventory while crafting. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="珠宝加工是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，仅在燃烧的远征及之后的内容中可用。\r\n\r\n珠宝加工专注于切割宝石和制作珠宝，以强力的属性加成为装备提供增益。珠宝加工师可以制作戒指、项链、饰品，以及用于插槽的切割宝石。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习珠宝加工。训练完成后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需材料，主要是通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r采集的原始宝石和矿石。\r\n\r\n随着等级提升，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r（即图纸），它们会教你如何切割特定宝石并制作各种珠宝。\r\n\r\n制作大多数珠宝加工物品都需要一套珠宝匠工具，制作时必须放在你的背包中。对于管理多个专业的玩家来说，投资一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品可以将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
