T["Learn what it truly takes to survive in the world. Slowly build up hunger and thirst, which you'll have to quench with food and drink. Reach 100 stacks of either debuff and perish."]="了解在这个世界上生存真正需要什么。饥饿和口渴会缓慢累积，你必须用食物和饮料来缓解。任一减益达到 100 层你就会死亡。"
