T["Leather Armor"]="皮甲"
T["Leatherworking"]="制皮"
T["Leatherworking Bag"]="制皮包"
T["Leatherworking is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r focused on turning hides and leathers gathered from beasts into a variety of practical items such as equipment and stat-boosting |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r kits. Leatherworkers create essential gear for leather and mail wearers, as well as niche items that are required through specific endgame content.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn leatherworking. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the necessary materials. Leatherworking relies primarily on hides and leathers obtained by |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h|r throughout the open world, which can then be processed into tougher materials used in crafting.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you’ll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, known as patterns, that teach you how to craft specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r pieces and useful gear enhancements. Leatherworkers can also create specialized items like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r kits that provide |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r buffs, small |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r, toys, and unique gear that is required in various end-game content.\r\n\r\nWhile Leatherworking does not need specific tools to craft, many players pair it with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h|r to streamline their material gathering. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="制皮是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于将从野兽身上采集的皮和皮革制成各种实用物品，例如装备和提升属性的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r工具包。制皮师为穿皮甲和锁甲的职业制作必备装备，以及特定终局内容所需的特殊物品。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习制皮。训练完成后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需材料。制皮主要依赖通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r在开放世界中获得的皮和皮革，这些材料随后可以加工成制造所需的更坚韧的材料。\r\n\r\n随着等级提升，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r（即图样），它们会教你制作特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r部件和实用的装备强化物。制皮师还可以制作诸如提供|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r加成的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r工具包、小|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r、玩具，以及各种终局内容所需的独特装备等特殊物品。\r\n\r\n虽然制皮不需要特定工具来制作，但许多玩家会将其与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r搭配，以简化材料采集。对于管理多个专业的玩家来说，投资一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品可以将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
T["Leatherworking: Belt of Deep Shadow"]="制皮：深影腰带"
T["Leatherworking: Belt of Natural Power"]="制皮：自然力量腰带"
