T["Legendary spells are the most powerful spells. These abilities ensure a shift in the course of battle and often have multiple traits from many of the other qualities.\n\nLegendaries are made of abilities that include multiple traits of the other qualities, Powerful Offensive and Defensive cooldowns, and Immunities."]="传说法术是最强大的法术。这些技能能确保战局发生转变，并且通常拥有许多其他品质的多种特性。\n\n传说品质由包含其他品质多种特性的技能、强力的进攻与防御冷却技能以及免疫效果组成。"
T["Legends are not remembered for no reason. You will find your legacy in my trials! Step up!"]="传奇并非无缘无故被人铭记。你将在我的试炼中找到属于你的传奇！站出来吧！"
