T["Let the nightmare begin! Danger lurks around every corner, and one wrong step could be the end of your journey. You'll take 300% more damage from physical attacks and 500% more damage from spells. With only 5 lives to make it to level cap, you'll need to master every aspect of your hero to succeed. But take heart: you can group with other Nightmare adventurers to brave the challenge together. Will you emerge victorious, or be consumed by the terrors of the night?"]="让噩梦开始吧！危险潜伏在每个角落，一步走错就可能终结你的旅程。你受到的物理攻击伤害提高 300%，法术伤害提高 500%。只有 5 条命来达到等级上限，你必须精通英雄的每一个方面才能成功。但请放心：你可以与其他噩梦模式冒险者组队，共同面对挑战。你会凯旋而归，还是被黑夜的恐惧吞噬？"
