T["Maldice al objetivo con agonía, causando 36 daño de Sombras sobre 24 s. Este daño se inflige lentamente al principio y aumenta a medida que la maldición alcanza su duración completa. Only one Curse per Warlock can be active on any one target."]="以痛苦诅咒目标，在 24 秒内造成 36 点暗影伤害。该伤害起初生效缓慢，随着诅咒接近完整持续时间而逐渐提高。同一目标身上只能存在一个术士诅咒。"
T["Mana Burn\n|cffffffffLevel|r |cffff1a1a16|r"]="法力燃烧\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a16|r"
T["Mana Regeneration (also known as MP5 or mana per 5) is a secondary stat that increases the amount of mana you restore every 5 seconds, even while in combat. This helps sustain your ability usage during longer fights, especially for casters and hybrid builds that rely heavily on mana.\r\n\r\nYou can view your current mana regeneration rate in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="法力回复（也称为 MP5 或每 5 秒法力）是一项次要属性，可提高你每 5 秒恢复的法力值，即使在战斗中也会生效。这有助于在长时间战斗中维持技能使用，对严重依赖法力的施法者和混合构筑尤其如此。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看当前的法力回复数值。"
