T["Mana Tombs"]="法力陵墓"
T["Manage allocation of your attribute\npoints."]="管理你的属性点\n分配。"
T["Manage your current outfit and transmogrification collection. View all sets and appearances available."]="管理你当前的套装与幻化收藏。查看所有可用的套装和外观。"
T["Manastorm Cache"]="魔流宝箱"
T["Manastorm Caches"]="魔流宝箱"
T["Manastorm Caches are one of the primary sources of rewards in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r, offering level-scaled equipment scaled to your current progression. As you delve deeper, the quality of the loot improves (ranging from rare |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r gear to epic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r items from previous tiers) making them especially valuable for solo players or off-meta builds that may struggle in traditional group content. \r\n\r\nYou earn a cache each time you complete a new level, ensuring a steady stream of useful upgrades. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, there's a chance to receive a Bonus |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Cache, which contain even more loot. The probability to receive a bonus cache increases with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r progression. Bonus caches can also drop during re-clears of previously completed floors, giving players a reason to return even after hitting progression milestones."]="魔流宝箱是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r中主要的奖励来源之一，提供与你当前进度相匹配的等级缩放装备。深入得越深，战利品的品质就越高（从精良的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r装备到往期层级的史诗|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r物品），这使得它们对独行玩家或难以参与传统组队内容的非主流构筑尤其宝贵。\r\n\r\n每完成一个新层级都会获得一个宝箱，确保稳定的有用升级来源。\r\n\r\n此外，还有几率获得一个额外|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r宝箱，其中包含更多战利品。获得额外宝箱的几率会随着|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r进度提高而增加。在重新清理已完成的层数时也可能掉落额外宝箱，让玩家在达到进度里程碑后仍有理由回来。"
