T["Manastorm Spells are unique, powerful abilities designed to help you navigate and survive the chaos of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r. These spells offer a wide range of effects such as bonus stats, crowd control, or utility, that can turn the tide of battle or provide crucial support in challenging scenarios.\r\n\r\nYou can equip up to four spells at a time, known as your 'Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spells'. These spells can be swapped out to suit your playstyle, role, or the specific challenge you're facing. You can view all of your acquired |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spells in your Spellbook, under the Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Items tab.\r\n\r\nEach spell can upgrade up to eight different ranks. Higher ranks provide significantly more powerful effects, improving damage, healing, stats, or duration, based on the spell type. Upgrading your spells is essential for keeping pace with the increasing difficulty of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r content.\r\n\r\nYou can use |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h|r get new spells or upgrade existing ones from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r.\r\n"]="魔流法术是独特而强大的技能，旨在帮助你穿行并生存在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r的混乱之中。这些法术提供各种效果，例如属性加成、群体控制或辅助功能，能够扭转战局或在艰难处境中提供关键支援。\r\n\r\n你一次最多可以装备四个法术，称为你的\"激活|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r法术\"。这些法术可以随时更换，以适应你的玩法风格、职责或所面对的具体挑战。你可以在法术书的飞升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r物品标签页中查看所有已获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r法术。\r\n\r\n每个法术最多可升级八个不同的等级。更高等级提供明显更强的效果，根据法术类型提升伤害、治疗、属性或持续时间。升级法术对于跟上|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r内容日益增加的难度至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|h邦佐螺栓|h|r从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h齿轮沃斯|h|r处获取新法术或升级已有法术。\r\n"
