T["Mientras esté aplicado a la arma objetivo, aumenta el daño causado por los hechizos periódicos en 2% y la puntuación de celeridad con hechizos en 7. Este efecto dura 2 horas.\n\nYou can only benefit from one Warlock weapon enchant at a time."]="施加于目标武器时，使周期性法术造成的伤害提高 2%，法术急速等级提高 7。该效果持续 2 小时。\n\n同一时间只能受益于一个术士武器附魔。"
T["Mientras esté aplicado al arma, aumenta el daño de hechizos en 1% y la puntuación de golpe crítico de hechizos en 7. Este efecto dura 2 horas. \n\nYou can only benefit from one Warlock weapon enchant at a time."]="施加于武器时，使法术伤害提高 1%，法术爆击等级提高 7。该效果持续 2 小时。 \n\n同一时间只能受益于一个术士武器附魔。"
T["Millhouse |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r is a quirky and beloved gnome NPC who serves as your guide through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r and Vendor for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|hBedlam Bullions|h|r. He offers a wide selection of cosmetic items, convenience tools, and hilarious toys, making him a key figure for players looking to personalize their |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r or gain quality-of-life upgrades.\r\n\r\nWhenever you exit the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r you will be automatically teleported to Millhouse’s location at the entrance of your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. There, you can immediately spend your hard-earned |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r on unique rewards."]="米尔豪斯是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r中一位古怪而受人喜爱的侏儒 NPC，他既是你在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r中的向导，也是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|h混乱金锭|h|r的商人。他提供大量装饰物品、便利工具和搞笑道具，对于想要个性化自己|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r或获得便利性提升的玩家来说，他是关键人物。\r\n\r\n每当你离开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r时，你都会被自动传送到米尔豪斯所在的位置，即你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r入口处。在那里，你可以立刻用辛苦赚来的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r兑换独特奖励。"
T["Millhouse's Magical Escape"]="米尔豪斯的魔法逃生"
T["Millhouse’s Magical Escape is a reusable, utility item placed in every player’s inventory upon entering the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r. This enchanted gadget serves as a lifeline during high-stress encounters, allowing you to instantly break free from crowd control (CC) and Movement Impairing effects with the push of a button.\r\n\r\nWith a short cooldown and no resource cost, Millhouse’s Magical Escape is essential for surviving the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r’s fast-paced, unpredictable challenges. Many of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r’s enemies and environmental hazards are designed to lock you down or trap you in damaging mechanics and this item gives you a reliable way out. Whether you’re stunned, rooted, or slowed, it can provide the split-second freedom needed to reposition, dodge lethal mechanics, or finish off a tricky boss.\r\n\r\nWhile it’s only usable inside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r instance, Millhouse’s Magical Escape is one of the most important tools at your disposal so be sure to drag it to your action bar and keep it within easy reach."]="米尔豪斯的魔法逃生是一件可重复使用的实用物品，在进入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r时会放入每位玩家的背包。这件附魔小装置是高压力遭遇战中的救命稻草，只需按一下按钮，就能让你立即摆脱群体控制（CC）和移动限制效果。\r\n\r\n它冷却时间短且不消耗资源，对于在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r快节奏、难以预测的挑战中生存下来至关重要。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r中的许多敌人和环境危险都旨在将你定身或困在造成伤害的机制中，而这件物品为你提供了可靠的脱身手段。无论你是被昏迷、定身还是减速，它都能提供重新站位、躲避致命机制或解决棘手首领所需的瞬间自由。\r\n\r\n虽然它只能在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h魔流|h|r副本内使用，但米尔豪斯的魔法逃生是你手中最重要的工具之一，所以一定要把它拖到动作条上并放在随手可及的位置。"
