T["Mining"]="采矿"
T["Mining Bag"]="采矿包"
T["Mining Pick"]="矿工锄"
T["Mining is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Materials gathered by miners are used in a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|hBlacksmithing|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn mining. Once trained, you can begin gathering materials by locating mineral nodes found throughout the open world. After learning the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r, you'll also unlock the 'Find Minerals' function in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r, which highlights nearby ore nodes, making it much easier to spot gathering opportunities as you explore.\r\n\r\nEach mineral node you gather has a chance to contribute to your mining skill and provides stone-based materials used directly in crafting. Different zones contain different types of minerals, typically tied to level ranges and progression, so exploring new areas becomes a rewarding part of leveling the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo harvest minerals, you’ll need a pickaxe, which can be purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r. This tool must be in your inventory while gathering and is essential for collecting ore. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="采矿是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在开放世界中探索并采集自然资源的玩家。矿工采集的材料会用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|h锻造|h|r。\r\n\r\n要入门，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习采矿。训练完成后，你就可以通过寻找遍布开放世界的矿脉节点来开始采集材料。学会该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r后，你还将在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r中解锁「寻找矿物」功能，它会高亮显示附近的矿石节点，让你在探索时更容易发现采集机会。\r\n\r\n你采集的每个矿脉节点都有机会提升你的采矿技能，并提供可直接用于制造的矿石类材料。不同区域包含不同类型的矿物，通常与等级区间和进度相关，因此探索新区域会成为提升该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级过程中很有收获的一部分。\r\n\r\n要采集矿物，你需要一把矿工锄，可以向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r购买。采集时这件工具必须放在你的背包中，是收集矿石的必需品。对于同时管理多个专业的玩家，购买虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为这件物品能将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商城|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
