T["Mystic Enchant Preset"]="神秘附魔预设"
T["Mystic Enchant Specializations let you swap between Mystic Enchant loadouts in 1 click without using any Runes of Ascension.\n\nUnlock this specialization by using a Tome of Specialization or Scroll of Specialization: Mystic Enchants. These can be obtained at the Auction House or in the web shop."]="神秘附魔专精让你只需点击 1 次即可在神秘附魔配装之间切换，且无需消耗任何飞升符文。\n\n使用专精宝典或专精卷轴：神秘附魔来解锁此专精。这些物品可以在拍卖行或网页商城获得。"
T["Mystic Enchant Specializations unlock new Mystic Enchant loadouts that you can easily swap between to quickly change your active Enchants without spending orbs each time."]="神秘附魔专精会解锁新的神秘附魔配装，你可以轻松在它们之间切换，从而快速更换当前生效的附魔，无需每次都消耗法珠。"
T["Mystic Enchant has an invalid note."]="神秘附魔的备注无效。"
T["Mystic Enchant notes cannot contain profanity."]="神秘附魔的备注不能包含脏话。"
T["Mystic Enchanting Altar"]="神秘附魔祭坛"
T["Mystic Enchants"]="神秘附魔"
T["Mystic Enchants are automatically applied to your gear while leveling, granting you incredible boosts of power and unlocking cross class synergies that bring your archetype to life.\n\nThese Mystic Enchants will persist on your gear even when you upgrade gear!\n\nAutomatically learn the right spells and talents while you level. Guaranteeing that you have a powerful build and all the tools to play it."]="神秘附魔会在你升级过程中自动施加到你的装备上，为你带来惊人的力量提升，并解锁跨职业协同效果，让你的原型流派真正活起来。\n\n即使你升级装备，这些神秘附魔也会保留在你的装备上！\n\n在升级过程中自动学习合适的法术和天赋，确保你拥有强大的构筑以及发挥它所需的一切工具。"
T["Mystic Enchants can be found on gear or in Mystic Enchants Collection (Unlocks at level 60)"]="神秘附魔可以在装备上找到，或在神秘附魔收藏中查看（60 级解锁）"
T["Mythic (10-25 Players)"]="史诗（10-25 名玩家）"
T["Mythic Dungeon"]="史诗地下城"
T["Mythic Dungeons"]="史诗地下城"
T["Mythic Plus"]="史诗+"
T["Mythic+ dungeons are a high-level, repeatable challenge mode designed to test your skill, coordination, and efficiency. To begin a mythic+ run, you’ll need a mythic keystone, which you earn by completing a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r at mythic difficulty. Once you have a key, you can activate it at the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r’s entrance to begin the run.\r\n\r\nUnlike standard mythics, mythic+ dungeons are timed and scale in difficulty based on the level of your keystone. As the keystone level increases, enemies become stronger, and affixes (special |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r modifiers) are added that introduce new mechanics such as environmental hazards, enemy buffs, or group-wide pressure. These affixes change weekly and vary depending on the key level, keeping runs fresh and challenging.\r\n\r\nAt the end of each run, your keystone transforms based on your performance, either increasing in level or changing to a different |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r. Completing the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r quickly can upgrade your key and increase your rewards, while failing to complete within the timer may lower the difficulty.\r\n\r\nHigher level mythic+ runs offer increasingly better rewards, including epic gear, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, and progression toward achievements and leaderboards."]="史诗+地下城是一种高等级、可重复挑战的模式，旨在考验你的技巧、配合与效率。要开始一次史诗+挑战，你需要一枚史诗钥石，通过在史诗难度下完成|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r即可获得。拥有钥石后，你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r入口处激活它以开始挑战。\r\n\r\n与标准史诗不同，史诗+地下城有时间限制，并会根据你钥石的等级提升难度。随着钥石等级提高，敌人会变得更强，还会加入词缀（特殊的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r修正），引入环境危险、敌人增益或全队压力等新机制。这些词缀每周轮换，并会因钥石等级而异，让每次挑战都保持新鲜与挑战性。\r\n\r\n每次挑战结束时，你的钥石会根据你的表现而变化，要么提升等级，要么变成另一个|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r的钥石。快速完成|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r可以升级你的钥石并提高奖励，而未能在限时内完成则可能降低难度。\r\n\r\n更高等级的史诗+挑战会提供越来越好的奖励，包括史诗装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，以及成就与排行榜进度。"
T["Mythic+ dungeons are not\ncurrently active"]="史诗+地下城目前\n未开放"
