T["No-Risk PvP Mode"]="无风险 PvP 模式"
T["No-risk PvP mode is a ruleset that allows players to participate in open-world PvP without the danger of losing gear or items upon death. \r\n\r\nThis makes it a great choice for players who enjoy PvP combat but prefer a lower-stakes environment. In no-risk PvP mode, you can freely attack and be attacked by other players who are also flagged for PvP while still keeping your inventory, gear, and gold completely safe if you’re defeated.\r\n\r\nThe no-risk world is shared with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE Mode|h|r players, meaning both groups exist in the same zones. However, you cannot attack or be attacked by players in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE Mode|h|r. This shared environment creates a dynamic world where PvP and PvE players can coexist without conflict.\r\n\r\nTo enable no-risk PvP mode, head to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|hHybrid Risk|h|r menu (Hotkey H -> PvP Ruleset Tab), then select 'No-Risk PvP Mode' as your active ruleset. Keep in mind that switching between PvP modes has a 15 minute cooldown, so plan your activities accordingly."]="无风险 PvP 模式是一套规则，允许玩家参与开放世界 PvP，而不必担心死亡时失去装备或物品。\r\n\r\n这使它成为喜欢 PvP 战斗但偏好低风险环境的玩家的绝佳选择。在无风险 PvP 模式中，你可以自由攻击同样标记为 PvP 的其他玩家，也会被他们攻击，同时即便被击败，你的背包、装备和金币也完全安全。\r\n\r\n无风险世界与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE 模式|h|r玩家共享，这意味着两个群体存在于相同的区域中。不过，你无法攻击|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE 模式|h|r中的玩家，也不会被他们攻击。这种共享环境创造了一个动态世界，让 PvP 和 PvE 玩家能够无冲突地共存。\r\n\r\n要启用无风险 PvP 模式，请前往你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r并打开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|h混合风险|h|r菜单（快捷键 H -> PvP 规则集标签页），然后选择「无风险 PvP 模式」作为你的激活规则集。请注意，在 PvP 模式之间切换有 15 分钟冷却时间，因此请相应地安排你的活动。"
