T["Oh thank you, Hidexs! You saved my harvest! And I hope you showed a few of those Defias that they can't cause trouble around here.\n\nWe might be short on guards these days, but we're lucky to have heroes like you to protect us!"]="哦，谢谢你，Hidexs！你救了我的收成！我希望你已经让那些迪菲亚知道，他们不能在这里惹是生非。\n\n如今我们的守卫或许不够，但幸运的是，有像你这样的英雄保护我们！"
T["Oh! Hello! You must be an adventurer, right? That’s so exciting! I’ve been helping out here at the Tower of Azora, just an apprentice really, but I finally got assigned some real tasks! \r\n\r\nI can’t leave the grounds yet, but maybe you can help me with them?"]="哦！你好！你一定是个冒险者，对吧？太令人兴奋了！我一直在阿祖拉之塔帮忙，其实只是个学徒，但我终于被分配了真正的任务！\r\n\r\n我还不能离开这片区域，不过也许你能帮我完成它们？"
