T["Once you reach [KEYWORD:Azure Watch] you should turn in\n[QUEST:1903537]\nand look for additional quests to do.\n\n[KEYWORD:Remember] You can track quests in your [KEYWORD:Quest Log] by pressing [ACTION:L]\n\nYou can find out where to go for a quest by opening the [KEYWORD:Map] by pressing [ACTION:M].\n\n\nGood luck and have fun on [KEYWORD:Ascension]"]="抵达 [KEYWORD:碧蓝岗哨] 后，你应该交付\n[QUEST:1903537]\n并寻找更多可完成的任务。\n\n[KEYWORD:请记住] 你可以按 [ACTION:L] 在 [KEYWORD:任务日志] 中追踪任务\n\n你可以按 [ACTION:M] 打开 [KEYWORD:地图]，查看任务该去哪里完成。\n\n\n祝你在 [KEYWORD:Ascension] 玩得开心，好运相伴"
