T["Orgrimmar (Org) is the fierce and fortified |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r of the Horde faction, located in the harsh, arid region of Durotar. It serves as the central hub where Horde players can find key NPCs, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, Class Trainers, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h|r.\r\n\r\nAs the heart of Horde civilization, Orgrimmar is known for its rugged, tribal architecture built from massive stone and wood, reflecting the strength and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:208|hResilience|h|r of its inhabitants. The city is named after Orgrim Doomhammer, a legendary orc warrior.\r\n\r\nOrgrimmar is divided into several districts such as the Valley of Strength, home to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r; the Drag, where you’ll find |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Trainers, craftsmen, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r; and the Cleft of Shadow, the center for dark magic and other covert activities.\r\n\r\nOrgrimmar is a fortress against both monstrous threats and enemy players, providing a safe place for Horde adventurers to rest, craft, trade, and organize before heading out to explore or battle across Azeroth."]="奥格瑞玛（Org）是部落阵营坚固而凶悍的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，坐落于荒凉严酷的杜隆塔尔。它是部落玩家的中枢要地，可以在这里找到关键 NPC、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、职业训练师和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r。\r\n\r\n作为部落文明的心脏，奥格瑞玛以其粗犷的部族式建筑闻名，整座城市由巨大的石块与木材建成，体现了居民的坚韧与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:208|h韧性|h|r。这座城市以传奇兽人战士奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤命名。\r\n\r\n奥格瑞玛分为多个区域，例如力量谷，那里有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r；荣誉谷则是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r训练师、工匠和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r的聚集地；暗影裂口则是黑暗魔法和其他隐秘活动的中心。\r\n\r\n奥格瑞玛既是抵御怪物威胁的堡垒，也是对抗敌对玩家的要塞，为部落冒险者提供了一处安全的休整之所，让他们在出发探索或为艾泽拉斯而战之前休息、制造、交易和集结。"
