T["Parry is a secondary stat that increases your chance to deflect and avoid melee attacks from enemies positioned in front of you or to your sides. However, it does not provide any benefit against attacks coming from behind.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current parry rating in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="招架是一项次要属性，可提高你偏转并避开来自正面或侧面敌人近战攻击的几率。不过，它对来自背后的攻击没有任何效果。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看当前的招架等级。"
