T["Path of Agility"]="敏捷之道"
T["Path of Agility focuses on dealing rapid attacks and critical strikes, and is especially beneficial for Leather and Mail armor users.\n\nGrants you bonus Agility, and each point of Agility now also increases your |cFFFFFFFFAttack Power|r, |cFFFFFFFFCritical Strike Chance|r, and |cFFFFFFFFCritical Strike Damage|r."]="敏捷之道专注于快速攻击和爆击，对皮甲和锁甲使用者尤其有益。\n\n它会赋予你额外的敏捷，并且每点敏捷现在还会提高你的 |cFFFFFFFF攻击强度|r、|cFFFFFFFF爆击几率|r 和 |cFFFFFFFF爆击伤害|r。"
T["Path of Ascension"]="飞升之道"
T["Path of Ascension: Quest Name Example"]="飞升之道：任务名称示例"
T["Path of Frost\n|cffffffffLevel|r |cffff1a1a30|r"]="冰霜之道\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a30|r"
T["Path of Healing enables you to fulfill the |cFFFFFFFFHealer Role|r. This primary stat increases your Healing Power and allows you to use unique powerful Healer spells.\n\nGrants you bonus |cFFFFFFFFHealing Power|r, |cFFFFFFFFIntellect|r, |cFFFFFFFFSpirit|r, and each point of |cFFFFFFFFSpell Power|r now also increases your |cFFFFFFFFHealing Power|r."]="治疗之道使你能够胜任 |cFFFFFFFF治疗者职责|r。这一主属性会提高你的治疗强度，并让你可以使用独特而强大的治疗法术。\n\n它会赋予你额外的 |cFFFFFFFF治疗强度|r、|cFFFFFFFF智力|r 和 |cFFFFFFFF精神|r，并且每点 |cFFFFFFFF法术强度|r 现在还会提高你的 |cFFFFFFFF治疗强度|r。"
T["Path of Intellect focuses on empowering spell damage, increasing mana pool, and is especially beneficial for Cloth armor users.\n\nGrants you bonus |cFFFFFFFFSpell Power|r, Intellect, Spirit, and |cFFFFFFFFSpell Power|r gained from items and effects is doubled."]="智力之道专注于强化法术伤害、提高法力上限，对布甲使用者尤其有益。\n\n它会赋予你额外的 |cFFFFFFFF法术强度|r、智力和精神，并且从物品和效果中获得的 |cFFFFFFFF法术强度|r 翻倍。"
T["Path of Strength focuses on dealing heavy hits and armor piercing attacks, and is especially beneficial for Plate armor users.\n\nGrants you bonus Strength, and each point of Strength now also increases your |cFFFFFFFFAttack Power|r and |cFFFFFFFFParry|r."]="力量之道专注于打出沉重打击和破甲攻击，对板甲使用者尤其有益。\n\n它会赋予你额外的力量，并且每点力量现在还会提高你的 |cFFFFFFFF攻击强度|r 和 |cFFFFFFFF招架|r。"
T["Path to Ascension quests are special tasks that teach you the ins and outs of Ascension. Completing these quests grant epic rewards."]="飞升之路的任务是特殊的任务，会教你了解飞升的方方面面。完成这些任务将给予你史诗级奖励。"
T["Path to Ascension |cffffd100(SHIFT-J)|r"]="飞升之路 |cffffd100(SHIFT-J)|r"
