T["Performs item check (/raitem) on all ticked items\rQuery always gets current durablity, resistance and reagents information"]="对所有已勾选的物品执行物品检查（/raitem）\r查询始终会获取当前的耐久度、抗性和材料信息。"
T["Performs item check (/raitem) on all ticked items\\rQuery always gets current durablity, resistance and reagents information"]="对所有已勾选的物品执行物品检查（/raitem）\\r查询始终会获取当前的耐久度、抗性和材料信息"
T["Periodically deals 43 to 47 Arcane damage to nearby enemies."]="周期性对附近敌人造成 43 到 47 点奥术伤害。"
T["Periodically drains 10213 to 11287 mana from all enemy targets. Lasts until cancelled.  Targets without sufficient mana to drain detonate, dealing 10213 to 11287 damage in an area."]="周期性从所有敌方目标身上吸取 10213 到 11287 点法力值。持续直到取消。法力不足的目标会发生爆炸，造成 10213 到 11287 点范围伤害。"
T["Periodically drains 600 mana from all enemy targets. Lasts 5 sec.  Targets without sufficient mana to drain detonate, dealing 10213 to 11287 damage in an area."]="周期性从所有敌方目标身上吸取 600 点法力值。持续 5 秒。法力不足的目标会发生爆炸，造成 10213 到 11287 点范围伤害。"
T["Periodically inflicting 131 to 154 Fire damage to enemies in a cone in front of the caster."]="周期性对施法者前方锥形区域内的敌人造成 131 到 154 点火焰伤害。"
T["Permanent"]="永久"
T["Permanently adds 24 attack power, 10 stamina and 6 expertise rating to a leg or head slot item."]="永久性地为一件腿部或头部装备附加 24 点攻击强度、10 点耐力和 6 点精准等级。"
T["Permanently adds 3 defense rating to an item worn on the chest, legs, hands or feet. Requires level 50 or higher to gain this benefit."]="永久性地为一件佩戴在胸、腿、手或脚部的装备附加 3 点防御等级。需要等级 50 或以上才能获得此效果。"
T["Permanently delete this set."]="永久删除此套装。"
T["Permanently enchant a melee weapon to often heal for 75 to 125 and increase Strength by 40 for 15 sec. when attacking in melee. \r\n\r\nThis is 35% stronger if you are wielding a single two handed weapon.\r\n\r\nRequires level 30 or higher to gain this benefit."]="永久性地为一把近战武器附魔，使其在近战攻击时经常治疗 75 到 125 点生命值，并使力量提高 40 点，持续 15 秒。\r\n\r\n如果你只装备一把双手武器，此效果会强化 35%。\r\n\r\n需要等级 30 或以上才能获得此效果。"
T["Permanently enchant a melee weapon to often increase Agility by 40 for 15 seconds. when attacking in melee. \r\n\r\nThis is 35% stronger if you are wielding a single two handed weapon.\r\n\r\nRequires level 30 or higher to gain this benefit."]="永久性地为一把近战武器附魔，使其在近战攻击时经常使敏捷提高 40 点，持续 15 秒。\r\n\r\n如果你只装备一把双手武器，此效果会强化 35%。\r\n\r\n需要等级 30 或以上才能获得此效果。"
T["Permanently enchant a shield to give 3 spirit."]="永久性地为一面盾牌附魔，使其提供 3 点精神。"
T["Permanently unlock the Legendary, Epic, Rare and Uncommon Mystic Enchants for your build when reaching max level!\n\nAutomatically apply a full set of 16 end-game Mystic Enchants to your gear that persist even when you upgrade gear!\n\nFreely swap between a powerful end-game PvE or PvP build loadout, automatically updating your gear's Mystic Enchants and your talents and abilities."]="达到满级后，永久为你的构筑解锁传说、史诗、稀有和优秀品质的神秘附魔！\n\n自动为你的装备施加一整套 16 个终局神秘附魔，即使你升级装备它们也会保留！\n\n在强大的终局 PvE 或 PvP 构筑配装之间自由切换，自动更新你装备的神秘附魔以及你的天赋和技能。"
