T["Place a frost trap that freezes the first enemy that approaches, preventing all action for up to 10 sec.\r\nAny damage caused will break the ice. Trap will exist for 20 sec. Only one trap can be active at a time."]="放置一个冰霜陷阱，冻结第一个靠近的敌人，使其最多 10 秒内无法进行任何行动。\r\n造成的任何伤害都会打破冰冻。陷阱持续 20 秒。同一时间只能有一个陷阱生效。"
T["Place a frost trap that freezes the first enemy that approaches, preventing all action for up to 10 sec.\r\nAny damage caused will break the ice. Trap will exist for 30 sec. Only one trap can be active at a time."]="放置一个冰霜陷阱，冻结第一个靠近的敌人，使其最多 10 秒内无法进行任何行动。\r\n造成的任何伤害都会打破冰冻。陷阱持续 30 秒。同一时间只能有一个陷阱生效。"
T["Place a frost trap that freezes the first enemy that approaches, preventing all action for up to 10 sec.Any damage caused will break the ice. \r\nTrap will exist for 30 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="放置一个冰霜陷阱，冻结第一个靠近的敌人，使其最多 10 秒内无法进行任何行动。造成的任何伤害都会打破冰冻。\r\n陷阱持续 30 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Place a trap that will release several venomous snakes to attack the first enemy to approach. The snakes will die after 15 sec. Trap will exist for 30 sec. Only one trap can be active at a time."]="放置一个陷阱，释放数条毒蛇攻击第一个靠近的敌人。毒蛇将在 15 秒后死亡。陷阱持续 30 秒。同一时间只能有一个陷阱生效。"
T["Place an item here to |cff71d5ffReforge|r, |cff71d5ffExtract|r, or |cff71d5ffApply|r an enchant to the item"]="将物品放在此处以 |cff71d5ff重铸|r、|cff71d5ff提取|r 或 |cff71d5ff施加|r 附魔到该物品上"
T["Place in Bank"]="放入银行"
T["Place in the Talon Den."]="将其放置在塔隆巢穴。"
T["Place near the Troll Door."]="将其放置在巨魔之门附近。"
T["Place within the Cursed Cauldron..."]="将其放入被诅咒的大锅……"
T["Places 5 charges of the mark of the Shivan on the target.  Each time a marked target is hit with a weapon attack, one charge is expended.  If all charges are expended within 30 sec the mark detonates violently, dealing 3150 to 3850 damage to the target."]="对目标施加 5 层希瓦娜印记。每当被标记的目标受到武器攻击命中时，就会消耗一层。如果在 30 秒内消耗完所有层数，印记会猛烈引爆，对目标造成 3150 到 3850 点伤害。"
T["Places a Blessing on the friendly target, reducing damage taken by 3% and increasing Strength and Stamina by 10% for 30 min. \r\n\r\nIn addition, when the target blocks, parries, or dodges a melee attack the target will gain 6% of base mana.\r\n\r\nDoes not stack with similar effects."]="为目标盟友施加祝福，使其受到的伤害降低 3%，力量与耐力提高 10%，持续 30 分钟。\r\n\r\n此外，当目标格挡、招架或躲闪一次近战攻击时，目标将获得其基础法力的 6%。\r\n\r\n不与类似效果叠加。"
T["Places the Hunter's Mark on the target, increasing the ranged attack power of all attackers against that target by 110.\r\n\r\nThe marked target can always be seen by the hunter whether it stealths or turns invisible, and appears on the mini-map. Lasts for 5 min."]="对目标施加猎人印记，使所有攻击者对该目标的远程攻击强度提高 110 点。\r\n\r\n被标记的目标无论潜行还是隐形，猎人都始终能看到它，它也会显示在小地图上。持续 5 分钟。"
T["Places the Hunter's Mark on the target, increasing the ranged attack power of all attackers against that target by 20.\r\n\r\nThe marked target can always be seen by the hunter whether it stealths or turns invisible, and appears on the mini-map. Lasts for 5 min."]="对目标施加猎人印记，使所有攻击者对该目标的远程攻击强度提高 20 点。\r\n\r\n被标记的目标无论潜行还是隐形，猎人都始终能看到它，它也会显示在小地图上。持续 5 分钟。"
