T["Prepare to embrace the unexpected in Wildcard Mode, where the power of chance shapes your destiny. Here, you'll be granted a random set of abilities from an array of classes, challenging you to craft the most formidable build possible from the hand you've been dealt.\n\nAt the outset, you'll roll four random spells from all classes, and you're free to reroll these starting spells at will. As you grow stronger and ascend in levels, starting at level 10, you'll gain a new random ability every two levels, continually reshaping your strategy and gameplay.\n\nRemember, your powers may be random, but your talents are entirely in your control. Assign talent points to any class specialization of your choice, bringing your unique, ever-changing build to life. Plus, the Scrolls of Fortune you earn along your journey offer the chance to reroll abilities you're less fond of, refining your Wildcard build to perfection.\n\nDive into the unpredictable, exhilarating world of Wildcard Mode, where you have the chance to create a hero unlike any other. Will you rise to the challenge and master the power of chance? Only the roll of the dice will tell."]="准备在 Wildcard 模式中迎接意想不到的挑战吧，在这里，机遇的力量将塑造你的命运。你将被随机赋予来自各类职业的一系列技能，挑战你用手中这副牌打造出尽可能强大的构筑。\n\n一开始，你会从所有职业中随机抽取四个法术，并且可以随意重抽这些初始法术。随着你不断变强并提升等级，从 10 级开始，你每两级都会获得一个新的随机技能，不断重塑你的策略和玩法。\n\n请记住，你的力量或许是随机的，但你的天赋完全由你掌控。你可以将天赋点分配到任意你选择的职业专精中，让你那独特且不断变化的构筑焕发生机。此外，你在旅途中获得的幸运卷轴能让你重抽那些不太喜欢的技能，将你的 Wildcard 构筑打磨至完美。\n\n投身于 Wildcard 模式那不可预测又令人兴奋的世界吧，在那里你有机会创造出独一无二的英雄。你能否迎接挑战、掌控机遇的力量？只有掷出的骰子才知道答案。"
T["Presets"]="预设"
T["Press Ctrl-C to copy the text to the clipboard"]="按 Ctrl+C 将文本复制到剪贴板"
T["Press a key or mouse button to change the binding for this action.|nPress Escape to clear bindings for this action.|n|nClick to change the action of this button"]="按下一个按键或鼠标按钮来更改此命令的按键绑定。|n按 Escape 清除此命令的按键绑定。|n|n点击可更改此按钮的动作"
T["Press a key or mouse button to set the binding for this action|n|nClick to change the action of this button"]="按下一个按键或鼠标按钮来设置此命令的按键绑定|n|n点击可更改此按钮的动作"
T["Prestige Daily:"]="每日威望："
T["Prestige Mode"]="威望模式"
T["Prestige and get following rewards!"]="达到威望后可获得以下奖励！"
T["Prestige is a feature that allows you to reset your character back to level 1, wiping all learned abilities and talents while retaining your gear, gold, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, as well as your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h|r standings, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r levels, and gathered |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r. This system is designed to let you rebuild your character from scratch, offering a fresh leveling |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r and the opportunity to experiment with new builds or refine old ones. \r\n\r\nPrestiging offers exclusive rewards like titles, cosmetics, and other unlockables, depending on the realm or seasonal content. \r\n\r\nTo Prestige, visit Chromie near the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r in your faction’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r."]="威望是一项可将你的角色重置回 1 级的功能，它会清除所有已学会的技能和天赋，同时保留你的装备、金币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r，以及你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r 进度、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 等级和已积累的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r。该系统旨在让你从零开始重建角色，提供全新的升级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r，并有机会尝试新构筑或完善旧构筑。\r\n\r\n进行威望可获得专属奖励，例如头衔、外观和其他解锁内容，具体取决于服务器或赛季内容。\r\n\r\n要进行威望，请前往你阵营 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 附近的克罗米处。"
T["Prestige: Open World"]="威望：开放世界"
T["Prestigious Rewards"]="威望奖励"
