T["Primary Profession"]="主要专业"
T["Primary Professions are the main professions your character can learn and develop. They are divided into two categories and can be a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r. \r\n\r\nBy default, each character can learn up to two Primary Professions, allowing you to choose any combination that suits your playstyle.\r\n\r\nIf you want to expand beyond this limit, you can unlock additional |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r slots by obtaining a special item called the Craftsman’s Codex. This item enables you to learn and progress in more professions simultaneously, providing even greater flexibility and depth to your character’s skills. \r\n\r\nManaging your primary professions effectively can greatly enhance your gameplay, economy, and overall progression.\r\n"]="主要专业是你的角色可以学习和发展的核心专业。它们分为两类，可以是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r。\r\n\r\n默认情况下，每个角色最多可以学习两个主要专业，让你可以自由选择任何符合你玩法的组合。\r\n\r\n如果你想突破这一限制，可以通过获取名为工匠法典的特殊物品来解锁额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 栏位。该物品让你能够同时学习和提升更多专业，为你的角色技能带来更大的灵活性和深度。\r\n\r\n妥善管理你的主要专业可以极大地提升你的游戏体验、经济状况和整体成长。\r\n"
T["Primary Stat"]="主属性"
T["Print Screen"]="截图"
T["Priority"]="优先级"
T["Prismatic"]="棱彩"
T["Prismatic Gem"]="棱彩宝石"
T["Prison of Immol'Thar"]="伊莫尔萨的监狱"
T["Prizes"]="奖品"
T["Profession Rewards"]="专业奖励"
T["Profession Specializations"]="专业专精"
T["Profession Specializations are advanced branches within a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r that allow players to unlock unique |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r not available to others. Specializations give your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r a focused identity, whether it’s crafting stronger equipment, more efficient potions, or powerful enhancements, and can greatly enhance your crafting potential. Not all skills have a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Specialization, but those that do often offer a meaningful choice that sets your character apart in terms of what you can create and contribute.\r\n\r\nTo unlock a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Specialization, you’ll need to complete a series of tasks that demonstrate your dedication and skill. These challenges vary by |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r and may include completing special quests, crafting high-level items, or building rapport with key NPCs who serve as gatekeepers to the Specialization.\r\n\r\nOnce selected, your Specialization is permanent and you cannot switch without unlearning the entire |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r and starting over from scratch. This means you’ll lose all progress and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r tied to that |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r, so be sure to choose your Specialization carefully based on your goals, playstyle, or market demand."]="专业专精是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r 内的高级分支，让玩家可以解锁他人无法获得的独特 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r。专精会为你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 赋予明确的定位，无论是制造更强的装备、更高效的药水还是强大的强化效果，都能极大提升你的制造潜力。并非所有技能都有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 专精，但拥有专精的技能通常会提供有意义的选择，让你在能创造和贡献的内容上与众不同。\r\n\r\n要解锁一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 专精，你需要完成一系列任务来证明你的投入与能力。这些挑战因 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 而异，可能包括完成特殊任务、制造高级物品，或与作为专精守门人的关键 NPC 建立关系。\r\n\r\n一旦选定，你的专精就是永久的，除非遗忘整个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 并从零开始，否则无法更改。这意味着你将失去与该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 相关的所有进度和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，所以请务必根据你的目标、玩法或市场需求谨慎选择专精。"
T["Profession Trainer"]="专业训练师"
T["Profession Trainer / Book of Artisans"]="专业训练师 / 工匠之书"
T["Profession daily quests are daily challenges that require expertise in crafting and gathering skills, offering experience and materials as a reward for successful completion."]="专业日常任务是每日挑战，需要制造和采集技能方面的专长，成功完成后可获得经验值和材料作为奖励。"
T["Profession rewards indicate the rewards available upon utilizing crafting and gathering skills."]="专业奖励表示使用制造和采集技能时可获得的奖励。"
T["Professions are trade skills your character can learn to gather, craft, or enhance items that support your progression. They offer a valuable way to earn gold, improve your gear, and contribute to your character’s development.\r\n\r\nEach profession falls into one of two categories: a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r. Gathering professions encourage you to explore the world, collecting raw materials from nodes found throughout various zones. Crafting professions allow you to learn |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r and use those raw materials, along with loot from enemies, to create powerful gear, consumables, and enhancements.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, professions fall into two categories: a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r. Primary professions are more impactful and limited as by default, you can only learn two. Secondary skills, such as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|hFirst Aid|h|r, are available to all players with no restriction on how many you can learn.\r\n\r\nTo learn a Profession, visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to get started."]="专业是你的角色可以学习的商业技能，用于采集、制造或强化支持你成长的物品。它们提供了一条赚取金币、提升装备和为角色发展做贡献的宝贵途径。\r\n\r\n每个专业都属于以下两类之一：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r。采集专业鼓励你探索世界，从分布在各区域的节点中采集原材料。制造专业让你可以学习 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，并使用这些原材料以及敌人的战利品来制造强力的装备、消耗品和强化效果。\r\n\r\n此外，专业还分为两类：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r。主要专业影响更大且数量有限，因为默认情况下你只能学习两个。次要技能，例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|h急救|h|r，所有玩家都可以学习，且数量没有限制。\r\n\r\n要学习一项专业，请拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来开始。"
T["Profile will never auto-activate. Either PvP or PvE must be selected."]="配置永远不会自动激活。必须选择 PvP 或 PvE。"
T["Profile will never auto-activate. No group size is selected."]="配置永远不会自动激活。未选择队伍规模。"
T["Progression du Personnage"]="角色成长"
