T["Pursue valuable and useful ores, extracting them straight from the earth with a pickaxe. Their familiarity with the land gives them a strong notion of where veins of precious metals can be found, then retrieve and smelt these minerals for profit via the Auction House, or for use in metalworking of all types."]="追寻珍贵而有用的矿石，用矿镐直接从大地中开采它们。他们对地形的熟悉使其能敏锐地发现贵金属矿脉，随后开采并熔炼这些矿物，通过拍卖行获利，或将其用于各类金属加工。"
