T["PvE Mode is a ruleset that protects players from open-world PvP combat. \r\n\r\nWhen PvE mode is enabled, other players cannot attack you, and you are also restricted from participating in PvP activities. This includes healing or assisting players who are engaged in PvP combat. This mode is ideal for players who prefer to focus on completing a quest, exploring a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|hSub-Zone|h|r, leveling their |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r, or progressing through PvE without the risk of being ambushed by enemy players.\r\n\r\nThe PVE world is shared with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|hNo-Risk PvP Mode|h|r players, meaning both groups exist in the same zones. You’ll see other players in no-risk mode, but you won’t be able to interact with them in PvP-related ways unless you change your ruleset. However, engaging a world boss will automatically switch you to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|hNo-Risk PvP Mode|h|r for the duration of the encounter. This prevents players from bypassing PvP risk during high-value content.\r\n\r\nTo enable PvE Mode, visit your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|hHybrid Risk|h|r Menu (Hotkey H -> PvP Ruleset Tab) then select 'PvE Mode' as your active ruleset. Keep in mind that switching between PvP modes has a 15 minute cooldown, so plan your activities accordingly."]="PvE 模式是一套保护玩家免受开放世界 PvP 战斗影响的规则。\r\n\r\n当 PvE 模式启用时，其他玩家无法攻击你，同时你也被限制参与 PvP 活动。这包括治疗或协助正在参与 PvP 战斗的玩家。此模式非常适合那些希望专注于完成任务、探索 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|h子区域|h|r、提升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 等级，或在不受敌对玩家伏击风险的情况下推进 PvE 的玩家。\r\n\r\nPvE 世界与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|h无风险 PvP 模式|h|r 的玩家共享，这意味着两类玩家存在于相同的区域中。你会看到处于无风险模式的其他玩家，但除非你更改规则集，否则无法以与 PvP 相关的方式与他们互动。不过，与一名世界首领交战时，你会自动切换到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|h无风险 PvP 模式|h|r，持续整个战斗过程。这可以防止玩家在高价值内容中规避 PvP 风险。\r\n\r\n要启用 PvE 模式，请前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|h混合风险|h|r 菜单（快捷键 H -> PvP 规则标签页），然后选择“PvE 模式”作为你的活动规则集。请记住，在 PvP 模式之间切换有 15 分钟的冷却时间，因此请相应地安排你的活动。"
