T["Quest Givers are NPCs that offer quests to players, helping guide progression, storytelling, and rewards throughout the world. These NPCs are easily recognized by the icons that appear above their heads, which indicate the availability or status of a quest.\r\n\r\nAn exclamation mark (!) icon means a quest is being offered:\r\n\r\nYellow (!) indicates a new quest is available and ready to be accepted.\r\nBlue (!) signals a repeatable quest, which can be completed multiple times.\r\nGrey (!) shows that a quest exists, but you currently don’t meet the requirements to accept it.\r\n\r\nA question mark (?) icon appears when interacting with quest progress:\r\n\r\nYellow (?) means the quest is ready to be finished, and you can collect your rewards.\r\nBlue (?) indicates a repeatable quest that has been completed and can be turned in again.\r\nGrey (?) shows that you’ve accepted the quest, but the objective has not been completed.\r\n\r\nQuest givers are found throughout the world and serve as one of the main ways players gain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, gear, and story progression."]="任务给予者是向玩家提供任务的 NPC，帮助引导全世界范围内的成长、剧情和奖励。这些 NPC 很容易通过头顶出现的图标辨认，图标表示任务的可接取状态或进度。\r\n\r\n感叹号（!）图标表示有任务可接：\r\n\r\n黄色（!）表示有新任务可接取。\r\n蓝色（!）表示可重复任务，可以多次完成。\r\n灰色（!）表示任务存在，但你目前不满足接取条件。\r\n\r\n问号（?）图标会在与任务进度互动时出现：\r\n\r\n黄色（?）表示任务可以交付，你可以领取奖励。\r\n蓝色（?）表示已完成的可重复任务，可以再次交付。\r\n灰色（?）表示你已接取任务，但目标尚未完成。\r\n\r\n任务给予者遍布世界各地，是玩家获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r、装备和剧情进度的主要途径之一。"
