T["Raids refer to both a specific type of group as well as a category of high-level PvE content. \r\n\r\nA 'raid group' is a large |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r consisting of anywhere from 6 to 40 players, formed when a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r leader converts a standard group using the raid menu (Hotkey O -> Raid Tab -> Convert to Raid). \r\n\r\nRaid groups are typically used for content that requires more coordination and members than regular Dungeons or quests. However, it’s important to note that while in a Raid group, most normal quests won’t track progress.\r\n\r\nThe term \"\"raid\"\" also refers to raid encounters, which are instanced dungeons designed for 10 to 25 players. These encounters feature powerful bosses, complex mechanics, and often require strategic coordination, communication, and strong team builds. Raids offer some of the most prestigious rewards in the game, including high-tier gear, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, cosmetic items, and unique achievements."]="团队既指一种特定的队伍类型，也指一类高等级玩家对环境（PvE）内容。\r\n\r\n“团队队伍”是一个大型的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h队伍|h|r，由 6 到 40 名玩家组成；当一名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h队伍|h|r 领袖通过团队菜单（快捷键 O -> 团队标签页 -> 转换为团队）将标准队伍转换后即可创建。\r\n\r\n团队队伍通常用于比普通地下城或任务需要更多协调与成员的内容。不过需要注意的是，身处团队队伍时，大多数普通任务都不会记录进度。\r\n\r\n\"\"团队\"\"一词也指团队首领战，即为 10 到 25 名玩家设计的副本。这些战斗拥有强大的首领与复杂的机制，往往需要战略协调、沟通以及强力的团队构筑。团队会提供游戏中最负盛名的奖励，包括高等级装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、装饰品以及独特成就。"
