T["Rares are primarily made up of Passive self-buffs, Utility, Mana recovery, Healing over Time, and powerful attack abilities.\n\nRare spells allow you to add additional strengths to add to your core build, empowering your damaging abilities, debuffing your enemies or gaining additional passive defense, utility and sustain."]="稀有法术主要由被动自身增益、辅助功能、法力回复、持续治疗和强力攻击技能组成。\n\n稀有法术让你能为核心构筑增添额外优势，强化你的伤害技能、削弱敌人，或获得额外的被动防御、辅助功能和续航能力。"
