T["Realm-Bound items (commonly referred to as Bind-on-Account or BoA items) are special items appearing with beige text that can be shared across all characters on your account, but only within the same realm.\r\n\r\nRealm-Bound items include things like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, vanity items, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h|r, and purchases from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r. Most of these items can be stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r (Hotkey N -> Vanity Tab). This makes them easy to equip across your characters without having to mail them individually.\r\n\r\nIf you need to transfer a Realm-Bound item to a different live server, you’ll need to speak to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h|r, an NPC who can assist with cross-realm Vanity item transfers. But keep in mind that only items that can be saved in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r qualify for this service.\r\n"]="服务器绑定物品（通常称为账号绑定或 BoA 物品）是一类以米色文字显示的 special 物品，可以在你账号上的所有角色之间共享，但仅限同一服务器内。\r\n\r\n服务器绑定物品包括 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、外观物品、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r，以及从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r 购买的商品。其中大多数物品可以存放在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 中（快捷键 N -> 外观标签页）。这样就能方便地在各个角色间装备它们，无需逐一邮寄。\r\n\r\n如果你需要将服务器绑定物品转移到其他在线服务器，你需要与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|h信使马利克|h|r 交谈，这位 NPC 可以协助跨服务器转移外观物品。但请记住，只有能保存到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 中的物品才符合此服务的条件。\r\n"
T["Realm-Wide Bank"]="全服务器银行"
