T["Recipes are special items that teach your character how to craft specific items within a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r. Once learned, a recipe permanently adds a new crafting option to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r's crafting menu. Recipes are essential for progressing through professions and unlocking powerful gear, consumables, and utility items.\r\n\r\nYou can acquire recipes in several ways: by learning them from a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r, purchasing them from specialized |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, trading with other players, or looting them from enemies. Some recipes are easy to find, while others are tied to specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h|r milestones, quests, or Dungeons."]="配方是一种特殊物品，可教会你的角色如何在某个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 中制造特定物品。学会后，配方会永久为你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 制造菜单添加一个新的制造选项。配方对于推进专业进度、解锁强力装备、消耗品和实用物品至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以通过多种方式获得配方：从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r 处学习、从专门的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处购买、与其他玩家交易，或从敌人身上拾取。有些配方很容易找到，而另一些则与特定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r 里程碑、任务或地下城相关联。"
