T["Recovery Services can restore items that you may have lost accidentally. Whether you’ve sold an item to a Vendor, deleted it, or disenchanted it, you can often recover it using this system. \r\n\r\nTo access Recovery Services, click the question mark icon (?) in the micro menu, or speak with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h|r, who can be found in most Capital Cities. This will open the recovery menu, where you'll see a list of recently lost items eligible for restoration.\r\n\r\nYou can recover up to the last 500 lost items for a fee, and also restore deleted characters through this menu. It serves as a reliable safety net for undoing mistakes or recovering important items."]="恢复服务可以还原你可能意外丢失的物品。无论你是把物品卖给了商人、删除了它还是分解了它，通常都能通过该系统找回。\r\n\r\n要访问恢复服务，请点击微型菜单中的问号图标（?），或与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|h阿米尔·好运|h|r 交谈，他出现在大多数主城中。这会打开恢复菜单，你会在其中看到一份可还原的近期丢失物品列表。\r\n\r\n你可以支付一笔费用找回最近最多 500 件丢失的物品，也可以通过此菜单恢复已删除的角色。它是撤销失误或找回重要物品的可靠保障。"
T["Recovery is limited to the most recent 500 items."]="恢复仅限于最近 500 件物品。"
T["Recovery is limited to the most recent 500 items.|nWorldforged item recovery is limited to 5000 items."]="恢复仅限于最近 500 件物品。|n世界铸造物品的恢复上限为 5000 件。"
