T["Reduce el coste de maná de tu Sanación relámpago un 5% y aumenta la probabilidad de efecto crítico de tu Sanación relámpago un 5% sobre los objetivos amistosos con salud igual o menor del 50%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Flash Heal casts reduce the cooldown of your Inner Focus by 2 seconds.|r"]="使你的快速治疗的法力消耗降低 5%，并使你的快速治疗对生命值等于或低于 50% 的友方目标的爆击几率提高 5%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你施放快速治疗会使你的内心专注的冷却时间缩短 2 秒。|r"
T["Reduce el coste de rabia de tu habilidad Devastate en 1.\r\n\r\nYour attacks ignore an additional 2% of your target's armor."]="使你的毁灭打击技能的怒气消耗降低 1 点。\r\n\r\n你的攻击额外忽略目标 2% 的护甲。"
T["Reduce el daño con hechizos recibido en un 3%.\n\nYou have a 50% chance to refresh the duration of your Divine Plea when you hit an enemy. \n\nYour Divine Plea spell is 50% less likely to be dispelled."]="使受到的法术伤害降低 3%。\n\n当你击中一名敌人时，你有 50% 的几率刷新神圣恳求的持续时间。\n\n你的神圣恳求法术被驱散的几率降低 50%。"
T["Reduce el tiempo de reutilización de tu Martillo de justicia 5 s. \n\nIncreases the duration of your Seal of Justice effect by 0.5 sec.\n\nYour Judgement spells also reduce the melee attack speed of the target by 10%."]="使你的制裁之锤的冷却时间缩短 5 秒。\n\n使你的公正圣印效果的持续时间延长 0.5 秒。\n\n你的审判法术还会使目标的近战攻击速度降低 10%。"
T["Reduce el tiempo de reutilización de tus hechizos Empoderamiento demoníaco, Metamorfosis, Infierno, Ritual de la perdición y Dominación fel en un 10%, y el tiempo de reutilización de tu Salto demoníaco en 5 segundos.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: While in Metamorphosis, your Hand of Gul'dan can be cast twice within 6 sec before going on cooldown.|r"]="使你的恶魔强化、恶魔变形、地狱火、末日仪式和恶魔支配法术的冷却时间缩短 10%，恶魔跳跃的冷却时间缩短 5 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：处于恶魔变形状态时，你的古尔丹之手可以在进入冷却前于 6 秒内施放两次。|r"
T["Reduce el tiempo de reutilización de tus hechizos Enfoque interior, Infusión de poder, Supresión del dolor, Salto de fe y Penitencia en un 10%. \n\nIncreases the duration of Pain Suppression by 1 sec."]="使你的内心专注、能量灌注、痛苦压制、信仰飞跃和苦修法术的冷却时间缩短 10%。\n\n使痛苦压制的持续时间延长 1 秒。"
T["Reduce la amenaza de todos los enemigos en un radio de 50 m. un 50%."]="使半径 50 码内所有敌人的威胁值降低 50%。"
T["Reduce la probabilidad de que melee and spells by 2%.\r\n\r\nReduces all damage your summoned demon and dominated demon takes by 5% de tus golpes sean críticos."]="使你受到近战和法术爆击的几率降低 2%。\r\n\r\n使你召唤的恶魔和被支配的恶魔受到的所有伤害降低 5%。"
T["Reduce todo el daño recibido en 50% durante 12 s.ext@\n\nCannot be used within 30 sec of using Avenging Wrath.\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使受到的所有伤害降低 50%，持续 12 秒。\r\n\r\n在使用复仇之怒后的 30 秒内无法使用。\r\n\r\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduce todo el daño recibido en un 1%.\n\nYour Avenger's Shield has a 33% chance to silence your targets for 3 sec.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Being healed by others reduces the cooldown of your Divine Protection by 1 second and Holy Shield by 1 second. |r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="使受到的所有伤害降低 1%。\r\n\r\n你的复仇者之盾有 33% 的几率使目标沉默 3 秒。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：被他人治疗会使你的神圣保护冷却时间缩短 1 秒，神圣之盾冷却时间缩短 1 秒。 |r\r\n\r\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces all damage taken by 2%. \r\n\r\nReduces the fade time of your Invisibility spell by 1 sec."]="使受到的所有伤害降低 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的隐形术的渐隐时间缩短 1 秒。"
T["Reduces all damage taken by 4%. \r\n\r\nReduces the fade time of your Invisibility spell by 2 sec."]="使受到的所有伤害降低 4%。\r\n\r\n使你的隐形术的渐隐时间缩短 2 秒。"
T["Reduces all damage taken by 50% for 12 sec.\r\n\r\nCannot be used within 30 sec of using Avenging Wrath.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="使受到的所有伤害降低 50%，持续 12 秒。\r\n\r\n在使用复仇之怒后的 30 秒内无法使用。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces all threat generated by 30%.\r\n\r\nIncreases damage done by your Windfury and Flametongue Weapon Enhancements by 5%."]="使产生的所有威胁值降低 30%。\r\n\r\n使你的风怒武器和火舌武器强化造成的伤害提高 5%。"
T["Reduces duration of stuns by 5%."]="使昏迷效果的持续时间缩短 5%。"
T["Reduces the Energy cost of your Cheap Shot and Garrote abilities by 10. \r\n\r\nYour Rogue abilities cause 10% more damage against targets below 35% health."]="使你的偷袭和锁喉技能的能量消耗降低 10 点。\r\n\r\n你的潜行者技能对生命值低于 35% 的目标造成的伤害提高 10%。"
T["Reduces the Energy cost of your Cheap Shot and Garrote abilities by 20. \r\n\r\nYour Rogue abilities cause 20% more damage against targets below 35% health."]="使你的偷袭和锁喉技能的能量消耗降低 20 点。\r\n\r\n你的潜行者技能对生命值低于 35% 的目标造成的伤害提高 20%。"
T["Reduces the cast time of your Frostbolt by 0.1 sec.\r\n\r\nAfter casting Frostbolt the critical strike damage bonus of your spells is increased by 7% and your total Frost damage is increased by 3% for 8 sec."]="使你的寒冰箭的施法时间缩短 0.1 秒。\r\n\r\n施放寒冰箭后，你的法术爆击伤害加成提高 7%，你的冰霜总伤害提高 3%，持续 8 秒。"
T["Reduces the cast time of your Frostbolt by 0.2 sec.\r\n\r\nAfter casting Frostbolt the critical strike damage bonus of your spells is increased by 14% and your total Frost damage is increased by 5% for 8 sec."]="使你的寒冰箭的施法时间缩短 0.2 秒。\r\n\r\n施放寒冰箭后，你的法术爆击伤害加成提高 14%，你的冰霜总伤害提高 5%，持续 8 秒。"
T["Reduces the cast time of your Frostbolt by 0.3 sec.\r\n\r\nAfter casting Frostbolt the critical strike damage bonus of your spells is increased by 20% and your total Frost damage is increased by 7% for 8 sec."]="使你的寒冰箭的施法时间缩短 0.3 秒。\r\n\r\n施放寒冰箭后，你的法术爆击伤害加成提高 20%，你的冰霜总伤害提高 7%，持续 8 秒。"
T["Reduces the casting time of your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Felhunter and Fel Guard Summoning spells by 2 sec and the Mana cost by 20%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the duration of your Infernal and Doomguard summons by 3 min and your Wild Imps from Hand of Gul'Dan by 2 sec."]="使你的小鬼、虚空行者、魅魔、地狱猎犬和恶魔卫士召唤法术的施法时间缩短 2 秒，法力消耗降低 20%。\r\n\r\n使你的地狱火和末日守卫召唤物的持续时间延长 3 分钟，古尔丹之手的野生小鬼持续时间延长 2 秒。"
