T["Reduces the mana cost of your Prayer of Healing, Prayer of Mending and Halo spells by 10%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the critical strike chance of your Prayer of Healing and Halo spells by 5%."]="使你的治疗祷言、愈合祷言和光晕法术的法力消耗降低 10%。\r\n\r\n使你的治疗祷言和光晕法术的爆击几率提高 5%。"
T["Reduces the mana cost of your Shadow spells by 2%.\r\n\r\nYou receive 5% of your base mana when your Shadow Word: Pain or Vampiric Touch spells are dispelled.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: All threat generated is reduced by 20%. This capstone effect does not stack with similar capstone effects.|r"]="使你的暗影法术的法力消耗降低 2%。\r\n\r\n当你的暗言术：痛或吸血鬼之触法术被驱散时，你恢复 5% 的基础法力值。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：产生的所有威胁值降低 20%。此巅峰效果不与类似的巅峰效果叠加。|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of your Shadow spells by 4%.\r\n\r\nYou receive 10% of your base mana when your Shadow Word: Pain or Vampiric Touch spells are dispelled.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: All threat generated is reduced by 20%. This capstone effect does not stack with similar capstone effects.|r"]="使你的暗影法术的法力消耗降低 4%。\r\n\r\n当你的暗言术：痛或吸血鬼之触法术被驱散时，你恢复 10% 的基础法力值。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：产生的所有威胁值降低 20%。此巅峰效果不与类似的巅峰效果叠加。|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of your Shadow spells by 6%.\r\n\r\nYou receive 15% of your base mana when your Shadow Word: Pain or Vampiric Touch spells are dispelled.\n\nCapstone Bonus: All threat generated is reduced by 20%. This capstone effect does not stack with similar capstone effects."]="使你的暗影法术的法力消耗降低 6%。\r\n\r\n当你的暗言术：痛或吸血鬼之触法术被驱散时，你恢复 15% 的基础法力值。\n\n巅峰加成：产生的所有威胁值降低 20%。此巅峰效果不与类似的巅峰效果叠加。"
