T["Refine leather, hide and scales found via Skinning into medium armors - leather and mail - as well as cloaks, bags and unique embroideries improving equipment. Leatherworkers may outfit themselves and others with suitable armors, as well as proft from selling their creations via the Auction House.\n\nAdvanced Leatherworkers may specialize in Dragonscale, Elemental, or Tribal leatherworking."]="将剥皮获得的皮革、兽皮和鳞片加工成中型护甲——皮甲和锁甲——以及披风、背包和可强化装备的独特刺绣。制皮师可以为自己和他人配备合适的护甲，也可以通过拍卖行出售自己的作品获利。\n\n高级制皮师可以专精于龙鳞、元素或部族制皮。"
