T["Reputation (Hotkey U) is a progression system that tracks your standing with various factions throughout the world. \r\n\r\nEach faction has its own unique identity, goals, and rewards, and building reputation with them often unlocks valuable items such as gear, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, item enhancements, and cosmetics. \r\n\r\nYour standing with a faction typically progresses through several ranks: hated, hostile, unfriendly, neutral, friendly, honored, revered, and finally exalted. You begin at neutral with most factions, and by completing quests, killing specific enemies, turning in items, or participating in events tied to that faction, you can steadily increase your Reputation.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, certain factions can be set to 'At War' status, allowing you to attack their NPCs. Doing so will lower your reputation, potentially pushing it into negative standings like unfriendly or hated, which can impact your ability to access quests or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r from that group."]="声望（快捷键 U）是一个成长系统，用于记录你在世界各地各个阵营中的声望状态。\r\n\r\n每个阵营都有其独特的定位、目标和奖励，与它们建立声望通常能解锁有价值的物品，如装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h小伙伴|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r、物品强化和外观。\r\n\r\n你在某个阵营中的声望通常会经历多个等级：仇恨、敌对、冷淡、中立、友善、尊敬、崇敬，最后是崇拜。你在大多数阵营中都从中立开始，通过完成任务、击杀特定敌人、交付物品或参与与该阵营相关的活动，你可以稳步提升声望。\r\n\r\n此外，某些阵营可以设置为“交战”状态，让你可以攻击他们的 NPC。这样做会降低你的声望，甚至可能降至冷淡或仇恨等负面状态，从而影响你获取该阵营任务或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 的能力。"
