T["Requiere a |cffFFFFFFSingle Two-Handed or One-Handed Weapon|r.\n\nIncreases armor contribution from armor by 14% and increases the damage of Devastate by 8%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: With the final rank, stagger 30% of damage taken from attacks, distributing it over 10 seconds. This staggered damage does not break crowd control effects. \n\n|r\n\n|cff00DDFFMantén MAYÚS para más información|r"]="需要 |cffFFFFFF单手或双手武器|r。\n\n使护甲提供的护甲值提高 14%，毁灭打击的伤害提高 8%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：达到最高等级后，使受到的攻击伤害的 30% 发生醉拳延后，在 10 秒内分摊。此延后伤害不会打破群体控制效果。\n\n|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
