T["Resilience is a secondary stat that reduces the damage you take from other players and their Tamed Pets in PvP combat. This makes it an important stat for increasing your survivability in battlegrounds and arenas.\r\n\r\nYou can view your resilience rating in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="韧性是一项次要属性，可降低你在 PvP 战斗中受到的其他玩家及其驯服宠物造成的伤害。这使它成为提高你在战场和竞技场中生存能力的重要属性。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看你的韧性等级。"
T["Resist"]="抵抗"
T["Resistances reduce the amount of damage you take from specific types of magical attacks. There are five primary resistance types: fire, frost, shadow, nature, and arcane.\r\n\r\nWhen you are targeted by a magical spell, your resistance provides a chance to either partially resist the damage (reducing the damage taken) or fully resisting it (taking no damage at all). The effectiveness of resistances is based on your resistance rating, the level of the caster, and the difficulty of the content you're facing. \r\n\r\nIn general gameplay, resistances are not always essential, but they become critically important in certain situations. A high-level |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or world boss can often feature encounters with heavy elemental damage where resistances can significantly improve your survivability. In PvP, resistances can provide a strong defensive edge against caster-heavy opponents, allowing you to withstand or shrug off powerful spell-based attacks.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current resistances in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="抗性可降低你受到特定类型魔法攻击的伤害量。共有五种主要抗性类型：火焰、冰霜、暗影、自然和奥术。\r\n\r\n当你成为魔法法术的目标时，你的抗性提供部分抵抗伤害（减少受到的伤害）或完全抵抗（不受任何伤害）的机会。抗性的效果取决于你的抗性等级、施法者的等级以及你所面对内容的难度。\r\n\r\n在一般游戏中，抗性并非总是必需的，但在某些情况下会变得至关重要。高级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 或世界首领经常会遭遇大量元素伤害，此时抗性可以显著提高你的生存能力。在 PvP 中，抗性可以为你提供强大的防御优势，对抗以施法者为主的对手，让你能够承受或摆脱强大的法术攻击。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看你当前的抗性。"
