T["Rested |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r is a modifier that lets you level up faster by granting extra |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r points when you kill enemies. Your character accumulates rested |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r whenever you log out inside an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, also known as rest areas. \r\n\r\nThis bonus appears as a blue section on your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r bar and effectively doubles the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r gained from killing monsters until the rested amount is used up. However, rested |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r does not apply to quest rewards, only to kills."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 休息奖励是一种可让你升级更快的修正效果，在你击杀敌人时提供额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。每当你在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r（也称为休息区域）中登出时，你的角色就会累积休息 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。\r\n\r\n该奖励在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 条上显示为蓝色部分，实际上会使击杀怪物获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 翻倍，直到休息量用尽。不过，休息 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 不适用于任务奖励，仅适用于击杀。"
