T["Restores 0 to 1% of your health per second for 24 sec.  Must remain seated while eating.  If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain Stamina and Spirit for 30 min."]="在 24 秒内每秒恢复你 0 到 1% 的生命值。进食时必须保持坐姿。如果你进食至少 10 秒，你就会获得充分进食效果，耐力与精神提高，持续 30 分钟。"
