T["Riding Trainers are NPCs found in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, and occasionally a quest hub, who can teach you how to ride |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r and improve your riding speed. \r\n\r\nThey also provide training for flying |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r in Outland and Northrend once you reach the appropriate level and requirements. \r\n\r\nRiding comes in several tiers, each increasing your speed and unlocking new movement options:\r\n\r\nApprentice Riding – Increases ground mount speed by 60%.\r\nJourneyman Riding – Upgrades ground mount speed to 100%.\r\nExpert Riding – Unlocks flying at 150% flight speed.\r\nArtisan Riding – Improves flying speed to 280%.\r\nExtraordinary Riding – Grants the maximum flying speed of 310%."]="骑术训练师是出现在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中、偶尔也出现在任务枢纽的 NPC，他们可以教你骑乘 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 并提高你的骑乘速度。\r\n\r\n当你达到相应的等级和要求后，他们还会在外域和诺森德提供飞行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 的训练。\r\n\r\n骑术分为几个等级，每一级都会提高你的速度并解锁新的移动方式：\r\n\r\n学徒骑术——使地面坐骑速度提高 60%。\r\n熟练骑术——将地面坐骑速度提升至 100%。\r\n专家骑术——解锁飞行，飞行速度为 150%。\r\n工匠骑术——将飞行速度提升至 280%。\r\n非凡骑术——授予 310% 的最高飞行速度。"
