T["Savor Azeroth’s journey at a reduced pace. Your experience gained is reduced to 0.5x, so you can focus on the adventure rather than the destination.\r\n\r\nTake the time to explore zones in full and revisit quests you may have once overlooked.\r\n\r\nDuring this journey, you cannot benefit from bonus experience effects such as Aura of Experience, Potion of Experience, or Experience Hotspots.\r\n"]="以更缓慢的节奏品味艾泽拉斯之旅。你获得的经验值将降低至 0.5 倍，让你能够专注于冒险本身而非终点。\r\n\r\n花些时间彻底探索各个区域，重新造访那些你可能曾错过的任务。\r\n\r\n在此旅程中，你无法享受额外经验效果，例如经验光环、经验药水或经验热点。\r\n"
