T["Secondary Skills are a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r that every character can learn, regardless of their build or playstyle. Unlike a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r, which are limited by default to two per character, all heroes can learn and level every secondary skill. \r\n\r\nThe available secondary skills are:\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h|r - Cook meat and fish to create powerful consumables. (|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r)\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|hFirst Aid|h|r - Create bandages and healing items that you can use in combat. (|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r)\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:107|hFishing|h|r - Catch fish and sunken loot in any body of water. (|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r)\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:254|hWoodcutting|h|r - Chop down logs and turn them into lumber for quests. (|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r)\r\n\r\nYou can train these skills by visiting a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r or the appropriate |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r found in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r or quest hub."]="次要技能是一种每个角色都可以学习的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r，无论其构筑或玩法如何。与默认每个角色限学两个的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业|h|r 不同，所有英雄都可以学习和提升每一项次要技能。\r\n\r\n可用的次要技能有：\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r - 烹饪肉类和鱼类，制作强力的消耗品。（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r）\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|h急救|h|r - 制作可在战斗中使用的绷带和治疗物品。（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r）\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:107|h钓鱼|h|r - 在任何水域中钓取鱼类和沉没的战利品。（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r）\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:254|h伐木|h|r - 砍伐原木并将其制成任务用的木材。（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r）\r\n\r\n你可以通过拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 或位于你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 或任务枢纽中的相应 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r 来学习这些技能。"
