T["Sets the maximum angle Target Nearest Enemy (Tab Targeting) will find enemies in front of your character.\n\nThis checks for enemies inside of a cone in the direction you are facing.\n\nExample: a setting of 90° will check 45° left and 45° right."]="设置“选择最近敌人”（Tab 选敌）在角色前方寻找敌人的最大角度。\n\n这会在你面朝方向的锥形区域内检查敌人。\n\n例如：设置为 90° 时，会检查左侧 45° 和右侧 45°。"
