T["Shadow channeled spells and Mind Blast casts have a 33% chance to refresh the duration of your Shadow Word: Pain on the target.\r\n\r\nReduces the damage you take from your own Shadow Word: Death by 10%."]="暗影引导法术和心灵震爆施放有 33% 的几率刷新你对目标的暗言术：痛的持续时间。\r\n\r\n使你受到自己暗言术：灭的伤害降低 10%。"
