T["Shapeshift into Bear Form.\r\n\r\nIncreasing melee attack power by 30, armor contribution from cloth and leather items by 65%, and Stamina by 15%. \r\n\r\nTeaches you |cFFFFFFFFGrowl|r."]="变形为熊形态。\r\n\r\n使近战攻击强度提高 30 点，布甲和皮甲物品提供的护甲值提高 65%，耐力提高 15%。\r\n\r\n教你 |cFFFFFFFF低吼|r。"
T["Shapeshift into Dire Bear Form, significantly increasing threat generated, increasing melee attack power by 120, armor contribution from cloth and leather items by 85% and Stamina by 15%. Allows the use of various Bear abilities.\r\n\r\nIf your Primary Stat is Agility or Strength, shapeshifting into Dire Bear Form will free you from all movement impairing effects.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="变形为巨熊形态，大幅提高产生的威胁值，使近战攻击强度提高 120 点，布甲和皮甲物品提供的护甲值提高 85%，耐力提高 15%。允许使用各种熊形态技能。\r\n\r\n如果你的主属性是敏捷或力量，变形为巨熊形态将使你摆脱所有降低移动速度的效果。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Shapeshift into cat form, increasing melee attack power by 4 plus 25% of Agility. Allows the use of various cat abilities.\n\r\n"]="变形为豹形态，使你的近战攻击强度提高 4 点外加敏捷的 25%。允许使用各种豹形态技能。\n\r\n"
T["Shapeshift into flight form, increasing movement speed by 150% and allowing you to fly. Cannot use in combat. Can only use this form in Outland or Northrend.\r\n\r\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of movement impairing and Polymorph effects."]="变形为飞行形态，使移动速度提高 150% 并允许你飞行。无法在战斗中使用。只能在外域或诺森德使用此形态。\r\n\r\n变形的动作会使施法者摆脱变形和降低移动速度的效果。"
T["Shapeshift into the Tree of Life. While in this form you increase healing received by 6% for all party and raid members. Does not stack with other similar effects.\r\nIn addition, while in Tree of Life the mana cost of your healing over time spells is reduced by 20%. \r\n\r\nWhile in this form, you can only cast healing spells in addition to Innervate, Barkskin, Nature's Grasp, Thorns spells, and spells usable while shapeshifted. \r\n\r\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects."]="变形为生命之树。在此形态下，你使所有小队和团队成员受到的治疗效果提高 6%。不与类似效果叠加。\r\n此外，处于生命之树形态时，你的持续治疗法术的法力消耗降低 20%。\r\n\r\n在此形态下，你只能施放治疗法术，以及激活、树皮术、自然之握、荆棘术和可在变形状态下使用的法术。\r\n\r\n变形的动作会使施法者摆脱变形和降低移动速度的效果。"
