T["Silas Darkmoon in your capital city offers Scrolls of Fortune while leveling and at end-game that can be used to reroll any of your spells or talents! These scrolls are also found in quests, the Manastorm, dungeons, battlegrounds, High-risk, and raids."]="暗月马戏团的塞拉斯在你的主城中提供幸运卷轴，无论在升级途中还是游戏终局阶段，都可以用它们重新抽取你的任意法术或天赋！这些卷轴也可以在任务、法力风暴、地下城、战场、高风险区域和团队中找到。"
