T["Slay Gath'llzogg in Stonewatch Keep before level 24 or die! Then reach max level. This Hardcore challenge sends you deep into the dangerous cooridor's of Redridge's abandoned keep. One life, no friends.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:334|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Gath'llzogg] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 24|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="在 24 级前在石望要塞击杀加斯尔佐格，否则便会死亡！然后达到满级。这项硬核挑战将你作为梦魇勇士送入赤脊山废弃要塞的危险走廊深处。一条命，没有朋友。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:334|h你必须在达到 24 级前击杀 |cffffff00[加斯尔佐格]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
