T["Spell Power (also known as SP) is a secondary stat that increases the damage and healing done by your spells. A higher spell power value means your magical abilities will hit harder or restore more health, making it essential for both casters and hybrid builds.\r\n\r\nYou can view your spell power in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="法术强度（也称 SP）是一项次要属性，可提高你的法术造成的伤害与治疗量。法术强度数值越高，你的魔法技能就能打出更高的伤害或恢复更多的生命值，这对施法者与混合构筑而言都至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看自己的法术强度。"
