T["Spellbind Roulette"]="法术绑定轮盘"
T["Spellbind Roulette beckons you into a mesmerizing realm where the laws of spellcasting are governed by chance. Prepare for a whirlwind of enchantment as every 30 seconds, a random ability is drawn, only to be forbidden from your grasp. Adaptation becomes your greatest ally as you navigate this ethereal challenge, constantly reevaluating your approach and harnessing the untapped potential of your remaining spells. Engage in thrilling battles where innovation and quick thinking reign supreme, and discover the hidden depths of your magical repertoire amidst the ever-shifting tides of the Spellbind Roulette. Will you conquer the chaos and emerge as a master of spellcraft, or succumb to the whims of chance?"]="法术绑定轮盘将你引入一个迷人的国度，在这里魔法的法则由几率主宰。准备好迎接一场附魔的旋风吧——每 30 秒都会随机抽出一个技能，并将其从你的掌控中禁用。适应能力将成为你最好的盟友，你将在这一空灵的挑战中不断重新评估自己的策略，并挖掘剩余法术尚未开发的潜力。投身于激动人心的战斗，让创新与敏捷的思维占据绝对上风，在法术绑定轮盘不断变换的浪潮中，发现你魔法武库隐藏的深度。你会征服混乱，以魔法大师之姿脱颖而出，还是会屈服于命运的反复无常？"
