T["Spirit is the |cffFFFFFFhealer-only|r stat,\nand increases their mana regeneration.\n\n Choosing this specialization will give you bonus |cffFFFFFFIntellect|r and |cffFFFFFFSpirit|r and make each point of |cffFFFFFFSpell Power|r give you one additional |cffFFFFFFHealing Power|r."]="精神是 |cffFFFFFF仅限治疗者|r 的属性，\n并提高他们的法力回复。\n\n选择此专精将为你提供额外的 |cffFFFFFF智力|r 与 |cffFFFFFF精神|r，并使每点 |cffFFFFFF法术强度|r 额外为你提供一点 |cffFFFFFF治疗强度|r。"
