T["Step into a dangerous Open World adventure where every monster on Azeroth becomes Elite. Choose your difficulty, embark solo or with a party of up to five, and set off. In Adventure Mode, Quest experience is greatly increased and you can find dungeon loot off of monsters you slay. However, monsters have more dangerous behavior, increased health, and increased damage. Will you rise to the challenge and claim your destiny, or fall to a deadlier Azeroth? Welcome to Adventure Mode!"]="踏入一场危险的开放世界冒险，艾泽拉斯的每一只怪物都会变为精英。选择你的难度，独自出发或与最多五人的队伍同行，然后启程吧。在冒险模式中，任务经验会大幅提高，你还能从击杀的怪物身上找到地下城战利品。不过，怪物的行为会更加危险，生命值与伤害也更高。你能迎接挑战、掌握自己的命运，还是会倒在一个更致命的艾泽拉斯面前？欢迎来到冒险模式！"
T["Step into the exhilarating mayhem of Felforged Mode. In this rogue-like spin-off, you trade your soul to the Legion for unprecedented power. With a fast-paced progression system, you earn 500% increased experience rates and have a significantly increased chance to find loot in the open world. However, the real thrill comes from the game's high-stakes mechanic: if you die, you reset back to level 20, making each play session a unique and adrenaline-filled endeavor.\n\nFelforged Mode is a free-for-all PvP experience with the pulse-pounding excitement of a session-based PvP game. Your journey begins at the Legion's stronghold, Demon's Tears, in the Twisting Nether. From there, you will drop into Azeroth as a Legion Meteor, leaving a trail of destruction in your wake. Kill, Loot, Die, Repeat, and become stronger as you reap souls from the players you vanquish. With entirely random abilities every time you level, no two play sessions will be the same.\n\nTake on Felforged Challenges for an extra test of your skill and courage. Completing these trials rewards you with Legion Crests, which can be used to obtain unique rewards. You can also group with other Felforged players to conquer these challenges, adding another layer of strategy to this high-risk, high-reward game mode.\n\nWill you risk it all in the pursuit of power? Enter the Felforged Mode, embrace the chaos, and carve your path to infamy."]="踏入魔化模式那令人振奋的混乱之中。在这个类 Rogue 的衍生模式里，你将灵魂献给燃烧军团以换取前所未有的力量。凭借快节奏的成长体系，你将获得 500% 的经验加成，并在开放世界中拥有显著更高的战利品掉落几率。然而，真正的刺激来自该模式的高风险机制：一旦死亡，你就会回到 20 级，让每一次游戏都成为独一无二、充满肾上腺素的挑战。\n\n魔化模式是一种自由混战的 PvP 体验，拥有基于场次的 PvP 游戏那种令人心跳加速的刺激感。你的旅程始于扭曲虚空中军团的堡垒——恶魔之泪。从那里，你将化作一颗军团流星坠入艾泽拉斯，在身后留下一路毁灭。杀戮、拾取、死亡、重复，在收割你击败的玩家灵魂的同时变得更强。由于每次升级都会获得完全随机的技能，没有两次游戏会是相同的。\n\n迎接魔化挑战，进一步考验你的技巧与勇气。完成这些试炼将奖励你军团徽记，可用于获取独特奖励。你也可以与其他魔化模式的玩家组队征服这些挑战，为这个高风险、高回报的游戏模式再添一层策略。\n\n你会为了追求力量而赌上一切吗？进入魔化模式，拥抱混乱，开辟属于你的恶名之路。"
T["Step into the unpredictable thrill of Draft Mode. A game mode like no other where every 2 levels, you are presented with a choice of 3 spell cards to add to your arsenal. These spells can span across any class, challenging you to strategize and create the most powerful build possible from your drafted abilities.\n\nAs you ascend in levels and expand your deck of spells, you can assign talent points to any talent tree, empowering your abilities without restriction. But the adventure doesn't end at max level. By completing daily quests and overcoming challenging end-game content, you earn the opportunity to redraft spells and refine your hero, enabling you to craft your ultimate class fantasy.\n\nJoin the ranks in Draft Mode and let the power of choice guide your path to glory."]="踏入抽取模式那难以预测的刺激之中。这是一个与众不同的游戏模式：每提升 2 级，你都会面对 3 张法术卡牌的选择，将它们加入你的武库。这些法术可以来自任何职业，考验你如何规划并利用所抽取的技能打造最强构筑。\n\n随着等级提升与法术牌组的扩充，你可以将天赋点分配到任意天赋树，不受限制地强化你的技能。但冒险并不会在达到满级时结束。通过完成日常任务并攻克富有挑战性的终局内容，你将有机会重新抽取法术、完善你的英雄，从而打造出你心目中的终极职业幻想。\n\n加入抽取模式的行列，让选择的力量指引你走向荣耀。"
T["Step into the untamed heart of the jungle as an Ironman Hero. Alone and isolated, with one life and no help except your own skill, take on the ferocious beasts that lurk in the shadows. Slay Bangalash and complete the Big Game Hunter quest before level 40 and escape Stranglethorn Vale alive before climbing to 60 to complete this challenge. Fail to slay the king before level 40, and you'll die.\n\n|Hascensiondb:quest:208|hYou must complete |cffffff00[Big Game hunter] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 40|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="以铁人英雄的身份踏入丛林那未驯服的核心。孤身一人、与世隔绝，只有一条命，除自身技巧外别无依靠，直面潜伏在阴影中的凶猛野兽。在 40 级前击杀邦加拉什并完成任务「大猎人」，并在升到 60 级前活着逃离荆棘谷，即可完成此挑战。若未能在 40 级前击杀这位王者，你就会死亡。\n\n|Hascensiondb:quest:208|h你必须在达到 40 级前完成 |cffffff00[大猎人]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
T["Steps to Reproduce"]="复现步骤"
T["Stereo"]="立体声"
T["Stitch cloth into bandages and antidotes to heal injuries and remove poisons. Bandages are supplemental to (but not replacing) magical means of healing. Heroes with limited healing capabilities may find great benefit from being skilled in First Aid."]="用布匹缝制绷带与解毒剂，以治疗伤势并解除中毒。绷带是魔法治疗手段的补充（而非替代）。治疗能力有限的英雄若能精通急救，将会受益匪浅。"
T["Stone of Retreat Locations"]="退避之石位置"
T["Stones of Retreat"]="退避之石"
T["Stones of Retreat are convenient teleportation items that allow you to instantly travel to major cities and quest hubs throughout the open world. \r\n\r\nOnce acquired, a stone of retreat is added to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r, and after learning it, you can use it at any time either from your Spellbook or by shift-clicking the destination directly on your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r. These stones make traveling much faster and are especially useful for skipping long flight paths or returning to key locations quickly. \r\n\r\nStones of Retreat can be obtained from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, alternatively they can be purchased from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="退避之石是便利的传送物品，能让你瞬间前往开放世界中的主要城市与任务枢纽。 \r\n\r\n获得之后，退避之石会被加入你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r；学会它以后，你可以随时从法术书中使用它，或直接在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上按住 Shift 点击目的地来使用。这些石头能让旅行快上许多，尤其适合跳过漫长的飞行路线或快速返回关键地点。 \r\n\r\n退避之石可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或向 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r 用游戏内 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 获取；此外，也可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商城|h|r 用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["Stony Tark is an NPC who gives players access to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h|r menu (Hotkey J), a feature that allows you to take on optional leveling challenges with unique rules and rewards. \r\n\r\nYou can find Stony Tark in any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r or starter zone. To begin a trial, your character must be level 1 as either a freshly created character or one that has just been Prestiged. \r\n\r\nInteracting with Stony Tark opens the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h|r menu, where you can choose from a variety of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h|r that may limit gear, abilities, or add permadeath mechanics. While you can view the rules of your trial at any time through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h|r menu, starting or ending a new one always requires speaking with Stony Tark in person."]="斯托尼·塔克是一名 NPC，让玩家可以访问 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r 菜单（快捷键 J），该功能允许你接受带有独特规则与奖励的可选升级挑战。 \r\n\r\n你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 或起始区域找到斯托尼·塔克。要开始一项试炼，你的角色必须是 1 级，无论是新创建的角色还是刚刚完成威望重置的角色。 \r\n\r\n与斯托尼·塔克互动会打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r 菜单，你可以在其中从多种 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r 中进行选择，它们可能会限制装备、技能，或加入永久死亡机制。虽然你可以随时通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r 菜单查看自己的试炼规则，但开始或结束一项新试炼始终需要亲自与斯托尼·塔克交谈。"
