T["Stormwind (SW) is the last remaining human kingdom in the world of Azeroth and serves as the majestic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r of the Alliance faction. Located in the peaceful region of Elwynn Forest, Stormwind is a bustling hub where players of the Alliance can find important NPCs, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, Class Trainers, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h|r.\r\n\r\nAs the heart of human civilization, Stormwind is known for its towering stone walls, grand architecture, and iconic structures such as the Cathedral of Light and the Stormwind Keep, home to King Varian Wrynn. \r\n\r\nThe city is divided into several districts, each with its own purpose like the Trade District hosting |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, the Mage Quarter for magical training, and the Dwarven District where you can find access to the Deeprun Tram.\r\n\r\nIt is a safe haven from monsters and enemy players, making it an ideal place to rest, craft, trade, and prepare for adventures throughout Azeroth."]="暴风城（SW）是艾泽拉斯世界中仅存的人类王国，也是联盟阵营庄严的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。它坐落于宁静的艾尔文森林，是一座繁华的枢纽，联盟玩家可以在这里找到重要的 NPC、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、职业训练师以及 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r。\r\n\r\n作为人类文明的中心，暴风城以其高耸的石墙、宏伟的建筑以及光明大教堂、暴风要塞等标志性建筑而闻名，后者是瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王的居所。 \r\n\r\n这座城市分为多个区域，各有其用途，例如设有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r 与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 的贸易区、用于魔法训练的法师区，以及可以通往矿道地铁的矮人区。\r\n\r\n这里是远离怪物与敌对玩家的安全避风港，因此成为休息、制造、交易，以及为遍及艾泽拉斯的冒险做准备的理想之地。"
