T["Sub-Zones are smaller, named areas within a larger zone. The first time you enter a Sub-Zone, you’ll earn a small amount of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r and unveil its unique location on your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r, helping you track where you’ve been.\r\n\r\nYou can hover your mouse over any revealed area on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r to see the name of the Sub-Zone. These areas are often tied to quests, gathering materials, and exploration achievements, making them valuable to discover during your journey.\r\n"]="子区域是较大区域内部更小、有名称的区域。首次进入某个子区域时，你将获得少量 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r，并在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上揭示其独特位置，帮助你记录自己去过哪里。\r\n\r\n你可以将鼠标悬停在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上任何已揭示的区域，查看该子区域的名称。这些区域往往与任务、材料采集和探索成就相关，因此在你旅途中很值得去发现。\r\n"
