T["Summons a Searing Totem with 5 health at your feet for 45 sec that repeatedly attacks an enemy within 20 yards for 24 to 32 Fire damage.\r\n\r\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted."]="在你的脚下召唤一个具有5点生命值的灼热图腾，持续45秒，不断攻击20码内的敌人，造成24至32点火焰伤害。\r\n\r\n该技能可在变形状态下使用。"
