T["Summons a Stoneskin Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster. The totem protects party and raid members within 50 yards, increasing armor by 750.  Lasts 5 min.\r\rThis ability is usable while shapeshifted."]="在施法者脚下召唤一个具有5点生命值的石肤图腾。该图腾保护50码内的小队和团队成员，使其护甲值提高750点。持续5分钟。\r\r该技能可在变形状态下使用。"
T["Summons a Stoneskin Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster. The totem protects party and raid members within 50 yards, increasing armor by 860.  Lasts 5 min.\r\rThis ability is usable while shapeshifted."]="在施法者脚下召唤一个具有5点生命值的石肤图腾。该图腾保护50码内的小队和团队成员，使其护甲值提高860点。持续5分钟。\r\r该技能可在变形状态下使用。"
T["Summons a Totem of Wrath with 5 health at the feet of the caster. \r\n\r\nThe totem increases Intellect by 22 and spell power by 23 for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of all spells and attacks made against all nearby targets by 3%. Lasts 5 min.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="在施法者脚下召唤一个具有5点生命值的愤怒图腾。\r\n\r\n该图腾使所有小队和团队成员智力提高22点、法术强度提高23点，并使附近所有目标受到的所有法术和攻击的爆击几率提高3%。持续5分钟。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Summons a demon from the nether."]="从虚空中召唤一个恶魔。"
T["Summons a swarm of toads."]="召唤一群蟾蜍。"
T["Summons a totem with 5 health for 15 sec that stores 30% of your Nature healing. When it expires or is recalled, it heals injured allies within 40 yards, divided evenly. Recasting the spell recalls the totem and releases the healing."]="召唤一个具有5点生命值的图腾，持续15秒，储存你30%的自然系治疗量。当它失效或被召回时，会治疗40码内受伤的盟友，治疗量平均分配。再次施放该法术可召回图腾并释放治疗量。"
T["Summons an Air Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster for 6 sec, granting party members within 10 yards Windwalk. Their movement speed is increased by 20% and cannot go below 100% speed while affected.\r\n\r\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted."]="在施法者脚下召唤一个具有5点生命值的空气图腾，持续6秒，使10码内的小队成员获得风行。其移动速度提高20%，且在受影响期间速度不会低于100%。\r\n\r\n该技能可在变形状态下使用。"
