T["Surrounds the caster with a freezing aura beneath his feet, allowing him and his party or raid to walk on water for 10 min. Works while mounted. Any damage will cancel the effect.\n\n"]="在施法者脚下生成一道冰霜光环，使他及其小队或团队成员可以在水面上行走，持续10分钟。骑乘状态下依然有效。任何伤害都会取消该效果。\n\n"
T["Surrounds you in an Anti-Magic Shell, absorbing 75% of the damage dealt by harmful spells (up to a maximum of 50% of your health) and preventing application of harmful magical effects.  \r\n\r\n20% of the absorbed damage by Anti-Magic Shell is granted as additional rage. Lasts 5 sec."]="以反魔法护罩笼罩你，吸收有害法术造成的75%伤害（最多不超过你生命值上限的50%），并阻止有害魔法效果的施加。\r\n\r\n反魔法护罩吸收伤害的20%会转化为额外的怒气。持续5秒。"
T["Surrounds you with fel energy, increasing spell damage by 40 plus 30% of your Spirit. \r\nRestores 2% of your max health every 5 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="以邪能能量笼罩你，使法术伤害提高40点，再加上你精神的30%。\r\n每5秒恢复你2%的生命值上限。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Surrounds you with fel energy, increasing spell damage by 70 plus 30% of your Spirit. \r\nRestores 2% of your max health every 5 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="以邪能能量笼罩你，使法术伤害提高70点，再加上你精神的30%。\r\n每5秒恢复你2%的生命值上限。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
