T["Tailoring"]="裁缝"
T["Tailoring is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r and a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h|r focused on transforming cloth materials found throughout the world into a wide range of items such as equipment, item enhancements, large |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r to expand your inventory, and even |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn tailoring. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the required materials. Tailoring relies primarily on cloth dropped from humanoid enemies across the open world and turning them into larger bolts of material.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you'll unlock |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r, known as patterns, that teach you how to craft specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r pieces, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r, and spell-enhancing items. In addition to wearable gear, tailors can also craft spellthreads that can be applied to equipment to boost stats and are particularly useful for caster builds.\r\n\r\nWhile tailors do not require a special tool to sew their patterns, many players combine it with other professions like Enchanting to streamline their material supply. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="裁缝是一门|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业|h|r，也是一门|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于将世界各地发现的布料转化为各种物品，例如装备、物品强化、用于扩充背包空间的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r，甚至|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习裁缝。学会之后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需材料。裁缝主要依赖开放世界中类人敌人掉落的布料，并将它们加工成更大的布卷。\r\n\r\n随着等级提升，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，即所谓的图样，它们会教你制作特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r和强化法术的物品。除了可穿戴的装备外，裁缝还能制作可施加在装备上以提升属性的法术丝线，对施法者构筑尤其有用。\r\n\r\n虽然裁缝缝制图样不需要特殊工具，但许多玩家会将其与附魔等其他专业搭配，以简化材料来源。对于同时管理多个专业的玩家来说，投资一个虚灵工具分发器会很有帮助，因为该物品能将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
