T["Tamed Pet"]="驯服的宠物"
T["Tamed Pets"]="驯服的宠物"
T["Tamed pets are creatures that assist you in battle, each offering unique abilities based on their type. Some pets even come with Pet Talents, allowing you to customize their skills and playstyle to fit your combat needs. You can view the stats and details of your tamed pet in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h|r (Hotkey Shift + P).\r\n\r\nYou can only have one tamed pet active at a time, but there are many types to choose from, including beasts, demons, undead, dragonkin, and elementals. Summoning a pet depends on its classification and requires specific spells: Tame Beast, Tame Dragonkin, Tether Elemental, Summon Demon, Enslave Demon, and Dominate Undead. \r\n\r\nThere are two ways to acquire combat pets: by finding and taming them directly in the open world, or by using a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r item known as a pet whistle. Each whistle is tied to a specific pet and can be found in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r (Hotkey N -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r Tab -> Pets). These whistles can drop from their corresponding creatures in the world, be purchased from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, or obtained from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r using |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nPets tamed in the open world must be managed through a stablemaster if you wish to swap between them. However, pets acquired via whistles are far more convenient, allowing you to switch your active pet anytime and anywhere without needing to visit a stable."]="驯服的宠物是在战斗中协助你的生物，每种类型都有独特的技能。有些宠物甚至拥有宠物天赋，让你可以自定义它们的技能和玩法，以适应你的战斗需求。你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r（快捷键 Shift + P）中查看驯服宠物的属性和详细信息。\r\n\r\n你同时只能拥有一只激活的驯服宠物，但可供选择的类型很多，包括野兽、恶魔、亡灵、龙类和元素生物。召唤宠物取决于其分类，需要特定的法术：驯服野兽、驯服龙类、束缚元素、召唤恶魔、奴役恶魔和支配亡灵。\r\n\r\n获得战斗宠物有两种方式：直接在开放世界中找到并驯服它们，或使用一种名为宠物哨的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h绑定服务器|h|r物品。每个哨子都与特定的宠物绑定，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r中找到（快捷键 N -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r标签页 -> 宠物）。这些哨子可能从世界上对应的生物身上掉落，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r购买，也可以从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）获得。\r\n\r\n如果你想在开放世界中驯服的宠物之间切换，必须通过驯兽师进行管理。不过，通过哨子获得的宠物要方便得多，它们让你随时随地在无需前往兽栏的情况下切换激活的宠物。"
