T["The Admiral Revealed: Mal'Ganis's Portal"]="揭示的海军上将：玛尔加尼斯的传送门"
T["The Alliance requires your strength human! Core Materials and Demon Materials can be claimed by Heroes willing to venture into High-Risk to obtain them.\r\n\r\nWhile in High-Risk, you can obtain these materials and choose the risk you are willing to take with Tiered Zones.\r\n\r\nTier 1 Zones: Un'goro Crater, Burning Steppes and Azshara. You will only drop items from your bags.\r\n\r\nTier 2 Zones: Western and Eastern Plaguelands. You will drop items from your bag, equipped items or Felcom gold if your items are insured.\r\n\r\nTier 3 Zones: Silithus and Winterspring. You will drop items from your bag and equipped items. Felcom costs 3 times more."]="联盟需要你的力量，人类！核心材料与恶魔材料可由那些愿意冒险进入高风险区域获取它们的英雄所取得。\r\n\r\n身处高风险状态时，你可以获取这些材料，并通过分级区域来选择你愿意承担的风险。\r\n\r\n1级区域：安戈洛环形山、燃烧平原和艾萨拉。你只会掉落背包中的物品。\r\n\r\n2级区域：东、西瘟疫之地。如果你的物品已投保，你将掉落背包中的物品、已装备的物品或邪能金币。\r\n\r\n3级区域：希利苏斯和冬泉谷。你将掉落背包中的物品和已装备的物品。邪能金币的消耗为3倍。"
T["The Ascension Store offers a wide variety of cosmetics, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r, and other convenience items designed to enhance your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r. All items in the store are purchased using |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nMost store items are tradable, meaning they can be listed on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or exchanged through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, making many store-exclusive items accessible even to non-donating players.\r\n\r\nYou can access the store through the Ascension launcher or by visiting ascension.gg/store.\r\n\r\nEach realm has its own separate store, so availability and purchase history are unique per realm. Be sure to check which realm you're shopping on before finalizing your purchase!"]="飞升商店提供各式各样的外观、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r以及其他旨在提升你|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h游戏体验|h|r的便利物品。商店中的所有物品均使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n大多数商店物品都可交易，也就是说它们可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r上架，或通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r兑换成游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，这让许多商店专属物品即使是对于不捐赠的玩家也能获得。\r\n\r\n你可以通过飞升启动器或访问 ascension.gg/store 进入商店。\r\n\r\n每个服务器都有各自独立的商店，因此库存情况和购买记录都是各服务器专属的。完成购买前请务必确认你正在哪个服务器上购物！"
T["The Ascension Wiki page is a community page closely maintained by both players and the Ascension Staff (|cffffd200www.ascension.gg/wiki|r). It contains info about many aspects of the game, from Build Guides to explaining custom mechanics, and is an essential resource for Ascension!"]="飞升 Wiki 是一个由玩家和飞升团队（|cffffd200www.ascension.gg/wiki|r）共同维护的社区页面。它包含游戏诸多方面的信息，从构筑指南到自定义机制的说明，是飞升不可或缺的资源。"
T["The Auction House is the primary in-game marketplace, allowing players to buy and sell items using gold. From gear and crafting materials to vanity equipment and even |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h|r, the Auction House serves as the central hub for all player-to-player transactions.\r\n\r\nYou can list your own items for sale or browse listings posted by others, making it a powerful tool for both making gold and acquiring rare or useful items. The market is dynamic and prices can fluctuate, so savvy trading can be very rewarding.\r\n\r\nAuction Houses are located in every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. Use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r to locate an Auctioneer on your minimap, or ask a guard for directions."]="拍卖行是游戏中的主要市场，让玩家可以用金币买卖物品。从装备和制造材料到外观装备，甚至|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r，拍卖行都是所有玩家间交易的核心枢纽。\r\n\r\n你可以将自己的物品上架出售，也可以浏览其他玩家的挂单，这使它成为既能赚取金币又能获得稀有或实用物品的强大工具。市场是动态的，价格会有所波动，因此精明的交易能带来丰厚回报。\r\n\r\n每座|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r中都有拍卖行。使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r在小地图上定位拍卖师，或向卫兵询问方向。"
T["The Bank is personal storage that allows you to safely retain extra items, materials, and gear that without cluttering your inventory. Each character has their own unique Bank, meaning items stored here are not shared across your account or other characters.\r\n\r\nBy default, your Bank offers a limited number of storage slots, but you can expand its capacity by placing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r into the additional Bank Bag slots. If you still need more room, consider purchasing a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:35|hPersonal Bank|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:36|hRealm-Wide Bank|h|r from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nYou can access your bank in any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. Use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r and search for bankers to highlight their location on your mini-map or ask a guard for directions!\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you could summon a Treasure Keeper Companion who allows remote access to your bank without the need to return to a city."]="银行是个人储物空间，让你安全地保存额外的物品、材料和装备，而不会塞满背包。每个角色都有各自独立的银行，这意味着存放在这里的物品不会与账号内其他角色共享。\r\n\r\n默认情况下，你的银行只有数量有限的储物栏位，但你可以将|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r放入额外的银行背包栏位来扩充容量。如果仍需要更多空间，可以考虑在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:35|h个人银行|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:36|h全服务器银行|h|r，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n你可以在任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r使用银行。使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r搜索银行家即可在小地图上高亮其位置，或向卫兵询问方向！\r\n\r\n此外，你还可以召唤一个宝藏守护者，这个伙伴让你无需返回城市就能远程使用银行。"
T["The Banquet Hall"]="宴会大厅"
T["The Beginner’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r is a NPC that functions as a universal Class Trainer. Found in starter zones and early-level questing hubs, this book allows any character, regardless of class, to learn all available class abilities up to level 20.\r\n\r\nWith the Beginner’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r, you won’t need to hunt down a specific Class Trainer in the early game, making it a great tool for getting started quickly. \r\n\r\nYou can easily locate the Beginner’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r on your mini-map. Just search for “Class Trainer”, and any nearby Books will be marked for you.\r\n\r\nAfter reaching level 20, you’ll need to visit your class-specific trainer or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r to continue learning new spells and higher ranks."]="初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r是一个NPC，充当通用的职业训练师。它出现在新手区域和低等级任务枢纽，这本书让任何角色，无论职业，都能学习20级前所有可用的职业技能。\r\n\r\n有了初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r，你在游戏初期就不必四处寻找特定的职业训练师，这使它成为快速起步的绝佳工具。\r\n\r\n你可以在小地图上使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r轻松找到初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r。只需搜索「职业训练师」，附近所有的书籍都会被标记出来。\r\n\r\n达到20级后，你需要拜访你职业对应的训练师，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r来继续学习新法术和更高级别。"
T["The Beginner’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r is a NPC that acts as a universal |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r. Found in starter zones and early-level questing hubs, this book allows you to learn any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r up to a skill level of 75, making it an excellent way to get started without needing to hunt down specific trainers.\r\n\r\nThis early-game convenience helps you jump into crafting, gathering, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r leveling without delay, no matter which |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r you’re aiming for, be it |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|hMining|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h|r, or others.\r\n\r\nYou can easily locate the Beginner’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r on your mini-map. Just search for “|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Trainers”, and any nearby books will be marked for you.\r\n\r\nOnce you’ve passed skill level 75, you’ll need to visit a full |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r in a larger hub, or use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r Companion, to continue learning |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r and advancing your skill further."]="初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r是一个NPC，充当通用的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r。它出现在新手区域和低等级任务枢纽，这本书让你可以把任意|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r学到75点技能等级，这使它成为无需四处寻找特定训练师就能起步的绝佳方式。\r\n\r\n这项游戏初期的便利能帮助你立即投入制造、采集和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r升级，无论你向往哪种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r，无论是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r还是其他。\r\n\r\n你可以在小地图上使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r轻松找到初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r。只需搜索「|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r训练师」，附近所有的书籍都会被标记出来。\r\n\r\n一旦你的技能等级超过75，你就需要前往更大的枢纽拜访完整的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r伙伴，来继续学习|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r并进一步提升技能。"
T["The Black Morass Complete"]="黑色沼泽已完成"
T["The Blood Furnace"]="鲜血熔炉"
T["The Book of Artisans is a convenient, summonable companion pet that functions as a portable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r. When summoned, it allows your character to learn any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r or trainer-taught Recipe, just as if you were speaking to a trainer in a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r or quest hub.\r\n\r\nThis tool is especially valuable for players leveling professions across multiple characters or frequently changing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r setups. With the Book of Artisans, there’s no need to travel across the world to visit individual trainers.\r\n\r\nYou can buy a Book of Artisans from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r. Alternatively, you can purchase one from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nThe Book of Artisans is one of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r saved in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r, making it available to all your characters on the same realm once unlocked."]="工匠之书是一只会被召唤出来的便利伙伴宠物，充当便携的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r。被召唤后，它能让你的角色学习任何训练师传授的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r或配方，就像你在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r或任务枢纽与训练师交谈一样。\r\n\r\n对于在多个角色上练专业、或经常更换|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r配置的玩家来说，这个工具尤其宝贵。有了工匠之书，就无需跑遍世界各地去拜访每一位训练师。\r\n\r\n你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买工匠之书。也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买一本。\r\n\r\n工匠之书是保存在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r之一，因此一旦解锁，同服务器的所有角色都可以使用。"
T["The Book of Ascension is a powerful, summonable companion pet that acts as an all-in-one Class Trainer. When summoned, it allows your character to learn all available class abilities, including new spells as you level and higher ranks of existing spells no matter where you are in the world.\r\n\r\nThis makes it an incredibly useful quality-of-life tool, especially for players on the go or those playing in zones far from major cities. You can even use another player’s Book of Ascension if they’ve summoned theirs nearby, making it an asset in group settings as well. However, if you have the book as on of your own |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, it will automatically train your new spells and ranks as you level up!\r\n\r\nYou can buy a Book of Ascension from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r for in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r. Alternatively, you can purchase one from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP).\r\n\r\nThe Book of Ascension is a companion saved in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r, so it’s available to all your characters on the same realm once unlocked."]="飞升之书是一本强大的可召唤伙伴，充当多合一的职业训练师。被召唤后，它能让你的角色学习所有可用的职业技能，包括随着等级提升而出现的新法术以及已有法术的更高级别，无论你身处世界的哪个角落。\r\n\r\n这使它成为极其实用的生活品质工具，对于在外游历或在远离大城市的区域游玩的玩家尤其如此。如果其他玩家在附近召唤了他的飞升之书，你甚至也能使用，这让它在组队时同样是有价值的资源。不过，如果你把这本书作为自己的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r之一，它会在你升级时自动训练你的新法术和更高级别！\r\n\r\n你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买飞升之书。或者，你也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买一本。\r\n\r\n飞升之书是保存在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中的伙伴，因此一旦解锁，同服务器的所有角色都可以使用。"
T["The Botanica"]="植物园"
T["The Burning Crusade"]="燃烧的远征"
T["The Call Board is a useful quest hub found near the entrances of every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, designed to help players stay on track throughout their journey.\r\n\r\nWhile leveling, the Call Board directs you to the next appropriate questing area, ensuring smooth zone progression and helping you avoid out-leveling content. It’s especially handy for new players or those unsure of where to go next.\r\n\r\nAt the maximum level, the Call Board offers daily and weekly quests that provide a variety of rewards, including Marks of Ascension, valuable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, rare or epic equipment, and more. These quests often encourage players to revisit dungeons, complete world events, or engage in other content that contributes to their overall progression.\r\n\r\nFor added convenience, you can acquire a portable call board, which lets you access these quests from anywhere in the world. You can buy a call board for your faction or a neutral one that can be used by all characters from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="告示板是一个实用的任务枢纽，位于每座|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r的入口附近，旨在帮助玩家在整个冒险旅程中始终有明确的方向。\r\n\r\n在升级过程中，告示板会指引你前往下一个合适的任务区域，确保区域之间平滑过渡，并帮助你避免等级超出内容。它对新玩家或不确定下一步该去哪里的玩家尤其有用。\r\n\r\n在满级时，告示板会提供每日和每周任务，给予各种奖励，包括飞升印记、珍贵的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r、精良或史诗装备等等。这些任务通常会鼓励玩家重访地下城、完成世界事件，或参与其他有助于整体成长的内容。\r\n\r\n为求方便，你还可以获得一块便携告示板，让你在世界任何地方都能使用这些任务。你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买属于你阵营的告示板，或一块所有角色都能使用的中立告示板。"
T["The Cauldron"]="大熔炉"
T["The Cauldron 2nd floor"]="大熔炉二层"
T["The Cauldron 3rd floor"]="大熔炉三层"
T["The Celestial Watch"]="苍穹守望者"
T["The Cooling Pools"]="冷却之池"
T["The Courtyard"]="庭院"
T["The Deadmines"]="死亡矿井"
T["The Defias are a joke compared to us."]="与我们相比，迪菲亚不过是个笑话。"
T["The Deposit is paid upfront. If your item sells, you get the deposit back! If your item does not sell, you lose the deposit. Make sure to price your item to sell so you don't lose your deposit!"]="保证金需预先支付。如果你的物品售出，你会拿回保证金！如果你的物品没有售出，你将失去保证金。请务必定价合理以便售出，不要白白损失保证金！"
T["The Dormitory"]="宿舍"
T["The Dungeon(s) you are having issues with..."]="你遇到问题的一个或多个地下城……"
T["The Ethereal Bazaar is a special, ever-changing shop accessible through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r inside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r of any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r. Unlike regular |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, the bazaar offers a selection of rare and exclusive cosmetic items that you won’t find anywhere else.\r\n\r\nTo purchase from the Ethereal Bazaar, you’ll need |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r, an item purchased from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP). \r\n\r\nKeep in mind that the bazaar’s inventory rotates on a random timer, and only one copy of each item is available per cycle. This means you’ll often compete with other players to snag these limited items before they disappear."]="虚灵集市是一家特殊且不断变化的商店，可通过任意|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r内的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r进入。与普通的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r不同，集市提供一批别处找不到的稀有专属外观物品。\r\n\r\n要在虚灵集市购买物品，你需要|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r，该物品可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n请注意，集市的库存按随机计时器轮换，每个周期每种物品仅有一份可供出售。这意味着你常常需要与其他玩家竞争，才能在限量的物品消失前抢到手。"
T["The Exorcism Lightning Bunny Visual"]="驱邪术闪电兔视觉效果"
T["The Exorcism, Flying Skull Despawn"]="驱邪术，飞行骷髅消失"
T["The Exorcism, Flying Skull attack"]="驱邪术，飞行骷髅攻击"
T["The Eye"]="魔眼"
T["The Floor is Lava!"]="地板是岩浆！"
T["The Fool and the Foul"]="愚者与恶徒"
T["The Forgotten Pool"]="被遗忘的水池"
T["The Frozen Halls"]="冰封大厅"
T["The Gauntlet"]="夹击通道"
T["The Grand Approach"]="宏伟入口"
T["The Guest Chambers"]="宾客厅堂"
T["The Hall of Gears"]="齿轮大厅"
T["The Hermit"]="隐士"
T["The Hero Architect (Hotkey N -> Hero Architect Tab) is a library of featured builds and community created builds that contain full loadouts of spells, Talents, recommended playstyles, macros, equipment suggestions, and various buff recommendations. \r\n\r\nYou can use it to discover new archetypes or share your setup with other players. Community builds can be created by anyone, but you can guarantee a powerful build with the 'Featured Builds' category, designed to teach you how to play effectively."]="英雄建筑师（快捷键 N -> 英雄建筑师标签页）是一个精选构筑和社区构筑的库，其中包含完整的法术配装、天赋、推荐玩法、宏、装备建议以及各种增益推荐。\r\n\r\n你可以用它来发现新的流派，或与其他玩家分享你的配置。任何人都可以创建社区构筑，但你可以通过 \"精选构筑\" 分类获得有保障的强力构筑，该分类旨在教你如何高效地进行游戏。"
T["The Hero Architect has many builds created by other Heroes! Builds you have recently viewed will appear here where you're be able to import them for your Desired Spells and Unlearn Spells."]="英雄建筑师中有许多由其他英雄创建的配置！你最近查看过的构筑会显示在这里，你可以将它们导入到你的期望法术和遗忘法术中。"
T["The High Risk Tier you are currently in does not allow Fel Commutation protection"]="你当前所处的高风险等级不允许邪能转换保护"
T["The Hit Cap refers to the minimum amount of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r a player needs to never miss an attack on an enemy. Reaching the hit cap ensures your offensive abilities connect reliably, especially in high level content like Dungeons and Raids.\r\n\r\nThe hit cap is divided into two categories, players and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r bosses.\r\n\r\nTo never miss a player with a physical attack or spell, you need 4% |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r.\r\nTo never miss a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r boss with a physical attack, you need 8% |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r.\r\nTo never miss a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r boss with a spell, you need 17% |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r. \r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r bosses have higher resistance and avoidance, meaning players typically need a higher Hit Cap to perform consistently in endgame content.\r\n\r\nIf you're at or above the hit cap, any extra |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r provides no additional benefit and could be better spent on other stats like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:81|hCritical Strike|h|r or Haste.\r\n\r\nYou can find your hit cap by mousing over “|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h|r” in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="命中上限指的是玩家为了永不落空攻击敌人所需的最低|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。达到命中上限可确保你的攻击技能稳定命中，尤其是在地下城和团队副本等高等级内容中。\r\n\r\n命中上限分为两类：针对玩家和针对|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领。\r\n\r\n要用物理攻击或法术永不落空地命中玩家，你需要4%的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。\r\n要用物理攻击永不落空地命中|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领，你需要8%的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。\r\n要用法术永不落空地命中|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领，你需要17%的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领拥有更高的抗性和闪避，这意味着玩家通常需要更高的命中上限才能在终局内容中稳定发挥。\r\n\r\n如果你已达到或超过命中上限，任何额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r都不会带来额外收益，不如投入到|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:81|h爆击|h|r或急速等其他属性上。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中将鼠标悬停在 \"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r\" 上查看你的命中上限。"
T["The Hive Undergrounds"]="虫巢地下层"
T["The Kingways is treacherous. Proceed with caution."]="国王大道危机四伏。请谨慎前行。"
T["The Legend of Stalvan"]="斯塔文的传说"
T["The Manastorm"]="法力风暴"
T["The Manastorm is a dynamic, randomized, and endlessly scaling |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r challenge, designed to test your skills, creativity, and survivability. It can be tackled solo or with a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r group of up to 15 players, offering flexible difficulty and a wide range of rewards.\r\n\r\nEach run of the Manastorm is procedurally generated, featuring unique bosses, custom encounters, randomized layouts, and increasingly difficult enemies the deeper you progress. As you ascend, you’ll encounter environmental hazards, elite foes, and powerful modifiers that keep every floor engaging and unpredictable.\r\n\r\nSuccessful progression through the Manastorm earns you a variety of valuable rewards, including |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:148|hManastorm Caches|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|hBedlam Bullions|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h|r, gold, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, and more.\r\n\r\nIf your group is defeated, you'll be ejected from the Manastorm and must start a new ascent. However, progress saves every 5 floors, so you can resume climbing later without starting over entirely.\r\n\r\nUpon exiting (whether voluntarily or by defeat) you’ll be automatically teleported back to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, where you’ll appear right next to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h|r. From there, you can immediately spend your earned |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r on rewards and prepare for your next dive into the arcane storm."]="法力风暴是一项动态、随机且无限递增的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r挑战，旨在考验你的技巧、创造力和生存能力。你可以单人挑战，也可以与最多15名玩家组成的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r队伍一同前往，享受灵活的难度和丰富多样的奖励。\r\n\r\n每一局法力风暴都是程序化生成的，拥有独特的首领、定制的遭遇战、随机的布局，以及随着你不断深入而愈发强大的敌人。随着你向上攀登，你会遇到环境危险、精英敌人和强力的词缀，让每一层都充满趣味与变数。\r\n\r\n成功通关法力风暴会给予你各式各样的珍贵奖励，包括|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:148|h法力风暴宝箱|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|h贝德兰锭|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|h邦佐螺栓|h|r、金币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r等等。\r\n\r\n如果你的队伍被击败，你将被逐出法力风暴，必须重新开始攀登。不过，进度每5层会保存一次，因此你之后可以接着继续，而不必从零开始。\r\n\r\n离开时（无论是主动离开还是因失败离开），你都会被自动传送回你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，并出现在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|h米尔豪斯·法力风暴|h|r身旁。在那里，你可以立即把获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r花在奖励上，并为下一次深入奥术风暴做好准备。"
T["The Manastorm is an Endless Wildcard Dungeon. Enter solo, or with any group composition of up to 15 players! Teleport to a random location, then locate and defeat a boss. If successful, a portal will open sending you deeper into The Manastorm.\n\nHigher levels increase monster difficulty, and increase rewards all the way up to end-game raid gear!\n\nMonsters and items are scaled to your level."]="法力风暴是一个无限 Wildcard 地下城。你可以独自进入，或与最多15名玩家的任何队伍配置一同进入！传送至随机地点，然后找到并击败一名首领。如果成功，一道传送门会打开，将你送往法力风暴更深处。\n\n更高的层数会提升怪物的难度，并提高奖励，直至可以获得满级团队副本装备！\n\n怪物和物品会根据你的等级进行缩放。"
T["The Manastorm is not available at this time"]="法力风暴目前不可用"
T["The Map Lens is the magnifying glass icon located on your mini-map, acting as a search and filtering tool for navigating the world around you. When clicked, the map lens opens a menu that allows you to highlight specific types of NPCs and key locations in your immediate area such as repair NPCs, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r, trainers, innkeepers, bankers, and more.\r\n\r\nIn addition to tracking NPCs, the Map Lens is also where you can enable tracking for a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r. This functionality is essential for efficiently farming resources in the world and leveling up your gathering skills.\r\n\r\nOnce you select what you are searching for, the NPCs or gathering nodes will appear as golden dots on your mini-map, making it much easier to locate important services and items, especially in busy Capital Cities or new zones."]="地图透镜是你小地图上的放大镜图标，充当在世界中导航的搜索与筛选工具。点击后，地图透镜会打开一个菜单，让你高亮当前区域中特定类型的NPC和关键地点，例如修理NPC、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、训练师、旅店老板、银行家等等。\r\n\r\n除了追踪NPC之外，地图透镜也是你启用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r追踪的地方。该功能对于在世界中高效采集资源、提升采集技能等级至关重要。\r\n\r\n选定你要搜索的内容后，NPC或采集节点会以小地图上的金点显示，让定位重要服务和物品变得容易得多，在繁华的主城或新区域尤其如此。"
T["The Mechanar"]="能源舰"
T["The Menagerie"]="兽栏"
T["The Mentor System"]="导师系统"
T["The Mentor System is an Ascension Feature that will allow new Heroes to quickly find veterans who are willing to teach them about the game. If you find a Hero with a Green Flag above their characters head you can be sure that character is willing to answer questions, provide help and generally aid you."]="导师系统是飞升的一项功能，让新英雄能够快速找到愿意教他们玩游戏的资深玩家。如果你看到某位英雄头顶有绿色旗帜，就可以确定该角色愿意回答问题、伸出援手并提供各种帮助。"
T["The Molten Core"]="熔火之心"
T["The Night Watch"]="守夜人"
T["The Nightmare has you! Every 30 seconds, one of your skills will be Marked for Death. You have one life, and if you use this ability it will instantly kill you, and you're already taking increased damage. Good luck."]="噩梦已经缠上你！每30秒，你的一个技能会被标记为死亡。你只有一条命，一旦使用该技能就会立即死亡；此外，你已经在承受更高的伤害了。祝你好运。"
T["The Options Menu is your central hub for customizing your gameplay |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r. You can open it by pressing the Escape (Esc) key or by clicking the red (?) icon located in the micro menu at the bottom of your screen. From here, you can adjust a wide range of settings to fine-tune how the game looks, sounds, and feels.\r\n\r\nWithin the Options Menu, you’ll find tabs for keybindings, graphics, sound, and interface settings. You can remap your keys for more comfortable controls, optimize your graphics settings for better performance or visual quality, and adjust sound effects or music volume to your liking. It also includes features for UI customization, such as toggling floating combat text, adjusting display options, and enabling auto-loot.\r\n\r\nUnder the Interface tab, you’ll find character-specific settings like the option to hide your helmet or cloak, adjust camera behavior, or modify action bar layouts. These options help you tailor the game's interface and visuals to match your preferences and playstyle.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the options menu provides tools for reporting bugs or contacting the Ascension team if you encounter technical issues or need support. It's an essential tool not only for improving your gameplay but also for communicating with the developers when needed."]="选项菜单是你自定义游戏|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r的核心枢纽。按下 Escape（Esc）键，或点击屏幕底部微型菜单中的红色（?）图标即可打开。在这里，你可以调整大量设置，精细地调节游戏的画面、音效和手感。\r\n\r\n在选项菜单中，你会看到按键绑定、图形、声音和界面设置等标签页。你可以重新分配按键以获得更舒适的操作，优化图形设置以提升性能或画质，并按喜好调整音效或音乐音量。它还包含自定义界面的功能，例如开启浮动战斗文字、调整显示选项以及启用自动拾取。\r\n\r\n在界面标签页中，你会找到角色专属的设置，例如隐藏头盔或披风、调整镜头行为或修改动作条的布局。这些选项有助于你按照自己的偏好和玩法风格来调整界面和视觉效果。\r\n\r\n此外，选项菜单还提供工具，让你在遇到技术问题或需要帮助时报告错误或联系飞升团队。它不仅是提升游戏体验的必备工具，也是在必要时与开发者沟通的渠道。"
T["The Path to Ascension"]="飞升之路"
T["The People of Westfall salute Reagle, a brave and valiant defender of freedom."]="西部荒野的人民向里格尔致敬，他是一位勇敢而英武的自由捍卫者。"
T["The Perpetual Prowl"]="永续潜行"
T["The Personal |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r is a summonable container that provides extra storage exclusively for your current character. It allows convenient access to additional |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r without needing to visit a physical |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r. \r\n\r\nUnlike the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:36|hRealm-Wide Bank|h|r, the Personal |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r is character-specific and can only be accessed by the character who owns it. It can be summoned only in rested areas, such as in an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, or in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r instances.\r\n\r\nThis item is part of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r and can be obtained from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or purchased on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="个人|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是一个可召唤的容器，为你当前角色提供专属的额外存储空间。它让你无需前往实体|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r就能方便地使用额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r。\r\n\r\n与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:36|h全服务器银行|h|r不同，个人|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是角色专属的，只有拥有它的角色才能使用。它只能在休息区域召唤，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r实例中。\r\n\r\n该物品属于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r的一部分，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r获得，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["The Pets Tab (Hotkey Shift + P) is the interface where you can view the details of your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h|r, as well as your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r. \r\n\r\nFor players using a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h|r, the pets tab displays key information including the pet’s name, type, level, and stats.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the pet tab gives you full access to your mount and companion collections, allowing you to preview, summon, or dismiss your learned vanity or regular non-combat pets and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r from one convenient location."]="宠物标签页（快捷键 Shift + P）是你查看|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服的宠物|h|r详情，以及你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r的界面。\r\n\r\n对于使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服的宠物|h|r的玩家，宠物标签页会显示关键信息，包括宠物的名称、类型、等级和属性。\r\n\r\n此外，宠物标签页让你完全访问自己的坐骑和伙伴收藏，让你能在一个方便的地方预览、召唤或解散已学会的外观宠物或普通非战斗宠物，以及你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r。"
T["The Pit of Refuse"]="废料坑"
T["The Pit of Sacrifice"]="献祭之坑"
T["The Pool of Ask'Ar"]="阿斯卡尔之池"
T["The Power Station"]="发电站"
T["The Quest(s) you are having issues with..."]="你遇到问题的一个或多个任务……"
T["The Radiant Spring"]="光辉之泉"
T["The Raid(s) you are having issues with..."]="你遇到问题的一个或多个团队副本……"
T["The Realm-Wide |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r is a summonable storage system accessible by all your characters on the same server, enabling easy item transfer between alts without relying on the mailbox. It holds a wide variety of non-|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r items but cannot store or transfer |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r gear.\r\n\r\nUnlike the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:35|hPersonal Bank|h|r, the Realm-Wide |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r is realm-specific and can be accessed by any character on that particular server. It can be summoned only in rested areas, such as in an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r or a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, or in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r instances. \r\n\r\nThis item is part of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r and can be obtained from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or purchased on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="全服务器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是一个可召唤的存储系统，同服务器上的所有角色都可以访问，让你无需依赖邮箱就能轻松在小号之间转移物品。它可以存放各种非|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r物品，但无法存放或转移|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r装备。\r\n\r\n与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:35|h个人银行|h|r不同，全服务器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是服务器专属的，该服务器上的任何角色都可以访问。它只能在休息区域召唤，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r实例中。\r\n\r\n该物品属于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r的一部分，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r获得，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["The Reliquary"]="圣物库"
T["The Repository"]="档案馆"
T["The Ruby Sanctum"]="红玉圣殿"
T["The Shattered Halls"]="破碎大厅"
T["The Shrine of Eldretharr"]="埃尔德拉斯神殿"
T["The Skills tab (Hotkey K) provides a detailed overview of your character’s various proficiencies. \r\n\r\nThis includes your skill levels in weaponry tracks your available |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r Type, class-related abilities (like stealth or lockpicking), |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r levels (such as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|hBlacksmithing|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h|r), |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r level (like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|hFirst Aid|h|r), and even languages your character can understand or speak. \r\n\r\nAs you use weapons in combat or actively work on professions, your skill levels increase naturally, improving your effectiveness with those tools or trades. For example, leveling a weapon skill makes you more accurate and efficient in combat with that weapon type, while increasing a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r skill allows you to craft higher-level items."]="技能标签页（快捷键 K）提供你角色各项熟练度的详细概览。\r\n\r\n其中包括你的武器技能等级、可用的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r类型追踪、与职业相关的技能（如潜行或开锁）、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级（如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|h锻造|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r）、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r等级（如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|h急救|h|r），甚至你的角色能听懂或会说的语言。\r\n\r\n当你在战斗中使用武器或积极从事专业时，你的技能等级会自然提升，从而提高你使用这些工具或手艺的效率。例如，提升武器技能会让你在使用该类武器作战时更精准、更高效，而提升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r技能则能让你制作更高级的物品。"
T["The Slave Pens"]="奴隶围栏"
T["The Spring"]="泉水"
T["The Steamvault"]="蒸汽地窟"
T["The Temple Gates"]="神殿大门"
T["The Temple of Embers"]="余烬神殿"
T["The Titans gave you two legs, and you intend to use them. You are unable to mount for your entire adventure."]="泰坦给了你两条腿，而你不打算浪费它们。在整个冒险过程中你都无法骑乘。"
T["The Totem of Infliction"]="折磨图腾"
T["The URL or location of the issue you are having..."]="你遇到问题的网址或位置……"
T["The Underbog"]="幽暗沼泽"
T["The Unyielding (0/0)"]="不屈者（0/0）"
T["The Upper Study"]="上层书房"
T["The Vacant Den"]="空置的巢穴"
T["The Vanity Collection (Hotkey N -> Vanity Tab) is your menu for managing all of your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r items. This includes |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h|r appearances, toys, equipment cosmetics, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, and non-consumable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h|r. \r\n\r\nAll items in your Vanity Collection are shared across all characters on the same realm, allowing you to easily access your favorite items regardless of which character you're playing.\r\n\r\nYou can instantly deliver any item from your collection to any of your characters at any time. This makes it incredibly convenient to equip cosmetics or toys without needing to transfer items manually.\r\n\r\nIf you play on multiple live realms, you can use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:248|hVanity Collection Sync|h|r to copy your unlocked cosmetics across realms, ensuring your collection stays consistent no matter where you play.\r\n\r\nThe Vanity tab is also where the seasonal shop can be browsed, offering access to exclusive appearances, pets, and other themed rewards during the current realm’s season."]="外观收藏（快捷键 N -> 外观标签页）是你管理所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h绑定服务器|h|r物品的菜单。其中包括|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服的宠物|h|r外观、玩具、装备外观、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r以及非消耗性的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r。\r\n\r\n你外观收藏中的所有物品都与同服务器的所有角色共享，无论你正在玩哪个角色，都能轻松使用自己喜爱的物品。\r\n\r\n你可以随时将收藏中的任意物品立刻发送到你的某个角色身上。这让装备外观或玩具变得极其方便，无需手动转移物品。\r\n\r\n如果你在多个活跃服务器上游戏，可以使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:248|h外观收藏同步|h|r在服务器之间复制你已解锁的外观，确保无论你在哪里游玩，收藏都保持一致。\r\n\r\n外观标签页也是浏览赛季商店的地方，在当前服务器赛季期间，它提供专属外观、宠物和其他主题奖励。"
T["The Wall Walk"]="城墙步道"
T["The Wardrobe (Hotkey N -> Wardrobe Tab) is your central hub for managing the cosmetic appearance of your character. Through the wardrobe, you can view all the equipment appearances you’ve collected over time, including individual |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r pieces, incarnations, spell cosmetics, and complete full gear sets. This system lets you customize your look without sacrificing the stats or functionality of your equipped gear.\r\n\r\nOne of the wardrobe’s key features is the ability to Transmogrify (or mog) the appearance of your current gear to match any collected visuals, giving you full control over your character’s style. Beyond simple transmogging, the wardrobe allows you to create and save custom outfits, making it easy to switch between different looks instantly."]="衣柜（快捷键 N -> 衣柜标签页）是你管理角色外观造型的核心枢纽。通过衣柜，你可以查看自己长期收集的所有装备外观，包括单件的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r、化身、法术外观以及整套装备。该系统让你在不牺牲已装备物品属性和功能的前提下自定义外观。\r\n\r\n衣柜的关键功能之一是能够将你当前装备的外观幻化（或称 mog），使其与任何已收集的视觉效果相匹配，让你完全掌控角色的风格。除了简单的幻化之外，衣柜还允许你创建并保存自定义套装，轻松在不同造型之间即时切换。"
T["The World Map (Hotkey M) helps you navigate Azeroth by displaying your current location and surrounding zones. \r\n\r\nYou can zoom in and out (with Left or Right Click) to view entire continents or focus on a specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|hSub-Zone|h|r. \r\n\r\nThe map starts out mostly blank, with details only appearing as you explore the world. As you discover new areas, the map gradually fills in with terrain, labels, and points of interest, encouraging exploration and rewarding curiosity.\r\n\r\nImportant icons mark quest hubs, various |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h|r, cities, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r entrances, and more. Tracked quests and objectives are also displayed directly on the map, making it easy to chart your path and find your next destination. These options are all toggleable with the magnifying glass icon in the top right corner so you can have as much, or as little information on your map as you like."]="世界地图（快捷键 M）通过显示你当前的位置和周边区域，帮助你在艾泽拉斯中辨明方向。\r\n\r\n你可以放大和缩小视图（使用左键或右键），以查看整块大陆，或专注于某个特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|h子区域|h|r。\r\n\r\n地图最初几乎是空白的，只有当你探索世界时才会显现细节。随着你发现新的区域，地图会逐渐填充地形、标签和兴趣点，这鼓励探索并回报好奇心。\r\n\r\n重要图标会标出任务枢纽、各种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r、城市、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r入口等等。已追踪的任务和目标也会直接显示在地图上，让你更容易规划路线并找到下一个目的地。所有这些选项都可以通过右上角的放大镜图标开启或关闭，让你随心决定地图上显示多少信息。"
T["The [KEYWORD:Call Board] is the quest hub of [KEYWORD:Ascension].\n\nCall Boards can be found in [KEYWORD:all] major cities, including Booty Bay."]="[KEYWORD:告示板]是[KEYWORD:飞升]的任务枢纽。\n\n在[KEYWORD:所有]主要城市中都能找到告示板，包括藏宝海湾。"
T["The amount a buyer can pay to instantly purchase the item, skipping the bidding process. This must be equal to or higher than the Starting Price.|n|cff00ff00This is the most common way players buy and sell at the auction house!|r"]="买家为立即购买该物品、跳过竞拍流程而愿意支付的金额。该金额必须等于或高于起始价格。|n|cff00ff00这是玩家在拍卖行买卖物品最常见的方式！|r"
T["The amount of experience you gain is reduced because you're really stubborn and don't like learning."]="由于你非常固执、不爱学习，你获得的经验值减少了。"
T["The amount of gold dropped if you die in High-Risk. This cost increases as you equip more powerful gear. If you cannot afford this Fel Com cost, you will drop some of your equipped gear instead. Dropped Soulbound gear permanently becomes Bloodforged gear."]="在高风险状态下死亡时损失的金币数量。该消耗会随着你装备更强大的装备而增加。如果你负担不起这笔邪能金币消耗，就会改为掉落部分已装备的装备。掉落的灵魂绑定装备会永久变为血铸装备。"
T["The appropriate expansion is not active."]="对应的资料片未激活。"
T["The breeze feels good, eh? You are unable to equip or wear armor of any kind."]="微风拂面，感觉不错吧？你无法装备或穿戴任何类型的护甲。"
T["The caster becomes untrackable."]="施法者变得无法被追踪。"
T["The caster is surrounded by 3 balls of lightning.  When a spell, melee or ranged attack hits the caster, the attacker will be struck for 198 Nature damage.  This expends one lightning ball. Only one ball will fire every 3 seconds.  Lasts 10 min.\r\n\r\nOnly one Elemental Shield can be active on the Hero at any one time."]="施法者被3颗闪电球环绕。当一个法术、近战或远程攻击命中施法者时，攻击者将受到198点自然伤害。这会消耗一颗闪电球。每3秒只会触发一颗。持续10分钟。\r\n\r\n同一时间英雄身上只能有一个元素护盾处于激活状态。"
T["The caster is surrounded by 3 balls of lightning.  When a spell, melee or ranged attack hits the caster, the attacker will be struck for 80 Nature damage.  This expends one lightning ball. Only one ball will fire every 3 seconds.  Lasts 10 min.\r\n\r\nOnly one Elemental Shield can be active on the Hero at any one time."]="施法者被3颗闪电球环绕。当一个法术、近战或远程攻击命中施法者时，攻击者将受到80点自然伤害。这会消耗一颗闪电球。每3秒只会触发一颗。持续10分钟。\r\n\r\n同一时间英雄身上只能有一个元素护盾处于激活状态。"
T["The current Mystic Enchant category is visible here"]="当前神秘附魔类别会显示在此处"
T["The deeds of other, lesser adventurers mean nothing to you. You are unable to benefit from World Buffs."]="其他低等冒险者的事迹对你毫无意义。你无法从世界增益中获益。"
T["The desired entry could not be found."]="未能找到期望的条目。"
T["The distance at which NamePlates will be fully transparent. Must be less than Nameplate Distance, and greater than Fade In Distance to have any effect"]="姓名板完全透明时的距离。必须小于姓名板距离，且大于淡入距离才会生效。"
T["The distance at which NamePlates will be shown at full opacity. Must be less than Nameplate Distance, and less than Fade Out Distance to have any effect."]="姓名板以完全不透明度显示时的距离。必须小于姓名板距离，且小于淡出距离才会生效。"
T["The following fields are empty:"]="以下字段为空："
T["The font to use"]="要使用的字体"
T["The hunter and raid members within 40 yards take on the aspects of a pack of cheetahs, increasing movement speed by 30%.  \r\n\r\nIf you are struck under the effect of this aspect, you will be dazed for 4 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="猎人和40码范围内的团队成员化为猎豹群之相，移动速度提高30%。\r\n\r\n若你在该守护效果下受到攻击，将被眩晕4秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["The invisibility liquor is ready for you, Korekfour."]="隐身酒已经为你准备好了，Korekfour。"
T["The items for the currently selected category are displayed here. Use the arrows at the bottom, or the scroll wheel to navigate"]="当前所选类别的物品会显示在这里。使用底部的箭头或滚轮进行浏览"
T["The king doesn't look north."]="国王不朝北看。"
T["The last spell selected here will be the next spell to be unlearned!"]="此处最后选中的法术将成为下一个被遗忘的法术！"
T["The library has become much more active now that the Sentinels are gathering information from the old ruins. We've imported some texts from Darnassus as well - our collection is growing larger and larger every day!\n\nAs I learn more about our ancestors, it makes me wonder about what happened to the rest of the Highborne. I know many turned away from Azshara and joined us Kal'dorei after the Sundering, such as Lorekeeper Farnae, but still - I wonder who else we might find…"]="如今哨兵们正从古老的废墟中收集资料，图书馆变得活跃多了。我们还从达纳苏斯引进了一些典籍——我们的收藏一天比一天丰富！\n\n随着我对先祖了解得越来越多，我不禁想知道其余的上层精灵后来怎么样了。我知道在大分裂之后，许多人都离开了艾萨拉并加入了我们卡多雷，比如博学者法尔娜，但我还是……想知道我们还能找到谁……"
T["The location you encountered this bug in"]="你遇到此错误的位置"
T["The mineral shipment from the Dunshire mine still hasn't arrived. I want to go and demand an answer in person, but I've been warned the road is dangerous."]="邓希尔矿场的矿石货运仍未送达。我想亲自去讨个说法，但有人警告我路上很危险。"
T["The moon waxes and wanes, yet she is never truly gone."]="月有阴晴圆缺，但她从未真正离去。"
T["The more detailed the better!"]="细节越多越好！"
T["The next undesired entry is not valid."]="下一个非期望条目无效。"
T["The nightmare consumes you! Sucked deep into the dark of Azeroths most dangerous reaches, you'll need to complete all dungeons in order to escape. With only one life, 300% more damage from physical attacks, and 500% more damage from spells, you'll need every ally you can find to overcome this terrifying trial. Will you emerge victorious, or be consumed by the terrors of the night?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Edwin VanCleef] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 21|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mutanus the Devourer] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 22|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Archmage Arugal] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 26|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Aku'mai] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 28|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Charlga Razorflank] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 33|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mekgineer Thermaplugg] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 34|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Bloodmage Thalnos] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 34|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Arcanist Doan] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 37|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Herod] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 40|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Amnennar]|cffffffffbefore reaching level 41|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Archaedas] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 47|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Lord Vyletongue] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 47|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Chief Ukorz Sandscalp] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 48|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Razorlash] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 48|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Celebras the Cursed] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 49|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Princess Theradras] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 51|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Shade of Eranikus] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 55|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Alzzin the Wildshaper] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 58|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Emperor Thaurissan] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 59|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|hYou must kill |cffffff00[King Gordok] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Prince Tortheldrin] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Overlord Wyrmthalak] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Balnazzar] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Baron Rivendare] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Darkmaster Gandling] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="噩梦正在吞噬你！你被拖入艾泽拉斯最危险角落的深处，必须通关所有地下城才能逃脱。你只有一条命，承受的物理攻击伤害提高300%、法术伤害提高500%，你需要召集所有能找到的盟友来通过这场恐怖的考验。你会凯旋而归，还是被暗夜的恐惧吞噬？\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|h你必须在达到21级前击杀|cffffff00[埃德温·范克里夫] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|h你必须在达到22级前击杀|cffffff00[吞噬者穆坦努斯] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|h你必须在达到26级前击杀|cffffff00[大法师阿鲁高] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|h你必须在达到28级前击杀|cffffff00[阿库麦尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|h你必须在达到33级前击杀|cffffff00[尖牙德鲁伊查尔加] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|h你必须在达到34级前击杀|cffffff00[机械师瑟玛普拉格] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|h你必须在达到34级前击杀|cffffff00[血法师萨尔诺斯] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|h你必须在达到37级前击杀|cffffff00[奥术师杜安] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|h你必须在达到40级前击杀|cffffff00[赫罗德] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|h你必须在达到41级前击杀|cffffff00[阿门纳尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|h你必须在达到47级前击杀|cffffff00[阿扎达斯] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|h你必须在达到47级前击杀|cffffff00[维雷泰恩领主] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|h你必须在达到48级前击杀|cffffff00[酋长乌克兹·沙顶] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|h你必须在达到48级前击杀|cffffff00[拉佐拉什] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|h你必须在达到49级前击杀|cffffff00[被诅咒的塞雷布拉斯] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|h你必须在达到51级前击杀|cffffff00[瑟莱德丝公主] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|h你必须在达到55级前击杀|cffffff00[伊兰尼库斯的阴影] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|h你必须在达到58级前击杀|cffffff00[变形者奥兹恩] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|h你必须在达到59级前击杀|cffffff00[索瑞森大帝] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|h你必须在达到60级前击杀|cffffff00[戈多克大王] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|h你必须在达到60级前击杀|cffffff00[托塞德林王子] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|h你必须在达到60级前击杀|cffffff00[维姆萨拉克霸主] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|h你必须在达到60级前击杀|cffffff00[巴纳扎尔] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|h你必须在达到60级前击杀|cffffff00[瑞文戴尔男爵] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|h你必须在达到60级前击杀|cffffff00[黑暗院长加丁] |cffffffff|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["The nightmare continues! With danger lurking around every corner, one wrong step could be the end of your journey. You'll take 300% more damage from physical attacks and 500% more damage from spells. With only 3 lives to make it to level cap, you'll need to master every aspect of your hero to succeed. But take heart: you can group with other Nightmare adventurers to brave the challenge together. Will you emerge victorious, or be consumed by the terrors of the night?"]="噩梦仍在继续！危险潜伏在每个角落，一步踏错就可能终结你的旅程。你承受的物理攻击伤害提高300%、法术伤害提高500%。只有3条命来达到满级，你必须精通英雄的方方面面才能成功。但不要气馁：你可以与其他噩梦冒险者组队，共同迎接挑战。你会凯旋而归，还是被暗夜的恐惧吞噬？"
T["The nightmare deepens: with no bonus experience and classic x1 experience rates, your nightmare is more overwhelming than ever. Will you survive the grueling journey while suffering 300% more damage from physical attacks and 500% more damage from spells? With only 3 lives to make it to level cap, you'll need to master every aspect of your hero to succeed. But take heart: you can group with other Nightmare adventurers to brave the challenge together."]="噩梦愈发深重：没有经验加成，采用经典1倍经验速率，你的噩梦比以往更加沉重。在承受物理攻击伤害提高300%、法术伤害提高500%的同时，你能在这段艰辛旅程中活下来吗？只有3条命来达到满级，你必须精通英雄的方方面面才能成功。但不要气馁：你可以与其他噩梦冒险者组队，共同迎接挑战。"
T["The nightmare threatens to consume you: one life, solo, with no grouping, trading, auction house, or battlegrounds. This experience is truly self-made. Will you survive the grueling journey while suffering 300% more damage from physical attacks and 500% more damage from spells? Or will you succumb to the nightmare like so many others?"]="噩梦即将将你吞噬：只有一条命、孤身一人、不能组队、不能交易、不能使用拍卖行、也不能进入战场。这场体验真正只属于勇者。在承受物理攻击伤害提高300%、法术伤害提高500%的同时，你能挺过这段艰辛旅程吗？还是会像许多人一样屈服于噩梦？"
T["The number of available rewards does not match the requested amount."]="可用奖励的数量与请求的数量不符。"
T["The number of reserved characters must be"]="保留字符的数量必须为"
T["The path ahead may bend, but it does not vanish. Walk it with faith, and trust that Elune already walks beside you."]="前方的道路或许会弯曲，但不会消失。怀着信念走下去，相信艾露恩已与你同行。"
T["The path to glory is paved with danger. In this Hardcore challenge, channel your grit and determination to make it to level cap at 1x classic experience rates as you navigate a merciless world with only one life. But you don't have to face the journey alone: rally your allies or find companions in the open world to overcome the challenges together. The ultimate test of perseverance awaits you!"]="通往荣耀的道路布满危险。在这场硬核挑战中，鼓起你的勇气与决心，在经典1倍经验速率下达到满级，并在只有一条命的情况下穿行于一个冷酷无情的世界。但你不必独自面对这段旅程：召集你的盟友，或在开放世界中寻找同伴，一起克服挑战。毅力的终极考验正等着你！"
T["The path to mastering your craft is a lonely one: one life, self-made, and you only gain experience through crafting and gathering."]="精通手艺的道路是孤独的：只有一条命、完全自力更生，而且你只能通过制造和采集获得经验。"
