T["The requested store could not be found."]="未能找到所请求的商店。"
T["The required item count for this purchase is too high."]="此次购买所需的物品数量过高。"
T["The sea has claimed you. You’ve grown gills and can no longer breathe on land. On your quest to reach max level, you must swim and fish your way through Azeroth’s waters, gathering rare catches to prove your mastery of the deep. Will you rise as a fishy hero, or drown trying?\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6294|hYou must loot |cffffff00[12 Pound Mud Snapper] |cffffffffx1 before reaching level 15|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6310|hYou must loot |cffffff00[19 Pound Catfish] |cffffffffx1 before reaching level 20|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13882|hYou must loot |cffffff00[42 Pound Redgill] |cffffffffx1 before reaching level 40|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13901|hYou must loot |cffffff00[15 Pound Salmon] |cffffffffx1 before reaching level 60|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="大海已经收回了你。你长出了鳃，再也无法在陆地上呼吸。在冲击满级的征程中，你必须游遍并钓遍艾泽拉斯的水域，收集稀有的渔获来证明你在这片深渊中的造诣。你会成为一条咸鱼英雄，还是会中途溺亡？\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6294|h你必须在达到15级前拾取|cffffff00[12磅泥鳅]|cffffffffx1|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6310|h你必须在达到20级前拾取|cffffff00[19磅鲶鱼]|cffffffffx1|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13882|h你必须在达到40级前拾取|cffffff00[42磅红鳃鱼]|cffffffffx1|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13901|h你必须在达到60级前拾取|cffffff00[15磅鲑鱼]|cffffffffx1|r。|cffffff00（点击此处！）|cffffffff |r|h"
