T["The single-life challenge. Leap into a test of skill and perseverance and battle through a merciless world with only one life. But you don't have to adventure alone: group up with other Hardcore adventurers to overcome the challenge together!"]="一条命的挑战。投入一场技巧与毅力的考验，在只有一条命的情况下在一个冷酷无情的世界中战斗。但你不必独自冒险：与其他硬核冒险者组队，一起克服挑战！"
