T["The text for Korean Ratings."]="韩语分级文本。"
T["The total cost for this purchase is too high."]="此次购买的总消耗过高。"
T["The ultimate nightmare: massively increased damage, one life. Can you survive?"]="终极噩梦：伤害大幅提高，只有一条命。你能活下来吗？"
T["The ultimate party favor!"]="给队伍的终极帮助！"
T["The ultimate test of grit and determination: one life, x1 classic experience, and a world of danger waiting to take you down. Will you persevere to reach level cap, or fall to a merciless, unforgiving world?"]="对勇气与决心的终极考验：只有一条命、经典1倍经验，以及一个充满危险、等着将你击倒的世界。你会坚持到满级，还是会倒在这个冷酷无情、毫不宽容的世界面前？"
T["The undesired entry could not be found."]="未能找到该非期望条目。"
T["The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r is a large shared storage space available to members of a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r. It allows players to store and share items, materials, and gold within their community, making it easier to manage resources collectively.\r\n\r\nYou can access the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r at special NPCs located in major cities. |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r leaders have control over permissions, deciding which members can deposit or withdraw items and funds to maintain organization and security.\r\n\r\nAs the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r grows, additional storage tabs can be purchased to expand the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r. This extra space helps support group activities like raiding, crafting, and other events, by providing plenty of room for important items."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是供|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r成员使用的大型共享存储空间。它让玩家可以在社区内保存和分享物品、材料和金币，便于集体管理资源。\r\n\r\n你可以在主要城市中的特殊NPC处使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r领袖掌控权限，决定哪些成员可以存入或取出物品与资金，以维持秩序与安全。\r\n\r\n随着|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r发展壮大，可以购买额外的存储标签页来扩充|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r。这些额外空间有助于支持团队副本、制造和其他活动，为重要物品提供充足的空间。"
T["The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Season is a defined competitive period during which players participate in rated |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r matches to climb the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|hArena Rating|h|r ladder. Each season offers a fresh opportunity to compete for exclusive seasonal rewards.\r\n\r\nWith the start of every season, a new tier of PvP equipment becomes available for purchase from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP Quartermaster|h|r, using |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r. While some of this gear is accessible to all players, the most powerful equipment requires you to achieve a specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|hArena Rating|h|r before they can be unlocked for purchase.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the season, ratings reset, rankings are tallied, and top-performing players receive special end-of-season rewards. Once a new season begins, all players start fresh, ready to compete again in a new cycle of progression and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r.\r\n\r\nYou can view the current, previous, and upcoming seasons at:\r\n\r\nhttps://ascension.gg/en/timeline"]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r赛季是一段明确的竞技周期，在此期间玩家参与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r评级比赛，以提升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|h竞技场等级|h|r排名。每个赛季都提供一次争夺赛季专属奖励的全新机会。\r\n\r\n随着每个赛季的开始，新一档的PvP装备将可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP军需官|h|r处使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r购买。虽然部分装备对所有玩家开放，但最强大的装备需要你达到特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|h竞技场等级|h|r后才能解锁购买。\r\n\r\n赛季结束时，分数会重置，排名会被计算，表现最好的玩家将获得特殊的赛季末奖励。一旦新赛季开始，所有玩家都从零出发，准备在新的成长与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r周期中再次竞技。\r\n\r\n你可以在以下地址查看当前、往季和未来的赛季：\r\n\r\nhttps://ascension.gg/en/timeline"
T["The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r sync is a powerful item that keeps your cosmetic collection unified across all live Ascension realms (excluding PTR servers). It ensures that any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h|r |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h|r, appearances, toys, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, or non-consumable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h|r you've unlocked on one realm are available on other servers.\r\n\r\nEach time you log in, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r sync automatically updates your collection, merging cosmetic data between realms.\r\n\r\nYou can obtain the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r sync from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r as well as the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r with in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, or you can purchase it from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r同步是一件强大的物品，可让你的外观收藏在飞升所有活跃服务器之间保持统一（PTR 服务器除外）。它确保你在某个服务器解锁的任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h绑定服务器|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r、外观、玩具、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r或非消耗性|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r，都能在其他服务器上使用。\r\n\r\n每次登录时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r同步都会自动更新你的收藏，在服务器之间合并外观数据。\r\n\r\n你可以从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉西斯|h|r处获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r同步，也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r Finder is a convenient tool that quickly connects you with other players to run dungeons together. To use it, open the Dungeons and Raids menu (Hotkey i), select your preferred role (|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r, or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r) and choose whether to queue for a specific |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r or a random |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r (often called Random |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r Finder or RDF).\r\n\r\nOnce the system finds a group, you’ll be instantly teleported to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r, where you can earn |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, gear, and complete quests. After finishing your run, simply right-click the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r finder icon on your minimap and select “Leave |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r” to return to the open world.\r\n\r\nChoosing to run random dungeons or filling a role that’s in high demand often grants bonus loot and rewards, making the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r Finder one of the fastest and most popular ways to level up and prepare for endgame content."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器是一个便利的工具，能快速帮你联系其他玩家一起打地下城。要使用它，请打开地下城与团队副本菜单（快捷键 i），选择你偏好的职责（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r），然后选择要排队进入特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r还是随机|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r（通常称为随机|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器或 RDF）。\r\n\r\n一旦系统找到队伍，你会立即被传送到|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r中，在那里可以获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r、装备并完成任务。结束行程后，只需右键点击小地图上的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器图标，选择「离开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r」即可返回开放世界。\r\n\r\n选择随机地下城或补位紧缺职责通常会给予额外的战利品和奖励，这使|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器成为升级和为终局内容做准备的最快、最受欢迎的方式之一。"
