T["These caches are reward chests earned by completing the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quest. Designed as a catch-up mechanic, these caches are ideal for helping players quickly gear up for current content, especially if you're returning to the game or leveling a fresh character.\r\n\r\nEach cache has a high chance to contain gear upgrades, from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r gear to epic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r loot from all previously released content, scaling up to the most recently released |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r. If you receive a cache from a daily quest requiring PvP activities, the gear from your cache will be |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h|r.\r\n\r\nThese chests offer a reliable alternative to repetitive farming, giving you access to relevant power gains even if you're behind the current progression curve. They're especially helpful for preparing alts or off-specs for group content."]="这些宝箱是通过完成|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r每日任务获得的奖励宝箱。作为追赶机制设计，这些宝箱非常适合帮助玩家快速为当前内容装备起来，尤其是当你回归游戏或正在练一个新角色时。\r\n\r\n每个宝箱都有很高几率开出装备升级，从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r装备到此前发布的所有内容中的史诗|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r战利品，并一路递增至最新发布的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r。如果你从需要PvP活动的每日任务中获得宝箱，宝箱中的装备将是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r装备。\r\n\r\n这些宝箱为重复刷取提供了可靠的替代方案，即使你的进度落后于当前曲线，也能获得相关的实力提升。它们对准备小号或备选专精来参与团队内容尤其有用。"
T["These controls allow you to modify specific detail levels for many game elements and effects, exclusively inside of Raids and Battlegrounds."]="这些控制选项让你可以调整许多游戏元素和效果的特定细节等级，且仅在团队副本和战场内生效。"
