T["This is your Mystic Enchanting Experience. |cffFFFFFFReforging items at the altar increases this experience.|r\nEvery time you level up, you gain 1 Mystic Extract. These extracts are used to save your favorite enchants to your collection for later use."]="这是你的神秘附魔经验。|cffFFFFFF在祭坛重铸物品会增加此经验。|r\n每次升级时，你都会获得1个神秘萃取物。这些萃取物用于将你喜爱的附魔保存到收藏中以备后用。"
