T["Though I'm not certain I'd wish to stay in Auberdine permanently, it is a nice change from the other roads I've traveled.\n\nThe corruption here is lesser than it was in Felwood, but I am eager to see how the forest fares upon Teldrassil - I've yet to lay my own eyes upon its boughs."]="虽然我不确定是否愿意永远留在奥伯丁，但与我走过的其他道路相比，这里是个令人愉快的改变。\n\n这里的腐化比费伍德时要轻，但我迫切想知道泰达希尔的森林长势如何——我还没亲眼见过它的枝干。"
