T["Timewalking quests are daily challenges take you back in time to relive classic adventures from World of Warcraft's past, offering great rewards upon successful completion."]="时光漫游任务是每日挑战，带你回到过去重温《魔兽世界》的经典冒险，成功完成后会给予丰厚奖励。"
T["Timewalking: The Burning Crusade"]="时光漫游：燃烧的远征"
T["Tinkers' Court"]="工匠议会"
T["Tiraxis is an NPC located near the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r, serving as the host of several specialty shops. \r\n\r\nAmong these is the highly sought-after |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r, offering a wide selection of unique and valuable items. Tiraxis also sells essential goods such as |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h|r for quick teleportation, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h|r that grant powerful realm-wide buffs, keeper scrolls to aid your professions and leveling journey, and the Ethereal Box of Wares containing retired seasonal items and random miscellaneous goods from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r. \r\n\r\nAll purchases from Tiraxis require |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r which can be bought from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="提拉西斯是一个位于你|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r附近的NPC，负责主持多家专营商店。\r\n\r\n其中包括备受追捧的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r，提供各式独特而珍贵的物品。提拉西斯还出售各种必需品，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、用于快速传送的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h撤退之石|h|r、提供强力全服增益的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r、帮助你提升专业和等级进度的守护者卷轴，以及包含已下架赛季物品和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r各类杂货的虚灵货箱。\r\n\r\n在提拉西斯处的所有购买都需要|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r，该物品可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r购买，或通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["Tirion Message to Isillien"]="提里奥给伊森利恩的消息"
T["Tirion Message to Isillien 002"]="提里奥给伊森利恩的消息 002"
T["Titan Scrolls"]="泰坦卷轴"
T["Titan Scrolls are powerful consumable items that provide realm-wide buffs, benefiting every player in the open world, except for those in starter zones. Each type of scroll can stack up to 5 times, and all five different scrolls can be active simultaneously, combining their effects for maximum benefit.\r\n\r\nThe five Titan Scrolls and their effects are:\r\n\r\nNorgannon: Increases damage dealt to enemies and boosts |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r gained from combat.\r\nEonar: Can create a ring of flowers upon defeating an enemy, restoring health and mana.\r\nAggramar: Increases damage dealt to demons.\r\nKhaz’goroth: Boosts |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r gained from a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r.\r\nGolganneth: Enhances swim speed and grants underwater breathing.\r\n\r\nTitan Scrolls can be discovered as drops throughout the world, purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r or the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r using in-game |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, or bought from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP)."]="泰坦卷轴是强力的消耗品，提供全服增益，惠及开放世界中的所有玩家，但新手区域中的玩家除外。每种卷轴最多可叠加5次，五种不同的卷轴可以同时生效，组合其效果以获得最大收益。\r\n\r\n五种泰坦卷轴及其效果如下：\r\n\r\n诺甘农：提高对敌人造成的伤害，并提升战斗中获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。\r\n艾欧娜尔：击败敌人时可生成一圈花朵，恢复生命值和法力值。\r\n阿格拉玛：提高对恶魔造成的伤害。\r\n卡兹格罗斯：提升从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r中获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。\r\n戈尔甘尼斯：提高游泳速度并赋予水下呼吸能力。\r\n\r\n泰坦卷轴可以在世界各地作为战利品找到，可以向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买，也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
