T["Transform into an unstoppable colossus for 12 sec, causing you to deal 15% increased Physical damage and take 20% less damage.\r\n\r\nWhile in this state you move at 80% speed which cannot be reduced or increased. You are also immune to immobilizing effects."]="变为不可阻挡的巨像，持续 12 秒，使你的物理伤害提高 15%，受到的伤害降低 20%。\r\n\r\n处于此状态时，你的移动速度为 80%，无法被降低或提高。你还免疫定身效果。"
T["Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to 20 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  \r\n\r\nAny damage will transform the target back into its normal form.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="将敌人变形为一只绵羊，使其漫无目的地游荡，最多持续 20 秒。游荡期间，绵羊无法攻击或施放法术，但会极快地恢复生命值。  \r\n\r\n任何伤害都会使目标恢复原本的形态。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to 30 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  \r\n\r\nAny damage will transform the target back into its normal form.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="将敌人变形为一只绵羊，使其漫无目的地游荡，最多持续 30 秒。游荡期间，绵羊无法攻击或施放法术，但会极快地恢复生命值。  \r\n\r\n任何伤害都会使目标恢复原本的形态。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
