T["Transmogrification (commonly called 'transmog' or 'mog') is a cosmetic system that allows you to change the appearance of your equipped gear using appearances you’ve collected in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r (Hotkey N -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r Tab).\r\n\r\nThis feature lets you customize your character’s look without affecting the gear’s stats or performance.\r\n\r\nWhen you transmog an item, only its visual appearance changes, its stats, item level, and effects remain exactly the same. This means you can maintain your optimal gear setup while expressing your personal style or recreating iconic looks from across the game.\r\n\r\nTo unlock appearances for your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r, simply obtain the items themselves (whether through quest rewards, drops, crafting, or purchases) and they will automatically be added to your collection when you equip them."]="幻化（通常称为「transmog」或「mog」）是一种外观系统，让你使用在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 中收集的外观来改变已装备物品的外观（快捷键 N -> |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 标签页）。\r\n\r\n此功能让你可以自定义角色的外观，而不影响装备的属性或性能。\r\n\r\n对物品进行幻化时，只有它的视觉效果会改变；其属性、物品等级和效果完全保持不变。这意味着你可以在保持最优装备配置的同时展现个人风格，或重现游戏中的经典造型。\r\n\r\n要解锁 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 中的外观，只需获得物品本身（无论是通过任务奖励、掉落、制作还是购买），装备它们时就会自动加入你的收藏。"
T["Transmogrify Items"]="幻化物品"
T["Transmutes Earth to Living Essence."]="将土之精华转化为生命精华。"
