T["Trials are special self-imposed challenges that add unique twists to the leveling journey. They reward creativity, skill, and dedication by offering exclusive rewards, cosmetics, and achievements for completing the game under specific conditions.\r\n\r\nYou can view active trials at any time through the trials menu (Hotkey J), but trials can only be initiated or deactivated by speaking with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h|r, found in any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r or starter zone. To begin a trial, your character must be level 1, either as a brand-new character or immediately after prestiging.\r\n\r\nEach trial imposes different restrictions or gameplay modifiers (such as permadeath, changing the ways you obtain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, or adding in completely new challenges) that make the leveling process more difficult and rewarding."]="试炼是特殊自我挑战，为升级之旅增添独特的玩法变化。通过在特定条件下完成游戏，它们以专属奖励、外观和成就来回报你的创造力、技巧与投入。\r\n\r\n你可以随时通过试炼菜单（快捷键 J）查看当前生效的试炼，但只有与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h|r 对话才能开启或关闭试炼，他位于任意 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 或新手区域。要开始试炼，你的角色必须为 1 级，无论是全新角色还是刚完成威望重置。\r\n\r\n每种试炼都会施加不同的限制或游戏机制改动（例如永久死亡、改变你获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r的方式，或加入全新的挑战），使升级过程更加困难，也更有成就感。"
T["Trials |cffffd100(J)|r"]="试炼 |cffffd100(J)|r"
T["Trials? I have them - though I don't want to hear any whining when you fail them."]="试炼？我有的是——不过你们失败的时候，我可不听任何抱怨。"
