T["Upon entering the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r, every player is granted an Endless |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Potion, a reusable consumable with a short cooldown that restores your health, energy, mana, and rage. This versatile potion is placed directly into your inventory and is designed to help you sustain yourself during the relentless encounters inside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.\r\n\r\nThe potion’s effectiveness scales with group size, providing the most healing when you’re running solo, and slightly less when in larger parties. This scaling ensures it remains balanced and useful whether you’re tackling the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r alone or with a full |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r group.\r\n\r\nBecause the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r can be punishing, keeping this potion handy on your action bar is essential for survival, allowing you to quickly recover and push deeper into the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r’s challenges."]="进入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r时，每位玩家都会获得一瓶无尽|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r药水，这是一种可重复使用的消耗品，冷却时间很短，能恢复你的生命值、能量、法力和怒气。这种多用途药水会直接放入你的背包，旨在帮助你抵御|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r内接连不断的战斗。\r\n\r\n药水的效果会随小队人数变化，单人游戏时治疗量最高，小队人数越多则略低。这一设定确保它无论你是单挑|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r，还是与满编|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r小队同行，都能保持平衡且实用。\r\n\r\n由于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r极为严酷，把这瓶药水放在动作条上随时备用是生存的关键，它能让你迅速恢复并深入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r的挑战。"
