T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Accursed:|r\nIncreases your chance to miss by |cffFF99005%|r.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with |cffFF99000|r souls.\n\n|cFFCC3300Challenges can only be accepted at level 20.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Once you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.|r"]="使用此物品来尝试该挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00受诅咒:|r\n你的未命中几率提高|cffFF99005%|r。\n完成本挑战将奖励你|cffFF99000|r个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，就会被它束缚至死。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Animus:|r\nEnemies slain by you have a |cffFF990010%|r chance to reanimate\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with |cffFF99000|r souls.\n\n|cFFCC3300Challenges can only be accepted at level 20.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Once you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.|r"]="使用此物品来尝试该挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00灵魂:|r\n被你击杀的敌人有|cffFF990010%|r的几率复活。\n完成本挑战将奖励你|cffFF99000|r个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，就会被它束缚至死。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Bewitched:|r\nMagic damage taken increased by |cffFF9900100%|r.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with |cffFF99000|r souls.\n\n|cFFCC3300Challenges can only be accepted at level 20.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Once you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.|r"]="使用此物品来尝试该挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00迷惑:|r\n受到的魔法伤害提高|cffFF9900100%|r。\n完成本挑战将奖励你|cffFF99000|r个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，就会被它束缚至死。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Bile:|r\nPools of Toxic Bile will spawn at your feet every |cffFF9900300 seconds|r.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with |cffFF99000|r souls.\n\n|cFFCC3300Challenges can only be accepted at level 20.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Once you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.|r"]="使用此物品来尝试该挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00胆汁:|r\n每|cffFF9900300 秒|r会在你脚下生成一滩剧毒胆汁。\n完成本挑战将奖励你|cffFF99000|r个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，就会被它束缚至死。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Callowness:|r\nReduces all experience gained by |cffFF990010%|r.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with |cffFF99000|r souls.\n\n|cFFCC3300Challenges can only be accepted at level 20.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Once you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.|r"]="使用此物品来尝试该挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00稚嫩:|r\n获得的所有经验值降低|cffFF990010%|r。\n完成本挑战将奖励你|cffFF99000|r个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，就会被它束缚至死。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\n|cFFFFCC00Contender:|r\nYou can only get kill credit and experience while at a level disadvantage.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with |cffFF99000|r souls.\n\n|cFFCC3300All player kills must be acquired before reaching max level.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Challenges can only be accepted at level 20.|r\n\n|cFFCC3300Once you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.|r"]="使用此物品来尝试该挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00竞争者:|r\n只有在你处于等级劣势时才能获得击杀计数和经验值。\n完成本挑战将奖励你|cffFF99000|r个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300所有玩家击杀都必须在达到满级之前取得。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，就会被它束缚至死。|r"
