T["Used to unlearn EITHER Abilities or Talents in Specialization I by clicking EITHER the Ability or Talent icon in Character Advancement, this will randomly select a new ability to take its place.\r\n\r\nYou can obtain scrolls from The Manastorm, Quests, Dungeons, Raids, Callboard Caches, Battlegrounds, High-Risk Open-World, and a Questchain on Silas Darkmoon in Capitals using Marks of Ascension."]="用于在专精 I 中遗忘技能或天赋：在角色成长界面点击技能或天赋图标，即可随机选取一个新技能来替代它。\r\n\r\n你可以在法力风暴、任务、地下城、团队副本、告示板宝箱、战场、高风险野外，以及主城中与 Silas Darkmoon 的任务链中获得卷轴，需使用飞升印记。"
T["Used to unlearn Talents in Specialization I by clicking the Talent icon in Character Advancement, this will randomly select a new Talent to take its place.\r\n\r\nYou can obtain scrolls from The Manastorm, Quests, Dungeons, Raids, Callboard Caches, Battlegrounds, High-Risk Open-World, and a Questchain on Silas Darkmoon in Capitals using Marks of Ascension."]="用于在专精 I 中遗忘天赋：在角色成长界面点击天赋图标，即可随机选取一个新天赋来替代它。\r\n\r\n你可以在法力风暴、任务、地下城、团队副本、告示板宝箱、战场、高风险野外，以及主城中与 Silas Darkmoon 的任务链中获得卷轴，需使用飞升印记。"
