T["Using Marks of Ascension you can discover new abilities everyday with Hands of Fate and skillcards!\n\nHands of Fate allow you to draft new abilities!\nSkillcards allow you to gain specific abilities while prestiging!"]="使用飞升印记，你可以每天通过命运之手和技能卡发现新技能！\n\n命运之手让你能够抽取新技能！\n技能卡让你在威望重置时获得指定的技能！"
T["Using Marks of Ascension you can discover new abilities everyday with Scrolls of Fortune and Skill Cards!\n\nScrolls of Fortune allow you to roll new abilities and talents!\nSkill Cards allow you to gain specific abilities while prestiging!"]="使用飞升印记，你可以每天通过幸运卷轴和技能卡发现新技能！\n\n幸运卷轴让你能够抽取新技能和天赋！\n技能卡让你在威望重置时获得指定的技能！"
