T["Vendors are NPCs who sell a wide variety of useful items such as weapons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r, consumables, and crafting materials. They also buy items from you, helping you manage your inventory by turning unwanted loot into gold. If you accidentally sell something important, vendors offer a buyback tab that lets you repurchase recently sold items. \r\n\r\nVendors come in different types such as general goods vendors, trade suppliers, reagents vendors, or weapon and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h|r merchants. Some of these NPCs provide repair services to restore your equipment’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|hDurability|h|r. \r\n\r\nVendors can be found in towns, cities, and quest hubs or just walking down the road all throughout the open world. If you need a specific type of vendor, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r offers a variety of search options to highlight the NPC you need."]="商人是出售各种实用物品的 NPC，例如武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r、消耗品和制造材料。他们也会收购你的物品，帮你把不需要的战利品换成金币，从而管理好背包。如果你不小心卖掉了重要的东西，商人还提供一个回购标签页，让你可以买回最近售出的物品。 \r\n\r\n商人分为不同类型，例如杂货商、贸易供应商、材料商，或是武器与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r商人。其中一些 NPC 还提供修理服务，以恢复你装备的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|h耐久度|h|r。 \r\n\r\n商人可以在城镇、城市和任务枢纽找到，也可能只是走在开放世界的路上。如果你需要特定类型的商人，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r提供了多种搜索选项，可以高亮你需要的 NPC。"
T["Venture into High Risk as an Ironman. Embrace the danger and fear of a world where every Hero is your enemy, and every step could be your last –but one kill might give you the resources you need to persevere. Slay foes, take their gear, and survive. Will you embrace the ruthless tactics of this game mode, or fall to more savage foes?"]="以钢铁侠身份踏入高风险。拥抱这个世界的危险与恐惧——在这里每个英雄都是你的敌人，每一步都可能是你的最后一步，但一次击杀也许就能给你坚持下去所需的资源。击杀敌人，夺取他们的装备，然后活下去。你会接受这种游戏模式的冷酷战术，还是会倒在更凶蛮的敌人手下？"
T["Venture into an extraordinary test of movement as you explore vast realms with a unique twist. Engage in the art of lateral maneuvering, skillfully sidestepping through diverse landscapes without the ability to walk forward or backward. The Sideways Shuffle challenge immerses you in a new way of traversing, requiring strategic thinking and precision. Adapt your strategy, navigate treacherous terrain, and conquer formidable foes using the power of sidestepping. Embrace this unconventional journey and uncover the hidden rewards that await those who master the art of the Sideways Shuffle.\n\nYou have to strafe. The challenge is that you can only strafe to move."]="踏上一次非凡的移动考验，以独特的方式探索广袤的世界。修习横向移动的技艺，在无法向前或向后行走的情况下灵巧地横穿各种地形。横向滑步挑战将让你沉浸于一种全新的移动方式，需要战略思维与精准操作。调整你的策略，穿越险恶的地形，并借助横向移动的力量征服强敌。接受这段非同寻常的旅程，发掘那些等待精通横向滑步之人的隐藏奖励。\n\n你必须侧移。挑战在于你只能靠侧移来移动。"
T["Venture into the wilds of Azeroth and walk the path of a Trollbane! Prove your strength by defeating 6 troll leaders from the various troll tribes, scattered across the continents. \n\nFrom the dense jungles of Stranglethorn Vale, to the sandy dunes of Tanaris, your journey will take you through diverse terrains where you'll face off against many cunning trolls and their powerful leaders. \n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254168|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Vazul] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 40|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1060|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mogh the Undying] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 44|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254170|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Zazera] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 45|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5401|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Kazkaz the Unholy] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 48|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10802|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Hitah'ya the Keeper] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 51|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254169|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Yahola] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 59|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="踏入艾泽拉斯的荒野，走上巨魔克星之路！击败来自各大巨魔部族、散布于各个大陆的 6 位巨魔首领，以证明你的实力。 \n\n从荆棘谷茂密的丛林到塔纳利斯的沙丘，你的旅程将带你穿越各种地形，面对众多狡猾的巨魔及其强大的首领。 \n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254168|h你必须在达到 40 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[瓦祖尔] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1060|h你必须在达到 44 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[不朽者莫格] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254170|h你必须在达到 45 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[扎泽拉] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5401|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[不洁者卡兹卡兹] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10802|h你必须在达到 51 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[守护者希塔亚] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254169|h你必须在达到 59 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[亚霍拉] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
