T["Visit a Book of Artisans or a cooking trainer to learn cooking.  Cooking lets you learn recipes to create food that heals you out of combat and grants you powerful temporary buffs."]="拜访工匠之书或烹饪训练师以学习烹饪。烹饪让你学习食谱，制作能在战斗外治疗你并赋予强力临时增益的食物。"
