T["We are strongest when we listen to the wisdom of our elders, to when we share our burdens with one another, and when we remember that Elune’s light is reflected in each other."]="当我们聆听长者的智慧，彼此分担重负，并铭记艾露恩之光在彼此身上交相辉映时，我们最为强大。"
