T["Welcome to Ascension WoW!"]="欢迎来到 Ascension WoW！"
T["Welcome to [KEYWORD:Ascension]!\n\nThese tutorials will introduce you to the basics.\n\nThey can be disabled or re-enabled at any time by pressing [ACTION:Escape] and going to [KEYWORD:Interface - Ascension Tutorials]"]="欢迎来到[KEYWORD:飞升]！\n\n这些教学将向你介绍基础内容。\n\n你可以随时按[ACTION:Esc]并前往[KEYWORD:界面 - 飞升教学]将其关闭或重新开启"
T["Welcome to the Vanity Item Collection!"]="欢迎来到外观物品收藏！"
T["Well done, citizen. Those kobolds are thieves and cowards, but in large numbers they pose a threat to us. And the humans of Stormwind do not need another threat.\n\nFor defeating them, you have my gratitude."]="干得好，公民。那些狗头人是小偷和懦夫，但数量一多就对我们构成威胁。而暴风城的人类不需要再多一个威胁。\n\n感谢你击败了他们。"
T["Well met, Hidexs.\r\n\r\nYou've been looking for me, no?"]="幸会，Hidexs。\r\n\r\n你一直在找我，不是吗？"
T["Well, what do we have here? Do you truly believe you can steal the title of Chieftain of Ealdmaine from me? Ha!"]="哦，看看这是谁？你真以为能从我手里夺走埃尔德梅因酋长的头衔？哈！"
T["What actually happened?"]="到底发生了什么？"
T["What are you doing here!?"]="你在这里做什么！？"
T["What did you expect to happen?"]="你以为会发生什么？"
T["What the hells happened to my pumpkins?!"]="我的南瓜到底怎么了？！"
T["What type of issue are you having?"]="你遇到了哪类问题？"
T["What was that noise? It sounded like a roar.!"]="那是什么声音？听起来像是咆哮！"
T["What were you doing"]="你当时在做什么"
T["What's a Guild Bank?"]="什么是公会银行？"
T["What's a Realm Bank?"]="什么是服务器银行？"
T["What? Are you looking for something?\n\nThere's nothing left here. Dead crops. Dead people. So many... dead.\n\nThe blight has taken everything. Even the earth feels it, its shadow seeps into the soil like poison. It's unnatural... If I weren't so stubborn, if I hadn't insisted on staying in our home, maybe they'd still be here.\n\nIt's just Minnie and I now. We're all that's left... and I still refuse to leave.\n\nLight save us both."]="什么？你在找东西吗？\n\n这里什么都不剩了。死掉的庄稼。死去的人。太多……死人了。\n\n瘟疫夺走了一切。连大地都能感觉到，它的阴影像毒药一样渗入土壤。这不自然……如果我没那么固执，如果我没有坚持留在我们的家里，也许他们现在还在这里。\n\n现在只剩下我和米妮了。我们是仅存的……而我仍然拒绝离开。\n\n愿圣光拯救我们两个。"
T["When activated, this ability causes your Mangle abilities to hit up to 3 targets and have no cooldown.\r\n\r\nReduces the cost of all your Cat Form and Bear Form abilities by 50%. \r\n\r\nWhile active your Savage Defense absorb effect is doubled."]="激活后，该技能使你的裂伤技能最多击中 3 个目标，且没有冷却时间。\r\n\r\n使你所有猎豹形态和熊形态技能的消耗降低 50%。\r\n\r\n激活期间，你的野蛮防御吸收效果翻倍。"
T["When activated, your next direct damage Rogue ability has 100% increased critical strike chance, 20% increased damage  and is usable from 10 yards. \r\n\r\nWhen consumed you will gain 4% melee and ranged critical strike chance for 15 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="激活后，你的下一个潜行者直接伤害技能爆击几率提高 100%，伤害提高 20%，并可在 10 码外使用。\r\n\r\n消耗后，你将获得 4% 的近战和远程爆击几率，持续 15 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When active, 0% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by the target."]="激活时，施法者受到的所有伤害中有 0% 由目标承担。"
T["When active, 20% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Summoned or Enslaved Demon. That damage cannot be prevented. Lasts as long as the demon is active, controlled and you are within 30 yards of it.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="激活时，施法者受到的所有伤害中有 20% 由你召唤或奴役的恶魔承担。该伤害无法被减免。只要恶魔处于激活、受控状态且你在其 30 码范围内，效果就会持续。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When active, 20% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your summoned Voidwalker, Succubus, Felhunter, or Felguard. That damage cannot be prevented. Lasts as long as the demon is active, controlled and you are within 30 yards of it."]="激活时，施法者受到的所有伤害中有 20% 由你召唤的虚空行者、魅魔、地狱猎犬或恶魔卫士承担。该伤害无法被减免。只要恶魔处于激活、受控状态且你在其 30 码范围内，效果就会持续。"
T["When active, 5% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by the target."]="激活时，施法者受到的所有伤害中有 5% 由目标承担。"
T["When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 2%.\r\n\r\nYou have a 33% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="生命值低于 35% 时，受到的所有伤害降低 2%。\r\n\r\n你有 33% 的几率完全吸收一次本会杀死你的攻击，最多吸收你总生命值的 15%，并为你恢复最多 20% 的最大生命值（治疗量取决于防御）。此外，你在接下来 3 秒内受到的治疗效果提高 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 4%.\r\n\r\nYou have a 66% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="生命值低于 35% 时，受到的所有伤害降低 4%。\r\n\r\n你有 66% 的几率完全吸收一次本会杀死你的攻击，最多吸收你总生命值的 15%，并为你恢复最多 20% 的最大生命值（治疗量取决于防御）。此外，你在接下来 3 秒内受到的治疗效果提高 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 6%.\r\n\r\nYou have a 100% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="生命值低于 35% 时，受到的所有伤害降低 6%。\r\n\r\n你有 100% 的几率完全吸收一次本会杀死你的攻击，最多吸收你总生命值的 15%，并为你恢复最多 20% 的最大生命值（治疗量取决于防御）。此外，你在接下来 3 秒内受到的治疗效果提高 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When enabled, allows equipping set items from your bank.\n\nItems unequipped this way will be sent to your bank."]="启用后，允许从你的银行装备套装物品。\n\n以这种方式卸下的物品将被送回你的银行。"
T["When enabled, this will show a floating display of your current zone instance. When multiple instances of a zone are available you may use it to change which instance you are currently in!"]="启用后，会以浮动显示形式展示你当前所在区域的分线。当一个区域有多个分线可用时，你可以用它来切换当前所在的分线！"
T["When you cast Conflagrate, Mind Blast, Shadowfury or Shadowburn, the cast or channel time of  your next 3 Shadow or Fire spells is reduced by 10%. Lasts 15 sec. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage of your Shadowburn by 7%."]="当你施放燃烧、心灵震爆、暗影之怒或暗影灼烧时，你接下来 3 个暗影或火焰法术的施法或引导时间缩短 10%。持续 15 秒。\r\n\r\n使你的暗影灼烧伤害提高 7%。"
T["When you gain mana from Drain Mana or Life Tap spells, your tamed pet gains 100% of the mana you gain.\r\n\r\nYour tamed pet regenerates 3% of its missing mana every 5 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="当你通过吸取法力或生命分流法术获得法力时，你的驯服宠物获得你所获法力的 100%。\r\n\r\n你的驯服宠物每 5 秒恢复其已失去法力的 3%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Whenever one of your attacks is dodged or blocked you have a 50% chance to gain 2% critical strike chance for 8 sec, stacks up to 3 times. \r\n\r\nReduces the duration of all Disarm effects used against you by 15%.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="每当你的攻击被躲闪或格挡时，你有 50% 的几率获得 2% 的爆击几率，持续 8 秒，最多叠加 3 次。\r\n\r\n使你受到的所有缴械效果的持续时间缩短 15%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Whenever one of your attacks is dodged or blocked you have a 50% chance to gain 2% critical strike chance for 8 sec, stacks up to 3 times. \r\n\r\nReduces the duration of all Disarm effects used against you by 30%.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="每当你的攻击被躲闪或格挡时，你有 50% 的几率获得 2% 的爆击几率，持续 8 秒，最多叠加 3 次。\r\n\r\n使你受到的所有缴械效果的持续时间缩短 30%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Whenever you kill an enemy that grants experience or honor, you generate up to 10 rage.  \r\n\r\nYou generate 1 rage per 5 sec while in combat."]="每当你击杀一个提供经验值或荣誉的敌人时，你最多产生 10 点怒气。\r\n\r\n战斗中你每 5 秒产生 1 点怒气。"
T["Where corruption creeps, we will answer with vigilance, patience, and Elune’s light. The roots remember us, and they will heal."]="无论腐败蔓延何处，我们都会以警觉、耐心和艾露恩之光回应。树根记得我们，它们将会治愈。"
T["Which character are you having issues on?"]="你在哪个角色上遇到了问题？"
T["While applied to target weapon it increases damage dealt by spells by 1% and spell critical strike rating by 21. This effect lasts for 2 hours.\r\n\r\nYou can only benefit from one Warlock weapon enchant at a time."]="施加于目标武器后，使法术造成的伤害提高 1%，法术爆击等级提高 21。此效果持续 2 小时。\r\n\r\n你同时只能受益于一种术士武器附魔。"
T["While applied to target weapon it increases damage dealt by spells by 1% and spell critical strike rating by 28. This effect lasts for 2 hours.\r\n\r\nYou can only benefit from one Warlock weapon enchant at a time."]="施加于目标武器后，使法术造成的伤害提高 1%，法术爆击等级提高 28。此效果持续 2 小时。\r\n\r\n你同时只能受益于一种术士武器附魔。"
T["While applied to target weapon it increases damage dealt by spells by 1% and spell critical strike rating by 35. This effect lasts for 2 hours.\r\n\r\nYou can only benefit from one Warlock weapon enchant at a time."]="施加于目标武器后，使法术造成的伤害提高 1%，法术爆击等级提高 35。此效果持续 2 小时。\r\n\r\n你同时只能受益于一种术士武器附魔。"
T["While applied to target weapon it increases damage dealt by spells by 1% and spell critical strike rating by 7. This effect lasts for 2 hours. \r\n\r\nYou can only benefit from one Warlock weapon enchant at a time."]="施加于目标武器后，使法术造成的伤害提高 1%，法术爆击等级提高 7。此效果持续 2 小时。\r\n\r\n你同时只能受益于一种术士武器附魔。"
T["While channeling, encases yourself in a barrier of blood, making you immune to interrupts, silences and stuns. Any time an enemy within 15 yards deals non-periodic damage to you, you drain their health and cause them to run in horror for 4 sec."]="引导期间，你将自己包裹在一道鲜血屏障中，使你免疫打断、沉默和昏迷。每当 15 码内的敌人对你造成非周期性伤害时，你会吸取其生命值，并使其恐惧奔逃 4 秒。"
T["While in Bear Form or Dire Bear Form, your Enrage ability increases physical damage done by 5%.\n\nWhile in Cat Form, casting Tiger's Fury restores 20 energy. \r\n\r\nReduces the mana cost of Bear Form, Cat Form, and Dire Bear Form by 20%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: The global cooldown of Cat Form and Bear Form is reduced by 0.5 sec.|r"]="处于熊形态或巨熊形态时，你的激怒技能使造成的物理伤害提高 5%。\n\n处于猎豹形态时，施放猛虎之怒恢复 20 点能量。\r\n\r\n使熊形态、猎豹形态和巨熊形态的法力消耗降低 20%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：猎豹形态和熊形态的公共冷却时间缩短 0.5 秒。|r"
T["While in Blood Presence or Frost Presence, you retain 8% increased movement speed from Unholy Presence. \r\n\r\nYour runes finish their cooldowns 5% faster in Unholy Presence."]="处于鲜血灵气或冰霜灵气时，你保留邪恶灵气带来的 8% 移动速度加成。\r\n\r\n处于邪恶灵气时，你的符文冷却速度加快 5%。"
T["While in Blood Presence or Unholy Presence, you retain 4% Stamina from Frost Presence.\r\n\r\nDamage done to you is decreased by an additional 1% in Frost Presence."]="处于鲜血灵气或邪恶灵气时，你保留冰霜灵气带来的 4% 耐力。\r\n\r\n处于冰霜灵气时，你受到的伤害额外降低 1%。"
T["While in Moonkin Form, attacks against you have an 8% chance to trigger a Frenzy, increasing your damage done by 5%. \r\n\r\nThis also grants immunity to casting pushback for Balance spells and restores 2% base mana every 2 sec. Lasts 10 sec."]="处于枭兽形态时，针对你的攻击有 8% 的几率触发狂乱，使你造成的伤害提高 5%。\r\n\r\n这还会使你的平衡法术免疫施法延迟，并每 2 秒恢复 2% 基础法力。持续 10 秒。"
T["While leveling, the [KEYWORD:Call Board] can direct you to the next [KEYWORD:Path to Ascension] quest, or the next area to level up in!"]="升级过程中，[KEYWORD:告示板]可以指引你前往下一个[KEYWORD:飞升之路]任务，或下一个适合升级的区域！"
T["While you are in Bear Form:\r\n\r\nIncreases all attributes by 2%.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance you'll be critically hit by melee attacks by 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your armor contribution from cloth and leather items by 11%."]="处于熊形态时：\r\n\r\n所有属性提高 2%。\r\n\r\n被近战攻击爆击的几率降低 2%。\r\n\r\n布甲和皮甲提供的护甲值提高 11%。"
T["While you are in Bear Form:\r\n\r\nIncreases all attributes by 4%.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance you'll be critically hit by melee attacks by 4%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your armor contribution from cloth and leather items by 22%."]="处于熊形态时：\r\n\r\n所有属性提高 4%。\r\n\r\n被近战攻击爆击的几率降低 4%。\r\n\r\n布甲和皮甲提供的护甲值提高 22%。"
T["While you are in Bear Form:\r\n\r\nIncreases all attributes by 6%.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance you'll be critically hit by melee attacks by 6%.\r\n\r\nIncreases your armor contribution from cloth and leather items by 33%."]="处于熊形态时：\r\n\r\n所有属性提高 6%。\r\n\r\n被近战攻击爆击的几率降低 6%。\r\n\r\n布甲和皮甲提供的护甲值提高 33%。"
T["While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 1% of total health every 10 sec.\r\n\r\nIncreases healing done to you and your pet by 5%.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的宠物激活期间，你和你的宠物每 10 秒恢复 1% 的总生命值。\r\n\r\n使你和你的宠物受到的治疗效果提高 5%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 2% of total health every 10 sec.\r\n\r\nIncreases healing done to you and your pet by 10%.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的宠物激活期间，你和你的宠物每 10 秒恢复 2% 的总生命值。\r\n\r\n使你和你的宠物受到的治疗效果提高 10%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
