T["Wildcard Mode"]="万能牌模式"
T["Wildcard Mode offers a unique and unpredictable adventure where your character spells, abilities, and Talents are randomly assigned as you level. This creates a constantly shifting playstyle that tests your adaptability and creativity. To help influence your build despite the unpredictability, you can use Scrolls of Fortune to reroll unwanted spells and Talents. You can also collect Skill Cards and activate them early in a build to guarantee specific spells or Talents when they become available. Skill Card collections are shared across your account, so new characters and Prestiged characters can benefit from cards you have already collected."]="万能牌模式提供一段独特而不可预测的冒险：随着你升级，角色的法术、技能和天赋会被随机分配。这造就了不断变化的玩法，考验你的适应力与创造力。为了在不可预测中影响你的构筑，你可以使用幸运卷轴重抽不想要的技能和天赋。你也可以收集技能卡，并在构筑早期激活它们，以在可用时确保获得特定技能或天赋。技能卡收藏在同一账号下共享，因此新角色和已威望重置的角色也能受益于你已收集的卡牌。"
