T["With High-Precision NamePlates enabled, NamePlates will follow their unit more accurately and far quicker.|n|nEnabling this can cause a massive decrease in Framerates."]="启用高精度姓名板后，姓名板会以更高的精度和更快的速度跟随其单位。|n|n启用此项可能导致帧率大幅下降。"
