T["Woodcutting"]="伐木"
T["Woodcutting is a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h|r, similar to a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h|r, for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Lumber gathered by woodcutters is used to complete quests and serves as an exploration-focused activity.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r or use a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn woodcutting. Once trained, you can begin gathering by locating and chopping down tree nodes found throughout the open world. After learning the skill, you’ll also unlock the 'Find Trees' function in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r, which highlights nearby tree nodes, making it much easier to spot gathering opportunities as you explore.\r\n\r\nEach log you gather can boost your woodcutting skill and yields wood materials for quest objectives. Different zones feature trees tied to level ranges, making exploration key to progression. Logs can be refined into lumber at sawmills for extra skill points. Though lumber isn't used in crafting yet, it's often needed for the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quest.\r\n\r\nTo harvest trees, you’ll need a lumber axe, which can be purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r. This tool must be in your inventory while gathering and is essential for collecting logs. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h|r (DP) or from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r for in-game gold."]="伐木是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r，类似于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在开放世界中探索并采集自然资源的玩家。伐木者采集的木材用于完成任务，也是一项以探索为主的活动。\r\n\r\n要开始，你需要拜访一位|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用一本|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习伐木。训练完成后，你就可以通过寻找并砍伐开放世界各处的树木节点来开始采集。学会该技能后，你还会在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r中解锁「寻找树木」功能，它会高亮附近的树木节点，让你在探索时更容易发现采集机会。\r\n\r\n每根采集到的原木都能提升你的伐木技能，并为任务目标提供木材材料。不同区域分布着与等级区间对应的树木，因此探索是成长的关键。原木可以在锯木厂加工成木材以获得额外技能点。虽然木材目前尚未用于制造，但|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r的日常任务常常需要它。\r\n\r\n要砍伐树木，你需要一把伐木斧，可以向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r购买。采集时必须把该工具放在背包中，它是收集原木的必需品。对于管理多个专业的人来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包格中，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
