T["You and a friend have become trapped in a nightmare, your fates now linked together. Together you must defeat the witch that cursed you into this horrible dream, or die trying. Can you defeat your nightmarish captor, or will you vanish into the nightmare forever?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:255146|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Yil'da] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 44|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="你和一位朋友被困在噩梦中，命运从此相连。你们必须合力击败那个将你们诅咒进这场可怕梦境的女巫，否则就死在尝试中。你能击败这个噩梦般的俘获者，还是会永远消失在噩梦之中？\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:255146|h你必须在达到 44 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[伊尔达] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
