T["You looted a |cff0070ddRare|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\n|cff0070ddRare|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] will make up the the largest part of a full [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant] set.\n\nThey are commonly used by players to enhance their existing spells and talents. You may have an [KEYWORD:Unlimited] amount of different |cff0070ddRare|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], but [KEYWORD:Only 3] of the same kind."]="你拾取了一个|cff0070dd稀有|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cff0070dd稀有|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]将构成整套[FEATURE:神秘附魔]的最大部分。\n\n玩家通常用它们来强化自己现有的法术和天赋。你可以拥有[KEYWORD:无限]数量的不同|cff0070dd稀有|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]，但同种[KEYWORD:只能有 3 个]。"
T["You looted a |cff1eff00Uncommon|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\n|cff1eff00Uncommon|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are the weakest in terms of power.\n\nThey are commonly used by players to complement their existing spells and [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], rather than creating a build focused on them. You may have an [KEYWORD:Unlimited] amount of different |cff1eff00Uncommon|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], but [KEYWORD:Only 3] of the same kind."]="你拾取了一个|cff1eff00优秀|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cff1eff00优秀|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]在强度上是最弱的。\n\n玩家通常用它们来补足现有的法术和[FEATURE:神秘附魔]，而不是围绕它们建立构筑。你可以拥有[KEYWORD:无限]数量的不同|cff1eff00优秀|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]，但同种[KEYWORD:只能有 3 个]。"
T["You looted a |cffa335eeEpic|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\n|cffa335eeEpic|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are the second strongest part of a [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant] set.\n\n|cffa335eeEpic|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] can modify spells, talents, provide large damage increase, or other interesting changes to your build's rotation!\n\nYou may [KEYWORD:Only have 3] different |cffa335eeEpic|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], and [KEYWORD:Only 1] of the same kind."]="你拾取了一个|cffa335ee史诗|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cffa335ee史诗|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]是[FEATURE:神秘附魔]套装中第二强的部分。\n\n|cffa335ee史诗|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]可以修改法术、天赋，提供大幅伤害提升，或为你的构筑循环带来其他有趣的变化！\n\n你[KEYWORD:只能拥有 3 个]不同的|cffa335ee史诗|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]，且同种[KEYWORD:只能有 1 个]。"
T["You looted a |cffff8000Legendary|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\n|cffff8000Legendary|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are the strongest component in a [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant] set, and provide [KEYWORD:Build Defining] changes to your spells and rotation!\n\n|cffff8000Legendary|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] Change the behaviour of your spells, talents, and provide the [KEYWORD:Largest damage increase] of any [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants]\n\nYou may [KEYWORD:Only have 1] |cffff8000Legendary|r [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants]"]="你拾取了一个|cffff8000传说|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cffff8000传说|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]是[FEATURE:神秘附魔]套装中最强的组成部分，能为你的法术和循环带来[KEYWORD:定义构筑]的改变！\n\n|cffff8000传说|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]会改变你法术和天赋的行为方式，并提供所有[FEATURE:神秘附魔]中最高的[KEYWORD:伤害提升]\n\n你[KEYWORD:只能拥有 1 个]|cffff8000传说|r[FEATURE:神秘附魔]"
T["You may find that a solution for your issue has already been posted on the Technical Support Forum, located on the Ascension site at:\n\nwww.ascension.gg\n\nIf your technical issue is not addressed by the solutions posted there, please contact our Staff:\n\nBy Discord at:  https://discord.gg/Ng3PA2z\nBy Web at: http://ascension.gg\nBy Email at:  support@ascension.gg"]="你可能会发现你的问题解决方案已发布在技术支持论坛上，该论坛位于 Ascension 网站：\n\nwww.ascension.gg\n\n如果那里发布的解决方案未能解决你的技术问题，请联系我们的工作人员：\n\nDiscord：https://discord.gg/Ng3PA2z\n网站：http://ascension.gg\n邮箱：support@ascension.gg"
