T["You prefer to get knee-deep in blood. Complete your challenge without at any point completing a quest."]="你更喜欢浴血奋战。在完全不完成任何任务的情况下完成你的挑战。"
T["You really, really enjoy running around and killing everything. You can only gain experience from killing monsters."]="你真的、真的很喜欢到处跑并杀光一切。你只能通过击杀怪物获得经验值。"
T["You received a free |cffFFFFFFBonus Card Swap!|r\nThese have a chance to occur after every Hand of Fate.\nLearning more Uncommon, Rare, Epic or Legendary spells\nwill |cffFFFFFFincrease your chance to trigger a Card Swap|r of that quality!"]="你获得了一次免费的|cffFFFFFF奖励卡牌替换！|r\n每次命运之手之后都有几率触发。\n学习更多优秀、稀有、史诗或传说法术\n将|cffFFFFFF提高你触发该品质卡牌替换的几率|r！"
T["You refuse to harm animals, because they're cute and fluffy. You deal 0 damage to beasts."]="你拒绝伤害动物，因为它们又可爱又毛茸茸。你对野兽造成 0 点伤害。"
T["You refuse to harm another person, because that's really mean. You deal 0 damage to humanoids."]="你拒绝伤害他人，因为那实在太刻薄了。你对人型生物造成 0 点伤害。"
T["You require more talent points invested in the designated specialization."]="你需要在指定专精中投入更多天赋点。"
T["You serve an ominous power. You can only gain experience from Quests or PvP."]="你侍奉着一股不祥的力量。你只能通过任务或 PvP 获得经验值。"
T["You shall serve as a lesson to the others."]="你将作为给其他人的教训。"
T["You should complete\n[QUEST:1903537] before leaving this area.\n\nYou can complete this quest by\n[ACTION:Reaching level] [KEYWORD:7]!\n\nComplete this by either doing additional [KEYWORD:Quests] or [ACTION:Kill] Monsters [KEYWORD:around your level]"]="在离开此区域之前，你应该完成\n[QUEST:1903537]。\n\n你可以通过\n[ACTION:达到等级] [KEYWORD:7] 来完成任务！\n\n你可以通过完成额外的[KEYWORD:任务]或[ACTION:击杀][KEYWORD:与你等级相近的]怪物来完成它"
T["You should probably see a doctor. You are unable to passively regenerate health."]="你大概该去看看医生了。你无法被动恢复生命值。"
T["You slept through your economics class in college, so you don't know how to buy or sell items on the Auction House."]="你在大学的经济学课上睡过去了，所以你不知道如何在拍卖行买卖物品。"
T["You start with unlocked skillcards (N) for both Tank and Healer Archetypes, you can slot these up to level 10 to guarantee abilites AND talents while leveling up to max level."]="你一开始就为坦克和治疗者两种流派解锁了技能卡（N），你可以在 10 级之前镶嵌它们，从而在升级至满级的过程中确保获得技能与天赋。"
T["You surrender your physical form to the power of the elements, transforming into a being of raw elemental energy for 15 sec. \r\n\r\nYour Stormstrike has a 30 yard range and deals extra Elemental damage.\r\n\r\nThe cooldown of Stormstrike is reset when using any Shaman Shock, Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning."]="你将肉身交给元素之力，变成为纯粹元素能量构成的存在，持续 15 秒。\r\n\r\n你的风暴打击射程为 30 码，并造成额外的元素伤害。\r\n\r\n使用任何萨满震击、闪电箭或闪电链时，风暴打击的冷却时间会被重置。"
T["You take 2% less damage from all magic.  \r\n\r\nYour Anti-Magic Shell absorbs an additional 8% of spell damage."]="你受到的所有魔法伤害降低 2%。\r\n\r\n你的反魔法护罩额外吸收 8% 的法术伤害。"
T["You think capitalism is an oppressive system, and so you cannot buy or sell items from vendors."]="你认为资本主义是压迫性的制度，因此你无法与商人买卖物品。"
T["You think durability is a pretty cool addition to modern games. You are unable to repair items, and must discard them when they break."]="你认为耐久度是现代游戏里相当酷的设定。你无法修理物品，物品损坏后只能丢弃。"
T["You think teleportation is kind of cheating, so you are unable to use your hearthstone."]="你觉得传送有点作弊，因此你无法使用你的炉石。"
T["You thirst for blood and thunder. You can only gain experience from PvP."]="你渴望鲜血与雷霆。你只能通过 PvP 获得经验值。"
T["You were born in the jungle, and want to welcome others to it. Slay King Bangalash and complete the Big Game Hunter quest before reaching level 40, then go on to finish the challenge."]="你出生在丛林中，想欢迎其他人来到这里。在达到 40 级之前击杀虎王邦加拉什并完成狩猎大师任务，然后继续完成该挑战。"
T["You weren't made very well, so taking damage reduces your movement speed. You also may secretly be a robot."]="你的制造工艺不太好，因此受到伤害会降低你的移动速度。你还可能暗地里是个机器人。"
T["You will gain:"]="你将获得："
