T["You wont have enough Talent Essence invested"]="你投入的天赋精华会不足"
T["You're Too Slow"]="你太慢了"
T["You're a little afraid of tight spaces. You cannot enter Dungeons."]="你有点害怕封闭空间。你无法进入地下城。"
T["You're changing appearances too quickly. Please wait a moment before trying again."]="你更换外观过于频繁。请稍等片刻再重试。"
T["You're don't really care about 'stuff'. You are unable to loot items."]="你不太在乎「东西」。你无法拾取物品。"
T["You're exhausted beyond belief. You cannot recieve or regenerate mana, rage, or energy in any form."]="你疲惫到难以置信的程度。你无法以任何形式获得或恢复法力、怒气或能量。"
T["You're famous, incredible, critically acclaimed! The pressure from all eyes on you means any ability now has a chance to critically strike you."]="你声名远扬、令人惊叹、广受赞誉！众人目光带来的压力意味着任何技能现在都有几率对你造成爆击。"
T["You're in danger! You take increased damage."]="你身处危险之中！你受到的伤害提高。"
T["You're interested in a real challenge. You can only gain kill credit on monsters of a higher level than you."]="你对真正的挑战很感兴趣。你只能从等级高于你的怪物身上获得击杀计数。"
T["You're just really, really sleepy. You have a fatigue bar, and it drains every second you're not in a rested area. If it hits 0, you fall asleep and never wake up."]="你只是真的、真的很困。你有一条疲劳条，只要不在休息区域，它就会每秒消耗。如果它降到 0，你就会睡去，再也醒不过来。"
T["You're narcaleptic, but you're a real do-it-yourself kinda' person. Leaving a rested area causes you to become Fatigued. If the bar runs out, you fall asleep forever."]="你患有嗜睡症，但你是个真正凡事靠自己的人。离开休息区域会使你陷入疲劳。如果疲劳条耗尽，你将永远睡去。"
T["You're not really a 'people person'. You are unable to group with other players."]="你不太擅长与人打交道。你无法与其他玩家组队。"
T["You're old and your bones are brittle. If you fall any distance, you might die."]="你年迈且骨质疏松。从任何高度摔落都可能让你丧命。"
T["You're plagued by nightmares, so sleeping is hard. You take increased damage, and are Fatigued outside of rested areas."]="你饱受噩梦折磨，因此难以入眠。你受到的伤害提高，且在休息区域之外会处于疲劳状态。"
T["You're really helpful, and also a really nice person. You only gain experience from completing quests and helping the citizens of Azeroth."]="你非常乐于助人，也是个非常好心的人。你只能通过完成任务和帮助艾泽拉斯的居民获得经验值。"
T["You're scared of blood, especially your own. When you have less than full health, you'll lose health every second because of how scared you are."]="你害怕血，尤其是自己的血。当你的生命值未满时，你会因为过度恐惧而每秒损失生命值。"
T["You're secretly a necromancer, but you don't know it. Enemies you slay have a chance to reanimate."]="你暗地里是个死灵法师，但你自己并不知道。你击杀的敌人有几率复活。"
T["You're sick of the people of Azeroth and their requests. You are unable to do any quests. "]="你受够了艾泽拉斯的人们和他们的请求。你无法进行任何任务。 "
T["You're way too good at the game to need gear. You are unable to equip items higher than common rarity. White knight powers, activate!"]="你游戏水平太高，根本不需要装备。你无法装备高于普通品质的物品。白骑士之力，启动！"
T["You've Entered High-Risk PvP"]="你已进入高风险 PvP"
T["You've Entered High-Risk: |cff00FF00Tier 1|r"]="你已进入高风险：|cff00FF00第 1 阶|r"
T["You've Entered High-Risk: |cffFF0000Tier 3|r"]="你已进入高风险：|cffFF0000第 3 阶|r"
T["You've Entered High-Risk: |cffFFFF00Tier 2|r"]="你已进入高风险：|cffFFFF00第 2 阶|r"
T["You've accepted a [KEYWORD:Collect Quest].\n\nThis quest requires you to collect certain items to complete it."]="你接受了一个[KEYWORD:收集任务]。\n\n此任务要求你收集特定物品才能完成。"
T["You've accepted a [KEYWORD:Kill Quest].\n\nThis quest requires you to defeat a certain amount of monsters to complete it."]="你接受了一个[KEYWORD:击杀任务]。\n\n此任务要求你击败一定数量的怪物才能完成。"
T["You've collected this appearance, but not from this item"]="你已收集此外观，但不是来自此物品"
T["You've done us here in Auberdine a great service, lass.  We'll make sure that their effects are properly taken care of.\n\nAs for you, please have this.  It is the least I can do for someone with the bravery to set things right."]="姑娘，你在奥伯丁帮了我们大忙。我们会确保妥善处理它们的影响。\n\n至于你，请收下这个。对于有勇气拨乱反正的人来说，这是我能做的最起码的事。"
T["You've earned |n|cffFFFF00[Ability Essence]|r! by leveling up! Click here to learn a new ability!"]="你通过升级获得了|n|cffFFFF00[技能精华]|r！点击此处学习一个新技能！"
T["You've exchanged your lungs for a pair of gills! Not only this, but a terrible nightmare now hangs over you... Retreat to the water to replenish your breath, while suffering from increased damage taken! "]="你把肺换成了一对鳃！不仅如此，一场可怕的噩梦如今笼罩着你……退回水中补充呼吸，同时承受更高的伤害！ "
T["You've exchanged your lungs for a pair of gills! You'll have to retreat to the water for air, or risk suffocating! Level through Azeroth as a fish person, adventuring only where it's wet. "]="你把肺换成了一对鳃！你必须退回水中呼吸，否则就有窒息的风险！以鱼人身份在艾泽拉斯升级，只在有水的地方冒险。 "
T["You've gained |cffFFFF00experience|r! You'll |cffFFFF00level up|r when this bar is filled"]="你获得了|cffFFFF00经验值|r！当此条填满时你将|cffFFFF00升级|r"
T["You've learned a new spell!\n\nYou should put this spell on your action bar so you can use it!"]="你学会了一个新法术！\n\n你应该把这个法术放到动作条上，以便使用它！"
T["You've looted a [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant!]\n\n[FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are an important part of your character's late game power.\n\n[FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] can be obtained in several ways."]="你拾取了一个[FEATURE:神秘附魔！]\n\n[FEATURE:神秘附魔]是你角色后期实力的重要组成部分。\n\n[FEATURE:神秘附魔]可以通过多种方式获得。"
T["You've reached a new checkpoint! You are now able to enter the manastorm from this level in the future!"]="你到达了一个新的检查点！今后你可以从该等级进入法力风暴！"
T["You've seen it all anyway. You are unable to leave the continent you start on."]="反正你什么都见过了。你无法离开你起始所在的大陆。"
T["You've slain a turkey. Beware."]="你击杀了一只火鸡。小心点。"
T["You've stopped breathing..."]="你已经停止了呼吸……"
T["You've suddenly entered a terrible Nightmare: As the newest member of the D.E.H.T.A organization, you swear to protect animal wildlife at all costs. To prove your worth to the cause, you're tasked with slaying 5 Venture Company leaders. \n \nDue to your newly found D.E.H.T.A beliefs, you refuse to harm beasts or critters of any kind, and killing one will cause you to instantly lose your membership status. Furthermore, pets of any kind (even demons) would be considered cruel enslavement.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3051|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Supervisor Fizsprocket] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 13|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3471|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Tinkerer Sniggles] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 15|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9336|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Boss Copperplug] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 18|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7288|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 22|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4202|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 26|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h"]="你突然陷入了一场可怕的噩梦：作为 D.E.H.T.A 组织的最新成员，你发誓不惜一切代价保护野生动物。为了向这一事业证明自己的价值，你的任务是击杀 5 位风险投资公司首领。\n\n由于你新近信奉的 D.E.H.T.A 信念，你拒绝伤害任何野兽或小动物，杀死一只就会立即失去成员身份。此外，任何宠物（哪怕是恶魔）都会被视为残酷的奴役。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3051|h你必须在达到 13 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[主管菲兹斯普洛科特] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3471|h你必须在达到 15 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[工匠斯尼格斯] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9336|h你必须在达到 18 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[铜栓老大] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7288|h你必须在达到 22 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[大工头普兹克·加里维克斯] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4202|h你必须在达到 26 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[格雷恩佐·扳哨] |cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
T["You've used all of your rerolls for this specialization."]="你已经用完了此专精的所有重抽次数。"
T["Your AddOns are experiencing a large number of errors and may be slowing down the game. \n\n3rd party AddOns can cause FPS, lag, and crashing issues. Please try to use AddOns from the Ascension Launcher when possible."]="你的插件正在产生大量错误，可能会拖慢游戏。\n\n第三方插件可能导致帧率、延迟和崩溃问题。请尽量使用 Ascension 启动器提供的插件。"
T["Your Faerie Fire spell also increases the chance the target will be hit by spell attacks by 1%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the critical strike chance of your damage spells by 1% on targets afflicted by Faerie Fire."]="你的精灵之火法术还会使目标被法术攻击命中的几率提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你受精灵之火影响的目标身上的伤害法术爆击几率提高 1%。"
T["Your Faerie Fire spell also increases the chance the target will be hit by spell attacks by 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the critical strike chance of your damage spells by 2% on targets afflicted by Faerie Fire."]="你的精灵之火法术还会使目标被法术攻击命中的几率提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你受精灵之火影响的目标身上的伤害法术爆击几率提高 2%。"
T["Your Faerie Fire spell also increases the chance the target will be hit by spell attacks by 3%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the critical strike chance of your damage spells by 3% on targets afflicted by Faerie Fire."]="你的精灵之火法术还会使目标被法术攻击命中的几率提高 3%。\r\n\r\n使你受精灵之火影响的目标身上的伤害法术爆击几率提高 3%。"
T["Your Felhunter regains 4% of its maximum mana each time it hits with its Shadow Bite ability and the cooldown on that ability is reduced by 2 sec. \r\n\r\nIn addition, the effect of your Felhunter's Fel Intelligence is increased by 5%."]="你的地狱猎犬每次以暗影撕咬命中时，都会恢复其最大法力的 4%，且该技能的冷却时间缩短 2 秒。\r\n\r\n此外，你地狱猎犬的邪能智力效果提高 5%。"
T["Your Frost and Shadow damage heals you for 2% of the damage dealt.\r\n\r\nIncreases Frost and Shadow damage done by 2%."]="你的冰霜和暗影伤害会为你恢复造成伤害的 2%。\r\n\r\n使你造成的冰霜和暗影伤害提高 2%。"
T["Your Holy Shock critical effects reduce the cast time of your next Flash of Light by 0.75 sec, or increases the critical chance and critical heal effect of your next Holy Light by 10%.\r\n\r\nIn addition, causes your Flash of Light to heal targets with Sacred Shield for an additional 50% over 12 sec."]="你的神圣震击的爆击效果会使你下一个圣光闪现的施法时间缩短 0.75 秒，或使你下一个圣光术的爆击几率和爆击治疗效果提高 10%。\r\n\r\n此外，使你的圣光闪现对带有圣洁护盾的目标在 12 秒内额外恢复 50% 的生命值。"
T["Your Mind Blast, Mind Flay and Mind Sear gain an additional 10% of your bonus spell damage effects.\r\n\r\nYour Shadow Word: Pain, Mind Flay and Vampiric Touch spells increase the chance for harmful spells to hit by 2% lasting 24 sec."]="你的心灵震爆、精神鞭笞和心灵灼烧额外获得你法术伤害加成的 10%。\r\n\r\n你的暗言术：痛、精神鞭笞和吸血鬼之触法术使有害法术的命中几率提高 2%，持续 24 秒。"
T["Your Mind Blast, Mind Flay and Mind Sear gain an additional 15% of your bonus spell damage effects.\r\n\r\nYour Shadow Word: Pain, Mind Flay and Vampiric Touch spells increase the chance for harmful spells to hit by 3% lasting 24 sec."]="你的心灵震爆、精神鞭笞和心灵灼烧额外获得你法术伤害加成的 15%。\r\n\r\n你的暗言术：痛、精神鞭笞和吸血鬼之触法术使有害法术的命中几率提高 3%，持续 24 秒。"
T["Your Mind Blast, Mind Flay and Mind Sear gain an additional 5% of your bonus spell damage effects.\r\n\r\nYour Shadow Word: Pain, Mind Flay and Vampiric Touch spells increase the chance for harmful spells to hit by 1% lasting 24 sec."]="你的心灵震爆、精神鞭笞和心灵灼烧额外获得你法术伤害加成的 5%。\r\n\r\n你的暗言术：痛、精神鞭笞和吸血鬼之触法术使有害法术的命中几率提高 1%，持续 24 秒。"
T["Your Spirit is increased by 10% for 12 sec after you critically heal with Flash Heal, Greater Heal, or Binding Heal, or critically hit with Holy Fire or Smite. \r\n\r\nGreater Heal, Flash Heal, Binding Heal, and Circle of Healing have a 33% chance to extend the duration of your Renew on all nearby party and raid members by 3 sec, up to an additional 6 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="当你以圣光闪现、强效治疗术或联结治疗造成爆击治疗，或以神圣之火或惩击造成爆击后，你的精神提高 10%，持续 12 秒。\r\n\r\n强效治疗术、圣光闪现、联结治疗和治疗之环有 33% 的几率使你附近所有小队和团队成员身上的恢复持续时间延长 3 秒，最多额外延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your Spirit is increased by 20% for 12 sec after you critically heal with Flash Heal, Greater Heal, or Binding Heal, or critically hit with Holy Fire or Smite. \r\n\r\nGreater Heal, Flash Heal, Binding Heal, and Circle of Healing have a 66% chance to extend the duration of your Renew on all nearby party and raid members by 3 sec, up to an additional 6 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="当你以圣光闪现、强效治疗术或联结治疗造成爆击治疗，或以神圣之火或惩击造成爆击后，你的精神提高 20%，持续 12 秒。\r\n\r\n强效治疗术、圣光闪现、联结治疗和治疗之环有 66% 的几率使你附近所有小队和团队成员身上的恢复持续时间延长 3 秒，最多额外延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your Spirit is increased by 30% for 12 sec after you critically heal with Flash Heal, Greater Heal, or Binding Heal, or critically hit with Holy Fire or Smite. \r\n\r\nGreater Heal, Flash Heal, Binding Heal, and Circle of Healing have a 100% chance to extend the duration of your Renew on all nearby party and raid members by 3 sec, up to an additional 6 sec.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="当你以圣光闪现、强效治疗术或联结治疗造成爆击治疗，或以神圣之火或惩击造成爆击后，你的精神提高 30%，持续 12 秒。\r\n\r\n强效治疗术、圣光闪现、联结治疗和治疗之环有 100% 的几率使你附近所有小队和团队成员身上的恢复持续时间延长 3 秒，最多额外延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your Stormstrike has a 50% chance to deal an additional 25% weapon damage as Fire when you have a weapon imbued with Flametongue and an additional 25% weapon damage as Frost when you have a weapon imbued with Frostbrand. \r\n\r\nThere is a 50% chance after casting Stormstrike that your auto-attacks will deal an additional 0 Nature damage for 8 sec."]="当你的武器附有火舌效果时，你的风暴打击有 50% 的几率额外造成 25% 的武器伤害，类型为火焰伤害；当你的武器附有冰封效果时，额外造成 25% 的武器伤害，类型为冰霜伤害。\r\n\r\n施放风暴打击后有 50% 的几率使你的自动攻击在 8 秒内额外造成 0 点自然伤害。"
T["Your Strength is increased by 2%.\r\n\r\nThe cost of your Mind Freeze is reduced by 10 rage."]="你的力量提高 2%。\r\n\r\n你的心灵冰冻消耗降低 10 点怒气。"
T["Your [SPELL:Hearthstone] is an item in your backpack which can return you to an [KEYWORD:Inn] you've set as your home!\n\n[ACTION:Speak with the Innkeeper]\nand select\n[ACTION:Make this inn your home]."]="你的[SPELL:炉石]是背包中的一件物品，可以让你返回设为家的[KEYWORD:旅店]！\n\n[ACTION:与旅店老板交谈]\n并选择\n[ACTION:将这家旅店设为你的家]。"
T["Your ability to create support tickets has been suspended. Please try again later."]="你创建支持工单的权限已被暂停。请稍后重试。"
T["Your about section is too long."]="你的简介部分过长。"
T["Your about section is too short."]="你的简介部分过短。"
T["Your active specialization is prestige locked."]="你的当前专精已被威望锁定。"
T["Your armor checks out, but your strength...? We'll see."]="你的护甲没问题，但你的力量……？我们走着瞧。"
T["Your attack speed is increased by 30%, but all damage taken is increased by 10%. Your next 3 non-periodic Warrior abilities have an additional 100% to critically hit, 3 yards extra range and will cause you to charge toward your enemy if not in melee range already. Lasts for 8 sec.\r\n\r\nCharges are not consumed versus monsters.\r\n\r\nWhile active, the duration of stun and movement impairing effects on you is reduced by 50%."]="你的攻击速度提高 30%，但受到的所有伤害提高 10%。你接下来 3 个非周期性战士技能的爆击几率额外提高 100%，射程增加 3 码，且若你不在近战范围内，会令你冲向敌人。持续 8 秒。\r\n\r\n对怪物不会消耗充能。\r\n\r\n激活期间，你身上昏迷和移动限制效果的持续时间缩短 50%。"
T["Your attacks to ignore up to 3% of your target's Armor.\r\n\r\nIncreases the damage dealt by your Rupture ability by 10%."]="你的攻击可以无视目标最多 3% 的护甲。\r\n\r\n使你的割裂技能造成的伤害提高 10%。"
T["Your attacks to ignore up to 6% of your target's Armor.\r\n\r\nIncreases the damage dealt by your Rupture ability by 20%."]="你的攻击可以无视目标最多 6% 的护甲。\r\n\r\n使你的割裂技能造成的伤害提高 20%。"
T["Your attacks to ignore up to 9% of your target's Armor.\r\n\r\nIncreases the damage dealt by your Rupture ability by 30%."]="你的攻击可以无视目标最多 9% 的护甲。\r\n\r\n使你的割裂技能造成的伤害提高 30%。"
T["Your bags are full! Click here or press |cffFFFF00(B)|r to open your |cffFFFF00bags|r"]="你的背包已满！点击此处或按|cffFFFF00(B)|r打开你的|cffFFFF00背包|r"
T["Your blood is delicious. Enemies steal some of your health whenever they deal damage to you."]="你的血很美味。敌人每次对你造成伤害时都会偷取你的一部分生命值。"
T["Your challenges prevent you from resurrecting, and you do not possess an Iron Soul."]="你的挑战使你无法复活，而且你没有钢铁之魂。"
T["Your class cannot do that."]="你的职业无法这么做。"
T["Your class cannot learn this"]="你的职业无法学习这个"
T["Your class specialization that is used when giving you specialized loot. \"Default\" is your current specialization."]="在给予你专精战利品时使用的职业专精。\"默认\"即为你当前的专精。"
T["Your critical healing spells heal for an additional 10% of the healed amount over 12 seconds.\r\n\r\nSheath of Light is doubled for Single Target heals."]="你的爆击治疗法术会在 12 秒内额外恢复治疗量的 10%。\r\n\r\n圣光之鞘对单体治疗的效果翻倍。"
T["Your critical strikes from Rogue abilities that add combo points have a 100% chance to add an additional combo point. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by Eviscerate, Rupture, Deadly Throw and Crimson Tempest by 10%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Consuming Cold Blood with a finishing move has a 20% chance per combo point to increase your movement speed by 70% for 4 sec."]="你的潜行者连击点数技能的爆击有 100% 的几率额外增加一个连击点数。\r\n\r\n使你的剔骨、割裂、致命投掷和猩红风暴造成的伤害提高 10%。\n\n巅峰奖励：以终结技消耗冷血时，每点连击点数有 20% 的几率使你的移动速度提高 70%，持续 4 秒。"
T["Your critical strikes from Rogue abilities that add combo points have a 33% chance to add an additional combo point. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by Eviscerate, Rupture, Deadly Throw and Crimson Tempest by 4%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Consuming Cold Blood with a finishing move has a 20% chance per combo point to increase your movement speed by 70% for 4 sec.|r"]="你的潜行者连击点数技能的爆击有 33% 的几率额外增加一个连击点数。\r\n\r\n使你的剔骨、割裂、致命投掷和猩红风暴造成的伤害提高 4%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：以终结技消耗冷血时，每点连击点数有 20% 的几率使你的移动速度提高 70%，持续 4 秒。|r"
T["Your critical strikes from Rogue abilities that add combo points have a 66% chance to add an additional combo point. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by Eviscerate, Rupture, Deadly Throw and Crimson Tempest by 7%.\n\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Consuming Cold Blood with a finishing move has a 20% chance per combo point to increase your movement speed by 70% for 4 sec.|r"]="你的潜行者连击点数技能的爆击有 66% 的几率额外增加一个连击点数。\r\n\r\n使你的剔骨、割裂、致命投掷和猩红风暴造成的伤害提高 7%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：以终结技消耗冷血时，每点连击点数有 20% 的几率使你的移动速度提高 70%，持续 4 秒。|r"
