T["Your ranged and melee critical strikes cause your tamed beast to generate 25 Focus.\r\n\r\nDominate undead, enslaved demon or tamed dragonkin generate 25 Energy.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的远程和近战爆击会使你驯服的野兽产生 25 点集中值。\r\n\r\n被支配的亡灵、被奴役的恶魔或被驯服的龙类产生 25 点能量。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your ranged and melee critical strikes cause your tamed beast to generate 50 Focus.\r\n\r\nDominate undead, enslaved demon or tamed dragonkin generate 50 Energy.\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的远程和近战爆击会使你驯服的野兽产生 50 点集中值。\r\n\r\n被支配的亡灵、被奴役的恶魔或被驯服的龙类产生 50 点能量。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your soul is captured."]="你的灵魂已被捕获。"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Dealing direct critical damage with a spell while your mana is below 50% taps into raw power, restoring 1% of your total mana each second and increasing your magic damage by 4% and Arcane damage by another 2%. This effect lasts for 15 seconds and can only occur once every 30 seconds.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 的伤害。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：当你的法力低于 50% 时，用法术造成直接爆击伤害会汲取原始力量，每秒恢复你总法力的 1%，并使你的魔法伤害提高 4%，奥术伤害再额外提高 2%。此效果持续 15 秒，且每 30 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Increases your Fire and Shadow damage done by 2%. This effect is quadrupled against targets above 75% health.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 的伤害。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：使你造成的火焰和暗影伤害提高 2%。对生命值高于 75% 的目标，此效果提升为四倍。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: The final rank of this talent increases damage against frozen targets by 6%.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 的伤害。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：此天赋的最终等级使对冰冻目标的伤害提高 6%。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Holy damaging spell critical strikes have a 50% chance to increase magic damage done by 5% for 6 seconds.\r\n\r\nThis effect can only occur once every 8 seconds.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 的伤害。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：你的神圣伤害法术爆击有 50% 的几率使造成的魔法伤害提高 5%，持续 6 秒。\r\n\r\n此效果每 8 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Nature damage is increased by 6% and other magic damage increased by 3% while Clearcasting from Elemental Focus is active.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 的伤害。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：当元素专注提供的清晰施法生效时，你的自然伤害提高 6%，其他魔法伤害提高 3%。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAACapstone Bonus: Your Shadow and Holy periodic damage effects have a 30% chance to make the target vulnerable to your power, increasing their Magic damage taken from you by 4% for 4 seconds.|r\n\n|cff00DDFFHold SHIFT for more information|r"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 的伤害。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰奖励：你的暗影和神圣持续伤害效果有 30% 的几率使目标对你的力量变得脆弱，使其受到你的魔法伤害提高 4%，持续 4 秒。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
