T["You’re either lost or looking for trouble, stranger. Either way, welcome to Blackthorn Garrison… the last place anyone wants to be stationed.\n\nWhy are we here? Because Duskwood ain't getting any safer, that’s why. The Night Watch does what it can, but this place? It needs more than a few torches and sharp sticks to keep the horrors out. We’re here to keep the nightmares from spilling into Elwynn.\n\nThe fence? You’d think it’s to keep things out, but truth is… it’s just as much to keep things in."]="你要么是迷路了，要么是来找麻烦的，陌生人。不管怎样，欢迎来到黑棘要塞……没人愿意被派驻的最后一个地方。\n\n我们为什么在这儿？因为暮色森林越来越不安全了，就是这么回事。守夜人已经尽力了，但这地方？光靠几支火把和尖木棍可挡不住那些恐怖之物。我们在这里是为了不让噩梦蔓延到艾尔文森林。\n\n那道栅栏？你以为是用來挡住外面的东西，但事实上……它同样是为了把里面的东西关住。"
