T["[ACTION:Left-Click] the item slots you wish to protect\n\n[KEYWORD:Protected] slots will prevent the equipped item from dropping on death in [KEYWORD:High-Risk PvP]\n\nYou will instead [KEYWORD:Drop Gold] proportional to the item protected."]="[ACTION:左键点击]你想要保护的物品栏位\n\n[KEYWORD:受保护]的栏位可防止已装备的物品在高风险 PvP 中因死亡而掉落\n\n作为替代，你将[KEYWORD:掉落金币]，数量与受保护的物品成正比。"
