T["[ACTION:Spend] your [KEYWORD:Ability Essence] on [ACTION:Learning] abilities by [ACTION:Left-Clicking] on the spell's icon\n\nYou may choose spells from another class by clicking the class icons at the top of the frame.\n\nYou can choose spells from a classes specialization using the tabs in the top left."]="通过[ACTION:左键点击]法术图标，[ACTION:花费]你的[KEYWORD:技能精华]来[ACTION:学习]技能\n\n你可以点击框架顶部的职业图标，从其他职业选择法术。\n\n你可以使用左上角的标签页，从某个职业的专精中选择法术。"
T["[ACTION:Talk] to the\n[NPC:Book of Ascension]\nand select\n[ACTION:Train Me]\n\nThen train the new rank of your spell(s)!"]="[ACTION:与]\n[NPC:飞升之书]交谈\n并选择\n[ACTION:训练我]\n\n然后训练你法术的新等级！"
T["[ACTION:Use] the [SPELL:Bloody Jar] on an item to convert it to a [KEYWORD:Bloodforged] item.\n\n[KEYWORD:REMEMBER] The item will lose it's Mystic Enchants, Random Attributes, Gems, and Enchants.\n\nHeroic, Mythic, Mythic+ and Ascensded items will be converted to their lowest tier counterpart."]="对一件物品[ACTION:使用][SPELL:血腥之罐]，将其转化为[KEYWORD:鲜血铸造]物品。\n\n[KEYWORD:切记]该物品将失去其神秘附魔、随机属性、宝石和附魔。\n\n英雄、史诗、史诗+和飞升物品将被转化为其最低层级的对应物品。"
