T["[GRATS:Great Choices!]\nRemember, you can always change your spells and talents at any time.\n\nYou can change them for free before [KEYWORD:level 10]!"]="[GRATS:不错的选择！]\n记住，你随时都可以更换你的法术和天赋。\n\n在 [KEYWORD:10 级] 之前你可以免费更换！"
T["[GRATS:Great job!]\n\nYou have just allocated your primary stat!\n\nWhen you level up, you will gain points in that stat!\n\nYou can change your stat at anytime.\n\n"]="[GRATS:干得好！]\n\n你刚刚分配了你的主属性！\n\n当你升级时，你会获得该属性的点数！\n\n你随时可以更改你的属性。\n\n"
T["[GRATS:Great job!]\n\nYou have just allocated your primary stat!\n\nWhen you level up, you will gain points in that stat!\n\nYou can change your stat at anytime.\n\nTo continue, complete the quest at [NPC:Beginner's Book of Ascension]"]="[GRATS:干得好！]\n\n你刚刚分配了你的主属性！\n\n当你升级时，你会获得该属性的点数！\n\n你随时可以更改你的属性。\n\n"
T["[GRATS:Great job!]\n\nYou have just allocated your primary stat!\n\nWhen you level up, you will gain points in that stat!\n\nYou can change your stat at anytime.\n\nTo continue, complete the quest at [NPC:Undertaker Mordo]"]="[GRATS:干得好！]\n\n你刚刚分配了你的主属性！\n\n当你升级时，你会获得该属性的点数！\n\n你随时可以更改你的属性。\n\n如需继续，请在 [NPC:Beginner's Book of Ascension] 处完成任务"
