T["[KEYWORD:Bloodforging] allows you to convert PvE gear, and soulbound PvP gear into unbound PvP gear\n\nThis means you can sell and buy [KEYWORD:Bloodforged] items on the [KEYWORD:Auction House].\n\n[KEYWORD:Bloodforging] will [KEYWORD:remove] Mystic Enchants, Random Attributes, Gems, and Enchants."]="[KEYWORD:血铸] 允许你将 PvE 装备和灵魂绑定的 PvP 装备转换为非绑定的 PvP 装备\n\n这意味着你可以在 [KEYWORD:拍卖行] 上买卖 [KEYWORD:血铸] 物品。\n\n[KEYWORD:血铸] [KEYWORD:将移除] 神秘附魔、随机属性、宝石和附魔。"
