T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\InPersonInvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>An invasion is a periodic World Event that spawns throughout Azeroth and scales to how many players are near the zone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To find an invasion, you can look on your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r or ask in World Chat if one is currently up.</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Worldmaplegioninvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>To complete an invasion, you must kill the Final Boss. Once entering an invasion, a percentage completion counter will appear. Once this counter reaches 100% the final boss will appear.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\InPersonInvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>入侵是一种定期的世界事件，会在艾泽拉斯各处出现，并根据区域附近的玩家数量进行调整。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>要找到入侵，你可以查看你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r，或在世界聊天中询问当前是否有入侵进行中。</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Worldmaplegioninvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>要完成入侵，你必须击杀最终首领。进入入侵后，会出现一个完成度百分比计数器。当该计数器达到 100% 时，最终首领就会出现。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Level70:2:1}\r\n<p>Continue your journey in Outlands and acquire enough |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r to reach level 70.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Find a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 70.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Level70:2:1}\r\n<p>继续你的外域之旅，获取足够的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 以到达 70 级。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>随着你不断升级，你将需要前往新的区域，寻找更接近你等级的任务和生物，以继续获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会将视角拉远至整体的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r。将鼠标悬停在当前区域周围的地区上，你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>找到与你等级相符的区域并前往那里，发现新的任务并继续你前往 70 级的旅程。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\101_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Level 60!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Continue traveling to new zones to find new quests and more challenging creatures to continue gaining |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nCheck the Path to Ascension menu often for new quests as you level up! Completing Paths to Ascension will grant you rewards as well as ensure you reach the heights of your power while exploring the world and gaining levels!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\101_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到 60 级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>继续前往新的区域，寻找新的任务和更具挑战性的生物，以继续获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n升级时请经常查看飞升之路菜单中的新任务！完成飞升之路会为你提供奖励，并确保你在探索世界和升级的过程中达到力量的巅峰！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Your Tamed Beast has Pet Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You've gained your first Pet Talent Point! These are earned every 4 levels starting at level 20.<br/><br/>\r\nRight-click your Pet's Portrait, Select Pet Talents, then click any talent to learn it!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Empower Your Tamed Beast with Pet Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each Tamed Beast type has a different Pet Talent tree! Only Tamed Beasts have Pet Talents.<br/><br/>\r\nThe Beast Mastery talent located in the Beast Mastery Talent Tree grants an additional 6 Pet Talent Points.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你的驯服野兽拥有宠物天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你获得了第一个宠物天赋点！从 20 级开始，每 4 级可获得一个。<br/><br/>\r\n右键点击你的宠物头像，选择宠物天赋，然后点击任意天赋即可学习！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\105_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用宠物天赋强化你的驯服野兽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每种驯服野兽都有不同的宠物天赋树！只有驯服野兽拥有宠物天赋。<br/><br/>\r\n位于野兽控制天赋树中的野兽控制天赋会额外提供 6 点宠物天赋点。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Item Level Shows Your Gear Power!!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The first step to improving your power at end-game is to improve your gear. It's time to start replacing your leveling gear with max level gear!<br/><br/>\r\nMouse over any piece of gear to see the item level. This is a good general measurement of gear's power.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can view your Average Item Level in your character sheet. This is an approximation of how strong your gear is!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Upgrade Gear - Increase Your Item Level!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>There are many paths to upgrading your gear:<br/>\r\n•Complete Dungeons<br/>\r\n•Quest in Max Level Zones<br/>\r\n•Enter the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r<br/>\r\n•Complete |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">物品等级体现你的装备强度！！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在满级阶段提升实力的第一步就是提升你的装备。是时候开始把升级期的装备换成满级装备了！<br/><br/>\r\n将鼠标悬停在任意一件装备上即可查看物品等级。这是衡量装备强度的一个很好的总体指标。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在角色信息面板中查看你的平均物品等级。它大致反映了你装备的强力程度！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">升级装备 - 提高你的物品等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>提升装备的途径有很多：<br/>\r\n•完成地下城<br/>\r\n•在满级区域做任务<br/>\r\n•进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r<br/>\r\n•完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Travel Faster!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r greatly increase your movement speed! They can only be used outdoors.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>Seek out a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r to receive your first Mount for free!<br/><br/>Select Start Quest and the nearest |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r will be tracked in your Quest Objectives and as a Yellow ? on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>You will receive a Mount in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r after completing the Novice Rider quest at the Traveling |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r.<br/><br/>Open your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r and use the Mount to learn it.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">旅行得更快！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 会大幅提高你的移动速度！它们只能在户外使用。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>寻找一位 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 免费获得你的第一只坐骑！<br/><br/>选择开始任务后，最近的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 会被追踪在你的任务目标中，并在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上显示为黄色问号。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>在巡回 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 处完成新手骑手任务后，你会在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 中收到一只坐骑。<br/><br/>打开你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 并使用该坐骑来学习它。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Choose Your Raiding Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Raids allow for mistakes and are perfect for practicing fight mechanics without high pressure.<br/><br/>\r\nRight-click your character portrait to set your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Difficulty.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can complete Normal Raids with beginner gear and builds. They are often advertised in Global Chat and are designed for pickup groups, offering Epic Gear rewards!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Normal Raids Require No Attunements or Keys!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Raids are immediately accessible—you can enter them right now!<br/><br/>\r\nThere are no attunements, quests, keys, or other prerequisites before entering a Normal Difficulty |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\normalraids2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Raids Adapt to 10-25 Players</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Raids are entry-level PvE content that adapt their difficulty to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r size, requiring at least 10 players and allowing up to 25.<br/><br/>\r\nThey drop more loot and are easier to complete with more players!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r Loot Lockouts Instead of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Locks</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You are not locked to a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r ID on Ascension. You can join as many raids as you want but are only eligible to loot each boss once.<br/><br/>\r\nThis means you can join an in-progress |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r and return later for bosses you missed.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you need to leave or your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r disbands, you can join a new one and still get loot from any boss you have not already defeated!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">选择你的团队副本难度！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通团队副本允许犯错，非常适合在没有太大压力的情况下练习战斗机制。<br/><br/>\r\n右键点击你的角色头像即可设置 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 难度。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以用新手装备和构筑完成普通团队副本。它们经常在世界聊天中招募，是为临时队伍设计的，并提供史诗装备奖励！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">普通团队副本无需调和或钥匙！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通团队副本可以立即进入——你现在就能进去！<br/><br/>\r\n进入普通难度的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 之前，无需调和、任务、钥匙或其他前置条件。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\normalraids2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">团队副本可适应 10-25 名玩家</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通团队副本是入门级的 PvE 内容，其难度会根据你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 规模调整，至少需要 10 名玩家，最多允许 25 名。<br/><br/>\r\n玩家人数越多，掉落的战利品越多，也越容易完成！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 战利品锁定取代 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 锁定</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在飞升，你不会被锁定在某个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r ID 上。你可以加入任意数量的团队副本，但每个首领只能拾取一次战利品。<br/><br/>\r\n这意味着你可以加入一个进行中的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r，之后再来击杀错过的首领。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你需要离开，或你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍解散，你可以加入新的团队，仍然能从任何你尚未击杀过的首领身上获得战利品。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\18_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Heroic Raiding - Heroic Loot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Raids drop Heroic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Gear! This is the same loot that drops from Normal Raids, but stronger!<br/><br/>\r\nHeroic Raids build on everything you learned in Normal Raids. Boss mechanics deal more damage, and ignoring them will almost always lead to death!<br/><br/>\r\nIt's helpful to have maxed PvE Power and Mystic Enchants that compliment your build.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\18_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">英雄团队副本 - 英雄战利品！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄团队副本掉落英雄 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 装备！这与普通团队副本掉落的战利品相同，但更强大！<br/><br/>\r\n英雄团队副本建立你在普通团队副本中学到的一切之上。首领的机制会造成更高伤害，忽视它们几乎总会导致死亡！<br/><br/>\r\n拥有满级的 PvE 能量和与你的构筑相配的神秘附魔会很有帮助。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Resurrect in a safe spot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When your character dies, a small menu will appear on your screen. You’ll have the option to view the Death Recap to see what caused your death or check the Combat Log in your chat window for a more detailed breakdown. <br/><br/>\r\nTo continue, click 'Release Spirit' to become a ghost, where you can begin the process of reviving your character.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">In the Spirit World, there are several ways to revive!</h1>\r\n<p>Player Resurrection: Nearby players can cast resurrection spells (Revive, Redemption, Rebirth) allowing you to revive at their location. <br/><br/>\r\n\r\nReturn to Corpse: As a ghost, run back to your body and click the prompt to revive. Click 'Return to Graveyard' if you get lost to restart at the spirit |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\nSafe Zone Resurrection: Choose 'Resurrect in a Safe Zone' to instantly revive in the nearest town or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r without any penalty. <br/><br/>\r\n\r\nSpirit |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r: Talk to the spirit |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r at the graveyard to revive on the spot. This causes Resurrection Sickness (temporary stat reduction) and reduces equipment |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|hDurability|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在安全的地点复活！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当你的角色死亡时，屏幕上会出现一个小菜单。你可以选择查看死亡回顾以了解死亡原因，或在聊天窗口中查看战斗记录以获得更详细的分析。<br/><br/>\r\n若要继续，请点击“释放灵魂”变成幽灵，然后你就可以开始复活角色的流程。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在灵魂世界中，有多种复活方式！</h1>\r\n<p>玩家复活：附近的玩家可以施放复活法术（复活、救赎、重生），让你在他们的位置复活。<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n返回尸体：作为幽灵，跑回你的尸体并点击提示即可复活。如果你迷路了，点击“返回墓地”可在灵魂 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗|h|r 处重新开始。<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n安全区域复活：选择“在安全区域复活”，即可在最近的城镇或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 立即复活，且没有任何惩罚。<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n灵魂 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗|h|r：与墓地的灵魂 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗|h|r 对话即可原地复活。这会导致复活虚弱（暂时降低属性）并降低装备 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|h耐久度|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Raiding. Ascended Mechanics. Ascended Loot.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Raiding is the ultimate PvE challenge on Ascension and drops the strongest obtainable gear for each Tier!<br/><br/>\r\nBosses deal more damage, are more durable, and have new challenging mechanics unique to Ascended difficulty.<br/><br/>\r\nAscended Raids are designed for Players with optimized builds, gear, a coordinate group, and a strong knowledge of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Raids Should Not Be Attempted with PvP Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wearing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h|r or PvP gear in Ascended Raids will apply the Bloody debuff to you, massively reducing your damage dealt and your survivability.<br/><br/>\r\nEnsure you have full PvE Power gear equipped. Even |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r PvP gear will apply the Bloody debuff.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升团队副本。飞升机制。飞升战利品。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升团队副本是飞升上终极的 PvE 挑战，掉落每个阶段可获得的最强装备！<br/><br/>\r\n首领造成更高伤害、更加耐久，并拥有飞升难度独有的全新挑战机制。<br/><br/>\r\n飞升团队副本是为拥有优化构筑、精良装备、协调队伍以及对 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 有深入了解的玩家设计的。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">不应穿着 PvP 装备尝试飞升团队副本！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在飞升团队副本中穿着 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r 或 PvP 装备会给你施加血腥减益，大幅降低你造成的伤害和生存能力。<br/><br/>\r\n确保你装备了全套 PvE 能量装备。即使是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的 PvP 装备也会施加血腥减益。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\219_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r is a random, endless |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r that can be queued solo or with 1-15 players!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can join from anywhere by opening the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r menu (Hotkey \"i\"), and navigating to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r tab.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\enterthemanastorm2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Dive Deeper for Greater Challenges and Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each boss you defeat will send you deeper into the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r and award |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, Gear, Gold, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:148|hManastorm Caches|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|hBedlam Bullions|h|r, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h|r will return you safe and sound to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r upon exiting or being defeated.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\219_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 是一个随机的无尽 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，可以单人排队，也可以与 1-15 名玩家一起排队！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以随时打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 菜单（快捷键 \"i\"）并切换到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 标签页来加入。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\enterthemanastorm2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">深入更深处，迎接更大的挑战与奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你击败的每个首领都会把你送入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 更深处，并给予 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r、装备、金币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:148|h法力风暴宝箱|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|h混乱金锭|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|h邦佐螺栓|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|h米尔豪斯·法力风暴|h|r 会在你离开或被击败时，将你安然无恙地送回你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\220_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat level 5 and you can begin your next run at level 6!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Unlock Checkpoints every 5th level, allowing you to start a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r from that level.<br/><br/>\r\nYou will encounter specific Checkpoint fights as you progress! Defeating these Checkpoints unlocks new creatures, new levels, new bosses and more powerful loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\220_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败 5 级后，你就可以从 6 级开始下一轮挑战！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每 5 级解锁一个检查点，让你可以从该等级开始挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你的推进，你会遇到特定的检查点战斗！击败这些检查点会解锁新的生物、新的层级、新的首领和更强大的战利品！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\225_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy the |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h|r from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Bosses often have powerful spells and abilities that deal massive amounts of damage. The Interrupt Rod will allow you to counter enemy spell casts.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r and Upgrades are added to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r, meaning all of your characters on this realm will gain access to the Interrupt Rod!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h|r Spell can be found inside the Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Items tab in your spell book!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\225_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[法术反制杖]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>首领通常拥有强大的法术和能力，会造成巨额伤害。法术反制杖可以让你反制敌人的法术施放。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 和升级会自动加入你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r，这意味着你在该服务器上的所有角色都能使用法术反制杖！<br/><br/>\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[法术反制杖]|h|r 法术可在你法术书的飞升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Purchase the Hearty Heal Upgrade from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Hearty Hearts are a major source of healing in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r, upgrade them to increase their healing!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Hearty Heal Upgrade does not need to be added to your Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r. It is always active!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Upgrade Your Most Used |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>All Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r can be upgraded up to Rank 10 at |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r! Upgrades can grant increased power, durations, and reduced cooldowns.<br/><br/>\r\nUpgrades are added to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r! All your characters get access to them!<br/><br/>\r\nMake sure to fully upgrade the Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r you use most often.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处购买强效治疗升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>强效之心是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中的主要治疗来源，升级它们可以提高其治疗量！<br/><br/>\r\n强效治疗升级无需加入你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 中。它始终处于激活状态！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">升级你最常用的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>所有激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 都可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处升级至 10 级！升级可以提高威力、延长持续时间并缩短冷却时间。<br/><br/>\r\n升级会加入你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r！你所有的角色都能使用它们！<br/><br/>\r\n请务必把你最常使用的激活 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 升级到满级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\229_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Heal with your |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You automatically receive an |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h|r in your inventory each time you enter the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nThis potion has unlimited uses and will allow you to progress through Manastorms solo or with friends when you do not have a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nDrag the |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h|r onto your bar and use it to heal anytime your health gets low!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\229_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r 进行治疗！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每次进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 时，你都会自动在背包中获得一瓶 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n这种药水使用次数无限，当你没有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗|h|r 时，它可以让你独自或与朋友一起推进法力风暴。<br/><br/>\r\n将 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r 拖到你的动作条上，在生命值偏低时随时使用它进行治疗。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\230_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Your |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You will automatically receive |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r in your inventory each time you enter the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nThis potion will allow you to break free from stuns, silences, and other loss of control effects that could quickly lead to your death!<br/><br/>\r\nThis item has unlimited uses and is key to your survival. Drag |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r onto your hot bar and use it to escape deadly crowd control effects.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\230_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每次进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 时，你都会自动在背包中获得 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n这种药水可以让你摆脱昏迷、沉默和其他可能导致你迅速死亡的控制效果！<br/><br/>\r\n此物品使用次数无限，是你生存的关键。将 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r 拖到快捷栏上，用它逃离致命的群体控制效果。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Slot 4 Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Active Spell loadout can complement your build! There is no best setup, only the setup that matches your build and playstyle.<br/><br/>\r\nFind a set of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r that complement your build and fill out all 4 slots!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cogsley sells new spells and upgrades!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Cogsley sells many tools that increase your power and offer new utility to allow you to progress further into the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce you find a set of spells that work well for you, try to upgrade them as much as possible!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">装备 4 个激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 激活法术配装可以补充你的构筑！没有最好的配置，只有适合你构筑和玩法的配置。<br/><br/>\r\n找出一组能够补充你构筑的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r，填满全部 4 个栏位！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">考格斯利出售新的法术和升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>考格斯利出售许多能提升你实力并提供新用途的工具，让你能在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中推进得更远。<br/><br/>\r\n一旦你找到一套适合自己的法术，就尽可能多地升级它们！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Slot an Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spell!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Some |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r and items must be added to your Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r to be used.<br/><br/>\r\nFrom the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Menu, select an empty Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spell slot and add your |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse Mobility Mixture]|h|r or |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h|r.<br/><br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r are in your Spell Book!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Your unlocked |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r can be found inside the Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Items tab in your spell book!<br/><br/>\r\nKeep in mind some of these must be added as Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h|r to be cast while inside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">The |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h|r does not require an Active Slot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Some essential spells and items like the |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h|r, |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h|r, and |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h|r can always be used and do not take up an Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spell slot!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">装备一个激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>某些 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 和物品必须先加入你的激活 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 中才能使用。<br/><br/>\r\n在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 菜单中，选择一个空的激活 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术栏位，加入你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[米尔豪斯的移动混合物]|h|r 或 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[冲刺血清]|h|r。<br/><br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 就在法术书里！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你已解锁的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 可以在法术书的飞升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 物品标签页中找到！<br/><br/>\r\n请记住，其中一些必须作为激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|h法力风暴法术|h|r 添加，才能在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 内施放。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[法术反制杖]|h|r 不需要激活栏位！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>某些关键法术和物品，如 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[法术反制杖]|h|r、|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽法力风暴药水]|h|r 和 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[米尔豪斯的魔法逃脱]|h|r，始终可以使用，且不占用激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术栏位！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn Free Scrolls of Fortune from Silas Every 10 Levels!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Scrolls of Fortune (SoF) allow you to reroll spells and talents, rolling off unwanted spells and rolling for stronger talents!<br/><br/>\r\nVisit Silas every 10 levels to claim free Scrolls! You will be offered more and more scrolls every 10 levels.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce claimed from Silas, use them in your inventory to add them to your Character Advancement UI.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Find Silas Darkmoon in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Silas is marked on your map in Capital Cities with a Darkmoon flag icon.<br/><br/>\r\nLook for Silas and Burth in prominent areas of your Capital! They both have Dice icons floating above their head.<br/><br/>\r\nThey can also be found in early level questing hubs.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn Unlimited Scrolls of Fortune at Max Level.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Silas Darkmoon offers Scrolls of Fortune for Marks of Ascension at max level. There is a cap to how many Scrolls you can claim this way.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can earn uncapped Scrolls through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r, Dungeons, Battlegrounds, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r, Raids, High-Risk farming and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">There are two types of Scrolls and Multi-Spec Support!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[Scroll of Fortune]|h|r allows you to reroll either an Ability or a Talent and |cffe6cc80|Hitem:97933|h[Scroll of Fortune: Talents]|h|r only allow rerolling a Talent.<br/><br/>\r\nEvery Specialization has its own unique |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[Scroll of Fortune I]|h|r. Every Spec gets free scrolls from Silas while leveling. You don't have to choose which spec to spend your Scrolls on!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">每 10 级从塞拉斯处获得免费幸运卷轴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>幸运卷轴（SoF）让你可以重抽法术和天赋，抽掉不需要的法术，并抽取更强大的天赋！<br/><br/>\r\n每 10 级拜访塞拉斯即可领取免费卷轴！每 10 级你能领取的卷轴数量都会越来越多。<br/><br/>\r\n从塞拉斯处领取后，在背包中使用它们即可加入你的角色成长界面。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中寻找塞拉斯·暗月！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>塞拉斯在主城的地图上以暗月旗帜图标标记。<br/><br/>\r\n在主城的显眼区域寻找塞拉斯和伯斯！他们头顶都漂浮着骰子图标。<br/><br/>\r\n他们也可以在低等级的练级区域中找到。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在满级时获得无限幸运卷轴。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>塞拉斯·暗月在满级时以飞升印记出售幸运卷轴。你能以此方式领取的卷轴数量有上限。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r、地下城、战场、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r、团队副本、高风险刷取等方式获得无上限的卷轴！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">卷轴分为两种，并支持多专精！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[幸运卷轴]|h|r 允许你重抽一个技能或一个天赋，而 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:97933|h[幸运卷轴：天赋]|h|r 只允许重抽天赋。<br/><br/>\r\n每个专精都拥有自己独特的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[幸运卷轴 I]|h|r，因此你可以分别重抽每个专精的法术和天赋！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy Back Scrolls After |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can buy back Scrolls of Fortune earned from Cases of Fortune and other non-Silas methods.<br/><br/>\r\nVisit Silas Darkmoon and select Repurchase Scrolls.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Permanent Scroll Progress!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Scrolls of Fortune earned from Cases of Fortune and other non-Silas methods can be repurchased every time you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nUsed and unused Scrolls, bought back or not bought back, are Scrolls are eligible for repurchase! You never lose this progress when Prestiging.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Silas Scrolls Reset, They Can Not be Repurchased!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Scrolls you buy from Silas are not added to your Repurchase Scroll counts. This is because they already reset every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nThe same is true for the bonus scrolls earned each time you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r. Those are not added to your Repurchase Scroll counts, you already get them back for free every |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 后回购卷轴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以回购从幸运宝箱及其他非塞拉斯途径获得的幸运卷轴。<br/><br/>\r\n拜访塞拉斯·暗月并选择回购卷轴。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">卷轴进度永久保留！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从幸运宝箱和其他非塞拉斯途径获得的幸运卷轴，每次你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时都可以回购。<br/><br/>\r\n无论是已使用还是未使用、已回购还是未回购的卷轴，都符合回购资格！进行威望时你永远不会失去这些进度。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">塞拉斯卷轴会重置，无法回购！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你从塞拉斯处购买的卷轴不会计入你的回购卷轴数量。这是因为它们每次 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时都会重置！<br/><br/>\r\n每次你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时获得的额外卷轴也是如此。它们不会计入你的回购卷轴数量，因为你每次 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 都能免费拿回它们。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Return to Level 1! Reroll Your Build!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r will reset your character to level 1 and teleport you to your starting zone.<br/><br/>\r\nThis will reroll your entire build, unlearning every spell and talent for your current Specialization you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r in, allowing you to re-level and reroll that specialization.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Only Reroll Your Current Spec!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Only your active specialization will be rerolled! Your other Specs will will remain intact.<br/><br/>\r\nWhile prestiging, all other specs will be locked until you reach max level again.<br/><br/>\r\nThis means you can reroll and experiment with multi-specs while preserving your main spec!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wcprestige3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Permanent Scroll of Fortune Progress!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each time you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r you will earn bonus Scrolls of Fortune when reaching max level. The amount earned increases every time you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can also buy back Scrolls of Fortune earned from Cases of Fortune, ensuring your time spent farming cases of fortune is never lost.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Pick New Skill Cards and Try New Builds!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r resets your current spec's Skill Cards!<br/><br/>\r\nThis allows you to try a whole new skill card loadout and experiment with new found skill cards.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Keep Character Progress. Return to Level 1. Earn Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r is a great way to earn end-game gear, Mystic Enchanting supplies, Marks of Ascension, and more!<br/><br/>\r\nRelive the leveling journey, dungeons, and Battlegrounds with all the knowledge you have acquired, including your saved Mystic Enchants!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Not Starting Over. Starting Better!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You keep all professions, gear, Marks of Ascension, currencies, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r, and items.<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard and Draft Heroes get to roll a new build! But do not keep the Prestiged Spec's Unspent Hand of Fates or Scroll of Fortune.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You can |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r at Chromie and Redeem |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r Tokens!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Chromie offers rewards for prestiges and an in-depth explanation of exactly what occurs when you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r, including what you keep and what you lose!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find Chromie by the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">返回 1 级！重抽你的构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 会把你的角色重置为 1 级，并将你传送到起始区域。<br/><br/>\r\n这会重抽你的整个构筑，遗忘你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时所处专精的全部法术和天赋，让你可以重新升级并重抽该专精。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">只重抽你当前的专精！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>只有你当前激活的专精会被重抽！你的其他专精将保持原样。<br/><br/>\r\n进行威望期间，所有其他专精都会被锁定，直到你再次达到满级。<br/><br/>\r\n这意味着你可以在保留主专精的同时，重抽并尝试多种专精！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wcprestige3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">幸运卷轴进度永久保留！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每当你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r，达到满级时都会获得额外的幸运卷轴。获得的数量会随着你每次进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 而增加！<br/><br/>\r\n你还可以回购从好运宝箱中获得的幸运卷轴，这样你花在刷好运宝箱上的时间就永远不会白费。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">挑选新的技能卡，尝试新的构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 会重置你当前专精的技能卡！<br/><br/>\r\n这让你可以尝试一套全新的技能卡配装，并用新发现的技能卡进行试验。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保留角色进度。返回 1 级。获取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 是获取终局装备、神秘附魔材料、飞升印记等物品的好方法！<br/><br/>\r\n带着你积累的所有知识重温升级之旅、地下城和战场，包括你保存的神秘附魔！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">不是从零开始。而是更好的开始！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你会保留所有专业、装备、飞升印记、货币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 和物品。<br/><br/>\r\n万能牌和抽取模式英雄可以重抽一套新构筑！但不会保留已进行威望专精的未使用命运之手或幸运卷轴。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以在克罗米处进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 并兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 代币！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>克罗米会提供威望奖励，并详细说明你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时究竟会发生什么，包括你会保留什么、失去什么。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 旁找到克罗米。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Rapid Rerolling is an Optional Way to Roll!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can enter Rapid Rerolling through Character Advancement. Click the button in the bottom right.<br/><br/>\r\nRapid Rerolling only works at max level. You must have already rolled all pending Spell and Talent rolls before you can use it!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increases Your Roll Speed, Not Your Roll Chance!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Rapid Rerolling uses multiple Scrolls of Fortune at once. Each Scroll is still being rolled individually! However, the dice will only stop when they roll a desired spell or talent, or reach the last roll.<br/><br/>\r\nThere is no direct benefit to using Rapid Rerolling versus normal Rerolling besides time.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You Should Not Always Use Rapid Rerolling!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Rapid Rerolling is a great tool to help finish builds and quickly roll through large amounts of Scrolls to find a few missing spells or talents.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you are still discovering the direction of your build, you should use normal rerolling! This will ensure Rapid Rerolling does not skip over rolls you might otherwise want to explore.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Suggested Abilities and Talent. Don't Miss Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Suggested Abilities and Talents will tell the dice to stop rolling on spells and talents that may make your build stronger.<br/><br/>\r\nThis does not lower your chances to get other Desired entries! It only ensures that the dice don't skip over options that you would gain power from!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">The Dice Stop on Your Desired Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Select Spells, Talents or even entire Categories like Mage: Frost or Ability Type: Mobility to tell the dice when to stop rolling.<br/><br/>\r\nRapid Reroll will skip anything not in your desired! And it will only stop rolling when one of your desired entries comes up.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you are rolling 5 scrolls at once, and you get a desired entry on the 3rd roll, it will only use 3 Scrolls before stopping.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Select Spells and Talents To Unlearn!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Spells and Talents to mark them as Undesired.<br/><br/>\r\nSpells that will be unlearned and rerolled will be highlighted in Red.<br/><br/>\r\nYour Locked spells and talents will not appear in this list! Be sure to Lock anything you wish to keep.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Import Full Builds!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Selecting every possible spell and talent, or category you desire can take time to set up. There is also the chance you miss something!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can create a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r Build, or import a Featured Build specifically designed to optimize Rapid Rerolling.<br/><br/>\r\nDiscover how to Import Full Builds from the Path to Ascension Wildcard: Rapid Reroll Full Builds!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">快速重抽是一种可选的抽取方式！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以从角色成长中进入快速重抽。点击右下角的按钮。<br/><br/>\r\n快速重抽只在满级时有效。你必须先完成所有待处理的法术和天赋抽取，才能使用它！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提高你的抽取速度，而不是你的概率！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>快速重抽会同时使用多个幸运卷轴。每个卷轴仍然会单独抽取！不过，只有在抽到想要的法术或天赋时，或到达最后一次抽取时，骰子才会停下。<br/><br/>\r\n除了节省时间之外，使用快速重抽相比普通重抽没有任何直接的额外收益。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你不应该总是使用快速重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>快速重抽是完善构筑、以及为寻找某些缺失的法术或天赋而快速消耗大量卷轴的绝佳工具。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你还在决定构筑的方向，那就应该使用普通重抽！这样可以确保快速重抽不会跳过你可能想要探索的抽取。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用建议的技能和天赋。不要损失威力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>建议的技能和天赋会让骰子停在可能强化你构筑的法术和天赋上。<br/><br/>\r\n这不会降低你获得其他想要条目的概率！它只是确保骰子不会跳过多余提升威力的选项。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保存的构筑会与快速重抽完美配合！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>如果你从 <br/><br/>\r\nh英雄构筑师<br/><br/>\r\n 导入了构筑，其建议的技能和天赋会自动应用到你的快速重抽中。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n这样就能轻松地快速重抽，直到你获得构筑所需的法术和天赋。\\{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">242_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}</h1><br/>\r\n<p>快速重抽不会改变任何概率！<br/><br/>\r\n每一次抽取的几率都与手动重抽完全相同。<br/><br/>\r\n快速重抽只是替你完成了重复点击的工作。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">随时可以停止快速重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以随时中止快速重抽，已完成的抽取都会保留。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Browse Featured Builds in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r to Browse Featured Builds!<br/><br/>\r\nFeatured builds are approved builds designed for Rapid Rerolling. These are a great way to jump into end-game build progression and explore new ways to play.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can browse builds based on PvE or PvP content, and select one based on your desired role: |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r, or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Core, Optimal, and Empowering Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Core Spells and Talents are the bare minimum requirements to use the build.<br/><br/>\r\nOptimal Spells and Talents are the best options for your build. Don't reroll these!<br/><br/>\r\nEmpowering Spells and Talents make your build stronger, but are not the strongest option. Reroll these last!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Import Builds into Rapid Rerolling!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Select Rapid Roll This Build from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r! This will bring you to the Rapid Reroll UI.<br/><br/>\r\nSelect Import |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r Build, then select the one you desire from the list.<br/><br/>\r\nKeep in mind that only Featured Builds are guaranteed optimized for Rapid Rerolling. You should inspect community made builds before Rapid Rerolling them!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Desire All Spells!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Import |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r build, select your desired build, then click Desire All Spells!<br/><br/>\r\nThis will mark all Core, Optimal, and Empowering Spells and Talents as Desired entries. This means the Dice will always stop on spells and talents that empower this chosen build!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlearn All Non-Build Spells!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Import |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r build, select your desired build, then click Unlearn All Non-Build Spells!<br/><br/>\r\nThis sets all spells and talents you currently know that are not in the build as ones you want to reroll!<br/><br/>\r\nThis will not set Locked spells or talents to be rerolled. Be sure to unlock non-build spells you wish to reroll.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">When to Reroll Empowering Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>As you Rapid Reroll, eventually your entire build will consist of Core, Optimal, and Empowering spells and talents.<br/><br/>\r\nAt this point, you can begin marking Empowering Spells and Talents to be unlearned to try to seek out Optimal Spells and Talents!<br/><br/>\r\nYou should reroll Empowering entries one at a time to ensure your build retains as much power while rerolling as possible.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Lock Your Build Spells!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Import |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h|r build, select your desired build, then click Lock Core, Optimal, Empowering Spells!<br/><br/>\r\nBe sure to lock spells in your build to prevent accidentally rerolling them! This is also a great way to see how many spells and talents you have towards your desired build.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄构筑师|h|r 中浏览精选构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄构筑师|h|r 浏览精选构筑！<br/><br/>\r\n精选构筑是专为快速重抽设计的经审核构筑。它们是快速进入满级构筑成长体系并探索新玩法的绝佳途径。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以根据 PvE 或 PvP 内容浏览构筑，并根据你想要的职责进行选择：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">核心、最优和强化法术与天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>核心法术和天赋是使用该构筑的最低要求。<br/><br/>\r\n最优法术和天赋是你构筑的最佳选择。不要重抽它们！<br/><br/>\r\n强化法术和天赋会让你的构筑更强，但并非最强的选择。最后再重抽它们！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">将构筑导入快速重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄构筑师|h|r 中选择“快速重抽此构筑”！这会带你进入快速重抽界面。<br/><br/>\r\n选择“导入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄构筑师|h|r 构筑”，然后从列表中选择你想要的那个。<br/><br/>\r\n请记住，只有精选构筑才保证针对快速重抽进行了优化。在对社区制作的构筑使用快速重抽之前，你应该先检查一下！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">期望所有法术！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>点击导入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄构筑师|h|r 构筑，选择你想要的构筑，然后点击“期望所有法术”！<br/><br/>\r\n这会将构筑中的所有法术标记为期望，因此骰子会在它们上停下，而不是跳过它们。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 </h1><br/>\r\n<p>h天赋精华|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h 获取特定的天赋！|h|rh天赋精华<br/><br/>\r\n 可以制作，并让你从天赋树中获取特定天赋。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 </p>\r\n{page}\r\nh拍卖行\\ 或从其他玩家处获得 \\h天赋精华\\。\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">{T:Interface</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Tutorials<br/><br/>\r\nPtA<br/><br/>\r\n243_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}</p>\r\n{page}\r\n用 \\h天赋精华\\ 完善你的构筑！\\在重抽你的技能卡之后，用 \r\n<h1 align=\"center\">h天赋精华</h1><br/>\r\n<p> 来获取构筑所需的精确天赋。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h每个 |h|rh天赋精华<br/><br/>\r\n 都有稀有度，只能获取对应稀有度的天赋。</p>{T:InterfaceTutorialsPtA243_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}希望你喜欢你的新构筑！完成构筑后，你就可以使用它去挑战这个世界的各种内容了！"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn LP by Securing Your Account!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Visit https://ascension.gg/user/account-overview and secure your account to earn Loyalty Points!<br/><br/>\r\nLP can be spent on |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r vanity items! Claim 50 LP for securing your account.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit the LP Item Shop!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the Store on the website or the Launcher.<br/><br/>\r\nLP is displayed as the silver |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h|r, you can see your current LP in the top right of the website or launcher.\r\nOpen the Store, then click the LP Items category to spend your LP!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Delivered Straight to Your Mailbox!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Store items are delivered straight to your mailbox. You can choose which realm and character you want them delivered to when checking out.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保护你的账号即可获得 LP！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>访问 https://ascension.gg/user/account-overview 并保护你的账号即可获得忠诚点数！<br/><br/>\r\nLP 可用于购买 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的幻化物品！保护账号即可领取 50 LP。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">访问 LP 物品商店！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在网站或启动器上打开商店。<br/><br/>\r\nLP 以银色 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r 显示，你可以在网站或启动器的右上角查看当前 LP。\r\n打开商店，然后点击 LP 物品分类来消费你的 LP！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">直接送达你的邮箱！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>商店物品会直接送达你的邮箱。结账时你可以选择要送达的服务器和角色。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Save Your Equipment’s Appearance with the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r keeps a record of all the equipment your characters collect over the course of your adventure on the server! You can find your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r by hitting ‘N’, and selecting the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r tab under Character Advancement.<br/><br/>\r\nFind appearances by looting enemies, purchasing equipment from other players or npcs, and completing quests!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gotta Collect Them All!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>To save an item’s appearance to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r, use Ctrl + Right Click on a piece of gear in your inventory to save its appearance. You can also do this by equipping the item yourself!<br/><br/>\r\nContinue your adventures and collect 10 Transmog Appearances!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 保存你装备的外观！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 会记录你角色在本服务器冒险过程中收集的所有装备！按下“N”并在角色成长下选择 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 标签页即可找到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n通过拾取敌人的战利品、从其他玩家或 NPC 处购买装备以及完成任务来发现外观！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">把它们全部收集起来！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>要将物品的外观保存到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r，请在背包中按住 Ctrl 并右键点击一件装备来保存其外观。你也可以通过自己装备该物品来做到这一点！<br/><br/>\r\n继续你的冒险，收集 10 个幻化外观！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\247_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You Can Save Your Transmogs with Outfits!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Once you’ve made a complete transmog, you can save it with the Outfits tab in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h|r! This way if you change your look, you can apply your previously saved Outfit with ease and not have to remake your transmog from scratch.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can have as many different Outfits as you like, there is no limit!<br/><br/>\r\nYour Outfit collection is saved to your server, so all of your different characters can apply your various transmogs with just the click of a button!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\247_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以用套装保存你的幻化！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>一旦你完成了一整套幻化，就可以用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 中的套装标签页将其保存！这样即使你改变了外观，也能轻松套用之前保存的套装，而不必从头重做幻化。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以拥有任意数量的不同套装，没有限制！<br/><br/>\r\n你的套装收藏保存在服务器上，因此你所有的不同角色只需点击一个按钮即可套用你各式各样的幻化！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlock multiple builds on the same character!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Unlocking new Specializations allows you to create completely new builds on your same character and freely switch between them!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can obtain a |cffe6cc80|Hitem:106954|h[Tome of Specialization II]|h|r from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, an Honor Vendor, Nozdormu, or the Ascension Shop.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can unlock up to 20 specs using |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:245|hTome of Specialization|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Swap and Name Specs in Character Advancement!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can switch between known specializations in the Specs Tab inside Character Advancement.<br/><br/>\r\nKeep track of your specs by naming them! You can also link an Equipment Set and Enchant Specialization to each spec by clicking the cog wheel.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在同一个角色上解锁多个构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>解锁新的专精可以让你在同一个角色上创建全新的构筑，并在它们之间自由切换！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r、荣誉商人、诺兹多姆或飞升商店获得 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:106954|h[专精之书 II]|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:245|h专精之书|h|r 解锁最多 20 个专精。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在角色成长中切换并命名专精！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在角色成长内的专精标签页中切换已学会的专精。<br/><br/>\r\n通过给专精命名来管理它们！你还可以点击齿轮图标，为每个专精关联一套装备套装和附魔专精。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat a World Boss! Choose PvE or PvP!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>World Bosses are open world boss encounters that require a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r to defeat! These bosses respawn on a timer.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can challenge bosses in No-Risk |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE Mode|h|r if you prefer to avoid PvP. Bosses spawn in both No-Risk and High-Risk.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">World Boss Spawns are Announced in Ascension Chat!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When a World Boss dies or spawns, it will alert you in the chatbox.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen looking for a World Boss group, it is easiest to ask for an invite through World Chat.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can use the First-Class-Experimental-Teleporter to get a head start on the destination after finding your group.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">World Boss Take Time to Fully Manifest!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Sometimes it takes time to travel or fly to a World Boss location.<br/><br/>\r\nBosses will spawn in an invulnerable state to give the whole |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r group time to reach the destination.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce the boss fully manifests, it can be engaged!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">World Bosses Respawn on Server Restarts!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Server Restarts have a distinct advantage on Ascension! All World Bosses will respawn as soon as the realm comes back online!<br/><br/>\r\nLogging back in immediately after a restart is a great time to find a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Group to challenge each World Boss back to back!<br/><br/>\r\nKeep an eye on Ascension Chat after a restart to find a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or make your own!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Everyone gets loot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When a World Boss is killed they will drop a Treasures of Azeroth Cache stuffed with gear that everyone can loot!<br/><br/>\r\nThey also drop individual loot that can be rolled on or distributed as your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Leader decides.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败世界首领！选择 PvE 或 PvP！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>世界首领是开放世界中的首领战，需要一支 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 才能击败！这些首领按计时器重生。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你想避开 PvP，可以在无风险的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE 模式|h|r 中挑战首领。首领会在无风险和高风险模式中刷新。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界首领的刷新会在飞升聊天中公告！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当世界首领死亡或刷新时，聊天框会提醒你。<br/><br/>\r\n寻找世界首领队伍时，最简单的方法是通过世界聊天请求邀请。<br/><br/>\r\n找到队伍后，你可以使用头等实验传送器抢先一步抵达目的地。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界首领需要时间才能完全显现！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>有时前往世界首领所在地点需要旅行或飞行一段时间。<br/><br/>\r\n首领刷新时处于无敌状态，以便整个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍有时间抵达目的地。<br/><br/>\r\n一旦首领完全显现，就可以开战了！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">服务器重启后世界首领将重新刷新！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>服务器重启在飞升有一个明显的优势！所有世界首领都会在服务器重新上线后立即刷新！<br/><br/>\r\n重启后立刻登录，正是寻找 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍接连挑战各个世界首领的好时机！<br/><br/>\r\n重启后请留意飞升聊天以寻找 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r，或自己组建一个！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界首领掉落强大的战利品！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>世界首领掉落装备、金币和其他珍贵物品。<br/><br/>\r\n它们还会奖励 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h经验值|h|r 和飞升印记！</p>组队击败它们可获得额外的战利品和奖励。"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Rank Up Spells to Increase their Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Higher ranked spells deal more damage and even gain additional effects!<br/><br/>\r\nNew ranks become available as you level up.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Rank Your Spells Up at a Trainer!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>A |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:44|hBeginner's Book of Ascension|h|r can rank spells up to level 20!<br/><br/>\r\nUse the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r on your mini-map and select Class Trainer to find a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:44|hBeginner's Book of Ascension|h|r! They can be found near the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h|r in your starter zone and surrounding towns.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">The Book Icon Lets You Know Spells Can Rank Up!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The book icon will appear next to spells that can be ranked up in your Spell Book, Character Advancement, and above the menu icon!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can train your spells up to max level at a class trainer in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r or anyone's |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r! Many players have a portable |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r, so don't hesitate to ask them to summon one!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提升法术等级以增强其威力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>更高等级的法术造成更多伤害，甚至会获得额外效果！<br/><br/>\r\n随着你升级，新的等级会变得可用。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在训练师处提升你的法术等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:44|h初级飞升之书|h|r 可以将法术提升至 20 级！<br/><br/>\r\n在小地图上使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 并选择职业训练师来寻找 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:44|h初级飞升之书|h|r！它们可以在你的起始区域和周边城镇的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r 附近找到。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">书本图标提示法术可以提升等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>书本图标会出现在法术书、角色成长中可提升等级的法术旁边，以及菜单图标上方！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中的职业训练师处，或用任何人的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r 将法术训练至满级！许多玩家都有便携的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r，所以尽管请他们召唤一个！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fast Travel to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r with your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r is the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r for the Alliance and offers important services:<br/><br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|hBank|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r<br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r<br/>\r\n• Class Trainers, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Trainers, and Riding Trainers<br/>\r\n• Flightmasters<br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Navigating Through the City</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Opening your Map inside the city will show POIs for important services and NPCs. Mouse over these icons to see their function.<br/><br/>\r\nThe city may be large, but |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r Guards can give you directions on where you need to go!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Report to Justine Demalier</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroes travel from the furthest reaches of Azeroth to seek comfort and companionship behind the mighty walls surrounding the city. The time has come for you to do the same, Hero.<br/><br/>\r\nTravel to the royal city of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r and announce yourself to Justine Demalier. She will be waiting to greet you inside the walls.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 快速前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 是联盟的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，提供重要的服务：<br/><br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r<br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r<br/>\r\n• 职业训练师、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r 训练师和骑术训练师<br/>\r\n• 飞行管理员<br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 以及更多</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">如何在城中穿行</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在城内打开地图时，你会看到重要服务和 NPC 的兴趣点。将鼠标悬停在这些图标上即可查看其功能。<br/><br/>\r\n这座城市可能很大，但 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 的卫兵可以告诉你如何前往你需要去的地方。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">向贾斯汀·德玛利尔报到</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄们从艾泽拉斯最偏远的角落远道而来，在这座城市周围坚固的城墙内寻求慰藉与陪伴。英雄，现在轮到你了。<br/><br/>\r\n前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 并向贾斯汀·德玛利尔报到。她会在城墙内等候迎接你。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\63_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Worldforged Mystic Enchants Cannot Be Traded or Found Reforging.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Worldforged Mystic Enchants can only be discovered or earned! They cannot be traded or found by reforging. Discover them hidden in the world, by defeating bosses, solving puzzles, and overcoming challenges.<br/><br/>\r\nMany Featured Builds use Worldforged Enchants to complete their Archetype. Reaching max level with those Featured builds will also unlock their Worldforged Mystic Enchants!\r\n</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\worldforged2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Discover Hidden Worldforged Enchants!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can filter for Unknown Worldforged Enchants in the Enchant Collection.<br/><br/>\r\nRead the tooltip of undiscovered Worldforged Enchants for clues to locate them! You can also ask other players for hints!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\worldforged3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Discover Clues and Explore!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Follow the clues and discover a Worldforged Mystic Scroll, or explore the world at your leisure! You are sure to discover them naturally while exploring the world.<br/><br/>\r\nAcquire a Worldforged Mystic Enchant Scroll and Extract it to your Enchant Collection.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\63_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界铸造神秘附魔无法交易，也无法通过重铸获得。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>世界铸造神秘附魔只能被发现或获得！它们无法交易，也无法通过重铸找到。在世界各处隐藏的地点、击败首领、解开谜题和克服挑战来发现它们。<br/><br/>\r\n许多精选构筑会使用世界铸造附魔来完成其原型。使用这些精选构筑达到满级，也会解锁它们的世界铸造神秘附魔！\r\n</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\worldforged2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">发现隐藏的世界铸造附魔！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在附魔收藏中筛选未知的世界铸造附魔。<br/><br/>\r\n阅读未发现的世界铸造附魔的提示文字以获取定位线索！你也可以向其他玩家寻求提示！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\worldforged3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">发现线索并探索！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>跟随线索发现一卷世界铸造神秘卷轴，或者随心所欲地探索世界！你在探索世界的过程中一定会自然而然地发现它们。<br/><br/>\r\n获取世界铸造神秘附魔卷轴，并将其提取到你的附魔收藏中。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\64_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit the Mark of Triumph Vendor!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Marks of Triumph are earned by completing Heroic and Mythic difficulty dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nThese marks can be exchanged for gear! Use them to upgrade your gear or save up for specific equipment key to your build.<br/><br/>\r\nVisit Markus in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r Throne Room to see the gear you can acquire.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\64_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">拜访凯旋印记商人！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>凯旋印记通过完成英雄和史诗难度的地下城获得。<br/><br/>\r\n这些印记可以兑换装备！用它们升级你的装备，或攒起来购买构筑所需的关键装备。<br/><br/>\r\n前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 王座厅拜访马库斯，查看你可以获得的装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Slay Creatures and Complete Quests to Gain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Slaying creatures and completing quests is the primary way to gain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nYour |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r bar is located directly above your hot bar and menu bar. You can mouse over it to see the exact amount of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r required to gain your next level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevelten2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">NPCs with Yellow Exclamation Points Offer Quests!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>NPCs with a Yellow Exclamation Point offer quests. Complete quests to earn loot and big |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nCompleting quests is a great way to get stronger. They can reward gear, |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1297884|h[Adventurer's Cache]|h|r, Reputations, and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Yellow Names are Non-Aggressive. Red Names Attack on Sight!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Enemies become more dangerous as you level up and venture into more difficult areas. If you’re feeling bold, you can set off on any nearby road. Roads will lead you to new towns and villages with more challenging Quests.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">See How Much |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r You Earn!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can see the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r gained from slaying creatures and completing quests on screen! More difficult creatures and quests grant more |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击杀生物并完成任务以获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>击杀生物和完成任务是获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 的主要方式！<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 条位于快捷栏和菜单栏的正上方。你可以将鼠标悬停在上面，查看升到下一级所需的精确 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevelten2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 会提供任务！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 会提供任务。完成任务可获得战利品和大量 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n完成任务是变强的好方法。它们可以奖励装备、|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1297884|h[冒险者的宝箱]|h|r、声望等等！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">黄色名字不会主动攻击。红色名字一见你就打！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>随着你升级并进入更危险的区域，敌人会变得更危险。如果你有胆量，可以沿着附近的任意一条路出发。道路会带你前往拥有更具挑战性任务的新城镇和村庄。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">看看你获得了多少 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在屏幕上看到击杀生物和完成任务所获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！更具挑战性的生物和任务会提供更多 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fast Travel Home with Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Make an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r your Home at an Innkeeper to set your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h|r location, allowing you to teleport back to your home |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r from anywhere in the world.<br/><br/>\r\nLogging out while inside an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|hInn|h|r grants you bonus |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|hRested Experience|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Find Innkeepers in Most Towns!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Innkeepers have everything you need to rest and relax! They sell |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r, Food, and Drink.<br/><br/>\r\nInnkeepers are found in Cities and most Quest Hubs. You can locate them by using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r and selecting Innkeeper.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r 快速回家！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与旅店老板交谈，将一间 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 设为你的家，即可设定你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r 位置，让你可以从世界任何地方传送回你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 内下线可获得额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|h休息经验|h|r！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在大多数城镇都能找到旅店老板！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>旅店老板拥有你休息放松所需的一切！他们出售 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r、食物和饮料。<br/><br/>\r\n旅店老板出现在城市和大多数任务枢纽中。你可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 并选择旅店老板来定位他们。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Craft and Gather Useful Items with Professions!</h1>\r\n<p>Professions help you level! Using your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r grants |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r while also providing gear, consumables, and materials. You can start by learning two primary professions, and all the secondary ones!<br/><br/>\r\n•Primary Gathering Professions: Gatherers can pick up crafting materials around the world. They can sell them for gold, or use the items in their crafting professions.<br/><br/>\r\n•Primary Crafting Professions: Crafters can make equipment and other useful items from materials found by gathering professions.<br/><br/>\r\n•Secondary Professions: These life skills can be used by anyone without restriction!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Learn a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Visit a Beginner’s |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r to learn your first |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r. Find one using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r! You can unlearn a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r at any time to learn a new one.<br/><br/>\r\nTry to pick two primary professions that work well together like |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|hLeatherworking|h|r, or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h|r! This way you can gather your own materials to skill up without having to rely on other players.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Skill Up Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r!</h1>\r\n<p>You can level up your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r just by using it! Use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:220|hSkills Tab|h|r (Hotkey K) to view your current, and skill level. Visit a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h|r to increase your maximum skill as you progress.<br/><br/>\r\nDifficulty colors guide you on what to do next to skill up. Always try to aim for orange level skills!<br/><br/>\r\n•Orange: Always grants a skill point!<br/>\r\n•Yellow: Usually grants a skill point.<br/>\r\n•Green: Rarely grants a skill point.<br/>\r\n•Grey: Does not increase your skill.<br/>\r\n•Red: Your skill level isn’t high enough yet!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increase Your Skills to Unlock New |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r</h1>\r\n<p>As you craft and gather using your professions, you’ll rank up!<br/><br/>\r\nNew |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r become available as you gain skill and you can train them at |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h|r Trainers or the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h|r. Other |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h|r can be found throughout the world as loot or purchased from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r and the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you want to learn more than two Primary Professions, use a Craftsman’s Codex to gain an additional |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h|r slot! You can buy them from Nozdormu, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r, or the webstore.</p>"]="\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">用专业技能制造和采集有用的物品！</h1><p>专业技能能帮助你升级！使用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r 可获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r，同时还能提供装备、消耗品和材料。你可以从学习两个主要专业技能和所有次要专业技能开始！<br/><br/>•主要采集专业技能：采集者可以在世界各地拾取制造材料。他们可以将其出售换取金币，或在制造专业技能中使用这些物品。<br/><br/>•主要制造专业技能：制造者可以用采集专业技能找到的材料制作装备和其他有用的物品。<br/><br/>•次要专业技能：这些生活技能任何人都可以不受限制地使用！</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">学习一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r！</h1><br/><p>拜访初级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习你的第一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r。使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 找到它！你可以随时遗忘一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r 来学习新的。<br/><br/>试着选择两项搭配良好的主要专业技能，例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|h制皮|h|r，或者 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r！这样你就可以采集自己的材料来提升技能，而不必依赖其他玩家。</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">提升你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r 技能！</h1><p>只需使用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r 就能提升它！使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:220|h技能标签页|h|r（快捷键 K）查看你当前的技能等级。随着你的进展，拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业技能训练师|h|r 来提高你的技能上限。<br/><br/>难度颜色会指导你接下来该做什么来提升技能。始终以橙色等级的技能为目标！<br/><br/>•橙色：必定提升一点技能！<br/>•黄色：通常会提升一点技能。<br/>•绿色：很少提升一点技能。<br/>•灰色：不会提升你的技能。<br/>•红色：你的技能等级还不够高！</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">提升技能以解锁新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r</h1><p>随着你使用专业技能进行制造和采集，你会不断晋升！<br/><br/>随着技能提升，新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 会变得可用，你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业技能|h|r 训练师或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 处学习它们。其他 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 可以在世界各地作为战利品找到，或从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买。<br/><br/>如果你想学习两个以上的主要专业技能，请使用工匠法典来获得一个额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业技能|h|r 栏位！你可以从诺兹多姆、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或网上商店购买。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\80_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>Continue your journey and acquire enough |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r to reach level 15.<br/><br/>\r\nAs you continue advancing in levels, you will have to travel to new zones to find more challenging creatures and quests!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel152:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r to find new zones!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Hit M, then right-click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h|r. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.<br/><br/>\r\nFind the nearby zone that is level 10+ and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 15.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\80_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>继续你的旅程，获取足够的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 以达到 15 级。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你不断升级，你将需要前往新的区域，寻找更具挑战性的生物和任务！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel152:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 寻找新的区域！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会将视角拉远至整体的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r。将鼠标悬停在当前区域周围的地区上，你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。<br/><br/>\r\n找到附近 10 级以上的区域并前往那里，发现新的任务并继续你前往 15 级的旅程。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\81_1:2:1}\r\n<p>You can find a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r in any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can use these boards while leveling to discover where to go next and accept any tutorial quests you may have missed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At max level, the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r offers Daily Quests and Weekly Quests granting you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r, Marks of Ascension, Mystic Orbs, and Mystic Runes.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\81_1:2:1}\r\n<p>你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中找到一块 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r！</p>\r\n\r\n<p>你可以在升级期间使用这些告示板来了解下一步该去哪里，并接取你可能错过的教程任务。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>在满级时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 会提供日常任务和每周任务，给予你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r、飞升印记、神秘法球和神秘符文。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fly to Westfall or Redridge at the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Nearby Flightpaths are automatically unlocked! Visit the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and fly to a new zone to continue leveling!<br/><br/>\r\nWestfall or Redridge are the most popular quest hubs for Heroes leaving the capital for the first time.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find nearby Flightmasters by using the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h|r and selecting |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlock new Flightpaths at Flightmasters!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Interacting with a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r unlocks their |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h|r. Anytime you travel to a new zone, you should look for the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h|r’s green “!” in your faction's quest hub.<br/><br/>\r\nEach |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h|r connects to other nearby locations. Unlocking multiple locations allows you to chain them together to fly even greater distances at once! Unlock the nodes between two locations to fly between those locations.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 处飞往西部荒野或赤岭山！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>附近的飞行路线会自动解锁！前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h主城|h|r 中的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h飞行管理员|h|r，飞往新的区域继续升级！<br/><br/>\r\n西部荒野和赤岭山是首次离开主城的英雄们最热门的任务枢纽。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 并选择 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 来寻找附近的飞行管理员。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在飞行管理员处解锁新的飞行路线！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 互动会解锁他们的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r。每当你前往新的区域时，都应该在你阵营的任务枢纽中寻找 \"h飞行管理员\" 的绿色 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h!|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n每条 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r 都会连接其他附近的地点。解锁多个地点让你可以将它们串联起来，一次性飞往更远的距离！解锁两个地点之间的节点即可在两个地点之间飞行。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\84_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Continue your journey and reach level 20!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Continue to accept and complete new quests, venturing into more difficult areas as you gain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r until you reach level 20!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel202:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Quests Unlock as Your Level!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h|r with a Grey Exclamation Mark means you must be a higher level to accept their quest.<br/><br/>\r\nAs you gain levels, more difficult quests will become available to you.<br/><br/>\r\nQuests in the starter area scale up to level 20! All other quests scale up to max. That means you will never out-level the quests you are on or quest hubs!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\84_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">继续你的旅程并达到 20 级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>继续接取并完成新的任务，随着你获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 而进入更困难的区域，直到你达到 20 级！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel202:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">任务会随你的等级解锁！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>带有灰色感叹号的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r 意味着你必须达到更高的等级才能接取其任务。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你升级，更困难的任务会向你开放。<br/><br/>\r\n起始区域的任务最高可扩展至 20 级！所有其他任务都扩展至满级。这意味着你永远不会超过你所接任务或任务枢纽的等级！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Join the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r Queue!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r automatically pairs you with other heroes in a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r and teleports you to a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r to fight a series of enemies and get awesome loot!<br/><br/>\r\nOpen the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r (Hotkey “i”, for Instances) or click the Green Eye in your menu bar.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Select your Role!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Pick your role from the icons at the top. You can only queue as a single role at a time.<br/><br/>\r\n•The Shield Icon is for a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h|r.<br/>\r\n•The Green Health Icon is for a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h|r.<br/>\r\n•The Sword is for a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nSelect Find Group after picking a role that suits your build and spells!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Continue playing while the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r fills up!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can continue questing, slaying creatures or explore while you wait for your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r to fill up. You will be returned to your original location after the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r icon will appear on your minimap when you are in the queue. Hover over this icon to see the status and estimated wait time.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen the group fills up, you will see a pop-up notification and be teleported to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r when everyone accepts.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">加入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 队列！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>h地下城查找器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h 会自动将你与其他英雄配对组成 |h|rh小队|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h，并将你传送至 |h|rh地下城|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h 与一系列敌人战斗并获得丰厚战利品！|h|r打开 <br/><br/>\r\nh地下城查找器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h（快捷键 |h|ri\"，代表副本），或点击菜单栏中的绿色眼睛。\"{T:Interface</p>\r\n{page}\r\nTutorials\\PtA\\89_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\选择你的职责！\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从顶部的图标中选择你的职责。每次只能以一个职责排队。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>•盾牌图标代表 <br/><br/>\r\nh坦克|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h。|h|r•绿色生命图标代表 <br/>\r\nh治疗|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h。|h|r•剑代表 <br/>\r\nhDPS|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|h。|h|r选择适合你构筑和法术的职责后，点击寻找队伍！<br/><br/>\r\n{T:Interface</p>\r\n{page}\r\nTutorials\\PtA\\89_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\在 \r\n<h1 align=\"center\">h小队|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h 集结期间继续游戏！|h|r在等待 </h1><br/>\r\n<p>h小队|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h 集结时，你可以继续做任务、击杀生物或探索。|h|rh地下城|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h 结束后你会被送回原来的位置！|h|r排队期间 <br/><br/>\r\nh地下城查找器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h 图标会显示在你的小地图上。将鼠标悬停在该图标上可查看状态和预计等待时间。|h|r当队伍集结完毕时，你会看到弹出通知，并在所有人接受后被传送至 <br/><br/>\r\nh地下城|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h。|h|r</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\91_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increase your Mounted Speed!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Talk to a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r to learn Apprentice Riding! This will increase your mounted movement speed from 40% to 60%!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find Traveling Riding Trainers in early level quest hubs or visit your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and ask a guard for directions to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r.</p><br/><br/>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\91_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提高你的骑乘速度！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 对话学习初级骑术！这会将你的骑乘移动速度从 40% 提高到 60%。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在低等级的练级区域找到巡回的骑术训练师，或前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 向卫兵询问前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 的路线。</p><br/><br/>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Learned |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r are stored in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>•Open up your Character Sheet (Hotkey C).<br/>\r\n•Click the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h|r on the bottom.<br/>\r\n•Click the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r tab on the top.<br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Drag your Mount onto your Hot Bars!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>This gives you quick access to summon your mount with a key of your choosing.<br/><br/>\r\nYour first mount increases your movement speed by 40%.<br/><br/>No Riding Training is required. You can learn to ride even faster at a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">已学会的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 会保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p> 中<br/>\r\n•打开你的角色信息面板（快捷键 C）。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h•点击下方的 |h|rh宠物标签页<br/>\r\n。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h•点击上方的 |h|rh坐骑<br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n 标签页。\\{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">93_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的坐骑拖到动作条上！<br/><br/>\r\n这样你就可以用自己选择的按键快速召唤坐骑。<br/><br/>你的第一只坐骑会使你的移动速度提高 40%。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h不需要骑术训练。你可以通过 |h|rh骑术训练师</p> 更快地学会骑乘。"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn Skill Card Packs from Silas!</h1><br/>\n<p>Completing max level Scroll of Fortune quests at Silas grants Sealed Card Packs containing 5 random max-level Talent Skill Cards.<br/><br/>\nUse Card Packs from your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r or Skill Cards Menu, then Card Packs and Cards tab.<br/><br/>\nSkill Card Packs are found in almost all content. Your Skill Card Collection expands fast!</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Your Skill Card Pack to Reveal 5 Cards!</h1><br/>\n<p>Each Skill Card Pack contains 5 random max-level Talent Skill Cards.<br/><br/>\nYour revealed Skill Cards are automatically added to your Skill Card Collection.<br/><br/>\nYour Skill Card Collection is shared across all characters on your account.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Collect Max-Level Talent Cards!</h1><br/>\n<p>Skill Card Packs grant max-level Talent Skill Cards directly.<br/><br/>\nOpen packs to expand your account-wide collection and give future builds more talent options.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">从塞拉斯处获得技能卡包！</h1><br/>\n<p>在塞拉斯处完成满级幸运卷轴任务，可获得密封卡包，内含 5 张随机的满级天赋技能卡。<br/><br/>\n从你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 或技能卡菜单中的卡包与卡牌标签页使用卡包。<br/><br/>\n几乎在所有内容中都能找到技能卡包。你的技能卡收藏会迅速扩充！</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用技能卡包揭示 5 张卡牌！</h1><br/>\n<p>每个技能卡包内含 5 张随机的满级天赋技能卡。<br/><br/>\n你揭示的技能卡会自动加入你的技能卡收藏。<br/><br/>\n你的技能卡收藏在账号下的所有角色之间共享。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">收集满级天赋卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>技能卡包会直接给予满级天赋技能卡。<br/><br/>\n打开卡包来扩充你的账号通用收藏，让未来的构筑拥有更多天赋选择。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Opening Card Packs Grants Darkmoon Tickets!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Card Packs grant Darkmoon Tickets and Golden Card Packs grant Golden Darkmoon Tickets.<br/><br/>\r\nRedeem these tickets for specific Skill Cards, Random Uncollected Cards, and Cosmetic Prizes!<br/><br/>\r\nCard Packs always grants tickets, regardless of rarity or duplicate cards.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Obtain Specific Skill Cards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Darkmoon Tickets can be redeemed at Silas Darkmoon to buy Normal, Uncommon, Rare, and Epic Skill Cards. Save up your tickets to acquire key skill cards for your build.<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to Silas, Select the Darkmoon Prizes tab, then Skill Cards or Golden Skill Cards to buy specific cards.<br/><br/>\r\nNormal Tickets grant Normal Skill Cards and Golden Tickets grant Golden Skill Cards.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Obtain Uncollected Skill Cards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Darkmoon Tickets can be redeemed in the Skill Card Menu -> Card Packs tab to acquire 3 random uncollected cards from a specific rarity.<br/><br/>\r\nThis is a great option when your Skill Card Collection starts to fill out and ensures you can collect every card!<br/><br/>\r\nEach time you use this option the price increases.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Transfer Tickets with |cffe6cc80|Hitem:246095|h[Darkmoon Ticket Pouch (25)]|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Transfer Tickets between characters on your account with Darkmoon Ticket Pouches.<br/><br/>\r\nBuy a Darkmoon Pouch from Silas! Click Darkmoon Prizes Tab, then the middle Prizes option.<br/><br/>\r\nThe Prizes Menu also has exclusive Darkmoon Ticket cosmetics!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">开启卡包可获得暗月奖券！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通卡包给予暗月奖券，金色卡包给予金色暗月奖券。<br/><br/>\r\n用这些奖券兑换特定的技能卡、未收集的随机卡牌和外观奖励！<br/><br/>\r\n无论稀有度如何或是否重复，卡包总是会给予奖券。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">获取特定技能卡！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>暗月奖券可以在暗月塞拉斯处兑换普通、优秀、精良和史诗技能卡。攒下你的奖券来获取构筑所需的关键技能卡。<br/><br/>\r\n与塞拉斯对话，选择暗月奖励标签页，然后选择技能卡或金色技能卡来购买特定卡牌。<br/><br/>\r\n普通奖券给予普通技能卡，金色奖券给予金色技能卡。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">获取未收集的技能卡！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>暗月奖券可以在技能卡菜单 -> 卡包标签页中兑换，以从特定稀有度中获取 3 张随机的未收集卡牌。<br/><br/>\r\n当你的技能卡收藏逐渐填满时，这是一个很好的选择，能确保你收集到每一张卡！<br/><br/>\r\n每次使用此选项，价格都会上涨。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:246095|h[Darkmoon Ticket Pouch (25)]|h|r 转移奖券</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用暗月奖券袋在你账号上的角色之间转移奖券。<br/><br/>\r\n从塞拉斯处购买暗月奖券袋！点击暗月奖励标签页，然后选择中间的奖励选项。<br/><br/>\r\n奖励菜单中还有专属的暗月奖券外观物品！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Tokens_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy a Bazaar Token from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r have many uses and can be traded!|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r can be spent at |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r on Cosmetics and Convenience items, or used to complete missed |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests.<br/><br/>\r\nVisit the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r and purchase a Bazaar Token!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Tokens_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买一枚集市代币！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 用途广泛且可以交易！|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 处消费，用于购买外观和便利物品，也可用于完成你错过的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务。<br/><br/>\r\n前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买一枚集市代币！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests for Gear Upgrades!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Quests grants Marks of Ascension, Mystic Orbs, Mystic Runes and a |cffe6cc80|Hitem:978050|h[Callboard Cache]|h|r, allowing you to quickly catch up in gear and jump straight into end-game content!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Multiple Quest Completions, One Area!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Accept all available |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests! They are meant to be completed together.<br/><br/>\r\nThese quests are all located in the same area, allowing you to complete them all without having to travel to multiple zones.<br/><br/>\r\nBe sure to ask to join a group with other players, or invite them to a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|hParty|h|r you form! Quest progress and items are all shared!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务以升级装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务可获得飞升印记、神秘法球、神秘符文和一个 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:978050|h[告示板宝箱]|h|r，让你能快速赶上装备进度，直接投入满级内容！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">多个任务，一个区域即可完成！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>接取所有可用的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务！它们本就是设计成一起完成的。<br/><br/>\r\n这些任务都位于同一区域，让你无需前往多个区域即可全部完成。<br/><br/>\r\n请务必请求加入其他玩家的队伍，或邀请他们加入你组建的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r！任务进度和物品都是共享的！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Dungeon_Finder_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r and queue for a Random Normal |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r or pick any of the available Specific Dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nNormal Difficulty Dungeons are entry level end-game content that will help you learn your build and gear up!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Dungeon_Finder_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r，排队进入随机普通 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或从可用的特定地下城中任选一个。<br/><br/>\r\n普通难度地下城是入门级的满级内容，能帮助你熟悉自己的构筑并提升装备！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Epic_Riding_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ride at 100% Mounted Movement Speed!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Talk to a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r to learn Journeyman Riding! This will increase your mounted movement speed from 60% to 100%!<br/><br/>\r\nVisit your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r and ask a guard for directions to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can often acquire a |cffe6cc80|Hitem:3001005|h[Riding Tome: Journeyman Riding]|h|r from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or another player cheaper than the Trainer offers!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Epic_Riding_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以 100% 的骑乘移动速度驰骋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 对话学习高级骑术！这会将你的骑乘移动速度从 60% 提高到 100%。<br/><br/>\r\n前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 向卫兵询问前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 的路线。<br/><br/>\r\n你常常可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或从其他玩家处以比训练师更便宜的价格买到 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:3001005|h[骑术宝典：中级骑术]|h|r！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Ethereal_Bazaar_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">View the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r sells a limited stock of random Vanity items, spells, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r updates his inventory randomly multiple times per day from a pool of thousands of vanity items.<br/><br/>\r\nThere is always something new to discover on |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r, and you may even be the first player to find a specific Vanity Item!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Item_Stock:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Each Vanity item in stock can only be bought once!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When you buy an item from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r, no one else will be able to acquire that item unless it is randomly selected for his stock again.<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r and purchase any item for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r. You can obtain |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Ethereal_Bazaar_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">参观 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r 出售限量且随机的幻化物品、法术和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 每天会从数千件幻化物品的池中随机多次更新他的库存。<br/><br/>\r\n在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 处总能有新发现，你甚至可能是第一个找到某件特定幻化物品的玩家！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Item_Stock:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">库存中的每件幻化物品只能购买一次！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当你从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 处购买一件物品后，除非该物品再次被随机选入他的库存，否则其他人都无法获得它。<br/><br/>\r\n与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 对话，用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 购买任意物品。你可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fast Travel to High-Level Zones and Capital Cities!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The First Class Experimental Teleporter allows you to air drop between Capital Cities and into high-level zones.<br/><br/>\r\nThis Teleporter is located in popular parts of the Capital Cities, it stands out and you won't miss it.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Steer your Parachute!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You will be dropped hundreds of yards into the air, don't worry, we provide a parachute that lasts just long enough to get you to the ground... safely!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can turn your camera to steer the direction of your parachute. Operator takes full responsibility for their steering!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">快速前往高等级区域和主城！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>头等实验传送器让你可以在主城之间以及进入高等级区域时空投。<br/><br/>\r\n该传送器位于主城的热闹区域，十分显眼，你不会错过它。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\First_Class_Teleporter_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">操控你的降落伞！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你会在数百码的高空被投下，别担心，我们提供的降落伞持续时间刚好够你……安全着陆！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以转动镜头来操控降落伞的方向。操控者需对自己的操控负全部责任！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Interesting_Ethereals_Horde:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Find Interesting Ethereals Inside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can find |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r, Marazz, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h|r inside any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nThese Ethereals offer a variety of essential services. Talk to each of them to see what they offer.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\tiraxis1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r runs the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r runs the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h|r, offering exclusive cosmetic items that randomly rotate and have a limited stock, making these appearances hyper exclusive.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can also redeem |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h|r for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r items like the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r, convenience items like Potions of |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h|r and more from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ameer1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h|r Offers |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can also open up |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h|r anytime by clicking Help Request Red Question Mark in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:176|hOptions Menu|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h|r allow you to restore deleted, disenchanted or vendored items! Restore deleted characters and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\malik1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Send Unbound Vanity Items to Seasonal Realms with Malik!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h|r allows you to send Unbound |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r items from the Area 52 Realm to Seasonal Realms.<br/><br/>\r\nThese transferred items are added directly to your collection on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|hSeasonal Realm|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nYou will not receive them in the mail, meaning they are not tradable when transferred.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Interesting_Ethereals_Horde:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 内寻找有趣的虚灵！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 内找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|h阿米尔·好运|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r、马拉兹和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|h信使马利克|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n这些虚灵提供各种必要的服务。与他们每个人交谈，看看他们能提供什么。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\tiraxis1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 经营着 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 经营着 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r，提供随机轮换且限量供应的专属外观物品，使这些外观极为稀有。<br/><br/>\r\n你还可以用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉克西斯|h|r 处兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、诸如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r 之类的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r 物品、诸如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 药水之类的便利物品、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h撤退之石|h|r 等等！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ameer1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|h阿米尔·好运|h|r 提供 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你也可以随时点击 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:176|h选项菜单|h|r 中的求助红色问号来打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r 让你可以恢复已删除、已分解或已出售的物品！还能恢复已删除的角色等等！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\malik1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用马利克将非绑定的幻化物品发送到赛季服务器！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|h信使马利克|h|r 允许你将非绑定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r 物品从 52 区服务器发送到赛季服务器。<br/><br/>\r\n这些转移的物品会直接加入你在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|h赛季服务器|h|r 上的收藏。<br/><br/>\r\n你不会通过邮件收到它们，这意味着转移后它们无法交易。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Learn_to_Play_Rewards:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Learn to Play! Earn Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Path to Ascension is your guide to Ascension’s custom systems.<br/><br/>\r\nThese quests teach you the basics, grant your first free mount at level 6, and let you teleport straight to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r at level 20!<br/><br/>\r\nAs you level up, new quests unlock that guide you through Dungeons, Mystic Enchants, Transmog, and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\PTA_Supertracker2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete Objectives with or without the Quest!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each Path to Ascension has a quest that will offer additional guidance with a supertracker marker to direct you where to go.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can still complete each objective without the quest. You may even naturally complete objectives just by playing. You still get the rewards!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\120_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Collect Rewards in the UI!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Return to this UI to claim your rewards once you complete a Path to Ascension quest or objective!<br/><br/>\r\nMake sure to claim your rewards, as they may also unlock new Path to Ascension Quests!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Unlock_New_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlock New Path to Ascension Quests as You Play!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Level Up and complete Path to Ascension Quests to unlock new ones!<br/><br/>\r\nContinue the Path to Ascension to earn your first free Mount, discover new power through Mystic Enchants, and earn rewards!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Learn_to_Play_Rewards:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">学习游戏！赢取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升之路是你了解飞升专属系统的指南。<br/><br/>\r\n这些任务会教你基础知识，在 6 级时赠送你第一只免费坐骑，并在 20 级时让你直接传送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n随着你升级，新的任务会解锁，引导你了解地下城、神秘附魔、幻化以及更多内容。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\PTA_Supertracker2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">无论是否接取任务都能完成目标！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每个飞升之路都有一个任务，它会通过超级追踪标记为你提供额外指引，告诉你该去哪里。<br/><br/>\r\n即使没有接取任务，你仍然可以完成每个目标。你甚至可以在正常游玩的过程中自然而然地完成目标。奖励照样能拿到！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\120_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在界面中领取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成飞升之路的任务或目标后，回到此界面领取你的奖励！<br/><br/>\r\n请务必领取你的奖励，因为它们还可能解锁新的飞升之路任务！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Unlock_New_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在游玩过程中解锁新的飞升之路任务！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>升级并完成飞升之路任务即可解锁更多新任务！<br/><br/>\r\n继续飞升之路，获取你的第一只免费坐骑，通过神秘附魔发现新的力量，等等！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You can |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r at Chromie and Redeem |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r Tokens!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Chromie offers rewards for prestiges and an in-depth explanation of exactly what occurs when you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r, including what you keep and what you lose!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find Chromie by the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Keep Your Progress. Return to Level 1. Earn Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r will reset your character to level 1 and teleport you to your starting zone.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h|r is a great way to earn end-game gear, Mystic Enchanting supplies, Marks of Ascension, and more!<br/><br/>\r\nRelive the leveling journey, dungeons, and Battlegrounds with all the knowledge you have acquired, including your saved Mystic Enchants!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Not Starting Over. Starting Better!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You keep all professions, gear, Marks of Ascension, currencies, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h|r, and items.<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard and Draft Heroes get to roll a new build! But do not keep the Prestiged Spec's Unspent Hand of Fates or Scroll of Fortune.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以在克罗米处进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 并兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 代币！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>克罗米会为威望提供奖励，并深入解释你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时究竟会发生什么，包括你会保留什么、失去什么！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 旁找到克罗米。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保留你的进度。回到 1 级。赢取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 会将你的角色重置为 1 级，并将你传送回起始区域。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 是获取满级装备、神秘附魔材料、飞升印记等物品的好方法！<br/><br/>\r\n带上你积累的所有知识重温升级之旅、地下城和战场，包括你保存的神秘附魔！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">不是从头再来。而是更好的开始！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你会保留所有专业技能、装备、飞升印记、货币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 和物品。<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard 和 Draft 英雄可以重新抽取新的构筑！但不会保留已进行威望专精的未使用命运之手或幸运卷轴。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buff the whole realm!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h|r grant a unique buff to every hero in the open world based on the titan they resemble. Multiple scrolls can be used to stack each buff to 5 and refresh their duration.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h|r announce who used them in Global Chat, letting other heroes know who to thank!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>There are 5 difference |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h|r:<br/>\r\n• Norgannon<br/>\r\n• Eonar<br/>\r\n• Aggramar<br/>\r\n• Khaz'goroth<br/>\r\n• Golganneth<br/><br/>\r\nYou can obtain them from the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r or randomly when slaying creatures.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">为整个服务器提供增益！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r 会根据所对应的泰坦，为开放世界中的每位英雄提供独特的增益。可以使用多个卷轴将每种增益叠加至 5 层并刷新其持续时间。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r 会在世界聊天中公告使用者的名字，让其他英雄知道该感谢谁！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>共有 5 种不同的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r：<br/>\r\n• 诺甘农<br/>\r\n• 艾欧娜尔<br/>\r\n• 阿格拉玛<br/>\r\n• 卡兹格罗斯<br/>\r\n• 戈尔甘尼斯<br/><br/>\r\n你可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 获得它们，或在击杀生物时随机获得。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Vanity_Items_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Customize your Appearance with Vanity Items!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Cosmetic Vanity items help you create your unique look tailored to your class fantasy.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find a huge selection on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r! Click the Rarity Dropdown and select Vanity. Then hit Search!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can Ctrl + Left Click an item to preview its appearance. Find and Buyout any Vanity item on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Vanity_Items_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用幻化物品自定义你的外观！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>外观幻化物品能帮助你打造符合职业幻想的独特造型。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 上找到海量选择！点击品质下拉菜单并选择幻化。然后点击搜索！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以按住 Ctrl 并左键点击物品来预览其外观。在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 上找到并一口价购买任意幻化物品。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj is in Silithus!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r is located in the southern part of Silithus in Kalimdor.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Cenarion Hold or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Silithus is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj Meeting Stone is located outside the entrance to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj Through the Main Gate!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Walk through the main gate to enter the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Ossirian the Unscarred!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ossirian the Unscarred is the final boss of Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat him to complete the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">安其拉废墟位于希利苏斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>安其拉废墟 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于卡利姆多希利苏斯南部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往塞纳里奥要塞，或使用头等实验传送器空降希利苏斯，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n安其拉废墟的集合石位于该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口外。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从正门进入安其拉废墟！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>穿过正门即可进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在飞升无需 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败无疤者奥斯里安！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>无疤者奥斯里安是安其拉废墟的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n击败他以完成该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Temple of Ahn'Qiraj is in Silithus!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Temple of Ahn'Qiraj |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r is located next to the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj in Silithus.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Cenarion Hold or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Silithus is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Temple of Ahn'Qiraj Meeting Stone is located outside the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r entrance.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Temple of Ahn'Qiraj Through the Main Entrance!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Proceed through the grand entrance to begin the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat C'Thun in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>C'Thun is the final boss of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.<br/><br/>\r\nOvercome the temple's challenges to face C'Thun at the end.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">安其拉神殿位于希利苏斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>安其拉神殿 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于希利苏斯安其拉废墟旁边。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往塞纳里奥要塞，或使用头等实验传送器空降希利苏斯，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n安其拉神殿的集合石位于该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口外。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从正门进入安其拉神殿！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>穿过宏伟的入口即可开始该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在飞升无需 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在安其拉神殿击败克苏恩！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>克苏恩是安其拉神殿的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n克服神殿的重重挑战，最终面对克苏恩。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenaqueue1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You Can Queue for 2v2 Arenas Solo!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can join a 2v2 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Game without a partner. Qeuue solo, and you will be matched with another player for a 2v2 match!<br/><br/>\r\nTo join any 2v2 game, open the PvP interface (Hotkey H) and click the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r drop-down tab.<br/><br/>\r\nSelect 2v2 rated |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r battle, then \"Join Battle\" to solo-queue.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenaqueue1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以单人排队参加 2v2 竞技场！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在没有队友的情况下加入 2v2 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 比赛。单人排队后，系统会为你匹配另一名玩家组成 2v2 比赛。<br/><br/>\r\n要加入任何 2v2 比赛，请打开 PvP 界面（快捷键 H）并点击 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 下拉标签页。<br/><br/>\r\n选择 2v2 排名 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 战斗，然后点击 \"加入战斗\" 即可单人排队。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Vendor!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can find the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Vendor in Capital Cities by the Honor and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Quartermasters.<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to Vik \"Angry\" Smalls or Leeni \"Angry\" Smalls to view |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Gear!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">No Rating Requirements for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r gear requires |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r to buy. You can earn |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r by participating in Arenas!<br/><br/>\r\nThis gear does not require a specific Area Rating to buy or equip!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gear Progresses with new |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Seasons!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>New |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Gear is released with each new |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|hArena Season|h|r! The previous seeason's gear will be available for honor.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen a new |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|hArena Season|h|r starts |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h|r are converted into |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 商人！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在主城中找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 商人，他们就在荣誉军需官和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 军需官旁边。<br/><br/>\r\n与 \"愤怒的\" 维克·斯莫斯或 \"愤怒的\" 李尼·斯莫斯对话，查看 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">购买 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备没有等级要求！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>h竞技场|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h 装备需要用 |h|rh竞技场点数|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h 购买。你可以通过参加竞技场获得 |h|rh竞技场点数|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h！|h|r此装备购买或装备都不需要特定的等级评分！<br/><br/>\r\n{T:Interface</p>\r\n{page}\r\nTutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\装备会随新的 \r\n<h1 align=\"center\">h竞技场|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h 赛季而更新！|h|r每个新的 </h1><br/>\r\n<p>h竞技场赛季|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h 都会发布新的 |h|rh竞技场|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|h 装备！上一赛季的装备可以用荣誉购买。|h|r当新的 <br/><br/>\r\nh竞技场赛季|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|h 开始时，|h|rh竞技场点数|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h 会转换为 |h|rh荣誉点数|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h。|h|r</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Queue from Anywhere for Random Battlegrounds!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Battlegrounds offer team vs team objective based PvP in instanced areas. Engage in Capture the Flag, Point Control, Death Match and more.<br/><br/>\r\nOpen the Player vs. Player Tab (Hotkey H). Click Random Battlegrounds and then Join Battle to join the Battleground Queue!<br/><br/>\r\nQueue from anywhere, keep adventuring while you wait, and you'll be returned to your original location after the Battleground ends.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\22_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Accepting Battleground Queues!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can continue questing, slaying creatures or explore while you wait for your group to fill up. You will be returned to your original location after the Battleground!<br/><br/>\r\nYour faction emblem will appear on your minimap when you are in the queue. Hover over this icon to see the status and estimated wait time.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen the Battleground group fills up, you will see a pop-up notification and be teleported to the Battleground immediately.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cross Faction PvP Against Players Your Level!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Battlegrounds group players together in level brackets, starting at 10-19, then 20-29 and so on until max level. Max level players are in their own max level bracket.<br/><br/>\r\nBattlegrounds are always cross faction on Ascension. Meaning you will randomly be placed on the Horde or the Alliance side. You can also queue with your friends from the opposite faction.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Battlegrounds Grant |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r. You Can Level Up in PvP!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You earn |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r for completing objectives, slaying players and completing the Battleground on Ascension. Wins award more |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nYou will earn |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r up to your current level bracket. This means you cannot reach level 20 inside of a 10-19 Battleground. You will still earn an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h|r bonus at the end of the battleground even if you are max level for that bracket!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r, Buy PvP Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Scoring kills, capturing and defending objectives, and completing Battlegrounds grant you |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r that can be spent on PvP Gear!<br/><br/>\r\nYour |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r are stored in the Player vs. Player tab (Hotkey H).<br/><br/>\r\nYou can store up to 75,000 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r. Honor earned while capped will be lost, so be sure to spend your points on gear, currencies and other prizes from the Honor Quartermaster in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">随时随地排队参加随机战场！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>战场在副本化的区域中提供基于目标的团队 <br/><br/>\r\nhPvP<br/><br/>\r\n。参加夺旗、据点争夺、死斗以及更多玩法。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n打开玩家对玩家标签页（快捷键 H）。点击随机战场，然后点击加入战斗即可排队进入战场。\\你可以在任何地方排队，等待期间继续冒险，战场结束后你会回到原来的位置。\\{T:Interface\\Tutorials\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PtA</h1><br/>\r\n<p>22_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<br/><br/>\r\n接受战场排队！<br/><br/>\r\n在等待队伍集结时，你可以继续做任务、击杀生物或探索。战场结束后你会回到原来的位置！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n排队期间你的阵营徽记会显示在小地图上。将鼠标悬停在该图标上可查看状态和预计等待时间。\\当战场队伍集结完毕时，你会看到弹出通知，并立即被传送到战场。\\{T:Interface\\Tutorials\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PtA</h1><br/>\r\n<p>battlegrounds3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<br/><br/>\r\n跨阵营 PvP，对手都是与你等级相近的玩家！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n战场会按等级区间对玩家进行分组，从 10-19 级开始，然后是 20-29 级，依此类推直到满级。满级玩家处于独立的满级区间。\\在飞升，战场始终是跨阵营的。这意味着你会被随机分配到 \\h部落\\ 或 \r\n<h1 align=\"center\">h联盟|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h 一方。你也可以排队加入任意一方！|h|r{T:Interface</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Tutorials|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|hPtA|h|rbattlegrounds4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h战场会奖励荣誉点数！|h|r赢得战场可获得 <br/><br/>\r\nh荣誉点数|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h，用于购买 PvP 装备。|h|r你还可以通过完成战场目标获得额外奖励。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h{T:Interface|h|rTutorials</p>\r\n{page}\r\nPtA\\battlegrounds5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\\随时查看你的战场统计！\\打开玩家对玩家标签页即可查看你的战场战绩和已获得的荣誉。\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h|h|r</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Blackwing Lair is in Blackrock Mountain!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Blackwing Lair |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r is located at the top of Blackrock Mountain in the Burning Steppes.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Burning Steppes or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Searing Gorge is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Blackwing Lair Meeting Stone is located near the entrance to Upper Blackrock Spire.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cross the Chain and Enter the Balcony.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>From the meeting stone, run across the chain, then follow the rock ledge to the balcony on your right!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Blackwing Lair via the Orb of Command!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>After entering the balcony, run down the long hallway and use the orb of command!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Nefarian in Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Nefarian is the final boss of Blackwing Lair.<br/><br/>\r\nBattle through his minions to confront him at the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r's climax.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">黑翼之巢位于黑石山！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>黑翼之巢 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于燃烧平原黑石山的顶端。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往燃烧平原，或使用头等实验传送器空降灼热峡谷，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n黑翼之巢的集合石位于黑石塔上层的入口附近。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">穿过锁链，进入阳台。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从集合石出发，跑过锁链，然后沿着岩石平台走到你右侧的阳台！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过命令宝珠进入黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进入阳台后，沿着长长的走廊跑下去并使用命令宝珠。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在黑翼之巢击败奈法利安！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>奈法利安是黑翼之巢的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n一路击杀他的爪牙，在该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的高潮处与他对决。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\castwhilemoving1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy the |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse Mobility Mixture]|h|r from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse Mobility Mixture]|h|r allows you to cast while moving and is essential for builds using spells with a cast time in the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r. It can be used mid-cast to escape ground effects without interrupting your casting.<br/><br/>\r\nThis must be set as an Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spell through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r UI before it can be used!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h|r Spell can be found inside the Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Items tab in your spell book!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\castwhilemoving1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[米尔豪斯的移动混合物]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[米尔豪斯的移动混合物]|h|r 让你可以在移动中施法，对于在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中使用有施法时间法术的构筑来说至关重要。它可以在施法过程中使用，以躲避地面效果而不打断你的施法。<br/><br/>\r\n必须先通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 界面将其设为激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术才能使用！<br/><br/>\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[冲刺血清]|h|r 法术可在你法术书的飞升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You have a new item in your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r!</h1>\r\n<p>A |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r will be added to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r AT LEVEL 20 that will teleport you to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r! You can deliver any Vanity Item to complete this quest.<br/><br/>\r\nYour |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h|r is shared to all characters on this realm.<br/><br/>Convenience items like the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h|r, Cosmetics, Pets, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h|r, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h|r and more are stored here and accessible by all of your characters.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Claim your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r!</h1>\r\n<p>Deliver your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r so you can teleport to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r!<br/>\r\n•Open Character Advancement.<br/>\r\n•Click the Vanity Tab.<br/>\r\n•Type |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r into the search bar or Filter by Known.<br/>\r\n•Find and click the scroll, and then Deliver Item.<br/><br/>\r\nYour |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h|r will be sent directly to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r! Vanity items are either sent directly to your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r or to the Ascension Vanity Items tab in your Spell Book.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r 中有一件新物品！</h1>\r\n<p>在 20 级时，一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 会加入你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r，它能将你传送至你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r！你可以上交任意幻化物品来完成此任务。<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h幻化收藏|h|r 与本服的所有角色共享。<br/><br/>诸如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r、外观、宠物、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r 等便利物品都存放在这里，你所有的角色都可以使用。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">领取你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r！</h1>\r\n<p>上交你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r，这样你就能传送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r！<br/>\r\n•打开角色成长。<br/>\r\n•点击幻化标签页。<br/>\r\n•在搜索栏中输入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r，或按已学会筛选。<br/>\r\n•找到并点击该卷轴，然后点击上交物品。<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 会直接发送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 中！幻化物品会直接发送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r，或法术书中的飞升幻化物品标签页。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increase Your Item Level to 58 for Mythic Dungeons</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests is a great way to upgrade your gear and raise your average item level.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r award gear based on your current item level, up to the latest |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r tier.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Zul'Gurub, complete Heroic Dungeons, and run |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r to upgrade your gear to item level 58.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">将物品等级提升至 58 以进入史诗地下城</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务是升级装备、提高平均物品等级的好方法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备，最高可达最新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 层级。<br/><br/>\r\n完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 祖尔格拉布、通关英雄地下城，以及挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r，可将你的装备提升至物品等级 58。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup_naxxramas1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 76 to Enter Naxxramas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Strive for an average item level of 76 to prepare for Naxxramas.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Utilize |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Complete |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests and run |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r to enhance your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r offer gear upgrades based on your current item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Progress with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons and Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons (+15 and above) for superior gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeating bosses in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj or higher difficulties of previous raids also provides valuable upgrades.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup_naxxramas1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 76 以进入纳克萨玛斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>努力使平均物品等级达到 76，为纳克萨玛斯做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">善用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 来强化你的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级提供装备升级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城和安其拉神殿取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城（+15 及以上）以获取更优秀的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败安其拉神殿的首领，或挑战之前团队副本的更高难度，也能提供宝贵的升级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy golden Skill Card Packs from Silas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Golden Skill Card Packs contain Golden Skill Cards!<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to Silas, then Select Golden Skill Cards Menu and buy a Golden Pack.<br/><br/>\r\nThen open it from your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|hBags|h|r or the Skill Card menu.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Same As Skill Cards but Golden!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Golden Skill Cards Packs and Golden Cards function the same as normal Skill Cards, but they can fill the Golden Skill Card slots, allowing even more control of your build as you collect them.<br/><br/>\r\nGolden Skill Cards can only be obtained from Golden Card Packs, or earning enough duplicate cards to earn free packs. They are not found in the world.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从塞拉斯处购买金色技能卡包！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>金色技能卡包含有金色技能卡！<br/><br/>\r\n与塞拉斯对话，然后选择金色技能卡菜单并购买一个金色卡包。<br/><br/>\r\n然后从你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 或技能卡菜单中打开它。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">与技能卡相同，但是金色的！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>金色技能卡包和金色卡牌的功能与普通技能卡相同，但它们可以填入金色技能卡栏位，让你在收集它们的过程中对构筑拥有更强的掌控力。<br/><br/>\r\n金色技能卡只能从金色卡包中获得，或通过收集足够多的重复卡牌来获得免费卡包。它们不会在世界中掉落。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\heroicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|hHeroic Dungeon|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r and queue for a Random |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|hHeroic Dungeon|h|r or pick any of the available Heroic Dungeons under Specific Dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nYou are ready to queue for Heroic Dungeons! These are more challenging than Normal Dungeons and offer higher item level gear rewards!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\heroicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|h英雄地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r，排队进入随机 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|h英雄地下城|h|r，或在特定地下城中任选一个可用的英雄地下城。<br/><br/>\r\n你已经可以排队进入英雄地下城了！它们比普通地下城更具挑战性，并提供更高物品等级的装备奖励！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\honorvendoralliance:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit the Honor Gear Vendor!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Visit John \"Sailor\" Honor in Champion's Hall, Old Town in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nHis location is marked on the map with the Honor and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Quartermaster POI.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Honor Gear Boosts your PvP Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>This NPC trades PvP Gear for |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h|r!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can purchase a full set of Season 0.5 gear after a few Battlegrounds! This gear will massively increase your survivability and damage in Battlegrounds.<br/><br/>\r\nAs PvP Seasons progress, new gear will become available in this area.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\honorvendoralliance:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">拜访荣誉装备商人！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>前往 \"h暴风城\" 旧城区的勇士大厅拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h水手|h|r 约翰·荣誉。<br/><br/>\r\n他的位置在地图上以荣誉与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 军需官的兴趣点标记。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">荣誉装备会提高你的 PvP 强度！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>此 NPC 会用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r 兑换 PvP 装备！<br/><br/>\r\n只需参加几场战场，你就能买齐一整套 0.5 赛季装备！这套装备会大幅提高你在战场中的生存能力和伤害。<br/><br/>\r\n随着 PvP 赛季推进，此区域会有新的装备可供选择。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqr:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 68 to Enter Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Work towards an average item level of 68 to prepare for Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gear Up with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Complete |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests and run |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r to upgrade your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r provide gear up to the current |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r tier based on your item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Advance Through |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons and Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons to obtain higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeating bosses in Blackwing Lair or higher difficulties of previous raids also offers valuable upgrades.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqr:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 68 以进入安其拉废墟！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>努力使平均物品等级达到 68，为安其拉废墟做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 提升装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 来升级你的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你的物品等级提供最高至当前 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 层级的装备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城和黑翼之巢取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败黑翼之巢的首领，或挑战之前团队副本的更高难度，也能提供宝贵的升级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqt:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 70 to Enter Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Increase your average item level to 70 to prepare for Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Upgrade via |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Quests and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests and running |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r can help you gear up.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r adjust to your item level, providing suitable upgrades.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enhance Gear with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons and Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons (+8 and above) for higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat bosses in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj or higher difficulties of previous raids for additional upgrades.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqt:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 70 以进入安其拉神殿！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的平均物品等级提高到 70，为安其拉神殿做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 可以帮助你提升装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你的物品等级调整，提供合适的升级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城和安其拉废墟强化装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城（+8 及以上）以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败安其拉废墟的首领，或挑战之前团队副本的更高难度，以获得额外的升级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlbwl:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 64 to Enter Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Aim for an average item level of 64 to prepare for Blackwing Lair.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Progress with |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Quests and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Upgrade your gear by completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests and running |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r scale with your item level and can provide valuable upgrades.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enhance Gear via Mythic Dungeons and Onyxia's Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Run Mythic Dungeons to obtain higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat bosses in Onyxia's Lair or higher difficulties of previous raids for additional upgrades.<br/><br/>\r\nEngage in |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons for even better rewards.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlbwl:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 64 以进入黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>以平均物品等级 64 为目标，为黑翼之巢做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>通过完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 来升级你的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会随你的物品等级提升，并能提供宝贵的升级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过史诗地下城和奥妮克希亚的巢穴强化装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>挑战史诗地下城以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败奥妮克希亚的巢穴的首领，或挑战之前团队副本的更高难度，以获得额外的升级。<br/><br/>\r\n参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城以获取更好的奖励。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlmc:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 60 to Enter Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Prepare yourself by increasing your average item level to 60 to enter Molten Core.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Quests and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests is a great way to upgrade your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r award gear based on your current item level, up to the current |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r tier.<br/><br/>\r\nRunning |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r is also a quick way to increase your item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Run Mythic Dungeons and Previous Raids</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in Mythic Dungeons to obtain higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can also earn better equipment by running Zul'Gurub or higher difficulties of previous raids.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons are excellent for continuing to upgrade your gear.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlmc:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 60 以进入熔火之心！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的平均物品等级提升至 60，为进入熔火之心做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务是升级装备的好方法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备，最高可达当前的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 层级。<br/><br/>\r\n挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 也是快速提升物品等级的方法。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">挑战史诗地下城和之前的团队副本</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与史诗地下城以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n你也可以通过挑战祖尔格拉布或之前团队副本的更高难度来获得更好的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城非常适合继续升级你的装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlony:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 62 to Enter Onyxia's Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Increase your average item level to 62 to prepare for Onyxia's Lair.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests and running |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r are effective ways to upgrade your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r provide gear up to the current |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r tier based on your item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Advance Through Mythic Dungeons and Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in Mythic Dungeons to obtain better gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeating bosses in Molten Core or higher difficulties of previous raids also rewards higher item level equipment.<br/><br/>\r\nDon't forget to try |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons for even greater rewards.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlony:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 62 以进入奥妮克希亚的巢穴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的平均物品等级提高到 62，为奥妮克希亚的巢穴做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">善用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 是升级装备的有效方法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你的物品等级提供最高至当前 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 层级的装备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过史诗地下城和熔火之心取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与史诗地下城以获取更好的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败熔火之心的首领，或挑战之前团队副本的更高难度，也能奖励更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n别忘了尝试 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城以获取更丰厚的奖励。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlzg:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 52 to Prepare to Enter Zul'Gurub.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests is a great way to upgrade your gear and increase your average item level! |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h|r award gear based on your current item level. You can obtain upgrades up to the currently released |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r Tier.<br/><br/>\r\nUsing the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r to Queue for Normal dungeons, Heroic Dungeons, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r is also a quick way to increase your Item Level to 52.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlzg:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 52，为进入祖尔格拉布做好准备。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务是升级装备、提高平均物品等级的好方法！|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备。你可以获得最高至当前已开放 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 层级的升级。<br/><br/>\r\n使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 排队进入普通地下城、英雄地下城和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r，也是快速将物品等级提升至 52 的方法。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\lockingspellsandtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Locks Protect Your Build and Make Rerolling Easier!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Select the Lock icon on an ability or talent you would like to lock. These can be unlocked at any time.<br/><br/>\r\nLocked Spells and Talents cannot be rerolled until unlocking them by clicking the Lock icon again. This prevents accidentally rerolling important spells!<br/><br/>\r\nLocked Spells and Talents sort to the top. This allows you to quickly find unlocked spells and talents to reroll and ensures you don't reroll ones you want to keep!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\lockingspellsandtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">锁定可以保护你的构筑，并让重抽更轻松！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在你想要锁定的技能或天赋上选择锁定图标。它们随时都可以解锁。<br/><br/>\r\n被锁定的法术和天赋在再次点击锁定图标解锁之前无法被重抽。这可以防止意外重抽重要的法术！<br/><br/>\r\n被锁定的法术和天赋会排到最前面。这让你能快速找到未锁定的法术和天赋进行重抽，并确保你不会重抽想保留的那些！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\manastormsprintserum1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy the |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h|r from |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>This movement speed potion is an extremely versatile Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spell that will help you avoid deadly ground effects, distance yourself from enemies, and close the gap between you and enemies when necessary.<br/><br/>\r\nThis must be set as an Active |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Spell through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r UI before it can be used!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h|r Spell can be found inside the Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r Items tab in your spell book!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\manastormsprintserum1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|h考格斯沃斯|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[冲刺血清]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>这种移动速度药水是一种极为多用途的激活 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术，能帮助你避开致命的地面效果、与敌人拉开距离，并在必要时拉近与敌人的距离。<br/><br/>\r\n必须先通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 界面将其设为激活的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 法术才能使用！<br/><br/>\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[冲刺血清]|h|r 法术可在你法术书的飞升 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Molten Core is in Blackrock Mountain!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Molten Core is inside Blackrock Mountain, located in the north western area of Burning Steppes.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Burning Steppes or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Burning Steppes is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Meeting stone is on the center platform held up by giant chains. Enter Blackrock Mountains and run across the chains to reach it!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Lothos Riftwalker Teleports You into the Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Keep following the path down from the Meeting Stone to find Lothos. Speak to him to teleport into the Molten Core.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Ragnaros in Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ragnaros is the final boss of Molten Core.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat the bosses throughout the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r before challenging Majordomo Executus. Defeat Majordomo’s minions without slaying Majordomo, and he will surrender and agree to awaken Ragnaros!<br/><br/>\r\nRagnaros is located in the center of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, at the bottom of the lava pit</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">熔火之心位于黑石山！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>熔火之心位于黑石山内部，坐落在燃烧平原西北部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往燃烧平原，或使用头等实验传送器空降燃烧平原，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n集合石位于由巨大锁链支撑的中央平台上。进入黑石山并跑过锁链即可到达！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">洛索斯·天痕会将你传送进熔火之心！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>沿着集合石向下的路径继续走即可找到洛索斯。与他对话即可传送进入熔火之心。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在熔火之心击败拉格纳罗斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>拉格纳罗斯是熔火之心的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n在挑战管理者埃克索图斯之前，先击败该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 中各处的首领。在不杀死管理者的情况下击败他的爪牙，他就会投降并同意唤醒拉格纳罗斯！<br/><br/>\r\n拉格纳罗斯位于该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的中央，熔岩池的底部。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete a Mythic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h|r and queue for a Random Mythic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r or select a specific one under Specific Dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nMythic Dungeons are more challenging than Heroic Dungeons and offer higher item level gear rewards!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat the Final Boss to Earn a Mythic Keystone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Defeating the final boss of a Mythic |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h|r awards a Mythic Keystone Cache.<br/><br/>\r\nThese Keystones allow you to join |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h|r Dungeons, taking on greater challenges for even more powerful rewards.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成一个史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r，排队进入随机史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或在特定地下城下选择一个指定的地下城。<br/><br/>\r\n史诗地下城比英雄地下城更具挑战性，并提供更高物品等级的装备奖励！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败最终首领以获得史诗钥石！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>击败史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 的最终首领会奖励一个史诗钥石宝箱。<br/><br/>\r\n这些钥石让你可以加入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城，迎接更大的挑战以获取更强大的奖励。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Naxxramas is in Eastern Plaguelands!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Naxxramas |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r is located above the Eastern Plaguelands in the Eastern Kingdoms.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Light's Hope Chapel or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Eastern Plaguelands is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Naxxramas Meeting Stone is located at the base of the necropolis.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Naxxramas via Portal!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Speak with Archmage Angela Dosantos to enter Naxxramas.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Kel'Thuzad in Naxxramas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Kel'Thuzad is the final boss of Naxxramas.<br/><br/>\r\nBattle through the four wings to confront him in the final chamber.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">纳克萨玛斯位于东瘟疫之地！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>纳克萨玛斯 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于东部王国东瘟疫之地上空。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往光明希望教堂，或使用头等实验传送器空降东瘟疫之地，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n纳克萨玛斯的集合石位于大墓地底部。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过传送门进入纳克萨玛斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯对话即可进入纳克萨玛斯。<br/><br/>\r\n在飞升无需 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在纳克萨玛斯击败克尔苏加德！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>克尔苏加德是纳克萨玛斯的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n穿越四个区，在最终的密室中与他对决。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Onyxia's Lair is in Dustwallow Marsh!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Onyxia's Lair |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r is located in the southern part of Dustwallow Marsh in Kalimdor.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Theramore or Mudsprocket in Dustwallow Marsh is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Onyxia's Lair Meeting Stone is located just outside the cave entrance in the Wyrmbog area.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Onyxia's Lair Through the Cave!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Follow the path into the cave to reach the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r entrance.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h|r is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Onyxia in Onyxia's Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Onyxia is the sole boss of Onyxia's Lair.<br/><br/>\r\nPrepare your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r for a challenging encounter with this powerful dragon!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">奥妮克希亚的巢穴位于尘泥沼泽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>奥妮克希亚的巢穴 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于卡利姆多尘泥沼泽南部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往尘泥沼泽的塞拉摩或泥链镇，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n奥妮克希亚的巢穴集合石位于巨龙沼泽区域的洞穴入口外。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">穿过洞穴进入奥妮克希亚的巢穴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>沿着路径进入洞穴即可到达该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口。<br/><br/>\r\n在飞升无需 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在奥妮克希亚的巢穴击败奥妮克希亚！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>奥妮克希亚是奥妮克希亚的巢穴中唯一的首领。<br/><br/>\r\n准备好你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，与这条强大的巨龙展开一场富有挑战的战斗！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvE Power Increases Damage, Healing, and Survivability!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can view your PvE Power in your Character Sheet.<br/><br/>\r\nPvE Power is only active at max level and is critical to progressing through end-game PvE content on Ascension.<br/><br/>\r\nPvE Power does not affect other players in PvP! It is only active against creatures.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gear Obtained from Dungeons and Raids has PvE Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Gear obtained from max level PvE content has PvE power. This includes Bind on Equip gear.<br/><br/>\r\nAcquire a set of PvE gear by queuing for Dungeons, |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h|r Daily Quests, The |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r, and through the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r (just add \"pve\" to your search).</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvE 能量可提高伤害、治疗和生存能力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在角色信息面板中查看你的 PvE 能量。<br/><br/>\r\nPvE 能量仅在满级时生效，对于在飞升推进满级 PvE 内容至关重要。<br/><br/>\r\nPvE 能量不会在 PvP 中影响其他玩家！它只对生物生效。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从地下城和团队副本获得的装备拥有 PvE 能量！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从满级 PvE 内容中获得的装备拥有 PvE 能量。这包括装备绑定的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n通过排队进入地下城、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 以及 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r（只需在搜索中加入“pve”）来获取一套 PvE 装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP Power is Your Most Important PvP Stat!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP Power increases your damage dealt to players and reduces the damage you take from players!<br/><br/>\r\nHealers deal increased healing and absoption in Arenas and Battlegrounds.<br/><br/>\r\nWhile in the High-Risk Open World PvP Power increases your damage dealt to creatures and reduces your damage taken from creatures.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h|r, Honor, and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r Gear Has PvP Power.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Reaching max PvP power is the most important thing you can do to get better at PvP.<br/><br/>\r\nAcquire a set of PvP gear from Honor |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h|r or on the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h|r by searching for \"PvP\" or \"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h|r.\"<br/><br/>\r\nTaking |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r PvE gear into PvP will put you at a disadvantage against players in PvP gear.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP Power Is Only Active at Max Level.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP Power exists on all max level PvP gear. It is not used while leveling.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can increase your PvP Power before reaching max level, but you will not gain benefits from it until max level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Bloodforge |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r Gear into PvP Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can Bloodforge |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r gear by buying a |cffe6cc80|Hitem:777999|h[Bloody Jar]|h|r from Nozdormu. This cannot be undone!<br/><br/>\r\nBloodforging |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h|r Honor or |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r gear will reduce their stats, so you should only do so if you want to trade or sell the item!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP 强度是你最重要的 PvP 属性！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP 强度会提高你对其他玩家造成的伤害，并降低你从他们那里受到的伤害！<br/><br/>\r\n治疗者在竞技场和战场中会造成更多的治疗和吸收效果。<br/><br/>\r\n在开放世界的高风险模式中，PvP 强度会提高你对生物造成的伤害，并降低你从它们那里受到的伤害。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r、荣誉和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备都带有 PvP 强度。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>达到 PvP 强度上限是提升 PvP 水平最重要的事。<br/><br/>\r\n从荣誉 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处获取一套 PvP 装备，或在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 搜索 \"PvP\" 或 \"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r\"。<br/><br/>\r\n穿着 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的 PvE 装备进入 PvP 会让你在面对穿着 PvP 装备的玩家时处于劣势。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP 强度只在满级时生效。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP 强度存在于所有满级 PvP 装备中。在你升级过程中不会生效。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在达到满级前提高 PvP 强度，但在满级之前不会获得它的收益。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">将你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 装备血铸为 PvP 装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以从诺兹多姆处购买一个 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:777999|h[血腥之罐]|h|r 来血铸 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 装备。此操作无法撤销！<br/><br/>\r\n血铸 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的荣誉或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备会降低其属性，所以只有在你想交易或出售该物品时才应该这样做！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingspells1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Unwanted Spells and Abilities!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[Scroll of Fortune]|h|r allows you to reroll spells and abilities! Obtain them from Silas Darkmoon.<br/><br/>\r\nOpen Character Advancement, find an ability you would like to reroll, and select Unlearn.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can always save your Scrolls of Fortune if you like all of your spells and abilities!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard Tries to Find Synergy!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard isn't always 100% Random! Wildcard will often try to give you a Spells that synergizes with your talents and vice versa.<br/><br/>\r\nSave Spells you want to see synergy for, and reroll Spells you don't want to see synergy for. Wildcard will never stop trying to give you Synergies.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerolltalents4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Strategically!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Reroll your least-used spells and abilities that are not increasing your build's potential.<br/><br/>\r\nAs you continue rerolling the spells that help you the least, you will acquire more and more spells that significantly empower your build.<br/><br/>\r\nThis method will ensure you get really strong, really fast! And maximize your Synergy Rolls!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingspells1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">重抽不需要的法术和技能！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[幸运卷轴]|h|r 让你可以重抽法术和技能！从塞拉斯·暗月处获得它们。<br/><br/>\r\n打开角色成长，找到你想要重抽的技能，然后选择遗忘。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你喜欢自己所有的法术和技能，随时都可以保留你的幸运卷轴！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard 会尝试寻找协同效果！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard 并不总是 100% 随机！Wildcard 常常会尝试给你与天赋产生协同的法术，反之亦然。<br/><br/>\r\n保留你希望看到协同效果的法术，重抽你不希望看到协同效果的法术。Wildcard 永远不会停止尝试为你提供协同效果。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerolltalents4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">有策略地重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>重抽你最少使用、且未提升你构筑潜力的法术和技能。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你不断重抽对你帮助最小的法术，你会获得越来越多能显著强化你构筑的法术。<br/><br/>\r\n这种方法能确保你迅速变得非常强大！并让你的协同抽取最大化！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:97933|h[Scroll of Fortune: Talents]|h|r allows you to reroll Talents! Obtain them from Silas Darkmoon.<br/><br/>\r\nOpen Character Advancement, find a Talent you would like to reroll, and select Unlearn.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can always save your Scrolls of Fortune if you like all of your Talents!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard Tries to Find Synergy!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard isn't always 100% Random! Wildcard will often try to give you a Talents that synergizes with your Spells and vice versa.<br/><br/>\r\nSave Talents you want to see synergy for, and reroll Talents you don't want to see synergy for. Wildcard will never stop trying to give you Synergies.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Talents Can Rank Up When Rerolling!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>If you have Rank 1 of a Talent, you can upgrade it to higher ranks when Rerolling other talents! Talent Upgrade Rolls happen randomly.<br/><br/>\r\nMake sure you hang on to lower ranks of talents! Rerolling other talents has a chance to upgrade any of your other talents.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen you get a Talent Upgrade during a Reroll, you will still Roll into a new talent after receiving the upgraded.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\95_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Strategically!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Focus on rerolling talents that do not directly increase your power or empower your core abilities you use the most!<br/><br/>\r\nAs you reroll your weakest or least relevant talents, your build will quickly fill up with talents that all add immense power.<br/><br/>\r\nThis method will ensure you get really strong, really fast! And maximize your Synergy Rolls!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">重抽天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:97933|h[幸运卷轴：天赋]|h|r 让你可以重抽天赋！从塞拉斯·暗月处获得它们。<br/><br/>\r\n打开角色成长，找到你想要重抽的天赋，然后选择遗忘。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你喜欢自己所有的天赋，随时都可以保留你的幸运卷轴！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard 会尝试寻找协同效果！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard 并不总是 100% 随机！Wildcard 常常会尝试给你与法术产生协同的天赋，反之亦然。<br/><br/>\r\n保留你希望看到协同效果的天赋，重抽你不希望看到协同效果的天赋。Wildcard 永远不会停止尝试为你提供协同效果。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">天赋可以在重抽时提升等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>如果你拥有某个天赋的 1 级，你可以在重抽其他天赋时将其升级到更高等级！天赋升级抽取会随机发生。<br/><br/>\r\n请务必保留较低等级的天赋！重抽其他天赋有机会升级你的任意其他天赋。<br/><br/>\r\n当你在重抽过程中获得天赋升级时，在收到升级后的天赋之后，你仍然会抽到一个新天赋。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\95_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">有策略地重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>专注于重抽那些不会直接提升你的实力，或强化你最常用的核心技能的天赋！<br/><br/>\r\n随着你重抽最弱或最无关紧要的天赋，你的构筑会迅速被能带来巨大提升的天赋填满。<br/><br/>\r\n这种方法能确保你迅速变得非常强大！并让你的协同抽取最大化！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Obtain Skill Cards from Creatures!</h1><br/>\n<p>Skill Cards drop from creatures in the World, Dungeons and |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r! They can also be found during exploration and solving puzzles.<br/><br/>\nCreatures can drop Skill Cards for any spell they cast that can be learned by players. If they cast Divine Shield, they can drop a Divine Shield Skill Card.<br/><br/>\nAt max level, you can obtain a huge collection of Skill Cards from Silas Darkmoon by completing End-Game Scroll of Fortune quests.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardslot4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Skill Card Collection</h1><br/>\n<p>Open Character Advancement, then click Skill Cards to view your collected cards. Ability and Talent Cards are stored in the tabs at the top.<br/><br/>\nYou can add Skill Cards to your collection at any time.<br/><br/>\nYour Skill Card Collection is shared across all characters on your account, so new characters and Prestiged characters can use cards you have already collected.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Activate Skill Cards from Levels 1-9!</h1><br/>\n<p>Click on the Skill Card you want to slot, then hit Activate!<br/><br/>\nSkill Cards can only be activated while you are levels 1-9.<br/><br/>\nYou are guaranteed to roll any Spell or Talent you have activated with a Skill Card.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Skill Cards Before Your Build Fills Out!</h1><br/>\n<p>You will roll any slotted Skill Card Spell or Talent at the first level it is available.<br/><br/>\nIf you use multiple specializations, you can use Skill Cards in a specialization until that specialization rolls its 5th spell.<br/><br/>\nEach Specialization has its own Skill Card slots, so you can experiment with different cards in different Specs.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">从生物身上获得技能卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>技能卡会从世界、地下城和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中的生物身上掉落！它们也可以在探索和解决谜题时找到。<br/><br/>\n生物可以掉落它们施放的、且玩家可以学习的任何法术的技能卡。如果它们施放圣盾术，就可能掉落圣盾术技能卡。<br/><br/>\n在满级时，你可以通过完成满级幸运卷轴任务，从塞拉斯·暗月处获得海量的技能卡收藏。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardslot4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">技能卡收藏</h1><br/>\n<p>打开角色成长，然后点击技能卡查看你收集的卡牌。技能卡和天赋卡存放在顶部的标签页中。<br/><br/>\n你可以随时将技能卡加入你的收藏。<br/><br/>\n你的技能卡收藏在账号下的所有角色之间共享，因此新角色和进行过威望的角色都可以使用你已经收集的卡牌。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 1-9 级激活技能卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>点击你想要装备的技能卡，然后点击激活！<br/><br/>\n技能卡只能在你处于 1-9 级时激活。<br/><br/>\n你使用技能卡激活的任何法术或天赋都保证会被抽到。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">在你的构筑填满之前使用技能卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>你会在技能卡法术或天赋可用的第一个等级抽到它。<br/><br/>\n如果你使用多个专精，你可以在某个专精中使用技能卡，直到该专精抽到它的第 5 个法术。<br/><br/>\n每个专精都有自己独立的技能卡。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wargames Let You Host Battlegrounds and Arenas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can challenge other players or groups to an |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r or Battleground of your choice with Wargames.<br/><br/>\r\nIt's up to you how many players to bring! You can enter a wargame 1v1 or bring any group size of your choosing.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Start a Wargame at Teri Glozlik!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>To queue for a Wargame, locate Teri Glozilk in any |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h|r.<br/><br/>\r\nPick the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h|r or Battleground you wish to enter. Then type in the name of the other player or group leader you wish to challenge.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce they accept, you and your groups will immediately enter the Wargame. No queues!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">战争游戏让你可以主办战场和竞技场！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以通过战争游戏向其他玩家或队伍发起你所选择的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 或战场挑战。<br/><br/>\r\n带多少玩家由你决定！你可以进行 1v1 战争游戏，也可以带上任意规模的队伍。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在泰莉·格罗兹利克处开始战争游戏！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>要排队参加战争游戏，请在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中找到泰莉·格罗兹利克。<br/><br/>\r\n选择你想要进入的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 或战场。然后输入你想要挑战的另一名玩家或队伍队长的名字。<br/><br/>\r\n一旦他们接受，你和你的队伍将立即进入战争游戏。无需排队！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardbasics1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">Roll Your Build as You Level!</h1><br />\n<p>Wildcard Heroes roll their build! As you level up you will begin rolling random Abilities and Talents starting at level 10!<br /><br />\nWildcard will often grant you Abilities and Talents that synergize with your current build. New ways to play will unfold as you level!<br /><br />\nPath to Ascension will walk you through how to further improve your Wildcard build and reroll Abilities and Talents.</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardbasics2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">Roll New Spells Every 2 Levels!</h1><br />\n<p>You will roll your first new spell at level 10, then level 12, 14 and again every 2 levels until max level!<br /><br />\nThere is no limit to how many Legendary, Epic, Rare or Uncommon spells you can have in your build!</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardbasics3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">Roll New Talents Every 2 Levels!</h1><br />\n<p>You will roll your first new Talent at level 11, then level 13, 15 and again every other level until max level!<br /><br />\nThere is no limit to how many Legendary, Epic, Rare or Uncommon Talents you can have in your build!<br /><br />\nMulti-rank talents that would normally require 5 Talent Essence still only count as a single talent essence on Wildcard.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardbasics1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">在升级过程中抽取你的构筑！</h1><br />\n<p>Wildcard 英雄会抽取他们的构筑！随着你升级，你会从 10 级开始抽取随机的技能和天赋！<br /><br />\nWildcard 常常会给予你与你当前构筑产生协同的技能和天赋。随着你升级，新的玩法会不断展开！<br /><br />\n飞升之路会引导你了解如何进一步改进你的 Wildcard 构筑并重抽技能和天赋。</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardbasics2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">每 2 级抽取新法术！</h1><br />\n<p>你会在 10 级抽到第一个新法术，然后是 12 级、14 级，之后每 2 级一次，直到满级！<br /><br />\n你的构筑中可以拥有数量不限的传说、史诗、精良或优秀法术！</p>{page}{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardbasics3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}<h1 align=\"center\">每 2 级抽取新天赋！</h1><br />\n<p>你会在 11 级抽到第一个新天赋，然后是 13 级、15 级，之后每隔一级一次，直到满级！<br /><br />\n你的构筑中可以拥有数量不限的传说、史诗、精良或优秀天赋！<br /><br />\n通常需要 5 点天赋精华的多级天赋，在 Wildcard 中仍然只算作一点天赋精华。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Zul'Gurub is in Stranglethorn Vale!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Zul'Gurub |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r located in the north eastern part of Stranglethorn Vale.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Booty Bay or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Booty Bay is a quick way to travel to the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Zul'Gurub Meeting Stone is at the entrance of Zul'Gurub, directly East of Lake Nazferit and North of Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Zul'Gurub</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Head east through the large open gate from the meeting stone.<br/><br/>\r\nProceed up the stone stairs, and run through the instance portal to enter Zul'Gurub.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Hakkar in Zul'Gurub!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Hakkar is the final boss of Zul'Gurub.<br/><br/>\r\nIn order to defeat Hakkar, you should first defeat the priestesses spread throughout the instance. Each one left alive empowers Hakkar!<br/><br/>\r\nHakkar is located atop the central temple in the middle of the |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h|r.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">祖尔格拉布位于荆棘谷！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>祖尔格拉布 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于荆棘谷东北部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往藏宝海湾，或使用头等实验传送器空降藏宝海湾，都是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石帮助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或接受其他队伍成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n祖尔格拉布的集合石位于祖尔格拉布入口处，纳兹费瑞提湖正东、莫什奥格食人魔山以北。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">进入祖尔格拉布</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从集合石出发，向东穿过巨大的敞开大门。<br/><br/>\r\n沿着石阶向上，跑过副本传送门进入祖尔格拉布。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在祖尔格拉布击败哈卡！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>哈卡是祖尔格拉布的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n为了击败哈卡，你应先击败散布在副本中的祭司。每一个存活的祭司都会强化哈卡！<br/><br/>\r\n哈卡位于该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 中央神殿的顶部。</p>"
