T["|cffFFFFFFFreedom isn’t free! The free resets are now over but fear not as you can reset your spell or talent choices by simply using |r[Ability purge]|cffFFFFFF or |r[Talent Purge]|cffFFFFFF. You start off with |r3 of each|cffFFFFFF but after you run out you can use gold to reset further but the cost increases over time.|r"]="|cffFFFFFF自由是有代价的！免费重置已经结束，但别担心，你仍然可以通过使用 |r[Ability purge]|cffFFFFFF 或 |r[Talent Purge]|cffFFFFFF 来重置你的法术或天赋。你初始各有 |r3 个|cffFFFFFF，一旦用完，你可以用金币继续重置，但费用会随时间上涨。|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFHigh Risk mode means loot drop on death. For You and your Enemies. |cffFFFFFF With increased gear drops in the world, including dungeon and raid gear, you will find gear just as quick as you might lose it!  |cffFFFFFF! You only lose loot to players within your level range.|r"]="|cffFFFFFF高风险模式意味着死亡时会掉落战利品。对你和你的敌人都是如此。 |cffFFFFFF 随着世界装备获取量的提升（包括地下城和团队副本装备），你获得装备的速度会和你失去它一样快！ |cffFFFFFF！你只会被等级区间内的玩家夺走战利品。|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFHigh-risk |rFFA|cffFFFFFF PVP, this means that you can attack players basically anytime you are outside of a town. The stakes are high. Be |rcareful|cffFFFFFF out there!|r"]="|cffFFFFFFPVP |r小心|cffFFFFFF 属于高风险，这意味着你可以攻击玩ores básicamente en cualquier momento que estés fuera de una ciudad. Hay mucho en juego. ¡Ten |rcuidado|cffFFFFFF ahí fuera！|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFIt is time to choose your first talent and a new ability. Choose wisely, but don't fret you can always reset and try new things through the Hero Creator!|r"]="|cffFFFFFF是时候选择你的第一个天赋和一个新技能了。明智地选择吧，但别担心，你随时都可以通过英雄构筑师重置并尝试新东西！|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFNeed a |rchange|cffFFFFFF? Up until level 10 you have |rfree spell resets|cffFFFFFF to ensure you can play around with different play styles and discover what is right for you.|r"]="|cffFFFFFF需要 |r改变|cffFFFFFF 吗？在 10 级之前你拥有 |r免费法术调整|cffFFFFFF，确保你可以尝试不同的玩法风格，找出最适合你的方式。|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFNew |rVanity Item|cffFFFFFF unlocked -"]="|cffFFFFFF新 |r外观物品|cffFFFFFF 已解锁 -"
T["|cffFFFFFFOn Ascension, you have a lot of |rnew|cffFFFFFF features. You can access them using the |rHero Creator|cffFFFFFF on your |rMain Menu Bar|cffFFFFFF or through the |rquick access|cffFFFFFF frame on your screen.|r"]="|cffFFFFFF在飞升，你有许多 |r新|cffFFFFFF 功能。你可以通过 |r主菜单栏|cffFFFFFF 中的 |r英雄构筑师|cffFFFFFF，或屏幕上的 |r快捷访问|cffFFFFFF 框架来使用它们。|r"
