T["|cffFFFFFFThe Classless system means that every user is able to use all three |rresources|cffFFFFFF: |rmana|cffFFFFFF, |rrage|cffFFFFFF and |renergy|cffFFFFFF. To make it clear and easy to control, we include all three on your |rplayer portrait|cffFFFFFF. The |rhorizontal|cffFFFFFF bar is for energy and the |rvertical|cffFFFFFF bar is for rage.|r"]="|cffFFFFFF单一职业系统意味着每个角色都可以使用全部三种 |r资源|cffFFFFFF：|r法力|cffFFFFFF、|r怒气|cffFFFFFF 和 |r能量|cffFFFFFF。为了清晰且易于掌控，我们把三者都放在你的 |r角色头像|cffFFFFFF 上。|r横向|cffFFFFFF 条代表能量，|r纵向|cffFFFFFF 条代表怒气。|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFWelcome! |rAscension|cffFFFFFF is a progressive |rclassless|cffFFFFFF game. Over the course of your progression, you'll receive important tutorials that will help you understand how Ascension works. |rMake sure to read your tutorials!|cffFFFFFF No matter how you decide to play, you can expect to be able to fully live out your fantasy of a hero truly unique to you!|r"]="|cffFFFFFF欢迎！|r飞升|cffFFFFFF 是一款渐进式的 |r无职业|cffFFFFFF 游戏。随着你的成长，你会收到重要的教程，帮助你理解飞升的运作方式。|r请务必阅读你的教程！|cffFFFFFF 无论你决定如何游玩，都能充分实现属于你自己的独特英雄幻想！|r"
T["|cffFFFFFFYou have successfuly unlocked|r Vanity Item|cffFFFFFF!|r"]="|cffFFFFFF你已成功解锁|r 外观物品|cffFFFFFF！|r"
