T["|cffFFFFFF|rFFA|cffFFFFFF PVP is |renabled|cffFFFFFF at level 20! Soon you will be able to kill and be killed by ANYONE, even your |rown faction,|cffFFFFFF if they are willing to become a criminal. May the odds be ever in your favor!|r"]="|cffFFFFFF|rFFA|cffFFFFFF PVP 将在 20 级 |r重新启用|cffFFFFFF！届时任何人（甚至你的 |r阵营|cffFFFFFF 成员，只要他们愿意成为罪犯）都可以杀死你，你也可以杀死他们。祝你好运！|r"
T["|cffFFFFFF|rRandom Enchants|cffFFFFFF! Using a Mystic Altar, you can augment your weapons and armor with these unique effects to alter your playstyle. You will also discover gear that has powerful enchants that you like. These can be extracted and stored for continual use at a Mystic Altar. Enchants take your hero crafting to the next level!|r"]="|cffFFFFFF|r随机附魔|cffFFFFFF！使用神秘祭坛，你可以用这些独特效果强化武器和护甲，改变你的玩法风格。你还会发现带有你喜欢的强力附魔的装备。这些附魔可以被提取并储存，以便在神秘祭坛中持续使用。附魔将你的英雄构筑提升到新的层次！|r"
