T["|cffffd100Warning:|r Changing to this specialization will overwrite your |cffc942fdMystic Enchants|r with |cffffd100Build Draft|r |cffc942fdMystic Enchants|r!\n\nYou may re-apply your |cffc942fdMystic Enchants|r for no cost.\n\nYou may also use a |cffe6cc80[Scroll of Specialization: Mystic Enchants]|r to save your current Enchant loadout!"]="|cffffd100警告：|r 切换到此专精会用 |cffffd100构筑抽取|r 的 |cffc942fd神秘附魔|r 覆盖你的 |cffc942fd神秘附魔|r！\n\n你可以免费重新应用你的 |cffc942fd神秘附魔|r。\n\n你也可以使用 |cffe6cc80[专精卷轴：神秘附魔]|r 来保存你当前的附魔配置！"
