T["\nCreatures in this area drop bonus shared materials lootable by your entire party! \n\nBonus shared materials, Marks of War, Scroll of Fortune and Skill Cards do not drop on death!\n\nEvent items will not drop for players in a raid group!"]="\n\n该区域的生物会掉落额外的共享材料战利品，你整个小队都可以拾取！ \n\n\n|cff71D5FF额外的共享材料、战争印记、幸运卷轴和技能卡都会与你小队共享！|cff22FF22|r|cffFF2222|r"
T["\nOnly in High-Risk Open World:"]="\n|cff00d1ff仅限高风险开放世界："
T["\nThis event is active!"]="\n|cff22FF22该事件正在进行中！"
T["\nUse a [Keeper's Scroll: High Risk Events] while in this area to activate Bonus Loot drops for the entire server! This bonus loot is shared for the entire party, meaning everyone can loot it! This Bonus Loot does not drop on death!\n\n[Keeper's Scroll: High Risk Events] can be obtained from Alliance and Horde War Heralds for [Lesser Profane Nether], the Auction House, or the store at Ascension.gg"]="\n|cffFFFFFF\n|cffE6CC80在该区域使用 |cffFFFFFF[守护者卷轴：高风险事件]|cff00d1ff 即可为整个服务器激活额外战利品！这些额外战利品会与整个团队共享，意味着所有人都能受益！\n|cffE6CC80|r|cff0070dd|r|cffE6CC80|r"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\133_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Face C'Thun in Heroic Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic difficulty offers a more demanding |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h and greater rewards.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat C'Thun to earn powerful Heroic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\133_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在英雄难度的安其拉神殿挑战克苏恩！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄难度提供更具挑战性的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 和更好的战利品，包括专属装备和坐骑。<br/><br/>\r\n</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\138_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Overcome Blackwing Lair on Mythic!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Mythic Blackwing Lair pushes your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h to the limit with increased difficulty.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Nefarian to earn prestigious Mythic Loot exclusive to this difficulty!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\138_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以史诗难度通关黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>史诗黑翼之巢以更高的难度和更好的战利品，将你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 逼到极限。<br/><br/>\r\n</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\143_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Molten Core Awaits!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Molten Core is the pinnacle of difficulty, requiring |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h quest by speaking with Lothos Riftwaker at Blackrock Mountain.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Ragnaros to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\143_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升熔火之心在等着你！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升熔火之心是难度的顶峰，进入需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\145_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Face Ascended Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Blackwing Lair requires |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h and offers the greatest challenges.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h by obtaining the quest \"Blackhand's Command\" from Drakkisath.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Nefarian to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\145_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">挑战飞升黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升黑翼之巢需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r，并提供最严酷的挑战。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r\"\"<br/><br/>\r\n</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\146_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj Beckons!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended difficulty requires |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h and provides the toughest battles.<br/><br/>\r\nStart your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h by speaking with Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.<br/><br/>\r\nEarn prestigious to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\146_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升安其拉废墟在等着你！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升难度需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r，并提供最大的挑战。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\147_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Conquer Ascended Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Temple of Ahn'Qiraj is the ultimate test, requiring |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h by completing the \"Scepter of the Shifting Sands\" questline.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat C'Thun to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\147_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">征服飞升安其拉神殿！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升安其拉神殿是终极考验，需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r\"\"<br/><br/>\r\n</p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\148_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Naxxramas Challenges You!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Naxxramas requires |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h to enter its formidable halls.<br/><br/>\r\nStart your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h by speaking with Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Kel'Thuzad to obtain exclusive <strong>Ascended Loot</strong>!</p>\r\n"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\148_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升纳克萨玛斯向你发起挑战！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升纳克萨玛斯进入其可怕的大厅需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n<strong></strong></p>\r\n"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\MythicPlus_Dungeon:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Challenge |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons are timed versions of your favorite dungeons with added twists.<br/><br/>\r\nEnemies are augmented with Affixes that increase difficulty and challenge you in new ways.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Group_Finder:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Form a Group for |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You cannot queue for |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons using the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h.<br/><br/>\r\nGather a group of 1 |Hkeyword:237|hTank|h, 1 |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h, and 3 Damage Dealers by inviting players from |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h Chat or Global Chat.<br/><br/>\r\nTravel to the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h entrance together.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Keystone_Start:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Begin Your |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Once inside the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h, the group leader can use a Mythic Keystone to start the |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h run.<br/><br/>\r\nUse a Stone of Retreat or the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to reach the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h quickly.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\MythicPlus_Dungeon:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">挑战 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>h史诗+|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h 地下城是拥有更高难度和战利品的强化版地下城。|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n</p>\r\n{page}\r\n\\\\\\\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h|h|r</p>\r\n{page}\r\n\\\\\\\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h|h|r</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Onyxia's Lair Calls You!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Onyxia's Lair demands the highest level of skill and preparation.<br/><br/>\r\nStart your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h by talking to Drakefire Amulet quest giver in Dustwallow Marsh.<br/><br/>\r\nConquer Onyxia to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升奥妮克希亚的巢穴在召唤你！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升奥妮克希亚的巢穴要求最高的技巧与准备水平。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n</p>"
T["\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Zul'Gurub Awaits!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Zul'Gurub is the pinnacle of difficulty, requiring |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h.<br/><br/>\r\nBegin your |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h quest by speaking with the appropriate NPC.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat Hakkar to earn exclusive Ascended Loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升祖尔格拉布在等着你！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升祖尔格拉布是难度的顶峰，需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h调和|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h|h|r<br/><br/>\r\n</p>"
