T["5x Common = 1 Card\n5x Uncommon = 1 Card\nRare = 1 Card\nEpic = 5 Cards\nLegendary = 25 Cards"]="5x |cffFFFFFF普通|r = |cffFFFFFF1 张卡|r\n\n5x |cff1eff00优秀|r = |cffFFFFFF1 张卡|r\n|cff0070dd\n|r精良|cffFFFFFF = |r|cffa335ee1 张卡|r|cffFFFFFF史诗|r|cffff8000 = |r5 张卡|cffFFFFFF|r传说 = 25 张卡"
