T["<p>Max level builds are significantly more powerful than leveling builds. It's vital that you upgrade your build at max level to succeed in end-game content.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• You can find many end-game ready builds in the |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h. Hit N, then click the |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h Tab, then select either Level 60 or 70 Builds depending on your current level.</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\endgamebuilds1:2:1}\r\n<p>You can scroll through high-rated end game builds to find one that matches your playstyle!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>End-game builds rely on Mystic Enchants. Each build will show the required Mystic Enchants at the bottom of the build page.</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\endgamebuilds2:2:1}\r\n<p>You should acquire the Legendary and Epic enchants suggested immediately to unlock the full power of the build, then seek out the Blue and Green enchants as soon as possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• It is highly recommended you try out featured builds before trying to create your own end-game build. You can also reference high-rated builds when creating your own to start with a strong foundation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once you choose a build and begin to grow comfortable with it, don't be afraid to experiment and adjust the build to your specific style of play.</p>"]="<p>满级构筑比升级途中的构筑强大得多。要想在满级内容中取得成功，就必须在达到满级时强化你的构筑。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h• 你可以在 |h|rh英雄构筑师|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h 中找到满级构筑。\r\n\r\n• 你也可以在 |h|rh拍卖行</p>\r\n 中购买满级装备。\r\n\r\n• 完成 \\h飞升之路\\ 的任务会奖励强力装备。\\\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\\\\\\<p></p><p></p><p></p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h and defeat level 100!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 100.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中不断深入，并击败第 100 层！</p><br/><p>你将在第 100 层遭遇……</p><br/><p>这场战斗需要……</p><br/><p>击败它之后，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h and defeat level 1000!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 1000.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中不断深入，并击败第 1000 层！</p><br/><p>你将在第 1000 层遭遇……</p><br/><p>这场战斗需要……</p><br/><p>击败它之后，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h and defeat level 50!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 50.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中推进，并击败第 50 层！</p><br/><p>你将在第 50 层遭遇……</p><br/><p>这场战斗需要……</p><br/><p>击败它之后，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["<p>Progress through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h and defeat level 500!</p><br/><p>You will encounter .... at level 500.</p><br/><p>This encounter requires...</p><br/><p>Once defeated, you will begin to encounter...</p>"]="<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 中推进，并击败第 500 层。</p><br/><p>你将在第 500 层遭遇……</p><br/><p>这场战斗需要……</p><br/><p>击败它之后，你将开始遭遇……</p>"
T["A Craftsman’s Codex is a consumable item that unlocks an additional |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h slot for the character it is used on. This allows you to learn and level a third |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h, expanding your crafting and gathering capabilities beyond the usual two-slot limit.\r\n\r\nYou can use multiple codexes on a single character (one for each additional |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h slot) until you have unlocked every |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h. This gives you the freedom to master every crafting and gathering trade if you wish.\r\n\r\nYou can purchase a codex off of the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, from |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h or from Nozdormu for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, or from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="工匠法典是一种消耗品，可为使用它的角色解锁一个额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r 栏位。这让你可以学习并提升第三项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h专业|h|r，从而在同一角色上收集更多采集与制造专业。\r\n\r\n工匠法典可以从 \r\n\r\nh拍卖行|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h、其他玩家处获得，或通过游戏内活动获得。|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h|h|r"
T["A Feather of the Ancients is a convenience item that instantly unlocks every |Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h for your character within a specific expansion. It’s an invaluable tool for players who want to skip the slow process of manually discovering each |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h, especially on alts or during seasonal leveling.\r\n\r\nThere are different versions of the feather for each expansion:\r\n\r\nKalimdor and Eastern Kingdoms – Unlocks all Vanilla (Classic) flightpaths.\r\nOutland – Unlocks all The Burning Crusade flightpaths.\r\nNorthrend – Unlocks all Wrath of the Lich King flightpaths.\r\n\r\nOnce obtained, feathers are stored in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h and can be used account-wide on any character.\r\n\r\nYou can acquire Feathers of the Ancients from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, as well as the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="先祖之羽是一种便利物品，可立即为你的角色解锁特定资料片内的所有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r。对于想要跳过解锁飞行点繁琐过程的玩家来说，它是无价之宝。\r\n\r\n先祖之羽可以从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h拍卖行|h|r 购买，或作为游戏内奖励获得。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h|h|r"
T["A Hearthstone is an item that allows your character to instantly teleport back to the |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h you've set as your current home location. Every player starts with a Hearthstone automatically, bound to their starter zone, and it can be used to quickly return to town for safety, repairs, or quest turn-ins. You can change your home location by speaking with any Innkeeper and selecting the 'Make this |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h your home.' option.\r\n\r\nIf your Hearthstone is ever lost or deleted, it can be easily replaced by talking to any innkeeper, who will provide a new one at no cost. Hearthstones have a 30 minute cooldown, so they’re best used strategically when fast travel is needed.\r\n\r\nIn addition to travel, Hearthstones also have a unique purpose as they serve as an all-in-one totem reagent. Totem-based abilities depend on having a hearthstone in your inventory, so it’s important to keep one with you at all times, even if you use alternate travel methods like teleport scrolls or portals."]="炉石是一种可以让你的角色立即传送回你所设定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 的物品。所有玩家都会自动获得一个炉石。\r\n\r\n你可以在任意旅店老板处设置你的炉石位置。炉石有冷却时间，但可以通过各种方式缩短。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h|h|r\r\n\r\n"
T["A Hotspot is a temporary, rotating area in the open world that offers a bonus to |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h gained from defeating enemies and completing quests within its boundaries.\r\n\r\nWhen a hotspot becomes active, it’s announced in the chat for players currently in that zone, making it easy to know when and where one has appeared. You can also identify a Hotspot by looking at your |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h (if you’re in the affected zone).\r\n\r\nHotspots rotate periodically and can appear in different zones, encouraging players to move around the world and take advantage of shifting leveling opportunities."]="热点是开放世界中一个临时且轮换的区域，在其实范围内击败敌人和完成任务可获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 加成。\r\n\r\n当热点激活时，它会在世界地图上标记出来，并在聊天中公告。热点提供的经验加成使其成为升级的绝佳场所，但也要小心——其他玩家可能也在争夺同样的资源和敌人！\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h|h|r"
T["A PvP Quartermaster is a vendor who sells rare and epic Quality PvP gear, available in exchange for |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h and |Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h. These |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h are your main source of PvP equipment outside of |Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h gear.\r\n\r\nPvP Quartermasters are typically found in Capital Cities and PvP-focused hubs throughout the world. To locate them easily, look for the PvP icon on the |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h or ask a guard.\r\n\r\nThe gear sold by these quartermasters is seasonal, meaning it changes with each competitive PvP season to reflect updated balance and rewards."]="PvP 军需官是出售精良和史诗品质 PvP 装备的商人，可用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r 兑换。这些 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 位于你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h主城|h|r 中。\r\n\r\n他们出售的装备会随着 PvP 赛季更新，因此请经常回来查看新装备！\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h|h|r"
T["A Scroll of Retreat is a special teleportation item stored in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h (Hotkey N -> Vanity Tab) that instantly transports your character back to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h. \r\n\r\nEvery character gets a scroll upon reaching level 20. To use it, open the |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h, select the scroll, and click 'Deliver Item' to add it to your inventory to use like any other item.\r\n\r\nYou can use a Scroll of Retreat at any level, but unlike a |Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h or |Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h, it has a long cooldown, so it's best to save your scroll for when you want to avoid a |Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h or really need to fast travel."]="撤离卷轴是一种特殊的传送物品，保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 中（快捷键 N -> 外观标签页），可立即将你的角色传送回你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。\r\n\r\n撤离卷轴有冷却时间，且只能在开放世界中使用。它是摆脱危险处境或快速返回城市的好方法。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h|h|r\"\"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h|h|r"
T["A Tome of Specialization allows you to unlock additional Specialization slots on your character, giving you the flexibility to create and save multiple unique builds.\r\n\r\nEach tome unlocks a specific Specialization slot, and slots must be unlocked in order starting with your second Specialization. Your second slot's tome can be purchased directly from Nozdormu using in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h. Additional slots, up to the seventh, can be unlocked using these numbered tomes, which are available from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h, or the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n\r\nTo unlock your eighth slot and beyond, you’ll need a Master’s Tome of Specialization.\r\n\r\nOnce unlocked, each Specialization slot lets you swap between character loadouts without having to manually reset or rebuild your character. This makes it easy to switch between PvE and PvP builds, Tanking and |Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h, all on the same character."]="专精之书可让你在角色上解锁额外的专精栏位，让你能灵活地创建并保存多套独特的构筑。\r\n\r\n每本书解锁一个专精栏位，可以在 \r\n\r\nh拍卖行|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h 购买，或通过游戏内活动获得。\r\n\r\n额外的专精栏位让你可以同时保留多套构筑，随时切换而无需重置。|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|h|h|r"
T["A flightmaster is an NPC that provides fast travel between different zones and towns across the world using a |Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h. Speaking to a flightmaster for the first time unlocks their location, allowing you to travel back there later from other connected flightmasters.\r\n\r\nUndiscovered flightmasters are marked with a green (!) above their heads, making them easy to spot as you explore new areas. Once unlocked, they will appear as wing icons on your |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h, showing all the places your character can fly to from any given location.\r\n\r\nYou can also use the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h to highlight nearby flightmasters, helping you quickly locate the nearest point of fast travel."]="飞行管理员是一种 NPC，通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r 在世界各地的区域和城镇之间提供快速旅行。首次与飞行管理员交谈会解锁其位置，让你日后可以飞回该处。\r\n\r\n飞行管理员通常位于 \r\n\r\nh主城|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h 和任务枢纽中。解锁飞行路线对于高效旅行至关重要。你可以使用 |h|rh地图透镜 来寻找附近的飞行管理员。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h|h|r"
T["A mount is a player-controlled creature that boosts movement speed for faster travel. Found in the |Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h (Hotkey Shift + P), mounts are vital for leveling, exploration, and convenience, and come in various cosmetic styles and types. The various mount types provide unique advantages based on the terrain.\r\n\r\nGround Mounts:\r\nUnlocked first, these mounts increase movement speed by 40%, with higher speeds available from Riding Trainers. Usable only outdoors, they dismount you in buildings, or when using certain abilities. All mounts can function as ground mounts, regardless of type.\r\n\r\nFlying Mounts:\r\nThese mounts enable aerial travel in zones that support it (Outland and Northrend). Flying mounts require flight training and the proper zone; otherwise, they act as ground mounts.\r\n\r\nAquatic Mounts:\r\nDesigned for swimming, these mounts boost swim speed but offer little to no speed on land. Ideal for underwater activities, these rare mounts offer unique utility.\r\n\r\nMounts can be obtained through quests, achievements, |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, seasonal events, or purchased from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h."]="坐骑是由玩家控制的生物，可提高移动速度以便更快旅行。它位于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r（快捷键 Shift + P）中，坐骑对于从 10 级开始快速升级至关重要。\r\n\r\n坐骑可以通过多种方式获得，包括任务奖励、掉落、成就和 \r\n\r\nh拍卖行\r\n。\r\n\r\n你可以在 \r\n\r\nh宠物标签页\r\n 的坐骑标签中查看和管理你已学会的坐骑。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h|h|r"
T["A party is a small group of 2 to 5 players who team up to complete content together. Parties are used for a wide range of cooperative activities, including questing, dungeons, elite mobs, and PvP battlegrounds. Playing in a party allows you to share |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, complete group objectives more easily, and support one another with different roles and abilities.\r\n\r\nTo form a party, right-click on another player’s portrait and select 'Invite', or type '/invite PlayerName' in the chat box. Once invited, the other player can accept to join your group. To leave a party, you can either type '/leave' or right-click your own portrait and select 'Leave Party.'\r\n\r\nThe player who forms a party becomes the Party Leader, marked by a crown icon. The leader can set instance difficulty, queue the group for dungeons or battlegrounds, manage loot rules, and place visible-only-to-party markers on players or enemies. Leadership can be transferred by right-clicking a member’s portrait and selecting \"\"Promote to Leader.\"\"\r\n\r\nA standard party for group content (especially for dungeons) typically includes 1 |Hkeyword:237|hTank|h, 1 |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h, and 3 |Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h. This balanced setup ensures your team can handle incoming damage, stay healed, and deal enough damage to defeat enemies efficiently."]="小队是由 2 到 5 名玩家组成的小型团体，共同完成内容。小队用于各种合作活动，例如任务、地下城、精英怪物和 PvP 战场。与小队一起游玩可获得额外经验值和更好的战利品。\r\n\r\n你可以通过右键点击其他玩家的头像并选择“邀请入队”来邀请他们，或使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h地下城查找器|h|r 自动匹配。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"\"\"\"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|h|h|r"
T["A |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Trainer is an NPCs who teach your character the skills needed to learn, level, and specialize in professions. Unlike the |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h, which serves as an all-in-one training interface, traditional trainers specialize in a single |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h at a time. \r\n\r\nWhether you’re picking up a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h or a |Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h, trainers are essential for unlocking new |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, higher ranks, and |Hkeyword:193|hProfession Specializations|h.\r\n\r\nTrainers are commonly found in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, but can also be seen in major towns, and themed areas such as a forge or potion shop. Higher level trainers can be found in more remote or faction-specific zones, and may only become accessible at certain levels or |Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h thresholds.\r\n\r\nTo make locating trainers easier, you can use the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h to highlight nearby |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h trainers on your mini-map, helping you quickly find the one you need while exploring the world."]="专业训练师是一种 NPC，会教授你的角色学习、提升和专精专业所需的技能。与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h工匠之书|h|r 不同，训练师是免费的，并且会随着你的专业等级提升提供新的配方和技能。\r\n\r\n无论你想专精 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h主专业|h|r 还是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h次级技能|h|r，训练师对于解锁新 \r\n\r\nh配方|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h、更高等级和 |h|rh专业专精|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h 都至关重要。\r\n\r\n训练师通常位于你的 |h|rh主城|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h 中，但也会出现在重要城镇和主题区域（如锻造铺或药水店）。更高等级的训练师位于更偏远或阵营专属的区域，可能只有达到特定等级或 |h|rh声望|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:193|h 门槛后才能使用。为了方便寻找训练师，你可以使用 |h|rh地图透镜 在小地图上高亮附近的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h专业|h|r 训练师，帮助你在探索世界时快速找到需要的那位。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h|h|r|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h|h|r"
