T["Avenging Wrath\nLevel 50"]="Ira vengativa\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a50|r"
T["Bags expand your inventory space by increasing the number of item slots your character can carry. Every character begins with a permanent 16-slot backpack and has four additional bag slots where larger or specialized bags can be equipped to hold even more items.\r\n\r\nBags come in a variety of sizes and types, and can be purchased from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, found on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, looted from enemies, or bought from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h. Some bags function as containers for specific items only, like gathering or crafting materials, and cannot hold other objects.\r\n\r\nTo manage your inventory, press (Hotkey B) to open your main backpack. Pressing (Hotkey Shift + B) will open all of your equipped bags at once, making it easier to organize and access your items."]="Las Bolsas amplían tu espacio de inventario aumentando el número de espacios de objetos que tu personaje puede llevar. Todos los personajes comienzan con una mochila permanente de 16 espacios y tienen cuatro espacios de 背包 adicionales donde se pueden equipar 背包 más grandes o especializadas para guardar aún más objetos.\r\r\r\r\n\n\n\nLas Bolsas vienen en diversos tamaños y tipos、y se pueden comprar a |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|hVendedores|h|r、encontrar en la |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|hCasa de subastas|h|r、obtener como botín de enemigos、o comprar en la |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|hTienda de Ascension|h|r. Algunas 背包 funcionan como contenedores solo para objetos específicos、como materiales de recolección o fabricación、y no pueden guardar otros objetos.Para gestionar tu inventario、pulsa (Tecla B) para abrir tu mochila principal. Pulsar (Tecla Mayús + B) abrirá todas tus 背包 equipadas a la vez、facilitando organizar y acceder a tus objetos."
T["Band together with two other allies in the Hardcore Trio challenge! Grab your closest friends and set off on a single-life adventure where you'll need to tackle all vanilla dungeons in order and complete them all before level 60. Delve into the deepest reaches of Azeroth and confront the creatures within, proving your mettle as true Heroes of Azeroth!\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill [Edwin VanCleef] before reaching level 21. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill [Mutanus the Devourer] before reaching level 22. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill [Archmage Arugal] before reaching level 26. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill [Aku'mai] before reaching level 28. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill [Charlga Razorflank] before reaching level 33. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill [Mekgineer Thermaplugg] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill [Bloodmage Thalnos] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill [Arcanist Doan] before reaching level 37. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill [Herod] before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill [Amnennar]before reaching level 41. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill [Archaedas] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill [Lord Vyletongue] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|hYou must kill [Chief Ukorz Sandscalp] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|hYou must kill [Razorlash] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|hYou must kill [Celebras the Cursed] before reaching level 49. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|hYou must kill [Princess Theradras] before reaching level 51. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|hYou must kill [Shade of Eranikus] before reaching level 55. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|hYou must kill [Alzzin the Wildshaper] before reaching level 58. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|hYou must kill [Emperor Thaurissan] before reaching level 59. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|hYou must kill [King Gordok] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|hYou must kill [Prince Tortheldrin] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|hYou must kill [Overlord Wyrmthalak] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|hYou must kill [Balnazzar] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|hYou must kill [Baron Rivendare] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|hYou must kill [Darkmaster Gandling] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h"]="与另外两位盟友一起加入硬核三人组挑战！召集你最亲密的朋友，踏上一场冒险ntura de una sola vida en la que deberás enfrentarte a todas las mazmorras de vanilla en orden y completarlas todas antes del nivel 60. ¡Adéntrate en los rincones más profundos de Azeroth y enfrenta a las criaturas que habitan en ellos、demostrando tu valía como auténticos Héroes de Azeroth!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Edwin VanCleef] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 21|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Mutanus el Devorador] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 22|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Archimago Arugal] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 26|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Aku'mai] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 28|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hDeb