T["Delve into this single life challenge, where you're tasked with completing every vanilla dungeon entirely SOLO. \n\nIt's you against every dungeon boss, will you survive to max level and best every dungeon boss alone?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill [Edwin VanCleef] before reaching level 21. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill [Mutanus the Devourer] before reaching level 22. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill [Archmage Arugal] before reaching level 26. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill [Aku'mai] before reaching level 28. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill [Charlga Razorflank] before reaching level 33. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill [Mekgineer Thermaplugg] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill [Bloodmage Thalnos] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill [Arcanist Doan] before reaching level 37. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill [Herod] before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill [Amnennar]before reaching level 41. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill [Archaedas] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill [Lord Vyletongue] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|hYou must kill [Chief Ukorz Sandscalp] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|hYou must kill [Razorlash] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|hYou must kill [Celebras the Cursed] before reaching level 49. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|hYou must kill [Princess Theradras] before reaching level 51. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|hYou must kill [Shade of Eranikus] before reaching level 55. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|hYou must kill [Alzzin the Wildshaper] before reaching level 58. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|hYou must kill [Emperor Thaurissan] before reaching level 59. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|hYou must kill [King Gordok] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|hYou must kill [Prince Tortheldrin] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|hYou must kill [Overlord Wyrmthalak] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|hYou must kill [Balnazzar] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|hYou must kill [Baron Rivendare] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|hYou must kill [Darkmaster Gandling] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h"]="投入这场只有一条命的挑战，你的任务是独自完整通关每一个经典地下城LITARIO. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEres tú contra cada jefe de mazmorra、¿sobrevivirás hasta el nivel máximo y vencerás a cada jefe de mazmorra a solas?|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Edwin VanCleef] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 21|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Mutanus el Devorador] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 22|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Archimago Arugal] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 26|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Aku'mai] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 28|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Charlga Flanco de navaja] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 33|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Mekgineer Thermaplugg] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 34|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Mago de sangre Thalnos] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 34|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Arcanista Doan] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 37|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Herod] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 40|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Amnennar]|cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 41|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Archaedas] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 47|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Lord Vyletongue] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 47|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Jefe Ukorz Sandscalp] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 48|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Razorlash] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 48|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Celebras el Maldito] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 49|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Princesa Theradras] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 51|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Sombra de Eranikus] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 55|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Alzzin el Cambiante] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 58|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|hDebes matar a |cffffff00[Emperador Thaurissan] |cffffffffantes de alcanzar el nivel 59|r. |cffffff00(¡Haz clic aquí!) |cffffffff |r|h|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|hDeb