T["Donation Points (DP) are a premium |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h used in the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h to purchase cosmetics, |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h, |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h, and a wide range of convenience items. DP allows players to support the development of the server while unlocking useful features and stylish gear.\r\n\r\nWhen you purchase Donation Points, you receive equal amounts of both DP and RDP (Realm Donation Points). While your DP balance is shared across your entire account, different realms may use different currencies. Live realms use DP, while PTR or testing realms (such as |Hkeyword:71|hConquest of Azeroth|h during its testing phase) use RDP.\r\n\r\nRDP functions like DP but is exclusive to PTR realms. When a PTR realm graduates to a live realm, it resets its economy, and all future purchases must be made with standard DP.\r\n\r\nMost items purchased with these points are tradable and can be found on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or exchanged with |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, giving even non-donating players a way to access premium content.\r\n\r\nYou can access the store through the Ascension launcher or at ascension.gg/store.\r\n"]="捐赠点数（DP）是一种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r中购买外观、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r以及种类繁多的便利物品。DP 让玩家在支持服务器开发的同时，解锁实用功能与炫酷装备。\r\n\r\n购买捐赠点数时，你会获得等量的 DP 和 RDP（服务器捐赠点数）。虽然你的 DP 余额在整个账号内共享，但不同服务器可能使用不同的货币。正式服务器使用 DP，而 PTR 或测试服务器（例如测试阶段的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:71|h征服艾泽拉斯|h|r）则使用 RDP。\r\n\r\nRDP 的运作方式与 DP 相同，但仅限 PTR 服务器使用。当 PTR 服务器转为正式服务器时，其经济会重置，之后所有购买都必须使用标准 DP。\r\n\r\n用这些点数购买的大多数物品都可以交易，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r中找到，或与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|h提拉希斯|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r交换，这让不捐赠的玩家也能获得付费内容。\r\n\r\n你可以通过飞升启动器或访问 ascension.gg/store 进入商店。\r\n"
T["Donation Points can be used to purchase vanity items from Ascension.\n\nYou can purchase more at:\nhttps://ascension.gg/\nClick to open browser."]="捐赠点数可用于在飞升中购买外观物品。\n\n你可以在以下地址购买更多：\n|cffFFFFFFhttps://ascension.gg/|r\n点击以打开浏览器。"
T["Donation items are special items obtained through the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h, typically purchased using |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP). These items are designed to provide convenience, cosmetic customization, and utility, without offering unfair power advantages in competitive content.\r\n\r\nWhile most donation items are acquired through the online store, many can also be found on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, allowing players to purchase them with in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h instead of |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h. This makes them accessible to all players, whether or not they spend real money.\r\n\r\nMost donation items fall into one of two categories:\r\n\r\nConsumables – Useful tools like a Craftsman’s Codex, an |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h booster, or Tomes of Specialization.\r\n\r\n|Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h Items – |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, toys, cosmetic equipment, |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h, |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, and other |Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h unlocks are stored safely in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h, where they can be accessed by any character on the same server."]="捐赠物品是在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r中获得的特殊物品，通常使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。这些物品旨在提供便利、外观定制和实用性，而不会在竞技内容中带来不公平的战力优势。\r\n\r\n虽然大多数捐赠物品通过在线商店获得，但许多也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r中找到，让玩家可以用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r而非|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r购买。这使得所有玩家都能获得它们，无论是否花费真钱。\r\n\r\n大多数捐赠物品分为两类：\r\n\r\n消耗品：实用工具，例如工匠法典、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r加成道具或专精宝典。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r物品：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、玩具、外观装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r以及其他|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r解锁内容会安全地保存在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中，同一服务器的任何角色都可以使用。"
