T["Dungeons are five-player instanced challenges with elite enemies, tough bosses, and valuable loot, essential for leveling and endgame progression as they scale with your strength. \r\n\r\nYou can access them through entrances across the open world or with the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h (RDF), which matches you with a group and teleports you inside. More difficult dungeons aren’t available through RDF due to difficulty, requiring you to manually form a |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h (often via World Chat) and travel to the entrance. There are four types of dungeons:\r\n\r\nNormal Dungeon – Available while leveling or shortly after reaching max level. A good place to learn boss mechanics and earn baseline gear.\r\n\r\n|Hkeyword:129|hHeroic Dungeon|h – Tougher versions designed for max-level characters. Enemies hit harder, and bosses drop better loot, including Marks of Triumph or Badges of Justice.\r\n\r\nMythic Dungeon – Even more challenging, with stronger mobs and enhanced mechanics. Mythic dungeons are typically run with organized groups aiming for high performance and better loot.\r\n\r\n|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h – A competitive, timed version of Mythic dungeons that scales in difficulty with each level. Completing these challenges rewards powerful gear and seasonal rewards."]="地下城是供五名玩家挑战的副本内容，包含精英敌人、强力首领和丰厚战利品，会随你的实力成长，因此无论对升级还是对满级后的成长都至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以通过散布在开放世界中的入口进入，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r（RDF），它会为你匹配队伍并将你传送进副本。较难的地下城因难度过高而无法通过 RDF 进入，因此你必须手动组建|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r（通常通过综合频道），并自行前往入口。地下城共分为四种类型：\r\n\r\n普通地下城：在升级过程中或刚达到满级后即可挑战。是学习首领机制和获取基础装备的好去处。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|h英雄地下城|h|r：为满级角色设计的更难版本。敌人攻击更强，首领掉落更好的战利品，包括凯旋徽记或正义徽章。\r\n\r\n史诗地下城：更具挑战性，敌人更强、机制更完善。史诗地下城通常由追求高表现和更好战利品的固定队伍进行。\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r：史诗地下城的竞技化计时版本，每提升一级难度都会增加。完成这些挑战可获得强力装备和赛季奖励。"
T["Durability is a system that tracks how much wear and tear your equipment takes during gameplay.  Weapons and |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h have a durability value that gradually decreases as you engage in combat. Taking damage, using abilities, and especially dying all contribute to durability loss.\r\n\r\nWhen a piece of gear reaches zero durability, it breaks. Broken items lose all of their stat bonuses, |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h value, and effects, making them completely unusable until repaired.\r\n\r\nTo restore durability, visit any repair Vendor, typically found in towns, quest hubs, and capital cities. These NPCs can be quickly located using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h by searching for 'Repair.' Repairing gear costs gold, with more powerful items generally requiring more to fix.\r\n\r\nKeeping your gear in good condition is vital, especially before entering dungeons, battlegrounds, or high-risk zones. Don’t wait until something breaks mid-fight, repair early and often."]="耐久度是一个记录你的装备在游戏过程中磨损程度的系统。武器和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r都有耐久度数值，会随着战斗逐渐降低。受到伤害、使用技能，尤其是死亡，都会导致耐久度损失。\r\n\r\n当一件装备的耐久度降为零时，它就会损坏。损坏的物品会失去所有属性加成、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r值和特效，在修复之前完全无法使用。\r\n\r\n要恢复耐久度，请拜访任何修理商，他们通常出现在城镇、任务枢纽和首都城市中。这些 NPC 可以通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r搜索「修理」快速找到。修理装备需要花费金币，越强力的物品通常修理费用越高。\r\n\r\n保持装备状态良好至关重要，尤其是在进入地下城、战场或高风险区域之前。不要等到装备在战斗中损坏：尽早且经常修理。"
