T["Engineering is a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h and a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h for players who want to invent powerful gadgets, explosives, and utility items that can enhance the way you play. Engineers craft unique tools, devices, and trinkets that offer both combat advantages and quirky mechanical effects.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn engineering. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the materials needed. Engineering relies heavily on metal bars and stone gathered and smelted through |Hkeyword:155|hMining|h, though many |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h also require components sourced by |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, enemy loot, or parts crafted through another |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you'll unlock |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, known as schematics, that teach you how to craft many items that can’t be found through other professions, like teleporters, parachutes, and combat-enhancing bombs.\r\n\r\nCrafting engineering items requires an rclight spanner, a tool that must remain in your inventory to make most schematics. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP) or from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game gold."]="工程学是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，适合想要发明强力装置、炸药和实用物品来改善游戏体验的玩家。工程师可以制造独特的工具、装置和小玩意，既能提供战斗优势，也带有奇特有趣的机械效果。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习工程学。接受训练后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需材料。工程学在很大程度上依赖通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r获得并熔炼的金属锭和石头，不过许多|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r还需要来自|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r的零件、敌人的战利品，或其他|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r制造的部件。\r\n\r\n随着你提升等级，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，也就是所谓的图纸，它们会教你制造其他专业无法制作的许多物品，例如传送器、降落伞和增强战斗力的炸弹。\r\n\r\n制造工程学物品需要一把工程师扳手，该工具必须放在你的背包中才能制造大多数图纸。对于同时管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品可将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，并可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
