T["Equipment Sets let you quickly swap between different gear loadouts using the equipment manager (Hotkey C -> Equipment Manager Tab) a built-in tool designed to make changing builds fast and efficient. \r\n\r\nThe equipment manager allows you to save your current gear as a named set, making it easy to switch between setups. When you activate a saved set, the system will automatically equip the correct items whether they’re in your inventory or stored in your |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h.\r\n\r\nYou can also assign specific equipment sets to your Specialization, so your gear automatically swaps to match the build you're using."]="装备套装让你可以使用装备管理器（快捷键 C -> 装备管理器标签页）在不同装备配置之间快速切换，这是一个为快速高效更换构筑而设计的集成工具。\r\n\r\n装备管理器让你可以将当前装备保存为具名套装，方便在配置之间切换。当你启用已保存的套装时，系统会自动装备正确的物品，无论它们在你的背包中还是存放在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r里。\r\n\r\n你还可以将特定装备套装绑定到你的专精，让装备自动切换以适配你正在使用的构筑。"
