T["Experience (also known as XP or EXP) is the core system that tracks your character’s progress toward the next level until the maximum level is achieved. The maximum level is 60 for Vanilla, 70 for the Burning Crusade Expansion, and 80 for Wrath of the Lich King.\r\n\r\nYou gain experience by doing a wide variety of activities in the world, including:\r\n\r\nCompleting Quests\r\nDefeating Enemies\r\nExploring a New |Hkeyword:15|hSub-Zone|h\r\nGathering or Crafting using a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h\r\nParticipating in Battlegrounds or World Events\r\n\r\nYour experience bar is located along the bottom of the screen, showing your progress toward the next level. Once the bar is filled, your character levels up and grants new stat points, spell options, Talents and more.\r\n\r\nYour experience gain can be boosted by items like |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, |Hkeyword:210|hRested Experience|h from an |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h, and |Hkeyword:133|hHotspots|h, which offer bonus experience in specific zones."]="经验值（也称为 XP 或 EXP）是记录你的角色向下一级迈进、直至达到最高等级的主要系统。最高等级在经典旧世为 60 级，在《燃烧的远征》资料片中为 70 级，在《巫妖王之怒》中为 80 级。\r\n\r\n你可以通过在世界上进行各种各样的活动来获得经验值，其中包括：\r\n\r\n完成任务\r\n击败敌人\r\n探索新的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|h子区域|h|r\r\n使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r采集或制造\r\n参加战场或世界事件\r\n\r\n你的经验条位于屏幕底部，显示你向下一级迈进的进度。一旦经验条填满，你的角色就会升级，并获得新的属性点、法术选择、天赋等。\r\n\r\n你的经验获取量可以通过多种物品提升，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r中获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|h休息经验|h|r，以及|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:133|h奖励区域|h|r，它们会在特定区域提供额外经验值。"
