T["Fel Commutation is a special gear protection system used in |Hkeyword:130|hHigh-Risk PvP Mode|h, allowing players to safeguard up to three specific pieces of equipment from being dropped when they die. It acts like a form of insurance, helping reduce the sting of PvP losses without fully removing the risk.\r\n\r\nWhen you commutate, you select which three gear pieces (such as weapons, trinkets, or |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h) you want to protect. If you die while flagged for high-risk, these protected items will be immune to loot drops, ensuring you keep your most valuable gear. However, a small gold fee will be automatically deducted each time fel commutation activates upon death.\r\n\r\nYou can access the Fel Commutation Portal in any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h by looking for its icon on the |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h or asking a guard. It’s a vital system for players diving into dangerous PvP zones, especially those carrying valuable equipment or farming high-stakes objectives."]="邪能转换是一项特殊的装备保护系统，用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:130|h高风险 PvP 模式|h|r，让玩家可以保护最多三件特定装备在死亡时不会掉落。它的作用类似一种保险，有助于减轻 PvP 失败带来的损失，但并不会完全消除风险。\r\n\r\n进行转换时，你可以选择想要保护的三件装备（例如武器、饰品或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r）。如果你在高风险标记状态下死亡，这些受保护的物品将免疫掉落，确保你保留最宝贵的装备。不过，每次死亡时邪能转换激活，都会自动扣除少量金币。\r\n\r\n你可以在任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h首都城市|h|r中找到邪能转换传送门，在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r上寻找其图标，或询问卫兵。对于深入危险 PvP 区域的玩家来说，这是一个至关重要的系统，尤其是那些携带贵重装备或追求高风险目标的玩家。"
T["Fel Commutation protects your equipped items, but costs 3x as much!"]="邪能转换可保护你已装备的物品，|cffFF2222但费用是原来的三倍！|r"
