T["Finishing move that causes damage and incapacitates the target. Causes more damage and lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  : 133-136 damage, 1 sec\n   2 points: 217-220 damage, 2 sec\n   3 points: 301-304 damage, 3 sec\n   4 points: 385-388 damage, 4 sec\n   5 points: 469-472 damage, 5 sec\r\n\r\nNon-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec. \r\n\r\nAny damage caused will interrupt the incapacitating effect.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="终结技，造成伤害并使目标瘫痪。每点连击点数使伤害更高、持续时间更长：\r\n   1 点：133-136 点伤害，1 秒\r\n   2 点：217-220 点伤害，2 秒\r\n   3 点：301-304 点伤害，3 秒\r\n   4 点：385-388 点伤害，4 秒\n   5 点：469-472 点伤害，5 秒\n\n非玩家受害者的施法也会被打断，持续 3 秒。\n\n任何造成的伤害都会打断此瘫痪效果。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Finishing move that increases melee attack speed by 20%. Lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  : 9 seconds\n   2 points: 12 seconds\n   3 points: 15 seconds\n   4 points: 18 seconds\n   5 points: 21 seconds\n\nMantén MAYÚS para más información"]="终结技，使近战攻击速度提高 20%。每点连击点数使持续时间更长：\n   1 点：9 秒\n   2 点：12 秒\n   3 点：15 秒\n   4 点：18 秒\n   5 点：21 秒\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
