T["First Aid is a |Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h and a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h, focused on creating bandages and other medical supplies that restore health quickly in and out of combat.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn first aid. Once trained, you can start collecting the necessary materials, which primarily consists of cloth dropped by humanoid enemies in the open world. These materials are then processed into bandages of increasing potency as you level up this skill.\r\n\r\nAs you progress, you’ll unlock |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, known as manuals, that teach you how to craft stronger bandages and other healing items.\r\n\r\nFirst aid does not require any tools or special crafting locations, making it one of the most accessible and low-maintenance skills to use."]="急救是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于制作绷带和其他医疗用品，以便在战斗内外快速恢复生命值。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习急救。接受训练后，你就可以开始收集所需材料，这些材料主要是开放世界中的人形敌人掉落的布料。随着你提升该技能等级，这些材料会被加工成效力越来越强的绷带。\r\n\r\n随着你的成长，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，也就是所谓的手册，它们会教你制作更强的绷带和其他治疗物品。\r\n\r\n急救不需要任何工具或特殊制造地点，这使它成为最容易上手、维护成本最低的技能之一。"
T["Fishing is a |Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h and a |Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Fish gathered through this skill are used in a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h like |Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h or |Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn fishing. Once trained, you can begin gathering fish, or even buried treasure, by locating the nearest body of water. Once leveling to fishing skill 100, you can use a Weather-Beaten Journal that will teach you the skill to 'Find Fish' using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h. This highlights nearby pools with schools of fish where you have a much higher chance to get specific items.\r\n\r\nEach time you collect an item from the water, you have a chance to contribute to your Fishing skill and provide fish-based materials used directly in crafting. Different zones contain different types of fish, typically tied to level ranges and progression, so exploring new areas becomes a rewarding part of leveling the |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h.\r\n\r\nTo catch fish, you’ll need a Fishing Rod, which must be equipped and can be purchased from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h. You can also enhance your fishing ability by attaching lures to your rod. These can also be bought from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, and will temporarily boost your fishing skill allowing you to fish in higher-level waters."]="钓鱼是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在探索开放世界的同时采集自然资源的玩家。通过该技能获得的鱼类可用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习钓鱼。接受训练后，你就可以通过寻找最近的水域来采集鱼类，甚至挖出埋藏的宝藏。当钓鱼技能提升到 100 后，你可以使用一本饱经风霜的日志，它会通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r教会你「寻找鱼群」技能。这会高亮附近有鱼群的水域，让你有更大几率获得特定物品。\r\n\r\n每当你从水中收集到物品时，都有机会提升你的钓鱼技能，并获得可直接用于制造的鱼类材料。不同区域含有不同种类的鱼，通常与等级区间和成长进度相关，因此探索新区域成为提升该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级过程中很有成就感的一部分。\r\n\r\n要钓鱼，你需要一根鱼竿，必须装备后才能使用，可以从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r处购买。你还可以通过在鱼竿上安装鱼饵来提升钓鱼能力。鱼饵同样可以从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r处购买，会暂时提高你的钓鱼技能，让你能在更高级别的水域中钓鱼。"
