T["Flightpaths (FP) are a fast-travel system, allowing players to quickly fly between specific, connected locations across the open world. They’re essential for cutting down travel time, especially when questing or moving between distant zones.\r\n\r\nTo use a flightpath, you must first unlock its node by speaking to the local |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h. You can also instantly unlock certain nodes by using special items like the |Hkeyword:106|hFeather of the Ancients|h, which reveals multiple locations at once.\r\n\r\nHowever, you can only fly between nodes that are directly connected and already discovered. If you're trying to travel across multiple zones, you’ll need to have unlocked all the Flightmasters along the route, otherwise, the system won’t allow you to fly to your intended destination.\r\n\r\nOnce enough nodes are unlocked, you can chain multiple points together to create efficient travel routes, making it much easier to return to old quest hubs, dungeons, or cities.\r\n\r\nFlightpaths are accessed through any |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h, typically marked with a wing icon on your |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h and mini-map. When planning your journey, be sure to use the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h to find nearby Flightmasters and keep your travel network growing."]="飞行路线（FP）是一种快速旅行系统，让玩家可以在开放世界中快速飞往具体且相互连接的地点之间。它们对于缩短旅行时间至关重要，尤其是在做任务或在遥远区域之间移动时。\r\n\r\n要使用飞行路线，你必须先与当地的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r交谈来解锁其节点。你也可以使用特殊物品立即解锁某些节点，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:106|h先祖之羽|h|r，它能一次性揭示多个地点。\r\n\r\n不过，你只能在直接相连且已发现的节点之间飞行。如果你想跨多个区域旅行，就必须解锁沿途所有的飞行管理员；否则系统不会允许你飞往预期的目的地。\r\n\r\n一旦解锁了足够多的节点，你就可以将多个地点串联起来，创建高效的旅行路线，让返回旧任务枢纽、地下城或城市变得容易得多。\r\n\r\n飞行路线可通过任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r使用，他们通常在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r和小地图上以翅膀图标标记。规划旅程时，请务必使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r来寻找附近的飞行管理员，不断扩展你的旅行网络。"
