T["For assistance with any issues like these, please contact us By Email at:  support@ascension.gg |n|nWe also recommend you check the Account Management page at: |n|nwww.ascension.gg |n|nOn the Account Management page, you can access important account functions and options."]="如需就此类问题获取帮助，请通过以下邮箱联系我们：|cffffd200support@ascension.gg|r |n|n我们还建议你查看账号管理页面：|n|n|cffffd200www.ascension.gg|r |n|n在账号管理页面上，你可以访问重要的账号功能与选项。"
T["Freedom isn’t free! The free resets are now over but fear not as you can reset your spell or talent choices by simply using [Ability purge] or [Talent Purge]. You start off with 3 of each but after you run out you can use gold to reset further but the cost increases over time."]="|cffFFFFFF自由是有代价的！免费重置已经结束，但别担心，你只需使用 |r[技能清洗]|cffFFFFFF 或 |r[天赋清洗]|cffFFFFFF 就能重置你的法术或天赋选择。你一开始各有 |r3 个|cffFFFFFF，但用完之后，你可以花费金币继续重置，不过费用会随着时间上涨。|r"
