T["Gain the ability to craft Crude Leather from the Leather obtained from Skinning, gives you a chance to find it when Skinning beasts, and increases your Skinning speed.\n\nAllows you to craft items that require Crude Leather.\n\nYou can learn Bushcraft crafts from a Ranger Trainer, which can be found by speaking to a Guard in most capital cities."]="使你能够用剥皮获得的皮革制作|cffffffff粗制皮革|r，在剥取野兽皮时有机会获得它，并提高你的剥皮速度。\n\n让你能够制作需要|cffffffff粗制皮革|r的物品。\n\n你可以向游侠训练师学习|cffffffff丛林工艺|r，在大多数首都城市中与卫兵交谈即可找到他们。"
