T["Gathering professions are a category of |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h that allows players to gather raw materials from the world to supply various a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h.\r\n\r\nThe available gathering professions are:\r\n\r\n|Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h - Gather herbs used in |Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h and other crafting |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h.\r\n|Hkeyword:155|hMining|h - Extract ore and stone from mineral nodes, used in |Hkeyword:47|hBlacksmithing|h and |Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h.\r\n|Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h - Collect leather, hides, and scales from slain beasts, used in |Hkeyword:142|hLeatherworking|h.\r\n|Hkeyword:254|hWoodcutting|h - Chop down trees to turn into lumber and turn in for quests.\r\n\r\nGathering professions are a great way to earn gold, supply yourself or your |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h with necessary crafting materials, and engage more deeply with the world’s diverse zones."]="采集专业是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r的一个类别，让玩家可以从世界中采集原材料，为各种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r提供原料。\r\n\r\n可用的采集专业有：\r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r —— 采集用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r和其他制造|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r的草药。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r —— 从矿脉中开采矿石和石头，用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|h锻造|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r —— 从被击杀的野兽身上收集皮革、毛皮和鳞片，用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|h制皮|h|r。\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:254|h伐木|h|r —— 砍伐树木将其制成木材，并交付任务。\r\n\r\n采集专业是赚取金币、为自己或你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r提供所需制造材料，以及更深入地融入世界各个区域的绝佳方式。"
