T["Guilds are player-created communities that bring adventurers together under a shared banner. Whether you’re looking for friends to chat with, teammates for Dungeons and Raids, or just a sense of belonging in the world, joining a guild opens the door to more social and rewarding gameplay.\r\n\r\nBeing part of a guild gives you access to several valuable features, including a guild chat channel as well as a |Hkeyword:34|hGuild Bank|h to collect and share items with your guildmates.\r\n\r\nTo find a guild, keep an eye on the global chat for recruitment messages or check your realm’s Discord server, where many guilds advertise their goals and playstyles.\r\n\r\nIf you’d rather lead than join, you can start your own guild by visiting your faction’s Guild Master NPC, found in major cities. For a small fee, you can purchase a Guild Charter, gather a few signatures from fellow players, and form your own community from scratch."]="公会是玩家创建的社群，将冒险者们聚集在同一面旗帜之下。无论你是想找聊天的朋友、一起打地下城和团队副本的队友，还是只想在世界上找到归属感，加入公会都能为你打开更社交、更有收获的游戏体验之门。\r\n\r\n成为公会的一员可以让你使用多项实用功能，包括公会聊天频道，以及一个用于收集和与公会伙伴分享物品的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:34|h公会银行|h|r。\r\n\r\n要寻找公会，请留意综合频道中的招募信息，或查看你所在服务器的 Discord，许多公会会在那里公布他们的目标和游戏风格。\r\n\r\n如果你更愿意领导而非加入，可以拜访你所属阵营的公会大师 NPC 来创建自己的公会，他们位于主要城市中。只需支付少量费用，你就可以购买一份公会章程，收集其他玩家的若干签名，从零开始建立自己的社群。"
