T["Hardcore |Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h are special challenge modes that reward players for reaching the maximum level without dying. Designed to test your skill, focus, and knowledge of the game, these |Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h offer unique rewards and bragging rights to those who survive the journey from level 1 to maximum without falling in battle.\r\n\r\nTo begin a hardcore trial, your character must be level 1. Visit |Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h, found in your starting zone or |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, to activate the trial. It's important to note that you must start the trial before gaining any |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h. Additionally, you won’t be able to trade, use the mailbox, or access the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h until after you’ve started the challenge.\r\n\r\nDuring the trial, if your character dies even once, the challenge is failed. However, unlike perma-death modes, your character will revive normally and can continue to play the game as usual, they simply won’t receive the tardcore trial rewards.\r\n\r\nSuccessfully completing a hardcore trial often grants you cosmetics, titles, vanity items, or other exclusive rewards, making it a popular option for players seeking thrilling and rewarding gameplay."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h极限挑战|h|r是特殊的挑战模式，奖励那些在不死亡的情况下达到最高等级的玩家。这些|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h极限挑战|h|r旨在考验你的技术、专注力和对游戏的了解，为那些在战斗中从未倒下、从 1 级一路活到满级的玩家提供独特奖励与荣誉。\r\n\r\n要开始硬核挑战，你的角色必须是 1 级。前往|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|h石肤塔克|h|r处以激活挑战，他位于你的起始区域或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h首都城市|h|r中。请务必注意，你必须在获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r之前开启挑战。此外，在开始挑战之前，你无法进行交易、使用邮箱或进入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r。\r\n\r\n在挑战期间，如果你的角色哪怕只死亡一次，挑战即告失败。不过，与永久死亡模式不同，你的角色会正常复活，可以照常继续游戏，只是不会获得硬核挑战的奖励。\r\n\r\n成功完成硬核挑战通常会奖励你外观、头衔、玩具或其他专属奖励，这使它成为寻求刺激且有成就感体验的玩家的热门选择。"
T["Have a chance at looting Bloodforged Rare and Epic dungeon items throughout the world!\nThe higher your Item Level, the better the rewards!"]="你有机会在世界上各处获得|cff0070dd稀有|r和|cffa335ee史诗|r品质的血铸地下城物品！\n你的物品等级越高，奖励就越好！"
