T["Heirlooms are special pieces of |Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h gear designed to scale with your character as they level, making them ideal for leveling alternative characters or speeding up the journey to maximum level. These items not only increase in power as your character gains levels, but many also provide bonus |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, helping you level faster through quests, kills, and battlegrounds.\r\n\r\nHeirlooms are stored in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h and are accessible to all characters on the same realm. Once unlocked, you can equip heirlooms on any eligible character, giving you a powerful head start with solid stats and consistent performance across all level ranges.\r\n\r\nMost heirlooms come in the form of weapons, |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h, and trinkets, and some are themed to match specific class roles, such as Strength-based melee, Intellect-based casters, or Agility-based archers.\r\n\r\nHeirlooms can be obtained through various means, including purchasing them from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h for PvP Points, |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h Points, Marks of Ascension, and from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n"]="传家宝是特殊的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r装备，其设计目的是随着你的角色升级而成长，因此非常适合练小号或加快达到满级的速度。这些物品不仅会随着角色等级提升而增强威力，其中许多还会提供额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r，帮助你在做任务、击杀和战场中更快升级。\r\n\r\n传家宝会保存在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中，同一服务器的所有角色都可以使用。一旦解锁，你就可以在任何符合条件的角色上装备传家宝，凭借良好的属性和在各个等级区间稳定的表现，获得强大的起步优势。\r\n\r\n大多数传家宝是武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r和饰品，其中一些针对特定的职业定位设计，例如以力量为基础的近战、以智力为基础的法系或以敏捷为基础的弓手。\r\n\r\n传家宝可以通过多种方式获得，包括从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r处用 PvP 点数、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r点数、飞升徽记购买，以及在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n"
