T["Hemophilia:\nWhile your health is below 90% of your maximum health, you take 5% of your health every 1 second."]="|cFFFFCC00血友病：|r\n当你的生命值低于最大生命值的 90% 时，每 |cffFF99001 秒|r 受到相当于你生命值 |cffFF99005%|r 的伤害。"
