T["Herbalism is a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h and a |Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Herbs gathered by herbalists are used in Crafting Professions like |Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn herbalism. Once trained, you can begin gathering herbs by locating plant nodes found throughout the open world. After learning the |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h, you'll also unlock the 'Find Herbs' function in the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h, which highlights nearby herb nodes, making it much easier to spot gathering opportunities as you explore.\r\n\r\nEach herb node you gather has a chance to contribute to your herbalism skill and provides plant-based materials used directly in crafting. Different zones contain different types of herbs, typically tied to level ranges and progression, so exploring new areas becomes a rewarding part of leveling the |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h.\r\n\r\nWhile herbalism does not require a special tool to gather herbs, many players combine it with Crafting Professions like |Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h to streamline their material supply. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP) or from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game gold."]="草药学是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在探索开放世界的同时采集自然资源的玩家。草药师采集的草药可用于制造专业，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习草药学。接受训练后，你就可以通过寻找散布在开放世界各处的植物节点来采集草药。学会该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r后，你还将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r中的「寻找草药」功能，它会高亮附近的草药节点，让你在探索时更容易发现采集机会。\r\n\r\n你采集的每个草药节点都有机会提升你的草药学技能，并提供可直接用于制造的植物材料。不同区域含有不同种类的草药，通常与等级区间和成长进度相关，因此探索新区域成为提升该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级过程中很有成就感的一部分。\r\n\r\n虽然草药学不需要特殊工具来采集草药，但许多玩家会将其与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r等制造专业搭配，以简化材料供应。对于同时管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品可将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，并可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
