T["Heroic dungeons are tougher, maximum level versions of regular dungeons, designed to offer greater challenges and significantly improved rewards. These dungeons feature enhanced enemies, harder-hitting bosses, and more complex mechanics, making them a key part of any player’s endgame progression.\r\n\r\nTo enter a heroic |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h from the open world, right-click your character portrait, select '|Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h Difficulty', and switch to 'Heroic' before entering the instance. Otherwise simply select the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h you desire from the specific list, or use the 'Random Heroic |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h' option from the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h.\r\n\r\nHeroic dungeons offer access to endgame PvE currencies. Bosses in these dungeons drop either Marks of Triumph (in Vanilla content) or Badges of Justice (in Burning Crusade content).\r\n\r\nThese currencies can be exchanged at special |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h or PvE hub for specific pieces of |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h-quality gear, giving players a guaranteed path to upgrades even if the boss doesn’t drop what they need directly. This system helps ensure that everyone in the group can make progress.\r\n\r\nHeroic dungeons are a core stepping stone into the next |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, mythic |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h, and high-end character builds, offering a reliable way to gear up and master your role."]="英雄地下城是普通地下城更难、面向满级的版本，旨在提供更大的挑战和明显更好的奖励。这些地下城拥有强化的敌人、攻击更猛的首领和更复杂的机制，使其成为任何玩家满级后成长的关键一环。\r\n\r\n要从开放世界进入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r英雄模式，请右键点击你的角色头像，选择\"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r难度\"，并在进入副本前切换为\"英雄\"。你也可以直接在指定列表中选择想要的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r中使用\"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r英雄随机\"选项。\r\n\r\n英雄地下城可以获取满级 PvE 货币。这些地下城的首领掉落凯旋徽记（经典旧世内容）或正义徽章（燃烧的远征内容）。\r\n\r\n这些货币可以在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h首都城市|h|r或 PvE 枢纽的专属|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r处兑换特定部位的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r品质装备，即使首领没有直接掉落所需物品，也能为玩家提供一条稳定的提升途径。该系统有助于确保队伍中的每个人都能取得进展。\r\n\r\n英雄地下城是通往下一个|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r、史诗|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r和高阶角色构筑的关键跳板，提供了一条可靠的装备提升和精通自身定位的途径。"
