T["High Risk mode means loot drop on death. For You and your Enemies.  With increased gear drops in the world, including dungeon and raid gear, you will find gear just as quick as you might lose it!  ! You only lose loot to players within your level range."]="|cffFFFFFF高风险模式意味着死亡时会掉落战利品。对你和你的敌人都是如此。|cffFFFFFF 随着世界中装备掉落量增加，包括地下城和团队副本装备，你会发现获得装备的速度和失去装备的速度一样快！|cffFFFFFF！你只会向等级区间内的玩家掉落战利品。|r"
T["High-Risk Bonuses"]="|cffff0000高风险加成|r"
T["High-Risk PvP Mode is a ruleset designed for players seeking a high-stakes, full-loot PvP extravaganza. \r\n\r\nIn this mode, defeating other players allows you to loot their gear and inventory, creating intense and rewarding encounters. However, the danger goes both ways, if you die, you risk dropping a piece of your equipped gear, along with items from your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h.\r\n\r\nTo help manage the risk, players can use |Hkeyword:104|hFel Commutation|h, a system that allows you to protect specific gear pieces from being dropped on death. \r\n\r\nItems that are not protected by |Hkeyword:104|hFel Commutation|h and are looted in High-Risk PvP Mode immediately become |Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h with powerful PvP stats.\r\n\r\nTo enable High-Risk mode, head to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h and open the |Hkeyword:136|hHybrid Risk|h menu (Hotkey H -> PvP Ruleset Tab), then select 'High-Risk PvP Mode' as your active ruleset. Keep in mind that switching between PvP modes has a 15 minute cooldown, so plan your activities accordingly."]="高风险 PvP 模式是一套为追求高赌注、全掉落的 PvP 体验的玩家而设计的规则集。\r\n\r\n在该模式下，击败其他玩家可以让你掠夺他们的装备和背包，创造出激烈而令人满足的对决。然而，危险是双向的：如果你死亡，就有可能失去一件已装备的装备，以及你|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r中的物品。\r\n\r\n为帮助管理风险，玩家可以使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:104|h邪能转换|h|r，这一系统让你可以保护特定装备在死亡时不会掉落。\r\n\r\n未受|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:104|h邪能转换|h|r保护、并在高风险 PvP 模式中被掠夺的物品会立即变为带有强力 PvP 属性的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r装备。\r\n\r\n要启用高风险模式，请前往你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h首都城市|h|r并打开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|h混合风险|h|r菜单（快捷键 H -> PvP 规则集标签页），然后选择「高风险 PvP 模式」作为你的启用规则集。请注意，在 PvP 模式之间切换有 15 分钟的冷却时间，因此请相应地规划你的活动。"
T["High-risk FFA PVP, this means that you can attack players basically anytime you are outside of a town. The stakes are high. Be careful out there!"]="|cffFFFFFF高风险 |r自由|cffFFFFFF PVP，这意味着只要你在城镇之外，基本上随时都可以攻击玩家。赌注很高。在外|r小心|cffFFFFFF行事！|r"
T["Hit rating is a secondary stat that increases your chance to successfully land spells and abilities on your target. It helps prevent your attacks from missing, which is vital for maintaining a consistent damage output.\r\n\r\nMelee, ranged, and spell attacks each have their own |Hkeyword:131|hHit Cap|h. Reaching the appropriate |Hkeyword:131|hHit Cap|h for your build and content type (PvE or PvP) is a key part of optimizing performance.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current hit rating in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="命中等级是一项次要属性，可提高你的法术和技能命中目标的几率。它有助于避免你的攻击落空，这对保持稳定的伤害输出至关重要。\r\n\r\n近战、远程和法术攻击各有自己的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:131|h命中上限|h|r。达到适合你的构筑和内容类型（PvE 或 PvP）的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:131|h命中上限|h|r，是优化表现的关键。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中查看当前的命中等级。"
T["Hold Shift to allocate 10 points per stat"]="|cffE1AB18按住 |cffFFFFFFShift|cffE1AB18 可为每项属性分配 10 点|r"
T["Hold left click to drag Mount to your Action Bars"]="|cffFFFF00按住鼠标左键|r即可|cffFFFF00拖动|r坐骑到你的动作条上"
