T["If there is another player you have enjoyed playing with, add them to your friends list! Click on the Social Button (Hotkey O) and add them to your list of friends.|n|nYou can only add friends from your own realm."]="如果有你乐于一起游戏的玩家，就把他们加入好友列表！点击|cffffd200社交按钮|r（快捷键 O）并将其加入好友列表。|n|你只能添加自己所在服务器的好友。"
