T["Increases Armor by 120.\r\n\r\nIf an enemy strikes the caster, they may have their movement slowed by 15% and the time between their attacks increased by 20% for 5 sec. \r\nLasts until cancelled.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使护甲值提高 120。\r\n\r\n如果敌人击中施法者，其移动速度可能降低 15%，攻击间隔延长 20%，持续 5 秒。\r\n持续直到主动取消。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
