T["Increases Swipe and Ravage damage by 10%.\n\nIncreases all damage dealt by 1% while Tiger's Fury is active.\n\r\nReduces the chance enemies have to detect you while Prowling.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing damage with Swipe and Ravage reduce the cooldown of Tiger's Fury and Enrage by 1 second."]="使横扫和毁灭造成的伤害提高 10%。\r\n\n当老虎之怒激活时，使所有造成的伤害提高 1%。\n\n使你在潜行时被敌人发现的几率降低。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：用横扫和毁灭造成伤害可使老虎之怒和激怒的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。|r"
T["Increases Swipe and Ravage damage by 20%.\n\nIncreases all damage dealt by 2% while Tiger's Fury is active.\r\n\r\nReduces the chance enemies have to detect you while Prowling.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing damage with Swipe and Ravage reduce the cooldown of Tiger's Fury and Enrage by 1 second."]="使横扫和毁灭造成的伤害提高 20%。\r\n\r\n当老虎之怒激活时，使所有造成的伤害提高 2%。\n\n使你在潜行时被敌人发现的几率降低。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：用横扫和毁灭造成伤害可使老虎之怒和激怒的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。|r"
T["Increases all damage and healing caused by 20% for 20 sec.\n\r\nCannot be used within 30 sec of being the target of Divine Shield, Divine Protection, or Hand of Protection, or of using Lay on Hands on oneself.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使所有造成的伤害和治疗量提高 20%，持续 20 秒。\r\n\n在成为圣盾术、神圣保护或保护之手的目标后 30 秒内，或对自己使用圣疗术后 30 秒内，无法使用。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases all damage done by 1%\r\n\r\nIncreases Frost damage done by 1%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the duration of Deep Freeze by 0.33 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Deep Freeze casts apply up to 5 frozen enemies within 8 yards of your target. If used with Fingers of Frost, it will consume only one charge."]="使所有造成的伤害提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使造成的冰霜伤害提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使深度冻结的持续时间延长 0.33 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的深度冻结会使目标 8 码范围内最多 5 个敌人被冻结。若与寒冰指一同使用，则只消耗一层。|r"
T["Increases all damage done by 2%\r\n\r\nIncreases Frost damage done by 2%.\r\n\r\nIncreases the duration of Deep Freeze by 0.66 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Deep Freeze casts apply up to 5 frozen enemies within 8 yards of your target. If used with Fingers of Frost, it will consume only one charge."]="使所有造成的伤害提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使造成的冰霜伤害提高 2%。\r\n\n使深度冻结的持续时间延长 0.66 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的深度冻结会使目标 8 码范围内最多 5 个敌人被冻结。若与寒冰指一同使用，则只消耗一层。|r"
T["Increases armor from cloth and leather by 370%, damage taken while stunned is reduced by 15%. Your direct damaging spells have a 33% chance to regenerate 2% of your total mana.\r\n\nAll party and raid members gain 5% increased spell critical effect chance.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使布甲和皮甲提供的护甲值提高 370%，你处于昏迷状态时受到的伤害降低 15%。你的直接伤害法术有 33% 的几率恢复你总法力值的 2%。\r\n\n所有小队和团队成员的法术爆击几率提高 5%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases haste by 1%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 35%\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your periodic magic damage heals you for 20% of the damage done while casting any damaging spell. \n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的急速提高 1%。\r\n\r\n使你在施法时受到的伤害性攻击造成的施法推迟降低 35%。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：在施放任何伤害性法术时，你的周期性魔法伤害会为你恢复其所造成伤害的 20%。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases haste by 2%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 70%\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your periodic magic damage heals you for 20% of the damage done while casting any damaging spell.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的急速提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你在施法时受到的伤害性攻击造成的施法推迟降低 70%。\r\n\r\n巅峰加成：在施放任何伤害性法术时，你的周期性魔法伤害会为你恢复其所造成伤害的 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases haste by 3%.\r\n\r\nReduces the pushback suffered from damaging attacks while casting by 100%\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your periodic magic damage heals you for 20% of the damage done while casting any damaging spell.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的急速提高 3%。\r\n\r\n使你在施法时受到的伤害性攻击造成的施法推迟降低 100%。\r\n\r\n巅峰加成：在施放任何伤害性法术时，你的周期性魔法伤害会为你恢复其所造成伤害的 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases healing done to you by 10%. \r\n \r\nYour Rogue finishing moves refund 40% of their Energy cost when they fail to hit.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你所受到的治疗量提高 10%。\r\n \r\n你的潜行者终结技未命中时会返还其能量消耗的 40%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
