T["Increases the critical effect chance of your Holy Light, Flash of Light, Holy Shock, and Light of Dawn spells by 2%. \r\n\r\nIncreases the amount healed by your Holy critical heals by 5%.\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: After using Blinding Light your next Holy Light, Flash of Light, Holy Shock or Light of Dawn has a 100% increased critical effect chance."]="使你的圣光术、圣光闪现、神圣震击和黎明之光的爆击几率提高 2%。\r\n\r\n使你的神圣爆击治疗的治疗量提高 5%。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：使用致盲之光后，你的下一个圣光术、圣光闪现、神圣震击或黎明之光的爆击几率提高 100%。|r"
T["Increases the critical effect chance of your Holy Light, Flash of Light, Holy Shock, and Light of Dawn spells by 4%. \r\n\r\nIncreases the amount healed by your Holy critical heals by 10%.\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: After using Blinding Light your next Holy Light, Flash of Light, Holy Shock or Light of Dawn has a 100% increased critical effect chance."]="使你的圣光术、圣光闪现、神圣震击和黎明之光的爆击几率提高 4%。\r\n\r\n使你的神圣爆击治疗的治疗量提高 10%。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：使用致盲之光后，你的下一个圣光术、圣光闪现、神圣震击或黎明之光的爆击几率提高 100%。|r"
