T["Increases the duration of your Immolate by 3 sec. Dealing damage with Corruption has a 4% chance to grant you Molten Core.\r\n\r\nMolten Core empowers your next 3 spells cast within 15 sec:\r\n\r\nIncinerate - Increases damage done by 6% and reduces cast time by 10%.\r\n\r\nSoul Fire - Increases damage done by 6% and increases critical strike chance by 5%."]="使你的献祭持续时间延长 3 秒。用腐蚀术造成伤害有 4% 的几率赋予你熔火之心。\r\n\r\n熔火之心会强化你在 15 秒内施放的下 3 个法术：\r\n\r\n|cFFFFFFFF烧尽|r —— 造成的伤害提高 6%，施法时间缩短 10%。\r\n\r\n|cFFFFFFFF灵魂之火|r —— 造成的伤害提高 6%，爆击几率提高 5%。"
T["Increases the effect of your Concentration Aura by an additional 10%.\r\n\r\nWhile any Aura is active reduces the duration of any Silence or Interrupt effect used against an affected group member by 20%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的专注光环的效果额外提高 10%。\r\n\r\n当任何光环激活时，使任何针对受影响小队成员的沉默或打断效果的持续时间缩短 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
