T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing direct magic damage to a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 33% chance to corrupt their soul, dealing Shadow damage over 3 seconds. \n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的带有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的射程延长 2 码。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对 20 码以外的目标造成直接魔法伤害时，有 33% 的几率腐蚀其灵魂，在 3 秒内造成暗影伤害。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing periodic Shadow damage to an enemy within melee range has a 33% chance to trigger a Grim Strike, dealing Shadow damage and reducing the target's melee attack power by 15 for 30 sec. \n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的带有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的射程延长 2 码。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对近战范围内的敌人造成周期性暗影伤害时，有 33% 的几率触发一次冷酷打击，造成暗影伤害并使目标的近战攻击强度降低 15，持续 30 秒。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your Nature non-periodic spells have a 100% chance to spread your Insect Swarm to all enemies within 5 yards, if hitting a target affected by Insect Swarm. \n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的带有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的射程延长 2 码。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：如果你的非周期性自然法术命中了受到虫群影响的目标，则有 100% 的几率将你的虫群传播到 5 码内的所有敌人身上。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Increases the range of your damaging spells with a channeling or cast time by 2 yards. \r\n\r\nIncreases the radius of your Prayer of Healing, Holy Nova, Divine Hymn, and Circle of Healing spells by 7%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Directly healing or directly damaging a target further than 20 yards away from you has a 20% chance to restore 2% of your missing mana over 4 sec. This effect can only occur once every 15 seconds.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的带有引导或施法时间的伤害性法术的射程延长 2 码。\r\n\r\n使你的治疗祷言、神圣新星、神圣赞美诗和治疗之环的半径扩大 7%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：对 20 码以外的目标进行直接治疗或造成直接伤害时，有 20% 的几率在 4 秒内恢复你 2% 的缺失法力值。此效果每 15 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
