T["Inns are important locations found in most quest hubs, towns, and cities throughout the world. Each inn is managed by an innkeeper, who can function as a vendor and bind your |Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h to their location.\r\n\r\nTo bind your |Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h, speak to the Innkeeper and select the option to 'Make this Inn your home.' Upon its next use, your |Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h will teleport you back to that location.\r\n\r\nInns also serve as rest areas, meaning if you log out inside an inn, you’ll gradually accumulate |Hkeyword:210|hRested Experience|h. Spending even a few hours offline in an inn can provide a significant |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h boost, making them valuable for both active and casual players.\r\n\r\nTo quickly find an inn or innkeeper in any area, use the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h and select 'Innkeeper' to highlight any nearby Inns."]="旅店是重要的地点，遍布世界上大多数任务枢纽、城镇和城市。每家旅店都由一位旅店老板经营，他可以充当商人，并将你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r绑定到他的位置。\r\n\r\n要绑定你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r，请与旅店老板交谈并选择\"将这家旅店设为你的家\"。下次使用时，你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r就会将你传送回该地点。\r\n\r\n旅店同时也是休息区域，这意味着如果你在旅店内下线，就会逐渐累积|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|h休息经验|h|r。在旅店中离线哪怕几个小时，也能带来可观的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r加成，因此对活跃玩家和休闲玩家都很有价值。\r\n\r\n要在任何区域快速找到旅店或旅店老板，请使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r并选择\"旅店老板\"，即可高亮附近的旅店。"
T["Inside of that menu, click on Open Game Directory."]="在该菜单中点击|cff00CCFF打开游戏目录|r。"
T["Instantáneamente golpea al objetivo con Escarcha, causando 89 to 95 daño de Escarcha y ralentizando la velocidad de movimiento en 50%. Dura 8 s. Causa una gran cantidad de amenaza.\n\nMantén MAYÚS para más información"]="立即用冰霜攻击目标，造成 89 至 95 点冰霜伤害，并使其移动速度降低 50%。持续 8 秒。产生大量威胁值。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Instantáneamente golpea al objetivo con una fuerza aturdidora, causando 14 to 17 daño de Naturaleza y reduciendo la velocidad de ataque a distancia en 10% durante 8 s.\n\nMantén MAYÚS para más información"]="立即用震荡之力攻击目标，造成 14 至 17 点自然伤害，并使其远程攻击速度降低 10%，持续 8 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
