T["It is time to choose your first talent and a new ability. Choose wisely, but don't fret you can always reset and try new things through the Hero Creator!"]="|cffFFFFFF是时候选择你的第一个天赋和一个新技能了。明智地选择吧，但别担心，你随时可以通过英雄创建器重置并尝试新的组合！|r"
T["It looks like Extensions.dll failed to load! This issue is typically caused by a false-positive with your anti-virus!"]="看起来 |cffFF8800Extensions.dll|r 加载失败了！这个问题通常是由于杀毒软件误报造成的！"
T["It looks like you're playing Draft Mode!\nClick here to choose 4 Spells!"]="看起来你正在玩 |cffFFFF00抽取模式|r！\n点击此处选择 4 个 |cff71d5ff法术|r！"
T["Jewelcrafting is a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h and a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h that is only available in Burning Crusade content and beyond.\r\n\r\nJewelcrafting focuses on cutting gems and crafting jewelry to enhance gear with powerful stat bonuses. Jewelcrafters can create rings, necklaces, trinkets, and cut gems used in sockets.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn jewelcrafting. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the necessary materials, primarily being raw gems and ores gathered through |Hkeyword:155|hMining|h.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you’ll unlock |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, known as designs, that teach you how to cut specific gems and craft a variety of jewelry.\r\n\r\nCreating most jewelcrafting items requires a jeweler’s kit, which must be in your inventory while crafting. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP) or from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game gold."]="珠宝加工是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，仅在燃烧的远征及之后的内容中可用。\r\n\r\n珠宝加工专注于切割宝石和制作珠宝，以强力的属性加成为装备提供强化。珠宝匠可以制作戒指、项链、饰品，并切割用于插槽的宝石。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习珠宝加工。接受训练后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需的材料，主要是通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r获得的原石和矿石。\r\n\r\n随着你提升等级，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，也就是所谓的图鉴，它们会教你切割特定的宝石并制作各种各样的珠宝。\r\n\r\n制作大多数珠宝加工物品需要一套珠宝匠工具，制造时必须放在你的背包中。对于同时管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品可将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，并可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
