T["Leader of the Pack also causes affected targets to heal themselves for 2% of their base health when they critically hit with a melee or ranged attack.  \r\n\r\nYou gain 8% of your base mana when you benefit from this heal.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="兽群领袖还会使受影响的目标在近战或远程攻击造成爆击时，为其恢复其基础生命值的 2%。\r\n\r\n当你从该治疗中获益时，你会获得你基础法力的 8%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Leader of the Pack also causes affected targets to heal themselves for 4% of their base health when they critically hit with a melee or ranged attack.  \r\n\r\nYou gain 16% of your base mana when you benefit from this heal.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="兽群领袖还会使受影响的目标在近战或远程攻击造成爆击时，为其恢复其基础生命值的 4%。\r\n\r\n当你从该治疗中获益时，你会获得你基础法力的 16%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
