T["Learn Apprentice Riding Training. Speak to Randal Hunter at the Eastvale Logging Camp outside |Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h in Elwynn Forest and select \"I seek to training to ride a steed.\""]="学习学徒骑术。前往艾尔文森林，在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 城外的谷地伐木场与 Randal Hunter 交谈，并选择 \"我想学习骑乘一匹战马\"。"
T["Learn spells quickly by Shift-Clicking or Double-Clicking on the icon."]="通过 |cffffd100Shift-点击|r 或 |cffffd100双击|r 图标即可快速学习法术。"
T["Leatherworking is a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h and a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h focused on turning hides and leathers gathered from beasts into a variety of practical items such as equipment and stat-boosting |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h kits. Leatherworkers create essential gear for leather and mail wearers, as well as niche items that are required through specific endgame content.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn leatherworking. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the necessary materials. Leatherworking relies primarily on hides and leathers obtained by |Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h throughout the open world, which can then be processed into tougher materials used in crafting.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you’ll unlock |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, known as patterns, that teach you how to craft specific |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h pieces and useful gear enhancements. Leatherworkers can also create specialized items like |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h kits that provide |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h buffs, small |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h, toys, and unique gear that is required in various end-game content.\r\n\r\nWhile Leatherworking does not need specific tools to craft, many players pair it with |Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h to streamline their material gathering. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP) or from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game gold."]="制皮是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于把从野兽身上采集的皮革和毛皮转化为各种实用物品，例如装备和提升属性的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r工具包。制皮师会为穿皮甲和锁甲的角色制作必备装备，以及某些终局内容所需的特定物品。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习制皮。接受训练后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需的材料。制皮主要依赖通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r在开放世界中获得的皮革和毛皮，这些材料随后可以加工成制皮所需的更坚韧的材料。\r\n\r\n随着你提升等级，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，也就是所谓的图样，它们会教你制作特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r部件和实用的装备强化品。制皮师还可以制作护甲工具包这类特殊物品，它们能提供|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r增益，此外还有小型|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r、玩具，以及各种终局内容所需的独特装备。\r\n\r\n虽然制皮制造时不需要特定的工具，但许多玩家会搭配|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r来加快材料收集。对于同时管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品可将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，并可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买，也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r获得。"
