T["Manastorm Caches are one of the primary sources of rewards in the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h, offering level-scaled equipment scaled to your current progression. As you delve deeper, the quality of the loot improves (ranging from rare |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h gear to epic |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h items from previous tiers) making them especially valuable for solo players or off-meta builds that may struggle in traditional group content. \r\n\r\nYou earn a cache each time you complete a new level, ensuring a steady stream of useful upgrades. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, there's a chance to receive a Bonus |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Cache, which contain even more loot. The probability to receive a bonus cache increases with |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h progression. Bonus caches can also drop during re-clears of previously completed floors, giving players a reason to return even after hitting progression milestones."]="法力风暴宝箱是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r中的主要奖励来源之一，会提供与你的当前进度相匹配的装备。随着你深入探索，战利品的品质也会提升（从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r的稀有装备到旧版本|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r的史诗物品），这使得它们对独行玩家或在传统组队内容中吃力的非主流构筑尤其有价值。\r\n\r\n每当你完成一个新的层级时，都会获得一个宝箱，从而保证你能源源不断地获得实用的提升。\r\n\r\n此外，还有可能获得一个额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r宝箱，其中包含更多战利品。获得额外宝箱的几率会随着|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r进度而提高。额外宝箱也可能在重新清理已完成的楼层时出现，让玩家在达成进度里程碑后仍有理由回来。"
T["Manastorm Spells are unique, powerful abilities designed to help you navigate and survive the chaos of the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h. These spells offer a wide range of effects such as bonus stats, crowd control, or utility, that can turn the tide of battle or provide crucial support in challenging scenarios.\r\n\r\nYou can equip up to four spells at a time, known as your 'Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spells'. These spells can be swapped out to suit your playstyle, role, or the specific challenge you're facing. You can view all of your acquired |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spells in your Spellbook, under the Ascension |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Items tab.\r\n\r\nEach spell can upgrade up to eight different ranks. Higher ranks provide significantly more powerful effects, improving damage, healing, stats, or duration, based on the spell type. Upgrading your spells is essential for keeping pace with the increasing difficulty of |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h content.\r\n\r\nYou can use |Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h get new spells or upgrade existing ones from |Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h.\r\n"]="法力风暴法术是独特而强大的技能，旨在帮助你在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r的混乱中移动并存活下来。这些法术提供各种各样的效果，例如属性加成、群体控制或辅助功能，能够扭转战局，或在艰难的处境中提供关键支援。\r\n\r\n你最多可以同时装备四个法术，它们被称为你的\"主动|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r法术\"。这些法术可以根据你的玩法风格、职责或所面对的具体挑战进行更换。你可以在法术书的飞升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r物品标签页中查看所有已获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r法术。\r\n\r\n每个法术最多可以升级到八个不同的等级。等级越高，效果就越强大，会根据法术类型提升伤害、治疗、属性或持续时间。升级你的法术对于跟上|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r内容日益增长的难度至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h|r来获取新法术，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r处升级已有法术。\r\n"
