T["Millhouse |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h is a quirky and beloved gnome NPC who serves as your guide through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h and Vendor for |Hkeyword:43|hBedlam Bullions|h. He offers a wide selection of cosmetic items, convenience tools, and hilarious toys, making him a key figure for players looking to personalize their |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h or gain quality-of-life upgrades.\r\n\r\nWhenever you exit the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h you will be automatically teleported to Millhouse’s location at the entrance of your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h. There, you can immediately spend your hard-earned |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h on unique rewards."]="Millhouse |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r是一位古怪又讨人喜爱的侏儒 NPC，他会在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r中担任你的向导，同时出售|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|hBedlam 锭|h|r。他提供大量外观物品、便利工具和滑稽的玩具，这使他成为想要个性化自己的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r或获取生活质量提升的玩家的关键人物。\r\n\r\n每次你离开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r时，都会被自动传送到你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r入口处的 Millhouse 所在位置。在那里，你可以立刻把辛苦赚来的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r花在独特的奖励上。"
T["Millhouse’s Magical Escape is a reusable, utility item placed in every player’s inventory upon entering the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h. This enchanted gadget serves as a lifeline during high-stress encounters, allowing you to instantly break free from crowd control (CC) and Movement Impairing effects with the push of a button.\r\n\r\nWith a short cooldown and no resource cost, Millhouse’s Magical Escape is essential for surviving the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h’s fast-paced, unpredictable challenges. Many of the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h’s enemies and environmental hazards are designed to lock you down or trap you in damaging mechanics and this item gives you a reliable way out. Whether you’re stunned, rooted, or slowed, it can provide the split-second freedom needed to reposition, dodge lethal mechanics, or finish off a tricky boss.\r\n\r\nWhile it’s only usable inside the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h instance, Millhouse’s Magical Escape is one of the most important tools at your disposal so be sure to drag it to your action bar and keep it within easy reach."]="Millhouse 的魔法逃生是一个可重复使用的实用物品，会在所有玩家进入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r时放入其背包。这件附魔小装置是紧张战斗中的保命法宝，只需按下一个按钮，就能让你立刻摆脱群体控制（CC）和妨碍移动的效果。\r\n\r\n凭借较短的冷却时间且不消耗资源，Millhouse 的魔法逃生是你在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r疯狂而不可预测的挑战中生存下来的必备之物。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r中的许多敌人和环境危险都旨在将你定身或困在有害的机制中，而这件物品为你提供了可靠的出路。无论你是被击晕、缠绕还是减速，它都能给你重新站位、躲避致命机制或击杀棘手首领所需的那一瞬间自由。\r\n\r\n虽然只能在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r副本内使用，但 Millhouse 的魔法逃生是你手中最重要的工具之一，所以一定要把它拖到动作条上并随时可用。"
