T["Mythic+ dungeons are a high-level, repeatable challenge mode designed to test your skill, coordination, and efficiency. To begin a mythic+ run, you’ll need a mythic keystone, which you earn by completing a |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h at mythic difficulty. Once you have a key, you can activate it at the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h’s entrance to begin the run.\r\n\r\nUnlike standard mythics, mythic+ dungeons are timed and scale in difficulty based on the level of your keystone. As the keystone level increases, enemies become stronger, and affixes (special |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h modifiers) are added that introduce new mechanics such as environmental hazards, enemy buffs, or group-wide pressure. These affixes change weekly and vary depending on the key level, keeping runs fresh and challenging.\r\n\r\nAt the end of each run, your keystone transforms based on your performance, either increasing in level or changing to a different |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h. Completing the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h quickly can upgrade your key and increase your rewards, while failing to complete within the timer may lower the difficulty.\r\n\r\nHigher level mythic+ runs offer increasingly better rewards, including epic gear, |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, and progression toward achievements and leaderboards."]="史诗+地下城是一种高难度、可重复的挑战模式，旨在考验你的技巧、配合与效率。要开始一次史诗+挑战，你需要一把史诗钥石，通过在史诗难度下完成一个|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r即可获得。拿到钥石后，你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r入口处激活它来开始挑战。\r\n\r\n与标准史诗地下城不同，史诗+地下城有计时，并且难度会随钥石等级提升。随着钥石等级提高，敌人会变得更强，还会加入词缀（特殊的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r修正效果），带来新的机制，例如环境危险、敌人增益或全队压力。这些词缀每周轮换，并随钥石等级变化，让每次挑战都保持新鲜与挑战性。\r\n\r\n每次挑战结束时，你的钥石会根据表现发生变化，要么提升等级，要么变为另一个|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r。快速完成|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r可以升级你的钥石并提高奖励，而未能在时限内完成则可能降低难度。\r\n\r\n等级越高的史诗+挑战提供的奖励也越丰厚，包括史诗装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，以及成就和排行榜进度。"
