T["On Ascension, you have a lot of new features. You can access them using the Hero Creator on your Main Menu Bar or through the quick access frame on your screen."]="|cffFFFFFF在飞升中，你有很多 |r新|cffFFFFFF 功能。你可以使用 |r主菜单栏|cffFFFFFF 上的 |r英雄创建器|cffFFFFFF 来访问它们，也可以通过屏幕上的 |r快捷访问|cffFFFFFF 框架。|r"
T["Once you have done that, or you do not have an anti-virus, Close the game and run Repair Client from the Launcher. "]="完成上述操作后，如果你没有安装杀毒软件，请 |cff00CCFF关闭游戏|r，然后从启动器运行 |cff00CCFF修复客户端|r。 "
T["Once you select you role, you will not be able see new Build Drafts until you prestige.\n\nIf you don't like the options, you can Leave Build Draft and choose a Featured Build from the Hero Architect (N)."]="|cffff0000一旦你选择了自己的角色定位，在你进行威望重置之前，将无法看到新的构筑抽取选项。\n\n如果你不喜欢这些选项，可以放弃这次构筑抽取，并从英雄建筑师处选择一个精选构筑（|cffffffffN|r|cffff0000）。|r"
T["One or more of your skill card slots is empty!\nLearning this spell will prevent you from selecting skill cards until you prestige.\nare you sure you want to learn this spell?"]="你的技能卡槽中有一个或多个是空的！\n|cffff0000学习这个法术将导致你在威望重置之前无法选择技能卡。|r\n你确定要学习这个法术吗？"
T["One scoop, er, life, is all you need to kill Ragnaros! ...Right?\n\nReach max level, slay Ragnaros without dying.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11502|hYou must kill [Ragnaros] before reaching level 61. (Click Here!)  |h"]="一勺，呃，一条命，就是你击杀拉格纳罗斯所需要的全部！……对吧？\n\n达到满级，并在不死亡的情况下击杀拉格纳罗斯。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11502|h你必须在达到 61 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[拉格纳罗斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["Open Character Upgrades"]="|cffFFFFFF打开角色强化|r"
T["Open the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h (Hotkey i), select your Role, and then click Find a Group."]="打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r（快捷键 I），选择你的职责，然后点击寻找队伍。"
T["Open your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h and right click your new Mount."]="打开你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r，右键点击你的新坐骑。"
T["Orgrimmar (Org) is the fierce and fortified |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h of the Horde faction, located in the harsh, arid region of Durotar. It serves as the central hub where Horde players can find key NPCs, |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, Class Trainers, and |Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h.\r\n\r\nAs the heart of Horde civilization, Orgrimmar is known for its rugged, tribal architecture built from massive stone and wood, reflecting the strength and |Hkeyword:208|hResilience|h of its inhabitants. The city is named after Orgrim Doomhammer, a legendary orc warrior.\r\n\r\nOrgrimmar is divided into several districts such as the Valley of Strength, home to the |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h and |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h; the Drag, where you’ll find |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Trainers, craftsmen, and |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h; and the Cleft of Shadow, the center for dark magic and other covert activities.\r\n\r\nOrgrimmar is a fortress against both monstrous threats and enemy players, providing a safe place for Horde adventurers to rest, craft, trade, and organize before heading out to explore or battle across Azeroth."]="奥格瑞玛（Org）是部落阵营凶悍而坚固的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，位于严酷干旱的杜隆塔尔地区。它是核心枢纽，部落玩家可以在这里找到关键 NPC、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、职业训练师和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r。\r\n\r\n作为部落文明的心脏，奥格瑞玛以其粗犷的部族风格建筑而闻名，由巨大的石块和木材建成，映照出居民的坚韧与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:208|h韧性|h|r。这座城市以传奇兽人战士奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤命名。\r\n\r\n奥格瑞玛分为多个区域，例如力量谷，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r的所在地；暗巷区，你可以在那里找到|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r训练师、工匠和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r；以及暗影裂口，那里是黑暗魔法和其他隐秘活动的中心。\r\n\r\n奥格瑞玛既是抵御怪物威胁的堡垒，也是抵御敌对玩家的要塞，为部落冒险者提供了一个安全的地方，让他们在出发探索或为艾泽拉斯而战之前休息、制造、交易和集结。"
T["Ouvrir les Améliorations du Personnage"]="|cffFFFFFF打开角色强化|r"
