T["Path of Agility focuses on dealing rapid attacks and critical strikes, and is especially beneficial for Leather and Mail armor users.\n\nGrants you bonus Agility, and each point of Agility now also increases your Attack Power, Critical Strike Chance, and Critical Strike Damage."]="敏捷之路专注于快速攻击和爆击，对穿皮甲和锁甲的角色尤其有利。\n\n它赋予你额外的敏捷，并且现在每点敏捷还会提高你的 |cFFFFFFFF攻击强度|r、|cFFFFFFFF爆击几率|r 和 |cFFFFFFFF爆击伤害|r。"
T["Path of Frost\nLevel 30"]="冰霜之路\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a30|r"
T["Path of Healing enables you to fulfill the Healer Role. This primary stat increases your Healing Power and allows you to use unique powerful Healer spells.\n\nGrants you bonus Healing Power, Intellect, Spirit, and each point of Spell Power now also increases your Healing Power."]="治疗之路让你能够担任 |cFFFFFFFF治疗者职责|r。这项主属性会提高你的治疗强度，并让你可以使用独特而强大的治疗法术。\n\n它赋予你额外的 |cFFFFFFFF治疗强度|r、|cFFFFFFFF智力|r 和 |cFFFFFFFF精神|r，并且现在每点 |cFFFFFFFF法术强度|r 还会提高你的 |cFFFFFFFF治疗强度|r。"
T["Path of Intellect focuses on empowering spell damage, increasing mana pool, and is especially beneficial for Cloth armor users.\n\nGrants you bonus Spell Power, Intellect, Spirit, and Spell Power gained from items and effects is doubled."]="智力之路专注于强化法术伤害、提高法力储备，对穿布甲的角色尤其有利。\n\n它赋予你额外的 |cFFFFFFFF法术强度|r、智力和精神，并且从物品和效果中获得的 |cFFFFFFFF法术强度|r 会翻倍。"
T["Path of Strength focuses on dealing heavy hits and armor piercing attacks, and is especially beneficial for Plate armor users.\n\nGrants you bonus Strength, and each point of Strength now also increases your Attack Power and Parry."]="力量之路专注于造成沉重打击和护甲穿透攻击，对穿板甲的角色尤其有利。\n\n它赋予你额外的力量，并且现在每点力量还会提高你的 |cFFFFFFFF攻击强度|r 和 |cFFFFFFFF格挡|r。"
