T["Place a frost trap that freezes the first enemy that approaches, preventing all action for up to 10 sec.Any damage caused will break the ice. \r\nTrap will exist for 30 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="放置一个冰霜陷阱，冻结第一个靠近的敌人，使其最多 10 秒内无法行动。任何造成的伤害都会打破冰冻。\r\n陷阱会存在 30 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
