T["Prestige is a feature that allows you to reset your character back to level 1, wiping all learned abilities and talents while retaining your gear, gold, |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, as well as your |Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h standings, |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h levels, and gathered |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h. This system is designed to let you rebuild your character from scratch, offering a fresh leveling |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h and the opportunity to experiment with new builds or refine old ones. \r\n\r\nPrestiging offers exclusive rewards like titles, cosmetics, and other unlockables, depending on the realm or seasonal content. \r\n\r\nTo Prestige, visit Chromie near the |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h in your faction’s |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h."]="威望是一项允许你将角色重置回 1 级的功能，它会移除所有已学会的技能和天赋，同时保留你的装备、金币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r，以及你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r进度、各项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级和已累积的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r。该系统旨在让你从零开始重建角色，带来全新的升级|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r，并有机会尝试新的构筑或完善旧有的构筑。\r\n\r\n进行威望重置会根据服务器或赛季内容提供专属奖励，例如头衔、外观和其他可解锁内容。\r\n\r\n要进行威望重置，请前往你的阵营|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r中|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r附近的克罗米。"
T["Primary Professions are the main professions your character can learn and develop. They are divided into two categories and can be a |Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h or a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h. \r\n\r\nBy default, each character can learn up to two Primary Professions, allowing you to choose any combination that suits your playstyle.\r\n\r\nIf you want to expand beyond this limit, you can unlock additional |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h slots by obtaining a special item called the Craftsman’s Codex. This item enables you to learn and progress in more professions simultaneously, providing even greater flexibility and depth to your character’s skills. \r\n\r\nManaging your primary professions effectively can greatly enhance your gameplay, economy, and overall progression.\r\n"]="主专业是你的角色可以学习和发展的主要专业。它们分为两类，可以是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，也可以是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r。\r\n\r\n默认情况下，每个角色最多可以学习两个主专业，让你可以自由选择适合自己玩法的任意组合。\r\n\r\n如果你想突破这个限制，可以通过获得名为工匠法典的特殊物品来解锁额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r栏位。该物品让你可以同时学习和提升更多专业，为你的角色技能带来更大的灵活性和深度。\r\n\r\n妥善管理你的主专业可以极大地改善你的游戏方式、经济状况和整体进度。\r\n"
T["Prochaine Réinitialisation: "]="|cffE1AB18下次重置： |cffFFFFFF"
T["Profession Specializations are advanced branches within a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h that allow players to unlock unique |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h not available to others. Specializations give your |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h a focused identity, whether it’s crafting stronger equipment, more efficient potions, or powerful enhancements, and can greatly enhance your crafting potential. Not all skills have a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Specialization, but those that do often offer a meaningful choice that sets your character apart in terms of what you can create and contribute.\r\n\r\nTo unlock a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Specialization, you’ll need to complete a series of tasks that demonstrate your dedication and skill. These challenges vary by |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h and may include completing special quests, crafting high-level items, or building rapport with key NPCs who serve as gatekeepers to the Specialization.\r\n\r\nOnce selected, your Specialization is permanent and you cannot switch without unlearning the entire |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h and starting over from scratch. This means you’ll lose all progress and |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h tied to that |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h, so be sure to choose your Specialization carefully based on your goals, playstyle, or market demand."]="专业专精是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r中的进阶分支，让玩家可以解锁他人无法获得的独特|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r。专精会赋予你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r明确的定位，无论是制作更强的装备、更高效的法药，还是强力的强化品，都能大幅提升你的制造潜力。并非所有技能都有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r专精，但拥有专精的技能通常会提供有意义的选择，让你在能制造和贡献的内容上与众不同。\r\n\r\n要解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r专精，你需要完成一系列任务来证明你的投入与技艺。这些挑战因|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r而异，可能包括完成特殊任务、制作高等级物品，或与作为专精守门人的关键 NPC 建立关系。\r\n\r\n一旦选定，你的专精就是永久的，除非遗忘整个|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r并从头开始，否则无法更换。这意味着你将失去与该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r相关的所有进度和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，所以请务必根据你的目标、玩法风格或市场需求谨慎选择专精。"
T["Professions are trade skills your character can learn to gather, craft, or enhance items that support your progression. They offer a valuable way to earn gold, improve your gear, and contribute to your character’s development.\r\n\r\nEach profession falls into one of two categories: a |Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h or a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h. Gathering professions encourage you to explore the world, collecting raw materials from nodes found throughout various zones. Crafting professions allow you to learn |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h and use those raw materials, along with loot from enemies, to create powerful gear, consumables, and enhancements.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, professions fall into two categories: a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h or a |Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h. Primary professions are more impactful and limited as by default, you can only learn two. Secondary skills, such as |Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h and |Hkeyword:108|hFirst Aid|h, are available to all players with no restriction on how many you can learn.\r\n\r\nTo learn a Profession, visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to get started."]="专业是你的角色可以学习的贸易技能，用于采集、制造或强化支持你成长的物品。它们提供了一种赚取金币、提升装备并为角色发展做出贡献的宝贵方式。\r\n\r\n每项专业都归属于两类之一：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r。采集专业鼓励你探索世界，从各个区域的节点中收集原材料。制造专业则让你学习|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，并使用这些原材料以及敌人的战利品来制作强力的装备、消耗品和强化品。\r\n\r\n此外，专业还分为两类：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r。主专业影响更大且数量有限，因为默认情况下你只能学习两个。次要技能，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|h急救|h|r，对所有玩家开放，学习数量没有限制。\r\n\r\n要学习专业，请拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来开始。"
