T["Prove your might as the ultimate Plains Stalker! Slay three elusive beasts along The Barrens, Lakota'mani, Owatanka, Washte Pawne, before level 20, and reach max level. Succeed, and bring honor to your clan. Fail, and die.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3474|hYou must kill [Lakota'mani] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3473|hYou must kill [Owatanka] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3472|hYou must kill [Washte Pawne] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h"]="证明你是终极的平原追猎者！在达到 20 级之前，在贫瘠之地击杀三只难以捉摸的野兽：Lakota'mani、Owatanka 和 Washte Pawne，然后达到满级。成功，你将给你的氏族带来荣耀。失败，你就会死。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3474|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Lakota'mani]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3473|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Owatanka]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3472|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Washte Pawne]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["Prove your power and hunting might. Slay three elusive beasts along The Barrens, Lakota'mani, Owatanka, Washte Pawne, before level 20 completely solo, and reach max level. Fail, and die.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3474|hYou must kill [Lakota'mani] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3473|hYou must kill [Owatanka] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3472|hYou must kill [Washte Pawne] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h"]="以猎人的身份展现你的力量与技巧。在达到 20 级之前，完全独自一人在贫瘠之地击杀三只难以捉摸的野兽：Lakota'mani、Owatanka 和 Washte Pawne，然后达到满级。失败，你就会死。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3474|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Lakota'mani]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3473|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Owatanka]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3472|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Washte Pawne]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
