T["PvE Mode is a ruleset that protects players from open-world PvP combat. \r\n\r\nWhen PvE mode is enabled, other players cannot attack you, and you are also restricted from participating in PvP activities. This includes healing or assisting players who are engaged in PvP combat. This mode is ideal for players who prefer to focus on completing a quest, exploring a |Hkeyword:15|hSub-Zone|h, leveling their |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h, or progressing through PvE without the risk of being ambushed by enemy players.\r\n\r\nThe PVE world is shared with |Hkeyword:174|hNo-Risk PvP Mode|h players, meaning both groups exist in the same zones. You’ll see other players in no-risk mode, but you won’t be able to interact with them in PvP-related ways unless you change your ruleset. However, engaging a world boss will automatically switch you to |Hkeyword:174|hNo-Risk PvP Mode|h for the duration of the encounter. This prevents players from bypassing PvP risk during high-value content.\r\n\r\nTo enable PvE Mode, visit your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h and open the |Hkeyword:136|hHybrid Risk|h Menu (Hotkey H -> PvP Ruleset Tab) then select 'PvE Mode' as your active ruleset. Keep in mind that switching between PvP modes has a 15 minute cooldown, so plan your activities accordingly."]="PvE 模式是一套保护玩家免受开放世界 PvP 战斗影响的规则。\r\n\r\n启用 PvE 模式后，其他玩家无法攻击你，你参与 PvP 活动也会受到限制。这包括治疗或协助正在进行 PvP 战斗的玩家。该模式非常适合专注于完成任务、探索|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|h子区域|h|r、提升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级，或在不必担心被敌对玩家偷袭的情况下推进 PvE 内容的玩家。\r\n\r\nPvE 世界与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|h无风险 PvP 模式|h|r的玩家共享，这意味着两个群体存在于相同的区域。你会看到处于无风险模式的其他玩家，但除非你更改自己的规则集，否则无法与他们进行与 PvP 相关的互动。不过，与首领交战时，会在战斗持续期间自动将你切换为|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:174|h无风险 PvP 模式|h|r。这可以防止玩家在高价值内容中规避 PvP 风险。\r\n\r\n要启用 PvE 模式，请前往你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，打开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:136|h混合风险|h|r菜单（快捷键 H → PvP 规则标签页），然后选择「PvE 模式」作为你的生效规则。请注意，在 PvP 模式之间切换有 15 分钟冷却时间，因此请相应地安排你的活动。"
T["Quest Givers are NPCs that offer quests to players, helping guide progression, storytelling, and rewards throughout the world. These NPCs are easily recognized by the icons that appear above their heads, which indicate the availability or status of a quest.\r\n\r\nAn exclamation mark (!) icon means a quest is being offered:\r\n\r\nYellow (!) indicates a new quest is available and ready to be accepted.\r\nBlue (!) signals a repeatable quest, which can be completed multiple times.\r\nGrey (!) shows that a quest exists, but you currently don’t meet the requirements to accept it.\r\n\r\nA question mark (?) icon appears when interacting with quest progress:\r\n\r\nYellow (?) means the quest is ready to be finished, and you can collect your rewards.\r\nBlue (?) indicates a repeatable quest that has been completed and can be turned in again.\r\nGrey (?) shows that you’ve accepted the quest, but the objective has not been completed.\r\n\r\nQuest givers are found throughout the world and serve as one of the main ways players gain |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, gear, and story progression."]="任务给予者是向玩家提供任务的 NPC，帮助引导整个世界中的进度、剧情和奖励。这些 NPC 很容易通过头顶的图标辨认，图标会显示任务的可接取状态或进度状态。\r\n\r\n感叹号（!）图标表示可以接到任务：\r\n\r\n黄色（!）表示有新的任务可以接取。\r\n蓝色（!）表示可重复任务，可以多次完成。\r\n灰色（!）表示存在任务，但你目前不满足接取条件。\r\n\r\n问号（?）图标会在与任务进度互动时出现：\r\n\r\n黄色（?）表示任务可以交付，你可以领取奖励。\r\n蓝色（?）表示已完成且可以再次交付的可重复任务。\r\n灰色（?）表示你已接取任务，但目标尚未完成。\r\n\r\n任务给予者遍布整个世界，是玩家获取|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r、装备和剧情进度的主要途径之一。"
T["Quest NPCs: Display names for NPCs involved with quests, as well as tracked NPCs using the minimap tracker.\n\nHostile and Quest NPCs: Display names for hostile NPCs and those NPCs involved with quests or being tracked\n\nHostile, Quest, and Interactive NPCs: Display names for hostile NPCs, those NPCs involved with quests or being tracked, and NPCs you can interact with\n\nAll NPCs: Display names for all NPCs\n\nNone: Do not display names for any NPCs"]="|cffffffff任务 NPC：|r 显示与任务相关的 NPC 名称，以及通过小地图追踪器追踪的 NPC。\n\n|cffffffff敌对与任务 NPC：|r 显示敌对 NPC 的名称，以及与任务相关或正在被追踪的 NPC。\n\n|cffffffff敌对、任务与可互动 NPC：|r 显示敌对 NPC、与任务相关或正在被追踪的 NPC，以及你可以互动的 NPC。\n\n|cffffffff所有 NPC：|r 显示所有 NPC 的名称\n\n|cffffffff无：|r 不显示任何 NPC 的名称"
T["Quickly learn all ranks of a talent by Ctrl-Clicking on the icon."]="通过 |cffffd100Ctrl+点击|r 图标即可快速学习一个天赋的所有等级。"
T["Raging Blow\nLevel 28"]="狂暴打击\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a28|r"
T["Raids refer to both a specific type of group as well as a category of high-level PvE content. \r\n\r\nA 'raid group' is a large |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h consisting of anywhere from 6 to 40 players, formed when a |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h leader converts a standard group using the raid menu (Hotkey O -> Raid Tab -> Convert to Raid). \r\n\r\nRaid groups are typically used for content that requires more coordination and members than regular Dungeons or quests. However, it’s important to note that while in a Raid group, most normal quests won’t track progress.\r\n\r\nThe term \"\"raid\"\" also refers to raid encounters, which are instanced dungeons designed for 10 to 25 players. These encounters feature powerful bosses, complex mechanics, and often require strategic coordination, communication, and strong team builds. Raids offer some of the most prestigious rewards in the game, including high-tier gear, |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, cosmetic items, and unique achievements."]="团队副本既指一种特定的队伍类型，也指一类高等级 PvE 内容。\r\n\r\n「团队副本队伍」是由 6 到 40 名玩家组成的大型 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h队伍|h|r，当 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h队伍|h|r 队长通过团队菜单（快捷键 O -> 团队标签页 -> 转换为团队）将标准队伍转换而成。\r\n\r\n团队副本队伍通常用于比地下城或普通任务需要更多配合与成员的内容。不过需要注意的是，当你处于团队副本队伍中时，大多数普通任务不会记录进度。\r\n\r\n\"\"团队副本\"\"一词也指团队副本战斗，即为 10 到 25 名玩家设计的副本。这些战斗包含强大的首领和复杂的机制，往往需要战略配合、沟通和扎实的团队构筑。团队副本会提供游戏中一些最负盛名的奖励，包括高阶装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、外观物品和独特成就。"
