T["Real Slot ID "]="|cfff73600真实栏位 ID|r |cfffc8a00"
T["Realm-Bound items (commonly referred to as Bind-on-Account or BoA items) are special items appearing with beige text that can be shared across all characters on your account, but only within the same realm.\r\n\r\nRealm-Bound items include things like |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, vanity items, |Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h, and purchases from the |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h. Most of these items can be stored in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h (Hotkey N -> Vanity Tab). This makes them easy to equip across your characters without having to mail them individually.\r\n\r\nIf you need to transfer a Realm-Bound item to a different live server, you’ll need to speak to |Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h, an NPC who can assist with cross-realm Vanity item transfers. But keep in mind that only items that can be saved in the |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h qualify for this service.\r\n"]="服务器绑定物品（通常称为账号绑定物品或 BoA）是显示为米色文字的特殊物品，可以在你账号上的所有角色之间共享，但仅限于同一服务器内。\r\n\r\n服务器绑定物品包括|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h遗物|h|r、外观物品、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r，以及|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r中的购买物。这些物品大多可以存入你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r（快捷键 N → 外观标签页）。这让你可以轻松地在所有角色上装备它们，而不必逐个邮寄。\r\n\r\n如果你需要将服务器绑定物品转移到另一个在线服务器，则需要与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h|r交谈，这位 NPC 可以协助进行跨服务器的外观物品转移。但请注意，只有可以存入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r的物品才符合该服务的条件。\r\n"
T["Rebirth\nLevel 20"]="重生\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a20|r"
T["Recipes are special items that teach your character how to craft specific items within a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h. Once learned, a recipe permanently adds a new crafting option to your |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h's crafting menu. Recipes are essential for progressing through professions and unlocking powerful gear, consumables, and utility items.\r\n\r\nYou can acquire recipes in several ways: by learning them from a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h, purchasing them from specialized |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, trading with other players, or looting them from enemies. Some recipes are easy to find, while others are tied to specific |Hkeyword:207|hReputation|h milestones, quests, or Dungeons."]="配方是特殊物品，会教会你的角色如何在某个|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r中制造特定的物品。学会之后，配方会永久地为你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r制造菜单添加一个新的制造选项。配方对于提升专业等级和解锁强力的装备、消耗品与实用物品至关重要。\r\n\r\n你可以通过多种方式获得配方：从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r处学习、向专门的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r购买、与其他玩家交易，或从敌人身上拾取。有些配方很容易找到，而另一些则与特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:207|h声望|h|r里程碑、任务或地下城相关联。"
T["Recklessness\nLevel 34"]="鲁莽\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a34|r"
T["Recovery Services can restore items that you may have lost accidentally. Whether you’ve sold an item to a Vendor, deleted it, or disenchanted it, you can often recover it using this system. \r\n\r\nTo access Recovery Services, click the question mark icon (?) in the micro menu, or speak with |Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h, who can be found in most Capital Cities. This will open the recovery menu, where you'll see a list of recently lost items eligible for restoration.\r\n\r\nYou can recover up to the last 500 lost items for a fee, and also restore deleted characters through this menu. It serves as a reliable safety net for undoing mistakes or recovering important items."]="物品恢复服务可以找回你不小心丢失的物品。无论你是把物品卖给了商人、删除了它，还是将其分解，通常都可以通过该系统找回。\r\n\r\n要使用物品恢复服务，请点击微型菜单中的问号（?）图标，或与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h|r交谈，你可以在大多数主城中找到他。这会打开恢复菜单，你可以在其中看到最近丢失且可以恢复的物品列表。\r\n\r\n你可以支付一定费用找回最近最多 500 件丢失的物品，也可以在此菜单中恢复已删除的角色。它是一道可靠的安全网，用于撤销失误或找回重要物品。"
T["Redemption\nLevel 12"]="救赎\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a12|r"
T["Reduce el coste de maná de tu Sanación relámpago un 5% y aumenta la probabilidad de efecto crítico de tu Sanación relámpago un 5% sobre los objetivos amistosos con salud igual o menor del 50%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Your Flash Heal casts reduce the cooldown of your Inner Focus by 2 seconds."]="你的闪电治疗的法力消耗降低 5%，并且对生命值等于或低于 50% 的友方目标，你的闪电治疗的爆击几率提高 5%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你施放的闪电治疗会使你的内心专注的冷却时间缩短 2 秒。|r"
T["Reduce el tiempo de reutilización de tus hechizos Empoderamiento demoníaco, Metamorfosis, Infierno, Ritual de la perdición y Dominación fel en un 10%, y el tiempo de reutilización de tu Salto demoníaco en 5 segundos.\n\nCapstone Bonus: While in Metamorphosis, your Hand of Gul'dan can be cast twice within 6 sec before going on cooldown."]="你的恶魔赋能、变形术、地狱火、厄运仪式和邪能支配的冷却时间缩短 10%，你的恶魔跳击的冷却时间缩短 5 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：在变形术状态下，你可以在古尔丹之手进入冷却之前，于 6 秒内施放它两次。|r"
T["Reduce todo el daño recibido en 50% durante 12 s.ext@\n\nCannot be used within 30 sec of using Avenging Wrath.\n\nMantén MAYÚS para más información"]="在 12 秒内使你受到的所有伤害降低 50%。\r\n\r\n在使用复仇之怒后 30 秒内无法使用。\r\n\r\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduce todo el daño recibido en un 1%.\n\nYour Avenger's Shield has a 33% chance to silence your targets for 3 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Being healed by others reduces the cooldown of your Divine Protection by 1 second and Holy Shield by 1 second. \n\nMantén MAYÚS para más información"]="使你受到的所有伤害降低 1%。\r\n\r\n你的复仇者之盾有 33% 的几率使你的目标沉默 3 秒。\r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：受到他人治疗会使你的神圣保护的冷却时间缩短 1 秒，圣洁护盾的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。 |r\r\n\r\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces all damage taken by 50% for 12 sec.\r\n\r\nCannot be used within 30 sec of using Avenging Wrath.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="在 12 秒内使你受到的所有伤害降低 50%。\r\n\r\n在使用复仇之怒后 30 秒内无法使用。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces the duration of all Disarm effects by 25%.\r\n\r\nIncreases mounted speed by 5%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你受到的所有缴械效果的持续时间缩短 25%。\r\n\r\n坐骑速度提高 5%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces the duration of all Disarm effects by 50%.\r\n\r\nIncreases mounted speed by 10%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你受到的所有缴械效果的持续时间缩短 50%。\r\n\r\n坐骑速度提高 10%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of all traps, Hunter melee abilities and Black Arrow by 20%.\r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of all traps and Black Arrow by 4 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing periodic damage with Immolation Trap, Explosive Trap or Black Arrow reduces the cooldown of your Mongoose Bite, Raptor Strike and Glaive Toss by 1 second.  \n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的所有陷阱、猎人近战技能和黑箭的法力消耗降低 20%。\r\n\r\n使所有陷阱和黑箭的冷却时间缩短 4 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：用献祭陷阱、爆炸陷阱或黑箭造成持续伤害，会使你的蟒蛇撕咬、猛禽一击和飞刀投掷的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。  |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of all traps, Hunter melee abilities and Black Arrow by 40%.\r\n\r\nReduces the cooldown of all traps and Black Arrow by 7 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing periodic damage with Immolation Trap, Explosive Trap or Black Arrow reduces the cooldown of your Mongoose Bite, Raptor Strike and Glaive Toss by 1 second.  \n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的所有陷阱、猎人近战技能和黑箭的法力消耗降低 40%。\r\n\r\n使所有陷阱和黑箭的冷却时间缩短 7 秒。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：用献祭陷阱、爆炸陷阱或黑箭造成持续伤害，会使你的蟒蛇撕咬、猛禽一击和飞刀投掷的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。  |r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of all traps, Hunter melee abilities and Black Arrow by 60%.\r\n \r\nReduces the cooldown of all traps and Black Arrow by 10 sec.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing periodic damage with Immolation Trap, Explosive Trap or Black Arrow reduces the cooldown of your Mongoose Bite, Raptor Strike and Glaive Toss by 1 second.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="使你的所有陷阱、猎人近战技能和黑箭的法力消耗降低 60%。\r\n \r\n使所有陷阱和黑箭的冷却时间缩短 10 秒。\n\n巅峰加成：用献祭陷阱、爆炸陷阱或黑箭造成持续伤害，会使你的蟒蛇撕咬、猛禽一击和飞刀投掷的冷却时间缩短 1 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of your Shadow spells by 2%.\r\n\r\nYou receive 5% of your base mana when your Shadow Word: Pain or Vampiric Touch spells are dispelled.\n\nCapstone Bonus: All threat generated is reduced by 20%. This capstone effect does not stack with similar capstone effects."]="使你的暗影法术的法力消耗降低 2%。\r\n\r\n当你的真言术：痛或吸血鬼之触被驱散时，你恢复 5% 的基础法力。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：所有产生的威胁值降低 20%。该巅峰效果不与类似的巅峰效果叠加。|r"
T["Reduces the mana cost of your Shadow spells by 4%.\r\n\r\nYou receive 10% of your base mana when your Shadow Word: Pain or Vampiric Touch spells are dispelled.\n\nCapstone Bonus: All threat generated is reduced by 20%. This capstone effect does not stack with similar capstone effects."]="使你的暗影法术的法力消耗降低 4%。\r\n\r\n当你的暗言术：痛或吸血鬼之触被移除时，你恢复 10% 的基础法力。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：所有产生的威胁值降低 20%。该巅峰效果不与类似的巅峰效果叠加。|r"
