T["Reforge more scrolls to obtain Mystic Extracts, then You can use Extracts to Save Mystic Enchants to your Collection."]="重铸更多卷轴以获取 |cffFFFF00神秘提取物|r；之后你可以使用这些提取物将神秘附魔保存到你的收藏中。"
