T["Remove Curse\nLevel 24"]="解除诅咒\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a24|r"
T["Reputation (Hotkey U) is a progression system that tracks your standing with various factions throughout the world. \r\n\r\nEach faction has its own unique identity, goals, and rewards, and building reputation with them often unlocks valuable items such as gear, |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h, |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, item enhancements, and cosmetics. \r\n\r\nYour standing with a faction typically progresses through several ranks: hated, hostile, unfriendly, neutral, friendly, honored, revered, and finally exalted. You begin at neutral with most factions, and by completing quests, killing specific enemies, turning in items, or participating in events tied to that faction, you can steadily increase your Reputation.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, certain factions can be set to 'At War' status, allowing you to attack their NPCs. Doing so will lower your reputation, potentially pushing it into negative standings like unfriendly or hated, which can impact your ability to access quests or |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h from that group."]="声望（快捷键 U）是一套进度系统，记录你与世界各地多个阵营的关系。\r\n\r\n每个阵营都有自己的定位、目标和奖励，提升与他们的声望通常可以解锁装备、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r、物品强化和外观等珍贵奖励。\r\n\r\n你与某个阵营的关系通常会经历多个等级：仇恨、敌对、冷淡、中立、友善、尊敬、崇敬，最终是崇拜。你与大多数阵营的初始关系为中立，通过完成任务、击杀特定敌人、上交物品或参与与该阵营相关的事件，你可以稳步提升声望。\r\n\r\n此外，某些阵营可以进入「交战」状态，让你可以攻击他们的 NPC。这样做会降低你的声望，甚至可能降至冷淡或仇恨等负面状态，从而影响你接取该阵营的任务或使用其|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r的能力。"
T["Requiere a Single Two-Handed or One-Handed Weapon.\n\nIncreases armor contribution from armor by 14% and increases the damage of Devastate by 8%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: With the final rank, stagger 30% of damage taken from attacks, distributing it over 10 seconds. This staggered damage does not break crowd control effects. \n\n\n\nMantén MAYÚS para más información"]="需要一把 |cffFFFFFF双手或单手武器|r。\n\n使护甲的护甲贡献提高 14%，并使毁灭的伤害提高 8%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：达到最终等级后，你会将受到的攻击伤害的 30% 延后，并在 10 秒内分摊。这种延后的伤害不会打破群体控制效果。\n\n|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
