T["Resets your CURRENT SPECIALIZATION ONLY. This is a complete reset of all abilities. Slot new Skillcards on your run to unlock your build. Resets your current specializations Hand of Fate quest chain."]="仅重置 |cffFF0000你当前的专精|r。这将完全重置所有技能。在你的旅程中放入新的技能卡以解锁你的构筑。同时会重置你当前专精的命运之手任务线。"
T["Resets your CURRENT SPECIALIZATION ONLY. This is a complete reset of all abilities. Slot new Skillcards on your run to unlock your build. Resets your current specializations Scroll of Fortune quest chain."]="仅重置 |cffFF0000你当前的专精|r。这将完全重置所有技能。在你的旅程中放入新的技能卡以解锁你的构筑。同时会重置你当前专精的幸运卷轴任务线。"
T["Resistances reduce the amount of damage you take from specific types of magical attacks. There are five primary resistance types: fire, frost, shadow, nature, and arcane.\r\n\r\nWhen you are targeted by a magical spell, your resistance provides a chance to either partially resist the damage (reducing the damage taken) or fully resisting it (taking no damage at all). The effectiveness of resistances is based on your resistance rating, the level of the caster, and the difficulty of the content you're facing. \r\n\r\nIn general gameplay, resistances are not always essential, but they become critically important in certain situations. A high-level |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h, |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or world boss can often feature encounters with heavy elemental damage where resistances can significantly improve your survivability. In PvP, resistances can provide a strong defensive edge against caster-heavy opponents, allowing you to withstand or shrug off powerful spell-based attacks.\r\n\r\nYou can find your current resistances in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="抗性会降低你受到特定类型魔法攻击的伤害量。主要有五种抗性：火焰、冰霜、暗影、自然和奥术。\r\n\r\n当你成为魔法法术的目标时，你的抗性让你有机会部分抵抗伤害（减少受到的伤害）或完全抵抗（不受任何伤害）。抗性的效果取决于你的抗性数值、施法者的等级以及你所面对内容的难度。\r\n\r\n在一般游戏中，抗性并不总是必需的，但在某些情况下会变得非常重要。高等级的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r或世界首领通常会带来大量元素伤害的战斗，此时抗性可以显著提高你的生存能力。在 PvP 中，抗性可以为你提供巨大的防御优势，对抗专注于法术的对手，让你能够承受或弹开强力的法术攻击。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息中查看当前抗性（快捷键 C）。"
T["Rested |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h is a modifier that lets you level up faster by granting extra |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h points when you kill enemies. Your character accumulates rested |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h whenever you log out inside an |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h or a |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, also known as rest areas. \r\n\r\nThis bonus appears as a blue section on your |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h bar and effectively doubles the |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h gained from killing monsters until the rested amount is used up. However, rested |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h does not apply to quest rewards, only to kills."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 充沛是一种让你升级更快的修正效果，在击杀敌人时会给予额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r。每当你在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r（也称为休息区）中下线时，你的角色都会累积 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 充沛。\r\n\r\n该加成会以蓝色区段显示在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 条上，实际上会在充沛量耗尽之前使你击杀怪物获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 翻倍。不过，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r 充沛不适用于任务奖励，只对击杀生效。"
T["Restores 10% base mana when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This effect cannot occur more than once every 5 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Benediction also restores mana to party members below 50% of their total mana."]="击杀可提供经验或荣誉的目标时，恢复 10% 的基础法力。该效果每 5 秒最多触发一次。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：祝福祷言还会为法力值低于其总法力 50% 的团队成员恢复法力。|r"
T["Restores 20% base mana when you kill a target that gives experience or honor. This effect cannot occur more than once every 5 seconds.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Benediction now also restores mana to party members below 50% of their total mana."]="击杀可提供经验或荣誉的目标时，恢复 20% 的基础法力。该效果每 5 秒最多触发一次。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：祝福现在还会为法力值低于其总法力 50% 的小队成员恢复法力。|r"
