T["Riding Trainers are NPCs found in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, and occasionally a quest hub, who can teach you how to ride |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h and improve your riding speed. \r\n\r\nThey also provide training for flying |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h in Outland and Northrend once you reach the appropriate level and requirements. \r\n\r\nRiding comes in several tiers, each increasing your speed and unlocking new movement options:\r\n\r\nApprentice Riding – Increases ground mount speed by 60%.\r\nJourneyman Riding – Upgrades ground mount speed to 100%.\r\nExpert Riding – Unlocks flying at 150% flight speed.\r\nArtisan Riding – Improves flying speed to 280%.\r\nExtraordinary Riding – Grants the maximum flying speed of 310%."]="骑术训练师是位于你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r、偶尔也出现在某些任务中心的 NPC，他们可以教你骑乘|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r并提升你的坐骑速度。\r\n\r\n当你达到所需的等级和条件后，他们还会在外域和诺森德提供飞行|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r的训练。\r\n\r\n骑术分为多个等级，每个等级都会提高你的速度并解锁新的移动方式：\r\n\r\n学徒骑术：使地面坐骑速度提高 60%。\r\n士官骑术：使地面坐骑速度提升至 100%。\r\n专家骑术：解锁 150% 速度的飞行。\r\n工匠骑术：使飞行速度提升至 280%。\r\n非凡骑术：提供 310% 的最高飞行速度。"
