T["Right Clicking an item in the vendor pane will buy that item if you have enough money.|n|nWhile the vendor pane is open, Right Clicking an item in your backpack will sell the item.|n|n If you accidently, sell an item, you can buy it back under 'Buyback'"]="|cffffd200右键点击|r 商人面板中的物品，如果你有足够的钱就会购买它。|n|n当商人面板打开时，右键点击你背包中的物品会将其出售。|n|n 如果你误售了某件物品，可以在「回购」中重新买回。"
