T["Seek out allies and delve into the deepest dungeons! Complete all Vanilla dungeons in order to overcome this savage Trial. The catch? You only have one life. Fall, and that member is out of the party. Will you overcome the darkest reaches of Azeroth and emerge victorious from the depths?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill [Edwin VanCleef] before reaching level 21. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill [Mutanus the Devourer] before reaching level 22. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill [Archmage Arugal] before reaching level 26. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill [Aku'mai] before reaching level 28. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill [Charlga Razorflank] before reaching level 33. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill [Mekgineer Thermaplugg] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill [Bloodmage Thalnos] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill [Arcanist Doan] before reaching level 37. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill [Herod] before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill [Amnennar]before reaching level 41. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill [Archaedas] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill [Lord Vyletongue] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|hYou must kill [Chief Ukorz Sandscalp] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|hYou must kill [Razorlash] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|hYou must kill [Celebras the Cursed] before reaching level 49. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|hYou must kill [Princess Theradras] before reaching level 51. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|hYou must kill [Shade of Eranikus] before reaching level 55. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|hYou must kill [Alzzin the Wildshaper] before reaching level 58. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|hYou must kill [Emperor Thaurissan] before reaching level 59. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|hYou must kill [King Gordok] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|hYou must kill [Prince Tortheldrin] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|hYou must kill [Overlord Wyrmthalak] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|hYou must kill [Balnazzar] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|hYou must kill [Baron Rivendare] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|hYou must kill [Darkmaster Gandling] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h"]="寻找盟友，深入最深的地下城！按顺序完成所有经典旧世地下城，以通过这场野蛮的试炼。问题在哪？你只有一条命。一旦倒下，该成员就会离开队伍。你能闯过艾泽拉斯最黑暗的角落，从深渊中凯旋而归吗？\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|h你必须在达到 21 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[埃德温·范克里夫]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|h你必须在达到 22 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[吞噬者穆坦努斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|h你必须在达到 26 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[大法师阿鲁高]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|h你必须在达到 28 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[阿库麦尔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|h你必须在达到 33 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[尖牙德鲁伊查尔加]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|h你必须在达到 34 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[机械师瑟玛普拉格]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|h你必须在达到 34 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[血法师萨尔诺斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|h你必须在达到 37 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[奥法师杜安]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|h你必须在达到 40 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[赫罗德]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|h你必须在达到 41 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[阿门纳尔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|h你必须在达到 47 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[阿扎达斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|h你必须在达到 47 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[维利塔恩领主]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Jefe Ukorz Escama de arena]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[锐刺鞭笞者]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|h你必须在达到 49 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Celebras el Maldito]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|h你必须在达到 51 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Princesa Theradras]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|h你必须在达到 55 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Sombra de Eranikus]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|h你必须在达到 58 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Alzzin el Cambiante]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|h你必须在达到 59 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Emperador Thaurissan]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Rey Gordok]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Príncipe Tortheldrin]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Señor Wyrmthalak]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Balnazzar]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Barón Rivendare]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Maestro Oscuro Gandling]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
