T["Shapeshift into Dire Bear Form, significantly increasing threat generated, increasing melee attack power by 120, armor contribution from cloth and leather items by 85% and Stamina by 15%. Allows the use of various Bear abilities.\r\n\r\nIf your Primary Stat is Agility or Strength, shapeshifting into Dire Bear Form will free you from all movement impairing effects.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="变形为狂野熊形态，大幅提高你产生的威胁值，近战攻击强度提高 120 点，布甲和皮甲物品的护甲贡献提高 85%，耐力提高 15%。允许使用多种熊形态技能。\r\n\r\n如果你的主属性是敏捷或力量，变形为狂野熊形态将使你摆脱所有移动限制效果。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
