T["Significantly Increases your threat generation.\r\n\r\nIncreases your armor by 10% and decreases damage taken by 10%.\r\n\r\nYour damage and healing done is decreased by 5%. \r\n\r\nTeaches you Taunt."]="大幅提高你产生的威胁值。\r\n\r\n你的护甲提高 10%，受到的伤害降低 10%。\r\n\r\n你造成的伤害和治疗降低 5%。 \r\n\r\n教你 |cFFFFFFFF嘲讽|r。"
T["Skinning is a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h and a |Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h for players who enjoy exploring the open world while collecting natural resources. Leathers gathered by skinners are used in a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h like |Hkeyword:142|hLeatherworking|h.\r\n\r\nTo get started, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn skinning. Once trained, you can begin gathering leather by fighting beasts and harvesting their hides after taking the loot. Skinning is unique to other gathering professions as it is not based on open world nodes, but rather defeated enemies.\r\n\r\nEvery time you skin a beast, you have a chance to contribute to your skinning skill and obtain leather used directly in crafting. Different beasts contain different types of hide, typically tied to level ranges and progression, so exploring new areas and defeating new enemies becomes a rewarding part of leveling the |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h.\r\n\r\nTo harvest beasts, you’ll need a skinning knife, which can be purchased from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, or the Skin-Peeler 9000 to automatically skin nearby defeated beasts. This tool must be in your inventory while gathering and is essential for collecting leather. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP) or from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game gold."]="剥皮是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r，适合喜欢在开放世界中探索并采集自然资源的玩家。剥皮者采集的皮革会用于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|h制皮|h|r。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习剥皮。接受训练后，你就可以通过与野兽战斗并在拾取战利品后剥取其毛皮来收集皮革。剥皮与其他采集专业不同，因为它不依赖开放世界中的节点，而是依赖被击败的敌人。\r\n\r\n每次你剥取一只野兽的皮，都有机会提升你的剥皮技能并获得可直接用于制造的皮革。不同野兽身上的毛皮类型不同，通常与等级区间和进度相关，因此探索新区域并击败新敌人便成为提升该|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级过程中很有成就感的一部分。\r\n\r\n要剥取野兽的皮，你需要一把剥皮小刀，可以从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r处购买，或者使用 Skin-Peeler 9000 来自动剥取附近已被击败的野兽。采集时该工具必须放在你的背包中，它是获取皮革的必需品。对于同时管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品可将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，并可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
