T["Slay Gath'llzogg in Stonewatch Keep before level 24 or die! Then reach max level. This Hardcore challenge sends you deep into the dangerous cooridor's of Redridge's abandoned keep.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:334|hYou must kill [Gath'llzogg] before reaching level 24. (Click Here!)  |h"]="在达到 24 级之前击杀石堡要塞的 Gath'llzogg，否则就会死！然后达到满级。这场硬核挑战会把你送入赤脊山废弃要塞中危险的回廊深处。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:334|h你必须在达到 24 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Gath'llzogg]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["Slay Gath'llzogg in Stonewatch Keep before level 24 or die! Then reach max level. This Hardcore challenge sends you deep into the dangerous cooridor's of Redridge's abandoned keep. One life, no friends.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:334|hYou must kill [Gath'llzogg] before reaching level 24. (Click Here!)  |h"]="在达到 24 级之前击杀石堡要塞的 Gath'llzogg，否则就会死！然后达到满级。这场硬核挑战会把你送入赤脊山废弃要塞中危险的回廊深处。一条命，没有朋友。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:334|h你必须在达到 24 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Gath'llzogg]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
