T["Soulbound items are objects that become permanently bound to a single character, preventing them from being traded, mailed, or sold to other players once used or equipped. This system ensures that powerful equipment remains unique to the player who earned or looted it. Most high-level gear obtained from a |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h, |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, and certain quests are Soulbound.\r\n\r\nThere are two primary types of soulbinding:\r\n\r\nBind on Equip (BoE): These items become soulbound the moment you equip them for the first time. Until equipped, BoE items can be freely traded or sold to other players.\r\n\r\nBind on Pickup (BoP): These items become soulbound immediately upon looting or receiving them, making them untradeable from the start.\r\n\r\nWhile soulbinding is generally permanent, some equipment can become |Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h, which converts the item into a special version of PvP gear that is tradeable."]="灵魂绑定物品是会永久绑定到单个角色的物品，一旦使用或装备，就无法交易、邮寄或出售给其他玩家。该系统确保强力装备始终只属于获得或拾取它的玩家。从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r和某些任务中获得的多数高等级装备都是灵魂绑定的。\r\n\r\n灵魂绑定主要有两种类型：\r\n\r\n装备后绑定（BoE）：这类物品在你首次装备时绑定。在装备之前，BoE 物品可以自由交易或出售给其他玩家。\r\n\r\n拾取后绑定（BoP）：这类物品在拾取或获得时立即绑定，因此从一开始就无法交易。\r\n\r\n虽然灵魂绑定通常是永久的，但某些装备可以变为|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r，将物品转变为可以交易的 PvP 装备的特殊版本。"
