T["Spirit is the healer-only stat,\nand increases their mana regeneration.\n\n Choosing this specialization will give you bonus Intellect and Spirit and make each point of Spell Power give you one additional Healing Power."]="精神是 |cffFFFFFF仅限治疗者|r 的属性，\n它能提高法力回复速度。\n\n选择此专精将赋予你额外的 |cffFFFFFF智力|r 和 |cffFFFFFF精神|r，并使每点 |cffFFFFFF法术强度|r 额外为你提供一点 |cffFFFFFF治疗强度|r。"
