T["Step into the untamed heart of the jungle as an Ironman Hero. Alone and isolated, with one life and no help except your own skill, take on the ferocious beasts that lurk in the shadows. Slay Bangalash and complete the Big Game Hunter quest before level 40 and escape Stranglethorn Vale alive before climbing to 60 to complete this challenge. Fail to slay the king before level 40, and you'll die.\n\n|Hascensiondb:quest:208|hYou must complete [Big Game hunter] before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h"]="以钢铁侠英雄的身份深入丛林狂野的心脏。独自一人，与世隔绝，只有一条命，除了自身技艺外别无依靠，去面对潜伏在阴影中的凶残野兽。在达到 40 级之前击杀 Bangalash 并完成「大猎物猎人」任务，然后在升到 60 级之前活着逃离荆棘谷以完成此挑战。如果你没有在 40 级之前击杀这位王者，你就会死。\n\n|Hascensiondb:quest:208|h你必须在达到 40 级之前完成 |cffffff00[大猎物猎人]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["Stones of Retreat are convenient teleportation items that allow you to instantly travel to major cities and quest hubs throughout the open world. \r\n\r\nOnce acquired, a stone of retreat is added to your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h, and after learning it, you can use it at any time either from your Spellbook or by shift-clicking the destination directly on your |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h. These stones make traveling much faster and are especially useful for skipping long flight paths or returning to key locations quickly. \r\n\r\nStones of Retreat can be obtained from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, alternatively they can be purchased from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="撤离石是便捷的传送物品，让你可以瞬间前往开放世界中的各大城市和任务区域。 \r\n\r\n获得后，撤离石会加入你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r，学会之后，你可以随时从法术书中使用它，或直接在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r上对目的地按住 Shift 点击。这些石头让旅行变得快得多，尤其适合跳过漫长的飞行路线或快速返回关键地点。 \r\n\r\n撤离石可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r获得；也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["Stonewing Halberd"]="|cffe6cc80石翼长戟|r"
T["Stony Tark is an NPC who gives players access to the |Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h menu (Hotkey J), a feature that allows you to take on optional leveling challenges with unique rules and rewards. \r\n\r\nYou can find Stony Tark in any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h or starter zone. To begin a trial, your character must be level 1 as either a freshly created character or one that has just been Prestiged. \r\n\r\nInteracting with Stony Tark opens the |Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h menu, where you can choose from a variety of |Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h that may limit gear, abilities, or add permadeath mechanics. While you can view the rules of your trial at any time through the |Hkeyword:244|hTrials|h menu, starting or ending a new one always requires speaking with Stony Tark in person."]="Stony Tark 是一位 NPC，让玩家可以打开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r菜单（快捷键 J），该功能让你能够面对带有独特规则和奖励的可选升级挑战。\r\n\r\n你可以在任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r或起始区域找到 Stony Tark。要开始一个试炼，你的角色必须处于 1 级，无论是新建角色还是刚进行过威望重置。\r\n\r\n与 Stony Tark 互动会打开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r菜单，你可以在其中从多种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r中选择，它们可能限制装备、技能，或加入永久死亡机制。虽然你可以随时通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:244|h试炼|h|r菜单查看试炼规则，但开始或结束一个试炼始终需要亲自与 Stony Tark 交谈。"
T["Stormwind (SW) is the last remaining human kingdom in the world of Azeroth and serves as the majestic |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h of the Alliance faction. Located in the peaceful region of Elwynn Forest, Stormwind is a bustling hub where players of the Alliance can find important NPCs, |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, Class Trainers, and |Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h.\r\n\r\nAs the heart of human civilization, Stormwind is known for its towering stone walls, grand architecture, and iconic structures such as the Cathedral of Light and the Stormwind Keep, home to King Varian Wrynn. \r\n\r\nThe city is divided into several districts, each with its own purpose like the Trade District hosting |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h and |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, the Mage Quarter for magical training, and the Dwarven District where you can find access to the Deeprun Tram.\r\n\r\nIt is a safe haven from monsters and enemy players, making it an ideal place to rest, craft, trade, and prepare for adventures throughout Azeroth."]="暴风城（SW）是艾泽拉斯世界中仅存的人类王国，也是联盟阵营庄严的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。它位于宁静的艾尔文森林地区，是一座繁华的中心，联盟玩家可以在这里找到重要 NPC、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、职业训练师和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r。\r\n\r\n作为人类文明的心脏，暴风城以其雄伟的石墙、宏伟的建筑和标志性建筑而闻名，例如光明大教堂和暴风要塞——瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王的居所。\r\n\r\n城市分为多个区域，各有用途，例如商业区，其中坐落着|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r；法师区负责魔法训练；矮人区则可以通往深铁电车。\r\n\r\n它是抵御怪物和敌对玩家的安全庇护所，因此成为休息、制造、交易并为横跨艾泽拉斯的冒险做准备的理想之地。"
T["Strangulate\nLevel 22"]="绞喉\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a22|r"
T["Strength of Earth Totem\nLevel 10"]="大地之力图腾\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a10|r"
T["Stuns the opponent for 5 sec and deals 7 damage.  \r\n\r\nCauses a High amount of threat.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="击晕对手 5 秒并造成 7 点伤害。\r\n\r\n产生大量威胁值。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Sub-Zones are smaller, named areas within a larger zone. The first time you enter a Sub-Zone, you’ll earn a small amount of |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h and unveil its unique location on your |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h, helping you track where you’ve been.\r\n\r\nYou can hover your mouse over any revealed area on the |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h to see the name of the Sub-Zone. These areas are often tied to quests, gathering materials, and exploration achievements, making them valuable to discover during your journey.\r\n"]="子区域是较大区域内部较小的具名区域。第一次进入某个子区域时，你会获得少量 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r，并在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r上显示其独特位置，帮助你记录自己去过哪里。\r\n\r\n你可以将鼠标悬停在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r上任何已揭示的区域来查看子区域名称。这些区域通常与任务、材料采集和探索成就相关，因此在旅途中发现它们很有价值。\r\n"
T["Summon Felhunter\nLevel 30"]="召唤恶魔猎犬 |cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a30|r"
T["Summon Succubus\nLevel 20"]="召唤魅魔\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a20|r"
T["Summon Voidwalker\nLevel 10"]="召唤虚空行者\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a10|r"
T["Summons 3 treants to attack enemy targets for 30 sec. Shares a cooldown with other Force of Nature spells.\n\nCan't be used while having an active pet.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="召唤 3 个树精攻击敌方目标，持续 30 秒。与其他自然之力法术共享冷却时间。\n\n如果你有激活的宠物则无法使用。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Summons a Totem of Wrath with 5 health at the feet of the caster. \r\n\r\nThe totem increases Intellect by 22 and spell power by 23 for all party and raid members, and increases the critical strike chance of all spells and attacks made against all nearby targets by 3%. Lasts 5 min.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="在施法者脚下召唤一个拥有 5 点生命值的愤怒图腾。\r\n\r\n该图腾使所有小队和团队成员智力提高 22 点、法术强度提高 23 点，并使对附近所有目标施放的所有法术和攻击的爆击几率提高 3%。持续 5 分钟。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Summons and dismisses a rideable Brown Horse. \r\n\r\nGround Mount"]="召唤或解散一匹可骑乘的棕色马。\r\n\r\n|cFF33FFF0地面坐骑|r"
T["Sundering\nLevel 34"]="碎裂\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a34|r"
T["Surrounds you with fel energy, increasing spell damage by 40 plus 30% of your Spirit. \r\nRestores 2% of your max health every 5 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="以邪能包裹自身，使法术伤害提高 40 点外加你精神的 30%。\r\n每 5 秒恢复你最大生命值的 2%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Surrounds you with fel energy, increasing spell damage by 70 plus 30% of your Spirit. \r\nRestores 2% of your max health every 5 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="以邪能包裹自身，使法术伤害提高 70 点外加你精神的 30%。\r\n每 5 秒恢复你最大生命值的 2%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Survival of the Fittest"]="|cff0070de适者生存|r"
T["Switch between Specific dungeons or Random dungeons here"]="在此处切换 |cffFFFF00指定|r 地下城或 |cffFFFF00随机|r 地下城"
T["Tailoring is a |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h and a |Hkeyword:78|hCrafting Profession|h focused on transforming cloth materials found throughout the world into a wide range of items such as equipment, item enhancements, large |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h to expand your inventory, and even |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h.\r\n\r\nTo begin, you’ll need to visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h or use a |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn tailoring. Once trained, you can start collecting or purchasing the required materials. Tailoring relies primarily on cloth dropped from humanoid enemies across the open world and turning them into larger bolts of material.\r\n\r\nAs you level up, you'll unlock |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h, known as patterns, that teach you how to craft specific |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h pieces, |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h, and spell-enhancing items. In addition to wearable gear, tailors can also craft spellthreads that can be applied to equipment to boost stats and are particularly useful for caster builds.\r\n\r\nWhile tailors do not require a special tool to sew their patterns, many players combine it with other professions like Enchanting to streamline their material supply. For those managing multiple professions, investing in an Ethereal Tool Dispenser can be helpful as this item consolidates all |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h tools into a single inventory slot and is available from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP) or from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game gold."]="裁缝是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r，也是一项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:78|h制造专业|h|r，专注于把世界各地采集的布料材料转化为各种各样的物品，例如装备、物品强化、用于扩充背包的大型|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r，甚至|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r。\r\n\r\n要开始学习，你需要拜访|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r来学习裁缝。接受训练后，你就可以开始收集或购买所需的材料。裁缝主要依赖开放世界中类人敌人掉落的布料，并将其加工成更大的布卷。\r\n\r\n随着你提升等级，你将解锁|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r，也就是所谓的图样，它们会教你制作|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r部件、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r以及强化法术的物品。除了可穿戴的装备外，裁缝还可以制作施加在装备上以提升属性的法术丝线，对施法者构筑尤其有用。\r\n\r\n虽然裁缝缝制图样不需要特殊工具，但许多玩家会将其与附魔等其他专业搭配，以加快材料供应。对于同时管理多项专业的玩家来说，购买虚灵工具分配器会很有帮助，因为该物品可将所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r工具整合到一个背包栏位中，并可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内金币购买。"
