T["Tamed pets are creatures that assist you in battle, each offering unique abilities based on their type. Some pets even come with Pet Talents, allowing you to customize their skills and playstyle to fit your combat needs. You can view the stats and details of your tamed pet in the |Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h (Hotkey Shift + P).\r\n\r\nYou can only have one tamed pet active at a time, but there are many types to choose from, including beasts, demons, undead, dragonkin, and elementals. Summoning a pet depends on its classification and requires specific spells: Tame Beast, Tame Dragonkin, Tether Elemental, Summon Demon, Enslave Demon, and Dominate Undead. \r\n\r\nThere are two ways to acquire combat pets: by finding and taming them directly in the open world, or by using a |Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h item known as a pet whistle. Each whistle is tied to a specific pet and can be found in the |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h (Hotkey N -> |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h Tab -> Pets). These whistles can drop from their corresponding creatures in the world, be purchased from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, or obtained from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h using |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n\r\nPets tamed in the open world must be managed through a stablemaster if you wish to swap between them. However, pets acquired via whistles are far more convenient, allowing you to switch your active pet anytime and anywhere without needing to visit a stable."]="驯服的宠物是在战斗中帮助你的生物，每种都根据其类型拥有独特技能。有些宠物甚至拥有宠物天赋，让你可以自定义它们的技能和玩法风格，以适应你的战斗需求。你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r（快捷键 Shift + P）中查看驯服宠物的属性和详情。\r\n\r\n你一次只能拥有一只激活的驯服宠物，但可供选择的类型很多，包括野兽、恶魔、亡灵、龙类和元素生物。召唤宠物取决于其分类，并需要特定法术：驯服野兽、驯服龙类、束缚元素、召唤恶魔、奴役恶魔和支配亡灵。\r\n\r\n获得战斗宠物有两种方式：在开放世界中直接找到并驯服它们，或使用被称为宠物哨声的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r物品。每个哨声都绑定到一只特定的宠物，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r中找到（快捷键 N → |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r标签页 → 宠物）。这些哨声可能从世界中对应的生物身上掉落、在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）获得。\r\n\r\n如果你想在开放世界中驯服的宠物之间切换，必须通过马厩管理员来管理。不过，通过哨声获得的宠物要方便得多，因为它们让你可以随时随地切换激活的宠物，而无需前往马厩。"
T["Teleport: Moonglade\nLevel 10"]="传送：明暗之间\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a10|r"
T["Temporary Enslaved Demon\nLevel 30"]="临时奴役的恶魔\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a30|r"
T["The Ascension Store offers a wide variety of cosmetics, |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h, and other convenience items designed to enhance your |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h. All items in the store are purchased using |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n\r\nMost store items are tradable, meaning they can be listed on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or exchanged through |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, making many store-exclusive items accessible even to non-donating players.\r\n\r\nYou can access the store through the Ascension launcher or by visiting ascension.gg/store.\r\n\r\nEach realm has its own separate store, so availability and purchase history are unique per realm. Be sure to check which realm you're shopping on before finalizing your purchase!"]="飞升商店提供各种各样的外观、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h遗物|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r以及其他为提升你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r而设计的便利物品。所有商店物品都用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n大多数商店物品都可以交易，也就是说可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r上架，或通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r换取游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r，这让许多商店专属物品即使对不捐赠的玩家来说也可以获得。\r\n\r\n你可以通过飞升启动器或访问 ascension.gg/store 进入商店。\r\n\r\n每个服务器都有自己的独立商店，因此库存和购买记录都只属于各自服务器。完成购买前请务必确认你正在哪个服务器上购物！"
T["The Ascension Wiki page is a community page closely maintained by both players and the Ascension Staff (www.ascension.gg/wiki). It contains info about many aspects of the game, from Build Guides to explaining custom mechanics, and is an essential resource for Ascension!"]="飞升 wiki 是由玩家和飞升团队共同维护的社区页面（|cffffd200www.ascension.gg/wiki|r）。它包含游戏许多方面的信息，从构筑指南到自定义机制说明，是飞升不可或缺的资源。"
T["The Auction House is the primary in-game marketplace, allowing players to buy and sell items using gold. From gear and crafting materials to vanity equipment and even |Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h, the Auction House serves as the central hub for all player-to-player transactions.\r\n\r\nYou can list your own items for sale or browse listings posted by others, making it a powerful tool for both making gold and acquiring rare or useful items. The market is dynamic and prices can fluctuate, so savvy trading can be very rewarding.\r\n\r\nAuction Houses are located in every |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h. Use the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h to locate an Auctioneer on your minimap, or ask a guard for directions."]="拍卖行是游戏的主要市场，让玩家可以用金币买卖物品。从装备和制造材料到外观装备，甚至|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r，拍卖行都是玩家之间一切交易的主要中心。\r\n\r\n你可以上架自己的物品，也可以查看其他玩家的挂单，这使它既是赚取金币的强力工具，也是获取稀有或实用物品的好方法。市场是动态的，价格会波动，因此聪明的交易可以带来丰厚回报。\r\n\r\n所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r都有拍卖行。使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r在小地图上定位拍卖师，或向卫兵询问方向。"
T["The Bank is personal storage that allows you to safely retain extra items, materials, and gear that without cluttering your inventory. Each character has their own unique Bank, meaning items stored here are not shared across your account or other characters.\r\n\r\nBy default, your Bank offers a limited number of storage slots, but you can expand its capacity by placing |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h into the additional Bank Bag slots. If you still need more room, consider purchasing a |Hkeyword:35|hPersonal Bank|h or a |Hkeyword:36|hRealm-Wide Bank|h from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, or from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n\r\nYou can access your bank in any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h. Use the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h and search for bankers to highlight their location on your mini-map or ask a guard for directions!\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you could summon a Treasure Keeper Companion who allows remote access to your bank without the need to return to a city."]="银行是个人存储空间，让你安全地保存额外的物品、材料和装备，而不必塞满背包。每个角色都有自己的独立银行，这意味着存放在这里的物品不会与账号内的其他角色共享。\r\n\r\n默认情况下，你的银行提供数量有限的存储栏位，但你可以通过在银行额外的背包栏位中放入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r来扩充容量。如果你还需要更多空间，可以考虑在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:35|h个人银行|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:36|h全服务器银行|h|r，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n你可以在任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r使用银行。使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r搜索银行家即可在小地图上高亮其位置，或向卫兵询问方向！\r\n\r\n另外，你还可以召唤一个宝藏守护者，这个伙伴让你可以远程使用银行，无需返回城市。"
T["The Beginner’s |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h is a NPC that functions as a universal Class Trainer. Found in starter zones and early-level questing hubs, this book allows any character, regardless of class, to learn all available class abilities up to level 20.\r\n\r\nWith the Beginner’s |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h, you won’t need to hunt down a specific Class Trainer in the early game, making it a great tool for getting started quickly. \r\n\r\nYou can easily locate the Beginner’s |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h on your mini-map. Just search for “Class Trainer”, and any nearby Books will be marked for you.\r\n\r\nAfter reaching level 20, you’ll need to visit your class-specific trainer or use a |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h to continue learning new spells and higher ranks."]="初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r是一位充当通用职业训练师的 NPC。它位于起始区域和低等级任务中心，这本书让任何角色，无论职业，都能学习 20 级之前所有可用的职业法术。\r\n\r\n有了初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r，你在游戏初期就不必再寻找特定的职业训练师，这使它成为快速上手的绝佳工具。\r\n\r\n你可以使用小地图上的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r轻松找到初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r。只需搜索「职业训练师」，附近所有书就会被标记出来。\r\n\r\n到达 20 级后，你需要拜访你的特定职业训练师，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r来继续学习新法术和更高等级。"
T["The Beginner’s |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h is a NPC that acts as a universal |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h. Found in starter zones and early-level questing hubs, this book allows you to learn any |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h or |Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h up to a skill level of 75, making it an excellent way to get started without needing to hunt down specific trainers.\r\n\r\nThis early-game convenience helps you jump into crafting, gathering, and |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h leveling without delay, no matter which |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h you’re aiming for, be it |Hkeyword:155|hMining|h, |Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h, |Hkeyword:95|hEngineering|h, or others.\r\n\r\nYou can easily locate the Beginner’s |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h on your mini-map. Just search for “|Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Trainers”, and any nearby books will be marked for you.\r\n\r\nOnce you’ve passed skill level 75, you’ll need to visit a full |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h in a larger hub, or use the |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h Companion, to continue learning |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h and advancing your skill further."]="初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r是一位充当通用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r的 NPC。它位于起始区域和低等级任务中心，这本书让你可以学习任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主专业|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r直到 75 点技能等级，是无需寻找特定训练师便能起步的绝佳方式。\r\n\r\n这种游戏初期的便利能帮助你立即投入制造、采集和提升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级，无论你志向哪项|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r，是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:155|h采矿|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:95|h工程学|h|r还是其他。\r\n\r\n你可以使用小地图上的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r轻松找到初学者|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r。只需搜索「|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r训练师」，附近所有书就会被标记出来。\r\n\r\n一旦你的技能等级超过 75，你就需要前往更大中心的完整|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r，或使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r伙伴，才能继续学习|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r并进一步提升技能。"
T["The Book of Artisans is a convenient, summonable companion pet that functions as a portable |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h. When summoned, it allows your character to learn any |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h or trainer-taught Recipe, just as if you were speaking to a trainer in a |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h or quest hub.\r\n\r\nThis tool is especially valuable for players leveling professions across multiple characters or frequently changing |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h setups. With the Book of Artisans, there’s no need to travel across the world to visit individual trainers.\r\n\r\nYou can buy a Book of Artisans from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h. Alternatively, you can purchase one from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n\r\nThe Book of Artisans is one of the |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h saved in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h, making it available to all your characters on the same realm once unlocked."]="工匠之书是一个实用的可召唤伙伴宠物，充当便携式|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r。召唤它后，你的角色可以学习任何由训练师教授的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r或配方，就像在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r或任务中心与训练师交谈一样。\r\n\r\n这件工具对于在多个角色上提升专业或频繁更换|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r配置的玩家尤其宝贵。有了工匠之书，你就不必跑遍世界去拜访每一位训练师。\r\n\r\n你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买工匠之书。也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买一本。\r\n\r\n工匠之书是保存在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r之一，因此一旦解锁，同服务器的所有角色都可以使用。"
T["The Book of Ascension is a powerful, summonable companion pet that acts as an all-in-one Class Trainer. When summoned, it allows your character to learn all available class abilities, including new spells as you level and higher ranks of existing spells no matter where you are in the world.\r\n\r\nThis makes it an incredibly useful quality-of-life tool, especially for players on the go or those playing in zones far from major cities. You can even use another player’s Book of Ascension if they’ve summoned theirs nearby, making it an asset in group settings as well. However, if you have the book as on of your own |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h, it will automatically train your new spells and ranks as you level up!\r\n\r\nYou can buy a Book of Ascension from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h for in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h. Alternatively, you can purchase one from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP).\r\n\r\nThe Book of Ascension is a companion saved in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h, so it’s available to all your characters on the same realm once unlocked."]="飞升之书是一个强大的可召唤伙伴，充当全能的职业训练师。召唤它后，你的角色可以学习所有可用的职业技能，包括随着你升级而出现的新法术以及已有法术的更高等级，无论你身处世界何处。\r\n\r\n这使它成为极其有用的生活质量工具，尤其适合正在旅行或身处远离大城市的区域的玩家。你甚至可以使用其他玩家召唤在你附近的飞升之书，这也使它成为组队时宝贵的资源。不过，如果你把这本书作为自己的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r之一，它会在你升级时自动训练你的新法术和等级！\r\n\r\n你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或通过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买飞升之书。也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买一本。\r\n\r\n飞升之书是保存在你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r中的伙伴，因此一旦解锁，同服务器的所有角色都可以使用。"
T["The Call Board is a useful quest hub found near the entrances of every |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, designed to help players stay on track throughout their journey.\r\n\r\nWhile leveling, the Call Board directs you to the next appropriate questing area, ensuring smooth zone progression and helping you avoid out-leveling content. It’s especially handy for new players or those unsure of where to go next.\r\n\r\nAt the maximum level, the Call Board offers daily and weekly quests that provide a variety of rewards, including Marks of Ascension, valuable |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, rare or epic equipment, and more. These quests often encourage players to revisit dungeons, complete world events, or engage in other content that contributes to their overall progression.\r\n\r\nFor added convenience, you can acquire a portable call board, which lets you access these quests from anywhere in the world. You can buy a call board for your faction or a neutral one that can be used by all characters from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="告示板是一个实用的任务中心，位于所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r入口附近，旨在帮助玩家在整个冒险过程中保持方向。\r\n\r\n在你升级的过程中，告示板会指引你前往下一个合适的任务区域，确保区域之间平滑过渡，并帮助你避免等级远超内容进度。它对新手玩家或不确定下一步该去哪里的玩家尤其有用。\r\n\r\n达到满级后，告示板会提供每日和每周任务，奖励各式各样的物品，包括飞升印记、珍贵的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r、稀有或史诗装备等等。这些任务通常会鼓励玩家重返地下城、完成世界事件或参与其他有助于整体进度的内容。\r\n\r\n为了方便，你可以获得一个便携式告示板，让你在世界任何地方都能使用这些任务。你可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买属于你阵营的告示板，或一个所有角色都能使用的中立告示板。"
T["The Classless system means that every user is able to use all three resources: mana, rage and energy. To make it clear and easy to control, we include all three on your player portrait. The horizontal bar is for energy and the vertical bar is for rage."]="|cffFFFFFF单一职业系统意味着每个用户都可以使用三种 |r资源|cffFFFFFF：|r法力|cffFFFFFF、|r怒气|cffFFFFFF 和 |r能量|cffFFFFFF。为了让一切都清晰易控，我们将三者都放进了你的 |r玩家头像|cffFFFFFF 中。|r水平|cffFFFFFF 条用于能量，|r垂直|cffFFFFFF 条用于怒气。|r"
T["The Ethereal Bazaar is a special, ever-changing shop accessible through |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h inside the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h of any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h. Unlike regular |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, the bazaar offers a selection of rare and exclusive cosmetic items that you won’t find anywhere else.\r\n\r\nTo purchase from the Ethereal Bazaar, you’ll need |Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h, an item purchased from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP). \r\n\r\nKeep in mind that the bazaar’s inventory rotates on a random timer, and only one copy of each item is available per cycle. This means you’ll often compete with other players to snag these limited items before they disappear."]="虚灵集市是一家特殊且不断变化的商店，可通过任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r中的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r进入。与普通的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r不同，集市提供在其他地方找不到的稀有专属外观物品。\r\n\r\n要在虚灵集市购物，你需要|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r，这种物品可在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。\r\n\r\n请注意，集市的库存按随机计时器轮换，每个周期每种物品只有一件。这意味着你常常需要与其他玩家竞争，在这些限量物品消失之前抢到手。"
T["The Hit Cap refers to the minimum amount of |Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h a player needs to never miss an attack on an enemy. Reaching the hit cap ensures your offensive abilities connect reliably, especially in high level content like Dungeons and Raids.\r\n\r\nThe hit cap is divided into two categories, players and |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h bosses.\r\n\r\nTo never miss a player with a physical attack or spell, you need 4% |Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h.\r\nTo never miss a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h boss with a physical attack, you need 8% |Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h.\r\nTo never miss a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h boss with a spell, you need 17% |Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h. \r\n\r\n|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h bosses have higher resistance and avoidance, meaning players typically need a higher Hit Cap to perform consistently in endgame content.\r\n\r\nIf you're at or above the hit cap, any extra |Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h provides no additional benefit and could be better spent on other stats like |Hkeyword:81|hCritical Strike|h or Haste.\r\n\r\nYou can find your hit cap by mousing over “|Hkeyword:132|hHit Rating|h” in Character Info (Hotkey C)."]="命中上限是指玩家为了永不对敌人攻击落空所需的最低|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r数值。达到命中上限可确保你的攻击技能稳定命中，在高等级内容（如地下城和团队副本）中尤其如此。\r\n\r\n命中上限分为两类：对玩家和对|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领。\r\n\r\n要永不对玩家的一次物理攻击或法术落空，你需要 4% 的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。\r\n要永不对|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领的一次物理攻击落空，你需要 8% 的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。\r\n要永不对|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领的一次法术落空，你需要 17% 的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r。 \r\n\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r首领拥有更高的抗性和躲闪，这意味着玩家通常需要更高的命中上限才能在终局内容中稳定发挥。\r\n\r\n如果你已达到或超过命中上限，额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r不会带来任何额外收益，不如投入到|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:81|h爆击|h|r或急速等其他属性上。\r\n\r\n你可以在角色信息（快捷键 C）中将鼠标悬停在 \"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:132|h命中等级|h|r\" 上查看你的命中上限。"
T["The Manastorm is a dynamic, randomized, and endlessly scaling |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h challenge, designed to test your skills, creativity, and survivability. It can be tackled solo or with a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h group of up to 15 players, offering flexible difficulty and a wide range of rewards.\r\n\r\nEach run of the Manastorm is procedurally generated, featuring unique bosses, custom encounters, randomized layouts, and increasingly difficult enemies the deeper you progress. As you ascend, you’ll encounter environmental hazards, elite foes, and powerful modifiers that keep every floor engaging and unpredictable.\r\n\r\nSuccessful progression through the Manastorm earns you a variety of valuable rewards, including |Hkeyword:148|hManastorm Caches|h, |Hkeyword:43|hBedlam Bullions|h, |Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h, gold, |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, and more.\r\n\r\nIf your group is defeated, you'll be ejected from the Manastorm and must start a new ascent. However, progress saves every 5 floors, so you can resume climbing later without starting over entirely.\r\n\r\nUpon exiting (whether voluntarily or by defeat) you’ll be automatically teleported back to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, where you’ll appear right next to |Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h. From there, you can immediately spend your earned |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h on rewards and prepare for your next dive into the arcane storm."]="法力风暴是一种动态、随机且无限成长难度的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r挑战，旨在考验你的技巧、创造力和生存能力。你可以独自面对，也可以与最多 15 名玩家的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r队伍一起挑战，提供灵活的难度和丰富多样的奖励。\r\n\r\n每局法力风暴都是程序化生成的，拥有独特的首领、定制的战斗、随机的布局，以及随着你深入而愈发强大的敌人。随着你攀升，会遇到环境危险、精英敌人和强力修正效果，让每一层都充满趣味和不可预测性。\r\n\r\n成功推进法力风暴会给予你各种各样珍贵的奖励，包括|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:148|h法力风暴宝箱|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|hBedlam 锭|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h|r、金币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r等等。\r\n\r\n如果你的队伍被击败，你将被逐出法力风暴，必须开始新的攀升。不过进度每 5 层会保存一次，因此你可以稍后继续攀升，不必从头开始。\r\n\r\n离开时（无论是主动离开还是因战败），你都会被自动传送回你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，出现在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h|r身旁。从那里，你可以立刻把辛苦获得的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r花在奖励上，并为下一次深入奥术风暴做好准备。"
T["The Map Lens is the magnifying glass icon located on your mini-map, acting as a search and filtering tool for navigating the world around you. When clicked, the map lens opens a menu that allows you to highlight specific types of NPCs and key locations in your immediate area such as repair NPCs, |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h, trainers, innkeepers, bankers, and more.\r\n\r\nIn addition to tracking NPCs, the Map Lens is also where you can enable tracking for a |Hkeyword:115|hGathering Profession|h. This functionality is essential for efficiently farming resources in the world and leveling up your gathering skills.\r\n\r\nOnce you select what you are searching for, the NPCs or gathering nodes will appear as golden dots on your mini-map, making it much easier to locate important services and items, especially in busy Capital Cities or new zones."]="地图透镜是你小地图上的放大镜图标，充当搜索和筛选工具，帮助你在周围世界中辨明方向。点击它，地图透镜会打开一个菜单，让你可以高亮当前区域中特定类型的 NPC 和关键地点，例如修理 NPC、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r、训练师、旅店老板、银行家等等。\r\n\r\n除了追踪 NPC，地图透镜也是你可以开启|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:115|h采集专业|h|r追踪的地方。该功能对于在世界上高效采集资源和提升采集技能等级至关重要。\r\n\r\n选定你要寻找的内容后，NPC 或采集节点会以小地图上的金色圆点显示，让你更容易找到重要服务和物品，在繁忙的主城或新区域尤其如此。"
T["The Options Menu is your central hub for customizing your gameplay |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h. You can open it by pressing the Escape (Esc) key or by clicking the red (?) icon located in the micro menu at the bottom of your screen. From here, you can adjust a wide range of settings to fine-tune how the game looks, sounds, and feels.\r\n\r\nWithin the Options Menu, you’ll find tabs for keybindings, graphics, sound, and interface settings. You can remap your keys for more comfortable controls, optimize your graphics settings for better performance or visual quality, and adjust sound effects or music volume to your liking. It also includes features for UI customization, such as toggling floating combat text, adjusting display options, and enabling auto-loot.\r\n\r\nUnder the Interface tab, you’ll find character-specific settings like the option to hide your helmet or cloak, adjust camera behavior, or modify action bar layouts. These options help you tailor the game's interface and visuals to match your preferences and playstyle.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the options menu provides tools for reporting bugs or contacting the Ascension team if you encounter technical issues or need support. It's an essential tool not only for improving your gameplay but also for communicating with the developers when needed."]="选项菜单是你个性化游戏|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h体验|h|r的主要中心。你可以按 Escape（Esc）键，或点击屏幕底部微型菜单中的红色（?）图标来打开它。在这里，你可以调整各种选项，精细地改变游戏的视觉、音效和手感。\r\n\r\n在选项菜单中，你会找到按键绑定、图形、声音和界面设置标签页。你可以重新分配按键以获得更舒适的操作、优化图形设置以提升性能或画质，并按喜好调整音效或音乐音量。它还包含自定义界面的功能，例如开启浮动战斗文字、调整显示选项和启用自动拾取。\r\n\r\n在界面标签页中，你会找到角色专属的设置，例如隐藏头盔或披风的选项、调整镜头行为，或修改动作条的布局。这些选项帮助你根据个人偏好和玩法风格调整界面与游戏画面。\r\n\r\n此外，选项菜单还提供工具，供你在遇到技术问题或需要帮助时报告错误或联系飞升团队。它不仅对提升游戏体验至关重要，也是在必要时与开发者沟通的必备工具。"
T["The Personal |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h is a summonable container that provides extra storage exclusively for your current character. It allows convenient access to additional |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h without needing to visit a physical |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h. \r\n\r\nUnlike the |Hkeyword:36|hRealm-Wide Bank|h, the Personal |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h is character-specific and can only be accessed by the character who owns it. It can be summoned only in rested areas, such as in an |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h or a |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, or in |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h instances.\r\n\r\nThis item is part of the |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h and can be obtained from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or purchased on the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="个人|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是一个可召唤的容器，为当前角色提供专属的额外存储空间。它让你无需前往实体|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r就能方便地使用额外的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r。\r\n\r\n与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:36|h全服务器银行|h|r不同，个人|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是每个角色专属的，只有拥有它的角色才能使用。它只能在休息区域（例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r）或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r副本中召唤。\r\n\r\n该物品属于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r获得，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["The Pets Tab (Hotkey Shift + P) is the interface where you can view the details of your |Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h, as well as your |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h and |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h. \r\n\r\nFor players using a |Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h, the pets tab displays key information including the pet’s name, type, level, and stats.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the pet tab gives you full access to your mount and companion collections, allowing you to preview, summon, or dismiss your learned vanity or regular non-combat pets and |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h from one convenient location."]="宠物标签页（快捷键 Shift + P）是你可以查看|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服宠物|h|r详情，以及你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r的界面。 \r\n\r\n对于使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服宠物|h|r的玩家，宠物标签页会显示关键信息，包括宠物的名称、类型、等级和属性。\r\n\r\n此外，宠物标签页让你可以完全访问坐骑和伙伴收藏，让你在一个便捷的地方预览、召唤或解散你的外观宠物、已学会的非战斗宠物，以及你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r。"
T["The Realm-Wide |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h is a summonable storage system accessible by all your characters on the same server, enabling easy item transfer between alts without relying on the mailbox. It holds a wide variety of non-|Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h items but cannot store or transfer |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h gear.\r\n\r\nUnlike the |Hkeyword:35|hPersonal Bank|h, the Realm-Wide |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h is realm-specific and can be accessed by any character on that particular server. It can be summoned only in rested areas, such as in an |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h or a |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, or in |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h instances. \r\n\r\nThis item is part of the |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h and can be obtained from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or purchased on the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="全服务器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是一种可召唤的存储系统，同服务器的所有角色都可以使用，让你无需依赖邮箱就能轻松在副角色之间转移物品。它可以存放各种非|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r物品，但无法存放或转移|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r装备。\r\n\r\n与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:35|h个人银行|h|r不同，全服务器|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r是每个服务器专属的，该服务器上的任何角色都可以使用。它只能在休息区域（例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r）或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r副本中召唤。\r\n\r\n该物品属于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r获得，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["The Skills tab (Hotkey K) provides a detailed overview of your character’s various proficiencies. \r\n\r\nThis includes your skill levels in weaponry tracks your available |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h Type, class-related abilities (like stealth or lockpicking), |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h levels (such as |Hkeyword:47|hBlacksmithing|h or |Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h), |Hkeyword:217|hSecondary Skill|h level (like |Hkeyword:72|hCooking|h and |Hkeyword:108|hFirst Aid|h), and even languages your character can understand or speak. \r\n\r\nAs you use weapons in combat or actively work on professions, your skill levels increase naturally, improving your effectiveness with those tools or trades. For example, leveling a weapon skill makes you more accurate and efficient in combat with that weapon type, while increasing a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h skill allows you to craft higher-level items."]="技能标签页（快捷键 K）提供你角色各项能力的详细概要。\r\n\r\n其中包括武器技能等级、可用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r类型的追踪、与职业相关的技能（例如潜行或开锁）、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r等级（例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:47|h锻造|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r）、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:217|h次要技能|h|r等级（例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:72|h烹饪|h|r和|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:108|h急救|h|r），甚至你的角色能听懂或说的语言。\r\n\r\n当你在战斗中使用武器或积极从事专业时，你的技能等级会自然提升，从而提高你使用这些工具或手艺的效率。例如，提升武器技能会让你在使用该类武器战斗时更精准高效，而提升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r技能则让你能制造更高等级的物品。"
T["The Vanity Collection (Hotkey N -> Vanity Tab) is your menu for managing all of your |Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h items. This includes |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, |Hkeyword:236|hTamed Pet|h appearances, toys, equipment cosmetics, |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h, |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, and non-consumable |Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h. \r\n\r\nAll items in your Vanity Collection are shared across all characters on the same realm, allowing you to easily access your favorite items regardless of which character you're playing.\r\n\r\nYou can instantly deliver any item from your collection to any of your characters at any time. This makes it incredibly convenient to equip cosmetics or toys without needing to transfer items manually.\r\n\r\nIf you play on multiple live realms, you can use a |Hkeyword:248|hVanity Collection Sync|h to copy your unlocked cosmetics across realms, ensuring your collection stays consistent no matter where you play.\r\n\r\nThe Vanity tab is also where the seasonal shop can be browsed, offering access to exclusive appearances, pets, and other themed rewards during the current realm’s season."]="外观收藏（快捷键 N → 外观标签页）是你管理所有|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r物品的菜单。其中包括|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:236|h驯服宠物|h|r外观、玩具、装备外观、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h遗物|h|r以及非消耗性|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r。 \r\n\r\n你外观收藏中的所有物品都会在同服务器的所有角色之间共享，让你无论玩哪个角色都能轻松使用喜爱的物品。\r\n\r\n你可以随时将收藏中的任何物品立即发送到你的任何角色。这让装备外观或玩具变得极其方便，无需手动转移物品。\r\n\r\n如果你在多个在线服务器上游戏，可以使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:248|h外观收藏同步|h|r在各个服务器之间复制你已解锁的外观，确保无论你在哪里游戏，收藏都保持一致。\r\n\r\n外观标签页也是浏览赛季商店的地方，在当前服务器赛季期间可以获取专属外观、宠物和其他主题奖励。"
T["The Wardrobe (Hotkey N -> Wardrobe Tab) is your central hub for managing the cosmetic appearance of your character. Through the wardrobe, you can view all the equipment appearances you’ve collected over time, including individual |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h pieces, incarnations, spell cosmetics, and complete full gear sets. This system lets you customize your look without sacrificing the stats or functionality of your equipped gear.\r\n\r\nOne of the wardrobe’s key features is the ability to Transmogrify (or mog) the appearance of your current gear to match any collected visuals, giving you full control over your character’s style. Beyond simple transmogging, the wardrobe allows you to create and save custom outfits, making it easy to switch between different looks instantly."]="衣柜（快捷键 N → 衣柜标签页）是你管理角色外观造型的主要中心。通过衣柜，你可以查看自己长期收集的所有装备外观，包括单件|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r、化身、法术外观和完整装备套装。该系统让你在个性化外观的同时，不必牺牲已装备物品的属性和功能。\r\n\r\n衣柜的关键功能之一是能够幻化（或 transmog）你当前装备的外观，使其与任何已收集的造型一致，让你完全掌控角色的风格。除了简单的幻化，衣柜还让你创建并保存自定义套装，从而轻松在不同造型之间即时切换。"
T["The World Map (Hotkey M) helps you navigate Azeroth by displaying your current location and surrounding zones. \r\n\r\nYou can zoom in and out (with Left or Right Click) to view entire continents or focus on a specific |Hkeyword:15|hSub-Zone|h. \r\n\r\nThe map starts out mostly blank, with details only appearing as you explore the world. As you discover new areas, the map gradually fills in with terrain, labels, and points of interest, encouraging exploration and rewarding curiosity.\r\n\r\nImportant icons mark quest hubs, various |Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h, cities, |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h entrances, and more. Tracked quests and objectives are also displayed directly on the map, making it easy to chart your path and find your next destination. These options are all toggleable with the magnifying glass icon in the top right corner so you can have as much, or as little information on your map as you like."]="世界地图（快捷键 M）通过显示你的当前位置和周边区域，帮助你辨明艾泽拉斯的方向。\r\n\r\n你可以放大和缩小视野（使用左键或右键），以查看整块大陆或聚焦于特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:15|h子区域|h|r。\r\n\r\n地图一开始几乎是空白的，只有在你探索世界时细节才会出现。随着你发现新区域，地图会逐渐填上地形、地标和兴趣点，这鼓励探索并奖励好奇心。\r\n\r\n重要图标会标出任务中心、各条|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r、城市、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r入口等等。已追踪的任务和目标也会直接显示在地图上，让你更容易规划路线并找到下一个目的地。所有这些选项都可以通过右上角的放大镜图标开启或关闭，让你想在地图上显示多少信息就显示多少。"
T["The amount a buyer can pay to instantly purchase the item, skipping the bidding process. This must be equal to or higher than the Starting Price.|nThis is the most common way players buy and sell at the auction house!"]="买家为立即买下该物品可以支付的金额，可跳过竞拍流程。该金额必须等于或高于起拍价。|n|cff00ff00这是玩家在拍卖行买卖物品最常见的方式。|r"
T["The hunter and raid members within 40 yards take on the aspects of a pack of cheetahs, increasing movement speed by 30%.  \r\n\r\nIf you are struck under the effect of this aspect, you will be dazed for 4 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="猎人和 40 码范围内的团队成员化身为猎豹群，使移动速度提高 30%。  \r\n\r\n如果你在该形态效果下受到攻击，你会被击晕 4 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["The nightmare consumes you! Sucked deep into the dark of Azeroths most dangerous reaches, you'll need to complete all dungeons in order to escape. With only one life, 300% more damage from physical attacks, and 500% more damage from spells, you'll need every ally you can find to overcome this terrifying trial. Will you emerge victorious, or be consumed by the terrors of the night?\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill [Edwin VanCleef] before reaching level 21. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill [Mutanus the Devourer] before reaching level 22. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill [Archmage Arugal] before reaching level 26. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill [Aku'mai] before reaching level 28. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill [Charlga Razorflank] before reaching level 33. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill [Mekgineer Thermaplugg] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill [Bloodmage Thalnos] before reaching level 34. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill [Arcanist Doan] before reaching level 37. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill [Herod] before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill [Amnennar]before reaching level 41. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill [Archaedas] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill [Lord Vyletongue] before reaching level 47. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|hYou must kill [Chief Ukorz Sandscalp] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|hYou must kill [Razorlash] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|hYou must kill [Celebras the Cursed] before reaching level 49. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|hYou must kill [Princess Theradras] before reaching level 51. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|hYou must kill [Shade of Eranikus] before reaching level 55. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|hYou must kill [Alzzin the Wildshaper] before reaching level 58. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|hYou must kill [Emperor Thaurissan] before reaching level 59. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|hYou must kill [King Gordok] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|hYou must kill [Prince Tortheldrin] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|hYou must kill [Overlord Wyrmthalak] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|hYou must kill [Balnazzar] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|hYou must kill [Baron Rivendare] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|hYou must kill [Darkmaster Gandling] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h"]="噩梦吞噬了你！你被拖入艾泽拉斯最危险角落的深处，必须完成所有地下城才能逃脱。只有一条命、物理攻击伤害提高 300%、法术伤害提高 500%，你需要能找到的所有盟友才能通过这场可怕的试炼。你会凯旋而归，还是被黑夜的恐怖吞噬？\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|h你必须在达到 21 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[埃德温·范克里夫]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|h你必须在达到 22 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[吞噬者穆坦努斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|h你必须在达到 26 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[大法师阿鲁高]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|h你必须在达到 28 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[阿库麦尔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|h你必须在达到 33 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[尖牙德鲁伊查尔加]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|h你必须在达到 34 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[机械师瑟玛普拉格]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|h你必须在达到 34 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[血法师萨尔诺斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|h你必须在达到 37 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[奥法师杜安]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|h你必须在达到 40 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[赫罗德]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|h你必须在达到 41 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[阿门纳尔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|h你必须在达到 47 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[阿扎达斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|h你必须在达到 47 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[维利塔恩领主]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7267|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Jefe Ukorz Escama de Arena]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12258|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[锐刺鞭笞者]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12225|h你必须在达到 49 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Celebras el Maldito]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12201|h你必须在达到 51 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Princesa Theradras]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5709|h你必须在达到 55 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Sombra de Eranikus]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11492|h你必须在达到 58 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Alzzin el Cambiaformas]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9019|h你必须在达到 59 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Emperador Thaurissan]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11501|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Rey Gordok]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11486|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Príncipe Tortheldrin]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9568|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Sobrecampeón Wyrmthalak]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10813|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Balnazzar]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10440|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Barón Rivendare]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1853|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[Maestro Oscuro Gandling]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["The sea has claimed you. You’ve grown gills and can no longer breathe on land. On your quest to reach max level, you must swim and fish your way through Azeroth’s waters, gathering rare catches to prove your mastery of the deep. Will you rise as a fishy hero, or drown trying?\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6294|hYou must loot [12 Pound Mud Snapper] x1 before reaching level 15. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6310|hYou must loot [19 Pound Catfish] x1 before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13882|hYou must loot [42 Pound Redgill] x1 before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13901|hYou must loot [15 Pound Salmon] x1 before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h"]="大海夺走了你。你长出了鳃，再也无法在陆地上呼吸。在达到满级的旅途中，你必须游遍并钓遍艾泽拉斯的水域，收集稀有的渔获以证明你在深渊中的造诣。你会作为水中英雄浮出水面，还是在尝试中溺亡？\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6294|h你必须在达到 15 级之前拾取 |cffffff00[12 磅重的泥鳅]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:6310|h你必须在达到 20 级之前拾取 |cffffff00[19 磅重的鲶鱼]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13882|h你必须在达到 40 级之前拾取 |cffffff00[42 磅重的红鳃鱼]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:item:13901|h你必须在达到 60 级之前拾取 |cffffff00[15 磅重的鲑鱼]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["The |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h is a large shared storage space available to members of a |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h. It allows players to store and share items, materials, and gold within their community, making it easier to manage resources collectively.\r\n\r\nYou can access the |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h at special NPCs located in major cities. |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h leaders have control over permissions, deciding which members can deposit or withdraw items and funds to maintain organization and security.\r\n\r\nAs the |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h grows, additional storage tabs can be purchased to expand the |Hkeyword:118|hGuild|h |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h. This extra space helps support group activities like raiding, crafting, and other events, by providing plenty of room for important items."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r版本是为|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r成员提供的巨大共享存储空间。它让玩家可以在自己的社群内保存和共享物品、材料和金币，便于集体管理资源。\r\n\r\n你可以在主要城市中的特殊 NPC 处使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r版本。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r领袖控制权限，决定哪些成员可以存入或取出物品与资金，以维持秩序与安全。\r\n\r\n随着|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r发展壮大，可以购买额外的存储标签页来扩充|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:118|h公会|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r。这些额外空间有助于支持团队副本、制造和其他集体活动，为重要物品提供充足的空间。"
T["The |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Season is a defined competitive period during which players participate in rated |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h matches to climb the |Hkeyword:16|hArena Rating|h ladder. Each season offers a fresh opportunity to compete for exclusive seasonal rewards.\r\n\r\nWith the start of every season, a new tier of PvP equipment becomes available for purchase from the |Hkeyword:135|hPvP Quartermaster|h, using |Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h. While some of this gear is accessible to all players, the most powerful equipment requires you to achieve a specific |Hkeyword:16|hArena Rating|h before they can be unlocked for purchase.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the season, ratings reset, rankings are tallied, and top-performing players receive special end-of-season rewards. Once a new season begins, all players start fresh, ready to compete again in a new cycle of progression and |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h.\r\n\r\nYou can view the current, previous, and upcoming seasons at:\r\n\r\nhttps://ascension.gg/en/timeline"]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r赛季是一段明确的竞技周期，在此期间玩家参与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r排名赛，以提升|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|h竞技场分数|h|r排名。每个赛季都提供争夺赛季专属奖励的新机会。\r\n\r\n每个赛季开始时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:135|hPvP 军需官|h|r处都会提供新一档的 PvP 装备，使用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r购买。虽然其中部分装备对所有玩家开放，但最强大的装备需要达到特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:16|h竞技场分数|h|r才能解锁购买。\r\n\r\n赛季结束时，分数会被重置，排名会被计算，表现最好的玩家将获得赛季结束专属奖励。新赛季开始后，所有玩家都从零开始，准备在新的成长与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r周期中再次竞争。\r\n\r\n你可以在以下地址查看当前、往期和未来的赛季：\r\n\r\nhttps://ascension.gg/en/timeline"
T["The |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h sync is a powerful item that keeps your cosmetic collection unified across all live Ascension realms (excluding PTR servers). It ensures that any |Hkeyword:8|hRealm-Bound|h |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, |Hkeyword:74|hCompanions|h, appearances, toys, |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, or non-consumable |Hkeyword:90|hDonation Items|h you've unlocked on one realm are available on other servers.\r\n\r\nEach time you log in, the |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h sync automatically updates your collection, merging cosmetic data between realms.\r\n\r\nYou can obtain the |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h sync from |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h as well as the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h with in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, or you can purchase it from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h with |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r同步是一件强大的物品，能让你的外观收藏在飞升所有在线服务器（PTR 服务器除外）之间保持统一。它确保你在一个服务器上解锁的任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:74|h伙伴|h|r、外观、玩具、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h遗物|h|r或非消耗性|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:90|h捐赠物品|h|r（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:8|h服务器绑定|h|r）都能在其他服务器上使用。\r\n\r\n每次你登录时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r同步都会自动更新你的收藏，在服务器之间合并外观数据。\r\n\r\n你可以从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r处以及在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r同步，也可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["The |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h Finder is a convenient tool that quickly connects you with other players to run dungeons together. To use it, open the Dungeons and Raids menu (Hotkey i), select your preferred role (|Hkeyword:237|hTank|h, |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h, or |Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h) and choose whether to queue for a specific |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h or a random |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h (often called Random |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h Finder or RDF).\r\n\r\nOnce the system finds a group, you’ll be instantly teleported to the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h, where you can earn |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, gear, and complete quests. After finishing your run, simply right-click the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h finder icon on your minimap and select “Leave |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h” to return to the open world.\r\n\r\nChoosing to run random dungeons or filling a role that’s in high demand often grants bonus loot and rewards, making the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h Finder one of the fastest and most popular ways to level up and prepare for endgame content."]="|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器是一个便捷工具，能让你快速与其他玩家组队一起打地下城。要使用它，请打开地下城与团队副本菜单（快捷键 I），选择你偏好的职责（|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r或|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r），然后选择是要排队进入特定的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r还是随机的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r（通常称为随机|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器或 RDF）。\r\n\r\n一旦系统找到队伍，你会被立即传送到|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，在那里你可以获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r、装备并完成任务。结束行程后，只需右键点击小地图上的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器图标，选择「离开|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r」即可返回开放世界。\r\n\r\n选择随机地下城或担任紧缺职责通常会给予额外战利品和奖励，这使|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r查找器成为升级和为终局内容做准备最快、最受欢迎的方式之一。"
T["These caches are reward chests earned by completing the |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quest. Designed as a catch-up mechanic, these caches are ideal for helping players quickly gear up for current content, especially if you're returning to the game or leveling a fresh character.\r\n\r\nEach cache has a high chance to contain gear upgrades, from |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h gear to epic |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h loot from all previously released content, scaling up to the most recently released |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h. If you receive a cache from a daily quest requiring PvP activities, the gear from your cache will be |Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h.\r\n\r\nThese chests offer a reliable alternative to repetitive farming, giving you access to relevant power gains even if you're behind the current progression curve. They're especially helpful for preparing alts or off-specs for group content."]="这些宝箱是完成|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r每日任务后获得的奖励箱。作为追赶机制，这些宝箱非常适合帮助玩家快速装备起来以应对当前内容，尤其适合回归游戏或正在练新角色的玩家。\r\n\r\n每个宝箱都有很高几率包含装备提升，从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r装备到此前发布的所有内容中的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r史诗战利品，并随最新|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r而提升。如果你从需要 PvP 活动的每日任务中获得宝箱，其中的装备将是|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r的。\r\n\r\n这些宝箱为重复刷本提供了可靠替代方案，即使你的进度落后于当前曲线，也能获得有意义的实力提升。它们对于为团队内容准备副角色或备用专精尤其有用。"
T["Thicket Sweeper"]="|cffe6cc80灌木清扫者|r"
T["This action will DELETE Hand of Fate items from your inventory and bank. Are you sure you want to delete those items?"]="此操作 |cffFF0000将删除|r 你背包和银行中的命运之手物品。你确定要删除这些物品吗？"
T["This action will DELETE Hand of Fate items from your inventory and bank.|nHands of Fate destroyed this way will not count towards your buyback next prestige.|nAre you sure you want to delete those items? "]="此操作 |cffFF0000将删除|r 你背包和银行中的命运之手物品。|n以这种方式销毁的命运之手 |cffff0000不会|r 计入你下次威望重置的回购奖励。|n你确定要删除这些物品吗？"
T["This action will set you BACK TO LEVEL 1.\nAre you sure you want to activate Prestige Mode?"]="此操作会将你 |cffFF0000重置回 1 级|r。\n你确定要激活威望模式吗？"
T["This action will set you BACK TO LEVEL 1.|nAre you sure you want to activate Prestige Mode?"]="此操作会将你 |cffFF0000重置回 1 级|r。|n你确定要激活威望模式吗？"
T["This challenge has a limited number of deaths.\nYou will fail this challenge if you die during this challenge!."]="此挑战有死亡次数限制。\n！|cffff0000如果你在挑战中死亡，挑战就会失败|r！"
T["This is your Mystic Enchanting Experience. Reforging items at the altar increases this experience.\nEvery time you level up, you gain 1 Mystic Extract. These extracts are used to save your favorite enchants to your collection for later use."]="这是你的神秘附魔经验。|cffFFFFFF在祭坛重铸物品会增加此经验。|r\n每次升级你都会获得 1 个神秘提取物。这些提取物用于将你喜爱的附魔保存到收藏中，以便日后使用。"
T["This is your final starting ability. You may redraft until level 10.\nYour next Draft unlocks at level 10.\nYour final starting ability will always contain Core Damaging Abilities if you have not yet learned one!"]="这是你的终极初始技能。在 10 级之前你都可以进行新的抽取。\n你的下一次抽取将在 |cffFFFFFF10 级|r 解锁。\n如果你还没有学习任何技能，你的终极初始技能将始终包含基础伤害技能！"
T["This item is not in your bags!"]="|cffFF0000此物品不在你的背包中！|r"
T["This will disable spell visuals from other players.|nYour own spell visuals will still be visible to you and other players.|nRequires a relog to take effect"]="这会关闭其他玩家的法术视觉效果。|n你自己的法术视觉效果对你和其他玩家仍然可见。|n|cffff0000需要重新进入游戏才能生效|r"
T["This will show the cost of Reforging an enchant on the current item"]="这会显示为当前物品 |cff71d5ff重铸|r 一个附魔的花费"
T["Those are your bags. You can have up to 4 bags equipped at once!"]="那些是你的背包。|cffFFFF00你最多可以同时装备 4 个背包|r！"
T["Thunder Clap"]="|cffffffff雷霆|r"
T["Tiger's Fury\nLevel 24"]="猛虎之怒\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a24|r"
T["Tiraxis is an NPC located near the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h, serving as the host of several specialty shops. \r\n\r\nAmong these is the highly sought-after |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h, offering a wide selection of unique and valuable items. Tiraxis also sells essential goods such as |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, |Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h for quick teleportation, |Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h that grant powerful realm-wide buffs, keeper scrolls to aid your professions and leveling journey, and the Ethereal Box of Wares containing retired seasonal items and random miscellaneous goods from the |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h. \r\n\r\nAll purchases from Tiraxis require |Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h which can be bought from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or through the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="Tiraxis 是一位 NPC，位于你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r附近，担任多家专门商店的主人。\r\n\r\n其中包括备受追捧的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r，提供大量独特而珍贵的物品。Tiraxis 还出售一些必需品，例如|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h遗物|h|r、用于快速传送的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h撤离石|h|r、为整个服务器提供强力增益的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r、帮助你提升专业和升级进度的守护者卷轴，以及包含已下架赛季物品和其他各种|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h虚灵集市|h|r商品的虚灵货箱。 \r\n\r\n在 Tiraxis 处购物都需要|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r，可以在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）购买。"
T["Titan Scrolls are powerful consumable items that provide realm-wide buffs, benefiting every player in the open world, except for those in starter zones. Each type of scroll can stack up to 5 times, and all five different scrolls can be active simultaneously, combining their effects for maximum benefit.\r\n\r\nThe five Titan Scrolls and their effects are:\r\n\r\nNorgannon: Increases damage dealt to enemies and boosts |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h gained from combat.\r\nEonar: Can create a ring of flowers upon defeating an enemy, restoring health and mana.\r\nAggramar: Increases damage dealt to demons.\r\nKhaz’goroth: Boosts |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h gained from a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h.\r\nGolganneth: Enhances swim speed and grants underwater breathing.\r\n\r\nTitan Scrolls can be discovered as drops throughout the world, purchased from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h or the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h using in-game |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, or bought from the |Hkeyword:31|hAscension Store|h for |Hkeyword:40|hDonation Points|h (DP)."]="泰坦卷轴是强力的消耗品，能为整个服务器提供增益，惠及开放世界中的所有玩家，但起始区域的玩家除外。每种卷轴最多可叠加 5 次，五种不同的卷轴可以同时生效，叠加其效果以获得最大收益。\r\n\r\n五种泰坦卷轴及其效果如下：\r\n\r\n诺甘农：提高对敌人造成的伤害，并增强战斗中获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r。\r\n艾欧娜尔：击败敌人时可以创造一个花之圆环，恢复生命值和法力。\r\n阿格拉玛：提高对恶魔造成的伤害。\r\n卡兹格罗斯：增强从|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r中获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r。\r\n戈甘尼斯：提高游泳速度并赋予水下呼吸能力。\r\n\r\n泰坦卷轴可以在世界各地作为战利品找到，向|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r用游戏内|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r购买，或在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:31|h飞升商店|h|r用|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:40|h捐赠点数|h|r（DP）获得。"
