T["To get started, you should begin a Quest.|n|nThere's a quest giver right in front of you. Tutorial tips will help you along the way.|n|nIf you still have questions, we have a wiki on our site, where you can learn more about Ascension!"]="首先，你应该开始一个 |cffffd200任务|r。|n|n你的正前方就有一位任务给予者。教程提示会在途中帮助你。|n|n如果你还有疑问，我们的网站上有一个 wiki，你可以在那里了解更多关于 Ascension 的内容！"
