T["Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to 20 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  \r\n\r\nAny damage will transform the target back into its normal form.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="将敌人变成一只绵羊，迫使它游荡最多 20 秒。游荡期间，绵羊无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。  \r\n\r\n任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to 30 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  \r\n\r\nAny damage will transform the target back into its normal form.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="将敌人变成一只绵羊，迫使它游荡最多 30 秒。游荡期间，绵羊无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。  \r\n\r\n任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to 40 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  \r\n\r\nAny damage will transform the target back into its normal form.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="将敌人变成一只绵羊，迫使它游荡最多 40 秒。游荡期间，绵羊无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。  \r\n\r\n任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to 50 sec. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  \r\n\r\nAny damage will transform the target back into its normal form.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="将敌人变成一只绵羊，迫使它游荡最多 50 秒。游荡期间，绵羊无法攻击或施法，但会极快地恢复生命。  \r\n\r\n任何伤害都会使目标恢复原形。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Transmogrification (commonly called 'transmog' or 'mog') is a cosmetic system that allows you to change the appearance of your equipped gear using appearances you’ve collected in your |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h (Hotkey N -> |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h Tab).\r\n\r\nThis feature lets you customize your character’s look without affecting the gear’s stats or performance.\r\n\r\nWhen you transmog an item, only its visual appearance changes, its stats, item level, and effects remain exactly the same. This means you can maintain your optimal gear setup while expressing your personal style or recreating iconic looks from across the game.\r\n\r\nTo unlock appearances for your |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h, simply obtain the items themselves (whether through quest rewards, drops, crafting, or purchases) and they will automatically be added to your collection when you equip them."]="幻化（通常称为「transmog」或「mog」）是一套外观系统，让你使用在|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r（快捷键 N → |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r标签页）中收集的外观来改变已装备物品的外形。\r\n\r\n该功能让你在个性化角色外观的同时，不影响装备的属性和性能。\r\n\r\n当你幻化一件物品时，改变的只是它的视觉外观；其属性、物品等级和效果保持完全一致。这意味着你可以在保持最优装备配置的同时，表达个人风格或重现游戏中的经典造型。\r\n\r\n要为你的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r解锁外观，只需获得物品本身（无论是通过任务奖励、战利品、制造还是购买），装备它们时就会自动加入你的收藏。"
