T["Travel Form\nLevel 16"]="旅行形态\n|cffffffff等级|r |cffff1a1a16|r"
T["Travel across Azeroth in this one life trial, and slay 10 notorious beasts. Track down, stalk, and slay each beast before reaching their level, and prove that you're truly a Big Game Hunter. \n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1225|hYou must kill [Ol' Sooty] before reaching level 20. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11921|hYou must kill [Besseleth] before reaching level 21. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5185|hYou must kill [Hammerhead Shark] before reaching level 32. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1559|hYou must kill [King Mukla] before reaching level 42. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5833|hYou must kill [Margol the Rager] before reaching level 43. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7977|hYou must kill [Gammerita] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6498|hYou must kill [Devilsaur] before reaching level 55. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10806|hYou must kill [Ursius] before reaching level 56. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:15196|hYou must kill [Deathclasp] before reaching level 59. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4374|hYou must kill [Strashaz Hydra] before reaching level 60. (Click Here!)  |h"]="在这场只能死一次的试炼中游历艾泽拉斯，击杀 10 只著名的野兽。追踪、潜近并在达到各自等级之前击杀每一只野兽，证明你是真正的大猎物猎人。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1225|h你必须在达到 20 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[老烟尘]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:11921|h你必须在达到 21 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[贝瑟莱斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5185|h你必须在达到 32 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[锤头鲨]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1559|h你必须在达到 42 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[穆克拉国王]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5833|h你必须在达到 43 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[暴怒的玛戈尔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7977|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[加梅里塔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6498|h你必须在达到 55 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[魔暴龙]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10806|h你必须在达到 56 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[乌尔休斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:15196|h你必须在达到 59 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[死亡之爪]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4374|h你必须在达到 60 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[斯特拉沙兹九头蛇]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
