T["Trials (J)"]="试炼 |cffffd100(J)|r"
T["Trials are special self-imposed challenges that add unique twists to the leveling journey. They reward creativity, skill, and dedication by offering exclusive rewards, cosmetics, and achievements for completing the game under specific conditions.\r\n\r\nYou can view active trials at any time through the trials menu (Hotkey J), but trials can only be initiated or deactivated by speaking with |Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h, found in any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h or starter zone. To begin a trial, your character must be level 1, either as a brand-new character or immediately after prestiging.\r\n\r\nEach trial imposes different restrictions or gameplay modifiers (such as permadeath, changing the ways you obtain |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, or adding in completely new challenges) that make the leveling process more difficult and rewarding."]="试炼是自我施加的特殊挑战，为升级旅程增添独特的变数。它们通过提供专属奖励、外观和成就来奖励创造力、技巧与投入，条件是你在特定规则下完成游戏。\r\n\r\n你可以随时通过试炼菜单（快捷键 J）查看进行中的试炼，但试炼只能通过与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:226|hStony Tark|h|r交谈来开始或关闭，他位于任何|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r或起始区域。要开始一个试炼，你的角色必须处于 1 级，无论是全新角色还是刚进行过威望重置。\r\n\r\n每个试炼都会施加不同的限制或游戏修正（例如永久死亡、改变你获得|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验|h|r的方式，或加入全新的挑战），让升级过程更具难度也更有成就感。"
