T["Unlocks at level:\n%i+"]="解锁等级：\n|cffFFFFFF%i+"
T["Upon entering the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h, every player is granted an Endless |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Potion, a reusable consumable with a short cooldown that restores your health, energy, mana, and rage. This versatile potion is placed directly into your inventory and is designed to help you sustain yourself during the relentless encounters inside the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h.\r\n\r\nThe potion’s effectiveness scales with group size, providing the most healing when you’re running solo, and slightly less when in larger parties. This scaling ensures it remains balanced and useful whether you’re tackling the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h alone or with a full |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h group.\r\n\r\nBecause the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h can be punishing, keeping this potion handy on your action bar is essential for survival, allowing you to quickly recover and push deeper into the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h’s challenges."]="进入|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r时，所有玩家都会获得一瓶无尽|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r药水，这是一种可重复使用、冷却时间很短的消耗品，能恢复你的生命值、能量、法力和怒气。这瓶万用药水会直接放入你的背包，旨在帮助你挺过|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r中无情的战斗。\r\n\r\n药水的效果会随队伍规模变化，独自游戏时提供的治疗量最高，队伍越大则略低。这种调整确保它保持平衡且实用，无论你是独自面对|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r，还是与完整的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r队伍一起。\r\n\r\n由于|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r可能异常残酷，把这瓶药水放在动作条上随时可用是生存的关键，让你能迅速恢复并更深入地挑战|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r。"
