T["Use the Find a Mentor System to locate another player who has flagged themselves as wanting to assist with learning Ascension. You may also use the Newcomers chat to ask questions about Ascension! Mentors are always available to help in the Newcomers chat!\n\nRight-Click on a player to send them a whisper.\n\n"]="使用「寻找导师」系统来找到另一位已标记为愿意帮助学习飞升的玩家。你也可以在 Newcomers 频道中提出关于飞升的问题！导师们随时都在 Newcomers 频道中提供帮助！\n\n|cffffd100右键点击一名玩家即可向其发送密语。|r\n\n"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\nAccursed:\nIncreases your chance to miss by 5%.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with 0 souls.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."]="使用此物品来尝试此挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00被诅咒：|r\n使你的攻击未命中几率提高 |cffFF99005%|r。\n完成此挑战将奖励你 |cffFF99000|r 个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300这是专属挑战；同时只能有一个专属挑战处于激活状态。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\nAnimus:\nEnemies slain by you have a 10% chance to reanimate\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with 0 souls.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."]="使用此物品来尝试此挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00灵魂：|r\n为你而死的敌人有 |cffFF990010%|r 的几率重新复活。\n完成此挑战将奖励你 |cffFF99000|r 个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300这是专属挑战；同时只能有一个专属挑战处于激活状态。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\nBewitched:\nMagic damage taken increased by 100%.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with 0 souls.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."]="使用此物品来尝试此挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00被蛊惑：|r\n受到的魔法伤害提高 |cffFF9900100%|r。\n完成此挑战将奖励你 |cffFF99000|r 个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300这是专属挑战；同时只能有一个专属挑战处于激活状态。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\nBile:\nPools of Toxic Bile will spawn at your feet every 300 seconds.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with 0 souls.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."]="使用此物品来尝试此挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00胆汁：|r\n每 |cffFF9900300 秒|r 你脚下会出现剧毒胆汁池。\n完成此挑战将奖励你 |cffFF99000|r 个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300这是专属挑战；同时只能有一个专属挑战处于激活状态。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\nCallowness:\nReduces all experience gained by 10%.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with 0 souls.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."]="使用此物品来尝试此挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00纯真：|r\n获得的全部经验降低 |cffFF990010%|r。\n完成此挑战将奖励你 |cffFF99000|r 个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300这是专属挑战；同时只能有一个专属挑战处于激活状态。|r"
T["Use this item to attempt this challenge.\n\nContender:\nYou can only get kill credit and experience while at a level disadvantage.\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with 0 souls.\n\nAll player kills must be acquired before reaching max level.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."]="使用此物品来尝试此挑战。\n\n|cFFFFCC00竞争者：|r\n只有在等级处于劣势时，你才能获得击杀和经验的奖励。\n完成此挑战将奖励你 |cffFF99000|r 个灵魂。\n\n|cFFCC3300挑战只能在 20 级时接受。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300这是专属挑战；同时只能有一个专属挑战处于激活状态。|r\n\n|cFFCC3300一旦你接受此挑战，你就会被绑定在其中，直到死亡。|r"
