T["Vendors are NPCs who sell a wide variety of useful items such as weapons, |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h, consumables, and crafting materials. They also buy items from you, helping you manage your inventory by turning unwanted loot into gold. If you accidentally sell something important, vendors offer a buyback tab that lets you repurchase recently sold items. \r\n\r\nVendors come in different types such as general goods vendors, trade suppliers, reagents vendors, or weapon and |Hkeyword:22|hArmor|h merchants. Some of these NPCs provide repair services to restore your equipment’s |Hkeyword:89|hDurability|h. \r\n\r\nVendors can be found in towns, cities, and quest hubs or just walking down the road all throughout the open world. If you need a specific type of vendor, the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h offers a variety of search options to highlight the NPC you need."]="商人是出售各种实用物品的 NPC，例如武器、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r、消耗品和制造材料。他们也会收购你的物品，帮助你把不需要的战利品换成金币，从而管理背包。如果你不小心卖掉了重要物品，商人提供回购标签页，让你可以买回最近出售的物品。 \r\n\r\n商人有不同类型，例如杂货商、贸易供应商、材料商人或武器与|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:22|h护甲|h|r商人。其中一些 NPC 还提供修理服务，用来恢复你装备的|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|h耐久度|h|r。 \r\n\r\n商人分布在村镇、城市和任务中心，也可能只是在开放世界的道路上行走。如果你需要特定类型的商人，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r提供多种搜索选项来高亮你需要的 NPC。"
T["Venture into the wilds of Azeroth and walk the path of a Trollbane! Prove your strength by defeating 6 troll leaders from the various troll tribes, scattered across the continents. \n\nFrom the dense jungles of Stranglethorn Vale, to the sandy dunes of Tanaris, your journey will take you through diverse terrains where you'll face off against many cunning trolls and their powerful leaders. \n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254168|hYou must kill [Vazul] before reaching level 40. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1060|hYou must kill [Mogh the Undying] before reaching level 44. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254170|hYou must kill [Zazera] before reaching level 45. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5401|hYou must kill [Kazkaz the Unholy] before reaching level 48. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10802|hYou must kill [Hitah'ya the Keeper] before reaching level 51. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254169|hYou must kill [Yahola] before reaching level 59. (Click Here!)  |h"]="深入艾泽拉斯的荒野，走上巨魔克星之路！击败各大陆上不同巨魔部族的 6 位巨魔领袖，展现你的力量。\n\n从荆棘谷茂密的丛林到塔纳利斯的沙丘，你的旅程将穿越各种地形，在那里你将面对许多狡猾的巨魔及其强大的领袖。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254168|h你必须在达到 40 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[瓦祖尔]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1060|h你必须在达到 44 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[不朽者莫格]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254170|h你必须在达到 45 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[扎泽拉]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5401|h你必须在达到 48 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[邪恶的卡兹卡兹]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10802|h你必须在达到 51 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[守护者希塔亚]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254169|h你必须在达到 59 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[亚霍拉]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
