T["Welcome! Ascension is a progressive classless game. Over the course of your progression, you'll receive important tutorials that will help you understand how Ascension works. Make sure to read your tutorials! No matter how you decide to play, you can expect to be able to fully live out your fantasy of a hero truly unique to you!"]="|cffFFFFFF欢迎！|rAscension|cffFFFFFF 是一款 |r无职业|cffFFFFFF 的渐进式游戏。在你的成长过程中，你会收到重要的教程，帮助你理解飞升的运作方式。|r请务必阅读你的教程！|cffFFFFFF 无论你决定怎么玩，都能充分实现一个真正属于你自己的英雄幻想！|r"
