T["When activated, your next direct damage Rogue ability has 100% increased critical strike chance, 20% increased damage  and is usable from 10 yards. \r\n\r\nWhen consumed you will gain 4% melee and ranged critical strike chance for 15 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="激活时，你下一次潜行者直接伤害技能获得 100% 爆击几率加成、伤害提高 20%，并可从 10 米外使用。\r\n\r\n消耗时，你将获得 4% 的近战和远程爆击几率，持续 15 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When active, 20% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Summoned or Enslaved Demon. That damage cannot be prevented. Lasts as long as the demon is active, controlled and you are within 30 yards of it.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="激活时，施法者受到的所有伤害中有 20% 由你召唤或奴役的恶魔承受。该伤害无法被减免。只要恶魔处于激活、受控状态且你与它相距不到 30 码，效果就会持续。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 2%.\r\n\r\nYou have a 33% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="当生命值低于 35% 时，你受到的所有伤害降低 2%。\r\n\r\n你有 33% 的几率完全吸收一次本会杀死你的攻击，最多不超过你总生命值的 15%，并为你恢复最多 20% 最大生命值（治疗量基于防御）。此外，在接下来的 3 秒内你受到的治疗效果提高 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 4%.\r\n\r\nYou have a 66% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="当生命值低于 35% 时，你受到的所有伤害降低 4%。\r\n\r\n你有 66% 的几率完全吸收一次本会杀死你的攻击，最多不超过你总生命值的 15%，并为你恢复最多 20% 最大生命值（治疗量基于防御）。此外，在接下来的 3 秒内你受到的治疗效果提高 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When below 35% health all damage taken is reduced by 6%.\r\n\r\nYou have a 100% chance to fully absorb an attack which would otherwise kill you, up to a maximum of 15% of your total health and heal you by up to 20% of your maximum health (amount healed based on defense). You also take 20% increased healing for the next 3 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="当生命值低于 35% 时，你受到的所有伤害降低 6%。\r\n\r\n你有 100% 的几率完全吸收一次本会杀死你的攻击，最多不超过你总生命值的 15%，并为你恢复最多 20% 最大生命值（治疗量基于防御）。此外，在接下来的 3 秒内你受到的治疗效果提高 20%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["When you gain mana from Drain Mana or Life Tap spells, your tamed pet gains 100% of the mana you gain.\r\n\r\nYour tamed pet regenerates 3% of its missing mana every 5 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="当你通过吸取法力或生命分流获得法力时，你的驯服宠物会获得你所获法力的 100%。\r\n\r\n你的驯服宠物每 5 秒恢复其缺失法力的 3%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Whenever one of your attacks is dodged or blocked you have a 50% chance to gain 2% critical strike chance for 8 sec, stacks up to 3 times. \r\n\r\nReduces the duration of all Disarm effects used against you by 15%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="每当你的一次攻击被躲闪或格挡时，你有 50% 的几率获得 2% 的爆击几率，持续 8 秒，最多可叠加 3 次。 \r\n\r\n使你受到的所有缴械效果持续时间缩短 15%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Whenever one of your attacks is dodged or blocked you have a 50% chance to gain 2% critical strike chance for 8 sec, stacks up to 3 times. \r\n\r\nReduces the duration of all Disarm effects used against you by 30%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="每当你的一次攻击被躲闪或格挡时，你有 50% 的几率获得 2% 的爆击几率，持续 8 秒，最多可叠加 3 次。 \r\n\r\n使你受到的所有缴械效果持续时间缩短 30%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["While in Arena or Battleground, increases your maximum health by 400."]="|cFFAAAAAA当你在竞技场或战场中时，你的最大生命值提高 400。|r"
T["While in Arena or Battleground, increases your maximum health by 500.\r\n\r\n2"]="|cFFAAAAAA当你在竞技场或战场中时，你的最大生命值提高 500。|r\r\n\r\n2"
T["While in Bear Form or Dire Bear Form, your Enrage ability increases physical damage done by 5%.\n\nWhile in Cat Form, casting Tiger's Fury restores 20 energy. \r\n\r\nReduces the mana cost of Bear Form, Cat Form, and Dire Bear Form by 20%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: The global cooldown of Cat Form and Bear Form is reduced by 0.5 sec."]="当你处于熊形态或狂野熊形态时，你的技能「狂暴」使造成的物理伤害提高 5%。\n\n当你处于猎豹形态时，施放猛虎之怒会恢复 20 点能量。 \r\n\r\n使熊形态、猎豹形态和狂野熊形态的法力消耗降低 20%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：猎豹形态和熊形态的公共冷却时间缩短 0.5 秒。|r"
T["While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 1% of total health every 10 sec.\r\n\r\nIncreases healing done to you and your pet by 5%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="当你的宠物处于激活状态时，你和你的宠物每 10 秒恢复总生命值的 1%。\r\n\r\n使你和你宠物受到的治疗效果提高 5%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 2% of total health every 10 sec.\r\n\r\nIncreases healing done to you and your pet by 10%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="当你的宠物处于激活状态时，你和你的宠物每 10 秒恢复总生命值的 2%。\r\n\r\n使你和你宠物受到的治疗效果提高 10%。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
