T["You can move spells and abilities to your action bar by clicking the Spellbook & Abilities Button at the bottom center of the screen (Hotkey - P) and then dragging the ability icon to your action bar.|n|nYou can access your Character Upgrades by pressing N and selecting Character Advancement."]="你可以点击屏幕下方中央的 |cffffd200法术与技能书按钮|r（快捷键 - P），然后将技能图标拖拽到动作条上，从而把法术和技能放到动作条中。|n你可以按 N 并选择角色进阶来访问你的角色强化。"
T["You can recover almost any kind of lost item at Ameer Greatluck. He can be found in Stormwind or Orgrimmar. Keep in mind, items recovered this way will have a small fee per item recovered!"]="你几乎可以用 |cffffd100Ameer Greatluck|r 找回任何类型的丢失物品。你可以在暴风城或奥格瑞玛找到他。请注意，以这种方式找回的物品每件都会收取少量手续费！"
