T["You have failed your trial.\nYou may revive using your Iron Soul to continue your adventure.\n\nYou only get 1 Iron Soul for your entire account!\n\nYou will no longer be participating in your trial."]="你未能通过试炼。\n你可以使用铁魂复活以继续你的冒险。\n\n|cffffd100整个账号只能获得 1 个铁魂！|r\n\n你将不再参与你的试炼。"
T["You have joined a raid group. (While in a raid, you cannot earn credit towards most non-raid quests.)"]="你已加入一个团队副本队伍。|cffff2020（当你身处团队副本队伍时，大多数非团队任务都无法获得进度。|r"
T["You have joined a raid group: a group with an increased limit of 40 members, though usually between 10 and 25. Raid groups are necessary to enter the most challenging dungeons or to defeat the most powerful enemies, typically at high level.|n|nWhile in a raid group, you will not earn credit towards most quests. To leave a raid group, Right Click on your character portrait and select Leave party."]="你已加入一个团队副本队伍：这是一个成员上限提高到 40 人的队伍，虽然通常为 10 到 25 人。要进入最具挑战性的地下城或击败最强大的敌人，团队副本队伍是必需的，通常针对高等级内容。|n|n|cffff2020当你身处团队副本队伍时，大多数任务都无法获得进度。要离开团队副本队伍，请右键点击你的角色头像并选择离开团队。|r"
T["You have not collected one or more of the enchants you are about to overwrite!\nAre you sure you want to activate these Enchants?\n"]="|cffff0000你尚未收集到一件或多件你即将覆盖的附魔！|r\n你确定要激活这些附魔吗？\n"
T["You have successfuly unlocked Vanity Item!"]="|cffFFFFFF你已成功解锁|r 外观物品|cffFFFFFF！|r"
T["You have unspent [Ability Essence].|nClick here to learn a new Spell!"]="你有未使用的 |cffffd100[技能精华]|r。|n点击此处学习一个新法术。"
T["You have unspent [Talent Essence].|nClick here to learn a new Talent!"]="你有未使用的 |cffffd100[天赋精华]|r。|n点击此处学习一个新天赋！"
T["You just rolled your Starter Skill Card. You can open Skill Cards to remove that skill card and pick a different one!"]="你刚刚获得了你的初始 |cffFFFF00技能卡|r。你可以打开技能卡来移除那张技能卡并选择另一张！|r"
T["You looted a Epic [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\nEpic [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are the second strongest part of a [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant] set.\n\nEpic [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] can modify spells, talents, provide large damage increase, or other interesting changes to your build's rotation!\n\nYou may [KEYWORD:Only have 3] different Epic [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], and [KEYWORD:Only 1] of the same kind."]="你获得了一个 |cffa335ee史诗|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cffa335ee史诗|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]是 [FEATURE:神秘附魔] 套装中第二强的部件。\n\n|cffa335ee史诗|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]可以修改法术、天赋，提供大幅伤害提升，或为你的构筑循环带来其他有趣的变化！\n\n你可以同时拥有 [KEYWORD:3 个]不同的 |cffa335ee史诗|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]，且同类型[KEYWORD:只能有 1 个]。"
T["You looted a Legendary [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\nLegendary [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are the strongest component in a [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant] set, and provide [KEYWORD:Build Defining] changes to your spells and rotation!\n\nLegendary [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] Change the behaviour of your spells, talents, and provide the [KEYWORD:Largest damage increase] of any [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants]\n\nYou may [KEYWORD:Only have 1] Legendary [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants]"]="你获得了一个 |cffff8000传说|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cffff8000传说|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]是 [FEATURE:神秘附魔] 套装中最强的部件，会为你的法术和循环带来 [KEYWORD:构筑决定性]的变化！\n\n|cffff8000传说|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]会改变你法术和天赋的行为，并提供所有 [FEATURE:神秘附魔] 中 [KEYWORD:最高的伤害提升]\n\n你可以[KEYWORD:只能拥有 1 个] |cffff8000传说|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]"
T["You looted a Rare [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\nRare [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] will make up the the largest part of a full [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant] set.\n\nThey are commonly used by players to enhance their existing spells and talents. You may have an [KEYWORD:Unlimited] amount of different Rare [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], but [KEYWORD:Only 3] of the same kind."]="你获得了一个 |cff0070dd精良|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cff0070dd精良|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]会构成完整 [FEATURE:神秘附魔] 套装的大部分。\n\n玩家通常用它们来强化现有的法术和天赋。你可以拥有[KEYWORD:不限数量]的不同 |cff0070dd精良|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]，但同类型[KEYWORD:只能有 3 个]。"
T["You looted a Uncommon [FEATURE:Mystic Enchant]!\n\nUncommon [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants] are the weakest in terms of power.\n\nThey are commonly used by players to complement their existing spells and [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], rather than creating a build focused on them. You may have an [KEYWORD:Unlimited] amount of different Uncommon [FEATURE:Mystic Enchants], but [KEYWORD:Only 3] of the same kind."]="你获得了一个 |cff1eff00优秀|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]！\n\n|cff1eff00优秀|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]在强度上是最弱的。\n\n玩家通常用它们来补充现有的法术和 [FEATURE:神秘附魔]，而不是围绕它们构建构筑。你可以拥有[KEYWORD:不限数量]的不同 |cff1eff00优秀|r [FEATURE:神秘附魔]，但同类型[KEYWORD:只能有 3 个]。"
T["You must have %s PvE Power or higher"]="你必须拥有 |cffFFFFFF%s|r 或更高的 PvE 强度"
T["You obtained a new mount! Check Character Info (C)"]="你获得了新坐骑！请查看 |cffFFFF00角色信息|r |cffFFFF00(C)|r"
T["You obtained your first Mount! Click here or press (B) to open your bags"]="你获得了你的第一只坐骑！点击此处或按 |cffFFFF00(B)|r 打开你的 |cffFFFF00背包|r"
T["You received a free Bonus Card Swap!\nThese have a chance to occur after every Hand of Fate.\nLearning more Uncommon, Rare, Epic or Legendary spells\nwill increase your chance to trigger a Card Swap of that quality!"]="你获得了一个 |cffFFFFFF免费卡牌重随！|r\n这些有几率在每次命运之手后出现。\n学习更多优秀、精良、史诗或传说法术\n|cffFFFFFF会提高你触发该品质卡牌重随的几率|r！"
T["You will need to use a |Hitem:97871:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:23|h[Craftsman's Codex]|h to learn an additional profession. You may get one from the Auction House or the shop at Ascension.gg/shop"]="你需要使用一个 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:97871:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:23|h[工匠法典]|h|r 来学习一项额外专业。你可以在拍卖行或 Ascension.gg/shop 商店获得一个。"
T["You will not receive a Build Master's Trophy if you reach max level using this build!"]="使用此构筑达到满级后，你将 |cffff0000不会|r 获得构筑大师奖杯！"
