T["You've Entered High-Risk: Tier 2"]="你已进入高风险：|cffFFFF00第 2 档|r"
T["You've Entered High-Risk: Tier 3"]="你已进入高风险：|cffFF0000第 3 档|r"
T["You've earned |n[Ability Essence]! by leveling up! Click here to learn a new ability!"]="你通过升级获得了 |n|cffFFFF00[技能精华]|r！点击此处学习一个新技能！"
T["You've gained experience! You'll level up when this bar is filled"]="你获得了 |cffFFFF00经验|r！当此条充满时你将 |cffFFFF00升级|r"
T["You've suddenly entered a terrible Nightmare: As the newest member of the D.E.H.T.A organization, you swear to protect animal wildlife at all costs. To prove your worth to the cause, you're tasked with slaying 5 Venture Company leaders. \n \nDue to your newly found D.E.H.T.A beliefs, you refuse to harm beasts or critters of any kind, and killing one will cause you to instantly lose your membership status. Furthermore, pets of any kind (even demons) would be considered cruel enslavement.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3051|hYou must kill [Supervisor Fizsprocket] before reaching level 13. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3471|hYou must kill [Tinkerer Sniggles] before reaching level 15. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9336|hYou must kill [Boss Copperplug] before reaching level 18. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7288|hYou must kill [Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix] before reaching level 22. (Click Here!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4202|hYou must kill [Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle] before reaching level 26. (Click Here!)  |h"]="你突然陷入了一场可怕的噩梦：作为 D.E.H.T.A 组织的最新成员，你发誓不惜一切代价保护野生动物。为向这一事业证明你的价值，你被委派消灭 5 位风险投资公司的领袖。\n \n由于你新近确立的 D.E.H.T.A 理念，你拒绝伤害任何类型的野兽或生物，杀死一只就会立刻让你失去成员资格。此外，任何类型的宠物（甚至恶魔）都会被视为残酷的奴役。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3051|h你必须在达到 13 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[工头菲兹斯普洛克]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3471|h你必须在达到 15 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[工匠斯尼格斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:9336|h你必须在达到 18 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[铜栓老大]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7288|h你必须在达到 22 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[总工头普兹克·加里维克斯]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4202|h你必须在达到 26 级之前击杀 |cffffff00[格伦佐·扳哨]|cffffffff。|r |cffffff00（点击这里！）|cffffffff |r|h"
T["Your Spirit is increased by 10% for 12 sec after you critically heal with Flash Heal, Greater Heal, or Binding Heal, or critically hit with Holy Fire or Smite. \r\n\r\nGreater Heal, Flash Heal, Binding Heal, and Circle of Healing have a 33% chance to extend the duration of your Renew on all nearby party and raid members by 3 sec, up to an additional 6 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="在使用快速治疗、强效治疗术或联结治疗造成爆击治疗，或用神圣之火或惩击造成爆击后的 12 秒 内，你的精神提高 10%。 \r\n\r\n强效治疗术、快速治疗、联结治疗和治疗之环有 33% 的几率将你的恢复在附近所有小队和团队成员身上的持续时间延长 3 秒，最多额外延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your Spirit is increased by 20% for 12 sec after you critically heal with Flash Heal, Greater Heal, or Binding Heal, or critically hit with Holy Fire or Smite. \r\n\r\nGreater Heal, Flash Heal, Binding Heal, and Circle of Healing have a 66% chance to extend the duration of your Renew on all nearby party and raid members by 3 sec, up to an additional 6 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="在使用快速治疗、强效治疗术或联结治疗造成爆击治疗，或用神圣之火或惩击造成爆击后的 12 秒 内，你的精神提高 20%。 \r\n\r\n强效治疗术、快速治疗、联结治疗和治疗之环有 66% 的几率将你的恢复在附近所有小队和团队成员身上的持续时间延长 3 秒，最多额外延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your Spirit is increased by 30% for 12 sec after you critically heal with Flash Heal, Greater Heal, or Binding Heal, or critically hit with Holy Fire or Smite. \r\n\r\nGreater Heal, Flash Heal, Binding Heal, and Circle of Healing have a 100% chance to extend the duration of your Renew on all nearby party and raid members by 3 sec, up to an additional 6 sec.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="在使用快速治疗、强效治疗术或联结治疗造成爆击治疗，或用神圣之火或惩击造成爆击后的 12 秒 内，你的精神提高 30%。 \r\n\r\n强效治疗术、快速治疗、联结治疗和治疗之环有 100% 的几率将你的恢复在附近所有小队和团队成员身上的持续时间延长 3 秒，最多额外延长 6 秒。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your bags are full! Click here or press (B) to open your bags"]="你的背包已满！点击此处或按 |cffFFFF00(B)|r 打开你的 |cffFFFF00背包|r"
T["Your critical strikes from Rogue abilities that add combo points have a 33% chance to add an additional combo point. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by Eviscerate, Rupture, Deadly Throw and Crimson Tempest by 4%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Consuming Cold Blood with a finishing move has a 20% chance per combo point to increase your movement speed by 70% for 4 sec."]="你潜行者增加连击点的技能造成爆击时，有 33% 的几率额外增加一个连击点。 \r\n\r\n使剔骨、割裂、致命投掷和猩红风暴造成的伤害提高 4%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：用终结技消耗冷血时，每个连击点有 20% 的几率使你的移动速度提高 70%，持续 4 秒。|r"
T["Your critical strikes from Rogue abilities that add combo points have a 66% chance to add an additional combo point. \r\n\r\nIncreases the damage done by Eviscerate, Rupture, Deadly Throw and Crimson Tempest by 7%.\n\nCapstone Bonus: Consuming Cold Blood with a finishing move has a 20% chance per combo point to increase your movement speed by 70% for 4 sec."]="你潜行者增加连击点的技能造成爆击时，有 66% 的几率额外增加一个连击点。 \r\n\r\n使剔骨、割裂、致命投掷和猩红风暴造成的伤害提高 7%。\n\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：用终结技消耗冷血时，每个连击点有 20% 的几率使你的移动速度提高 70%，持续 4 秒。|r"
T["Your items had been changed! Check Character Info (C)"]="你的物品已被更换！请查看 |cffFFFF00角色信息|r |cffFFFF00(C)|r"
T["Your ranged and melee critical strikes cause your tamed beast to generate 25 Focus.\r\n\r\nDominate undead, enslaved demon or tamed dragonkin generate 25 Energy.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的远程和近战爆击会使你驯服的野兽产生 25 点集中值。\r\n\r\n被支配的亡灵、被奴役的恶魔或被驯服的龙类会产生 25 点能量。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your ranged and melee critical strikes cause your tamed beast to generate 50 Focus.\r\n\r\nDominate undead, enslaved demon or tamed dragonkin generate 50 Energy.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的远程和近战爆击会使你驯服的野兽产生 50 点集中值。\r\n\r\n被支配的亡灵、被奴役的恶魔或被驯服的龙类会产生 50 点能量。\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Dealing direct critical damage with a spell while your mana is below 50% taps into raw power, restoring 1% of your total mana each second and increasing your magic damage by 4% and Arcane damage by another 2%. This effect lasts for 15 seconds and can only occur once every 30 seconds.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：当你的法力低于 50% 时用法术造成直接爆击伤害会引导纯粹之力，每秒恢复你总法力的 1%，并使你的法术伤害提高 4%、奥术伤害额外提高 2%。此效果持续 15 秒，每 30 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Increases your Fire and Shadow damage done by 2%. This effect is quadrupled against targets above 75% health.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：使你对敌人造成的火焰和暗影伤害提高 2%。对生命值高于 75% 的目标，此效果变为四倍。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: The final rank of this talent increases damage against frozen targets by 6%.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：此天赋的最终等级使你对被冻结目标造成的伤害提高 6%。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your Holy damaging spell critical strikes have a 50% chance to increase magic damage done by 5% for 6 seconds.\r\n\r\nThis effect can only occur once every 8 seconds.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的神圣伤害法术爆击有 50% 的几率使你造成的魔法伤害提高 5%，持续 6 秒。\r\n\r\n此效果每 8 秒只能触发一次。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your Nature damage is increased by 6% and other magic damage increased by 3% while Clearcasting from Elemental Focus is active.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：当元素专注的清晰施法效果激活时，你的自然伤害提高 6%，其他魔法伤害提高 3%。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 180% damage. \r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your Shadow and Holy periodic damage effects have a 30% chance to make the target vulnerable to your power, increasing their Magic damage taken from you by 4% for 4 seconds.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 180% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的暗影和神圣持续伤害效果有 30% 的几率使目标对你的力量变得脆弱，使其受到的你的魔法伤害提高 4%，持续 4 秒。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
T["Your spell critical strikes now deal 185% damage.\r\n\r\nCapstone Bonus: Your Shadow and Holy periodic damage effects have a 30% chance to make the target vulnerable to your power, increasing their Magic damage taken from you by 4% for 4 seconds.\n\nHold SHIFT for more information"]="你的法术爆击现在造成 185% 伤害。 \r\n\r\n|cFFAAAAAA巅峰加成：你的暗影和神圣持续伤害效果有 30% 的几率使目标对你的力量变得脆弱，使其受到的你的魔法伤害提高 4%，持续 4 秒。|r\n\n|cff00DDFF按住 SHIFT 查看更多信息|r"
