T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\InPersonInvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>An invasion is a periodic World Event that spawns throughout Azeroth and scales to how many players are near the zone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To find an invasion, you can look on your |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h or ask in World Chat if one is currently up.</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Worldmaplegioninvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>To complete an invasion, you must kill the Final Boss. Once entering an invasion, a percentage completion counter will appear. Once this counter reaches 100% the final boss will appear.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\InPersonInvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>入侵是一种周期性出现于艾泽拉斯各地的世界事件，并会根据区域附近的玩家数量进行缩放。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>要找到入侵，你可以查看你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r，或在世界频道中询问当前是否有正在进行的入侵。</p>\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Worldmaplegioninvasion:2:1}\r\n<p>要完成一次入侵，你必须击败最终首领。进入入侵后，会出现一个完成度百分比计数器。当该计数器达到 100% 时，最终首领就会出现。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Level70:2:1}\r\n<p>Continue your journey in Outlands and acquire enough |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h to reach level 70.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Find a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 70.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PathToAscension\\Level70:2:1}\r\n<p>继续你在外域的旅程，获取足够的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 以升到 70 级。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>随着你继续升级，你必须前往新的区域寻找更接近你等级的任务和生物，以继续获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会将视角拉远至总体的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r。将鼠标悬停在与你当前区域相邻的区域上。你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>找到一个与你等级相符的区域并前往那里，以发现新任务并继续你通往 70 级的旅程。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\101_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Level 60!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Continue traveling to new zones to find new quests and more challenging creatures to continue gaining |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h.<br/><br/>\r\nCheck the Path to Ascension menu often for new quests as you level up! Completing Paths to Ascension will grant you rewards as well as ensure you reach the heights of your power while exploring the world and gaining levels!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\101_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到 60 级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>继续前往新的区域，寻找新任务和更具挑战性的生物，以继续获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n升级时请经常查看飞升之路菜单中的新任务！完成飞升之路会给予你奖励，并确保你在探索世界和升级的过程中达到力量的巅峰。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Item Level Shows Your Gear Power!!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The first step to improving your power at end-game is to improve your gear. It's time to start replacing your leveling gear with max level gear!<br/><br/>\r\nMouse over any piece of gear to see the item level. This is a good general measurement of gear's power.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can view your Average Item Level in your character sheet. This is an approximation of how strong your gear is!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Upgrade Gear - Increase Your Item Level!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>There are many paths to upgrading your gear:<br/>\r\n•Complete Dungeons<br/>\r\n•Quest in Max Level Zones<br/>\r\n•Enter the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h<br/>\r\n•Complete |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">物品等级显示你装备的强度！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在满级内容中提升实力的第一步就是提升你的装备。是时候开始用满级装备替换你的升级装备了！<br/><br/>\r\n将鼠标悬停在任意一件装备上即可看到其物品等级。这是衡量装备强度的一个很好的总体标准。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在角色面板中查看你的平均物品等级。它近似反映了你装备的强度！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\10_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">升级装备——提高你的物品等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>提升装备的途径有很多：<br/>\r\n•完成地下城<br/>\r\n•在满级区域做任务<br/>\r\n•进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r<br/>\r\n•完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Travel Faster!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h greatly increase your movement speed! They can only be used outdoors.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>Seek out a |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h to receive your first Mount for free!<br/><br/>Select Start Quest and the nearest |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h will be tracked in your Quest Objectives and as a Yellow ? on the |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>You will receive a Mount in your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h after completing the Novice Rider quest at the Traveling |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h.<br/><br/>Open your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h and use the Mount to learn it.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">更快地旅行！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 会大幅提高你的移动速度。它们只能在户外使用。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>寻找一位 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 以免费获得你的第一只坐骑！<br/><br/>选择开始任务，最近的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 将会被追踪显示在你的任务目标中，并在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 上显示为一个黄色的 ？。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\110_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>在旅行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 处完成新手骑手任务后，你会在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 中收到一只坐骑。<br/><br/>打开你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 并使用该坐骑来学习它。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Choose Your Raiding Difficulty!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Raids allow for mistakes and are perfect for practicing fight mechanics without high pressure.<br/><br/>\r\nRight-click your character portrait to set your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Difficulty.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can complete Normal Raids with beginner gear and builds. They are often advertised in Global Chat and are designed for pickup groups, offering Epic Gear rewards!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Normal Raids Require No Attunements or Keys!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Raids are immediately accessible—you can enter them right now!<br/><br/>\r\nThere are no attunements, quests, keys, or other prerequisites before entering a Normal Difficulty |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\normalraids2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Raids Adapt to 10-25 Players</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Raids are entry-level PvE content that adapt their difficulty to your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h size, requiring at least 10 players and allowing up to 25.<br/><br/>\r\nThey drop more loot and are easier to complete with more players!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h Loot Lockouts Instead of |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Locks</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You are not locked to a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h ID on Ascension. You can join as many raids as you want but are only eligible to loot each boss once.<br/><br/>\r\nThis means you can join an in-progress |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h and return later for bosses you missed.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you need to leave or your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h disbands, you can join a new one and still get loot from any boss you have not already defeated!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">选择你的团队副本难度！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通团队副本允许犯错，非常适合在没有太大压力的情况下练习战斗机制。<br/><br/>\r\n右键点击你的角色头像即可设置你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 难度。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以用新手装备和构筑完成普通团队副本。它们经常在世界频道中被喊话组人，是为临时队伍设计的，并提供史诗装备奖励！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">普通团队副本不需要门任务或钥匙！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通团队副本可以立即进入——你现在就可以进去！<br/><br/>\r\n进入普通难度的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 之前，不需要门任务、任务、钥匙或其他任何前置条件。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\normalraids2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">团队副本会适应 10-25 名玩家</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通团队副本是入门级 PvE 内容，其难度会根据你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 人数进行调整，至少需要 10 名玩家，最多允许 25 名。<br/><br/>\r\n玩家人数越多，掉落的战利品越多，也越容易完成！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\15_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">按 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 锁定战利品，而非 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 锁定</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在 Ascension 中，你不会被锁定到某个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r ID。你可以加入任意多个团队副本，但每个首领只能拾取一次战利品。<br/><br/>\r\n这意味着你可以加入一个进行中的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r，稍后再回来打你错过的首领。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你需要离开，或者你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 解散了，你可以加入一个新的，并且仍然可以从任何你尚未击败过的首领那里获得战利品！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\18_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Heroic Raiding - Heroic Loot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroic Raids drop Heroic |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Gear! This is the same loot that drops from Normal Raids, but stronger!<br/><br/>\r\nHeroic Raids build on everything you learned in Normal Raids. Boss mechanics deal more damage, and ignoring them will almost always lead to death!<br/><br/>\r\nIt's helpful to have maxed PvE Power and Mystic Enchants that compliment your build.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\18_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">英雄团队副本——英雄战利品！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄团队副本会掉落英雄 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 装备！这与普通团队副本掉落的战利品相同，但更为强大。<br/><br/>\r\n英雄团队副本建立在你从普通团队副本中学到的一切之上。首领的机制会造成更高伤害，忽视它们几乎总是会导致死亡！<br/><br/>\r\n把 PvE 能量堆满，并配备与你构筑相辅相成的神秘附魔会很有帮助。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Resurrect in a safe spot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When your character dies, a small menu will appear on your screen. You’ll have the option to view the Death Recap to see what caused your death or check the Combat Log in your chat window for a more detailed breakdown. <br/><br/>\r\nTo continue, click 'Release Spirit' to become a ghost, where you can begin the process of reviving your character.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">In the Spirit World, there are several ways to revive!</h1>\r\n<p>Player Resurrection: Nearby players can cast resurrection spells (Revive, Redemption, Rebirth) allowing you to revive at their location. <br/><br/>\r\n\r\nReturn to Corpse: As a ghost, run back to your body and click the prompt to revive. Click 'Return to Graveyard' if you get lost to restart at the spirit |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\nSafe Zone Resurrection: Choose 'Resurrect in a Safe Zone' to instantly revive in the nearest town or |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h without any penalty. <br/><br/>\r\n\r\nSpirit |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h: Talk to the spirit |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h at the graveyard to revive on the spot. This causes Resurrection Sickness (temporary stat reduction) and reduces equipment |Hkeyword:89|hDurability|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在安全地点复活！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当你的角色死亡时，屏幕上会出现一个小菜单。你可以选择查看死亡回顾来了解是什么导致了你的死亡，或查看聊天窗口中的战斗记录以获得更详细的分解说明。 <br/><br/>\r\n要继续，请点击「释放灵魂」变成幽灵，此时你就可以开始复活你的角色了。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\193_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在灵魂世界中，有多种复活方式！</h1>\r\n<p>玩家复活：附近的玩家可以施放复活法术（复生、救赎、重生），让你在他们的位置复活。 <br/><br/>\r\n\r\n返回尸体：作为幽灵，跑回你的尸体并点击提示即可复活。如果你迷路了，点击「返回墓地」以在灵魂|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h医者|h|r 处重新出现。<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n安全区复活：选择「在安全区复活」可立即在最近的城镇或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 复活，且没有任何惩罚。 <br/><br/>\r\n\r\n灵魂|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h医者|h|r：与墓地的灵魂|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h医者|h|r 交谈即可就地复活。这会造成复活虚弱（暂时降低属性）并降低装备 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:89|h耐久度|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Raiding. Ascended Mechanics. Ascended Loot.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ascended Raiding is the ultimate PvE challenge on Ascension and drops the strongest obtainable gear for each Tier!<br/><br/>\r\nBosses deal more damage, are more durable, and have new challenging mechanics unique to Ascended difficulty.<br/><br/>\r\nAscended Raids are designed for Players with optimized builds, gear, a coordinate group, and a strong knowledge of the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ascended Raids Should Not Be Attempted with PvP Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wearing |Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h or PvP gear in Ascended Raids will apply the Bloody debuff to you, massively reducing your damage dealt and your survivability.<br/><br/>\r\nEnsure you have full PvE Power gear equipped. Even |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h PvP gear will apply the Bloody debuff.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">飞升团队副本。飞升机制。飞升战利品。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升团队副本是 Ascension 上终极的 PvE 挑战，每个阶段都会掉落可获得的最强装备！<br/><br/>\r\n首领造成的伤害更高、更耐打，并拥有飞升难度独有的新挑战机制。<br/><br/>\r\n飞升团队副本是为拥有优化构筑、良好装备、协调队伍以及对 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 有深入了解的玩家设计的。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\19_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">不要穿着 PvP 装备尝试飞升团队副本！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在飞升团队副本中穿戴 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r 或 PvP 装备会对你施加血腥减益，大幅降低你造成的伤害和生存能力。<br/><br/>\r\n确保你装备了一整套带有 PvE 能量的装备。即使是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的 PvP 装备也会施加血腥减益。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\219_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter The |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h from the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h is a random, endless |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h that can be queued solo or with 1-15 players!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can join from anywhere by opening the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h menu (Hotkey \"i\"), and navigating to the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h tab.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\enterthemanastorm2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Dive Deeper for Greater Challenges and Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each boss you defeat will send you deeper into the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h and award |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, Gear, Gold, |Hkeyword:148|hManastorm Caches|h, |Hkeyword:43|hBedlam Bullions|h, and |Hkeyword:53|hBonzo Bolts|h.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:154|hMillhouse Manastorm|h will return you safe and sound to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h upon exiting or being defeated.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\219_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 是一个随机且无尽的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，你可以单人排队，也可以与 1-15 名玩家一同前往！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在任何地方加入：打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 菜单（快捷键 \"i\"），然后进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 标签页。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\enterthemanastorm2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">深入其中，迎接更大的挑战与奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你每击败一个首领，都会将你送往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r 更深处，并给予你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r、装备、金币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:148|h法力风暴宝箱|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:43|h混乱金锭|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:53|h邦佐螺栓|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在退出或被击败时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:154|h米尔豪斯·法力风暴|h|r 会将你安全无恙地送回你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\220_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat level 5 and you can begin your next run at level 6!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Unlock Checkpoints every 5th level, allowing you to start a |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h from that level.<br/><br/>\r\nYou will encounter specific Checkpoint fights as you progress! Defeating these Checkpoints unlocks new creatures, new levels, new bosses and more powerful loot!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\220_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败第 5 层，你就能从第 6 层开始你的下一次挑战！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每 5 层解锁一个检查点，让你可以从该层开始 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|h法力风暴|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你不断推进，你会遇到特定的检查点战斗！击败这些检查点会解锁新的生物、新的层级、新的首领和更强大的战利品。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\225_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy the |Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h from |Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Bosses often have powerful spells and abilities that deal massive amounts of damage. The Interrupt Rod will allow you to counter enemy spell casts.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h and Upgrades are added to your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h, meaning all of your characters on this realm will gain access to the Interrupt Rod!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h Spell can be found inside the Ascension |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Items tab in your spell book!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\225_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[打断法杖]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>首领通常拥有强大的法术和能力，会造成大量伤害。打断法杖能让你反制敌方的施法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 及其升级会添加到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r，这意味着你在该服务器的所有角色都能使用打断法杖。<br/><br/>\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[打断法杖]|h|r 法术可以在你法术书中的 Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Purchase the Hearty Heal Upgrade from |Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Hearty Hearts are a major source of healing in the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h, upgrade them to increase their healing!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Hearty Heal Upgrade does not need to be added to your Active |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h. It is always active!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Upgrade Your Most Used |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>All Active |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h can be upgraded up to Rank 10 at |Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h! Upgrades can grant increased power, durations, and reduced cooldowns.<br/><br/>\r\nUpgrades are added to your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h! All your characters get access to them!<br/><br/>\r\nMake sure to fully upgrade the Active |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h you use most often.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r 处购买丰盛治疗升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>丰盛之心是 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 中重要的治疗来源，升级它们以提高其治疗量！<br/><br/>\r\n丰盛治疗升级不需要添加到你的主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 中。它始终处于激活状态！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\228_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">升级你最常用的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>所有主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 都可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r 处升级至最高 10 级！升级可以提高威力、延长持续时间并缩短冷却时间。<br/><br/>\r\n升级会添加到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r！你的所有角色都可以使用它们！<br/><br/>\r\n请务必把你最常使用的主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 升到满级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\229_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Heal with your |Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You automatically receive an |Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h in your inventory each time you enter the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h.<br/><br/>\r\nThis potion has unlimited uses and will allow you to progress through Manastorms solo or with friends when you do not have a |Hkeyword:237|hTank|h or |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h.<br/><br/>\r\nDrag the |Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h onto your bar and use it to heal anytime your health gets low!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\229_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽 Manastorm 药水]|h|r 进行治疗！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每次进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 时，你都会自动在背包中收到一瓶 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽 Manastorm 药水]|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n这瓶药水使用次数无限，当你没有 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r 时，它可以让你独自或与朋友一起推进 Manastorm。<br/><br/>\r\n将 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽 Manastorm 药水]|h|r 拖到你的动作条上，在生命值偏低时使用它进行治疗。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\230_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Your |Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You will automatically receive |Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h in your inventory each time you enter the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h.<br/><br/>\r\nThis potion will allow you to break free from stuns, silences, and other loss of control effects that could quickly lead to your death!<br/><br/>\r\nThis item has unlimited uses and is key to your survival. Drag |Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h onto your hot bar and use it to escape deadly crowd control effects.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\230_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse 的魔法逃脱]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每次进入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 时，你都会自动在背包中收到 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse 的魔法逃脱]|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n这瓶药水能让你摆脱昏迷、沉默以及其他可能迅速导致你死亡的控制效果！<br/><br/>\r\n该物品使用次数无限，是你生存的关键。将 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse 的魔法逃脱]|h|r 拖到你的快捷动作条上，用它来摆脱致命的范围控制效果。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Slot 4 Active |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Your |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Active Spell loadout can complement your build! There is no best setup, only the setup that matches your build and playstyle.<br/><br/>\r\nFind a set of |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h that complement your build and fill out all 4 slots!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cogsley sells new spells and upgrades!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Cogsley sells many tools that increase your power and offer new utility to allow you to progress further into the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce you find a set of spells that work well for you, try to upgrade them as much as possible!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">装备 4 个主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 主动法术搭配可以为你的构筑提供补充！没有最好的配置，只有契合你构筑和玩法风格的配置。<br/><br/>\r\n找出一套能与你的构筑互补的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r，并填满全部 4 个栏位。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\231_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cogsley 出售新的法术和升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Cogsley 出售许多能提升你实力并提供新功能的道具，帮助你更深入地推进 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n一旦你找到一套适合自己的法术，就尽量把它们升到最高级！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Slot an Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spell!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Some |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h and items must be added to your Active |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h to be used.<br/><br/>\r\nFrom the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Menu, select an empty Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spell slot and add your |Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse Mobility Mixture]|h or |Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h.<br/><br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Your |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h are in your Spell Book!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Your unlocked |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h can be found inside the Ascension |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Items tab in your spell book!<br/><br/>\r\nKeep in mind some of these must be added as Active |Hkeyword:1|hManastorm Spells|h to be cast while inside the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">The |Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h does not require an Active Slot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Some essential spells and items like the |Hitem:339041|h[Interrupt Rod]|h, |Hitem:254041|h[Endless Manastorm Potion]|h, and |Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse's Magical Escape]|h can always be used and do not take up an Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spell slot!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">装备一个主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 法术！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>某些 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 和物品必须添加到你的主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 中才能使用。<br/><br/>\r\n在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 菜单中，选择一个空的主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 法术栏位，然后添加你的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse 机动混合剂]|h|r 或 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[疾跑血清]|h|r。<br/><br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 就在你的法术书中！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你已解锁的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 可以在你法术书中的 Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 物品标签页中找到！<br/><br/>\r\n请记住，其中一些必须作为主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:1|hManastorm 法术|h|r 添加后，才能在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 内部施放。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\232_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[打断法杖]|h|r 不需要占用主动栏位！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>一些关键的法术和物品，例如 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339041|h[打断法杖]|h|r、|cffe6cc80|Hitem:254041|h[无尽 Manastorm 药水]|h|r 和 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:254042|h[Milhouse 的魔法逃脱]|h|r，始终可以使用，且不占用主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 法术栏位！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn Free Scrolls of Fortune from Silas Every 10 Levels!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Scrolls of Fortune (SoF) allow you to reroll spells and talents, rolling off unwanted spells and rolling for stronger talents!<br/><br/>\r\nVisit Silas every 10 levels to claim free Scrolls! You will be offered more and more scrolls every 10 levels.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce claimed from Silas, use them in your inventory to add them to your Character Advancement UI.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Find Silas Darkmoon in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Silas is marked on your map in Capital Cities with a Darkmoon flag icon.<br/><br/>\r\nLook for Silas and Burth in prominent areas of your Capital! They both have Dice icons floating above their head.<br/><br/>\r\nThey can also be found in early level questing hubs.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn Unlimited Scrolls of Fortune at Max Level.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Silas Darkmoon offers Scrolls of Fortune for Marks of Ascension at max level. There is a cap to how many Scrolls you can claim this way.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can earn uncapped Scrolls through |Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h, Dungeons, Battlegrounds, |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h, Raids, High-Risk farming and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">There are two types of Scrolls and Multi-Spec Support!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hitem:1101244|h[Scroll of Fortune]|h allows you to reroll either an Ability or a Talent and |Hitem:97933|h[Scroll of Fortune: Talents]|h only allow rerolling a Talent.<br/><br/>\r\nEvery Specialization has its own unique |Hitem:1101244|h[Scroll of Fortune I]|h. Every Spec gets free scrolls from Silas while leveling. You don't have to choose which spec to spend your Scrolls on!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">每 10 级从 Silas 处免费获得幸运卷轴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>幸运卷轴（SoF）让你可以重抽法术和天赋，抽掉不需要的，抽取更强的天赋！<br/><br/>\r\n每 10 级拜访一次 Silas 领取免费卷轴！每 10 级你都会被提供越来越多的卷轴。<br/><br/>\r\n从 Silas 处领取后，在背包中使用它们，即可将其添加到你的角色成长界面。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\238_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中找到 Silas Darkmoon！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Silas 在各主城的地图上以一个暗月旗帜图标标记。<br/><br/>\r\n在你主城的显眼区域寻找 Silas 和 Burth！他们头顶都漂浮着骰子图标。<br/><br/>\r\n他们也可以在新手任务枢纽中找到。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在满级获得无限量的幸运卷轴。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Silas Darkmoon 在满级时用飞升印记换取幸运卷轴。通过这种方式能领取的卷轴数量是有上限的。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r、地下城、战场、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r、团队副本、高风险刷怪等方式获得无上限的卷轴。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\scrolloffortune4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">卷轴有两种类型，并且支持多专精！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[幸运卷轴]|h|r 允许你重抽一个技能或一个天赋，而 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:97933|h[幸运卷轴：天赋]|h|r 只允许重抽天赋。<br/><br/>\r\n每个专精都有自己专属的 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[幸运卷轴 I]|h|r。每个专精在升级过程中都能从 Silas 处获得免费卷轴。你不必抉择把卷轴花在哪个专精上！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy Back Scrolls After |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can buy back Scrolls of Fortune earned from Cases of Fortune and other non-Silas methods.<br/><br/>\r\nVisit Silas Darkmoon and select Repurchase Scrolls.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Permanent Scroll Progress!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Scrolls of Fortune earned from Cases of Fortune and other non-Silas methods can be repurchased every time you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h.<br/><br/>\r\nUsed and unused Scrolls, bought back or not bought back, are Scrolls are eligible for repurchase! You never lose this progress when Prestiging.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Silas Scrolls Reset, They Can Not be Repurchased!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Scrolls you buy from Silas are not added to your Repurchase Scroll counts. This is because they already reset every |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h!<br/><br/>\r\nThe same is true for the bonus scrolls earned each time you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h. Those are not added to your Repurchase Scroll counts, you already get them back for free every |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 后可回购卷轴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以回购从幸运宝箱以及 Silas 之外的其他途径获得的幸运卷轴。<br/><br/>\r\n拜访 Silas Darkmoon 并选择回购卷轴。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">卷轴进度永久保留！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从幸运宝箱以及 Silas 之外的其他途径获得的幸运卷轴，每次你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时都可以回购。<br/><br/>\r\n已使用和未使用的卷轴，无论是否回购过，都可以回购！进行威望时你永远不会失去这些进度。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\240_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Silas 的卷轴会重置，无法回购！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你从 Silas 处购买的卷轴不会计入你的可回购卷轴数量。这是因为它们每次 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时就已经重置了！<br/><br/>\r\n你每次进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时获得的奖励卷轴也是如此。那些不会计入你的可回购卷轴数量，因为你每次 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 都能免费拿回它们。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Return to Level 1! Reroll Your Build!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h will reset your character to level 1 and teleport you to your starting zone.<br/><br/>\r\nThis will reroll your entire build, unlearning every spell and talent for your current Specialization you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h in, allowing you to re-level and reroll that specialization.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Only Reroll Your Current Spec!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Only your active specialization will be rerolled! Your other Specs will will remain intact.<br/><br/>\r\nWhile prestiging, all other specs will be locked until you reach max level again.<br/><br/>\r\nThis means you can reroll and experiment with multi-specs while preserving your main spec!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wcprestige3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Permanent Scroll of Fortune Progress!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each time you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h you will earn bonus Scrolls of Fortune when reaching max level. The amount earned increases every time you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can also buy back Scrolls of Fortune earned from Cases of Fortune, ensuring your time spent farming cases of fortune is never lost.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Pick New Skill Cards and Try New Builds!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h resets your current spec's Skill Cards!<br/><br/>\r\nThis allows you to try a whole new skill card loadout and experiment with new found skill cards.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Keep Character Progress. Return to Level 1. Earn Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h is a great way to earn end-game gear, Mystic Enchanting supplies, Marks of Ascension, and more!<br/><br/>\r\nRelive the leveling journey, dungeons, and Battlegrounds with all the knowledge you have acquired, including your saved Mystic Enchants!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Not Starting Over. Starting Better!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You keep all professions, gear, Marks of Ascension, currencies, |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h, and items.<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard and Draft Heroes get to roll a new build! But do not keep the Prestiged Spec's Unspent Hand of Fates or Scroll of Fortune.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You can |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h at Chromie and Redeem |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h Tokens!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Chromie offers rewards for prestiges and an in-depth explanation of exactly what occurs when you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h, including what you keep and what you lose!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find Chromie by the |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">回到 1 级！重铸你的构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 会将你的角色重置到 1 级，并把你传送到起始区域。<br/><br/>\r\n这会重铸你的整个构筑，使你遗忘当前进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 的那个专精的所有法术和天赋，让你可以重新升级并重铸该专精。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">只重铸你当前的专精！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>只有你的当前激活专精会被重铸！你的其他专精将保持原样。<br/><br/>\r\n进行威望期间，所有其他专精都会被锁定，直到你再次达到满级。<br/><br/>\r\n这意味着你可以在保留主专精的同时，重铸并尝试多个专精！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wcprestige3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">幸运卷轴进度永久保留！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每次你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r，在达到满级时都会获得额外的幸运卷轴。获得的数���会随你每次进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 而增加！<br/><br/>\r\n你还可以回购从幸运宝箱获得的幸运卷轴，确保你花在刷幸运宝箱上的时间永远不会白费。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\241_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">选择新的技能卡，尝试新的构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 会重置你当前专精的技能卡！<br/><br/>\r\n这让你可以尝试全新的技能卡配装，并用新获得的技能卡进行试验。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保留角色进度。回到 1 级。赢取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 是获得满级装备、神秘附魔材料、飞升印记等更多内容的好方法！<br/><br/>\r\n带着你已掌握的所有知识，包括已保存的神秘附魔，重温升级旅程、地下城和战场！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">不是从头开始。而是更好的开始！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你保留所有专业技能、装备、飞升印记、货币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 和物品。<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard 和 Draft 英雄可以重抽新的构筑！但他们不会保留已进行威望的专精未使用的命运之手或幸运卷轴。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以在 Chromie 处进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 并兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 代币！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Chromie 提供威望奖励，并详细说明你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时究竟会发生什么，包括你会保留什么、失去什么。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 旁找到 Chromie。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Rapid Rerolling is an Optional Way to Roll!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can enter Rapid Rerolling through Character Advancement. Click the button in the bottom right.<br/><br/>\r\nRapid Rerolling only works at max level. You must have already rolled all pending Spell and Talent rolls before you can use it!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increases Your Roll Speed, Not Your Roll Chance!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Rapid Rerolling uses multiple Scrolls of Fortune at once. Each Scroll is still being rolled individually! However, the dice will only stop when they roll a desired spell or talent, or reach the last roll.<br/><br/>\r\nThere is no direct benefit to using Rapid Rerolling versus normal Rerolling besides time.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You Should Not Always Use Rapid Rerolling!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Rapid Rerolling is a great tool to help finish builds and quickly roll through large amounts of Scrolls to find a few missing spells or talents.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you are still discovering the direction of your build, you should use normal rerolling! This will ensure Rapid Rerolling does not skip over rolls you might otherwise want to explore.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Suggested Abilities and Talent. Don't Miss Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Suggested Abilities and Talents will tell the dice to stop rolling on spells and talents that may make your build stronger.<br/><br/>\r\nThis does not lower your chances to get other Desired entries! It only ensures that the dice don't skip over options that you would gain power from!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">The Dice Stop on Your Desired Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Select Spells, Talents or even entire Categories like Mage: Frost or Ability Type: Mobility to tell the dice when to stop rolling.<br/><br/>\r\nRapid Reroll will skip anything not in your desired! And it will only stop rolling when one of your desired entries comes up.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you are rolling 5 scrolls at once, and you get a desired entry on the 3rd roll, it will only use 3 Scrolls before stopping.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Select Spells and Talents To Unlearn!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Spells and Talents to mark them as Undesired.<br/><br/>\r\nSpells that will be unlearned and rerolled will be highlighted in Red.<br/><br/>\r\nYour Locked spells and talents will not appear in this list! Be sure to Lock anything you wish to keep.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Import Full Builds!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Selecting every possible spell and talent, or category you desire can take time to set up. There is also the chance you miss something!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can create a |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h Build, or import a Featured Build specifically designed to optimize Rapid Rerolling.<br/><br/>\r\nDiscover how to Import Full Builds from the Path to Ascension Wildcard: Rapid Reroll Full Builds!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">快速重抽是一种可选的抽取方式！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以通过角色成长进入快速重抽。点击右下角的按钮。<br/><br/>\r\n快速重抽只在满级时可用。使用它之前，你必须已经抽完了所有待抽的法术和天赋！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提高的是抽取速度，而不是抽取几率！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>快速重抽会同时使用多张幸运卷轴。每张卷轴仍然是单独抽取的！不过，骰子只会在抽到想要的法术或天赋，或到达最后一次抽取时才会停下。<br/><br/>\r\n除了节省时间之外，使用快速重抽相比普通重抽没有任何直接的好处。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你不应该总是使用快速重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>快速重抽是完成构筑、快速消耗大量卷轴以寻找少数缺失法术或天赋的好工具。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你还在摸索构筑的方向，就应该使用普通重抽！这样可以确保快速重抽不会跳过你也许想尝试的抽取结果。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用推荐技能和天赋。不要错过实力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>推荐技能和天赋会让骰子在可能增强你构筑的法术和天赋上停下。<br/><br/>\r\n这不会降低你获得其他期望条目的几率！它只是确保骰子不会跳过能让你变强的选项。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">骰子会在你期望的法术和天赋上停下！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>选择法术、天赋，甚至整个类别，例如法师：冰霜或技能类型：机动性，来告诉骰子何时停止抽取。<br/><br/>\r\n快速重抽会跳过所有不在你期望列表中的内容！并且只有在出现你期望的条目时才会停止抽取。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你一次抽取 5 张卷轴，并在第 3 次抽取时获得了期望条目，那么它只会用掉 3 张卷轴就会停止。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">选择要遗忘的法术和天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>点击法术和天赋，将它们标记为不期望。<br/><br/>\r\n将被遗忘并重新抽取的法术会以红色高亮显示。<br/><br/>\r\n你已锁定的法术和天赋不会出现在此列表中！请务必锁定所有你想保留的内容。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\242_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">导入完整构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>逐个选择你想要的每个法术、天赋或类别可能很花时间。而且也有遗漏的可能！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以创建一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 构筑，或导入一个专为优化快速重抽而设计的精选构筑。<br/><br/>\r\n在飞升之路中了解如何导入完整构筑：Wildcard：快速重抽完整构筑！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Browse Featured Builds in the |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h to Browse Featured Builds!<br/><br/>\r\nFeatured builds are approved builds designed for Rapid Rerolling. These are a great way to jump into end-game build progression and explore new ways to play.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can browse builds based on PvE or PvP content, and select one based on your desired role: |Hkeyword:237|hTank|h, |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h, or |Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Core, Optimal, and Empowering Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Core Spells and Talents are the bare minimum requirements to use the build.<br/><br/>\r\nOptimal Spells and Talents are the best options for your build. Don't reroll these!<br/><br/>\r\nEmpowering Spells and Talents make your build stronger, but are not the strongest option. Reroll these last!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Import Builds into Rapid Rerolling!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Select Rapid Roll This Build from the |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h! This will bring you to the Rapid Reroll UI.<br/><br/>\r\nSelect Import |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h Build, then select the one you desire from the list.<br/><br/>\r\nKeep in mind that only Featured Builds are guaranteed optimized for Rapid Rerolling. You should inspect community made builds before Rapid Rerolling them!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Desire All Spells!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Import |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h build, select your desired build, then click Desire All Spells!<br/><br/>\r\nThis will mark all Core, Optimal, and Empowering Spells and Talents as Desired entries. This means the Dice will always stop on spells and talents that empower this chosen build!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlearn All Non-Build Spells!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Import |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h build, select your desired build, then click Unlearn All Non-Build Spells!<br/><br/>\r\nThis sets all spells and talents you currently know that are not in the build as ones you want to reroll!<br/><br/>\r\nThis will not set Locked spells or talents to be rerolled. Be sure to unlock non-build spells you wish to reroll.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">When to Reroll Empowering Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>As you Rapid Reroll, eventually your entire build will consist of Core, Optimal, and Empowering spells and talents.<br/><br/>\r\nAt this point, you can begin marking Empowering Spells and Talents to be unlearned to try to seek out Optimal Spells and Talents!<br/><br/>\r\nYou should reroll Empowering entries one at a time to ensure your build retains as much power while rerolling as possible.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Lock Your Build Spells!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Click Import |Hkeyword:128|hHero Architect|h build, select your desired build, then click Lock Core, Optimal, Empowering Spells!<br/><br/>\r\nBe sure to lock spells in your build to prevent accidentally rerolling them! This is also a great way to see how many spells and talents you have towards your desired build.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 中浏览精选构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 即可浏览精选构筑！<br/><br/>\r\n精选构筑是专为快速重抽而设计的、经过审核的构筑。它们是进入满级构筑成长体系并探索新玩法的绝佳途径。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以根据 PvE 或 PvP 内容浏览构筑，并根据你想要的角色进行选择：|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r 或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">核心、最优与强化法术和天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>核心法术和天赋是使用该构筑的最低必备要求。<br/><br/>\r\n最优法术和天赋是你的构筑的最佳选择。不要重抽它们！<br/><br/>\r\n强化法术和天赋会让你的构筑更强，但不是最强的选项。最后再重抽它们！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">将构筑导入快速重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 中选择「快速抽取此构筑」！这会带你进入快速重抽界面。<br/><br/>\r\n选择「导入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 构筑」，然后从列表中选择你想要的那个。<br/><br/>\r\n请记住，只有精选构筑才保证针对快速重抽进行了优化。在对社区制作的构筑使用快速重抽之前，你应该先检查一下！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">期望所有法术！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>点击「导入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 构筑」，选择你想要的构筑，然后点击「期望所有法术」！<br/><br/>\r\n这会把所有核心、最优和强化法术及天赋标记为期望条目。这意味着骰子会始终停在这个所选构筑的强化法术和天赋上！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">遗忘所有不属于该构筑的法术！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>点击「导入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 构筑」，选择你想要的构筑，然后点击「遗忘所有不属于该构筑的法术」！<br/><br/>\r\n这会把所有你当前已知、且不在该构筑中的法术和天赋标记为想要重抽的对象！<br/><br/>\r\n这不会把已锁定的法术或天赋标记为可重抽。请务必先解锁你想重抽的不属于该构筑的法术。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">何时重抽强化法术和天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>随着你进行快速重抽，最终你的整个构筑都会由核心、最优和强化法术及天赋组成。<br/><br/>\r\n到那时，你就可以开始标记强化法术和天赋将其遗忘，并尝试抽取最优法术和天赋！<br/><br/>\r\n你应该逐个重抽强化条目，以确保你的构筑在重抽过程中保持尽可能强的实力。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\243_7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">锁定你构筑中的法术！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>点击「导入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:128|h英雄建筑师|h|r 构筑」，选择你想要的构筑，然后点击「锁定核心、最优和强化法术」！<br/><br/>\r\n请务必锁定你构筑中的法术，以免意外重抽它们！这也是查看你距离目标构筑还差多少法术和天赋的好方法。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn LP by Securing Your Account!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Visit https://ascension.gg/user/account-overview and secure your account to earn Loyalty Points!<br/><br/>\r\nLP can be spent on |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h vanity items! Claim 50 LP for securing your account.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit the LP Item Shop!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the Store on the website or the Launcher.<br/><br/>\r\nLP is displayed as the silver |Hkeyword:82|hCurrency|h, you can see your current LP in the top right of the website or launcher.\r\nOpen the Store, then click the LP Items category to spend your LP!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Delivered Straight to Your Mailbox!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Store items are delivered straight to your mailbox. You can choose which realm and character you want them delivered to when checking out.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保护你的账号即可获得 LP！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>访问 https://ascension.gg/user/account-overview 并保护你的账号以获得忠诚点数！<br/><br/>\r\nLP 可用于购买 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的装饰物品！保护你的账号可领取 50 LP。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">访问 LP 物品商店！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在网站或启动器上打开商店。<br/><br/>\r\nLP 显示为银色的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:82|h货币|h|r；你可以在网站或启动器的右上角查看当前的 LP。\r\n打开商店，然后点击 LP 物品分类即可消费你的 LP！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\244_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">直接送达你的邮箱！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>商店物品会直接送达你的邮箱。结账时你可以选择想要送达的服务器和角色。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Save Your Equipment’s Appearance with the |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Your |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h keeps a record of all the equipment your characters collect over the course of your adventure on the server! You can find your |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h by hitting ‘N’, and selecting the |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h tab under Character Advancement.<br/><br/>\r\nFind appearances by looting enemies, purchasing equipment from other players or npcs, and completing quests!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gotta Collect Them All!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>To save an item’s appearance to your |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h, use Ctrl + Right Click on a piece of gear in your inventory to save its appearance. You can also do this by equipping the item yourself!<br/><br/>\r\nContinue your adventures and collect 10 Transmog Appearances!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 保存你装备的外观！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 会记录你的角色在本服冒险过程中收集到的所有装备！按下「N」，然后在角色成长下选择 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 标签页即可找到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n通过拾取敌人身上的战利品、从其他玩家或 NPC 处购买装备以及完成任务来发现外观！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\245_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">把它们全部收集起来！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>要保存一件物品的外观到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r，请对背包中的一件装备使用 Ctrl + 右键点击来保存其外观。你也可以通过自己装备该物品来做到这一点！<br/><br/>\r\n继续你的冒险，收集 10 个幻化外观！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\247_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You Can Save Your Transmogs with Outfits!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Once you’ve made a complete transmog, you can save it with the Outfits tab in the |Hkeyword:252|hWardrobe|h! This way if you change your look, you can apply your previously saved Outfit with ease and not have to remake your transmog from scratch.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can have as many different Outfits as you like, there is no limit!<br/><br/>\r\nYour Outfit collection is saved to your server, so all of your different characters can apply your various transmogs with just the click of a button!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\247_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以用套装保存你的幻化！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>一旦你完成了一套完整的幻化，就可以用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:252|h衣柜|h|r 中的套装标签页将其保存下来。这样，如果你改变了外观，就能轻松应用之前保存的套装，而不必从头重新制作幻化。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以拥有任意多套不同的套装，没有限制！<br/><br/>\r\n你的套装收藏保存在服务器上，所以你所有的不同角色都只需点击一个按钮即可应用你的各种幻化！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlock multiple builds on the same character!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Unlocking new Specializations allows you to create completely new builds on your same character and freely switch between them!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can obtain a |Hitem:106954|h[Tome of Specialization II]|h from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, an Honor Vendor, Nozdormu, or the Ascension Shop.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can unlock up to 20 specs using |Hkeyword:245|hTome of Specialization|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Swap and Name Specs in Character Advancement!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can switch between known specializations in the Specs Tab inside Character Advancement.<br/><br/>\r\nKeep track of your specs by naming them! You can also link an Equipment Set and Enchant Specialization to each spec by clicking the cog wheel.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在同一个角色上解锁多种构筑！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>解锁新的专精可以让你在同一个角色上创建全新的构筑，并在它们之间自由切换！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r、荣誉商人、Nozdormu 或 Ascension 商店获得 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:106954|h[专精之书 II]|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:245|h专精之书|h|r 最多可以解锁 20 个专精。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\28_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在角色成长中切换和命名专精！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在角色成长内的专精标签页中切换已学会的专精。<br/><br/>\r\n通过给专精命名来记录它们！你还可以点击齿轮图标，为每个专精关联一套装备套装和附魔专精。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat a World Boss! Choose PvE or PvP!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>World Bosses are open world boss encounters that require a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h to defeat! These bosses respawn on a timer.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can challenge bosses in No-Risk |Hkeyword:198|hPvE Mode|h if you prefer to avoid PvP. Bosses spawn in both No-Risk and High-Risk.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">World Boss Spawns are Announced in Ascension Chat!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When a World Boss dies or spawns, it will alert you in the chatbox.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen looking for a World Boss group, it is easiest to ask for an invite through World Chat.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can use the First-Class-Experimental-Teleporter to get a head start on the destination after finding your group.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">World Boss Take Time to Fully Manifest!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Sometimes it takes time to travel or fly to a World Boss location.<br/><br/>\r\nBosses will spawn in an invulnerable state to give the whole |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h group time to reach the destination.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce the boss fully manifests, it can be engaged!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">World Bosses Respawn on Server Restarts!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Server Restarts have a distinct advantage on Ascension! All World Bosses will respawn as soon as the realm comes back online!<br/><br/>\r\nLogging back in immediately after a restart is a great time to find a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Group to challenge each World Boss back to back!<br/><br/>\r\nKeep an eye on Ascension Chat after a restart to find a |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or make your own!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Everyone gets loot!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When a World Boss is killed they will drop a Treasures of Azeroth Cache stuffed with gear that everyone can loot!<br/><br/>\r\nThey also drop individual loot that can be rolled on or distributed as your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Leader decides.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败世界首领！选择 PvE 或 PvP！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>世界首领是野外首领战，需要一支 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍才能击败！这些首领按计时器刷新。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你希望避开 PvP，可以在无风险的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:198|hPvE 模式|h|r 下挑战首领。首领在无风险和高风险模式下都会出现。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界首领的刷新会在 Ascension 聊天中公告！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当世界首领死亡或刷新时，聊天框会提醒你。<br/><br/>\r\n在寻找世界首领队伍时，最简单的做法是通过世界频道请求邀请。<br/><br/>\r\n找到队伍后，你可以使用头等实验传送器来抢先抵达目的地。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界首领需要一段时间才能完全显现！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>有时前往或飞往世界首领所在地需要一些时间。<br/><br/>\r\n首领出现时会处于无敌状态，以便整个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍有时间抵达目的地。<br/><br/>\r\n一旦首领完全显现，就可以与之交战了！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">世界首领会在服务器重启后刷新！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>服务器重启在 Ascension 上有一个明显的优势！所有世界首领都会在服务器重新上线时立即刷新！<br/><br/>\r\n在重启后立刻登录，是找个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍连续挑战各个世界首领的好时机。<br/><br/>\r\n重启后留意 Ascension 聊天频道来寻找 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，或者自己组建一个！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\36_5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">人人都能获得战利品！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>世界首领被击杀时会掉落一个装满装备的艾泽拉斯宝藏宝箱，所有人都可以拾取！<br/><br/>\r\n它们还会掉落个人战利品，可以通过掷骰分配，或由 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 团长决定如何分配。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Rank Up Spells to Increase their Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Higher ranked spells deal more damage and even gain additional effects!<br/><br/>\r\nNew ranks become available as you level up.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Rank Your Spells Up at a Trainer!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>A |Hkeyword:44|hBeginner's Book of Ascension|h can rank spells up to level 20!<br/><br/>\r\nUse the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h on your mini-map and select Class Trainer to find a |Hkeyword:44|hBeginner's Book of Ascension|h! They can be found near the |Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h in your starter zone and surrounding towns.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">The Book Icon Lets You Know Spells Can Rank Up!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The book icon will appear next to spells that can be ranked up in your Spell Book, Character Advancement, and above the menu icon!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can train your spells up to max level at a class trainer in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h or anyone's |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h! Many players have a portable |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h, so don't hesitate to ask them to summon one!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提升法术等级以增强其威力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>更高等级的法术会造成更多伤害，甚至获得额外效果！<br/><br/>\r\n随着你升级，新的等级会变得可用。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在训练师处提升你的法术等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:44|h新手飞升之书|h|r 可以将法术提升到 20 级！<br/><br/>\r\n使用小地图上的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 并选择职业训练师，即可找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:44|h新手飞升之书|h|r。它们位于你起始区域和附近城镇的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r 附近。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\56_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">书本图标会提示法术可以升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>书本图标会出现在可升级的法术旁边，包括你的法术书、角色成长中，以及菜单图标上方！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的职业训练师处，或任何人的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r 处，将法术训练到满级！很多玩家都有便携的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r，所以不要犹豫，请他们召唤一个吧！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fast Travel to |Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h with your |Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h is the |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h for the Alliance and offers important services:<br/><br/>\r\n• |Hkeyword:37|hBank|h and |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h<br/>\r\n• |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h<br/>\r\n• Class Trainers, |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Trainers, and Riding Trainers<br/>\r\n• Flightmasters<br/>\r\n• |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Navigating Through the City</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Opening your Map inside the city will show POIs for important services and NPCs. Mouse over these icons to see their function.<br/><br/>\r\nThe city may be large, but |Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h Guards can give you directions on where you need to go!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Report to Justine Demalier</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Heroes travel from the furthest reaches of Azeroth to seek comfort and companionship behind the mighty walls surrounding the city. The time has come for you to do the same, Hero.<br/><br/>\r\nTravel to the royal city of |Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h and announce yourself to Justine Demalier. She will be waiting to greet you inside the walls.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 快速前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 是联盟的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r，提供重要的服务：<br/><br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:37|h银行|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r<br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r<br/>\r\n• 职业训练师、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 训练师和骑术训练师<br/>\r\n• 飞行管理员<br/>\r\n• |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 等等</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">如何在城中穿行</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在城内打开地图时，你会看到重要服务和 NPC 的兴趣点。将鼠标悬停在这些图标上即可查看其功能。<br/><br/>\r\n城市可能很大，但 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 的卫兵可以为你指明前往目的地的方向。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\58_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">向 Justine Demalier 报到</h1><br/>\r\n<p>英雄们从艾泽拉斯最遥远的地方赶来，在这座城市雄伟的城墙之后寻求慰藉与陪伴。英雄，现在轮到你了。<br/><br/>\r\n前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 王城，向 Justine Demalier 报到。她会在城墙内等着迎接你。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\64_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit the Mark of Triumph Vendor!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Marks of Triumph are earned by completing Heroic and Mythic difficulty dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nThese marks can be exchanged for gear! Use them to upgrade your gear or save up for specific equipment key to your build.<br/><br/>\r\nVisit Markus in the |Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h Throne Room to see the gear you can acquire.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\64_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">拜访凯旋印记商人！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>凯旋印记通过完成英雄和史诗难度的地下城获得。<br/><br/>\r\n这些印记可以兑换装备！用它们来升级你的装备，或攒起来购买你构筑所必需的特定装备。<br/><br/>\r\n前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 王座厅的马库斯处，查看你能获得的装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Slay Creatures and Complete Quests to Gain |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Slaying creatures and completing quests is the primary way to gain |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h!<br/><br/>\r\nYour |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h bar is located directly above your hot bar and menu bar. You can mouse over it to see the exact amount of |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h required to gain your next level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevelten2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">NPCs with Yellow Exclamation Points Offer Quests!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>NPCs with a Yellow Exclamation Point offer quests. Complete quests to earn loot and big |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h.<br/><br/>\r\nCompleting quests is a great way to get stronger. They can reward gear, |Hitem:1297884|h[Adventurer's Cache]|h, Reputations, and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Yellow Names are Non-Aggressive. Red Names Attack on Sight!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Enemies become more dangerous as you level up and venture into more difficult areas. If you’re feeling bold, you can set off on any nearby road. Roads will lead you to new towns and villages with more challenging Quests.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">See How Much |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h You Earn!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can see the |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h gained from slaying creatures and completing quests on screen! More difficult creatures and quests grant more |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击杀生物并完成任务以获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>击杀生物和完成任务是获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 的主要方式！<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 条位于你的动作条和菜单栏正上方。你可以将鼠标悬停在其上，查看升到下一级所需的确切 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 数量。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevelten2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 会提供任务！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 会提供任务。完成任务以获取战利品和大量 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n完成任务是变强的好方法。它们会奖励装备、|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1297884|h[冒险者的宝箱]|h|r、声望等等！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">黄色名字不会主动攻击。红色名字一看到你就会攻击！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>随着你升级并进入更困难的区域，敌人会变得更加危险。如果你胆子够大，可以沿着附近的任意一条路出发。道路会把你带到有新任务的新城镇和村庄。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\74_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">查看你获得了多少 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在屏幕上看到击杀生物和完成任务所获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！更困难的生物和任务会给予更多 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fast Travel Home with Your |Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Make an |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h your Home at an Innkeeper to set your |Hkeyword:124|hHearthstone|h location, allowing you to teleport back to your home |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h from anywhere in the world.<br/><br/>\r\nLogging out while inside an |Hkeyword:137|hInn|h grants you bonus |Hkeyword:210|hRested Experience|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Find Innkeepers in Most Towns!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Innkeepers have everything you need to rest and relax! They sell |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h, Food, and Drink.<br/><br/>\r\nInnkeepers are found in Cities and most Quest Hubs. You can locate them by using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h and selecting Innkeeper.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r 快速回家！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与旅店老板交谈，将一家 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 设为你的家，即可设置你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:124|h炉石|h|r 位置，让你可以从世界任何地方传送回你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:137|h旅店|h|r 内下线会给予你额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:210|h休息经验|h|r！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\76_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在大多数城镇都能找到旅店老板！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>旅店老板拥有你休息和放松所需的一切！他们出售 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r、食物和饮料。<br/><br/>\r\n旅店老板出现在城市和大多数任务枢纽中。你可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 并选择旅店老板来定位他们。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Craft and Gather Useful Items with Professions!</h1>\r\n<p>Professions help you level! Using your |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h grants |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h while also providing gear, consumables, and materials. You can start by learning two primary professions, and all the secondary ones!<br/><br/>\r\n•Primary Gathering Professions: Gatherers can pick up crafting materials around the world. They can sell them for gold, or use the items in their crafting professions.<br/><br/>\r\n•Primary Crafting Professions: Crafters can make equipment and other useful items from materials found by gathering professions.<br/><br/>\r\n•Secondary Professions: These life skills can be used by anyone without restriction!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Learn a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Visit a Beginner’s |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h to learn your first |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h. Find one using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h! You can unlearn a |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h at any time to learn a new one.<br/><br/>\r\nTry to pick two primary professions that work well together like |Hkeyword:219|hSkinning|h and |Hkeyword:142|hLeatherworking|h, or |Hkeyword:127|hHerbalism|h and |Hkeyword:12|hAlchemy|h! This way you can gather your own materials to skill up without having to rely on other players.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Skill Up Your |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h!</h1>\r\n<p>You can level up your |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h just by using it! Use the |Hkeyword:220|hSkills Tab|h (Hotkey K) to view your current, and skill level. Visit a |Hkeyword:195|hProfession Trainer|h to increase your maximum skill as you progress.<br/><br/>\r\nDifficulty colors guide you on what to do next to skill up. Always try to aim for orange level skills!<br/><br/>\r\n•Orange: Always grants a skill point!<br/>\r\n•Yellow: Usually grants a skill point.<br/>\r\n•Green: Rarely grants a skill point.<br/>\r\n•Grey: Does not increase your skill.<br/>\r\n•Red: Your skill level isn’t high enough yet!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increase Your Skills to Unlock New |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h</h1>\r\n<p>As you craft and gather using your professions, you’ll rank up!<br/><br/>\r\nNew |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h become available as you gain skill and you can train them at |Hkeyword:197|hProfession|h Trainers or the |Hkeyword:55|hBook of Artisans|h. Other |Hkeyword:203|hRecipes|h can be found throughout the world as loot or purchased from |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h and the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h.<br/><br/>\r\nIf you want to learn more than two Primary Professions, use a Craftsman’s Codex to gain an additional |Hkeyword:218|hPrimary Profession|h slot! You can buy them from Nozdormu, the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h, or the webstore.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用专业技能制作和采集有用的物品！</h1>\r\n<p>专业技能能帮助你升级！使用你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 会给予 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r，同时还能提供装备、消耗品和材料。你可以从学习两个主要专业开始，还有所有次要专业！<br/><br/>\r\n•主要采集专业：采集者可以在世界各地采集制造材料。他们可以把材料卖成金币，或在他们的制造专业中使用这些物品。<br/><br/>\r\n•主要制造专业：制造者可以用采集专业获得的材料制作装备和其他有用物品。<br/><br/>\r\n•次要专业：这些生活技能任何人都可以无限制地使用！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">学习一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>拜访新手 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习你的第一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r。使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 找到一个！你可以随时遗忘一项 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 来学习新的专业。<br/><br/>\r\n试着选择两个能很好搭配的主要专业，例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:219|h剥皮|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:142|h制皮|h|r，或者 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:127|h草药学|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:12|h炼金术|h|r！这样你就能自己采集材料来提升技能，而不必依赖其他玩家。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提升你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 技能！</h1>\r\n<p>你只需使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 就能提升它的等级！使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:220|h技能标签页|h|r（快捷键 K）查看你当前的技能和技能等级。随着你的进展，拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:195|h专业训练师|h|r 以提高你的技能上限。<br/><br/>\r\n难度颜色会指导你接下来该做什么来提升技能。始终尽量瞄准橙色的技能！<br/><br/>\r\n•橙色：必定给予一个技能点！<br/>\r\n•黄色：通常会给予一个技能点。<br/>\r\n•绿色：很少给予一个技能点。<br/>\r\n•灰色：不会提升你的技能。<br/>\r\n•红色：你的技能等级还不够高！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\78_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提高你的技能以解锁新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r</h1>\r\n<p>随着你使用专业技能制造和采集，你会不断提升等级！<br/><br/>\r\n新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 会随着你技能的提升而解锁，你可以通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:197|h专业|h|r 训练师或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:55|h工匠之书|h|r 来学习它们。其他 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:203|h配方|h|r 可以在世界各地作为战利品找到，或从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你想学习超过两个主要专业，请使用工匠法典来获得一个额外的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:218|h主要专业|h|r 栏位！你可以从 Nozdormu、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或网页商店购买它们。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\80_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>Continue your journey and acquire enough |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h to reach level 15.<br/><br/>\r\nAs you continue advancing in levels, you will have to travel to new zones to find more challenging creatures and quests!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel152:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use the |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h to find new zones!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Hit M, then right-click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall |Hkeyword:256|hWorld Map|h. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.<br/><br/>\r\nFind the nearby zone that is level 10+ and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 15.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\80_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>继续你的旅程，获取足够的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 以升到 15 级。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你继续升级，你需要前往新的区域，寻找更具挑战性的生物和任务。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel152:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r 来寻找新区域！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会将视角拉远至总体的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:256|h世界地图|h|r。将鼠标悬停在与你当前区域相邻的区域上。你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。<br/><br/>\r\n找到附近 10 级或更高的区域，前往那里以发现新任务并继续你通往 15 级的旅程。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\81_1:2:1}\r\n<p>You can find a |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h in any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can use these boards while leveling to discover where to go next and accept any tutorial quests you may have missed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At max level, the |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h offers Daily Quests and Weekly Quests granting you |Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h, Marks of Ascension, Mystic Orbs, and Mystic Runes.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\81_1:2:1}\r\n<p>你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r！</p>\r\n\r\n<p>你可以在升级过程中使用这些告示板来了解接下来该去哪里，并接取你可能错过的任何教学任务。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>在满级时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 会提供日常任务和每周任务，给予你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r、飞升印记、神秘宝珠和神秘符文。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Fly to Westfall or Redridge at the |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Nearby Flightpaths are automatically unlocked! Visit the |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h and fly to a new zone to continue leveling!<br/><br/>\r\nWestfall or Redridge are the most popular quest hubs for Heroes leaving the capital for the first time.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find nearby Flightmasters by using the |Hkeyword:151|hMap Lens|h and selecting |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlock new Flightpaths at Flightmasters!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Interacting with a |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h unlocks their |Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h. Anytime you travel to a new zone, you should look for the |Hkeyword:112|hFlightmaster|h’s green “!” in your faction's quest hub.<br/><br/>\r\nEach |Hkeyword:110|hFlightpath|h connects to other nearby locations. Unlocking multiple locations allows you to chain them together to fly even greater distances at once! Unlock the nodes between two locations to fly between those locations.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 处飞往西部荒野或赤脊山！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>附近的飞行路线会自动解锁！拜访你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r，飞往新的区域继续升级！<br/><br/>\r\n西部荒野和赤脊山是初次离开主城的英雄们最热门的任务枢纽。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:151|h地图透镜|h|r 并选择 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 来找到附近的飞行管理员。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\83_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在飞行管理员处解锁新的飞行路线！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 互动会解锁其 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r。每当你前往一个新区域时，都应该在你阵营的任务枢纽寻找 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:112|h飞行管理员|h|r 的绿色 \"!\"。<br/><br/>\r\n每条 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:110|h飞行路线|h|r 都会与其他附近的地点相连。解锁多个地点后，你可以把它们串联起来，一次飞行更远的距离！解锁两个地点之间的节点，就能在两个地点之间飞行。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\84_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Continue your journey and reach level 20!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Continue to accept and complete new quests, venturing into more difficult areas as you gain |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h until you reach level 20!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel202:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Quests Unlock as Your Level!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:199|hQuest Givers|h with a Grey Exclamation Mark means you must be a higher level to accept their quest.<br/><br/>\r\nAs you gain levels, more difficult quests will become available to you.<br/><br/>\r\nQuests in the starter area scale up to level 20! All other quests scale up to max. That means you will never out-level the quests you are on or quest hubs!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\84_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">继续你的旅程，达到 20 级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>继续接取并完成新任务，在你获取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 的过程中深入更困难的区域，直到达到 20 级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\reachlevel202:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">任务会随你的等级解锁！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>带有灰色感叹号的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:199|h任务给予者|h|r 意味着你必须达到更高的等级才能接取他们的任务。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你升级，更困难的任务会变得可用。<br/><br/>\r\n起始区域的任务会一直缩放到 20 级！所有其他任务都会缩放到满级。这意味着你永远不会超出你正在进行的任务或任务枢纽的等级！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Join the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h Queue!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h automatically pairs you with other heroes in a |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h and teleports you to a |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h to fight a series of enemies and get awesome loot!<br/><br/>\r\nOpen the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h (Hotkey “i”, for Instances) or click the Green Eye in your menu bar.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Select your Role!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Pick your role from the icons at the top. You can only queue as a single role at a time.<br/><br/>\r\n•The Shield Icon is for a |Hkeyword:237|hTank|h.<br/>\r\n•The Green Health Icon is for a |Hkeyword:122|hHealer|h.<br/>\r\n•The Sword is for a |Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h.<br/><br/>\r\nSelect Find Group after picking a role that suits your build and spells!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Continue playing while the |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h fills up!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can continue questing, slaying creatures or explore while you wait for your |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h to fill up. You will be returned to your original location after the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h icon will appear on your minimap when you are in the queue. Hover over this icon to see the status and estimated wait time.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen the group fills up, you will see a pop-up notification and be teleported to the |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h when everyone accepts.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">加入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 队列！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 会自动将你与其他英雄配对组成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r，并将你传送到一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，与一系列敌人战斗并获得丰厚战利品！<br/><br/>\r\n打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r（快捷键 \"i\"，取自 Instance 之意），或点击菜单栏上的绿色眼睛。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">选择你的职责！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从顶部的图标中选择你的职责。你一次只能以一个职责排队。<br/><br/>\r\n•盾牌图标代表 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:237|h坦克|h|r。<br/>\r\n•绿色的生命图标代表 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:122|h治疗者|h|r。<br/>\r\n•剑代表 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:83|hDPS|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n选择适合你构筑和法术的职责后，点击寻找小队！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\89_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r 集结期间继续游戏！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在等待 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r 集结时，你可以继续做任务、击杀生物或探索。|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 结束后你会被送回原来的位置！<br/><br/>\r\n排队期间，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 图标会显示在你的小地图上。将鼠标悬停在该图标上可查看状态和预计等待时间。<br/><br/>\r\n当队伍集结完成时，你会看到一条弹出通知，并在所有人接受后被传送到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\91_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increase your Mounted Speed!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Talk to a |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h to learn Apprentice Riding! This will increase your mounted movement speed from 40% to 60%!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find Traveling Riding Trainers in early level quest hubs or visit your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h and ask a guard for directions to the |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h.</p><br/><br/>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\91_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">提高你的骑乘速度！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 交谈以学习学徒骑术！这会将你的骑乘移动速度从 40% 提高到 60%。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在低等级任务枢纽中找到旅行骑术训练师，或者前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 向卫兵询问前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 的方向。</p><br/><br/>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Learned |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h are stored in your |Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h</h1><br/>\r\n<p>•Open up your Character Sheet (Hotkey C).<br/>\r\n•Click the |Hkeyword:186|hPets Tab|h on the bottom.<br/>\r\n•Click the |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h tab on the top.<br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Drag your Mount onto your Hot Bars!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>This gives you quick access to summon your mount with a key of your choosing.<br/><br/>\r\nYour first mount increases your movement speed by 40%.<br/><br/>No Riding Training is required. You can learn to ride even faster at a |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">已学会的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 保存在你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r 中</h1><br/>\r\n<p>•打开你的角色面板（快捷键 C）。<br/>\r\n•点击底部的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:186|h宠物标签页|h|r。<br/>\r\n•点击顶部的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r 标签页。<br/></p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\93_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">把你的坐骑拖到动作条上！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>这样你就可以用自己选择的按键快速召唤坐骑。<br/><br/>\r\n你的第一只坐骑会提高你 40% 的移动速度。<br/><br/>不需要骑术训练。你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 处学习骑得更快。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn Skill Card Packs from Silas!</h1><br/>\n<p>Completing max level Scroll of Fortune quests at Silas grants Sealed Card Packs containing 5 random max-level Talent Skill Cards.<br/><br/>\nUse Card Packs from your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h or Skill Cards Menu, then Card Packs and Cards tab.<br/><br/>\nSkill Card Packs are found in almost all content. Your Skill Card Collection expands fast!</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Your Skill Card Pack to Reveal 5 Cards!</h1><br/>\n<p>Each Skill Card Pack contains 5 random max-level Talent Skill Cards.<br/><br/>\nYour revealed Skill Cards are automatically added to your Skill Card Collection.<br/><br/>\nYour Skill Card Collection is shared across all characters on your account.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Collect Max-Level Talent Cards!</h1><br/>\n<p>Skill Card Packs grant max-level Talent Skill Cards directly.<br/><br/>\nOpen packs to expand your account-wide collection and give future builds more talent options.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 Silas 处获得技能卡包！</h1><br/>\n<p>在 Silas 处完成满级幸运卷轴任务，会给予内含 5 张随机满级天赋技能卡的密封卡包。<br/><br/>\n从你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 或技能卡菜单中使用卡包，然后切换到卡包与卡片标签页。<br/><br/>\n技能卡包几乎可以在所有内容中找到。你的技能卡收藏扩充得很快！</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用你的技能卡包揭示 5 张卡牌！</h1><br/>\n<p>每个技能卡包内含 5 张随机满级天赋技能卡。<br/><br/>\n你已揭示的技能卡会自动添加到你的技能卡收藏中。<br/><br/>\n你的技能卡收藏在你账号上的所有角色之间共享。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\97_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">收集满级天赋卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>技能卡包会直接给予满级天赋技能卡。<br/><br/>\n打开卡包来扩充你账号通用的收藏，并为未来的构筑提供更多天赋选择。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Opening Card Packs Grants Darkmoon Tickets!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Normal Card Packs grant Darkmoon Tickets and Golden Card Packs grant Golden Darkmoon Tickets.<br/><br/>\r\nRedeem these tickets for specific Skill Cards, Random Uncollected Cards, and Cosmetic Prizes!<br/><br/>\r\nCard Packs always grants tickets, regardless of rarity or duplicate cards.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Obtain Specific Skill Cards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Darkmoon Tickets can be redeemed at Silas Darkmoon to buy Normal, Uncommon, Rare, and Epic Skill Cards. Save up your tickets to acquire key skill cards for your build.<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to Silas, Select the Darkmoon Prizes tab, then Skill Cards or Golden Skill Cards to buy specific cards.<br/><br/>\r\nNormal Tickets grant Normal Skill Cards and Golden Tickets grant Golden Skill Cards.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Obtain Uncollected Skill Cards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Darkmoon Tickets can be redeemed in the Skill Card Menu -> Card Packs tab to acquire 3 random uncollected cards from a specific rarity.<br/><br/>\r\nThis is a great option when your Skill Card Collection starts to fill out and ensures you can collect every card!<br/><br/>\r\nEach time you use this option the price increases.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Transfer Tickets with |Hitem:246095|h[Darkmoon Ticket Pouch (25)]|h</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Transfer Tickets between characters on your account with Darkmoon Ticket Pouches.<br/><br/>\r\nBuy a Darkmoon Pouch from Silas! Click Darkmoon Prizes Tab, then the middle Prizes option.<br/><br/>\r\nThe Prizes Menu also has exclusive Darkmoon Ticket cosmetics!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">打开卡包会给予暗月奖券！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>普通卡包给予暗月奖券，金色卡包给予金色暗月奖券。<br/><br/>\r\n用这些奖券兑换特定的技能卡、随机的未收集卡牌以及外观奖励！<br/><br/>\r\n无论稀有度如何，也无论是否重复，卡包总会给予奖券。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">获得特定的技能卡！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>暗月奖券可以在 Silas Darkmoon 处兑换普通、优秀、精良和史诗技能卡。攒下你的奖券，以获取你构筑所需的关键技能卡。<br/><br/>\r\n与 Silas 交谈，选择暗月奖励标签页，然后选择技能卡或金色技能卡来购买特定卡牌。<br/><br/>\r\n普通奖券给予普通技能卡，金色奖券给予金色技能卡。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">获得你尚未收集的技能卡！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>暗月奖券可以在技能卡菜单 -> 卡包标签页中兑换，以获取 3 张指定稀有度的随机未收集卡牌。<br/><br/>\r\n当你的技能卡收藏开始填满时，这是一个很好的选择，能确保你可以收集到每一张卡！<br/><br/>\r\n每次使用此选项，价格都会上涨。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\99_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:246095|h[暗月奖券袋（25）]|h|r 转移奖券</h1><br/>\r\n<p>用暗月奖券袋在你账号上的角色之间转移奖券。<br/><br/>\r\n从 Silas 处购买一个暗月奖券袋！点击暗月奖励标签页，然后选择中间的奖励选项。<br/><br/>\r\n奖励菜单中还有专属的暗月奖券外观！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Tokens_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy a Bazaar Token from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h have many uses and can be traded!|Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h can be spent at |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h on Cosmetics and Convenience items, or used to complete missed |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests.<br/><br/>\r\nVisit the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h and purchase a Bazaar Token!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Tokens_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买一枚集市代币！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 有很多用途，并且可以交易！|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 处兑换外观和便利物品，或用来完成你错过的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务。<br/><br/>\r\n前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 购买一枚集市代币！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests for Gear Upgrades!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Quests grants Marks of Ascension, Mystic Orbs, Mystic Runes and a |Hitem:978050|h[Callboard Cache]|h, allowing you to quickly catch up in gear and jump straight into end-game content!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Multiple Quest Completions, One Area!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Accept all available |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests! They are meant to be completed together.<br/><br/>\r\nThese quests are all located in the same area, allowing you to complete them all without having to travel to multiple zones.<br/><br/>\r\nBe sure to ask to join a group with other players, or invite them to a |Hkeyword:181|hParty|h you form! Quest progress and items are all shared!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务以获取装备升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务会给予飞升印记、神秘宝珠、神秘符文和一个 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:978050|h[告示板宝箱]|h|r，让你能迅速追上装备进度，直接投入满级内容！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Call_Board_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">多个任务，一个区域！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>接受所有可用的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务！它们本来就设计成一起完成。<br/><br/>\r\n这些任务都位于同一个区域，让你无需前往多个区域就能全部完成。<br/><br/>\r\n请务必请求加入其他玩家的队伍，或邀请他们加入你组建的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:181|h小队|h|r！任务进度和物品都是共享的！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Dungeon_Finder_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete a |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h and queue for a Random Normal |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h or pick any of the available Specific Dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nNormal Difficulty Dungeons are entry level end-game content that will help you learn your build and gear up!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Dungeon_Finder_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 并排队进入随机普通 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或从可用的指定地下城中任选一个。<br/><br/>\r\n普通难度地下城是入门级满级内容，能帮助你熟悉自己的构筑并提升装备！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Epic_Riding_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ride at 100% Mounted Movement Speed!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Talk to a |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h to learn Journeyman Riding! This will increase your mounted movement speed from 60% to 100%!<br/><br/>\r\nVisit your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h and ask a guard for directions to the |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can often acquire a |Hitem:3001005|h[Riding Tome: Journeyman Riding]|h from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or another player cheaper than the Trainer offers!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Epic_Riding_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">以 100% 骑乘移动速度骑行！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 交谈以学习中级骑术！这会将你的骑乘移动速度从 60% 提高到 100%。<br/><br/>\r\n前往你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 并向卫兵询问前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 的路线。<br/><br/>\r\n你常常可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 或从其他玩家处，以比训练师更低的价格获得 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:3001005|h[骑术宝典：中级骑术]|h|r！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Ethereal_Bazaar_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">View the |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h sells a limited stock of random Vanity items, spells, and |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h updates his inventory randomly multiple times per day from a pool of thousands of vanity items.<br/><br/>\r\nThere is always something new to discover on |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h, and you may even be the first player to find a specific Vanity Item!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Item_Stock:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Each Vanity item in stock can only be bought once!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>When you buy an item from |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h, no one else will be able to acquire that item unless it is randomly selected for his stock again.<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h and purchase any item for |Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h. You can obtain |Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Ethereal_Bazaar_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">参观 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h以太集市|h|r。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h以太集市|h|r 出售数量有限的随机外观物品、法术和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 每天会从数千件外观物品的池子中随机刷新他的库存数次。<br/><br/>\r\n在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 处总有新东西可以发现，你甚至可能是第一个找到某件特定外观物品的玩家！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Bazaar_Item_Stock:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">库存中的每件外观物品只能购买一次！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当你从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 处购买一件物品后，其他人就无法再获得该物品，除非它再次被随机选中进入他的库存。<br/><br/>\r\n与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 交谈，用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 购买任意物品。你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Interesting_Ethereals_Horde:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Find Interesting Ethereals Inside the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can find |Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h, |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h, Marazz, and |Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h inside any |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h!<br/><br/>\r\nThese Ethereals offer a variety of essential services. Talk to each of them to see what they offer.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\tiraxis1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h runs the |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h runs the |Hkeyword:99|hEthereal Bazaar|h, offering exclusive cosmetic items that randomly rotate and have a limited stock, making these appearances hyper exclusive.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can also redeem |Hkeyword:41|hBazaar Tokens|h for |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h, |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h items like the |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h, convenience items like Potions of |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h, |Hkeyword:225|hStones of Retreat|h and more from |Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ameer1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h Offers |Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can also open up |Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h anytime by clicking Help Request Red Question Mark in your |Hkeyword:176|hOptions Menu|h.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:204|hRecovery Services|h allow you to restore deleted, disenchanted or vendored items! Restore deleted characters and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\malik1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Send Unbound Vanity Items to Seasonal Realms with Malik!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h allows you to send Unbound |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h items from the Area 52 Realm to Seasonal Realms.<br/><br/>\r\nThese transferred items are added directly to your collection on the |Hkeyword:113|hSeasonal Realm|h.<br/><br/>\r\nYou will not receive them in the mail, meaning they are not tradable when transferred.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Interesting_Ethereals_Horde:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 内寻找有趣的以太族！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 内找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r、Marazz 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n这些以太族提供各种必要的服务。与每个人都交谈一下，看看他们提供什么。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\tiraxis1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 经营着 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h以太集市|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 经营着 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:99|h以太集市|h|r，提供会随机轮换且库存有限的专属外观物品，使这些外观极其稀有。<br/><br/>\r\n你还可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:238|hTiraxis|h|r 处用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:41|h集市代币|h|r 兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 物品（例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r）、便利物品（例如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 药水）、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:225|h撤退之石|h|r 等等！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ameer1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:13|hAmeer Greatluck|h|r 提供 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你还可以随时点击 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:176|h选项菜单|h|r 中的求助红色问号来打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:204|h恢复服务|h|r 让你可以恢复已删除、已分解或已出售的物品！还可以恢复已删除的角色等等！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\malik1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 Malik 将未绑定的外观物品发送到赛季服务器！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:75|hCourier Malik|h|r 让你可以将未绑定的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 物品从 52 区服务器发送到赛季服务器。<br/><br/>\r\n这些转移的物品会直接添加到你在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:113|h赛季服务器|h|r 上的收藏中。<br/><br/>\r\n你不会通过邮件收到它们，这意味着它们在转移后不可交易。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Learn_to_Play_Rewards:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Learn to Play! Earn Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Path to Ascension is your guide to Ascension’s custom systems.<br/><br/>\r\nThese quests teach you the basics, grant your first free mount at level 6, and let you teleport straight to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h at level 20!<br/><br/>\r\nAs you level up, new quests unlock that guide you through Dungeons, Mystic Enchants, Transmog, and more!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\PTA_Supertracker2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete Objectives with or without the Quest!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Each Path to Ascension has a quest that will offer additional guidance with a supertracker marker to direct you where to go.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can still complete each objective without the quest. You may even naturally complete objectives just by playing. You still get the rewards!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\120_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Collect Rewards in the UI!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Return to this UI to claim your rewards once you complete a Path to Ascension quest or objective!<br/><br/>\r\nMake sure to claim your rewards, as they may also unlock new Path to Ascension Quests!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Unlock_New_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Unlock New Path to Ascension Quests as You Play!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Level Up and complete Path to Ascension Quests to unlock new ones!<br/><br/>\r\nContinue the Path to Ascension to earn your first free Mount, discover new power through Mystic Enchants, and earn rewards!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Learn_to_Play_Rewards:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">学习游玩！赢取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>飞升之路是你了解 Ascension 自定义系统的指南。<br/><br/>\r\n这些任务会教你基础知识，在 6 级时给予你第一只免费坐骑，并让你在 20 级时直接传送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n随着你升级，新的任务会解锁，引导你了解地下城、神秘附魔、幻化等等内容。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\PTA_Supertracker2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">无论有没有任务都可以完成目标！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每条飞升之路都有一个任务，会用超级追踪标记为你提供额外指引，告诉你该往哪里去。<br/><br/>\r\n你仍然可以在没有任务的情况下完成每个目标。你甚至可能只是在游玩过程中就自然而然地完成了目标。你依然能获得奖励！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\120_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在界面中领取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>当你完成一条飞升之路的任务或目标后，回到此界面领取你的奖励！<br/><br/>\r\n请务必领取你的奖励，因为它们也可能解锁新的飞升之路任务！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Unlock_New_Quests:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在游玩过程中解锁新的飞升之路任务！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>升级并完成飞升之路任务即可解锁新任务！<br/><br/>\r\n继续飞升之路，赢取你的第一只免费坐骑，通过神秘附魔发现新的力量，并获得奖励。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You can |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h at Chromie and Redeem |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h Tokens!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Chromie offers rewards for prestiges and an in-depth explanation of exactly what occurs when you |Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h, including what you keep and what you lose!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find Chromie by the |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Keep Your Progress. Return to Level 1. Earn Rewards!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h will reset your character to level 1 and teleport you to your starting zone.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:189|hPrestige|h is a great way to earn end-game gear, Mystic Enchanting supplies, Marks of Ascension, and more!<br/><br/>\r\nRelive the leveling journey, dungeons, and Battlegrounds with all the knowledge you have acquired, including your saved Mystic Enchants!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Not Starting Over. Starting Better!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You keep all professions, gear, Marks of Ascension, currencies, |Hkeyword:212|hRiding Trainer|h, and items.<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard and Draft Heroes get to roll a new build! But do not keep the Prestiged Spec's Unspent Hand of Fates or Scroll of Fortune.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以在 Chromie 处进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 并兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 代币！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Chromie 提供威望奖励，并详细说明你进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 时究竟会发生什么，包括你会保留什么、失去什么。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 旁找到 Chromie。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">保留你的进度。回到 1 级。赢取奖励！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 会将你的角色重置到 1 级，并把你传送到起始区域。<br/><br/>\r\n进行 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:189|h威望|h|r 是获得满级装备、神秘附魔材料、飞升印记等更多内容的好方法！<br/><br/>\r\n带着你已掌握的所有知识，包括已保存的神秘附魔，重温升级旅程、地下城和战场！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Prestige_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">不是从头开始。而是更好的开始！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你保留所有专业技能、装备、飞升印记、货币、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:212|h骑术训练师|h|r 和物品。<br/><br/>\r\nWildcard 和 Draft 英雄可以重抽新的构筑！但他们不会保留已进行威望的专精未使用的命运之手或幸运卷轴。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buff the whole realm!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h grant a unique buff to every hero in the open world based on the titan they resemble. Multiple scrolls can be used to stack each buff to 5 and refresh their duration.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h announce who used them in Global Chat, letting other heroes know who to thank!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>There are 5 difference |Hkeyword:239|hTitan Scrolls|h:<br/>\r\n• Norgannon<br/>\r\n• Eonar<br/>\r\n• Aggramar<br/>\r\n• Khaz'goroth<br/>\r\n• Golganneth<br/><br/>\r\nYou can obtain them from the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h or randomly when slaying creatures.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">为整个服务器提供增益！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r 会根据其所对应的泰坦，为开放世界中的每位英雄提供一种独特的增益。可以使用多个卷轴将每种增益叠加至 5 层，并刷新其持续时间。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r 会在世界频道中公告是谁使用了它们，让其他英雄知道该感谢谁！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Titan_Scrolls_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<p>共有 5 种不同的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:239|h泰坦卷轴|h|r：<br/>\r\n• 诺甘农<br/>\r\n• 艾欧娜尔<br/>\r\n• 阿格拉玛<br/>\r\n• 卡兹格罗斯<br/>\r\n• 高戈奈斯<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 获得它们，或在击杀生物时随机获得。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Vanity_Items_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Customize your Appearance with Vanity Items!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Cosmetic Vanity items help you create your unique look tailored to your class fantasy.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can find a huge selection on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h! Click the Rarity Dropdown and select Vanity. Then hit Search!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can Ctrl + Left Click an item to preview its appearance. Find and Buyout any Vanity item on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\Vanity_Items_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用外观物品自定义你的外形！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>装饰性外观物品能帮助你打造符合你职业幻想的独特造型。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 找到大量选择！点击稀有度下拉菜单并选择外观。然后点击搜索！<br/><br/>\r\n你可以对一件物品使用 Ctrl + 左键点击来预览其外观。在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 上找到并直接买断任意外观物品。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj is in Silithus!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h is located in the southern part of Silithus in Kalimdor.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Cenarion Hold or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Silithus is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj Meeting Stone is located outside the entrance to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj Through the Main Gate!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Walk through the main gate to enter the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Ossirian the Unscarred!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ossirian the Unscarred is the final boss of Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat him to complete the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">安其拉废墟位于希利苏斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>安其拉废墟 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于卡利姆多希利苏斯的南部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往塞纳里奥要塞，或使用头等实验传送器空降到希利苏斯，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n安其拉废墟的集合石位于该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口外。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">穿过正门进入安其拉废墟！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>穿过正门即可进入该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在 Ascension 上不需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h门任务|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqr4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败无疤者奥斯里安！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>无疤者奥斯里安是安其拉废墟的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n击败他以完成该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Temple of Ahn'Qiraj is in Silithus!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Temple of Ahn'Qiraj |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h is located next to the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj in Silithus.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Cenarion Hold or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Silithus is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Temple of Ahn'Qiraj Meeting Stone is located outside the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h entrance.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Temple of Ahn'Qiraj Through the Main Entrance!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Proceed through the grand entrance to begin the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat C'Thun in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>C'Thun is the final boss of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.<br/><br/>\r\nOvercome the temple's challenges to face C'Thun at the end.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">安其拉神殿位于希利苏斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>安其拉神殿 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于希利苏斯安其拉废墟旁。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往塞纳里奥要塞，或使用头等实验传送器空降到希利苏斯，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n安其拉神殿的集合石位于该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口外。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">穿过正门入口进入安其拉神殿！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>穿过宏伟的入口即可开始该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r。<br/><br/>\r\n在 Ascension 上不需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h门任务|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\aqt4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在安其拉神殿击败克苏恩！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>克苏恩是安其拉神殿的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n克服神殿的重重挑战，在最后面对克苏恩。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenaqueue1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You Can Queue for 2v2 Arenas Solo!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can join a 2v2 |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Game without a partner. Qeuue solo, and you will be matched with another player for a 2v2 match!<br/><br/>\r\nTo join any 2v2 game, open the PvP interface (Hotkey H) and click the |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h drop-down tab.<br/><br/>\r\nSelect 2v2 rated |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h battle, then \"Join Battle\" to solo-queue.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenaqueue1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你可以单人排队参加 2v2 竞技场！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在没有队友的情况下加入 2v2 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 比赛。单人排队，系统就会为你匹配另一名玩家进行一场 2v2 对局！<br/><br/>\r\n要加入任何 2v2 对局，请打开 PvP 界面（快捷键 H），然后点击 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 下拉标签页。<br/><br/>\r\n选择 2v2 评级 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 战斗，然后点击 \"加入战斗\" 即可单人排队。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit an |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Vendor!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can find the |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Vendor in Capital Cities by the Honor and |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Quartermasters.<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to Vik \"Angry\" Smalls or Leeni \"Angry\" Smalls to view |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Gear!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">No Rating Requirements for |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hkeyword:20|hArena|h gear requires |Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h to buy. You can earn |Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h by participating in Arenas!<br/><br/>\r\nThis gear does not require a specific Area Rating to buy or equip!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gear Progresses with new |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Seasons!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>New |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Gear is released with each new |Hkeyword:18|hArena Season|h! The previous seeason's gear will be available for honor.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen a new |Hkeyword:18|hArena Season|h starts |Hkeyword:19|hArena Points|h are converted into |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">拜访 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 商人！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在主城中找到 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 商人，他们就在荣誉军需官和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 军需官旁边。<br/><br/>\r\n与 \"愤怒的\" 维克·斯莫斯或 \"愤怒的\" 李尼·斯莫斯对话，查看 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备没有等级要求！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r 才能购买。你可以通过参加竞技场获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n这套装备购买或装备都不需要特定的竞技场等级！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\arenavendor3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">装备会随着新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 赛季而更新！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>每个新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|h竞技场赛季|h|r 都会发布新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备！上一赛季的装备可以用荣誉购买。<br/><br/>\r\n当新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:18|h竞技场赛季|h|r 开始时，|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:19|h竞技场点数|h|r 会转换为 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Queue from Anywhere for Random Battlegrounds!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Battlegrounds offer team vs team objective based PvP in instanced areas. Engage in Capture the Flag, Point Control, Death Match and more.<br/><br/>\r\nOpen the Player vs. Player Tab (Hotkey H). Click Random Battlegrounds and then Join Battle to join the Battleground Queue!<br/><br/>\r\nQueue from anywhere, keep adventuring while you wait, and you'll be returned to your original location after the Battleground ends.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\22_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Accepting Battleground Queues!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can continue questing, slaying creatures or explore while you wait for your group to fill up. You will be returned to your original location after the Battleground!<br/><br/>\r\nYour faction emblem will appear on your minimap when you are in the queue. Hover over this icon to see the status and estimated wait time.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen the Battleground group fills up, you will see a pop-up notification and be teleported to the Battleground immediately.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cross Faction PvP Against Players Your Level!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Battlegrounds group players together in level brackets, starting at 10-19, then 20-29 and so on until max level. Max level players are in their own max level bracket.<br/><br/>\r\nBattlegrounds are always cross faction on Ascension. Meaning you will randomly be placed on the Horde or the Alliance side. You can also queue with your friends from the opposite faction.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Battlegrounds Grant |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h. You Can Level Up in PvP!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You earn |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h for completing objectives, slaying players and completing the Battleground on Ascension. Wins award more |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h!<br/><br/>\r\nYou will earn |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h up to your current level bracket. This means you cannot reach level 20 inside of a 10-19 Battleground. You will still earn an |Hkeyword:100|hExperience|h bonus at the end of the battleground even if you are max level for that bracket!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Earn |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h, Buy PvP Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Scoring kills, capturing and defending objectives, and completing Battlegrounds grant you |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h that can be spent on PvP Gear!<br/><br/>\r\nYour |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h are stored in the Player vs. Player tab (Hotkey H).<br/><br/>\r\nYou can store up to 75,000 |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h. Honor earned while capped will be lost, so be sure to spend your points on gear, currencies and other prizes from the Honor Quartermaster in your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">随时随地排队参加随机战场！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>战场是在副本区域中进行的目标导向型团队对抗 PvP。参与夺旗、据点控制、死斗等等玩法。<br/><br/>\r\n打开玩家对玩家标签页（快捷键 H）。点击随机战场，然后点击加入战斗即可加入战场队列！<br/><br/>\r\n随时随地排队，在等待时继续冒险，战场结束后你会被送回原来的位置。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\22_2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">接受战场队列！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在等待队伍凑齐时，你可以继续做任务、击杀生物或探索。战场结束后你会被送回原来的位置！<br/><br/>\r\n当你在队列中时，你的阵营徽记会出现在小地图上。将鼠标悬停在该图标上即可查看状态和预计等待时间。<br/><br/>\r\n当战场队伍凑齐时，你会看到一条弹出通知，并立即被传送到战场。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">跨阵营 PvP，对抗与你等级相近的玩家！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>战场会按等级段将玩家分组，从 10-19 开始，然后是 20-29，以此类推直到满级。满级玩家处于他们自己的满级等级段中。<br/><br/>\r\n在 Ascension 上，战场始终是跨阵营的。这意味着你将被随机分配到部落或联盟一方。你也可以与敌对阵营的朋友一起排队。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">战场会给予 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。你可以在 PvP 中升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>在 Ascension 上，你可以通过完成目标、击杀玩家以及打完战场来获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r。获胜会给予更多 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n你获得的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 最高只能到你当前等级段的上限。这意味着你无法在 10-19 的战场中达到 20 级。不过，即使你已经达到该等级段的满级，你仍然会在战场结束时获得 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:100|h经验值|h|r 奖励！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\battlegrounds5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">赚取 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r 并购买 PvP 装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>取得击杀、占领和防守目标以及完成战场都会给予你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r，可用于购买 PvP 装备！<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r 保存在玩家对玩家标签页（快捷键 H）中。<br/><br/>\r\n你最多可以储存 75,000 点 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r。达到上限后获得的荣誉将会丢失，所以请务必在你 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 的荣誉军需官处把点数花在装备、货币和其他奖励上。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Blackwing Lair is in Blackrock Mountain!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Blackwing Lair |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h is located at the top of Blackrock Mountain in the Burning Steppes.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Burning Steppes or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Searing Gorge is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Blackwing Lair Meeting Stone is located near the entrance to Upper Blackrock Spire.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Cross the Chain and Enter the Balcony.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>From the meeting stone, run across the chain, then follow the rock ledge to the balcony on your right!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Blackwing Lair via the Orb of Command!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>After entering the balcony, run down the long hallway and use the orb of command!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Nefarian in Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Nefarian is the final boss of Blackwing Lair.<br/><br/>\r\nBattle through his minions to confront him at the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h's climax.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">黑翼之巢位于黑石山！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>黑翼之巢 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于燃烧平原黑石山的山顶。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往燃烧平原，或使用头等实验传送器空降到灼热峡谷，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n黑翼之巢的集合石位于上层黑石塔入口附近。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">穿过锁链，进入露台。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从集合石出发，跑过锁链，然后沿着岩石边缘走到你右侧的露台！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过命令宝珠进入黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>进入露台后，沿着长长的走廊跑过去并使用命令宝珠！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\bwl5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在黑翼之巢击败奈法利安！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>奈法利安是黑翼之巢的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n一路杀过他的爪牙，在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的高潮处与他对峙。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\castwhilemoving1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy the |Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse Mobility Mixture]|h from |Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The |Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse Mobility Mixture]|h allows you to cast while moving and is essential for builds using spells with a cast time in the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h. It can be used mid-cast to escape ground effects without interrupting your casting.<br/><br/>\r\nThis must be set as an Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spell through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h UI before it can be used!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h Spell can be found inside the Ascension |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Items tab in your spell book!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\castwhilemoving1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse 机动混合剂]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1300179|h[Millhouse 机动混合剂]|h|r 让你可以在移动中施法，对于在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 中使用读条法术的构筑来说至关重要。它可以在施法中途使用，让你在不打断施法的情况下躲避地面效果。<br/><br/>\r\n必须先在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 界面中将其设置为主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 法术才能使用！<br/><br/>\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[疾跑血清]|h|r 法术可以在你法术书中的 Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">You have a new item in your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h!</h1>\r\n<p>A |Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h will be added to your |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h AT LEVEL 20 that will teleport you to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h! You can deliver any Vanity Item to complete this quest.<br/><br/>\r\nYour |Hkeyword:249|hVanity Collection|h is shared to all characters on this realm.<br/><br/>Convenience items like the |Hkeyword:54|hBook of Ascension|h, Cosmetics, Pets, |Hkeyword:157|hMounts|h, |Hkeyword:125|hHeirlooms|h and more are stored here and accessible by all of your characters.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Claim your |Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h!</h1>\r\n<p>Deliver your |Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h so you can teleport to your |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h!<br/>\r\n•Open Character Advancement.<br/>\r\n•Click the Vanity Tab.<br/>\r\n•Type |Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h into the search bar or Filter by Known.<br/>\r\n•Find and click the scroll, and then Deliver Item.<br/><br/>\r\nYour |Hkeyword:215|hScroll of Retreat|h will be sent directly to your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h! Vanity items are either sent directly to your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h or to the Ascension Vanity Items tab in your Spell Book.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 中有一件新物品！</h1>\r\n<p>在 20 级时，一张 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 会被添加到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 中，它可以将你传送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r。你可以上交任意外观物品来完成此任务。<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:249|h外观收藏|h|r 与本服的所有角色共享。<br/><br/>便利物品（如 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:54|h飞升之书|h|r）、装饰品、宠物、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:157|h坐骑|h|r、|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:125|h传家宝|h|r 等等都存放在这里，你所有角色都可以使用。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\collectionsandcapitals1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">领取你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r！</h1>\r\n<p>上交你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r，这样你就能传送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r！<br/>\r\n•打开角色成长。<br/>\r\n•点击外观标签页。<br/>\r\n•在搜索栏中输入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r，或按已学会筛选。<br/>\r\n•找到并点击该卷轴，然后点击上交物品。<br/><br/>\r\n你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:215|h撤退卷轴|h|r 会直接发送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 中！外观物品会直接发送到你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r，或你法术书中的 Ascension 外观物品标签页。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Increase Your Item Level to 58 for Mythic Dungeons</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests is a great way to upgrade your gear and raise your average item level.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h award gear based on your current item level, up to the latest |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h tier.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Zul'Gurub, complete Heroic Dungeons, and run |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h to upgrade your gear to item level 58.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">将你的物品等级提高到 58 以进入史诗地下城</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务是提升装备、提高平均物品等级的好方法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备，最高可达最新的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 阶段。<br/><br/>\r\n打 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 祖尔格拉布、完成英雄地下城，并跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r，将你的装备提升到物品等级 58。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup_naxxramas1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 76 to Enter Naxxramas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Strive for an average item level of 76 to prepare for Naxxramas.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Utilize |Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Complete |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests and run |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h to enhance your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h offer gear upgrades based on your current item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Progress with |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons and Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons (+15 and above) for superior gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeating bosses in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj or higher difficulties of previous raids also provides valuable upgrades.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup_naxxramas1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 76 以进入纳克萨玛斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>努力达到平均物品等级 76，为纳克萨玛斯做准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">善用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 来提升你的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级提供装备升级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城和安其拉神殿取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城（+15 及以上）以获取更好的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败安其拉神殿的首领或以往团队副本的更高难度，也能提供有价值的升级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy golden Skill Card Packs from Silas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Golden Skill Card Packs contain Golden Skill Cards!<br/><br/>\r\nTalk to Silas, then Select Golden Skill Cards Menu and buy a Golden Pack.<br/><br/>\r\nThen open it from your |Hkeyword:32|hBags|h or the Skill Card menu.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Same As Skill Cards but Golden!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Golden Skill Cards Packs and Golden Cards function the same as normal Skill Cards, but they can fill the Golden Skill Card slots, allowing even more control of your build as you collect them.<br/><br/>\r\nGolden Skill Cards can only be obtained from Golden Card Packs, or earning enough duplicate cards to earn free packs. They are not found in the world.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 Silas 处购买金色技能卡包！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>金色技能卡包内含金色技能卡！<br/><br/>\r\n与 Silas 交谈，然后选择金色技能卡菜单并购买一个金色卡包。<br/><br/>\r\n然后从你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:32|h背包|h|r 或技能卡菜单中打开它。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\goldenskillcards2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">和技能卡一样，但是金色的！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>金色技能卡包和金色卡牌的功能与普通技能卡相同，但它们可以填入金色技能卡栏位，让你在收集它们的过程中能更好地掌控自己的构筑。<br/><br/>\r\n金色技能卡只能从金色卡包中获得，或通过积累足够的重复卡牌来赢得免费卡包。它们不会在世界上掉落。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\heroicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete a |Hkeyword:129|hHeroic Dungeon|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h and queue for a Random |Hkeyword:129|hHeroic Dungeon|h or pick any of the available Heroic Dungeons under Specific Dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nYou are ready to queue for Heroic Dungeons! These are more challenging than Normal Dungeons and offer higher item level gear rewards!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\heroicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成一个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|h英雄地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 并排队进入随机 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:129|h英雄地下城|h|r，或在指定地下城下选择任意可用的英雄地下城。<br/><br/>\r\n你已经可以排队进入英雄地下城了！它们比普通地下城更具挑战性，并提供更高物品等级的装备奖励！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\honorvendoralliance:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Visit the Honor Gear Vendor!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Visit John \"Sailor\" Honor in Champion's Hall, Old Town in |Hkeyword:227|hStormwind|h.<br/><br/>\r\nHis location is marked on the map with the Honor and |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Quartermaster POI.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Honor Gear Boosts your PvP Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>This NPC trades PvP Gear for |Hkeyword:134|hHonor Points|h!<br/><br/>\r\nYou can purchase a full set of Season 0.5 gear after a few Battlegrounds! This gear will massively increase your survivability and damage in Battlegrounds.<br/><br/>\r\nAs PvP Seasons progress, new gear will become available in this area.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\honorvendoralliance:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">拜访荣誉装备商人！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>前往 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:227|h暴风城|h|r 旧城区的勇士大厅拜访约翰·\"水手\"·霍诺尔。<br/><br/>\r\n他的位置在地图上以荣誉与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 军需官的兴趣点标记出来。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">荣誉装备会提升你的 PvP 实力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>这名 NPC 用 PvP 装备兑换 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:134|h荣誉点数|h|r！<br/><br/>\r\n参与几场战场后，你就可以购买一整套第 0.5 赛季装备！这套装备会大幅提升你在战场中的生存能力和伤害。<br/><br/>\r\n随着 PvP 赛季推进，该区域会提供新的装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqr:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 68 to Enter Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Work towards an average item level of 68 to prepare for Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gear Up with |Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Complete |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests and run |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h to upgrade your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h provide gear up to the current |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h tier based on your item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Advance Through |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons and Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons to obtain higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeating bosses in Blackwing Lair or higher difficulties of previous raids also offers valuable upgrades.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqr:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 68 以进入安其拉废墟！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>努力达到平均物品等级 68，为安其拉废墟做准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 提升装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 来升级你的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你的物品等级提供装备，最高可达当前的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 阶段。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城和黑翼之巢取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败黑翼之巢的首领或以往团队副本的更高难度，也能提供有价值的升级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqt:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 70 to Enter Temple of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Increase your average item level to 70 to prepare for Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Upgrade via |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Quests and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests and running |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h can help you gear up.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h adjust to your item level, providing suitable upgrades.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enhance Gear with |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons and Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons (+8 and above) for higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat bosses in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj or higher difficulties of previous raids for additional upgrades.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlaqt:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 70 以进入安其拉神殿！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的平均物品等级提高到 70，为安其拉神殿做准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 升级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 可以帮助你提升装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你的物品等级进行调整，提供合适的升级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城和安其拉废墟强化装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城（+8 及以上）以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败安其拉废墟的首领或以往团队副本的更高难度，以获取额外升级。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlbwl:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 64 to Enter Blackwing Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Aim for an average item level of 64 to prepare for Blackwing Lair.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Progress with |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Quests and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Upgrade your gear by completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests and running |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h scale with your item level and can provide valuable upgrades.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enhance Gear via Mythic Dungeons and Onyxia's Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Run Mythic Dungeons to obtain higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat bosses in Onyxia's Lair or higher difficulties of previous raids for additional upgrades.<br/><br/>\r\nEngage in |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons for even better rewards.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlbwl:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 64 以进入黑翼之巢！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>以平均物品等级 64 为目标，为黑翼之巢做准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 来升级你的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会随你的物品等级缩放，并能提供有价值的升级。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过史诗地下城和奥妮克希亚的巢穴强化装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打史诗地下城以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败奥妮克希亚的巢穴中的首领或以往团队副本的更高难度，以获取额外升级。<br/><br/>\r\n参与 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城以获取更好的奖励！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlmc:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 60 to Enter Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Prepare yourself by increasing your average item level to 60 to enter Molten Core.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Quests and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests is a great way to upgrade your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h award gear based on your current item level, up to the current |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h tier.<br/><br/>\r\nRunning |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h is also a quick way to increase your item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Run Mythic Dungeons and Previous Raids</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in Mythic Dungeons to obtain higher item level gear.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can also earn better equipment by running Zul'Gurub or higher difficulties of previous raids.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons are excellent for continuing to upgrade your gear.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlmc:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 60 以进入熔火之心！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的平均物品等级提高到 60，为进入熔火之心做好准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 任务和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务是升级装备的好方法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备，最高可达当前的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 阶段。<br/><br/>\r\n跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 也是快速提高物品等级的方法。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">打史诗地下城和以往的团队副本</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与史诗地下城以获取更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n你也可以通过打祖尔格拉布或以往团队副本的更高难度来获得更好的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城非常适合继续提升你的装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlony:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 62 to Enter Onyxia's Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Increase your average item level to 62 to prepare for Onyxia's Lair.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use |Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests and running |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h are effective ways to upgrade your gear.<br/><br/>\r\n|Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h provide gear up to the current |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h tier based on your item level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Advance Through Mythic Dungeons and Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Participate in Mythic Dungeons to obtain better gear.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeating bosses in Molten Core or higher difficulties of previous raids also rewards higher item level equipment.<br/><br/>\r\nDon't forget to try |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons for even greater rewards.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlony:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 62 以进入奥妮克希亚的巢穴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>将你的平均物品等级提高到 62，为奥妮克希亚的巢穴做准备。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务并跑 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 是升级装备的有效方法。<br/><br/>\r\n|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你的物品等级提供装备，最高可达当前的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 阶段。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\gearup3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过史诗地下城和熔火之心取得进展！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>参与史诗地下城以获取更好的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n击败熔火之心的首领或以往团队副本的更高难度，也会奖励更高物品等级的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n别忘了尝试 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城以获取更丰厚的奖励。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlzg:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reach Item Level 52 to Prepare to Enter Zul'Gurub.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Completing |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests is a great way to upgrade your gear and increase your average item level! |Hkeyword:61|hCall Board Caches|h award gear based on your current item level. You can obtain upgrades up to the currently released |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h Tier.<br/><br/>\r\nUsing the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h to Queue for Normal dungeons, Heroic Dungeons, and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h is also a quick way to increase your Item Level to 52.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\ilvlzg:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">达到物品等级 52，为进入祖尔格拉布做好准备。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务是升级装备、提高平均物品等级的绝佳方法！|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:61|h告示板宝箱|h|r 会根据你当前的物品等级给予装备。你可以获得最高达到当前已开放 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 阶段的升级。<br/><br/>\r\n使用 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 排队进入普通地下城、英雄地下城和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r，也是快速将物品等级提高到 52 的方法。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\manastormsprintserum1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Buy the |Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h from |Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>This movement speed potion is an extremely versatile Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spell that will help you avoid deadly ground effects, distance yourself from enemies, and close the gap between you and enemies when necessary.<br/><br/>\r\nThis must be set as an Active |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Spell through the |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h UI before it can be used!<br/><br/>\r\nThe |Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h Spell can be found inside the Ascension |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h Items tab in your spell book!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\manastormsprintserum1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:69|hCogsworth|h|r 处购买 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>这种移动速度药水是一种极其万能的主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 法术，能帮助你躲避致命的地面效果、与敌人拉开距离，并在必要时拉近与敌人之间的距离。<br/><br/>\r\n必须先通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 界面将其设置为主动 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 法术才能使用！<br/><br/>\r\n|cffe6cc80|Hitem:339050|h[Sprint Serum]|h|r 法术可以在你法术书中的 Ascension |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 物品标签页中找到！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Molten Core is in Blackrock Mountain!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Molten Core is inside Blackrock Mountain, located in the north western area of Burning Steppes.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Burning Steppes or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Burning Steppes is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Meeting stone is on the center platform held up by giant chains. Enter Blackrock Mountains and run across the chains to reach it!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Lothos Riftwalker Teleports You into the Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Keep following the path down from the Meeting Stone to find Lothos. Speak to him to teleport into the Molten Core.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Ragnaros in Molten Core!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Ragnaros is the final boss of Molten Core.<br/><br/>\r\nDefeat the bosses throughout the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h before challenging Majordomo Executus. Defeat Majordomo’s minions without slaying Majordomo, and he will surrender and agree to awaken Ragnaros!<br/><br/>\r\nRagnaros is located in the center of the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, at the bottom of the lava pit</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">熔火之心位于黑石山！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>熔火之心位于黑石山内部，坐落在燃烧平原的西北区域。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往燃烧平原，或使用头等实验传送器空降到燃烧平原，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n集合石位于由巨大锁链支撑的中央平台上。进入黑石山，沿着锁链跑过去就能到达！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Lothos Riftwalker 会将你传送到熔火之心！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>沿着从集合石向下的路继续走，找到 Lothos。与他交谈即可传送到熔火之心。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\moltencore4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在熔火之心击败拉格纳罗斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>拉格纳罗斯是熔火之心的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n在挑战管理者埃克索图斯之前，先击败整个 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 中的首领。在不杀死管理者本人的情况下击败他的爪牙，他就会投降并同意唤醒拉格纳罗斯！<br/><br/>\r\n拉格纳罗斯位于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的中央，岩浆池的底部。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Complete a Mythic |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Open the |Hkeyword:86|hDungeon Finder|h and queue for a Random Mythic |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h or select a specific one under Specific Dungeons.<br/><br/>\r\nMythic Dungeons are more challenging than Heroic Dungeons and offer higher item level gear rewards!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat the Final Boss to Earn a Mythic Keystone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Defeating the final boss of a Mythic |Hkeyword:88|hDungeon|h awards a Mythic Keystone Cache.<br/><br/>\r\nThese Keystones allow you to join |Hkeyword:173|hMythic+|h Dungeons, taking on greater challenges for even more powerful rewards.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">完成一个史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>打开 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:86|h地下城查找器|h|r 并排队进入随机史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r，或在指定地下城下选择一个特定的。<br/><br/>\r\n史诗地下城比英雄地下城更具挑战性，并提供更高物品等级的装备奖励！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\mythicdungeons2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">击败最终首领以赢得史诗钥匙！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>击败史诗 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:88|h地下城|h|r 的最终首领，会奖励一个史诗钥匙宝箱。<br/><br/>\r\n这些钥匙让你可以加入 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:173|h史诗+|h|r 地下城，迎接更大的挑战，获取更强大的奖励。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Naxxramas is in Eastern Plaguelands!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Naxxramas |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h is located above the Eastern Plaguelands in the Eastern Kingdoms.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Light's Hope Chapel or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Eastern Plaguelands is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Naxxramas Meeting Stone is located at the base of the necropolis.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Naxxramas via Portal!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Speak with Archmage Angela Dosantos to enter Naxxramas.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Kel'Thuzad in Naxxramas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Kel'Thuzad is the final boss of Naxxramas.<br/><br/>\r\nBattle through the four wings to confront him in the final chamber.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">纳克萨玛斯位于东瘟疫之地！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>纳克萨玛斯 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于东部王国东瘟疫之地的上空。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往圣光之愿礼拜堂，或使用头等实验传送器空降到东瘟疫之地，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n纳克萨玛斯的集合石位于这座浮空墓穴的底部。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">通过传送门进入纳克萨玛斯！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>与大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯交谈即可进入纳克萨玛斯。<br/><br/>\r\n在 Ascension 上不需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h门任务|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\naxx3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在纳克萨玛斯击败克尔苏加德！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>克尔苏加德是纳克萨玛斯的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n一路杀过四个区域，在最终大厅与他对峙。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Onyxia's Lair is in Dustwallow Marsh!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Onyxia's Lair |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h is located in the southern part of Dustwallow Marsh in Kalimdor.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Theramore or Mudsprocket in Dustwallow Marsh is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Onyxia's Lair Meeting Stone is located just outside the cave entrance in the Wyrmbog area.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Onyxia's Lair Through the Cave!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Follow the path into the cave to reach the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h entrance.<br/><br/>\r\nNo |Hkeyword:28|hAttunement|h is required on Ascension.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Onyxia in Onyxia's Lair!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Onyxia is the sole boss of Onyxia's Lair.<br/><br/>\r\nPrepare your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h for a challenging encounter with this powerful dragon!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">奥妮克希亚的巢穴位于尘泥沼泽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>奥妮克希亚的巢穴 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于卡利姆多尘泥沼泽的南部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往尘泥沼泽的塞拉摩或泥链镇，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n奥妮克希亚的巢穴集合石位于洞穴入口外，在巨龙沼泽区域。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">穿过洞穴进入奥妮克希亚的巢穴！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>沿着小路进入洞穴，即可到达 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 入口。<br/><br/>\r\n在 Ascension 上不需要 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:28|h门任务|h|r。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\onyxia_classic4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在奥妮克希亚的巢穴击败奥妮克希亚！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>奥妮克希亚是奥妮克希亚的巢穴中唯一的首领。<br/><br/>\r\n准备好你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 队伍，迎接与这头强大巨龙的挑战吧！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvE Power Increases Damage, Healing, and Survivability!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can view your PvE Power in your Character Sheet.<br/><br/>\r\nPvE Power is only active at max level and is critical to progressing through end-game PvE content on Ascension.<br/><br/>\r\nPvE Power does not affect other players in PvP! It is only active against creatures.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Gear Obtained from Dungeons and Raids has PvE Power!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Gear obtained from max level PvE content has PvE power. This includes Bind on Equip gear.<br/><br/>\r\nAcquire a set of PvE gear by queuing for Dungeons, |Hkeyword:63|hCall Board|h Daily Quests, The |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h, and through the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h (just add \"pve\" to your search).</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvE 能量会提高伤害、治疗和生存能力！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以在角色面板中查看你的 PvE 能量。<br/><br/>\r\nPvE 能量只在满级时生效，对于在 Ascension 上推进满级 PvE 内容至关重要。<br/><br/>\r\nPvE 能量在 PvP 中不会影响其他玩家！它只对生物生效。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvepower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">从地下城和团队副本获得的装备带有 PvE 能量！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从满级 PvE 内容中获得的装备带有 PvE 能量。这包括装备后绑定的装备。<br/><br/>\r\n通过排队进入地下城、完成 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:63|h告示板|h|r 日常任务、参加 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 以及通过 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r（只需在搜索中添加「pve」）来获取一套 PvE 装备。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP Power is Your Most Important PvP Stat!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP Power increases your damage dealt to players and reduces the damage you take from players!<br/><br/>\r\nHealers deal increased healing and absoption in Arenas and Battlegrounds.<br/><br/>\r\nWhile in the High-Risk Open World PvP Power increases your damage dealt to creatures and reduces your damage taken from creatures.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h, Honor, and |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h Gear Has PvP Power.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Reaching max PvP power is the most important thing you can do to get better at PvP.<br/><br/>\r\nAcquire a set of PvP gear from Honor |Hkeyword:250|hVendors|h or on the |Hkeyword:29|hAuction House|h by searching for \"PvP\" or \"|Hkeyword:33|hBloodforged|h.\"<br/><br/>\r\nTaking |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h PvE gear into PvP will put you at a disadvantage against players in PvP gear.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP Power Is Only Active at Max Level.</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP Power exists on all max level PvP gear. It is not used while leveling.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can increase your PvP Power before reaching max level, but you will not gain benefits from it until max level.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Bloodforge |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h Gear into PvP Gear!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can Bloodforge |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h gear by buying a |Hitem:777999|h[Bloody Jar]|h from Nozdormu. This cannot be undone!<br/><br/>\r\nBloodforging |Hkeyword:230|hSoulbound|h Honor or |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h gear will reduce their stats, so you should only do so if you want to trade or sell the item!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP 实力是你最重要的 PvP 属性！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>PvP 实力会提高你对玩家造成的伤害，并降低你受到的来自玩家的伤害！<br/><br/>\r\n治疗者在竞技场和战场中会提供更高的治疗量和吸收量。<br/><br/>\r\n在高风险开放世界中，PvP 实力会提高你对生物造成的伤害，并降低你受到的来自生物的伤害。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r、荣誉和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 装备都带有 PvP 实力。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>把 PvP 实力堆到最高，是提升你 PvP 水平最重要的事。<br/><br/>\r\n从荣誉 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:250|h商人|h|r 处，或在 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:29|h拍卖行|h|r 搜索 \"PvP\" 或 \"|cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:33|h血铸|h|r\" 来获取一套 PvP 装备。<br/><br/>\r\n把 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 的 PvE 装备带进 PvP，会让你在面对穿着 PvP 装备的玩家时处于劣势。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">PvP 实力只在满级时生效。</h1><br/>\r\n<p>所有满级 PvP 装备上都存在 PvP 实力。升级过程中不会用到它。<br/><br/>\r\n你可以在达到满级之前就提高 PvP 实力，但要到满级后才能获得它的收益。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\pvppower4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">将 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 装备血铸成 PvP 装备！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以向诺兹多姆购买一个 |cffe6cc80|Hitem:777999|h[鲜血之罐]|h|r 来血铸 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 装备。此操作无法撤销！<br/><br/>\r\n血铸荣誉或 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:230|h灵魂绑定|h|r 装备会降低其属性，所以只有在你想要交易或出售该物品时才应该这么做！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingspells1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Unwanted Spells and Abilities!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hitem:1101244|h[Scroll of Fortune]|h allows you to reroll spells and abilities! Obtain them from Silas Darkmoon.<br/><br/>\r\nOpen Character Advancement, find an ability you would like to reroll, and select Unlearn.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can always save your Scrolls of Fortune if you like all of your spells and abilities!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard Tries to Find Synergy!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard isn't always 100% Random! Wildcard will often try to give you a Spells that synergizes with your talents and vice versa.<br/><br/>\r\nSave Spells you want to see synergy for, and reroll Spells you don't want to see synergy for. Wildcard will never stop trying to give you Synergies.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerolltalents4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Strategically!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Reroll your least-used spells and abilities that are not increasing your build's potential.<br/><br/>\r\nAs you continue rerolling the spells that help you the least, you will acquire more and more spells that significantly empower your build.<br/><br/>\r\nThis method will ensure you get really strong, really fast! And maximize your Synergy Rolls!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingspells1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">重抽不需要的法术和技能！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:1101244|h[幸运卷轴]|h|r 让你可以重抽法术和技能！从 Silas Darkmoon 处获得它们。<br/><br/>\r\n打开角色成长，找到你想重抽的技能并选择遗忘。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你喜欢所有的法术和技能，你随时可以保留你的幸运卷轴！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard 会尝试寻找协同效应！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard 并不总是 100% 随机！Wildcard 经常会尝试给你与天赋有协同效应的法术，反之亦然。<br/><br/>\r\n保留你想看到协同效应的法术，重抽你不想看到协同效应的法术。Wildcard 永远不会停止尝试给你协同效应。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerolltalents4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">有策略地重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>重抽你最少使用、且不会提高你构筑潜力的法术和技能。<br/><br/>\r\n随着你不断重抽对你帮助最小的法术，你会获得越来越多能显著强化你构筑的法术。<br/><br/>\r\n这种方法能确保你很快变得非常强！并最大化你的协同抽取！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Talents!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|Hitem:97933|h[Scroll of Fortune: Talents]|h allows you to reroll Talents! Obtain them from Silas Darkmoon.<br/><br/>\r\nOpen Character Advancement, find a Talent you would like to reroll, and select Unlearn.<br/><br/>\r\nYou can always save your Scrolls of Fortune if you like all of your Talents!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard Tries to Find Synergy!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard isn't always 100% Random! Wildcard will often try to give you a Talents that synergizes with your Spells and vice versa.<br/><br/>\r\nSave Talents you want to see synergy for, and reroll Talents you don't want to see synergy for. Wildcard will never stop trying to give you Synergies.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Talents Can Rank Up When Rerolling!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>If you have Rank 1 of a Talent, you can upgrade it to higher ranks when Rerolling other talents! Talent Upgrade Rolls happen randomly.<br/><br/>\r\nMake sure you hang on to lower ranks of talents! Rerolling other talents has a chance to upgrade any of your other talents.<br/><br/>\r\nWhen you get a Talent Upgrade during a Reroll, you will still Roll into a new talent after receiving the upgraded.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\95_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Reroll Strategically!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Focus on rerolling talents that do not directly increase your power or empower your core abilities you use the most!<br/><br/>\r\nAs you reroll your weakest or least relevant talents, your build will quickly fill up with talents that all add immense power.<br/><br/>\r\nThis method will ensure you get really strong, really fast! And maximize your Synergy Rolls!</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">重抽天赋！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>|cffe6cc80|Hitem:97933|h[幸运卷轴：天赋]|h|r 让你可以重抽天赋！从 Silas Darkmoon 处获得它们。<br/><br/>\r\n打开角色成长，找到你想重抽的天赋并选择遗忘。<br/><br/>\r\n如果你喜欢所有的天赋，你随时可以保留你的幸运卷轴！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wildcard 会尝试寻找协同效应！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Wildcard 并不总是 100% 随机！Wildcard 经常会尝试给你与法术有协同效应的天赋，反之亦然。<br/><br/>\r\n保留你想看到协同效应的天赋，重抽你不想看到协同效应的天赋。Wildcard 永远不会停止尝试给你协同效应。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\rerollingtalents3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">重抽时天赋可以提升等级！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>如果你拥有某个天赋的 1 级，你可以在重抽其他天赋时将其提升到更高的等级！天赋升级抽取是随机发生的。<br/><br/>\r\n请务必保留你天赋的较低等级！重抽其他天赋有机会升级你的任何其他天赋。<br/><br/>\r\n当你在重抽过程中获得天赋升级时，在收到升级后你仍然会抽到一个新天赋。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\95_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">有策略地重抽！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>专注于重抽那些不会直接提升你的实力，或强化你最常使用的核心技能的天赋！<br/><br/>\r\n随着你重抽最弱或最不相关的天赋，你的构筑会迅速被能带来巨大实力的天赋填满。<br/><br/>\r\n这种方法能确保你很快变得非常强！并最大化你的协同抽取！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Obtain Skill Cards from Creatures!</h1><br/>\n<p>Skill Cards drop from creatures in the World, Dungeons and |Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h! They can also be found during exploration and solving puzzles.<br/><br/>\nCreatures can drop Skill Cards for any spell they cast that can be learned by players. If they cast Divine Shield, they can drop a Divine Shield Skill Card.<br/><br/>\nAt max level, you can obtain a huge collection of Skill Cards from Silas Darkmoon by completing End-Game Scroll of Fortune quests.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardslot4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Skill Card Collection</h1><br/>\n<p>Open Character Advancement, then click Skill Cards to view your collected cards. Ability and Talent Cards are stored in the tabs at the top.<br/><br/>\nYou can add Skill Cards to your collection at any time.<br/><br/>\nYour Skill Card Collection is shared across all characters on your account, so new characters and Prestiged characters can use cards you have already collected.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Activate Skill Cards from Levels 1-9!</h1><br/>\n<p>Click on the Skill Card you want to slot, then hit Activate!<br/><br/>\nSkill Cards can only be activated while you are levels 1-9.<br/><br/>\nYou are guaranteed to roll any Spell or Talent you have activated with a Skill Card.</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">Use Skill Cards Before Your Build Fills Out!</h1><br/>\n<p>You will roll any slotted Skill Card Spell or Talent at the first level it is available.<br/><br/>\nIf you use multiple specializations, you can use Skill Cards in a specialization until that specialization rolls its 5th spell.<br/><br/>\nEach Specialization has its own Skill Card slots, so you can experiment with different cards in different Specs.</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">从生物身上获得技能卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>技能卡会从世界、地下城和 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:150|hManastorm|h|r 中的生物身上掉落。它们也可以在探索和解谜过程中找到。<br/><br/>\n生物可以掉落它们施放且玩家可以学习的任何法术的技能卡。如果它们施放圣盾术，就能掉落一张圣盾术技能卡。<br/><br/>\n在满级时，你可以通过完成满级幸运卷轴任务，从 Silas Darkmoon 处获得大量技能卡收藏。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wildcardslot4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">技能卡收藏</h1><br/>\n<p>打开角色成长，然后点击技能卡查看你收集的卡牌。技能卡和天赋卡存放在顶部的标签页中。<br/><br/>\n你可以随时将技能卡添加到你的收藏中。<br/><br/>\n你的技能卡收藏在你账号上的所有角色之间共享，因此新角色和已进行威望的角色都可以使用你已经收集的卡牌。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 1-9 级时激活技能卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>点击你想装备的技能卡，然后点击激活！<br/><br/>\n技能卡只能在你处于 1-9 级时激活。<br/><br/>\n你通过技能卡激活的任何法术或天赋都保证会被抽到。</p>\n{page}\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\slotaskillcard3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\n<h1 align=\"center\">在你的构筑填满之前使用技能卡！</h1><br/>\n<p>你会在已装备的技能卡法术或天赋可用的第一个等级就抽到它。<br/><br/>\n如果你使用多个专精，你可以在某个专精中使用技能卡，直到该专精抽出它的第 5 个法术。<br/><br/>\n每个专精都有自己的技能卡栏位，所以你可以在不同专精中尝试不同的卡牌。</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Wargames Let You Host Battlegrounds and Arenas!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>You can challenge other players or groups to an |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h or Battleground of your choice with Wargames.<br/><br/>\r\nIt's up to you how many players to bring! You can enter a wargame 1v1 or bring any group size of your choosing.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Start a Wargame at Teri Glozlik!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>To queue for a Wargame, locate Teri Glozilk in any |Hkeyword:64|hCapital City|h.<br/><br/>\r\nPick the |Hkeyword:20|hArena|h or Battleground you wish to enter. Then type in the name of the other player or group leader you wish to challenge.<br/><br/>\r\nOnce they accept, you and your groups will immediately enter the Wargame. No queues!</p>"]="{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">战争游戏让你可以主办战场和竞技场！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>你可以通过战争游戏向其他玩家或队伍发起挑战，进行你选择的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 或战场。<br/><br/>\r\n带多少玩家由你决定！你可以进入 1v1 的战争游戏，也可以带上任意规模的队伍。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\wargames2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在 Teri Glozlik 处开始一场战争游戏！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>要排队参加战争游戏，请在任何 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:64|h主城|h|r 中找到 Teri Glozilk。<br/><br/>\r\n选择你想进入的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:20|h竞技场|h|r 或战场。然后输入你想挑战的另一名玩家或队伍领袖的名字。<br/><br/>\r\n一旦他们接受，你和你的队伍就会立即进入战争游戏。无需排队！</p>"
T["{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Zul'Gurub is in Stranglethorn Vale!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>The Zul'Gurub |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h located in the north eastern part of Stranglethorn Vale.<br/><br/>\r\nFlying to Booty Bay or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Booty Bay is a quick way to travel to the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h!</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Summon Your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>\r\nThe Zul'Gurub Meeting Stone is at the entrance of Zul'Gurub, directly East of Lake Nazferit and North of Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Enter Zul'Gurub</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Head east through the large open gate from the meeting stone.<br/><br/>\r\nProceed up the stone stairs, and run through the instance portal to enter Zul'Gurub.</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">Defeat Hakkar in Zul'Gurub!</h1><br/>\r\n<p>Hakkar is the final boss of Zul'Gurub.<br/><br/>\r\nIn order to defeat Hakkar, you should first defeat the priestesses spread throughout the instance. Each one left alive empowers Hakkar!<br/><br/>\r\nHakkar is located atop the central temple in the middle of the |Hkeyword:200|hRaid|h.</p>"]="\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">祖尔格拉布位于荆棘谷！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>祖尔格拉布 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 位于荆棘谷的东北部。<br/><br/>\r\n飞往藏宝海湾，或使用头等实验传送器空降到藏宝海湾，是前往该 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 的快捷方式！</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在集合石处召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>使用集合石来协助召唤你的 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 成员，或接受其他小队成员的召唤！<br/><br/>\r\n祖尔格拉布的集合石位于祖尔格拉布入口处，就在纳菲瑞提湖正东、莫什奥格食人魔山以北。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">进入祖尔格拉布</h1><br/>\r\n<p>从集合石出发，向东穿过那道敞开的大门。<br/><br/>\r\n沿石阶而上，跑过副本传送门即可进入祖尔格拉布。</p>\r\n{page}\r\n{T:Interface\\Tutorials\\PtA\\zulgurub4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}\r\n<h1 align=\"center\">在祖尔格拉布击败哈卡！</h1><br/>\r\n<p>哈卡是祖尔格拉布的最终首领。<br/><br/>\r\n要击败哈卡，你首先应该击败散布在副本各处的女祭司。每一个活着的女祭司都会强化哈卡！<br/><br/>\r\n哈卡位于 |cFF00CCFF|Hkeyword:200|h团队副本|h|r 中央神殿的顶上。</p>"
T["|Huierror:|hUI Error: an interface error occured. Click here and send the error to a developer.|h"]="|Huierror:|h|cfff73600界面错误：|r 发生了一个界面错误。点击此处将错误发送给开发者。|h"
T["¡Adéntrate en los parajes salvajes de Azeroth y recorre el camino de un Trollbane! Demuestra tu fuerza derrotando a 6 líderes trol de las diversas tribus trol repartidas por los continentes.\n\nDesde las densas selvas de Stranglethorn Vale hasta las dunas arenosas de Tanaris, tu viaje te llevará por diversos terrenos donde te enfrentarás a muchos trol astutos y sus poderosos líderes.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254168|hDebes matar a [Vazul] antes de alcanzar el nivel 40. (¡Haz clic aquí!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1060|hDebes matar a [Mogh the Undying] antes de alcanzar el nivel 44. (¡Haz clic aquí!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254170|hDebes matar a [Zazera] antes de alcanzar el nivel 45. (¡Haz clic aquí!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5401|hDebes matar a [Kazkaz the Unholy] antes de alcanzar el nivel 48. (¡Haz clic aquí!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10802|hDebes matar a [Hitah'ya the Keeper] antes de alcanzar el nivel 51. (¡Haz clic aquí!)  |h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254169|hDebes matar a [Yahola] antes de alcanzar el nivel 59. (¡Haz clic aquí!)  |h"]="深入艾泽拉斯的蛮荒之地，走上巨魔克星之路！击败各大陆上不同巨魔部族的 6 位巨魔领袖，以此证明你的力量。\n\n从荆棘谷茂密的丛林到塔纳利斯黄沙漫漫的沙丘，你的旅程将带你穿越各种地形，面对众多狡诈的巨魔以及他们强大的领袖。\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254168|h你必须在达到 40 级之前杀死 |cffffff00[Vazul]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:1060|h你必须在达到 44 级之前杀死 |cffffff00[不灭的莫格]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254170|h你必须在达到 45 级之前杀死 |cffffff00[Zazera]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:5401|h你必须在达到 48 级之前杀死 |cffffff00[邪恶的卡兹卡兹]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:10802|h你必须在达到 51 级之前杀死 |cffffff00[守护者希塔娅]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:254169|h你必须在达到 59 级之前杀死 |cffffff00[Yahola]|cffffffff|r。 |cffffff00（点击此处！） |cffffffff |r|h"
